अग्रा
अग्र <i>(I) a. (f. ग्रा)</i> Foremost, first, chief, best (as in अग्रमहिषी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=004-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्र|अग्रं|अग्रः
अग्र <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Foremost point or part, नासाग्रस्थितमौक्तिकम् Bh.V.ii.175; 2. front (as in अग्रसर, अग्ररंध्रं M.M.i.); 3. top, summit, e.g. कैलासाग्रसमासीनम्; 4. beginning; 5. excess, e.g. साग्रं शतं (more than शतं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=004-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

