अजात-अरि <i>m.</i> a name of Yudhiṣṭhira (Cf. अजातशत्रुः हन्त जातमजातारेः प्रथमेन त्वयाऽरिणा Sis.ii.102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

