अजात-ककुद <i>m.</i> a young Indian bull the hump ot which has not yet grown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजातव्यंजन|अजातव्यञ्जन
अजात-व्यंजन <i>a.</i> having an undeveloped beard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजातव्यवहार|अजातव्यवहारः
अजात-व्यवहार <i>m.</i> a minor, a youth under sixteen (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजातशत्रु|अजातशत्रुः
अजात-शत्रु <i>(I) a.</i> having no enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजातशत्रु|अजातशत्रुः
अजात-शत्रु <i>(II) m.</i> a name of युधिष्ठिर the first Pāṇḍava prince, न द्वेक्षि यज्जनमतस्त्वमजातशत्रुः Ve.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजानि|अजानिः
अजानि <i>m.</i> Having no wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजानिक
अजानिक <i>m.</i> The same as अजानि q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजिका
