अजितात्मन्
अजित-आत्मन् <i>a.</i> one who has not subdued his mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजितेन्द्रिय
अजित-इन्द्रिय <i>a.</i> one who has not subdued his senses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजिन|अजिनं
अजिन <i>n.</i> The hairy skin of a tiger, lion &c., but especially of an antelope used by the religious student as a couch, seat &c. अथाजिनाषाढधरः प्रगल्भवाक् K.S.v.30, गजाजिनं शोणितबिन्दुवर्षि च R.v.67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजिनयोनि|अजिनयोनिः
अजिन-योनि <i>m.</i> an antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजिनवासिन्
अजिन-वासिन् <i>a.</i> clad in an antelope-hide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजिर|अजिरं|अजिरः
अजिर <i>n.</i> 1. Area, court; 2. air, wind; 3. the body; 4. any object of sense; 5. a frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

