अजिरा <i>f.</i> A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजिह्म|अजिह्मं|अजिह्मः
