अजिह्मग|अजिह्मगः
अजिह्म-ग <i>m.</i> an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

