अजिह्व <i>m.</i> A frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

