अज्ञ|अज्ञः
अज्ञ <i>a. (f. ज्ञा)</i> 1. Not knowing; 2. ignorant, Bhartr.ii.3; 3. unwise, stupid; 4. not having the faculty of understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज्ञा
अज्ञ <i>a. (f. ज्ञा)</i> 1. Not knowing; 2. ignorant, Bhartr.ii.3; 3. unwise, stupid; 4. not having the faculty of understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज्ञान|अज्ञानं
अज्ञान <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Ignorant, unwise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज्ञाना
अज्ञान <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Ignorant, unwise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अज्ञान|अज्ञानं
अज्ञान <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Ignorance; 2. spiritual ignorance, which causes self to appear a distinct personality, and matter to appear a reality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्च्|अंच्
अञ्च् <i>vt. 10U (pp. अञ्चित; pres. अञ्चयति-ते)</i> To make clear, to unfold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्चन
अञ्चन <i>n.</i> Bending, curving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्चल|अंचलं|अंचलः|अञ्चलः
अञ्चल <i>m.n.</i> End, border, especially of a woman’s garment, दृगञ्चलैः पश्यति केवलं मनाक्; भूमौ दत्वा पदमिह समाधेहि चेलाञ्चलेऽस्मिन् Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्चित|अंचित|अञ्चितः
अञ्चित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Curved, bent, अञ्चित व्यापादः R.xviii.51; 2. handsome, graceful, R.ii.18; 3. honoured, R.ix.24; 4. strung together, R.viii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्चिता
अञ्चित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Curved, bent, अञ्चित व्यापादः R.xviii.51; 2. handsome, graceful, R.ii.18; 3. honoured, R.ix.24; 4. strung together, R.viii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्चितभ्रू
अञ्चित-भ्रू <i>f.</i> a woman with arched or handsome eyebrows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्ज्|अंज्
अञ्ज् <i>vt. 7P (pp. अक्त)</i> 1. To anoint; 2. to decorate; 3. to glorify, to celebrate; 4. to distinguish; 5. to go, to approach.With अभि-, 1. to anoint; 2. to pollute.With अभिवि-, to reveal, to make manifest.With आ-, 1. to anoint; 2. to extol.With वि-, to manifest, to reveal, व्यनक्ति लोकत्रितयेऽपि योग्यताम् Sis.i.26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जन|अञ्जनं|अंजनः|अञ्जनः
अञ्जन <i>(I) m.</i> Name of the elephant presiding over the west or south-west quarter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जन|अञ्जनं|अंजनः|अञ्जनः
अञ्जन <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Act of applying an ointment; 2. black pigment applied to the eyelashes, द्यौरञ्जनकालीभिर्जलदालीभिस्तथावव्रे R.G., R.vii.8, वर्षतीवाञ्जनं नभः Mrich.i.; 3. ointment; 4. ink; 5. night; 6. a suggested meaning (in rhetoric), See व्यञ्जन; 7. the process by which it is suggested (in rhetoric), अन्यार्थाधीकृद्व्यापृंतिरञ्जनम् K.Pr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जनशलाका
अञ्जन-शलाका <i>f.</i> a stick for the application of collyrium, ज्ञानाञ्जनशलाकया Sik.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जना|अंजना
अञ्जना <i>f.</i> 1. Name of Hanūmat’s mother; 2. the process by which a suggested meaning is got at (See अञ्जन 7).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जलि|अंजलिः|अञ्जलिः
अञ्जलि <i>m.</i> 1. The open hands placed side by side and slightly hollowed, श्रवणाञ्जलिपुटपेयं विरचितवान् भारताख्यममृतं यः Ve.i. (hence) a mode of supplication when such hands are raised to the forehead, e.g. अञ्जलिं बद्ध्वा; 2. a libation; 3. a measure sufficient to fill both hands when placed side by side, प्रकीर्णः पुष्पाणां हरिचरणयोरञ्जलिरयम् Ve.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जलिकर्मन्|अञ्जलिकर्म्मन्
अञ्जलि-कर्मन् <i>n.</i> making the anjali or respectful salutation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जलिकारिका
अञ्जलि-कारिका <i>f.</i> a doll or puppet made of clay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जलिपुट|अञ्जलिपुटः
अञ्जलि-पुट <i>m.n.</i> cavity produced in making the anjali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जलिबन्ध
अञ्जलि-बन्ध <i>m.</i> salutation with the anjali raised to the forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जलिबन्धन
अञ्जलि-बन्धन <i>n.</i> salutation with the anjali raised to the forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=008-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जलिका|अंजलिका
अञ्जलिका <i>f.</i> A small mouse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=009-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जस|अंजस|अञ्जसः
अञ्जस <i>a. (f. सी)</i> Straight, upright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=009-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जसी
अञ्जस <i>a. (f. सी)</i> Straight, upright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=009-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जसा|अंजसा
अञ्जसा <i>ind.</i> 1. Truly, in the proper light, R.xix.31; 2. straight; 3. soon, instantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=009-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अञ्जिष्ठ|अंजिष्ठः|अञ्जिष्ठः
अञ्जिष्ठ <i>m.</i> The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=009-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंजीर|अञ्जीर|अंजीरं|अञ्जीरं|अंजीरः|अञ्जीरः
अंजीर <i>m. or n.</i> 1. The fig tree; 2. its fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=009-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्
