अतिप्रसंग|अतिप्रसङ्ग|अतिप्रसंगः|अतिप्रसङ्गः
अति-प्रसंग <i>m.</i> 1. unwarrantable stretch of a rule or principle; 2. excessive familiarity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रश्न|अतिप्रश्नः
अति-प्रश्न <i>m.</i> an extravagant question, e.g. the question of Balākī in Bṛhadāraṇyaka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रौढा
अति-प्रौढा <i>f.</i> a girl who has attained a marriageable age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभार|अतिभारः
अति-भार <i>m.</i> 1. great burden; 2. excess, R.xiv.68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभारग|अतिभारगः
अति-भारग <i>m.</i> a mule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभाव
अति-भाव <i>m.</i> superiority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभी
अति-भी <i>m.</i> a lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभूमि|अतिभूमिः
अति-भूमि <i>f.</i> last extremity, excess, प्राप्य मन्मथरसादतिभूमिं दुःसहस्तनराः सुरतस्य Sis.x.80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमर्त्य
अति-मर्त्य <i>a.</i> superhuman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमात्र|अतिमात्रं
अति-मात्र <i>a.</i> exceeding proper measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमात्रम्
अति-मात्रम् <i>ind.</i> exceedingly, मुनिव्रतैस्त्वामतिमात्रकर्षिताम् K.S.v.48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमान|अतिमानः
अति-मान <i>m.</i> too much pride, अतिमाने च कौरवः Chan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमानुष
अति-मानुष <i>a.</i> superhuman, divine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमाय
अति-माय <i>a.</i> emancipated from māyā, finally liberated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमुक्त|अतिमुक्तः
अति-मुक्त <i>m.</i> the name of a tree and a creeper, Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरथ|अतिरथः
अति-रथ <i>m.</i> a very great warrior fighting from a car. (अतिरथ is thus defined- अमितान् योधयेद्यस्तु संप्रोक्तोऽतिरथास्तु सः)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिराजन्
अति-राजन् <i>m.</i> an excellent king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरात्र|अतिरात्रः
अति-रात्र <i>m.</i> 1. dead of night; 2. an optional part of the ज्योतिष्टोम sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवयस्
अति-वयस् <i>a.</i> aged, old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिविकट|अतिविकटः
अति-विकट <i>m.</i> a vicious elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवेल|अतिवेलं
अति-वेल <i>a.</i> excessive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवेलम्
अति-वेलम् <i>ind.</i> excessively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवृष्टि|अतिवृष्टिः
अति-वृष्टि <i>f.</i> excessive rain (considered as one of the six calamities of the season. Cf. ईति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिव्याप्ति|अतिव्याप्तिः
अति-व्याप्ति <i>f.</i> 1. an unwarrantable stretch of a rule or principle; 2. the inclusion of what is not intended to come under a proposition (in logic); 3. the inclusion of such things in a definition, as ought not to come under it, (Cf. अव्याप्ति), इदं लक्षणमव्याप्त्यतिव्याप्तिदूषितम् R.G.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशेष|अतिशेषः
अति-शेष <i>m.</i> 1. remainder; 2. remnant of time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिश्रेयसि|अतिश्रेयसिः
अति-श्रेयसि <i>m.</i> a man superior to the most excellent woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिश्व|अतिश्वः
अति-श्व <i>a.</i> superior to or worse than a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिश्वन्
अति-श्वन् <i>m.</i> an excellent dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसन्धम्|अतिसंधम्
अति-सन्धम् <i>ind.</i> in violation of an agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसर्व|अतिसर्वः|अतिसर्व्व
अति-सर्व <i>a.</i> above all, अतिसर्वाय सर्वाय Mug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिस्पर्श|अतिस्पर्शः
अति-स्पर्श <i>a.</i> a name for the semi-vowels and vowels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिहसित|अतिहसितं
अति-हसित <i>n.</i> a horselaugh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=010-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिक्रम|अतिक्रमः
अतिक्रम <i>m.</i> 1. Going over or beyond (lit. and fig.); 2. surpassing; 3. transgression; 4. neglect; 5. an imposition; 6. opposition; 7. passing away (as time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिक्रमण|अतिक्रमणं
अतिक्रमण <i>n.</i> See अतिक्रम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिग्रह|अतिग्रहः
अतिग्रह <i>m.</i> Act of overtaking or surpassing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिचर
अतिचर <i>a. (f. रा or री)</i> Going over or beyond (lit. and fig.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिचरा
अतिचर <i>a. (f. रा or री)</i> Going over or beyond (lit. and fig.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिचरी
अतिचर <i>a. (f. रा or री)</i> Going over or beyond (lit. and fig.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिचार|अतिचारः
अतिचार <i>m.</i> 1. Act of passing, overtaking; 2. excelling; 3. passage of a planet from one zodiacal sign to another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिथि|अतिथिः
अतिथि <i>m.</i> A guest entitled to hospitality, अतिथिनेव निवेदितम् Sak.iv. (Manu thus derives the word- एकरात्रं हि निवसन् ब्राह्मणो ह्यतिथिः स्मृतः । अनित्यास्य स्थितिर्यस्मात्तस्मादतिथिरुच्यते ॥ iii.102)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिथिक्रिया
अतिथि-क्रिया <i>f.</i> hospitality due to a guest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिथिपूजा
अतिथि-पूजा <i>f.</i> honouring a guest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिथिसत्कार|अतिथिसत्कारः
अतिथि-सत्कार, -सत्क्रिया <i>f.</i> See अतिथिक्रिया.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिथिसत्क्रिया
अतिथि-सत्कार, -सत्क्रिया <i>f.</i> See अतिथिक्रिया.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिदेश|अतिदेशः
अतिदेश <i>m.</i> Extended application of something said before, analogy. (It is thus defined- अन्यत्रैव प्रणीतायाः कृत्स्नाया धर्मसंहते । अन्यत्र कार्यतः प्राप्तिरतिदेशः स उच्यते.) अतः प्रधानमल्लनिबर्हणन्यायेनातिदिशति S.Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपतन|अतिपतनं
अतिपतन <i>n.</i> Exceeding, going beyond bounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपात|अतिपातः
अतिपात <i>m.</i> 1. Lapse (as of time) न चेत् कार्यातिपात Sak.i.; 2. neglect (as of duty); 3. transgression, deviation from laws or customs; 4. opposition, contrariety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरिक्त|अतिरिक्तः
अतिरिक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> Excessive, superfluous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरिक्ता
अतिरिक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> Excessive, superfluous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरेक|अतिरेकः
अति(ती)रेक <i>m.</i> 1. Surplus, excess, redundancy; 2. difference; 3. preeminence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतीरेक|अतीरेकः
अति(ती)रेक <i>m.</i> 1. Surplus, excess, redundancy; 2. difference; 3. preeminence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरेकिन्
अतिरेकिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> Surpassing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरेकिणी
अतिरेकिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> Surpassing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्तन|अतिवर्तनं|अतिवर्त्तन
अतिवर्तन <i>n.</i> A pardonable offence or misdemeanour (in civil law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवाद|अतिवादः
अतिवाद <i>m.</i> Harsh or unpleasant speech, M.vi.47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवृत्ति|अतिवृत्तिः
अतिवृत्ति <i>f.</i> Surpassing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशय|अतिशयः
अतिशय <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Excess, Sis.ix.77; 2. superiority in quality, quantity or number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशय|अतिशयः
अतिशय <i>(II) a. (f. या)</i> Preeminent, superior, अतिशयरयशालिना Kad. (Note. The acc. and inst. singulars, viz., अतिशयम् and अतिशयेन are used as indeclinables in the sense of ‘exceedingly, eminently.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशया
अतिशय <i>(II) a. (f. या)</i> Preeminent, superior, अतिशयरयशालिना Kad. (Note. The acc. and inst. singulars, viz., अतिशयम् and अतिशयेन are used as indeclinables in the sense of ‘exceedingly, eminently.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयोक्ति|अतिशयोक्तिः
अतिशय-उक्ति <i>f.</i> 1. hyperbolical language; 2. the name of a figure of speech differently defined by different authors. It is of four kinds according to K.Pr. and of five kinds according to S.D. Other authors differ from both.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयन|अतिशयनं
अतिशयन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Eminent, abundant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयना
अतिशयन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Eminent, abundant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=011-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयिन्
