अत्यन्त <i>a. (f. न्ता)</i> 1. Past its proper limit, much, excessive (as in अत्यन्तकोपन exceedingly passionate); 2. endless, perpetual, किं वा तवात्यन्तवियोगमोघे R.xix.65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=012-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

