अत्यन्तिक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. Going much or fast; 2. very near; 3. not near, distant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=012-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्यन्तिका
अत्यन्तिक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. Going much or fast; 2. very near; 3. not near, distant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=012-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अत्यन्तिक|अत्यंतिक|अत्यन्तिकः
