अत्रि-नेत्र˚ज, ˚भू, ˚प्रसूत, ˚सूत <i>m.</i> the moon. Cf. अथ नयनसमुत्थं ज्योतिरत्रेरिव द्यौः R.ii.75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=012-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

