अथर्वन्|अथर्व्वन्
अथर्वन् <i>(II) m.n.</i> The fourth Veda consisting chiefly of formulas, intended to obviate the effects of any mistake attending the performance of a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=012-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

