अदृष्ट <i>(II) n.</i> 1. An unforeseen danger; 2. destiny, fate; 3. virtue or vice as the eventual cause of pleasure or pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदृष्टार्थ
अदृष्ट-अर्थ <i>a.</i> having an object not evident to the senses, metaphysical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदृष्टपूर्व|अदृष्टपूर्व्व
अदृष्ट-पूर्व <i>a.</i> previously unseen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदृष्टफल
अदृष्ट-फल <i>a.</i> having consequences that are not yet visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदृष्टि|अदृष्टिः
अदृष्टि <i>a.</i> A malicious look, an evil eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदेय
अदेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Improper to be given away (in civil law). Wife, sons, deposits and some other things are considered as अदेय in Hindu law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदेया
अदेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Improper to be given away (in civil law). Wife, sons, deposits and some other things are considered as अदेय in Hindu law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदेव|अदेवः
अदेव <i>(I) a. (f. वा)</i> Godless, impious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदेवा
अदेव <i>(I) a. (f. वा)</i> Godless, impious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदेव|अदेवः
अदेव <i>(II) m.</i> One who is not a god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदेवमातृक|अदेवमातृकः
अदेव-मातृक <i>a.</i> not having the god Indra as mother, i.e. not rained upon, वितन्वति क्षेममदेवमातृकाश्चिराय तस्मिन् कुरवश्चकासते Kir.i.17. (Cf. देवो ववर्ष.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदेश|अदेशः
अदेश <i>m.</i> 1. A bad or improper place; 2. a bad country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदोष|अदोषः
अदोष <i>a. (f. षा)</i> 1. Free from defects or faults; 2. free from the faults of composition, तददोषौ शब्दार्थौ K.Pr.i.; तददोषं गुणवत् काव्यम् S.Kant.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदोषा
अदोष <i>a. (f. षा)</i> 1. Free from defects or faults; 2. free from the faults of composition, तददोषौ शब्दार्थौ K.Pr.i.; तददोषं गुणवत् काव्यम् S.Kant.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अदोह|अदोहः
अदोह <i>m.</i> A season when milking is impracticable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्धा
अद्धा <i>ind.</i> 1. Certainly, truly; 2. manifestly, व्यालाधिपं च यतेते परिरब्धुमद्धा Bh.V.i.95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्भुत|अद्भुतं|अद्भुतः
अद्भुत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Supernatural, wonderful, marvellous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्भुता
अद्भुत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Supernatural, wonderful, marvellous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्भुत|अद्भुतं|अद्भुतः
अद्भुत <i>(II) m.</i> The marvellous, considered as one of the eight or nine Rasas (in rhetoric). See under रस.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्भुत|अद्भुतं|अद्भुतः
अद्भुत <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Surprise, astonishment; 2. a prodigy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्भुतस्वन|अद्भुतस्वनः
अद्भुत-स्वन <i>m.</i> a name of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्मनि|अद्मनिः
अद्मनि <i>m.</i> Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्मर|अद्मरः
अद्मर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> Gluttonous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्मरा
अद्मर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> Gluttonous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्य
अद्य <i>(I) n.</i> Food, anything eatable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्य
अद्य <i>(II) ind.</i> Today, now, nowadays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यापि
अद्य-अपि <i>ind.</i> even now, to this day, अद्यापि नोज्झति हरः Ch.P.50. (Almost every stanza of Ch.P. begins with अद्यापि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यावधि
अद्य-अवधि <i>ind.</i> from or till today.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यैव
अद्य-एव <i>ind.</i> this very day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यदिन
अद्य-दिन <i>n.</i> the present day, e.g. अद्यदिनमारभ्य^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251226. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/104.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यदिवस
अद्य-दिवस <i>m.</i> the present day, e.g. अद्यदिनमारभ्य^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251226. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/104.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यपूर्वम्
अद्य-पूर्वम् <i>ind.</i> before now.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यप्रभृति
अद्य-प्रभृति <i>ind.</i> from today, अद्यप्रभृत्यवनतांगि तवास्मि दासः K.S.v.86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यश्वीन|अद्यश्वीनं
अद्य-श्वीन <i>a.</i> likely to happen today or tomorrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यश्वीना
अद्य-श्वीना <i>f.</i> a female near delivery, अद्यश्वीनावष्टब्धे Pan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यतन|अद्यतनः
अद्यतन <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Extending over or referring to today; 2. modern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यतनी
अद्यतन <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Extending over or referring to today; 2. modern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यतन|अद्यतनः
अद्यतन <i>(II) m.</i> The period of a current day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यतनभूत
अद्यतन-भूत <i>m.</i> the aorist. See अनद्यतन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यतनीय
अद्यतनीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Referring to today; 2. current, nowadays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्यतनीया
अद्यतनीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Referring to today; 2. current, nowadays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रव्य|अद्रव्यं
अद्रव्य <i>n.</i> A worthless or good-for-nothing object, e.g. नाद्रव्ये निहिता काचित्क्रिया फलवती भवेत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रि|अद्रिः
अद्रि <i>m.</i> 1. A stone; 2. a mountain; 3. a cloud; 4. a tree; 5. the sun; 6. the name of a measure; 7. the number ‘seven.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=013-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रीश|अद्रीशः
अद्रि-ईश <i>m.</i> 1. the Himālaya; 2. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिकीला
अद्रि-कीला <i>f.</i> the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिज|अद्रिजं
अद्रि-ज <i>n.</i> red chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिजा
अद्रि-जा <i>f.</i> a name of Pārvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रितनया
अद्रि-तनया, -सुता <i>f.</i> a name of Pārvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिसुता
अद्रि-तनया, -सुता <i>f.</i> a name of Pārvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिद्विष्
अद्रि-द्विष् <i>m.</i> Indra, the enemy of mountains (or of clouds according to some).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिद्रोणि
अद्रि-द्रोणि <i>f.</i> a river taking its rise from a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिपति|अद्रिपतिः
अद्रि-पति, -राज <i>m.</i> the Himālaya as the lord of mountains.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिराज|अद्रिराजः
अद्रि-पति, -राज <i>m.</i> the Himālaya as the lord of mountains.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिभिद्
अद्रि-भिद् <i>m.</i> a name of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिशृंग|अद्रिशृङ्ग
अद्रि-शृंग <i>n.</i> a mountain-peak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रिसार|अद्रिसारः
अद्रि-सार <i>m.</i> essence of stones, i.e. iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रोह|अद्रोहः
अद्रोह <i>m.</i> Mildness, moderation, M.iv.2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वय|अद्वयः
अद्वय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Not two; 2. without a second, unique.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वया
अद्वय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Not two; 2. without a second, unique.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वय|अद्वयः
अद्वय <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Non-duality, unity; 2. identity of spirit and matter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वय|अद्वयः
अद्वय <i>(III) m.</i> A follower of Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वयवादिन्
अद्वय-वादिन् <i>m.</i> 1. one who teaches advaya or identity; 2. a Bauddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वार|अद्वारं
अद्वार <i>n.</i> Any passage which is not intended to be used as a door, अद्वारेण न चातीयाद्ग्रामं वा वेश्म वा वृतम् M.iv.73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वितीय|अद्वितीयः
अद्वितीय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Without a second, i.e. matchless; 2. without a companion, i.e. alone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वितीया
अद्वितीय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Without a second, i.e. matchless; 2. without a companion, i.e. alone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वितीय|अद्वितीयः
अद्वितीय <i>(II) n.</i> Brahman (n.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्वैत|अद्वैतः
