अधरा
अधर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Lower, inferior; 2. low, vile; 3. silenced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधर|अधरं|अधरः
अधर <i>(II) m.</i> The lower lip, पिबसि रतिसर्वस्वमधरम् Sak.i.; निर्मृष्टरागोधरः K.Pr.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधर|अधरं|अधरः
