अधःकर|अधःकरः
अधस्-कर <i>m.</i> the lower part of the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधःखनन
अधस्-खनन <i>n.</i> undermining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधोगति|अधोगतिः
