अधोदिश्
अधस्-दिश् <i>f.</i> the south.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधोदृष्टि|अधोदृष्टिः
अधस्-दृष्टि <i>f.</i> downcast sight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधःपात|अधःपातः
अधस्-पात <i>m.</i> a down-fall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधःप्रस्तर|अधःप्रस्तरः
अधस्-प्रस्तर <i>m.</i> a seat of turf for persons in a state of impurity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधोभाग|अधोभागः
