अधस्तन
अधस्तन <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Lower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधस्तनी
अधस्तन <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Lower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधस्तात्
अधस्तात् <i>ind.</i> The same as अधस् q.v., गमनमधस्ताद्भवत्यधर्मेण /Sāṅkhya K./44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधि|अधिः
अधि <i>ind.</i> As a prefix to verbal themes, it expresses ‘above,’ ‘over and above,’ ‘besides.’As a prefix to nominal themes, it expresses- (1) excellence; (2) superiority; (3) abundance &c.As a separable adverb or preposition, (with acc. or loc., e.g. अधि लोकम्, अधि भुवि रामः), it expresses ‘over, upon, concerning.’(Note. In composition with nouns अधि often forms adverbs and has then the sense of ‘on,’ ‘concerning,’ ‘in’ e.g. अधिगिरि, अध्यात्मम् &c. Thus some of the following compounds may also be interpreted as indeclinables.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यक्ष|अध्यक्षः
अधि-अक्ष <i>(I) a. (f. क्षा)</i> 1. perceptible, present to the senses, यैरध्यक्षैरथ निजसखं नीरदं स्मारयद्भिः Bh.V.iv.17; 2. superintending, presiding over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यक्षा
अधि-अक्ष <i>(I) a. (f. क्षा)</i> 1. perceptible, present to the senses, यैरध्यक्षैरथ निजसखं नीरदं स्मारयद्भिः Bh.V.iv.17; 2. superintending, presiding over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यक्ष|अध्यक्षः
अधि-अक्ष <i>(II) m.</i> a superintendent, president, M.viii.81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=014-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यक्षर|अध्यक्षरं
अधि-अक्षर <i>n.</i> the mystical syllable Om.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यग्नि
अधि-अग्नि <i>(I) ind.</i> 1. near the fire; 2. on the fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यग्नि
अधि-अग्नि <i>(II) n.</i> a gift made to a woman at the time of her marriage. अधग्नि is thus defined by Kātyāyana- विवाहकाले यत्स्त्रीभ्यो दीयते ह्यग्निसन्निधौ । तदध्याग्निकृतं सद्भिः स्त्रीधनं परिकीर्तितम् ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यधि
अधि-अधि <i>ind.</i> on high, (with acc.), अध्यधिलोकम् S.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यधिक्षेप|अध्यधिक्षेपः
अधि-अधिक्षेप <i>m.</i> high censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यर्ध|अध्यर्धः
अधि-अर्ध <i>a.</i> together with its half, e.g. अध्यर्धोऽंशः ‘a share together with its half, i.e. a share and a half.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यात्मम्
