अधिकतिथि|अधिकतिथिः
अधिक-तिथि <i>m.f.</i> An intercalary lunar day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिकमास
अधिक-मास <i>m.</i> An intercalary month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिकवाक्योक्ति|अधिकवाक्योक्तिः
