अधिकरण|अधिकरणं
अधिकरण <i>n.</i> 1. Location, as the meaning of the 7th case (in gram.) आधारोऽधिकरणम् Pan.; 2. receptacle, support; 3. a complete argument dealing with one question. (In Mīmānsā and Vedānta) अधिकरण is thus defined- विषयो विशयश्चैव (i.e. doubt) पूर्वपक्षस्तथोत्तरः । निर्णयश्चेति सिद्धान्तः शास्त्रेऽधिकरणं स्मृतम् ॥; 4. supremacy; 5. a court of justice; 6. a claim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिकरणभोजक|अधिकरणभोजकः
