अधिकरणसिद्धान्त|अधिकरणसिद्धान्तः
अधिकरण-सिद्धान्त <i>m.</i> a syllogism or conclusion which involves others.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिकरणिक|अधिकरणिकः
अधिकरणिक <i>m.</i> 1. A judge or magistrate; 2. a government official.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिकर्मिक|अधिकर्मिकः|अधिकर्म्मिक|अधिकर्म्मिकः
