अधिकारिणी
अधिकारिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> One invested with अधिकार, i.e. a superintendent, a governor, a rightful claimant, a proprietor &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिकृत|अधिकृतः
अधिकृत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Invested with power; 2. appointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिकृता
अधिकृत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Invested with power; 2. appointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिकृति|अधिकृतिः
अधिकृति <i>f.</i> the same as अधिकार q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिक्रम|अधिक्रमः
अधिक्रम <i>m.</i> An invasion, an attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिक्रमण|अधिक्रमणं
अधिक्रमण <i>n.</i> See the preceding word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिक्षेप|अधिक्षेपः
अधिक्षेप <i>m.</i> 1. Abuse, contempt; 2. dismissal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिगत
अधिगत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Acquired; 2. known, Bhartr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिगता
अधिगत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Acquired; 2. known, Bhartr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिगम|अधिगमः
अधिगम <i>m.</i> 1. Acquisition; 2. study, knowledge; 3. acceptance; 4. finding treasure trove, considered as a mode of acquiring property (in civil law). The Mitākshara says- अधिगमो निध्यादेः प्राप्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=015-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिगमन|अधिगमनं
अधिगमन <i>n.</i> 1. Acquisition; 2. intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिचरण|अधिचरणं
अधिचरण <i>n.</i> The act of walking or moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधित्यका
अधित्यका <i>f.</i> Land on the upper part of a mountain, tableland, अधित्यकायामिव धातुमय्याम् R.ii.29, K.S.iii.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिप|अधिपः
अधिप <i>m.</i> 1. A ruler, a regent; 2. a king, अथ प्रजानामधिपः प्रभाते R.ii.1; श्रियः कुरूणामधिपस्य Kir.i.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिभू
अधिभू <i>m.</i> A master, a superior, a ruler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरोह|अधिरोहः
अधिरोह <i>m.</i> 1. Ascent; 2. mounting, overtopping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरोहण|अधिरोहणं
अधिरोहण <i>n.</i> See the preceding word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरोहणी
अधिरोह(हि)णी <i>f.</i> A ladder, a flight of steps.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरोहिणी
अधिरोह(हि)णी <i>f.</i> A ladder, a flight of steps.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवास|अधिवासः
अधि(धी)वास <i>m.</i> 1. Habitation, abode, श्रीः कैटभारिहृदयैककृताधिवासा; 2. an upper garment, mantle; 3. application of perfumes or fragrant cosmetics, ककुद्मिकन्यावक्त्रान्तर्वासलब्धाधिवासया Sis.ii.20; 4. scent, fragrance, अधिवासस्पृहयैव R.viii.34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीवास|अधीवासः
अधि(धी)वास <i>m.</i> 1. Habitation, abode, श्रीः कैटभारिहृदयैककृताधिवासा; 2. an upper garment, mantle; 3. application of perfumes or fragrant cosmetics, ककुद्मिकन्यावक्त्रान्तर्वासलब्धाधिवासया Sis.ii.20; 4. scent, fragrance, अधिवासस्पृहयैव R.viii.34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवासन|अधिवासनं
अधिवासन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of causing the divinity to take up its abode in an image; 2. application of perfumes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिविन्ना
अधिविन्ना <i>f.</i> A wife whose husband has married again, a superseded wife; अधिविन्ना तु या नारी निर्गच्छेदुषिता गृहात् M.ix.83, Yaj.ii.184.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवेदन|अधिवेदनं
अधिवेदन <i>n.</i> Marrying again while a former wife is living.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिश्रय|अधिश्रयः
अधिश्रय <i>m.</i> A place, a receptacle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिश्रयणी
अधिश्रयणी <i>f.</i> A fireplace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिष्ठान|अधिष्ठानं
अधिष्ठान <i>n.</i> 1. Approach; 2. basis; 3. residence, seat; 4. a town; 5. power, dominion; 6. a prescribed rule; 7. a benediction; 8. a wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीति|अधीतिः
अधीति <i>f.</i> Perusal, study, अधीतिबोधाचरणप्रचारणैः Na.i.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीतिन्
अधीतिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> A scholar, one who has finished his studies, (with loc., e.g. वेदेऽधीती, ‘versed in the Veda’; अधीती चतुर्ष्वाम्नायेषु D.K.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीतिनी
अधीतिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> A scholar, one who has finished his studies, (with loc., e.g. वेदेऽधीती, ‘versed in the Veda’; अधीती चतुर्ष्वाम्नायेषु D.K.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीन|अधीनः
अधीन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Dependent, subservient, इक्ष्वाकूणां दुरापेऽर्थे स्वदधीना हि सिद्धयः R.i.72; स्वदधीनं खलु देहिनां सुखम् K.S.iv.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीना
अधीन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Dependent, subservient, इक्ष्वाकूणां दुरापेऽर्थे स्वदधीना हि सिद्धयः R.i.72; स्वदधीनं खलु देहिनां सुखम् K.S.iv.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीर|अधीरः
अधीर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Excited, कान्तस्याधरमणिमधीरमाचुचुम्ब D.K.; 2. unsteady, as in अधीरलोचना; 3. confused, perplexed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीरा
अधीर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Excited, कान्तस्याधरमणिमधीरमाचुचुम्ब D.K.; 2. unsteady, as in अधीरलोचना; 3. confused, perplexed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीरा
अधीरा <i>f.</i> 1. Lightning; 2. a capricious mistress (one of the Nāyikās).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीष्ट|अधीष्टः
अधीष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> Solicited, honorary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीष्टा
अधीष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> Solicited, honorary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधीष्ट|अधीष्टः
अधीष्ट <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Solicitation; 2. honorary office (अधीष्टं सत्कारपूर्वकव्यापारः S.K.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधुना
अधुना <i>ind.</i> At this time, at present, now, असति त्वयि वारुणीमदः प्रमदानामधुना विडम्बना K.S.iv.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधुनातन|अधुनातनं
अधुना-तन <i>a.</i> of or belonging to the present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधूमक|अधूमकः
अधूमक <i>m.</i> Burning fire without smoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधृति|अधृतिः
अधृति <i>f.</i> 1. Want of firmness; 2. incontinence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधृष्य|अधृष्यः
अधृष्य <i>a. (f. ष्या)</i> 1. Unapproachable, अधृष्यश्चाभिगम्यश्च यादोरत्नैरिवार्णवः R.i.16; 2. invincible; 3. proud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधृष्या
अधृष्य <i>a. (f. ष्या)</i> 1. Unapproachable, अधृष्यश्चाभिगम्यश्च यादोरत्नैरिवार्णवः R.i.16; 2. invincible; 3. proud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यय|अध्ययः
अध्यय <i>m.</i> 1. Studying; 2. remembering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्ययन|अध्ययनं
अध्ययन <i>n.</i> Reading, study, learning, अब्राह्मणादध्ययनमापत्काले विधीयते M.ii.241.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यवसान|अध्यवसानं
अध्यवसान <i>n.</i> 1. determination; 2. effort, exertion; 3. complete identification of two things such that one of the things is absorbed into the other (in rhetoric). This अध्यवसान is the basis of the figure called अतिशयोक्ति and of the लक्षणा called साध्यावसाना. निगीर्याध्यवसानं तु प्रकृतस्य परेण यत् K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यवसाय|अध्यवसायः
अध्यवसाय <i>m.</i> 1. The same as अध्यवसान q.v.; 2. energy; 3. perseverance, constancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यशन|अध्यशनं
अध्यशन <i>n.</i> Eating before the last meal is digested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यापक|अध्यापकः
अध्यापक <i>m.</i> A teacher, a preceptor. According to Viṣṇu, अध्यापक is either an आचार्य or an उपाध्याय. An आचार्य is he who invests a boy with the sacred thread and teaches him the Veda. An उपाध्याय instructs for wages. (M.ii.140-41.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यापन|अध्यापनं
अध्यापन <i>n.</i> Instruction, lecturing. According to law-givers अध्यापन is undertaken either as a charity or for wages or in lieu of services rendered. It is one of the six duties of a Brāhmaṇa. See षट्कर्मन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्याय|अध्यायः
अध्याय <i>m.</i> 1. Study; 2. a lecture; 3. the time when sacred books ought to be read; 4. a chapter (as of a book). (Note. The chapters of books are called by several names in Sanskrit. The following are generally in use- स्कन्ध, सर्ग, वर्ग, परिच्छेद, उद्घात, अध्याय, अंक, संग्रह, उच्छ्वास, परिवर्त, पटल, उल्लास m., काण्ड, स्थान, प्रकरण, पर्वन्, आह्निक, आनन n.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यायिन्
अध्यायिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Studious, engaged in reading.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यायिनी
अध्यायिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Studious, engaged in reading.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यारोप|अध्यारोपः
अध्यारोप <i>m.</i> 1. Act of raising; 2. attaching erroneously the predicates of one object to another (in Vedānta phil.), e.g. रज्जौ सर्पस्याध्यारोपः ‘attaching the properties of a snake to a rope, i.e. mistaking a rope for a snake’; 3. erroneous knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=016-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यारोपण|अध्यारोपणं
अध्यारोपण <i>n.</i> The same as अध्यारोप q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यावाप|अध्यावापः
अध्यावाप <i>m.</i> 1. The act of throwing or scattering upon (as seed); 2. a field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यावाहनिक|अध्यावाहनिकं
अध्यावाहनिक <i>n.</i> That part of a wife’s property which she receives at the time of going to her husband’s house. Kat. thus defines it- यत्पुनर्लभते नारी नीयमाना पितुर्गृहात् । अध्यावाहनिकं नाम स्त्रीधनं परिकीर्तितम् ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यास|अध्यासः
अध्यास <i>m.</i> 1. Attributing erroneously the nature of one thing to another. Cf. अध्यारोप 2; 2. residing in, presiding over; 3. putting down upon (as in पदाध्यास.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्याहरण|अध्याहरणं
अध्याहरण <i>n.</i> 1. Supplying an ellipsis; 2. discussing; 3. reasoning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्याहार|अध्याहारः
अध्याहार <i>m.</i> The same as अध्याहरण q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्युष्ट्र|अध्युष्ट्रः
अध्युष्ट्र <i>m.</i> A conveyance borne or drawn by camels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यूढ|अध्यूढः
अध्यूढ <i>m.</i> Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्यूढा
अध्यूढा <i>f.</i> A wife whose husband has married an additional wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्येषण|अध्येषणं
अध्येषण <i>n.</i> Solicitation, entreaty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्येषणा
अध्येषणा <i>f.</i> See the preceding word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्रुव
अध्रुव <i>a. (f. वा)</i> 1. Uncertain, यो ध्रुवाणि परित्यज्य अध्रुवं परिषेवते । ध्रुवाणि तस्य नश्यन्ति अध्रुवं नष्टमेव च ॥ Hit.i.; 2. separable; 3. unstable, not permanent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्रुवा
अध्रुव <i>a. (f. वा)</i> 1. Uncertain, यो ध्रुवाणि परित्यज्य अध्रुवं परिषेवते । ध्रुवाणि तस्य नश्यन्ति अध्रुवं नष्टमेव च ॥ Hit.i.; 2. separable; 3. unstable, not permanent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वन्
अध्वन् <i>m.</i> 1. A road, a way, e.g. नैकोऽध्वानं गच्छेत्; 2. distance, अपि लंघितमध्वानं बुबुधेन बुधोपमः R.i.47; 3. time; 4. means, resource; 5. sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वग|अध्वगः
अध्वन्-ग <i>m.</i> 1. a traveller, उपरिसरं गोदावर्याः परित्यजताध्वगाः K.Pr.vii., K.S.vi.46; 2. a camel; 3. a mule; 4. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

