अध्वपति|अध्वपतिः
अध्वन्-पति <i>m.</i> the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वरथ|अध्वरथः
अध्वन्-रथ <i>m.</i> 1. a messenger; 2. a travelling carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वनीन|अध्वनीनः
