अध्वन्य <i>(II) m.</i> A traveller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्वर|अध्वरः
