अन्
अन् <i>(I) vi. 2P (pp. अनित)</i> 1. To breathe; 2. to live.With प्र-, to be alive, प्राणिवस्तव मानार्थम् Bt.iv.38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्
अन् <i>(II) vi. 4Ā (pp. अनित)</i> 1. To breathe; 2. to live.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनंश
अनंश <i>a. (f. शा)</i> Not entitled to a share in an inheritance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनंशा
