अनग्नि|अनग्निः
अनग्नि <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Absence of fire; 2. something differing from fire, e.g. अनग्नाविव शुष्कैधो न तज्ज्वलति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनग्नि|अनग्निः
अनग्नि <i>(II) a.</i> 1. Having no sacrificial fire (as a householder who does not keep sacred fire, or a sannyāsin); 2. irreligious; 3. having a bad digestion; 4. without the use of fire, विदधे विधिमस्य नैष्ठिकं यतिभिः सार्धमनग्निमग्निचित् R.viii.25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनघ|अनघः
अनघ <i>(I) a. (f. घा)</i> 1. Sinless; 2. handsome; 3. safe, secure, without injury, कच्चिन्मृगीणामनघा प्रसूतिः R.v.7; 4. defectless, अगाधस्यानघा गुणाः Am.i.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

