अनञ्जन <i>(II) m.</i> A name of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनञ्जन|अनंजन|अनञ्जनं
अनञ्जन <i>(III) n.</i> 1. The sky; 2. the supreme soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनडुह्
अनडुह् <i>m. (nom. अनड्वान्-हौ-हः; f. डुही or ड्वाही)</i> An ox or bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनडुही
अनडुह् <i>m. (nom. अनड्वान्-हौ-हः; f. डुही or ड्वाही)</i> An ox or bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनतिविलम्बिता
अनतिविलम्बिता <i>f.</i> Fluency as a qualification of a speaker. Hemacandra mentions 35 such qualifications.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनद्यतन|अनद्यतनः
अनद्यतन <i>m.</i> The time which does not belong to the current day. In grammar, it is either भूतानद्यतन the past or भविष्यदनद्यतन the future time, if such a period does not include the current day. अद्यतन (current day) is thus defined by Bhaṭṭojī- अतीताया रात्रेः पश्चार्धेन आगामिन्या रात्रेः पूर्वार्धेन सहितो दिवसोऽद्यतन S.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=017-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनधिक
अनधिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Boundless; 2. perfect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनधिका
अनधिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Boundless; 2. perfect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनध्यक्ष|अनध्यक्षः
अनध्यक्ष <i>a. (f. क्षा)</i> 1. Not before the eyes, unperceived; 2. destitute of a superintendent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनध्यक्षा
अनध्यक्ष <i>a. (f. क्षा)</i> 1. Not before the eyes, unperceived; 2. destitute of a superintendent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनध्याय|अनध्यायः
अनध्याय <i>m.</i> 1. Absence of study; 2. time when there ought to be an intermission of study, especially of the Vedas. (It is also used in the sense of a holiday).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन|अननं
अनन <i>n.</i> Breathing, living.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अननुभावक
अननुभावक <i>a. (f. विका)</i> Unable to comprehend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अननुभाविका
अननुभावक <i>a. (f. विका)</i> Unable to comprehend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्त|अनंत|अनन्तं|अनन्तः
अनन्त <i>(I) a. (f. न्ता)</i> Boundless (in time, space, or number) अनन्तरत्नप्रभवस्य यस्य K.S.i.3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्ता
अनन्त <i>(I) a. (f. न्ता)</i> Boundless (in time, space, or number) अनन्तरत्नप्रभवस्य यस्य K.S.i.3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्त|अनंत|अनन्तं|अनन्तः
अनन्त <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A name of Viṣṇu; 2. a name of Viṣṇu’s couch, i.e. Śeṣa; 3. a name of Kṛṣṇa; 4. of his brother Baladeva; 5. of Śiva; 6. a name of Vāsuki, king of the serpents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्त|अनंत|अनन्तं|अनन्तः
अनन्त <i>(III) n.</i> 1. The sky; 2. Brahman (n.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तदृष्टि|अनन्तदृष्टिः
अनन्त-दृष्टि <i>m.</i> an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तदेव|अनन्तदेवः
अनन्त-देव <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Viṣṇu; 2. a name of the serpent Śeṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तपार
अनन्त-पार <i>a.</i> of boundless extent, अनन्तपारं किल शब्दशास्त्रम् Panch.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तरूप
अनन्त-रूप <i>m.</i> Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तविजय|अनन्तविजयः
अनन्त-विजय <i>m.</i> the name of the conch shell of Yudhiṣṭhira, Bg.i.16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तर|अनंतर|अनन्तरं
अनन्तर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Having no interior; 2. having no interval (either of space or of time), near, immediate, e.g. एष ब्रह्मर्षिदेशो वै आर्यावर्तादनन्तरः; 3. near (as a relative).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तरा
अनन्तर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Having no interior; 2. having no interval (either of space or of time), near, immediate, e.g. एष ब्रह्मर्षिदेशो वै आर्यावर्तादनन्तरः; 3. near (as a relative).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तर|अनंतर|अनन्तरं
अनन्तर <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Contiguousness; 2. the supreme soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तरज|अनन्तरजः
अनन्तर-ज <i>m.</i> 1. the son of a Kṣatriya or Vaiśya mother by a father belonging to the caste immediately above the mother’s (in religious law); 2. an elder brother; 3. a younger brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तरम्
अनन्तरम् <i>ind.</i> Immediately after, afterwards (used with abl.) पितुरनन्तरमुत्तरकोसलात् R.ix.1; अथास्य गोदानविधेरनन्तरम् R.iii.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तरीय|अनंतरीय
अनन्तरीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Next in succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्तरीया
अनन्तरीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Next in succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्ता
अनन्ता <i>f.</i> 1. The earth; 2. the number ‘one’ (in math.); 3. a name of Pārvatī; 4. the dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्य
अनन्य <i>a. (f. न्या)</i> 1. No other, not different, identical; 2. without any attention to a second, अनन्याश्चिन्तयन्तो माम् Bg.ix.22; 3. sole, भक्त्या लभ्यस्त्वनन्यया Bg.viii.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्या
अनन्य <i>a. (f. न्या)</i> 1. No other, not different, identical; 2. without any attention to a second, अनन्याश्चिन्तयन्तो माम् Bg.ix.22; 3. sole, भक्त्या लभ्यस्त्वनन्यया Bg.viii.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यगति|अनन्यगतिः
अनन्य-गति, -गतिक <i>a.</i> having only one resort left, अनन्यगतिके जने विगतपातके चातके Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यगतिक|अनन्यगतिकः
अनन्य-गति, -गतिक <i>a.</i> having only one resort left, अनन्यगतिके जने विगतपातके चातके Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यज|अनन्यजः
अनन्य-ज <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kāmadeva, तस्यां च तादृशीमवस्थां गतायां जनस्यान्यजेन D.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यपूर्वा|अनन्यपूर्व्वा
अनन्य-पूर्वा <i>f.</i> a female who never belonged to another, i.e. a virgin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यभाज्
अनन्य-भाज् <i>a.</i> not attending to or waiting upon any other, अनन्यभाजं पतिमाप्नुहीति K.S.iii.63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यवृत्ति|अनन्यवृत्तिः
अनन्य-वृत्ति <i>a.</i> 1. closely attentive; 2. depending upon only one for livelihood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यसाधारण
अनन्य-साधारण <i>a.</i> not common to anyone else, R.vi.38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्वय|अनन्वयः
अनन्वय <i>m.</i> 1. Want of connection; 2. comparison of an object to itself which raises an implication that it is peerless (in rhetoric), as in त्वमिव जननि त्वं विजयते G.L.17. See K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनप
अनप <i>a. (f. पा)</i> Destitute of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपा
अनप <i>a. (f. पा)</i> Destitute of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपकरण|अनपकरणं
अनप(पा)करण <i>n.</i> 1. Not injuring; 2. non-payment (as of a debt); 3. non-delivery, as of a pledge (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाकरण
अनप(पा)करण <i>n.</i> 1. Not injuring; 2. non-payment (as of a debt); 3. non-delivery, as of a pledge (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपकर्मन्|अनपकर्म्मन्
अनप(पा)कर्मन् <i>n.</i> See अनपकरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाकर्मन्|अनपाकर्म्मन्
अनप(पा)कर्मन् <i>n.</i> See अनपकरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपक्रिया
अनपक्रिया <i>f.</i> See अनपकरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपत्य
अनपत्य <i>a. (f. त्या)</i> Childless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपत्या
अनपत्य <i>a. (f. त्या)</i> Childless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपत्रप
अनपत्रप <i>a. (f. पा)</i> Shameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपत्रपा
अनपत्रप <i>a. (f. पा)</i> Shameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपभ्रंश|अनपभ्रंशः
अनपभ्रंश <i>m.</i> A grammatically correct form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपसर|अनपसरः
अनपसर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Inexcusable, unjustifiable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपसरा
अनपसर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Inexcusable, unjustifiable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपसर|अनपसरः
अनपसर <i>(II) m.</i> A usurper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाय|अनपायः
अनपाय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Free from loss; 2. undiminished, unceasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाया
अनपाय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Free from loss; 2. undiminished, unceasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाय|अनपायः
अनपाय <i>(II) m.</i> Absence of diminution, permanence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=018-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपायिन्
