अनुजात|अनुजातः
अनुजात <i>(I) m.</i> A younger brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-52" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुजात|अनुजातः
अनुजात <i>(II) a. (f. ता)</i> Born after, as a son to his father, असौ कुमारस्तमनुजोऽनुजातः R.vi.78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-52" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुजाता
अनुजात <i>(II) a. (f. ता)</i> Born after, as a son to his father, असौ कुमारस्तमनुजोऽनुजातः R.vi.78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-52" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुजीविन्
अनुजीविन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Living by, dependent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-53" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुजीविनी
अनुजीविन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Living by, dependent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-53" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुजीविन्
अनुजीविन् <i>(II) m.</i> A dependent, a follower, सखोनिव प्रीतियुजोऽनुजीविनः Kir.i.10, i.14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-53" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुज्ञप्ति|अनुज्ञप्तिः
अनुज्ञप्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Authorisation; 2. issuing an order or permission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-54" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुज्ञा
अनुज्ञा <i>f.</i> 1. Assent, permission; 2. leave to depart; 3. an order or command. (Also अनुज्ञान n.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-55" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुज्ञापक|अनुज्ञापकः
अनुज्ञापक <i>m.</i> One who commands or enjoins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-56" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुज्ञापन|अनुज्ञापनं
अनुज्ञापन <i>n.</i> The same as अनुज्ञप्ति q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-57" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुतर्ष|अनुतर्षः
अनुतर्ष <i>m.</i> 1. Thirst; 2. a drinking vessel, सोपाचारमुपज्ञान्तविचारं सानुतर्षम् (1), अनुतर्षपदेन् (2), Sis.x.2; 3. wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=022-58" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुतर्षण|अनुतर्षणं
अनुतर्षण <i>m.</i> 1. A vessel from which liquor is drank; 2. distributing liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुताप|अनुतापः
अनुताप <i>m.</i> Repentance, M.xi.227.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुतिलम्
अनुतिलम् <i>ind.</i> Very minutely or by grains.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्क
अनुत्क <i>a. (f. त्का)</i> Free from regret or anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्का
अनुत्क <i>a. (f. त्का)</i> Free from regret or anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्तम|अनुत्तमः
अनुत्तम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Having no better, unsurpassed, the very best, chief, इह कीर्तिमवाप्नोति प्रेत्य चानुत्तमं मुखम् M.ii.9; 2. not used in the उत्तम or the first person (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्तमा
अनुत्तम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Having no better, unsurpassed, the very best, chief, इह कीर्तिमवाप्नोति प्रेत्य चानुत्तमं मुखम् M.ii.9; 2. not used in the उत्तम or the first person (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्तर|अनुत्तरं
अनुत्तर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Principal, chief; 2. best, excellent; 3. unable to answer, e.g. भवत्यवज्ञा च भवत्यनुत्तरात्; 4. low, inferior; 5. southern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्तरा
अनुत्तर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Principal, chief; 2. best, excellent; 3. unable to answer, e.g. भवत्यवज्ञा च भवत्यनुत्तरात्; 4. low, inferior; 5. southern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्तर|अनुत्तरं
अनुत्तर <i>(II) n.</i> A reply which is evasive and therefore held to be no answer, (e.g. of the defendant in a law-suit)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्तरंग
अनुत्तरंग <i>a. (f. गा)</i> 1. Steady, unruffled; 2. without waves, अपामिवाधारमनुत्तरंगम् K.S.iii.48, where अनुत्तरंग is used in both the senses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्तरंगा
अनुत्तरंग <i>a. (f. गा)</i> 1. Steady, unruffled; 2. without waves, अपामिवाधारमनुत्तरंगम् K.S.iii.48, where अनुत्तरंग is used in both the senses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्तरा
अनुत्तरा <i>f.</i> The south.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्थान|अनुत्थानं
अनुत्थान <i>n.</i> Want of exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्सूत्र
अनुत्सूत्र <i>a. (f. त्रा)</i> Not anomalous, i.e. not deviating from the sūtra (either of नीति or of व्याकरण in the quotation). अनुत्सूत्रपदन्यासा सद्वृत्तिः सन्निबन्धना Sis.ii.112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्सूत्रा
अनुत्सूत्र <i>a. (f. त्रा)</i> Not anomalous, i.e. not deviating from the sūtra (either of नीति or of व्याकरण in the quotation). अनुत्सूत्रपदन्यासा सद्वृत्तिः सन्निबन्धना Sis.ii.112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुत्सेक|अनुत्सेकः
अनुत्सेक <i>m.</i> Humility, want of pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदर
अनुदर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> Thin, lank. See अ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदरा
अनुदर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> Thin, lank. See अ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदात्त|अनुदात्तः
अनुदात्त <i>(I) a. (f. त्ता)</i> 1. Not raised, not elevated; 2. accentless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदात्ता
अनुदात्त <i>(I) a. (f. त्ता)</i> 1. Not raised, not elevated; 2. accentless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदात्त|अनुदात्तः
अनुदात्त <i>(II) m.</i> One of the three accents to be observed in reading the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदार|अनुदारः
अनुदार <i>a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Not generous, niggardly, mean; 2. followed by a wife, स भात्युदारोनुदारश्च K.Pr.iv., where both the senses are meant; 3. having a suitable wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदारा
अनुदार <i>a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Not generous, niggardly, mean; 2. followed by a wife, स भात्युदारोनुदारश्च K.Pr.iv., where both the senses are meant; 3. having a suitable wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदिनम्
अनुदिनम् <i>ind.</i> Daily, every day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदिशम्
अनुदिशम् <i>ind.</i> In every quarter, in every direction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदेश|अनुदेशः
अनुदेश <i>m.</i> 1. Order, injunction; 2. a rule, or injunction relating to a preceding rule or injunction (in gram.), यथासंख्यमनुदेशः समानाम् Pan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदर्शन|अनुदर्शनं
अनुदर्शन <i>n.</i> Consideration, regard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्भट
अनुद्भट <i>a. (f. टा)</i> Not exalted, not lofty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्भटा
अनुद्भट <i>a. (f. टा)</i> Not exalted, not lofty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्य
अनुद्य <i>a. (f. द्या)</i> Unutterable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्या
अनुद्य <i>a. (f. द्या)</i> Unutterable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्रुत|अनुद्रुतं
अनुद्रुत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Following, R.iii.38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्रुता
अनुद्रुत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Following, R.iii.38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्रुत|अनुद्रुतं
अनुद्रुत <i>(II) m.</i> A measure of time in music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्वाह|अनुद्वाहः
अनुद्वाह <i>m.</i> Celibacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुधावन|अनुधावनं
अनुधावन <i>n.</i> 1. Pursuing, running after; 2. pursuit of any object, research, investigation; 3. going after a mistress; 4. cleansing, purifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुध्यान
अनुध्यान <i>n.</i> Meditation, religious contemplation, या नः प्रीतिर्विरूपाक्ष त्वदनुध्यानसंभवा K.S.vi.21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनय|अनुनयः
अनुनय <i>m.</i> 1. Conciliation; 2. courtesy, civility; 3. humble supplication; 4. regulation of conduct, discipline.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनयामंत्रण|अनुनयामन्त्रण
अनुनय-आमंत्रण <i>n.</i> a conciliatory address.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनाद|अनुनादः
अनुनाद <i>m.</i> 1. Echo; 2. consequent sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनायक
अनुनायक <i>a. (f. यिका)</i> Submissive, humble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनायिका
अनुनायक <i>a. (f. यिका)</i> Submissive, humble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनायिका
अनुनायिका <i>f.</i> A female character in a drama subordinate to the heroine (नायिका) such as a friend, a female devotee, a maid servant, a nurse, female artisans &c. (सखी प्रव्रजिता दासी प्रेष्या धात्रेयिका तथा । अन्याश्च शिल्पकारिण्यो विज्ञेया ह्यनुनायिकाः ॥)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनासिक
अनुनासिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> Nasal, i.e. uttered through the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनासिका
अनुनासिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> Nasal, i.e. uttered through the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनासिकादि|अनुनासिकादिः
अनुनासिक-आदि <i>m.</i> a combined consonant beginning with a nasal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनासिकलोप
अनुनासिक-लोप <i>m.</i> the dropping or disappearance of a nasal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिर्देश|अनुनिर्देशः
अनुनिर्देश <i>m.</i> Describing in the same order as previously told, e.g. भूयसामुपदिष्टानां क्रियाणामथ कर्मणाम् । क्रमशो योनुनिर्देशो यथासंख्यं तदुच्यते ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनीति|अनुनीतिः
अनुनीति <i>f.</i> The same as अनुनय q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपघातार्जित
अनुपघातार्जित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Acquired without detriment to the paternal estate (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपघातार्जिता
अनुपघातार्जित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Acquired without detriment to the paternal estate (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपतन|अनुपतनं
अनुपतन <i>m.</i> 1. Falling on or upon; 2. following; 3. proportion (in math.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपथम्
अनुपथम् <i>ind.</i> Along the road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपद|अनुपदं|अनुपदः
अनुपद <i>n.</i> A chorus, the burden of a song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपदम्
अनुपदम् <i>ind.</i> 1. Step by step; 2. word for word; 3. after, immediately after, अर्घ्यानुपदमाशिषः R.i.44.It is used with a noun in the genetive case, आशिषामनुपदम् R.xi.31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपदवी
अनुपदवी <i>f.</i> A way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपदिन्
अनुपदिन् <i>m.</i> A searcher, one who follows or seeks for, (with a noun in the gen. case, e.g. अनुपदी गवाम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपदीना
अनुपदीना <i>f.</i> A kind of slippers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपध|अनुपधः
अनुपध <i>m.</i> A letter or syllable not preceded by another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपधि
अनुपधि <i>a.</i> Guileless, untainted, अनुपधि विशुद्धं विजयते Ut.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपन्यास|अनुपन्यासः
अनुपन्यास <i>m.</i> 1. Failure of proof or determination, doubt; 2. non-statement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपपत्ति|अनुपपत्तिः
अनुपपत्ति <i>f.</i> 1. The failing to be, failure, लक्षणाशक्यसंबंधस्तात्पर्यानुपपत्तितः Bh.P. (तात्पर्यानुपपत्ति the failure of the intended meaning or any consistent meaning); 2. the not being applicable; 3. absence of reasonable grounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=023-43" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपम|अनुपमः
अनुपम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> Incomparable, matchless, excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपमा
अनुपम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> Incomparable, matchless, excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपमा
अनुपमा <i>f.</i> The female elephant of the south-west.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपमित
अनुपमित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Incomparable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपमिता
अनुपमित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Incomparable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपमेय
अनुपमेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Incomparable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपमेया
अनुपमेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Incomparable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपलब्धि|अनुपलब्धिः
अनुपलब्धि <i>f.</i> 1. Non-perception, non-recognition; 2. non-perception as one of the six kinds of proof recognized by the Mīmānsākas T.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपलम्भ|अनुपलंभः|अनुपलम्भः
अनुपलम्भ <i>m.</i> Non-perception, want of apprehension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपलम्भन
अनुपलम्भन <i>m.</i> See अनुपलम्भ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपवीतिन्
अनुपवीतिन् <i>m.</i> One who does not wear the cord of his caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपशय|अनुपशयः
अनुपशय <i>m.</i> Any aggravating thing that increases a disease (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपसंहारिन्
अनुपसंहारिन् <i>m.</i> A particular fallacy in logic. In this fallacy, the argument being one of all comprehensiveness does not leave out anything to serve as a दृष्टांत. The example generally given is सर्वमनित्यं प्रमेयत्वात्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपसर्ग|अनुपसर्गः
अनुपसर्ग <i>m.</i> A particle which is not an Upasarga, as अन्तर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपस्थिति|अनुपस्थितिः
अनुपस्थिति <i>f.</i> 1. Absence; 2. the not being able to remember.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपहत
अनुपहत <i>n.</i> A new garment not used before, अनुपहतमतिधवलम् Kad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपाख्य
अनुपाख्य <i>a. (f. ख्या)</i> Not clearly discernible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपाख्या
अनुपाख्य <i>a. (f. ख्या)</i> Not clearly discernible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपातक|अनुपातकं
अनुपातक <i>m.</i> a heinous offence like the five mahāpātakas. According to Viṣṇu, they are 35, Manu mentions 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपातम्
अनुपातम् <i>ind.</i> In succession, following, going after, e.g. लतानुपातं कुसुमान्यगृह्णात् Bt.ii.11 ‘plucked flowers following creeper after creeper.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपान|अनुपानं
अनुपान <i>n.</i> Drink taken with or after medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपालन|अनुपालनं
अनुपालन <i>n.</i> Preserving, keeping up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपुरुष|अनुपुरुषः
अनुपुरुष <i>m.</i> A follower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपूर्व|अनुपूर्वं|अनुपूर्व्व
अनुपूर्व <i>a. (f. र्वा)</i> Regular, orderly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपूर्वा
अनुपूर्व <i>a. (f. र्वा)</i> Regular, orderly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपूर्वगात्र
अनुपूर्व-गात्र <i>m.</i> one who has regularly shaped limbs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपूर्ववत्सा
अनुपूर्व-वत्सा <i>f.</i> a cow which calves regularly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपूर्वशस्|अनुपूर्व्वशस्
अनुपूर्वशस् <i>ind.</i> In regular order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपेत
अनुपेत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Not endowed with; 2. not invested with the sacred thread (in religious law.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपेता
अनुपेत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Not endowed with; 2. not invested with the sacred thread (in religious law.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रज्ञान|अनुप्रज्ञानं
अनुप्रज्ञान <i>n.</i> Tracking, tracing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रदान|अनुप्रदानं
अनुप्रदान <i>n.</i> A gift, a donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रपातम्
अनुप्रपातम् <i>ind.</i> Going in succession, e.g. गेहं गेहमनुप्रपातमास्ते ‘having gone house by house, he sits down.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रयोग|अनुप्रयोगः
अनुप्रयोग <i>m.</i> Additional use.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रवेश|अनुप्रवेशः
अनुप्रवेश <i>m.</i> Entrance, R.iii.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रवेशन
अनुप्रवेशन <i>n.</i> See the preceding word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रश्न|अनुप्रश्नः
अनुप्रश्न <i>m.</i> A question referring to what has been previously said (as by the teacher).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रसक्ति|अनुप्रसक्तिः
अनुप्रसक्ति <i>f.</i> Close connection, especially logical connection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रहरण
अनुप्रहरण <i>n.</i> Throwing into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रास|अनुप्रासः
अनुप्रास <i>m.</i> Alliteration, repetition of the same consonant though the vowels may differ. वर्णसाम्यमनुप्रासः Mammata. (For instances, See K.Pr.ix., S.D.x.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्लव|अनुप्लवः
अनुप्लव <i>m.</i> 1. A companion; 2. a follower, सानुप्लवः प्रभुरपि क्षणदाचराणाम् R.xiii.75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबन्ध|अनुबंधः|अनुबन्धः
अनुबन्ध <i>m.</i> 1. Connection, attachment; 2. uninterrupted series, (e.g. वैरानुबन्ध an uninterrupted series of hostilities), continuity, R.i.64; 3. cause (especially of a crime), अनुबन्धं परिज्ञाय … दण्डं दण्ड्येषु पातयेत् M.viii.126 ‘let (the king) inflict punishment on criminals having (first) ascertained the cause’; 4. intention, design; 5. obstacle; 6. an indicatory letter which is annexed to words to mark some peculiarity in the accent, inflection, or derivation; 7. Commencement, beginning; 8. course, pursuit; 9. introductory reasons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबन्धन|अनुबंधनं
अनुबन्धन <i>n.</i> Connection, association.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबन्धिन्|अनुबंधिन्
अनुबन्धिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Following in unbroken continuity, दुःखं दुःखानुबन्धि “miseries never come single”; 2. all-pervading, R.vi.77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबन्धिनी
अनुबन्धिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Following in unbroken continuity, दुःखं दुःखानुबन्धि “miseries never come single”; 2. all-pervading, R.vi.77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबल|अनुबलं
अनुबल <i>n.</i> An auxiliary force.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबोध|अनुबोधः
अनुबोध <i>m.</i> 1. Reviving the scent of a faded perfume; 2. an after-thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबोधन|अनुबोधनं
अनुबोधन <i>n.</i> Recollecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभव|अनुभवः
अनुभव <i>m.</i> 1. Knowledge other than remembrance. See T.S. under बुद्धि. According to the Naiyāyikas, it is of four kinds, viz., (1) प्रत्यक्ष; (2) अनुमान; (3) उपमान; (4) शाब्द; 2. understanding; 3. impression on the mind derived from direct perception; 4. experience, अनुभवं वचसा सखि लुम्पति Na.iv.105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभवसिद्ध
अनुभव-सिद्ध <i>a.</i> established by experience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाव|अनुभावः
अनुभाव <i>m.</i> 1. Dignity, authority, अनुभावविशेषात्तु सेनापरिवृताविव R.i.87; 2. certainty, resolution, as in महानुभाव; 3. a symptom which indicates the feeling (भाव) produced by its appropriate causes (in rhetoric). अनुभाव is thus defined- भावं मनोगतं साक्षात् स्वगतं व्यञ्जयन्ति ये । तेऽनुभावाः. See S.D.iii. for further information.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=024-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभावन|अनुभावनं
अनुभावन <i>n.</i> Representing feelings so as to make them the characteristic of a poetical composition (in rhetoric).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाषण|अनुभाषणं
अनुभाषण <i>n.</i> 1. Repeating what has been said; 2. repeating a proposition in order to refute it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभूति|अनुभूतिः
अनुभूति <i>f.</i> The same as अनुभव q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभोग|अनुभोगः
अनुभोग <i>m.</i> A grant of hereditary land in return for service (a modern law-term).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभ्रातृ
अनुभ्रातृ <i>m.</i> A younger brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमति|अनुमतिः
अनुमति <i>f.</i> 1. Assent, permission; 2. the day on which the moon rises nearly full.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमतिपत्र
अनुमति-पत्र <i>n.</i> a deed expressive of assent or concurrence (a modern law-term).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमनन|अनुमननं
अनुमनन <i>n.</i> 1. Assenting; 2. independence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमंत्रण|अनुमन्त्रण|अनुमंत्रणं
अनुमंत्रण <i>n.</i> Consecration by the recital of appropriate hymns.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमरण|अनुमरणं
अनुमरण <i>n.</i> 1. Following in death, भवता नानुमृतापि लभ्यते R.viii.85; 2. The cremation of a widow with the body of the husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमा
अनुमा <i>f.</i> The same as अनुमिति q.v., शंका चेदनुमास्त्येव न चेच्छंका Kus.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमान|अनुमानं
अनुमान <i>n.</i> 1. Inferring as the cause of an अनुमिति or conclusion drawn from given premises (in Sāṅkhya and Nyāya phil.); 2. inference; 3. guess, conjecture; 4. a logical anacoluthon by the way of inference counted among figures of speech (in rhetoric), as in ‘wherever falls the look of woman, there fall sharpened arrows; I think, therefore, that the god of love runs before them while shooting off his arrows.’ See K.Pr.x.31, and the illustration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमानोक्ति|अनुमानोक्तिः
अनुमान-उक्ति <i>f.</i> reasoning, logic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमापक
अनुमापक <i>a. (f. पिका)</i> Being the ground of inference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमापिका
अनुमापक <i>a. (f. पिका)</i> Being the ground of inference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमास|अनुमासं|अनुमासः
अनुमास <i>m.</i> The following month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमिति|अनुमितिः
अनुमिति <i>f.</i> A conclusion from given premises^1, knowledge resulting from syllogizing.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251210. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमेय
अनुमेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Inferable, R.i.20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमेया
अनुमेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Inferable, R.i.20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमोदन|अनुमोदनं
अनुमोदन <i>n.</i> 1. Pleasing; 2. assent, acceptance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयाग
अनुयाग <i>m.</i> A subsequent sacrificial act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयातृ
अनुयातृ <i>m.</i> A follower, a companion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयात्रा
अनुयात्रा <i>f.</i> Retinue, attendance. (Also अनुयात्र n.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयात्रिक|अनुयात्रिकः
अनुयात्रिक <i>m.</i> A follower, an attendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयान|अनुयानं
अनुयान <i>n.</i> Following.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयायिन्
अनुयायिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Following, consequent upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयायिनी
अनुयायिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Following, consequent upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयायिन्
अनुयायिन् <i>(II) m.</i> A follower, an attendant, न्यषेधि शेषोऽप्यनुयायिवर्गः R.ii.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयोग|अनुयोगः
अनुयोग <i>m.</i> 1. A question; 2. solicitation; 3. censure, reproof; 4. religious meditation; 5. explanation, comment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयोगकृत्
अनुयोग-कृत् <i>m.</i> a spiritual teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयोजन|अनुयोजनं
अनुयोजन <i>m.</i> A question.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरक्ति|अनुरक्तिः
अनुरक्ति <i>f.</i> Affection, love, devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरञ्जन|अनुरंजनं|अनुरञ्जनं
अनुरञ्जन <i>n.</i> 1. Pleasing; 2. loving, being attached to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरणन|अनुरणनं
अनुरणन <i>n.</i> 1. A continuous tinkling echo produced by the sound of a bell &c.; 2. a meaning suggested by what is actually said (in rhetoric), e.g. शब्दशक्तिमूलानुरणनरूपव्यंग्यो ध्वनिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरति|अनुरतिः
अनुरति <i>f.</i> Love, attachment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरथ्या
अनुरथ्या <i>f.</i> A by-road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरहस
अनुरहस <i>a. (f. सा)</i> Solitary, private.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरहसा
अनुरहस <i>a. (f. सा)</i> Solitary, private.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुराग|अनुरागः
अनुराग <i>m.</i> Love, attachment, R.iii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरागेंगित|अनुरागेङ्गित
अनुराग-इंगित <i>n.</i> the external sign by which love betrays itself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरात्रम्
अनुरात्रम् <i>ind.</i> Every night, night by night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुराधा
अनु(नू)राधा <i>f.</i> The seventeenth Nakshatra or lunar mansion consisting of three stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूराधा
अनु(नू)राधा <i>f.</i> The seventeenth Nakshatra or lunar mansion consisting of three stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरूप|अनुरूपः
अनुरूप <i>(I) a. (f. पा)</i> 1. Like, resembling; 2. fit, suitable (generally with gen.); 3. according to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरूपा
अनुरूप <i>(I) a. (f. पा)</i> 1. Like, resembling; 2. fit, suitable (generally with gen.); 3. according to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरूप|अनुरूपः
अनुरूप <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Conformity, likeness; 2. fitness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरूपम्
अनुरूपम् <i>ind.</i> Conformably, agreeably to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरोध|अनुरोधः
अनुरोध <i>n.</i> 1. Obliging-ness, compliance; 2. consideration, respect; 3. the application or bearing (of a rule).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरोधन|अनुरोधनं
अनुरोधन <i>n.</i> See अनुरोध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलाप|अनुलापः
अनुलाप <i>m.</i> Repetition of what has been said.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलास|अनुलासः
अनुलास <i>m.</i> A peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलेप|अनुलेपः
अनुलेप <i>m.</i> 1. Anointing; 2. an unguent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलेपन|अनुलेपनं
अनुलेपन <i>n.</i> 1. Anointing the body; 2. unguent so used.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोम|अनुलोमः
अनुलोम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. In natural direction, in regular order, (op. to प्रतिलोम); 2. mixed (as a tribe or caste).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमा
अनुलोम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. In natural direction, in regular order, (op. to प्रतिलोम); 2. mixed (as a tribe or caste).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमार्थ
अनुलोम-अर्थ <i>a.</i> speaking in favour, जडानप्यनुलोमार्थान् प्रवाचः कृतिनां गिरः (scil. कुर्वते) Sis.ii.25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमकृष्ट
अनुलोम-कृष्ट <i>a.</i> ploughed with the grain, e.g. अनुलोमकृष्टं क्षेत्रं पुनः प्रतिलोमं कर्षति ‘he ploughs the field first with and then against the grain.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमज|अनुलोमजः
अनुलोम-ज <i>a.</i> applied to the offspring of a father superior in caste to the mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमजन्मन्
अनुलोम-जन्मन् <i>m.f.</i> See the preceding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=025-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुल्बण
अनुल्बण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Not excessive; 2. not manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुल्बणा
अनुल्बण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Not excessive; 2. not manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवंश|अनुवंशः
अनुवंश <i>m.</i> A genealogical table.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवक्र
अनुवक्र <i>a. (f. क्रा)</i> Somewhat oblique (applied to the motion of a planet.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवक्रा
अनुवक्र <i>a. (f. क्रा)</i> Somewhat oblique (applied to the motion of a planet.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवचन|अनुवचनं
अनुवचन <i>n.</i> Repeating, reciting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवत्सर|अनुवत्सरं|अनुवत्सरः
अनुवत्सर <i>m.</i> A year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवर्तन|अनुवर्तनं|अनुवर्त्तन|अनुवर्त्तनं
अनुवर्तन <i>n.</i> 1. Obliging or gratifying another; 2. compliance, obedience; 3. consequence, result.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवश|अनुवशः
अनुवश <i>(I) m.</i> Obedience to the will of another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवश|अनुवशः
अनुवश <i>(II) a. (f. शा)</i> Obedient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवशा
अनुवश <i>(II) a. (f. शा)</i> Obedient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाक|अनुवाकः
अनुवाक <i>m.</i> A chapter of the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाचन|अनुवाचनं
अनुवाचन <i>n.</i> 1. Causing to recite, teaching; 2. reading to oneself, i.e. mentally. (It occurs in this sense generally as a stage-direction, नाममुद्राक्षराण्यनुवाच्य Sak.i.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवात|अनुवातः
अनुवात <i>m.</i> The wind that blows from behind. (अनुवाते to windward.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाद|अनुवादः
अनुवाद <i>m.</i> 1. Repeating by way of explanation, explanatory reference to anything already said; 2. that which points to an injunction given before and illustrates it by the way of comment, (op. to विधि); 3. report, e.g. कुत्सितानुवादः ‘a report of (another’s) misdeeds.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाद्य
अनुवाद्य <i>a. (f. द्या)</i> Fit to be the subject or a part of the subject in a sentence, (op. to विधेय). In a sentence, the subject is supposed to be already known and is repeated in order to show its connection with the विधेय or predicate, which affirms or denies something about it; only the predicate conveys some new information about the उद्देश्य. (अनुवाद्यमनुक्त्यैव न विधेयमुदीरयेत्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाद्या
अनुवाद्य <i>a. (f. द्या)</i> Fit to be the subject or a part of the subject in a sentence, (op. to विधेय). In a sentence, the subject is supposed to be already known and is repeated in order to show its connection with the विधेय or predicate, which affirms or denies something about it; only the predicate conveys some new information about the उद्देश्य. (अनुवाद्यमनुक्त्यैव न विधेयमुदीरयेत्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवारम्
अनुवारम् <i>ind.</i> Time after time, repeatedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवास|अनुवासः
अनुवास <i>m.</i> 1. Perfuming the clothes; 2. an oily enema.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवासन|अनुवासनं
अनुवासन <i>n.</i> The same as अनुवास q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवित्ति|अनुवित्तिः
अनुवित्ति <i>f.</i> Finding, obtaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुविद्ध
अनुविद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. Intermixed, अनुविद्ध इवार्थे हि सर्वः शब्देन भासते V.P.; 2. hurt, pierced, bored, कीटानुविद्धरत्नादिसाधारण्येन काव्यता । दुष्टेष्वपि मता S.D.i.; 3. set (as a jewel), surrounded, intertwined, सरसिजमनुविद्धं शैवलेनापि रम्यम् Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुविद्धा
अनुविद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. Intermixed, अनुविद्ध इवार्थे हि सर्वः शब्देन भासते V.P.; 2. hurt, pierced, bored, कीटानुविद्धरत्नादिसाधारण्येन काव्यता । दुष्टेष्वपि मता S.D.i.; 3. set (as a jewel), surrounded, intertwined, सरसिजमनुविद्धं शैवलेनापि रम्यम् Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुविधान|अनुविधानं
अनुविधान <i>n.</i> 1. Obedience; 2. acting in conformity with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुविनाश|अनुविनाशः
अनुविनाश <i>m.</i> Dying after, perishing after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवृत्ति|अनुवृत्तिः
अनुवृत्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Pleasing another by acting conformably to his will, कान्तानुवृत्तिचातुर्यमप्यस्ति भवतः M.M.ix.; 2. application or bearing of a preceding rule or its part on a following one; 3. repetition, e.g. वर्णानामनुवृत्तिरनुप्रासः ‘अनुप्रास is a repetition^1 of letters.’<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251210. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवेध|अनुवेधः
अनुवेध <i>m.</i> The same as अनुव्याध q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवेलम्
अनुवेलम् <i>ind.</i> Constantly, continually, इति स्म पृच्छत्यनुवेलमादृतः R.iii.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवेश|अनुवेशः
अनुवेश <i>m.</i>^1 Entering after.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251210. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101. note: gender change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवेशन|अनुवेशनं
अनुवेशन <i>n.</i> The same as अनुवेश q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्यंजन|अनुव्यञ्जन|अनुव्यंजनं
अनुव्यंजन <i>n.</i> A secondary mark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्यवसाय|अनुव्यवसायः
अनुव्यवसाय <i>m.</i> Perception of a judgment or sentiment (in Vedānta phil.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्याध|अनुव्याधः
अनुव्याध <i>m.</i> 1. Hurting, piercing, न हि कीटानुव्याधादयो रत्नस्य रत्नत्वं व्याहन्तुमीशाः S.D.i.; 2. obstruction; 3. contact, Sis.ii.20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्याहरण|अनुव्याहरणं
अनुव्याहरण <i>n.</i> 1. A curse, an imprecation; 2. repeating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्याहार|अनुव्याहारः
अनुव्याहार <i>m.</i> See अनुव्याहरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्रजन|अनुव्रजनं
अनुव्रजन <i>n.</i> Following, especially a departing guest as a mark of respect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्रज्या
अनुव्रज्या <i>f.</i> The same as अनुव्रजन q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्रत|अनुव्रतः
अनुव्रत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Devout, faithful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्रता
अनुव्रत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Devout, faithful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशतिक
अनुशतिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Followed by a hundred; 2. bought for a hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशतिका
अनुशतिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Followed by a hundred; 2. bought for a hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशय|अनुशयः
अनुशय <i>m.</i> 1. Repentance, regret, Sis.ii.14; 2. deep or intense enmity, यस्मिन्नमुक्तानुशया सदैव जागर्ति दंशाय … भुजंगी M.M.vi., शिशुपालोऽनुशयं परं गतः Sis.xvi.2; 3. hatred; 4. close attachment; 5. the evil result of an act which clings to it and causes the soul to enter other bodies (in Vedānta phil.); 5. rescission, as of sale (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशयाना
अनुशयाना <i>f.</i> One of the heroines described in the rhetorical literature; a mistress who is overcome with sadness because she apprehends the loss of her lover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशयिन्
अनुशयिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Connected as with a consequence, e.g. दुःखानुशयी द्वेषः ‘hatred brings on sorrow’; 2. faithful; 3. penitent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशयिनी
अनुशयिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Connected as with a consequence, e.g. दुःखानुशयी द्वेषः ‘hatred brings on sorrow’; 2. faithful; 3. penitent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशर|अनुशरः
अनुशर <i>m.</i> A Rākṣasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशासन|अनुशासनं
अनुशासन <i>n.</i> 1. Instruction, precept, advice, भवादृशेषु प्रमदाजनोदितं भवत्याधिक्षेप इवानुशासनम् Kir.i.28; 2. explanation, explanatory treatise, अथ योगानुशासनम् P.Y.i.1., नामलिंगानुशासनम् Am.i.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशासिन्
अनुशासिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Instructor, adviser; 2. chastiser, एव स्तेनानुशासी राजा Vikr.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशासिनी
अनुशासिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Instructor, adviser; 2. chastiser, एव स्तेनानुशासी राजा Vikr.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=026-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिक्षिन्
अनुशिक्षिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> Learning, practising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिक्षिणी
अनुशिक्षिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> Learning, practising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिष्टि|अनुशिष्टिः
अनुशिष्टि <i>f.</i> Instruction, command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशीलन|अनुशीलनं
अनुशीलन <i>n.</i> 1. Constant study or application; 2. repeated and devoted service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशोक|अनुशोकः
अनुशोक <i>m.</i> Repentance, regret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशोचन|अनुशोचनं
अनुशोचन <i>n.</i> Sorrow, repentance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुश्रव|अनुश्रवः
अनुश्रव <i>m.</i> Sacred tradition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषंग|अनुषङ्ग|अनुषंगः|अनुषङ्गः
अनुषंग <i>m.</i> 1. Connection, association, attachment, adherence, e.g. मन्मथशिखी सिक्तोऽनुषंगोद्भवः ‘the fire of love produced by association was allayed’; 2. connection of word with word (in gram.); 3. tenderness, compassion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषंगिन्|अनुषङ्गिन्
अनुषंगिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Connected with as a necessary result, Kir.vi.35; 2. embracing, attending generally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषंगिणी
अनुषंगिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Connected with as a necessary result, Kir.vi.35; 2. embracing, attending generally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषञ्जनीय
अनुषञ्जनीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> To be supplied (as a word from a preceding sentence) राक्षसेन्द्रेणेत्यनुषञ्जनीयम् Comm. on Bt.vii.94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषञ्जनीया
अनुषञ्जनीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> To be supplied (as a word from a preceding sentence) राक्षसेन्द्रेणेत्यनुषञ्जनीयम् Comm. on Bt.vii.94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषेक|अनुषेकः
अनुषेक <i>m.</i> Sprinkling over again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषेचन
अनुषेचन <i>n.</i> See अनुषेक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्टुति|अनुष्टुतिः
अनुष्टुति <i>f.</i> Praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्टुभ्
अनुष्टुभ् <i>f.</i> 1. A kind of metre consisting of four pādas of eight syllables each (See App. I.); 2. speech; 3. a name of Sarasvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठान|अनुष्ठानं
अनुष्ठान <i>n.</i> 1. Commencement or course of proceeding; 2. performance, as in वेदार्थानुष्ठानम्; 3. religious practice, उपरुध्यते तपोऽनुष्ठानम् Sak.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठापन|अनुष्ठापनं
अनुष्ठापन <i>n.</i> The causing to perform an act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ण|अनुष्णं|अनुष्णः
अनुष्ण <i>(I) a.</i> 1. Not hot, cold; 2. lazy, sluggish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ण|अनुष्णं|अनुष्णः
अनुष्ण <i>(II) n.</i> A blue lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्णाशीत
अनुष्ण-अशीत <i>a.</i> neither hot nor cold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्णगु|अनुष्णगुः
अनुष्ण-गु <i>m.</i> the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्यन्द|अनुष्यंदः|अनुष्यन्दः
अनुष्यन्द <i>m.</i> A hind wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंहितम्
अनुसंहितम् <i>ind.</i> According to the Samhita text of the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंधान|अनुसन्धान|अनुसंधानं|अनुसन्धानं
अनुसंधान <i>n.</i> 1. Inquiry, investigation; 2. close inspection; 3. suitable connection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमय|अनुसमयः
अनुसमय <i>m.</i> Regular connection, which is the result of reasoning, e.g. इत्येवं पदार्थानुसमयोऽभ्युपेतव्यः ‘thus the connection ought to be taken as resulting from the bearing of the words.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमापन|अनुसमापनं
अनुसमापन <i>n.</i> Regular completion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसम्बद्ध|अनुसंबद्ध
अनुसम्बद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> Connected with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसम्बद्धा
अनुसम्बद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> Connected with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसर|अनुसरः
अनुसर <i>m.</i> A follower, an attendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसरण|अनुसरणं
अनुसरण <i>n.</i> Following, going after (lit. and fig.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसर्प|अनुसर्पः
अनुसर्प <i>m.</i> A reptile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसवनम्
अनुसवनम् <i>ind.</i> Every moment, e.g. न कश्चन किमपि वाञ्छति भर्तर्यनुसवनं स्नेहातिशयमन्तरेण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसाम
अनुसाम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> Friendly, favourable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसामा
अनुसाम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> Friendly, favourable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसायम्
अनुसायम् <i>ind.</i> Evening after evening, every evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसार|अनुसारः
अनुसार <i>m.</i> 1. Going after, following (lit. and fig.); 2. custom, usage; 3. established authority; 4. conformity to usage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारणा
अनुसारणा <i>f.</i> Pursuit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारिन्
अनुसारिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Following, going after, मृगानुसारिणं साक्षात्पश्यामीव पिनाकिनम् Sak.i.; 2. according with or to, आगमानुसारितर्कवशेन S.Bh.; 3. prying into, investigating (as in छिद्रानुसारिन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारिणी
अनुसारिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Following, going after, मृगानुसारिणं साक्षात्पश्यामीव पिनाकिनम् Sak.i.; 2. according with or to, आगमानुसारितर्कवशेन S.Bh.; 3. prying into, investigating (as in छिद्रानुसारिन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसूचक
अनुसूचक <i>a. (f. चिका)</i> Indicative of, pointing out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसूचिका
अनुसूचक <i>a. (f. चिका)</i> Indicative of, pointing out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसृति|अनुसृतिः
अनुसृति <i>f.</i> following, conforming to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसैन्य|अनुसैन्यं
अनुसैन्य <i>m.</i> Rear-guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्कन्दम्
अनुस्कन्दम् <i>ind.</i> Having entered, having gone into, e.g. गेहं गेहमनुस्कन्दम् ‘having entered house after house.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्तरणी
अनुस्तरणी <i>f.</i> The cow sacrificed at the funeral ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्मरण|अनुस्मरणं
अनुस्मरण <i>n.</i> 1. Remembering; 2. repeated recollection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्मृति|अनुस्मृतिः
अनुस्मृति <i>n.</i> The same as अनुस्मरण q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्यूत
अनुस्यूत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Sewn on; 2. closely attached to; 3. uninterrupted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्यूता
अनुस्यूत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Sewn on; 2. closely attached to; 3. uninterrupted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्वान|अनुस्वानः
अनुस्वान <i>m.</i> An after-sound. Cf. अनुरणन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्वार|अनुस्वारः
अनुस्वार <i>m.</i> The nasal sound which is marked by a dot above the line and which always belongs to a preceding vowel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुहरण|अनुहरणं
अनुहरण <i>n.</i> Imitation, resemblance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुहार|अनुहारः
अनुहार <i>m.</i> See अनुहरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-43" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूक|अनूकं|अनूकः
अनूक <i>(I) m.n.</i> Disposition, temperament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-44" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूक|अनूकं|अनूकः
अनूक <i>(II) n.</i> Race, family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-44" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूचान|अनूचानः
अनूचान <i>m.</i> 1. A Brāhmaṇa who is able to repeat, read, and teach the Veda; 2. one versed in the Vedas and Vedāṅgas, इदमूचुरनूचानाः प्रीतिकण्टकितत्विषः K.S.vi.15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-45" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूढ|अनूढः
अनूढ <i>a. (f. ढा)</i> 1. Unmarried; 2. not carried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-46" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूढा
अनूढ <i>a. (f. ढा)</i> 1. Unmarried; 2. not carried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-46" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूढा
अनूढा <i>f.</i> An unmarried girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-47" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूढागमन
अनूढा-गमन <i>n.</i> fornication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-47" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूढाभ्रातृ
अनूढा-भ्रातृ <i>m.</i> 1. the brother of an unmarried woman; 2. the brother of the concubine of a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-47" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूदक|अनूदकं
अनूदक <i>n.</i> Want of water, drought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-48" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूद्देश|अनूद्देशः
अनूद्देश <i>m.</i> Pointing in successive reference to what precedes, यथासंख्यमनूद्देश उद्दिष्टानां क्रमेण यत् S.D.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-49" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनून|अनूनं
अनून <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Whole, entire; 2. not less, not inferior; वृंदावने चैत्ररथादनूने R.vi.50; 3. undiminished, गुणैरनूनाम् R.vi.37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-50" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूना
अनून <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Whole, entire; 2. not less, not inferior; वृंदावने चैत्ररथादनूने R.vi.50; 3. undiminished, गुणैरनूनाम् R.vi.37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=027-50" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूप|अनूपं|अनूपः
अनूप <i>(I) a. (f. पा)</i> Watery, rich in water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूपा
अनूप <i>(I) a. (f. पा)</i> Watery, rich in water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूप|अनूपं|अनूपः
अनूप <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A buffalo; 2. the francoline partridge; 3. an elephant; 4. a frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूप|अनूपं|अनूपः
अनूप <i>(III) m. pl.</i> The name of a country, अनूपराजस्य गुणैरनूनाम् R.vi.37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूपज|अनूपजं
अनूप-ज <i>n.</i> ginger in its undried state.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूपप्राय
अनूप-प्राय <i>a.</i> marshy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूरु|अनूरुः
अनूरु <i>(I) a.</i> Thighless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूरु|अनूरुः
अनूरु <i>(II) m.</i> Aruṇa, the charioteer of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूरुसारथि|अनूरुसारथिः
अनूरु-सारथि <i>m.</i> one whose charioteer is अनूरु, i.e. the sun, Sis.i.2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूर्जित
अनूर्जित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Weak, powerless; 2. free from pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूर्जिता
अनूर्जित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Weak, powerless; 2. free from pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूषर
अनूषर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Saline, (the same as ऊषर); 2. not saline.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूषरा
अनूषर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Saline, (the same as ऊषर); 2. not saline.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृच
अनृच <i>m.</i> 1. One not conversant with the Ṛgveda; 2. a boy not yet invested with the sacred thread and hence not entitled to study the Veda, अनृचो माणावकः Mug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृजु|अनृजुः
अनृजु <i>a.</i> 1. Not straight; 2. wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृण
अनृण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> Free from debt (lit. and fig.) प्राणैर्दशरथप्रीतेरनृणं R.xii.54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृणा
अनृण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> Free from debt (lit. and fig.) प्राणैर्दशरथप्रीतेरनृणं R.xii.54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृणिन्
अनृणिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> The same as अऋणिन् q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृणिनी
अनृणिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> The same as अऋणिन् q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृत|अनृतं
अनृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Untrue, false, M.iv.138.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृता
अनृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Untrue, false, M.iv.138.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृत|अनृतं
अनृत <i>(II) n.</i> 1. False-hood, cheating; 2. agriculture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृतवाच्
अनृत-वाच् <i>f.</i> an untruth, a lie.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृतु|अनृतुः
अनृतु <i>m.</i> An unfit season, improper time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनृतुकन्या
अनृतु-कन्या <i>f.</i> a girl before menstruation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेक|अनेकं
अनेक <i>a.</i> 1. Not one, much, many, Kir.i.16; 2. more than one, अनेकपितृकाणां तु पितृतो भागकल्पना Yaj.ii.120; 3. separated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकाक्षर
अनेक-अक्षर <i>a.</i> consisting of more than one syllable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकाच्
अनेक-अच् <i>a.</i> having more than one vowel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकान्त|अनेकान्तः
अनेक-अन्त <i>(I) a.</i> variable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकान्त|अनेकान्तः
अनेक-अन्त <i>(II) m.</i> 1. want of permanency, unsettled condition; 2. uncertainty; 3. an unessential part, e.g. अनेकान्ता अनुबन्धाः ‘indicatory letters are not an essential part.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकान्तवाद|अनेकान्तवादः
अनेक-अन्त˚वाद <i>m.</i> scepticism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकान्तवादिन्
अनेक-अन्त˚वादिन् <i>m.</i> a Jaina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकार्थ|अनेकार्थः
अनेक-अर्थ <i>(I) m.</i> multiplicity of objects or topics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकार्थ|अनेकार्थः
अनेक-अर्थ <i>(II) a.</i> 1. having more than one meaning, अनेकार्थस्य शब्दस्य K.Pr.ii.; 2. having the sense of the word अनेक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकाश्रय
अनेक-आश्रय <i>m.</i> dependence upon more than one, abiding in more than one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेककालम्
अनेक-कालम् <i>ind.</i> for a long time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकगोत्र
अनेक-गोत्र <i>m.</i> a boy who belongs to two families, viz., to that of his own and to that of his adoptive father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकज|अनेकजः
अनेक-ज <i>(I) a.</i> born more than once.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकज|अनेकजः
अनेक-ज <i>(II) m.</i> a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकत्र
अनेक-त्र <i>ind.</i> in various places.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकधा
अनेक-धा <i>ind.</i> 1. in various ways (रूपं) चक्षुषः सहकारि स्याच्छुक्लादिकमनेकधा; 2. often.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकप|अनेकपः
अनेक-प <i>m.</i> an elephant, मालवनाथोऽप्यनेकानेकपयूथसनाथः D.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकमुख
अनेक-मुख <i>a.</i> 1. many-faced; 2. dispersed, going in various directions, बलानि जगाहिरेऽनेकमुखानि मार्गान् Bt.ii.54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकरूप|अनेकरूपः
अनेक-रूप <i>a.</i> 1. multiform; 2. of various sorts; 3. fickle, of various nature, e.g. वारांगनेव नृपनीतिरनेकरूपा Bhartr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकलोचन|अनेकलोचनः
अनेक-लोचन <i>m.</i> 1. a name of Śiva; 2. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकवचन
अनेक-वचन <i>n.</i> the dual and plural numbers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकवारम्
अनेक-वारम् <i>ind.</i> many times, frequently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकविध
अनेक-विध <i>a.</i> of many kinds, various.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकशफ
अनेक-शफ <i>a.</i> cloven-hoofed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेकशस्
अनेक-शस् <i>ind.</i> 1. in various manners, अनेकशो निर्जितराजकस्त्वम् Bt.ii.52; 2. several times, frequently; 3. by large numbers or quantities, अनेकगोब्राह्मणमनुष्यवधान्मे पुत्रा अनेकशो मृता दाराश्च Hit.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेड|अनेडः
अनेड <i>m.</i> A fool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेडमूक|अनेडमूकः
अनेडमूक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Deaf and dumb, अनेडमूकताद्यैश्चद्यतु दोषौरसंमतान् K.Pr.vii. (Cf. एडमूक); 2. wicked, perverse; 3. blind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेडमूका
अनेडमूक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Deaf and dumb, अनेडमूकताद्यैश्चद्यतु दोषौरसंमतान् K.Pr.vii. (Cf. एडमूक); 2. wicked, perverse; 3. blind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेनस्
अनेनस् <i>a.</i> Sinless, faultless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनेहस्
अनेहस् <i>m. (nom. sing. अनेह)</i> Time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनैकान्त|अनैकांत
अनैकान्त <i>a. (f. न्ता)</i> The same as अनैकान्तिक q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनैकान्ता
अनैकान्त <i>a. (f. न्ता)</i> The same as अनैकान्तिक q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनैकान्तिक|अनैकांतिक
अनैकान्तिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> A kind of fallacy, or हेत्वाभास (in logic). It is of 3 kinds. It is called साधारण if the argument is too general, असाधारण if it is not general enough, and अनुपसंहारिन् if it is non-conclusive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनैकान्तिका
अनैकान्तिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> A kind of fallacy, or हेत्वाभास (in logic). It is of 3 kinds. It is called साधारण if the argument is too general, असाधारण if it is not general enough, and अनुपसंहारिन् if it is non-conclusive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनैक्य|अनैक्यं
अनैक्य <i>n.</i> 1. Plurality; 2. want of union; 3. anarchy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनैतिह्य|अनैतिह्यं
अनैतिह्य <i>n.</i> Absence of traditional sanction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनो
अनो <i>ind.</i> No, not.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनोकशायिन्
अनोकशायिन् <i>m.</i> not sleeping in a house, i.e. a beggar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनोकह|अनोकहः
अनोकह <i>m.</i> A tree, R.ii.13, v.69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनौचित्य|अनौचित्यं
अनौचित्य <i>n.</i> Unfitness, impropriety, अनौचित्यादृते नान्यद्रसभंगस्य कारणम् K.Pr.vii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनौजस्य|अनौजस्यं
अनौजस्य <i>n.</i> Want of strength, want of energy. It is thus defined- दौर्गत्याद्यैरनौजस्यं दैन्यं मलिनतादिकृत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनौद्धत्य|अनौद्धत्यं
अनौद्धत्य <i>n.</i> 1. Modesty, humility; 2. tranquility, नदीरनौद्धत्यमपंकता महीम् (scil. उपैति) Kir.iv.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनौरस
अनौरस <i>m.</i> Not ones own, adopted (as a son).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्त|अंत|अन्तं|अन्तः
अन्त <i>(I) a. (f. न्ता)</i> 1. Lowest, worst; 2. youngest; 3. near; 4. last, e.g. अन्ते वयसि ‘in the last stage of life’; 5. handsome, beautiful, Sis.iv.40, Megh.i.23. (This meaning, is very doubtful, though Mall. renders अन्त by रम्य in the places referred to. Viśva and Śabdārṇava are the only Sanskrit lexicons which give it).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्ता
अन्त <i>(I) a. (f. न्ता)</i> 1. Lowest, worst; 2. youngest; 3. near; 4. last, e.g. अन्ते वयसि ‘in the last stage of life’; 5. handsome, beautiful, Sis.iv.40, Megh.i.23. (This meaning, is very doubtful, though Mall. renders अन्त by रम्य in the places referred to. Viśva and Śabdārṇava are the only Sanskrit lexicons which give it).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्त|अंत|अन्तं|अन्तः
अन्त <i>(II) m.</i> 1. End, अद्य कान्तः कृतान्तो वा दुःखस्यान्तं करिष्यति Ud., दिनान्ते श्रूयन्ते मदमलिनगण्डाः करटिनः Bh.V.i.2; 2. limit, boundary, e.g. ओदकान्तात्स्निग्धोऽनुगन्तव्यः; 3. end of a texture, e.g. पटान्तः, वसनान्तः; 4. place in general, e.g. वनान्तः ‘forest-ground,’ संगतयोर्वनांते R.ii.58; 5. end of life, death; 6. the final letter of a word (in gram.); 7. the last word of a compound; 8. definite ascertainment, उभयोरपिदृष्टोन्तस्त्वनयोस्तत्वदर्शीभिः Bg.ii.16; 9. proximity, nearness, e.g. आचार्यस्य वसेदन्ते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्त|अंत|अन्तं|अन्तः
अन्त <i>(III) n.</i> Nature, disposition, essence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्त|अंत|अन्तं|अन्तः
अन्त <i>(IV) m.n.</i> The last portion, the remainder (as in वेदान्त or निशान्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तावशायिन्
अन्त-अवशायिन्, -अवसायिन् <i>m.</i> 1. a barber; 2. a caṇḍāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तावसायिन्
अन्त-अवशायिन्, -अवसायिन् <i>m.</i> 1. a barber; 2. a caṇḍāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तकर
अन्त-कर, -करण, -कारिन् <i>a.</i> mortal, destructive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तकरण
अन्त-कर, -करण, -कारिन् <i>a.</i> mortal, destructive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तकारिन्
अन्त-कर, -करण, -कारिन् <i>a.</i> mortal, destructive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तकृत्
अन्त-कृत् <i>m.</i> death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तकाल|अन्तकालः
अन्त-काल <i>m.</i> time of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तग|अन्तगः
अन्त-ग <i>a.</i> going to the end, thoroughly conversant with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तदीपक
अन्त-दीपक <i>n.</i> a figure of speech (in rhetoric).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तपाल|अन्तपालः
अन्त-पाल <i>m.</i> 1. a frontier guard; 2. a door-keeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तलीन
अन्त-लीन <i>a.</i> hidden, concealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तलोप|अन्तलोपः
अन्त-लोप <i>m.</i> dropping of the final of a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तवत्|अंतवत्|अन्तवन्त्
अन्त-वत् <i>a.</i> perishable, अंतवन्त इमे देहाः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तवासिन्
अन्त-वासिन् <i>m.</i> 1. a pupil (who dwells in the house of his teacher); 2. a caṇḍāla (who dwells at the extremity of a village.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तवेला
अन्त-वेला <i>f.</i> hour of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तशय्या
अन्त-शय्या <i>f.</i> 1. death; 2. the place for burning or burial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तसत्क्रिया
अन्त-सत्क्रिया <i>f.</i> the funeral ceremonies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तसद्
अन्त-सद् <i>m.</i> a pupil, तमुपासते गुरुमिवान्तसदः Kir.vi.34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=028-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तक|अंतक|अन्तकः
अन्तक <i>m.</i> 1. Death; 2. Yama, the god of death, R.ii.62; 3. a destroyer, अन्तकस्यान्तकोऽहम् Ve.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्ततस्
अन्ततस् <i>ind.</i> From, on, at the end, border &c. (This form is used for nearly all the cases of अन्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्|अंतर्
अन्तर् <i>ind.</i> This word is used- (1) adverbially; (2) as a separable preposition; (3) as a prefix to verbs, and (4) in composition with nouns.When used adverbially, it means- (1) ‘in the middle,’ ‘within’ (generally with a noun in the loc., e.g. अप्स्वन्तरमृतम्); 2. ‘in the interior’ (with a noun in the gen. प्रतिबलजलधेरन्तरौर्वायमाणे Ve.iii.), लघुवृत्तितया भिदां गतं बहिरन्तश्च नृपस्य मण्डलम् Kir.ii.53; (3) by way of seizing, e.g. अन्तर्हत्वा मूषिकां श्येनो गतः.As a separable preposition, it means- (1) ‘within’; (2) ‘between’ (with a noun in the gen., e.g. हिरण्मय्योः कुश्योरन्तरवहित आस).As a prefix to verbs, it means- (1) ‘in the middle,’ ‘between,’ as in अन्तर्हत्य; 2. ‘under.’In composition with nouns, it means ‘in the middle of,’ ‘in the interior of,’ ‘in the heart of’ e.g. अन्तर्गिरि, उदरान्तः प्रविश्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरग्नि|अन्तरग्निः
अन्तर्-अग्नि <i>m.</i> the fire in the body, the digestive faculty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरंग|अन्तरङ्ग|अन्तरङ्गः
अन्तर्-अंग <i>(I) a.</i> 1. comprehended, included, (with abl.), त्रयमन्तरंगं पूर्वेभ्यः ‘the three are included in the former’; 2. essential, indispensable; 3. dear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरंग|अन्तरङ्ग|अन्तरङ्गः
अन्तर्-अंग <i>(II) n.</i> interior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तराकाश|अन्तराकाशः
अन्तर्-आकाश <i>m.</i> Brahman (n.) that resides in the heart (in Upanishads.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तराकूत
अन्तर्-आकूत <i>n.</i> hidden intention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरात्मन्
अन्तर्-आत्मन् <i>m.</i> 1. the soul; 2. the internal feelings, heart; 3. the supreme soul as residing in the interior of man (in phil.) अन्तरात्मासि देहिनाम् K.S.vi.21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तराराम
अन्तर्-आराम <i>a.</i> one who finds his pleasures in his soul or heart, योन्तःसुखोऽन्तरारामः Bg.v.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरिंद्रिय|अन्तरिन्द्रिय
अन्तर्-इंद्रिय <i>n.</i> an internal organ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःकरण|अन्तःकरणं
अन्तर्-करण <i>n.</i> 1. the seat of thought and feeling, i.e. the mind; 2. the thinking faculty, यास्वन्तःकरणस्य &c. M.M.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःकुटिल|अन्तःकुटिलः
अन्तर्-कुटिल <i>(I) a.</i> internally crooked (lit. and fig.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःकुटिल|अन्तःकुटिलः
अन्तर्-कुटिल <i>(II) m.</i> conch shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःकोण
अन्तर्-कोण <i>m.</i> the inner corner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःकोप|अन्तःकोपः
अन्तर्-कोप <i>m.</i> inward wrath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गडु
अन्तर्-गडु <i>n.</i> unnecessary, unavailing, किमनेनान्तर्गडुना Sar.S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गत|अंतर्गत|अन्तर्गतं
अन्तर्-गत <i>a.</i> 1. gone into, slipped into, e.g. रसवत्पद्यान्तर्गतनीरसपदानाम् ‘of tasteless words that have slipped into tasteful verses’; 2. included in or by, belonging to; 3. interior, hidden, secret, e.g. नेत्रवक्त्रविकारेण लक्ष्यतेऽन्तर्गतं मनः; 4. destroyed; 5. forgotten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गर्भ
अन्तर्-गर्भ <i>a.</i> pregnant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गूढविष|अन्तर्गूढविषः
अन्तर्-गूढविष <i>a.</i> with poison hidden in the heart, e.g. अंतर्गूढविषो बहिर्मधुमयश्चातीव मायापटुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गृह|अन्तर्गृहं
अन्तर्-गृह <i>n.</i> an inner apartment of the house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्जठर|अन्तर्जठरं
अन्तर्-जठर <i>n.</i> the stomach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तस्ताप|अन्तस्तापः
अन्तर्-ताप <i>m.</i> inward heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तस्त्य
अन्तर्-त्य <i>n.</i> intestines, bowels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्दाह|अन्तर्दाहः
अन्तर्-दाह <i>m.</i> inward heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्देश|अन्तर्देशः
अन्तर्-देश <i>m.</i> an intermediate region of the compass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्द्वार|अन्तर्द्वारं
अन्तर्-द्वार <i>n.</i> a private door within the house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःपट|अन्तःपटः
अन्तर्-पट <i>m.n.</i> a screen of cloth held between two persons who are to be united until the right moment of union is arrived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःपदम्
अन्तर्-पदम् <i>ind.</i> in the middle of an inflected word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःपरिधान
अन्तर्-परिधान <i>n.</i> the inner-most garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःपात|अन्तःपातः
अन्तर्-पात, -पात्य <i>m.</i> 1. insertion of a letter (in gram.); 2. a post fixed in the middle of the place of sacrifice (in ritual literature).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःपात्य|अन्तःपात्यः
अन्तर्-पात, -पात्य <i>m.</i> 1. insertion of a letter (in gram.); 2. a post fixed in the middle of the place of sacrifice (in ritual literature).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःपातिन्
अन्तर्-पातिन् <i>a.</i> involved in, included by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=029-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःपुर|अन्तःपुरं
