अन्तर्वेशिक
अन्तर्-वेश्म(शि)क <i>m.</i> superintendent of the women’s appartment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=030-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

