अन्तर्-सत्वा <i>f.</i> a pregnant woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=030-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःसंताप|अन्तःसन्ताप|अन्तःसन्तापः
