अन्तरतर
अन्तर-तर <i>a.</i> nearer, more intimate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=030-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरदिशा
अन्तर-दिशा <i>f.</i> an intermediate region of the compass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=030-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरपुरुष|अन्तरपुरुषः
अन्तर-पुरुष, -पूरुष <i>m.</i> soul or god that resides in the heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=030-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरपूरुष|अन्तरपूरुषः
अन्तर-पुरुष, -पूरुष <i>m.</i> soul or god that resides in the heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=030-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरप्रभव|अन्तरप्रभवः
अन्तर-प्रभव <i>m.</i> mixed caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=030-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरस्थ
अन्तर-स्थ <i>a.</i> 1. inward, internal; 2. standing between.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=030-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरम्
अन्तरम् <i>ind.</i> In the middle, within.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरय|अंतरयः|अन्तरयः
अन्तरय <i>m.</i> An impediment, an obstacle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरयण
अन्तरयण <i>n.</i> See अन्तरय, e.g. माकार्षीरन्तरयणम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरा|अंतरा
अन्तरा <i>ind.</i> It is used adverbially and as a preposition.As an adverb, it means- (1) ‘in the way,’ R.xv.20; (2) ‘between’; (3) ‘in the mean time’; (अन्तरान्तरा ‘at intervals,’ ‘now and then,’ e.g. सोऽपतानकसंज्ञो यः पातयत्यन्तरान्तरा); (4) near, at hand.As a preposition, (with a noun in the acc.), it means- (1) ‘between,’ अन्तरा त्वां च मां च कमण्डलुः P.Bh.; (2) ‘without.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरावेदि|अन्तरावेदिः
अन्तरा-वेदि(दी) <i>f.</i> 1. a kind of open portico; 2. a kind of wall, जयश्रीरन्तरावेदिर्मत्तवारणयोरिव R.xii.93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरावेदी
अन्तरा-वेदि(दी) <i>f.</i> 1. a kind of open portico; 2. a kind of wall, जयश्रीरन्तरावेदिर्मत्तवारणयोरिव R.xii.93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तराशृंगम्|अन्तराशृङ्गम्
अन्तरा-शृंगम् <i>ind.</i> between the horns.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तराय|अंतरायः|अन्तरायः
अन्तराय <i>m.</i> Obstacle, impediment, अस्य ते बाणपातपथवर्तिनः कृष्णसारस्यान्तरायौ तपस्विनौ संवृत्तौ Sak.i., त्वमन्तरायो भवसि च्युतो विधिः R.iii.45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तराल|अंतरालं|अन्तरालं
अन्तराल <i>n.</i> 1. Intermediate space; 2. intermediate time; 3. middle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरिक्ष|अंतरिक्षं|अन्तरिक्षं
