अन्तरि(री)क्ष-ग, -चर <i>m.</i> a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

