अन्तरेण|अंतरेण
अन्तरेण <i>ind.</i> 1. Amidst, between; 2. without, (with acc. तानन्तरेण रमणी रमणीयशिले Bh.V.iii.10), क्रियान्तरांतरायमन्तरेण Mud.iii.; 3. with regard to, with reference to, (with acc.), देवीं वसुमतीमन्तरेण महदुपालम्भनं गतोस्मि Sak.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्धा|अंतर्धा
