अन्तर्य|अंतर्य|अन्तर्य्य
अन्तर्य <i>a. (f. र्या)</i> Being within, in the middle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्या
अन्तर्य <i>a. (f. र्या)</i> Being within, in the middle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्ति|अंति|अन्तिः
अन्ति <i>f.</i> an elder sister (in theatrical language).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तिक|अंतिक|अन्तिकं|अन्तिकः
