अंतिमा
अंतिम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Immediately following; 2. final, ultimate, last, सकृद्दुःखकरावाद्यावंतिमस्तु पदेपदे Hit.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

