अन्ते
अन्ते <i>ind. (loc. sing. of अन्त sometimes used adverbially)</i> 1. In the end; 2. in the inside; 3. near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तेवास|अन्तेवासः
अन्ते-वास <i>m.</i> 1. a pupil; 2. a neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तेवासिन्
अन्ते-वासिन् <i>m.</i> 1. a pupil, अन्तेवासिदयालुरुज्झितनयेनासादितो जिष्णुना Ve.iii.; 2. a caṇḍāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्त्य|अंत्य|अन्त्यं|अन्त्यः
अन्त्य <i>(I) a. (f. न्त्या)</i> 1. Last (in place, time, or order), असद्मपीडं भगवन्नृणमंत्यमवेहि मे R.i.71, viii.71; 2. immediately following; 3. inferior, lowest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्त्या
अन्त्य <i>(I) a. (f. न्त्या)</i> 1. Last (in place, time, or order), असद्मपीडं भगवन्नृणमंत्यमवेहि मे R.i.71, viii.71; 2. immediately following; 3. inferior, lowest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्त्य|अंत्य|अन्त्यं|अन्त्यः
अन्त्य <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The last syllable of a word; 2. a man of the lowest tribe; 3. the last lunar month, viz., फाल्गुन; 4. a Mleccha or foreigner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्त्य|अंत्य|अन्त्यं|अन्त्यः
