अन्त्यावसायिन्
अन्त्य-अवसायिन् <i>m.</i> a man or woman of low caste, especially one of the following classes- चाण्डाल, श्वपच, क्षत्तृ, सूत, वैदेहक, मागध, आयोगव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

