अन्त्येष्टि|अन्त्येष्टिः
अन्त्य-इष्टि <i>f.</i> funeral sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्त्यर्ण
अन्त्य-ऋण <i>n.</i> the last debt, viz., that of begetting children. (There are three debts which every Brāhmaṇa owes- (1) to the sages, (2) to gods and (3) to deceased ancestors respectively. The first is discharged by studying scripture, the second by sacrificing, and the third by begetting children. See R.i.71, viii.30).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=031-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

