अपांग|अपाङ्ग|अपाङ्गः
अपांग <i>m.</i> 1. The outer corner of the eye; 2. a sectarian mark on the forehead; 3. the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=040-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपांगदर्शन|अपाङ्गदर्शन|अपाङ्गदर्शनं
अपांग-दर्शन <i>n.</i> a side-glance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=040-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपांगनेत्रा|अपाङ्गनेत्रा
अपांग-नेत्रा <i>f.</i> a lady having eyes with beautiful outer corners, यदियं पुनरप्यपांगनेत्रा परिवृत्तार्धमुखी मयाद्य दृष्टा Vikr.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=040-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाच्
