अपाची
अपाच् <i>a. (f. ची)</i> 1. Western; 2. southern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=040-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाची
अपाची <i>f.</i> The south.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=040-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

