अपार्थ
अपार्थ <i>(I) a. (f. र्था)</i> 1. Useless, unprofitable; 2. unmeaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=041-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपार्था
