अपिनद्ध|अपिनद्धं
अपिनद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. Tied on; 2. accoutred. (Also पिनद्ध)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिनद्धा
अपिनद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. Tied on; 2. accoutred. (Also पिनद्ध)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिव्रत
अपिव्रत <i>m.</i> One who is joint in property with others and shares in the same religious acts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिहित
अपिहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Covered, concealed (lit. and fig.), बाष्पेनापिहिता राज्ञी नोत्तरं किंचिदब्रवीत् the queen covered with tears did not give any reply; 2. not covered, plain, e.g. अर्थो गिरामपिहितः पिहितश्चकास्ति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिहिता
अपिहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Covered, concealed (lit. and fig.), बाष्पेनापिहिता राज्ञी नोत्तरं किंचिदब्रवीत् the queen covered with tears did not give any reply; 2. not covered, plain, e.g. अर्थो गिरामपिहितः पिहितश्चकास्ति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीति|अपीतिः
