अपुष्ट
अपुष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Not fat, lean; 2. not loud, not violent; 3. irrelevant, unassisting, as a word (considered in rhetoric as a fault of meaning or sense (अर्थदोष); in the instance ‘विलोक्य वितते व्योमिन् विधुं मुञ्च रुषं प्रिये,’ ‘वितते’ is irrelevant because the expansion of the sky has nothing to do with the cessation of anger).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुष्टा
अपुष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Not fat, lean; 2. not loud, not violent; 3. irrelevant, unassisting, as a word (considered in rhetoric as a fault of meaning or sense (अर्थदोष); in the instance ‘विलोक्य वितते व्योमिन् विधुं मुञ्च रुषं प्रिये,’ ‘वितते’ is irrelevant because the expansion of the sky has nothing to do with the cessation of anger).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूप|अपूपः
