अपेक्षण|अपेक्षणं
अपेक्षण <i>n.</i> The same as अपेक्षा q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षा
अपेक्षा <i>f.</i> 1. Attention, heedful-ness, e.g. देशापेक्षास्तथा यूयं यातादायांगुरीयकम् Bt.vii.49; 2. respect, deference; 3. consideration; 4. care, expectation; 5. reference, relation; 6. need. (The inst. and loc. singulars of this word, viz, अपेक्षया and अपेक्षायाम् are used generally as last members of a compound in the sense of ‘with reference to,’ e.g. अत्र व्यंग्यं गुणीभूतं तदपेक्षया वाच्यस्यैव चमत्कारित्वात् K.Pr.i.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षणीय|अपेक्षणीयं
अपेक्षणीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. To be considered or regarded; 2. to be had regard for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षणीया
अपेक्षणीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. To be considered or regarded; 2. to be had regard for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

