अपेक्षिता
अपेक्षित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Regarded, looked upon; 2. considered; 3. desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेत
अपेत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Departed, lost (lit. and fig.), अपेतयुद्धाभिनिवेशसौम्यो हरिः Sis.iii.1; 2. deprived of, free from, (with abl., e.g. सुखादपेतः); 3. contrary to, (with the abl., e.g. धर्मादपेतम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=042-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेता
