अप्रतिशासन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Having no rival in sovereignty, subject to one rule, R.viii.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिशासना
अप्रतिशासन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Having no rival in sovereignty, subject to one rule, R.viii.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिष्ठान
अप्रतिष्ठान <i>n.</i> Want of solidity or firmness (lit. and fig.), तर्काप्रतिष्ठानादप्यन्यथानुमेयम् S.Bh.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिहत
अप्रतिहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Unimpaired, unaffected, सा बुद्धिरप्रतिहता Bhartr.ii.40; 2. unobstructed, unimpeded, जृम्भतामप्रतिहतप्रसरमार्यस्य क्रोधज्योतिः Ve.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिहता
अप्रतिहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Unimpaired, unaffected, सा बुद्धिरप्रतिहता Bhartr.ii.40; 2. unobstructed, unimpeded, जृम्भतामप्रतिहतप्रसरमार्यस्य क्रोधज्योतिः Ve.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिहतचित्त
अप्रतिहत-चित्त <i>a.</i> of unimpaired intellect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिहतनेत्र|अप्रतिहतनेत्रः
अप्रतिहत-नेत्र <i>a.</i> with unimpaired eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिहतप्रसर
अप्रतिहत-प्रसर <i>a.</i> having an unimpaired course. (See above 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिहतशक्ति
अप्रतिहत-शक्ति <i>a.</i> of irresistible power or weapon, गुह इवाप्रतिहतशक्तिः Kad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतीत
अप्रतीत <i>a.</i> 1. Not understood, not clearly intelligible (as a word) (This is regarded as a defect of a word in rhetoric. A word is defined as being अप्रतीत, if it is used in a sense which it may have only in a certain class of works, K.Pr.vii.); 2. not pleased or satisfied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रत्ता
अप्रत्ता <i>f.</i> A girl not yet given in marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रत्यक्ष|अप्रत्यक्षः
अप्रत्यक्ष <i>a. (f. क्षा)</i> 1. Not visible, imperceptible; 2. absent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रत्यक्षा
अप्रत्यक्ष <i>a. (f. क्षा)</i> 1. Not visible, imperceptible; 2. absent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रत्यय|अप्रत्ययः
अप्रत्यय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. having no confidence, distrusting, बलवदपि शिक्षितानामात्मन्यप्रत्ययम् Sak.i.; 2. having no knowledge; 3. having no affix (in gram.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रत्यया
अप्रत्यय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. having no confidence, distrusting, बलवदपि शिक्षितानामात्मन्यप्रत्ययम् Sak.i.; 2. having no knowledge; 3. having no affix (in gram.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रत्यय|अप्रत्ययः
अप्रत्यय <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Distrust, want of confidence, e.g. कपटशतमयं क्षेत्रमप्रत्ययानाम् (scil. स्त्रीरूपम्) Silhaṇa. ‘a woman’s figure is a field … for all kinds of distrust’; 2. the not being understood, the not resulting clearly; 3. a non-affix (in gram.) अर्थवदधातुरप्रत्ययः प्रातिपादिकम् Pan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रदक्षिणम्
अप्रदक्षिणम् <i>ind.</i> From the left to the right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रधान|अप्रधानं
अप्रधान <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Not principal, secondary, subordinate, (op. to अगौण)^1, आवां तावदप्रधानौ Hit.i. (In most instances, the word occurs as a neuter, either as an attribute to a noun or absolutely or as a part of a compound in the sense of ‘any thing secondary’).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251210. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रधाना
अप्रधान <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Not principal, secondary, subordinate, (op. to अगौण)^1, आवां तावदप्रधानौ Hit.i. (In most instances, the word occurs as a neuter, either as an attribute to a noun or absolutely or as a part of a compound in the sense of ‘any thing secondary’).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251210. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रधृष्य
अप्रधृष्य <i>a. (f. ष्या)</i> Invincible, unconquerable, यथाश्रौषं भीष्ममत्यन्तशूरं हतं पार्थेनाहवेष्वप्रधृष्यम् Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रधृष्या
अप्रधृष्य <i>a. (f. ष्या)</i> Invincible, unconquerable, यथाश्रौषं भीष्ममत्यन्तशूरं हतं पार्थेनाहवेष्वप्रधृष्यम् Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रभु
अप्रभु <i>a.</i> 1. Incompetent, unable, (with the loc., e.g. आकर्षणेऽप्रभुः ‘unable to draw up’); 2. not powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमत्त|अप्रमत्तः
अप्रमत्त <i>a. (f. त्ता)</i> Assiduous, attentive, vigilant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमत्ता
अप्रमत्त <i>a. (f. त्ता)</i> Assiduous, attentive, vigilant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमद
अप्रमद <i>a. (f. दा)</i> Joyless, sad, Bt.x.9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमदा
अप्रमद <i>a. (f. दा)</i> Joyless, sad, Bt.x.9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=043-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमा
अप्रमा <i>f.</i> The reverse of प्रमा, the same as अप्रमाण II q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमाण
अप्रमाण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Immeasurable; 2. unauthorized, without proof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमाणा
अप्रमाण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Immeasurable; 2. unauthorized, without proof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमाण
अप्रमाण <i>(II) n.</i> 1. No authority, i.e. a rule, injunction, saying &c. which is not binding; 2. irrelevancy. (Cf. such words as अप्रामाण्य, अमा, अमान, प्रमाणाभाव^1).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251210. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमेय
अप्रमेय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Immeasurable, unbounded; 2. not to be properly understood or ascertained, e.g. अचिन्त्यस्याप्रमेयस्य कार्यतत्वार्थवित् प्रभुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमेया
अप्रमेय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Immeasurable, unbounded; 2. not to be properly understood or ascertained, e.g. अचिन्त्यस्याप्रमेयस्य कार्यतत्वार्थवित् प्रभुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमेय
अप्रमेय <i>(II) n.</i> The supreme soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रयाणि|अप्रयाणिः
अप्रयाणि <i>f.</i> Not going, not progressing (used only in negative phrases, implying an imprecation, e.g. अप्रयाणिस्ते भूयात् ‘mayst thou not be able to progress’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रयुक्त
अप्रयुक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Not employed, not applied; 2. wrongly used (as a word); 3. not usual, strange (as a word in a particular sense or gender). In rhetoric being अप्रयुक्त is considered as a defect of a word which must be avoided. In the instance तथा मन्ये दैवतोऽस्य पिशाचो राक्षसोऽथवा, the masc. form दैवतः is अप्रयुक्त, for although grammatically correct, it is not generally used, K.Pr.vii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रयुक्ता
अप्रयुक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Not employed, not applied; 2. wrongly used (as a word); 3. not usual, strange (as a word in a particular sense or gender). In rhetoric being अप्रयुक्त is considered as a defect of a word which must be avoided. In the instance तथा मन्ये दैवतोऽस्य पिशाचो राक्षसोऽथवा, the masc. form दैवतः is अप्रयुक्त, for although grammatically correct, it is not generally used, K.Pr.vii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रवृत्ति|अप्रवृत्तिः
अप्रवृत्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Not taking place, not proceeding; 2. inactivity, inertion, inertness, आलस्यं कायचित्तगुरुत्वादप्रवृत्तिः /Yoga S./<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रसंग|अप्रसङ्ग|अप्रसंगः|अप्रसङ्गः
अप्रसंग <i>m.</i> 1. Want of attachment; 2. want of connection; 3. improper time or occasion, अप्रसंगाभिधाने च श्रोतुः श्रद्धा न जायते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रस्ताविक
अप्रस्ताविक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Not belonging to the subject matter, irrelevant अप्रस्ताविकी (v.l. for अप्रा०) महत्येषा कथा M.M.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रस्ताविकी
अप्रस्ताविक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Not belonging to the subject matter, irrelevant अप्रस्ताविकी (v.l. for अप्रा०) महत्येषा कथा M.M.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रस्तुत|अप्रस्तुतं
अप्रस्तुत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Unsuitable to the time or subject, irrelevant; 2. accidental, extraneous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रस्तुता
अप्रस्तुत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Unsuitable to the time or subject, irrelevant; 2. accidental, extraneous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रस्तुतप्रशंसा
अप्रस्तुत-प्रशंसा <i>f.</i> a figure of speech in rhetoric, in which the information to be given is conveyed by stating something else. According to K.Pr., it is of five kinds and is defined as conveying the subject matter, if it is of a specific nature- (1) by means of generalisation, or if it is of a general kind; (2) by means of specification, or if it is viewed as a cause; (3) by stating the effect, or if it is viewed as an effect; (4) by stating the cause, or (5) hinting at the subject matter by stating what is similar to it. (For instances, See K.Pr.x.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रहत|अप्रहतं
अप्रहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Unploughed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रहता
अप्रहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Unploughed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राकरणिक
अप्राकरणिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Not belonging to the subject matter, अप्राकरणिकस्याभिधानेन प्राकरणिकस्याक्षेपोऽप्रस्तुतप्रशंसा K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राकरणिकी
अप्राकरणिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Not belonging to the subject matter, अप्राकरणिकस्याभिधानेन प्राकरणिकस्याक्षेपोऽप्रस्तुतप्रशंसा K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

