अप्राग्र्य <i>a. (f. ग्र्या)</i> Secondary, subordinate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राग्र्या
अप्राग्र्य <i>a. (f. ग्र्या)</i> Secondary, subordinate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राप्त|अप्राप्तः
अप्राप्त <i>a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Not obtained, not taken possession of, अप्राप्तयोस्तु या प्राप्तिः सैव संयोग ईरितः Bh.P.; 2. not arrived; 3. not authorized (as a rule).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राप्ता
अप्राप्त <i>a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Not obtained, not taken possession of, अप्राप्तयोस्तु या प्राप्तिः सैव संयोग ईरितः Bh.P.; 2. not arrived; 3. not authorized (as a rule).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राप्तावसर
अप्राप्त-अवसर <i>a.</i> unseasonable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राप्तकाल
अप्राप्त-काल <i>a.</i> out of season, ill-timed, e.g. अप्राप्तकालं वचनं बृहस्पतिरपि ब्रुवन् प्राप्नोति बुद्ध्यवज्ञानमपमानं च शाश्वतम् ॥.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राप्तयौवन
अप्राप्त-यौवन <i>a.</i> not arrived at puberty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राप्तवयस्
अप्राप्त-वयस्, -व्यवहार <i>a.</i> a minor in law, not of years to engage in public business. (A boy is a minor while under sixteen years of age, अप्राप्तव्यवहारोऽसौ यावत्षोडशवार्षिकः Daksha.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राप्तव्यवहार
अप्राप्त-वयस्, -व्यवहार <i>a.</i> a minor in law, not of years to engage in public business. (A boy is a minor while under sixteen years of age, अप्राप्तव्यवहारोऽसौ यावत्षोडशवार्षिकः Daksha.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्राप्ति|अप्राप्तिः
अप्राप्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Non-attainment, non-acquisition, तदप्राप्तिमहादुःखविलीनाशेषपातका K.Pr.iv.; 2. the not being established by a rule before, e.g. विधिरत्यन्तमप्राप्तौ; 3. the not takings place, the not occurring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रामाणिक|अप्रामाणिकः
अप्रामाणिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Unwarranted, unauthoritative, अतोऽविभक्तार्जितत्वमात्रेण धनस्य साधारणत्वाभिधानमप्रामाणिकम् D.B.; 2. unworthy of being trusted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रामाणिकी
अप्रामाणिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Unwarranted, unauthoritative, अतोऽविभक्तार्जितत्वमात्रेण धनस्य साधारणत्वाभिधानमप्रामाणिकम् D.B.; 2. unworthy of being trusted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रिय|अप्रियं|अप्रियः
अप्रिय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Disagreeable, disliked, offensive, e.g. अप्रियस्य च पथ्यस्य वक्ता श्रोता च दुर्लभः or न ब्रूयात्सत्यमप्रियम् M.iv.138; 2. unfriendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रिया
अप्रिय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Disagreeable, disliked, offensive, e.g. अप्रियस्य च पथ्यस्य वक्ता श्रोता च दुर्लभः or न ब्रूयात्सत्यमप्रियम् M.iv.138; 2. unfriendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रिय|अप्रियं|अप्रियः
अप्रिय <i>(II) n.</i> An unfriendly act, e.g. पाणिग्रहस्य साध्वी स्त्री नाचरेत्किंचिदप्रियम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रिय|अप्रियं|अप्रियः
अप्रिय <i>(III) m.</i> An enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रियंवद
अप्रियंवद <i>a.</i> speaking harshly, वन्ध्याऽर्थघ्न्यप्रियंवदा Yaj.i.73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रियवादिन्
अप्रिय-वादिन्, -भाषिन् <i>a.</i> speaking harshly or unkindly, माता यस्य गृहे नास्ति भार्या चाप्रियवादिनी Cāṇakya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रियभाषिन्
अप्रिय-वादिन्, -भाषिन् <i>a.</i> speaking harshly or unkindly, माता यस्य गृहे नास्ति भार्या चाप्रियवादिनी Cāṇakya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रौढ
अप्रौढ <i>a. (f. ढा)</i> 1. Not full grown; 2. not bold, gentle, timid, एकाकिनीं रहः क्षीवां लब्ध्वा दुर्लभयोषिताम् । अप्रौढोऽनुपभुज्यान्यदिने दूत्यार्थयेत यः Rajat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रौढा
अप्रौढ <i>a. (f. ढा)</i> 1. Not full grown; 2. not bold, gentle, timid, एकाकिनीं रहः क्षीवां लब्ध्वा दुर्लभयोषिताम् । अप्रौढोऽनुपभुज्यान्यदिने दूत्यार्थयेत यः Rajat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रौढा
अप्रौढा <i>f.</i> 1. A girl who has not attained womanhood; 2. an unmarried girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्लुत
अप्लुत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Not protracted, as a vowel (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्लुता
अप्लुत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Not protracted, as a vowel (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्सरस्
अप्सरस् <i>f. (generally pl. The word is thus derived- अप्सु निर्मथनादेव रसात्तस्माद्वरार्स्त्रियः । उत्पेतुर्मनुजश्रेष्ठ तस्मादप्सरसोऽभवन्.)</i> Certain female divinities who reside in the sky and are the wives of the Gandharvas. They are sometimes represented as the common women of gods. They are very fond of bathing and are said to have been produced at the churning of the ocean; एकाप्सरः प्रार्थितयोर्विवादः R.vii.53. The Kādambarī describes 14 families of them- विबुधसध्रन्यप्सरसो नाम कन्यकाः सन्ति … तासां चतुर्दश कुलानि &c. &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्सरस्तीर्थ
अप्सरस्-तीर्थ <i>n.</i> a pool in which the अप्सरसः bathe (perhaps it is the name of a particular place, Sak.vi.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्सरःपति|अप्सरःपतिः
अप्सरस्-पति <i>m.</i> an epithet of Indra (as being the lord of the अप्सरस्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=044-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्सरा
अप्सरा <i>f.</i> The same as अप्सरस् q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफल|अफलः
अफल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Without fruits (as a tree), याः फलिनीर्या अफला अपुष्पा याश्च पुष्पिणीः (Scil. ओषधयः) Vaj.S.; 2. useless, resultless, यथा षण्डोऽफलः स्त्रीषु यथा गौर्गवि चाफला । यथा चाज्ञेऽफलं ज्ञानं तथा विप्रोऽनृचोऽफलः M.ii.158; 3. emasculated, unmanned, अफलस्तु ततः शक्रः Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफला
अफल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Without fruits (as a tree), याः फलिनीर्या अफला अपुष्पा याश्च पुष्पिणीः (Scil. ओषधयः) Vaj.S.; 2. useless, resultless, यथा षण्डोऽफलः स्त्रीषु यथा गौर्गवि चाफला । यथा चाज्ञेऽफलं ज्ञानं तथा विप्रोऽनृचोऽफलः M.ii.158; 3. emasculated, unmanned, अफलस्तु ततः शक्रः Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफलाकांक्षिन्|अफलाकाङ्क्षिन्
अफल-आकांक्षिन् <i>a.</i> disinterested, e.g. अफलाकांक्षिभिर्यज्ञः क्रियते ब्रह्मवादिभिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफेन|अफेनं
अफेन <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Froth-less, without foam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफेना
अफेन <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Froth-less, without foam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अफेन|अफेनं
अफेन <i>(II) n.</i> Opium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबद्ध|अबद्धं|अबद्धः
अबद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. not bound, not restrained; 2. unmeaning, nonsensical, contradictory. (The following are given as instances of nonsensical and contradictory sentences- (1) जरद्गवः कम्बलपदुकाभ्यां द्वारि स्थितो गायति मंगलानि । ब्राह्मणी पृच्छति पुत्रकामा राजनगर्यां लवणस्य कोर्घः ॥ Rāyamukuṭa on Am.; (2) यावज्जीवमहं मौनी ब्रह्मचारी च मे पिता । माता तु मम वन्ध्याऽऽसीदपुत्रश्च पितामहः ॥).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबद्धा
अबद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. not bound, not restrained; 2. unmeaning, nonsensical, contradictory. (The following are given as instances of nonsensical and contradictory sentences- (1) जरद्गवः कम्बलपदुकाभ्यां द्वारि स्थितो गायति मंगलानि । ब्राह्मणी पृच्छति पुत्रकामा राजनगर्यां लवणस्य कोर्घः ॥ Rāyamukuṭa on Am.; (2) यावज्जीवमहं मौनी ब्रह्मचारी च मे पिता । माता तु मम वन्ध्याऽऽसीदपुत्रश्च पितामहः ॥).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबद्धमुख|अबद्धमुखः
अबद्ध-मुख <i>a.</i> scurrilous, foul-mouthed, abusive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबद्धक|अबद्धकं
अबद्धक <i>a. (f. द्धिका)</i> The same as अबद्ध q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबद्धिका
अबद्धक <i>a. (f. द्धिका)</i> The same as अबद्ध q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबन्धु|अबंधु
अबन्धु <i>a.</i> Without friends, without companions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबल|अबलं|अबलः
अबल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Weak, feeble; 2. unprotected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबला
अबल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Weak, feeble; 2. unprotected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबल|अबलं|अबलः
अबल <i>(II) n.</i> Want of strength, weakness, इतः किल जनाद्भगवतास्त्रिवर्गबलाबलज्ञानम् D.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबला
अबला <i>f.</i> A woman, नश्यन्ति ददर्श वृन्दानि कपीन्द्रः । हारिणबलानां हारिण्यबलानाम् Bt.x.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबाध|अबाधं|अबाधः
अबाध <i>(I) a. (f. धा)</i> Unimpeded, unobstructed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबाधा
अबाध <i>(I) a. (f. धा)</i> Unimpeded, unobstructed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबाध|अबाधं|अबाधः
अबाध <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Non-obstruction; 2. non-refutation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

