अबान्धव <i>a. (f. वा)</i> Without friends or relations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबान्धवा
अबान्धव <i>a. (f. वा)</i> Without friends or relations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=045-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अबाल
