अभय-डिंडिम <i>m.</i> 1. a war-drum; 2. a proclamation of re-assurance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयदक्षिणा
अभय-दक्षिणा <i>f.</i> promise of protection from danger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयदान
अभय-दान <i>n.</i> giving assurance of safety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयपत्र
अभय-पत्र <i>n.</i> a written document granting assurance of safety, a safe conduct (a modern term).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयप्रद
अभय-प्रद <i>a.</i> granting safety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयवचन
अभय-वचन <i>n.</i> assurance of safety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभव|अभवः
अभव <i>m.</i> 1. Non-existence; 2. destruction, end, भवाय सर्वभूतानामभवाय च रक्षसाम् Ram.; 3. final beatitude, प्राप्तुमभवमभिवाञ्छति वा Kir.xii.30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभव्य
अभव्य <i>a. (f. व्या)</i> Inauspicious, unhappy, अभव्यानामस्मिन् वरद रमणीयामरमणीम् Mahimastotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभव्या
अभव्य <i>a. (f. व्या)</i> Inauspicious, unhappy, अभव्यानामस्मिन् वरद रमणीयामरमणीम् Mahimastotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभाग
अभाग <i>a. (f. गा)</i> Without a share (as in an inheritance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभागा
अभाग <i>a. (f. गा)</i> Without a share (as in an inheritance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभाव|अभावः
अभाव <i>m.</i> 1. The not being, the not existing; 2. absence, want, failure, पित्रोरभावे पुत्राणां विभागः संप्रदर्शितः Bṛhaspati.; 3. non-entity, नाभाव उपलब्धेः S.Bh.; 4. non-entity considered as the seventh category in Kaṇāda’s system (It is distinguished as प्रागभाव, प्रध्वंसाभाव, अत्यन्ताभाव and अन्योन्याभाव); 4. death, destruction, e.g. अभावे भवतां योऽस्मिञ्जीवेत्तस्यास्त्वजीवनिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभावना
अभावना <i>f.</i> Non-perception, absence of correct understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभाषितपुंस्क|अभाषितपुंस्कः
अभाषितपुंस्क <i>n.</i> A word which can neither become a masculine nor a neuter, i.e. a word which is always a feminine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभि
अभि <i>ind.</i> As a prefix to verbs, it expresses- (1) ‘towards,’ ‘to,’ (e.g. अभिया ‘to go towards’); (2) ‘for,’ ‘against,’ (e.g. अभिलष् ‘to wish for’); (3) ‘on,’ ‘upon,’ (e.g. अभिसिंच् ‘to sprinkle upon’); (4) ‘on,’ ‘above,’ ‘over,’ (e.g. अभिभू ‘to overpower’).As a separable preposition, (with a noun in the acc.), it expresses- (1) towards, ‘in the direction of’ e.g. वृक्षमभि विद्योतते विद्युत् S.K.; (2) ‘with regard to,’ भक्तो हरिमभि; 3. by, severally, e.g. वृक्षं वृक्षमभि सिञ्चति.In composition with nouns, it implies- (1) superiority or intensity, as in अभिधर्म; (2) ‘towards,’ ‘in the direction of’ as in अभिमुखम्, अभिदक्षिणम्, अभिवातम् &c. In the last sense अभि always forms adverbs, e.g. अभिचैद्यम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिक|अभिकः
अभि(भी)क <i>a. (f. का)</i> Lustful, libidinous, सोऽधिकारमभिकः कुलोचितं काश्चन स्वयमवर्तयत् समाः R.xix.4 or अपि सिञ्चेः कृशानौ त्वं दर्पं मथ्यापि योऽभिकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीक|अभीकः
अभि(भी)क <i>a. (f. का)</i> Lustful, libidinous, सोऽधिकारमभिकः कुलोचितं काश्चन स्वयमवर्तयत् समाः R.xix.4 or अपि सिञ्चेः कृशानौ त्वं दर्पं मथ्यापि योऽभिकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिका
अभि(भी)क <i>a. (f. का)</i> Lustful, libidinous, सोऽधिकारमभिकः कुलोचितं काश्चन स्वयमवर्तयत् समाः R.xix.4 or अपि सिञ्चेः कृशानौ त्वं दर्पं मथ्यापि योऽभिकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिकांक्षा|अभिकाङ्क्षा
अभिकांक्षा <i>f.</i> Wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिकाम
अभिकाम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Loving, lustful; 2. desiring for, (with acc., e.g. याचे त्वामभिकामाऽहम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिकामा
अभिकाम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Loving, lustful; 2. desiring for, (with acc., e.g. याचे त्वामभिकामाऽहम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिकाम
अभिकाम <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Love, affection; 2. wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिक्रम|अभिक्रमः
अभिक्रम <i>m.</i> 1. A courageous attack; 2. mounting, ascending; 3. a beginning, an undertaking, e.g. नेहाभिक्रमनाशोऽस्ति प्रत्यवायो न विद्यते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिक्रमण|अभिक्रमणं
अभिक्रमण <i>n.</i> The same as अभिक्रम q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिक्रान्ति|अभिक्रांतिः|अभिक्रान्तिः
अभिक्रान्ति <i>f.</i> The same as अभिक्रम q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिक्रोशक|अभिक्रोशकः
अभिक्रोशक <i>m.</i> A reviler, an abuser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिख्या
अभिख्या <i>f.</i> 1. A name, an appellation; 2. a word, a synonym, भवेद्विष्णुपदाभिख्या क्षीरोदे Vis.P. ‘विष्णुपद is a synonym of क्षीरोद’; 3. fame, glory; 4. beauty, e.g. काप्यभिख्या तयोरासीद्व्र्जतोः शुद्धवेषयोः R.i.46, or सूर्यापाये न खलु कमलं पुष्यति स्वामभिख्याम् Megh.ii.17; 5. proclaiming, telling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिख्यान|अभिख्यानं
अभिख्यान <i>n.</i> Fame, notoriety, glory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिगम|अभिगमः
अभिगम <i>m.</i> 1. Approaching, coming near, e.g. तवार्हतो नाभिगमेन नृपम् R.v.11; 2. arrival (as in उष्णाभिगम); 3. sexual intercourse, e.g. प्रसह्य दास्यभिगमे दण्डो दशपणः स्मृतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिगमन|अभिगमनं
अभिगमन <i>n.</i> The same as अभिगम q.v., ज्येष्ठाभिगमनात्पूर्वं तेनाप्यनभिनन्दिता R.xii.35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिगम्य
अभिगम्य <i>a. (f. म्या)</i> Accessible, अधृष्यश्चाभिगम्यश्च यादोरत्नैरिवार्णवः R.i.16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिगम्या
अभिगम्य <i>a. (f. म्या)</i> Accessible, अधृष्यश्चाभिगम्यश्च यादोरत्नैरिवार्णवः R.i.16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिगामिन्
अभिगामिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Approaching, coming near; 2. having sexual intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिगामिनी
अभिगामिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Approaching, coming near; 2. having sexual intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिगर्जन|अभिगर्जनं
अभिगर्जन <i>n.</i> A tumult, an uproar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिगुप्ति|अभिगुप्तिः
अभिगुप्ति <i>f.</i> Guarding, protecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=046-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिग्रह|अभिग्रहः
अभिग्रह <i>m.</i> 1. Attack, onset; 2. robbing, plundering; 3. challenge; 4. complaint; 5. weight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिग्रहण|अभिग्रहणं
अभिग्रहण <i>n.</i> The same as अभिग्रह q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिघर्षण|अभिघर्षणं
अभिघर्षण <i>n.</i> 1. Friction; 2. possession by an evil spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिघात|अभिघातः
अभिघात <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Striking, beating, e.g. तडाभिघातादिव लग्नपंके; 2. complete destruction, extirpation, दुःखत्रयाभिघाताज्जिज्ञासा तदवघातके हेतौ Sank.K.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिघात|अभिघातः
अभिघात <i>(II) n.</i> A harsh pronunciation produced by the neglect of sandhi rules.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिघातक|अभिघातकः
अभिघातक <i>a. (f. तिका)</i> Warding off, extirpating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिघातिका
अभिघातक <i>a. (f. तिका)</i> Warding off, extirpating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिघातिन्
अभिघातिन् <i>m.</i> An enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिघार|अभिघारः
अभिघार <i>m.</i> 1. Ghee; 2. dropping ghee upon the offerings at sacrifices, प्रणीतपृषदाज्याभिघारघोरस्तनूनपात् Mv.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिघारण|अभिघारणं
अभिघारण <i>n.</i> The same as अभिघार (2) q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिचर|अभिचरः
अभिचर <i>m.</i> A servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिचरण|अभिचरणं
अभिचरण <i>n.</i> Employing charms or spells for a malevolent purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिचार|अभिचारः
अभिचार <i>m.</i> 1. Employment of charms or spells for a malevolent purpose; 2. killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिचारज्वर|अभिचारज्वरः
अभिचार-ज्वर <i>m.</i> a fever caused by incantation. (Suśruta speaks of such a fever).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिचारमन्त्र|अभिचारमन्त्रः
अभिचार-मन्त्र <i>m.</i> a formula for working a charm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिचारहोम|अभिचारहोमः
अभिचार-होम <i>m.</i> a sacrifice for working a charm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिचारिन्
अभिचारिन् <i>m.</i> A magician, a conjurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजन|अभिजनः
अभिजन <i>m.</i> 1. Family, race, न परिचयं रक्षति नाभिजनमीक्षते Kad.; 2. noble descent, अभिजनवतो भर्तुः श्लाघ्ये स्थिता गृहिणीपदे Sak.iv. or शीलं शैलतटात्पतत्वभिजनः संदह्यतां वह्निना Bhartr.ii.39; 3. native country, e.g. ततः प्रगदिता वाक्यं मिथिलाभिजना नृपम्; 4. the head of a family; 5. fame, glory; 6. attendants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजात|अभिजातः
अभिजात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Born, produced; 2. noble, wellborn, जात्यस्तेनाभिजातेन शूरः शौर्यवता कुशः R.xvii.4; 3. learned, wise, e.g. (वदेत्) संकीर्णं नाभिजातेषु नाप्रबुद्धेषु संस्कृतम्; 4. pure, faultless, e.g. प्रजल्पितायामभिजातवाचिः; 5. handsome; 6. honest, noble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजाता
अभिजात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Born, produced; 2. noble, wellborn, जात्यस्तेनाभिजातेन शूरः शौर्यवता कुशः R.xvii.4; 3. learned, wise, e.g. (वदेत्) संकीर्णं नाभिजातेषु नाप्रबुद्धेषु संस्कृतम्; 4. pure, faultless, e.g. प्रजल्पितायामभिजातवाचिः; 5. handsome; 6. honest, noble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजाति|अभिजातिः
अभिजाति <i>f.</i> Noble descent, high birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजय|अभिजयः
अभिजय <i>m.</i> Complete victory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजिघ्रण
अभिजिघ्रण <i>n.</i> Touching the head with the nose as a sign of affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजित्
अभिजित् <i>(I) m.</i> A name of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजित्
अभिजित् <i>(II) f.</i> The name of the twenty-second asterism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिज्ञ|अभिज्ञः
अभिज्ञ <i>a. (f. ज्ञा)</i> 1. Knowing, acquainted with, (with the gen. or loc. यद्वा कौशलमिन्द्रसूनुदमने तत्राप्यभिज्ञो जनः Ut.v.); 2. clever, skillful; 3. experiencing, getting experience, (with the gen. or loc.) अभिज्ञाश्छेदपातानां क्रियंते नन्दनद्रुमाः K.S.ii.41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिज्ञा
अभिज्ञ <i>a. (f. ज्ञा)</i> 1. Knowing, acquainted with, (with the gen. or loc. यद्वा कौशलमिन्द्रसूनुदमने तत्राप्यभिज्ञो जनः Ut.v.); 2. clever, skillful; 3. experiencing, getting experience, (with the gen. or loc.) अभिज्ञाश्छेदपातानां क्रियंते नन्दनद्रुमाः K.S.ii.41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिज्ञा
अभिज्ञा <i>f.</i> 1. Remembrance, recollection; 2. recognition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिज्ञान|अभिज्ञानं
अभिज्ञान <i>n.</i> 1. Recollection; 2. recognition; 3. a token of recognition, e.g. संभाषणं च मैथिल्या अभिज्ञानस्य चार्पणम् Ram. (अभिज्ञान has this meaning in the title अभिज्ञानशाकुन्तल); 4. the dark portion in the moon’s disc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभितस्
अभितस् <i>ind. (used absolutely or with a noun in the acc.)</i> 1. Before, in the presence of, तन्वन्तमिद्धमाभितो गुरुमंशुजालं लक्ष्मीमुवाह सकलस्य शशांकमुर्तेः Kir.ii.59; 2. towards, अभितस्तं पृथासूनुः स्नेहेन परितस्तरे Kir.xi.8; 3. near; 4. on both sides, परिजनमभितो विलोक्य दाहं दशवदनः प्रदिदेश वानरस्य Bt.xx.137; 5. completely, throughout, e.g. अभितो वनदाहः; 6. quick, quickly, e.g. गच्छाभितः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभितोभाव
अभितस्-भाव <i>m.</i> the being on both sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिताप|अभितापः
अभिताप <i>m.</i> 1. Extreme heat; 2. great pain (physically and morally).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिताम्र
अभिताम्र <i>a. (f. म्रा)</i> Deep red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिताम्रा
अभिताम्र <i>a. (f. म्रा)</i> Deep red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिदक्षिणम्
अभिदक्षिणम् <i>ind.</i> Towards the right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्रव|अभिद्रवः
अभिद्रव <i>m.</i> An attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्रोह|अभिद्रोहः
अभिद्रोह <i>m.</i> 1. Abuse, curse; 2. hurting, oppression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधर्षण|अभिधर्षणं
अभिधर्षण <i>n.</i> Possession by an evil spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधा
अभिधा <i>f.</i> 1. A name, an appellation, e.g. इति कुमारसंभवाभिधं काव्यं सम्पूर्णम्; 2. the literal power of a word, viz, that power (or process) which expresses the sense which the word has by common consent or convention, (op. to लक्षणा and व्यंजना), स मुख्योऽर्थस्तत्र मुख्यो व्यापारोऽस्याभिधोच्यते K.Pr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधामूल
अभिधा-मूल <i>a.</i> founded on the literal or original meaning of a word or a sentence (as a ध्वनि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधान|अभिधानं
अभिधान <i>(I) n.</i> 1. Naming, telling, expressing; 2. a speech, discourse; 3. a vocabulary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधान|अभिधानं
अभिधान <i>(II) m.n.</i> 1. A name, an appellation, तवाभिधानाद् व्यथते नताननः Kir.i.24; 2. a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधानकोष
अभिधान-कोष <i>m.</i> a dictionary, a lexicon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधानमाला
अभिधान-माला <i>f.</i> a dictionary, a lexicon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधायक
अभिधायक <i>a. (f. यिका)</i> Expressing, denominating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधायिका
अभिधायक <i>a. (f. यिका)</i> Expressing, denominating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधायिन्
अभिधायिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Expressing, denominating; 2. speaking, त्वं मुग्धाक्षि विनैव कञ्चुलिकया धत्से मनोहारिणीं लक्ष्मीमित्याभिधायिनि प्रियतमे Am.S.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधायिनी
अभिधायिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Expressing, denominating; 2. speaking, त्वं मुग्धाक्षि विनैव कञ्चुलिकया धत्से मनोहारिणीं लक्ष्मीमित्याभिधायिनि प्रियतमे Am.S.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधावन|अभिधावनं
अभिधावन <i>n.</i> Pursuit, attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधेय|अभिधेयं
अभिधेय <i>n.</i> 1. Meaning, sense, signification; 2. the primary meaning of a word, अभिधेयायिनाभूतप्रतीतिर्लक्षणोच्यते K.Pr.ii.; 3. the subject matter, इहाभिधेयं सप्रयोजनम् K.Pr.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=047-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिध्या
अभिध्या <i>f.</i> 1. Desire, wish, अभिध्योपदेशाच्च S.Bh.i.; 2. coveting another’s property; 3. desire of taking (generally).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिध्यान|अभिध्यानं
अभिध्यान <i>n.</i> 1. Desire, wish; 2. profound thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्द|अभिनंद|अभिनन्दः
अभिनन्द <i>m.</i> 1. Delighting; 2. applauding; 3. encouraging; 4. wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्दन|अभिनंदनं|अभिनन्दनः
अभिनन्दन <i>n.</i> 1. Applauding, greeting, praising; 2. rejoicing, delighting; 3. wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्दनीय|अभिनंदनीय
अभिनन्दनीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. To be applauded, greeted; 2. to be rejoiced at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्दनीया
अभिनन्दनीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. To be applauded, greeted; 2. to be rejoiced at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनम्र
अभिनम्र <i>a. (f. म्रा)</i> Bent, curved, इमां तटाशोकलतां च तन्वीं स्तनाभिरामस्तबकाभिनम्राम् R.xiii.32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनम्रा
अभिनम्र <i>a. (f. म्रा)</i> Bent, curved, इमां तटाशोकलतां च तन्वीं स्तनाभिरामस्तबकाभिनम्राम् R.xiii.32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनय|अभिनयः
अभिनय <i>m.</i> 1. Action and postures expressive of sentiment especially when exhibited in a dramatic performance, नर्तकीरभिनयातिलंघिनीः R.xix.14, अभिनयान् परिचेतुमिवोद्यता R.ix.33; 2. dramatic representation; (it is four-fold- (1) आंगिक conveyed by bodily action; (2) वाचिक by speech; (3) आहार्य by dress, decoration &c. and (4) सात्विक by the manifestation of feelings, as by perspiration, horripilation &c.) ललिताभिनयं तमद्य भर्ता मरुतां द्रष्टुमनाः सलोकपालः Vikr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनव|अभिनवः
अभिनव <i>a. (f. वा)</i> New, fresh, young, अभिनवा इव पत्रविशेषकाः R.ix.29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनवा
अभिनव <i>a. (f. वा)</i> New, fresh, young, अभिनवा इव पत्रविशेषकाः R.ix.29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनवयौवन
अभिनव-यौवन, -वयस्क <i>a.</i> quite youthful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनववयस्क
अभिनव-यौवन, -वयस्क <i>a.</i> quite youthful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनहन|अभिनहनं
अभिनहन <i>n.</i> A bandage, a blind (for the eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनियुक्त
अभिनियुक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> Engaged in, अध्ययनेऽभिनियुक्तस्य Kāśikā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनियुक्ता
अभिनियुक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> Engaged in, अध्ययनेऽभिनियुक्तस्य Kāśikā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्मुक्त|अभिनिर्मुक्तः|अभिनिर्म्मुक्त
अभिनिर्मुक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Left, quitted; 2. one asleep at sunset.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्मुक्ता
अभिनिर्मुक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Left, quitted; 2. one asleep at sunset.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्याण|अभिनिर्याणं|अभिनिर्य्याण
अभिनिर्याण <i>n.</i> 1. March (in general); 2. march of one who desires to conquer, i.e. an invasion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्वृत्ति|अभिनिर्वृत्तिः
