अभिनेतृ
अभिनेतृ <i>m.</i> An actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनेय
अभिनेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> To be represented or performed (as a drama), दृश्यं तत्राभिनेयं तद्रूपारोपात्तु रूपकम् S.D.vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

