अभिप्रथन|अभिप्रथनं
अभिप्रथन <i>n.</i> spreading over, throwing over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=048-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

