अभिभावन|अभिभावनं
अभिभावन <i>n.</i> Making victorious, giving mastership.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=049-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

