अभिभाविन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Overpowering, defeating, सर्वतेजोऽभिभाविना R.x.14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=049-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

