अभिभावुक <i>a. (f. का)</i> The same as अभिभाविन् q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=049-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

