अभिशापन|अभिशापनं
अभिशापन <i>n.</i> Pronouncing a curse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशीत
अभिशीत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Cold, अभिशीतो वायुः Kāśikā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशीता
अभिशीत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Cold, अभिशीतो वायुः Kāśikā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशोचन|अभिशोचनं
अभिशोचन <i>n.</i> Intense grief, excessive pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्रवण|अभिश्रवणं
अभिश्रवण <i>n.</i> Sitting down to a Śrāddha or repeating a portion of the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषक्त
अभिषक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> Defeated, humiliated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषक्ता
अभिषक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> Defeated, humiliated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषंग|अभिषङ्ग|अभिषंगः|अभिषङ्गः
अभिषंग <i>m.</i> 1. Defeat, discomfiture, misfortune, calamity, जाताभिषंगो नृपतिर्निषंगात् R.ii.30, अभिषंगजडं विजज्ञिवान् R.xiii.75, xiv.54; 2. connection, attachment, मुहुरिति वनविभ्रमाभिषंगात् Sis.viii.68; 3. embracing, copulation; 4. possession by evil spirits, अभिघाताभिषंगाभ्यामाभिचाराभिशापतः Mādhavanidāna.; 5. an oath; 6. a false accusation, a calumny; 7. curse, abuse; 8. contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषञ्जन|अभिषंजनं
अभिषञ्जन <i>n.</i> The same as अभिषंग q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषव|अभिषवं|अभिषवः
अभिषव <i>m.</i> 1. The religious act of pressing out the juice of the Soma plant; 2. ablution preparatory to religious rites; 3. sacrifice (in general); 4. bathing (in general); 5. the extracting of liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषवण|अभिषवणं
अभिषवण <i>n.</i> The same as अभिषव q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषिक्त
अभिषिक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Sprinkled over, अद्यापि तां क्षणवियोगविषाभिमग्नां संगे पुनर्वहुतरामृताभिषिक्ताम् Ch.P.29; 2. inaugurated, solemnly invested, enthroned (as a king or an idol), e.g. कंदर्पं परिवीक्ष्य नूतनमनोराज्याभिषिक्तम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषिक्ता
अभिषिक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Sprinkled over, अद्यापि तां क्षणवियोगविषाभिमग्नां संगे पुनर्वहुतरामृताभिषिक्ताम् Ch.P.29; 2. inaugurated, solemnly invested, enthroned (as a king or an idol), e.g. कंदर्पं परिवीक्ष्य नूतनमनोराज्याभिषिक्तम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेक|अभिषेकः
अभिषेक <i>m.</i> 1. Inauguration (of a king or an idol), अथाभिषेकं रघुवंशकेतोः R.xiv.7; 2. consecration by sprinkling water; 3. water used at an inauguration; 4. bathing (in general), कृताभिषेकां हुतजातवेदसम् K.S.v.16, or अत्राभिषेकाय तपोधनानाम् R.xii.51; 5. bathing of the divinity to whom worship is offered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेकाह|अभिषेकाहः
अभिषेक-अह <i>m.</i> the day of inauguration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेकशाला
अभिषेक-शाला <i>f.</i> the hall of coronation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेचन|अभिषेचनं
अभिषेचन <i>n.</i> The same as अभिषेक q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेणन|अभिषेणनं
अभिषेणन <i>n.</i> March with an army to attack an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेणय्
अभिषेणय् <i>vt. (denom.)</i> To march against, to attack, कः सिंधुराजमभिषेणयितुं समर्थः Ve.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्टव|अभिष्टवः
अभिष्टव <i>m.</i> Praise, eulogy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्यन्द|अभिष्यंदः|अभिष्यन्दः
अभिष्य(स्य)न्द <i>m.</i> 1. Oozing, flowing; 2. great increase, excess, स्वर्गाभिष्यन्दवमनं कृत्वेवोपनिवेशिता R.xv.29 (here अभिष्यन्दवमन means ‘letting out the excess, i.e. emigration’); 3. running at the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिस्यन्द|अभिस्यंदः|अभिस्यन्दः
अभिष्य(स्य)न्द <i>m.</i> 1. Oozing, flowing; 2. great increase, excess, स्वर्गाभिष्यन्दवमनं कृत्वेवोपनिवेशिता R.xv.29 (here अभिष्यन्दवमन means ‘letting out the excess, i.e. emigration’); 3. running at the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्वंग|अभिष्वङ्ग|अभिष्वंगः|अभिष्वङ्गः
अभिष्वंग <i>m.</i> Strong attachment, love, devotion, e.g. असक्तिरनाभिष्वंगो पुत्रदारगृहादिषु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसंश्रय|अभिसंश्रयः
अभिसंश्रय <i>m.</i> Refuge, shelter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसंस्तव|अभिसंस्तवः
अभिसंस्तव <i>m.</i> High praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसंक्षेप|अभिसङ्क्षेप|अभिसंक्षेपः
अभिसंक्षेप <i>m.</i> The same as संक्षेप q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्ताप|अभिसंताप|अभिसंतापः|अभिसन्तापः
अभिसन्ताप <i>m.</i> War, battle, (जन्यं स्यादभिसन्तापः Halāyudha.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्देह|अभिसंदेह|अभिसंदेहः
अभिसन्देह <i>m.</i> The organ of generation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्धक|अभिसंधक|अभिसंधकः
अभिसन्धक <i>m.</i> A detractor, a calumniator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्धा|अभिसंधा
अभिसन्धा <i>f.</i> 1. Promise, declaration, तेन (scil. दशरथेन) सत्याभिसन्धेन त्रिवर्गमनुतिष्ठता Ram.; 2. deceit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्धान|अभिसंधान|अभिसंधानं|अभिसन्धानं
अभिसन्धान <i>n.</i> 1. A declaration, a promise; 2. imposing, cheating, deceiving, पराभिसन्धानपरं यद्यप्यस्य विचेष्टितम् R.xvii.76, पराभिसंधानमधीयते यैः Sak.v.; 3. aim, intention, purpose (विज्ञानेश्वर in explaining जैहम्य says- अन्याभिसन्धानेनान्यवादित्वमन्यकर्तृत्वं च); 4. making peace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्धि|अभिसंधि|अभिसंधिः|अभिसन्धिः
अभिसन्धि <i>m. (According to some authorities fem.)</i> 1. A declaration, a promise; 2. intent, purpose, aim; 3. implied sense, bearing (the phrase अयमभिसंधिः is frequently met with in exegetical works, where it means ‘such is the sense’ of a passage); 4. belief, opinion, e.g. ददंश ताम्राम्बुरुहाभिसन्धिस्तृष्णातुरः पाणितलेपि धृष्णुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसम्पात|अभिसंपात|अभिसंपातः|अभिसम्पातः
अभिसम्पात <i>m.</i> 1. Concourse, confluence; 2. war, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसम्बन्ध|अभिसंबन्ध|अभिसंबंधः|अभिसंबन्धः
अभिसम्बन्ध <i>m.</i> Connection, association, relation, प्रकृतेन संबंधिना कस्यचिदनभिसंबन्धो वर्जनम् Kāśikā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसम्मुख|अभिसंमुख
अभिसम्मुख <i>a. (f. खा or खी)</i> Facing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसम्मुखा
अभिसम्मुख <i>a. (f. खा or खी)</i> Facing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसम्मुखी
अभिसम्मुख <i>a. (f. खा or खी)</i> Facing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=051-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसर|अभिसरः
अभिसर <i>m.</i> 1. A companion; 2. a servant, a follower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसरण|अभिसरणं
अभिसरण <i>n.</i> 1. Approaching, (with hostile intention); 2. an assignation, an appointment of lovers, त्वदभिसरणरभसेन वलन्ती । पतति पदानि कियन्ति चलन्ती Git.G.vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसर्ग|अभिसर्गः
अभिसर्ग <i>m.</i> Creation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसर्जन|अभिसर्जनं|अभिसर्ज्जन|अभिसर्ज्जनं
अभिसर्जन <i>n.</i> 1. Gift, donation; 2. killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसर्पण|अभिसर्पणं
अभिसर्पण <i>n.</i> Coming near, approaching (especially with a hostile intention).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसान्त्व|अभिसांत्वः|अभिसान्त्वः
अभिसान्त्व <i>m.</i> Conciliation, consolation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसायम्
अभिसायम् <i>ind.</i> In the evening, श्रितोदयोद्रेरभिसायमुच्चकैरचूचुरचंद्रमसोऽभिरामताम् Sis.i.16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसार|अभिसारः
अभिसार <i>m.</i> 1. An assignation, an appointment of lovers, रतिसुखसारे गतमभिसारे मदनमनोहरवेशम् Git.G.v.; 2. a place where lovers meet by previous appointment, त्वरितमुपैति न कथमभिसारं हरिरिति वदति सखीमनुजारम् Git.G.vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसारस्थान
अभिसार-स्थान <i>n.</i> a locality adapted for assignations. (The S.D. recommends the following eight places for lovers to meet- (1) field; (2) a garden; (3) temple-ruins; (4) the house of a procuress; (5) forest; (6) a place of pilgrimage; (7) the cemetery; (8) the banks of rivers &c., क्षेत्रं वाटी भग्नदेवालयो दूतीगृहं वनम् । मालयं च श्मशानं च नद्यादीनां तटी तथा ॥ S.D.vi.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसारिका
अभिसारिका <i>f.</i> a woman who meets her lover by assignation. (अभिसारिका is variously defined; the definition in Am. is- कान्तार्थिनी तु या याति संकेतं साभिसारिका.) अनभिज्ञास्तामिस्राणां दुर्दिनेष्वभिसारिकाः K.S.vi.48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसारिणी
अभिसारिणी <i>f.</i> The same as अभिसारिका q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसेवन|अभिसेवनं
अभिसेवन <i>n.</i> Indulgence in, fondness (as in मद्याभिसेवन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिस्नेह|अभिस्नेहः
अभिस्नेह <i>m.</i> Attachment, love, यः सर्वत्रानाभिस्नेहहस्तत्तत्प्राप्य शुभाशुभम् Bg.ii.57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिस्फुरित
अभिस्फुरित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Expanded, full blown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिस्फुरिता
अभिस्फुरित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Expanded, full blown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिस्यन्द|अभिस्यंदः|अभिस्यन्दः
अभिस्यन्द <i>m.</i> The same as अभिष्यन्द q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहत
अभिहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Struck, hurt, injured, प्रसभमभिहतोप्याददानोंऽशुकान्तम् Am.S.2; 2. subdued, overcome; 3. multiplied (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहता
अभिहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Struck, hurt, injured, प्रसभमभिहतोप्याददानोंऽशुकान्तम् Am.S.2; 2. subdued, overcome; 3. multiplied (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

