अभिहरण|अभिहरणं
अभिहरण <i>n.</i> Bringing, conveying, R.xi.43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहव|अभिहवः
अभिहव <i>m.</i> 1. Calling, invoking; 2. sacrificing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहार|अभिहारः
अभिहार <i>m.</i> 1. Robbing or stealing; 2. attack, assault; 3. aiming, taking up an armour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहास|अभिहासः
अभिहास <i>m.</i> Laughter, merriment, sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहित|अभिहितं
अभिहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Said, spoken, declared, named; 2. placed upon, fastened upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहिता
अभिहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Said, spoken, declared, named; 2. placed upon, fastened upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहितान्वयवाद|अभिहितान्वयवादः
अभिहित-अन्वयवाद <i>m.</i> the doctrine of the Naiyāyikas that the purport of a sentence arises out of the logical connection between the words and not out of the sense of the words themselves (K.Pr.ii.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहोम|अभिहोमः
अभिहोम <i>m.</i> Making an oblation of clarified butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभी
अभी <i>(I) ind.</i> A protracted form of अभि q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभी
अभी <i>(II) a.</i> Fearless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीक|अभीकः
अभीक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Lustful, libidinous, मेदस्विनः Sis.v.64 (Cf. अभिक); 2. anxious; 3. fearless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीका
अभीक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Lustful, libidinous, मेदस्विनः Sis.v.64 (Cf. अभिक); 2. anxious; 3. fearless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीक्ष्ण|अभीक्ष्णं
अभीक्ष्ण <i>a. (f. क्ष्णा)</i> 1. Frequent, repeated; 2. perpetual, constant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीक्ष्णा
अभीक्ष्ण <i>a. (f. क्ष्णा)</i> 1. Frequent, repeated; 2. perpetual, constant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीक्ष्णम्
