अभीप्सित|अभीप्सितं
अभीप्सित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Wished, desired, अभीप्सितुं नु मे किञ्चित् प्रियं कर्तुमिहार्हसि Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीप्सिता
अभीप्सित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Wished, desired, अभीप्सितुं नु मे किञ्चित् प्रियं कर्तुमिहार्हसि Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीप्सित|अभीप्सितं
अभीप्सित <i>(II) n.</i> Wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीर|अभीरः
अभीर <i>m.</i> 1. A cowherd; 2. the name of a pastoral tribe (the more correct form of this word is आभीर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीरपल्लि
अभीर-पल्लि <i>f.</i> a hamlet of cowherds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीशाप|अभीशापः
अभीशाप <i>m.</i> The some as अभिशाप q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीशु|अभीशुः
अभीशु <i>m.</i> 1. A ray of light, e.g. प्रफुल्लतापिच्छनिभैरभीषुभिः; 2. a rein.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=052-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीषंग|अभीषङ्ग|अभीषङ्गः
