अमन्दा
अमन्द <i>a. (f. न्दा)</i> 1. Not slow, active; 2. not little, much, great, excessive, अमन्दमिलदिन्दिरे निखिलमाधुरीमन्दिरे Bh.V.iv.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=055-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमम|अममः
