अममा
अमम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> Without egotism, devoid of worldly attachment, शरणेष्वममश्चैव वृक्षमूलनिकेतनः M.vi.26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=055-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

