अमावस्या
अमाव(वा)स्या <i>f.</i> The day of the conjunction of the sun and the moon, the newmoon-day, the fifteenth day of the dark half of lunar month. (सूर्याचन्द्रमसोर्यः परः सन्निकर्षः साऽमावस्या.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=057-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

