अमित
अमित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Boundless, measureless, infinite, immense, अमितस्य हि दातारं भर्तारं का न पूजयेत् Ram.; 2. unpolished, unclear; 3. unknown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=057-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमिता
अमित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Boundless, measureless, infinite, immense, अमितस्य हि दातारं भर्तारं का न पूजयेत् Ram.; 2. unpolished, unclear; 3. unknown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=057-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

