अमितद्युति
अमित-द्युति <i>a.</i> of infinite splendour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=057-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमितविक्रम|अमितविक्रमः
