अमित्र|अमित्रः
अमित्र <i>m. (This word is masculine though its reverse (मित्र) is neuter, as will be seen from the quotations below.)</i> Not a friend, an enemy, a foe, an adversary, स्याताममित्रौ मित्रे च सहजप्राकृतावपि Sis.ii.37, तस्य मित्राण्यमित्रास्ते Sis.ii.101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=057-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

