अमुतस्
अमुतस् <i>ind.</i> 1. From there; 2. from above, i.e. from heaven, from the other world; 3. hereupon, henceforth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=057-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुत्र
अमुत्र <i>ind.</i> 1. Here, अनेनैवार्भकाः सर्वे नगरेऽमुत्र भक्षिताः; 2. there, in what precedes; 3. in the other world, (op. to इह), e.g. नेह नामुत्र तद्भवेत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=057-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुत्रत्य
