अमुथा
अमुथा <i>ind.</i> Thus, in this or that manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=057-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमुष्य
