अंब|अम्ब|अंबः|अम्बः
अंब <i>(II) ind.</i> A particle of affirmation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंबक|अम्बक|अंबकं|अम्बकं
अंबक <i>(I) n.</i> An eye (as in त्र्यंबक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंबक|अम्बक|अंबकं|अम्बकं
अंबक <i>(II) m.</i> A father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंबर|अम्बर|अंबरं|अम्बरं|अम्बरः
अंबर <i>n.</i> 1. The sky, æther, तावतर्णयदम्बरे R.xii.41; 2. a garment, दिव्यमाल्याम्बरधरं दिव्यगन्धानुलेपनम् Bg.xi.11, R.iii.9; 3. talc; 4. saffron; 5. a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंबरान्त|अम्बरान्त|अम्बरान्तः
अंबर-अन्त <i>m.</i> 1. the end of a garment; 2. horizon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंबरौकस्|अम्बरौकस्
अंबर-ओकस् <i>m.</i> a god, विलिप्यन्ते मौलिभिरम्बरौकसाम् K.S.v.79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बरिष|अम्बरिषं
अम्बरि(री)ष <i>(I) m.n.</i> 1. A frying-pan; 2. one of the hells.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बरीष|अंबरीष|अंबरीषं|अम्बरीषं|अम्बरीषः
अम्बरि(री)ष <i>(I) m.n.</i> 1. A frying-pan; 2. one of the hells.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बरिष|अम्बरिषं
अम्बरि(री)ष <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A young animal; 2. the sun; 3. a name of Viṣṇu; 4. a name of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बरीष|अंबरीष|अंबरीषं|अम्बरीषं|अम्बरीषः
अम्बरि(री)ष <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A young animal; 2. the sun; 3. a name of Viṣṇu; 4. a name of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बष्ठ|अंबष्ठ|अंबष्ठः|अम्बष्ठः
अम्बष्ठ <i>(I) m. pl.</i> The name of a country and its inhabitants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बष्ठ|अंबष्ठ|अंबष्ठः|अम्बष्ठः
अम्बष्ठ <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The offspring of a man of Brāhmaṇa and of a woman of Vaiśya tribe, (ब्राह्मणाद्वैश्यकन्यायानम्बष्ठोनामजायेत M.x.8); 2. an elephant-driver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बष्ठा
अम्बष्ठा <i>f.</i> 1. A sort of jasmin; 2. a woman of the Ambaṣṭha caste (in this sense also अम्बष्ठी), ब्राह्मणेन वैश्यायामुत्पन्ना अम्बष्ठा Kull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बा|अंबा
अम्बा <i>f. (In the first sense, the voc. sing. is अंब in classical literature.)</i> 1. A mother (also used as a term of respect), कृताञ्जलिस्तत्र यदम्ब सत्यात् R.xiv.16, किमम्बाभिःप्रेषितः Sak.ii.; 2. a name of Durgā; 3. the name of a daughter of Kāśīrāja.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बाला
अम्बाला(डा) <i>f.</i> A mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बाडा|अंबाडा
अम्बाला(डा) <i>f.</i> A mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बालिका|अंबालिका
अम्बालिका <i>f.</i> 1. A mother (also used as a term of respect); 2. the name of a wife of Vicitravīrya. (See App. II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बिका|अंबिका
अम्बिका <i>f.</i> 1. A mother (also used as a term of respect; for instance, the brother-in-law of the king, kneeling before Vasantasenā and making profession of his love, is made to say in Mrich. ‘अत्तिके अम्बिके सुणु मम विण्णत्तिम्’; 2. a name of Pārvatī, आशीर्भिरेधयामासुः पुरःपाकाभिराम्बिकाम् K.S.vi.90; 3. the name of a wife of Vicitravīrya. (See App. II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बिकेश्वर
अम्बिका-ईश्वर, -पति <i>m.</i> a name of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बिकापति|अम्बिकापतिः
अम्बिका-ईश्वर, -पति <i>m.</i> a name of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बिकेय|अंबिकेय|अंबिकेयः|अम्बिकेयः
अम्बिकेय <i>m.</i> A name (1) of Gaṇeśa; (2) of Kārtikeya; (3) of Dhṛtarāṣṭra. (आम्बिकेय is the more correct form of this word).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बु|अंबु
अम्बु <i>n.</i> Water, गंगामम्बु सितमम्बु यामुनं कज्जलाभम् K.Pr.x., छातेतराम्बुच्छटा K.Pr.i., R.i.51, xi.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुकण|अम्बुकणः
अम्बु-कण <i>m.</i> 1. a drop of water; 2. a shower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुकण्टक|अम्बुकण्टकः
अम्बु-कण्टक, -किरात <i>m.</i> the short-nosed allegator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुकिरात|अम्बुकिरातः
अम्बु-कण्टक, -किरात <i>m.</i> the short-nosed allegator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुकीश|अम्बुकीशः
अम्बु-कीश, -कूर्म <i>m.</i> a porpoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुकूर्म|अम्बुकूर्मः|अम्बुकूर्म्म|अम्बुकूर्म्मः
अम्बु-कीश, -कूर्म <i>m.</i> a porpoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=058-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुक्रिया
अम्बु-क्रिया <i>f.</i> a funeral rite in which water is presented to the manes of the deceased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुघन|अम्बुघनः
अम्बु-घन <i>m.</i> hail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुचत्वर
अम्बु-चत्वर <i>n.</i> a lake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुचर
अम्बु-चर <i>a.</i> aquatic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुज|अम्बुजं|अम्बुजः
अम्बु-ज <i>(I) a.</i> grown in water, सुगन्धीनि च माल्यानि स्थलजान्यम्बुजानि च Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुज|अम्बुजं|अम्बुजः
अम्बु-ज <i>(II) n.</i> 1. a lotus, इंदीवरेण नयनं मुखमम्बुजेन (विधाय) Sr.T.3; 2. the thunderbolt of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुज|अम्बुजं|अम्बुजः
अम्बु-ज <i>(III) m.</i> 1. the moon; 2. the sārasa bird; 3. the conch; 4. camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुजासना
अम्बु-ज˚आसना <i>f.</i> the goddess Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुजभू
अम्बु-ज˚भू <i>m.</i> Brahman (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुजन्मन्
अम्बु-जन्मन् <i>(I) n.</i> a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुजन्मन्
अम्बु-जन्मन् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. the moon; 2. the conch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुतस्कर|अम्बुतस्करः
अम्बु-तस्कर <i>m.</i> the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुद|अम्बुदः
अम्बु-द <i>m.</i> a cloud, नवाम्बुदानीकमुहूर्तलांछने R.iii.53, लघयता शरदम्बुदसंहतिम् Kir.v.4, also 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुधर
अम्बु-धर <i>m.</i> 1. a cloud, शरत्प्रमृष्टाम्बुधरोपरोधः R.vi.44, वशिनश्चाम्बुधराश्च योनयः K.S.iv.43; 2. talc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुधि|अम्बुधिः
अम्बु-धि <i>m.</i> 1. the ocean, माधुर्यं मधुबिंदुना Bhartr.ii.6; 2. the number ‘4’ (in math.) (Note. all words meaning ‘ocean’ are used in this sense in math.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुनिधि|अम्बुनिधिः
अम्बु-निधि <i>m.</i> the ocean, देवासुरैरमृतमम्बुनिधिर्ममन्थे Kir.v.30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुप|अम्बुपः
अम्बु-प <i>m.</i> Varuṇa, the regent of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुपात
अम्बु-पात <i>m.</i> a current of water, गंगाम्बुपातप्रतिमा गृहेभ्यः Bt.i.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुप्रसाद|अम्बुप्रसादः
अम्बु-प्रसाद <i>m.</i> the clearing-nut tree called कतक. (See under कतक.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुप्रसादन|अम्बुप्रसादनं
अम्बु-प्रसादन <i>n.</i> the clearing-nut tree called कतक. (See under कतक.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुभव
अम्बु-भव <i>n.</i> a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुभृत्
अम्बु-भृत् <i>m.</i> 1. a cloud; 2. the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुमती
अम्बु-मती <i>f.</i> the name of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुमुच्
अम्बु-मुच् <i>m.</i> a cloud, उपबिभ्रतं ध्वनितसूचितमम्बुमुचां चयम् Kir.v.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुराज|अम्बुराजः
अम्बु-राज <i>m.</i> the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुराशि|अम्बुराशिः
अम्बु-राशि <i>m.</i> the ocean, अद्यापि नूनं हरकोपवह्निस्त्वयि ज्वलत्यौर्व इवाम्बुराशौ Sak.iii., K.S.iii.67, R.vi.57, ix.82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुरुह|अम्बुरुहः
अम्बु-रुह <i>m.</i> the lotus, विपुलिनाम्बुरुहा न सरिद्वधूः Kir.v.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुरोहिणी
