अम्लिमन् <i>m.</i> Sourness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अय्
अय् <i>vt. 1Ā (pp. अयित)</i> To go. (According to some authorities, this root is used also in the Par.)With अन्तर्-, to intervene, e.g. दर्दुरक उपसृत्यान्तरयति.With अभ्युत्-, 1. to prosper; 2. to rise as (the sun, moon &c.).With उद्-, 1. to come in sight, e.g. मुहूर्तो यज्ञियः प्राप्तश्चोदयन्तीह याजकाः; 2. to rise (as the sun or moon), अयमुदयति निद्राभञ्जनः पद्मिनीनाम् Ud.; 3. to arise from, to originate, e.g. मोहः कोयमहो महानुदयते लोकस्य शोकावहः.With परा-, (changed into पला) to run away, to retreat, कथं ह्यनुचरान् हित्वा शत्रुमध्ये पलायसे Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=059-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अय|अयः
अय <i>m.</i> 1. Going or moring towards (in this sense used only in compounds, as in अस्तमय); 2. good luck; 3. a die to play with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयान्वित|अयान्वितः
अय-अन्वित <i>a.</i> fortunate, lucky, e.g. शुद्धपार्ष्णिरयान्वितः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयवत्|अयवन्त्
अय-वत् <i>a.</i> lucky, fortunate, सुलभैः सदा नयवताऽयवता Kir.v.20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयक्ष्म
अयक्ष्म <i>n.</i> Freedom from disease, healthiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञिय
अयज्ञिय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Not fit to perform a sacrifice (as a boy not invested with the sacred thread); 2. not fit for sacrificing (as a thing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञिया
अयज्ञिय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Not fit to perform a sacrifice (as a boy not invested with the sacred thread); 2. not fit for sacrificing (as a thing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्न|अयत्नः
अयत्न <i>m.</i> Absence of effort or exertion, अयत्नसाध्यः समागमः D.K. (अयत्नेन and अयत्नतस् are used as indeclinables in the sense of ‘easily.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथा
अयथा <i>ind.</i> Unsuitably, unfitly, not as it ought to be, not as it is intended to be.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथेष्ट
अयथा-इष्ट <i>a.</i> 1. disliked, not according to wish; 2. insufficient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथोचित
अयथा-उचित <i>a.</i> improper, e.g. अयथोचितजल्पनम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथातथ
अयथा-तथ <i>a.</i> 1. unfit, unsuitable, improper, इदमयथातथं स्वामिनश्चेष्टितम् Ve.ii.; 2. useless, unprofitable, तद्गच्छत्ययथातथम् M.xii.240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथातथम्
अयथा-तथम् <i>ind.</i> 1. unsuitably; 2. uselessly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथातथ्य
अयथा-तथ्य <i>n.</i> unsuitableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथाद्योतन
अयथा-द्योतन <i>n.</i> intimation of an occurrence or act contrary to expectation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथापूर्व|अयथापूर्व्व
अयथा-पूर्व <i>a.</i> unprecedented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथार्थ
अयथा-अर्थ <i>a.</i> 1. incorrect, incongruous, स्मृतिरपि द्विविधा । यथार्थाऽयथार्था च … … अप्रमाजन्या अयथार्था or अयथार्थानुभवस्त्रिविधः T.S.; 2. improper, unfitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथावत्
अयथा-वत् <i>ind.</i> erroneously, improperly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथाशास्त्रकारिन्
अयथा-शास्त्रकारिन् <i>a.</i> not acting according to the scriptures, irreligious, अयथाशास्त्रकारी च न विभागो पिता प्रभुः Nārada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयन|अयनं
अयन <i>n.</i> 1. Motion; 2. the sun’s path north and south of the equator (called respectively उत्तरायण and दक्षिणायन); 3. a road, a path (as in स्वस्त्ययन, स्वेदायन); 4. the attainment of eternal bliss, नान्यः पन्थाविद्यतेऽयनाय Vaj.S.; 5. the period of the duration of the sun’s progress north or south of the equator; 6. the solstice (in astronomy); 7. an entrance to a military array of troops, अयनेषु च सर्वेषु यथाभागमवस्थिताः Bg.i.111.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनकाल|अयनकालः
अयन-काल <i>m.</i> the interval between the solstices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनवृत्त
अयन-वृत्त <i>n.</i> the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयन्त्रित|अयंत्रित|अयन्त्रितः
अयन्त्रित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Unchecked, unrestrained, self-willed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयन्त्रिता
अयन्त्रित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Unchecked, unrestrained, self-willed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयमित
अयमित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Unchecked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयमिता
अयमित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Unchecked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयमितनख
अयमित-नख <i>a.</i> with untrimmed nails, Megh.ii.29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयशस्
अयशस् <i>n.</i> Dishonour, disgrace, infamy, stain, स्वभावलोलेत्ययशः प्रमृष्टम् R.vi.41, or अयशो महदाप्नोति नरकं चैव गच्छति M.viii.28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयशस्कर
अयशस्कर <i>a. (f. री)</i> Causing dishonour, disgraceful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयशस्करी
अयशस्कर <i>a. (f. री)</i> Causing dishonour, disgraceful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयशस्य
अयशस्य <i>m. (fem. स्या)</i> Infamous, disgraceful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्
अयस् <i>(I) n.</i> 1. Iron, अभितप्तमयोऽपि मार्दवं भजते R.viii.43; 2. steel; 3. aloe-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्
अयस् <i>(II) m.</i> Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोग्र|अयोग्रं
अयोग्र <i>n.</i> pestle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्काण्ड
अयस्काण्ड <i>m.n.</i> 1. a large quantity of iron; 2. excellent iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्कान्त|अयस्कान्तः
अयस्कान्त <i>m.</i> loadstone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्कान्तमणि
अयस्कान्त˚मणि <i>m.</i> the loadstone, अयस्कान्तमणिशलाकेव लोहधातुमन्तःकरणमाकृष्टवती M.M.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्कार
अयस्कार <i>m.</i> a blacksmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्कीट
अयस्कीट <i>n.</i> rust of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्कुम्भ
अयस्कुम्भ <i>m.</i> rust of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोघन|अयोघनः
अयोघन <i>m.</i> an iron hammer, e.g. कुरु करे गुरुमेकमयोघनम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोजाल
अयोजाल <i>n.</i> an iron net.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्पात्र
अयस्पात्र <i>n.</i> an iron vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःप्रतिमा
अयस्-प्रतिमा <i>f.</i> an iron image.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्मय
अयस्मय <i>a.</i> made of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोमुख|अयोमुखः
अयोमुख <i>m.</i> an arrow, भेत्स्यन्यजः कुंभमयोमुखेन R.v.55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःशंकु|अयःशङ्कु|अयःशङ्कुः
अयस्-शंकु <i>m.</i> 1. an iron javelin; 2. an iron nail, R.xii.95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःशूल
अयस्-शूल <i>n.</i> 1. an iron lance (lit.); 2. a violent proceeding (fig.) अयःशूलेनान्विच्छतीत्यायःशूलिकः K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोहृदय
अयोहृदय <i>a.</i> having a heart as hard as iron, सुहृदयोहृदयः प्रतिगर्जताम् R.ix.9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचित|अयाचितं|अयाचितः
अयाचित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Unasked, unsolicited, obtained without solicitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचिता
अयाचित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Unasked, unsolicited, obtained without solicitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचित|अयाचितं|अयाचितः
अयाचित <i>(II) n.</i> Unsolicited alms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचितोपनत
अयाचित-उपनत, -उपस्थित <i>a.</i> obtained without solicitation, अयाचितोपस्थितमंबु केवलम् K.S.v.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचितोपस्थित
अयाचित-उपनत, -उपस्थित <i>a.</i> obtained without solicitation, अयाचितोपस्थितमंबु केवलम् K.S.v.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचितवृत्ति|अयाचितवृत्तिः
अयाचित-वृत्ति <i>a.</i> subsisting on alms obtained without begging, M.iv.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाज्य
अयाज्य <i>a. (f. ज्या)</i> 1. One for whom it is not permitted to perform a sacrifice (as a Śūdra); 2. not fit for a sacrificial offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाज्या
अयाज्य <i>a. (f. ज्या)</i> 1. One for whom it is not permitted to perform a sacrifice (as a Śūdra); 2. not fit for a sacrificial offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाज्ययाजन
अयाज्य-याजन <i>n.</i> sacrificing for a person for whom it is not permitted to perform a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाथार्थिक
अयाथार्थिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Improper, unjust; 2. absurd, incongruous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाथार्थिका
अयाथार्थिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Improper, unjust; 2. absurd, incongruous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=060-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाथार्थ्य|अयाथार्थ्यं
