अयान|अयानं
अयान <i>n.</i> 1. Natural disposition; 2. halt, stop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=061-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयि
अयि <i>ind.</i> 1. A vocative particle of gentle address, Bh.V.i.5, 11, 44, 121; 2. a particle- (1) of encouragement, अयि मन्दस्मितमधुरं वदनं तन्वंगि यदि मनाक्कुरुषे Bh.V.ii.150; (2) of solicitation, अयि सम्प्रति देहि दर्शनम् K.S.v.28; (3) of interrogation, अयि जीवितनाथ जीवसि K.S.iv.3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=061-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुक्त|अयुक्तं
