अये
अये <i>ind.</i> 1. A vocative particle, अये गौरीनाथ त्रिपुरहर शम्भो त्रिनयन Bhartr.iii.; 2. an interjection- (1) of anger; (2) of fatigue; (3) of recollection; (4) of fear; (5) of surprise; (6) of grief, अये देवपादपद्मोपजीविनोवस्थेयम् Mud.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=061-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोग|अयोगः
