अयोग्य
अयोग्य <i>a. (f. ग्या)</i> Improper, unsuitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=061-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोग्या
