अयोध्या
अयोध्या <i>f.</i> The capital of Rāma situated on the river Sarayū, अद्यायोध्या महाबाहो अयोध्या प्रतिभाति नः Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=061-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोगव|अयोगवः
