अयोनि|अयोनिः
अयोनि <i>(I) a.</i> 1. Without origin, जगद्योनिरयोनिस्त्वम् K.S.ii.9; 2. born in a manner not approved by law or religion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=061-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

