अरघट्ट|अरघट्टः
अर-घट्ट, -घट्टक <i>m.</i> 1. a wheel or machine for raising water from a well, कूपमासाद्यारघट्टघटिकामार्गेण सर्पस्तेनानीतः Panch.ii.; 2. a well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=061-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

