अरण्यगज|अरण्यगजः
अरण्य-गज <i>m.</i> a wild elephant not yet tamed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=061-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

