अर्धव्यास|अर्धव्यासः
अर्ध-व्यास <i>m.</i> the radius of a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धशत
अर्ध-शत <i>n.</i> fifty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धशेष
अर्ध-शेष <i>a.</i> having only half left.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धश्लोक|अर्धश्लोकः
अर्ध-श्लोक <i>m.</i> half a Śloka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धसीरिन्
अर्ध-सीरिन् <i>m.</i> a cultivator who takes half the crop for his labour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धहार|अर्द्धहारः|अर्धहारः
अर्ध-हार <i>m.</i> a necklace of twelve strings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धह्रस्व|अर्धह्रस्वः
