अर्धिक|अर्धिकः
अर्धिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Measuring a half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धिकी
अर्धिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Measuring a half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धिन्
अर्धिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Entitled to a half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धिनी
अर्धिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Entitled to a half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्पण|अर्पणं
अर्पण <i>n.</i> 1. Placing in or upon, पादार्पणानुग्रहपूतपृष्ठम् R.ii.35; 2. inserting, putting in, मुखार्पणेषु प्रकृतिप्रगल्भाः R.xiii.9; 3. delivering, making over, resigning, सेयं स्वदेहाप्रणनिष्क्रयेण R.ii.55; 4. piercing, तीक्ष्णतुण्डार्पणैर्ग्रीवां नखैः सर्वां व्यदारयत् Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्पिस|अर्पिसः
अर्पिस <i>m.</i> The heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्बुद|अर्बुदं|अर्बुदः|अर्ब्बुद|अर्ब्बुदः
अर्बुद <i>m.n.</i> 1. A hundred millions; 2. a serpent; 3. a name of the mountain Abu; 4. the name of a demon conquered by Indra; 5. a cloud; 6. a swelling or tumour (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्भक|अर्भकः
अर्भक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. Small, little; 2. weak; 3. young, childish (rarely used in classics as an adjective).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्भका
अर्भक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. Small, little; 2. weak; 3. young, childish (rarely used in classics as an adjective).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्भक|अर्भकः
अर्भक <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A boy, a child, श्रुतस्य यायादयमन्तमर्भकः R.iii.21, 25, vii.67; 2. a fool, an idiot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्य|अर्यः|अर्य्य|अर्य्यः
अर्य <i>(I) a. (f. र्या)</i> Excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्या|अर्य्या
अर्य <i>(I) a. (f. र्या)</i> Excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्य|अर्यः|अर्य्य|अर्य्यः
अर्य <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A master; 2. a Vaiśya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यवर्य|अर्यवर्यः
अर्य-वर्य <i>m.</i> a Vaiśya of rank. (The word has three fem. forms अर्या, अर्यी, अर्याणी qq.vv.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यमन्|अर्य्यमन्
अर्यमन् <i>m.</i> 1. The sun; 2. a name of the arka plant; 3. the head of the pitṛs, पितॄणामर्यमा चास्मि Bg.x.29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=067-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्या|अर्य्या
अर्या <i>f.</i> 1. A mistress; 2. a woman of the Vaiśya tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्याणी|अर्य्याणी
अर्याणी <i>f.</i> The same as अर्या q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यी|अर्य्यी
अर्यी <i>f.</i> The wife of a Vaiśya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वन्|अर्व्वन्
अर्वन् <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A horse, श्लथीकृतप्रग्रहमर्वतां व्रजाः Sis.xii.31; 2. one of the ten horses of the moon; 3. an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वन्|अर्व्वन्
अर्वन् <i>(II) a. (f. ती)</i> Mean, unworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वती|अर्व्वती
अर्वन् <i>(II) a. (f. ती)</i> Mean, unworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वती|अर्व्वती
अर्वती <i>f.</i> 1. A Mare; 2. a procuress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्|अर्व्वाक्
अर्वाक् <i>ind.</i> 1. Before, behind (in time or place), अर्वाक् सम्वत्सरात्स्वामी हरेत् परतो नृपः Yaj.ii.173, अर्वाक् संचायनादस्थ्नाम् M.v.59; 2. hitherward, on this side; 3. within, near, (with the loc., एते चार्वागुपवनभुवि छिन्नदर्भांकुरायां नष्टाशंका हरिणशिशवो मन्दमन्दं चरन्ति Sak.i.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्कालिक
अर्वाक्-कालिक <i>a.</i> modern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्कूल
अर्वाक्-कूल <i>n.</i> the near bank of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाच्|अर्व्वाच्
अर्वाच् <i>a. (f. ची)</i> 1. Coming hitherward; 2. coming to meet anyone; 3. being behind; 4. following, subsequent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाची
अर्वाच् <i>a. (f. ची)</i> 1. Coming hitherward; 2. coming to meet anyone; 3. being behind; 4. following, subsequent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाचीन|अर्व्वाचीन|अर्व्वाचीनः
अर्वाचीन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Modern; 2. later than, (with the abl., e.g. यदूर्ध्वं पृथिव्या अर्वाचीनमन्तरिक्षात् Sat.Br.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाचीना
अर्वाचीन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Modern; 2. later than, (with the abl., e.g. यदूर्ध्वं पृथिव्या अर्वाचीनमन्तरिक्षात् Sat.Br.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्श|अर्शं|अर्शः
अर्श <i>n.</i> Piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शस्
अर्शस् <i>n.</i> Piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शस|अर्शसः
अर्शस <i>a. (f. सा)</i> Suffering from piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शसा
अर्शस <i>a. (f. सा)</i> Suffering from piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोघ्न|अर्शोघ्नः
अर्शोघ्न <i>m.</i> A plant called Sūraṇa; so called because it is supposed to cure piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह्
अर्ह् <i>(I) vt. or vi. 1P (In epic poetry used in the Atm. also) (pp. अर्हित)</i> 1. To deserve, to merit, किमिव नामायुष्मानमरेश्वरान्नार्हति Sak.vii. or रावणो नार्हते पूजाम् Ram.; 2. to be entitled to, ननु गर्भः पित्र्यं रिक्थमर्हति Sak.vi. or न स्त्री स्वातन्त्र्यमर्हति M.ix.3; 3. to undergo; 4. to be equal to, न ते गात्राण्युपचारमर्हन्ति Sak.iii.; 5. to worship, to honour; 6. to deserve to be done, Na.v.112. (The second person of this root joined with an infinitive represents a mild form of command, request or advice, e.g. कर्तुमर्हसि ‘Be pleased to do,’ द्वित्राण्यहान्यर्हसि सोढुमर्हन् R.v.35).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह्
अर्ह् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pp. अर्हित)</i> To worship, to honour, राजार्जिहत्तं मधुपर्कपाणिः Bt.i.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह|अर्हः
अर्ह <i>(I) a. (f. र्हा)</i> 1. Worthy of respect, अर्हानभोजयन् विप्रो दण्डमर्हति माषकम् M.viii.392; 2. worthy of, entitled to, (with an acc. or an infinitive, नैवार्हः पैतृकं रिक्थं पतितोत्पादितो हि सः M.ix.144, न परित्यागमर्हेयं मत्सकाशात्, तस्मान्नार्हा वयं हन्तुं धार्तराष्ट्रान् स्वबान्धवान् Bg.i.36.); 3. proper, fit, स भृत्योऽर्हो महीभुजाम् Panch.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हा
अर्ह <i>(I) a. (f. र्हा)</i> 1. Worthy of respect, अर्हानभोजयन् विप्रो दण्डमर्हति माषकम् M.viii.392; 2. worthy of, entitled to, (with an acc. or an infinitive, नैवार्हः पैतृकं रिक्थं पतितोत्पादितो हि सः M.ix.144, न परित्यागमर्हेयं मत्सकाशात्, तस्मान्नार्हा वयं हन्तुं धार्तराष्ट्रान् स्वबान्धवान् Bg.i.36.); 3. proper, fit, स भृत्योऽर्हो महीभुजाम् Panch.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह|अर्हः
अर्ह <i>(II) m.</i> 1. An epithet of Viṣṇu; 2. of Indra; 3. price, महार्हशय्यापरिवर्तनच्युतैः K.S.v.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हण|अर्हणं
अर्हण <i>n.</i> Worship, adoration, शिष्यवर्गपरिकल्पितार्हणम् R.xi.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हणा
अर्हणा <i>f.</i> The same as अर्हण q.v., अर्हणामर्हते चक्रुः R.i.55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हत्|अर्हन्त्
अर्हत् <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A Buddha; 2. a superior divinity with the Jainas thus described- सर्वज्ञो जितरागादिदोषस्त्रैलोक्यपूजितः । यथास्थितार्थवादी च देवोऽर्हन् परमेश्वरः ॥.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हत्|अर्हन्त्
अर्हत् <i>(II) a.</i> Worthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हन्त|अर्हंत|अर्हन्तः
अर्हन्त <i>(I) a. (f. न्ती)</i> Worthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हन्ती
अर्हन्त <i>(I) a. (f. न्ती)</i> Worthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हन्त|अर्हंत|अर्हन्तः
अर्हन्त <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A Buddha; 2. a Buddhist mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हा
अर्हा <i>f.</i> Worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हन्ती
अर्हन्ती <i>f.</i> Veneration, homage, adoration, श्रोत्रार्हन्ती चणैर्गुणैः S.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह्य
अर्ह्य <i>a. (f. र्ह्या)</i> Worthy, respectable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह्या
अर्ह्य <i>a. (f. र्ह्या)</i> Worthy, respectable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्
अल् <i>vt. or vi. 1U (pp. अलित)</i> 1. To adorn; 2. to prevent, to ward off; 3. to be competent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल|अलं
अल <i>n.</i> A yellow pigment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक|अलकं|अलकः
अलक <i>m.n.</i> 1. Hair, a curl, हस्ते लीलाकमलमलके बालकुन्दानुविद्धम् Megh.ii.2, (Mall. quotes in his comment on this Śloka. ‘स्वभाववक्राण्यलकानि तासाम्’ to show that अलक is used in the neuter also), R.i.42, iv.54; 2. curls on the forehead; 3. saffron applied to the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकान्त|अलकान्तः
अलक-अन्त <i>m.</i> the end of a curl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकनन्दा
अलक-नन्दा <i>f.</i> 1. a young girl from eight to ten years old; 2. the name of a river falling into the Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकप्रभा
अलक-प्रभा <i>f.</i> the capital of Kubera, othewise-called अलका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकसंहति|अलकसंहतिः
अलक-संहति <i>f.</i> a row of curls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलका
अलका <i>f.</i> 1. A girl from eight to ten years of age; 2. the name of the capital of Kubera, विभाति यस्यां ललितालकायां मनोहरा वैश्रवणस्य लक्ष्मीः Bh.V.ii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकाधिप|अलकाधिपः
अलका-अधिप, -अधिपति, -ईश्वर <i>m.</i> Kubera, the lord of Alakā, अत्यजीवदमरालकेश्वरौ R.xix.15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकाधिपति|अलकाधिपतिः
अलका-अधिप, -अधिपति, -ईश्वर <i>m.</i> Kubera, the lord of Alakā, अत्यजीवदमरालकेश्वरौ R.xix.15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकेश्वर|अलकेश्वरः
अलका-अधिप, -अधिपति, -ईश्वर <i>m.</i> Kubera, the lord of Alakā, अत्यजीवदमरालकेश्वरौ R.xix.15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्त|अलक्तः
अलक्त <i>m.</i> The red resin of certain trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्तरस|अलक्तरसः
अलक्त-रस <i>m.</i> the alakta juice, अलक्तरसरक्ताभावलक्तरसवर्जितौ । अद्यापि चरणौ तस्याः पद्मकोशसमप्रभौ Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्तराग|अलक्तरागः
अलक्त-राग <i>m.</i> the red colour of alakta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्तक|अलक्तकः
अलक्तक <i>m.</i> The same as अलक्त q.v. (This substance was formerly used by ladies as an article of decoration with which they dyed certain parts of the body. See the quotations.) अलक्तकांकां पदवीं ततान R.vii.7, चिरोज्झितालक्तकपाटलेन K.S.v.34, स्त्रियो हृतार्थाः पुरुषं निरर्थं निष्पीडितालक्तकवत् त्यजन्ति Panch.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=068-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षण|अलक्षणं
अलक्षण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Having no good marks, inauspicious, क्लेशवहा भर्तुरलक्षणाऽहम् R.xiv.5; 2. having no definition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षणा
अलक्षण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Having no good marks, inauspicious, क्लेशवहा भर्तुरलक्षणाऽहम् R.xiv.5; 2. having no definition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षण|अलक्षणं
अलक्षण <i>(II) n.</i> 1. An inauspicious sign; 2. a no definition or bad definition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्य
अलक्ष्य <i>a. (f. क्ष्या)</i> 1. Invisible, unknown; 2. unmarked; 3. insignificant in appearance; 4. free from fraud; 5. not secondary (as a meaning).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्या
अलक्ष्य <i>a. (f. क्ष्या)</i> 1. Invisible, unknown; 2. unmarked; 3. insignificant in appearance; 4. free from fraud; 5. not secondary (as a meaning).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्यगति
अलक्ष्य-गति <i>a.</i> moving invisibly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्यजन्मता
अलक्ष्य-जन्मता <i>f.</i> unknown birth or origin, वपुर्विरूपाक्ष्यजन्मता K.S.v.72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्यलिंग|अलक्ष्यलिङ्ग
अलक्ष्य-लिंग <i>a.</i> disguised, incognito.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलगर्द|अलगर्दः|अलगर्द्द
अलगर्द(र्द्ध) <i>m.</i> A water-serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलगर्द्ध
अलगर्द(र्द्ध) <i>m.</i> A water-serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलघु
अलघु <i>a. (f. घु or घ्वी)</i> 1. Heavy; 2. long (as a syllable); 3. serious, solemn; 4. intense, violent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलघ्वी
अलघु <i>a. (f. घु or घ्वी)</i> 1. Heavy; 2. long (as a syllable); 3. serious, solemn; 4. intense, violent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलघूपल|अलघूपलः
अलघु-उपल <i>m.</i> a rock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकरण|अलङ्करण|अलंकरणं|अलङ्करणं
अलंकरण <i>n.</i> 1. Decoration; 2. an ornament (used figuratively also, सृजति तावदशेषगुणालयं पुरुषरत्नमलंकरणं भुवः Bhartr.ii.92).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकरिष्णु|अलङ्करिष्णु|अलंकरिष्णुः|अलङ्करिष्णुः
अलंकरिष्णु <i>a.</i> Fond of decoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकर्मीण|अलङ्कर्मीण|अलङ्कर्म्मीण|अलङ्कर्म्मीणः
अलंकर्मीण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> Skilful, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकर्मीणा
अलंकर्मीण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> Skilful, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकार|अलङ्कार|अलंकारः|अलङ्कारः
अलंकार <i>m.</i> 1. The act of decorating; 2. an ornament; 3. a figure of speech; (they are classed under the heads of अर्थालंकार and शब्दालंकार); 4. the science and art of rhetoric, अलंकारान् सर्वानपि गलितगर्वान् रचयतु R.G. Intr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारशास्त्र
अलंकार-शास्त्र <i>n.</i> the science and art of rhetoric (poetics and dramaturgy are both included in अलंकारशास्त्र though sometimes dramaturgy is treated separately).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारसुवर्ण
अलंकार-सुवर्ण <i>n.</i> gold used for ornaments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारक
अलंकारक <i>m.</i> The same as अलंकार q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकृति|अलङ्कृति|अलंकृतिः
अलंकृति <i>f.</i> 1. Decoration; 2. an ornament; 3. a figure of speech, e.g. सालंकृतिः श्रवणकोमलवर्णराजिः Bh.V.ii.6 (where the word is used in senses 2 and 3), or the following stanza of Jayadeva in which Mammata is contradicted in a poetic fashion- यो विद्वान् मन्यते काव्यं शब्दार्थावनलंकृती । असौ न मन्यते कस्मादनुष्णमनलंकृती Chandrāloka.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंक्रिया|अलङ्क्रिया
अलंक्रिया <i>f.</i> Adorning, ornamenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलज|अलजः
अलज <i>m.</i> A kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलञ्जर|अलंजरः|अलञ्जरः
अलञ्जर <i>m.</i> An earthen water-jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्
अलम् <i>ind.</i> A particle meaning- (1) enough, no more of, अलं महिपाल तव श्रमेण R.ii.34, अलं विवादेन यथा श्रुतं त्वया K.S.v.82 (in this sense used with an inst. or a gerund); (2) no need of, no use of, आलप्यालमिदं बभ्रोर्य्त्स दारानपाहरत् Sis.ii.40; (3) in a high degree, greatly, excessively, कथापि खलु पापानामलमश्रेयसे यतः Sis.ii.40, अलमुद्योतयामासुः R.x.80, त्वमपि विततयज्ञः स्वर्गिणः प्रीणयालम् Sak.vii.; (4) sufficient for, equal to, (with the dat., तस्यालमेषा क्षुधितस्य तृप्त्यै R.ii.39, or दैत्येभ्योऽलं हरिः); (5) able, competent (used with a loc. or an infinitive, त्रयाणामपि लोकानामलमस्मि निवारणे Ram., धर्माद्विचलितुं नाहमलं चन्द्रादिव प्रभा Ram. As prefixed to कृ, अलम् is an उपपद and means ‘to decorate’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंजीविक|अलञ्जीविक
अलम्-जीविक <i>a.</i> sufficient for livelihood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंधन|अलन्धन
अलम्-धन <i>a.</i> rich, प्रतिभूः स्यादलंधनः M.vii.162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंधूम|अलन्धूम|अलन्धूमः
अलम्-धूम <i>m.</i> thick smoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंपुरुषीण|अलम्पुरुषीण|अलम्पुरुषीणः
अलम्-पुरुषीण <i>a.</i> sufficient for a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंबल|अलम्बल
अलम्-बल <i>a.</i> strong enough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंबुद्धि
अलम्-बुद्धि <i>f.</i> sense enough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंभूष्णु|अलम्भूष्णु
अलम्-भूष्णु <i>a.</i> able, competent, विनाप्यस्मदलंभूष्णुरिज्यायै तपसः सुतः Sis.ii.9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंपट|अलम्पट|अलम्पटः
अलंपट <i>(I) a. (f. टा)</i> Not libidinous, chaste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंपटा
अलंपट <i>(I) a. (f. टा)</i> Not libidinous, chaste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंपट|अलम्पट|अलम्पटः
अलंपट <i>(II) m.</i> A woman’s apartment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंबुष|अलम्बुष|अलंबुषः|अलम्बुषः
अलंबुष <i>m.</i> The palm of the hand with the fingers extended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलय|अलयः
अलय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Homeless, houseless; 2. imperishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलया
अलय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Homeless, houseless; 2. imperishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलर्क|अलर्कः
अलर्क <i>m.</i> 1. A mad dog; 2. the arka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलले
अलले <i>ind.</i> A word without meaning occurring in the gibberish of the Piśāchas (mostly found in dramatic literature).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलवाल|अलवालं
अलवाल <i>n.</i> A basin for water at the foot of a tree. Cf. आलवाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलस|अलसः
अलस <i>a. (f. सा)</i> 1. Idle, indolent; 2. slow, श्रोणीभारादलसगमना Megh.ii.19, Am.S.97; 3. languid, अलसवलितैः प्रेमार्द्रार्द्रैः (scil. अंगैः) Am.S.4, also 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसा
अलस <i>a. (f. सा)</i> 1. Idle, indolent; 2. slow, श्रोणीभारादलसगमना Megh.ii.19, Am.S.97; 3. languid, अलसवलितैः प्रेमार्द्रार्द्रैः (scil. अंगैः) Am.S.4, also 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसेक्षणा
