अलाबू
अलाबु(बू) <i>(I) f.</i> A kind of gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबु|अलाबुः
अलाबु(बू) <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A vessel made of gourd; 2. a fruit of this gourd, which, being light, floats on water, thus we have किं हि नामैतत् । अम्बुनिमज्जन्त्यलाबूनि ग्रावाणः प्लवन्त इति in the Mv.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=069-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

