अल्प|अल्पं|अल्पः
अल्प <i>a. (f. ल्पा) (op. to महत्, बहु and बृहत्)</i> 1. Small, little, scanty, अल्पस्य हेतोर्बहु हातुमिच्छन् R.ii.47, i.2, M.xii.74; 2. trifling, M.x.36; 3. seldom, rare (as in अल्पप्रयोगोऽयं शब्दः); 4. of short existence. (The acc. inst. and abl. singulars, viz., अल्पम्, अल्पेन and अल्पात् are used as indeclinables in the sense of ‘easily,’ ‘without much trouble,’ ‘a little,’ ‘for a slight reason,’ प्रीतिरल्पेन Ram.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=070-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पा
