अल्प-इतर <i>a.</i> 1. other than small, i.e. large; 2. other than few, i.e. many, केषामेष नराधिपो न जनयत्यल्पेतराः कल्पनाः Pr.Bh.17; 3. other than little, i.e. much, Pr.Bh.9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=070-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

