अल्पिता
अल्पित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Diminished; 2. put down, lower in position or estimation, मृषा न चक्रेऽल्पितकल्पपादपः Na.i.15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=070-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

