अल्पिष्ठ <i>a. (f. ष्ठा) (the super. of अल्प)</i> Least, smallest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

