अवकृष्ट|अवकृष्टः
अवकृष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Expelled, turned out; 2. removed; 3. pulled; 4. degraded, out-caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकृष्टा
अवकृष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Expelled, turned out; 2. removed; 3. pulled; 4. degraded, out-caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकृष्ट|अवकृष्टः
अवकृष्ट <i>(II) m.</i> A low servant, पणौ देयोऽवकृष्टस्य M.vii.126. (Medhātithi explains अवकृष्ट by संमार्जनशोध्नविनियुक्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकॢप्ति|अवकॢप्तिः
अवकॢप्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Suitableness; 2. possibility, probability (अनवकॢप्तिरसंभावना S.K.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

