अवकेशिनी
अवकेशिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Barren (as a tree).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवक्रन्दन|अवक्रंदनं
अवक्रन्दन <i>n.</i> Crying out, weeping aloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवक्रय|अवक्रयः
अवक्रय <i>m.</i> 1. Letting out to hire; 2. rent; 3. a duty, a tax; 4. price.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवक्रान्ति|अवक्रांतिः|अवक्रान्तिः
