अवक्लेद|अवक्लेदः
अवक्लेद <i>m.</i> 1. Trickling; 2. fetid discharge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवक्वाथ|अवक्वाथः
अवक्वाथ <i>m.</i> An imperfect decoction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवक्षय|अवक्षयः
अवक्षय <i>m.</i> Decay, waste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवक्षेप|अवक्षेपः
अवक्षेप <i>m.</i> The same as अवक्षेपण q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवक्षेपण|अवक्षेपणं
अवक्षेपण <i>n.</i> 1. Throwing down; 2. throwing down considered as one of the 5 karmans of the Vaiśeṣikas (See under कर्मन्); 3. censure, blame; 4. despising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवक्षेपणी
अवक्षेपणी <i>f.</i> A bridle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवखात|अवखातं
अवखात <i>n.</i> A deep ditch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=071-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवगणन|अवगणनं
