अवघूर्णन|अवघूर्णनं|अवघूर्ण्णन
अवघूर्णन <i>n.</i> Whirling round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवघोषण|अवघोषणं
अवघोषण <i>n.</i> 1. Proclaiming; 2. a proclamation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवघोषणा
अवघोषणा <i>f.</i> 1. Proclaiming; 2. a proclamation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवघ्राण|अवघ्राणं
अवघ्राण <i>n.</i> the act of smelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचन
अवचन <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Silent, mute, शकुन्तला साध्वसादवचना तिष्ठति Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचना
