अवचूर्णन|अवचूर्णनं|अवचूर्ण्णन
अवचूर्णन <i>n.</i> 1. Pounding, reducing to powder; 2. sprinkling absorbent powders on sores (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचूल|अवचूलः
अवचूल <i>m.</i> An ornament (such as a chouri) hanging from the top of a banner, दिवसकरवारणस्यावचूलचामरकलाप इव Kad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचूलक|अवचूलकं|अवचूलकः
अवचूलक <i>m.</i> A brush for fanning off flies, a chouri.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छद|अवच्छदः
अवच्छद <i>m.</i> A cover, काञ्चनावच्छदान् Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छिन्न|अवच्छिन्नं
अवच्छिन्न <i>a. (f. न्ना)</i> 1. Cut off; 2. divided, separted; 3. particularized (as by a qualifying adjective); 4. bounded, determined, दिक्कालाद्यनवच्छिन्न Bhartr.ii.1; 5. separated from everything else by the properties peculiarly predicated of anything (in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

