अवच्छिन्न <i>a. (f. न्ना)</i> 1. Cut off; 2. divided, separted; 3. particularized (as by a qualifying adjective); 4. bounded, determined, दिक्कालाद्यनवच्छिन्न Bhartr.ii.1; 5. separated from everything else by the properties peculiarly predicated of anything (in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=072-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

