अवभासक <i>n.</i> The supreme soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभुग्न
अवभुग्न <i>a. (f. ग्ना)</i> Contracted, bent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभुग्ना
अवभुग्न <i>a. (f. ग्ना)</i> Contracted, bent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभृथ|अवभृथः
अवभृथ <i>m.</i> 1. Bathing after sacrifice for the purpose of purification, मेध्येनावभृथादपि R.i.84, ix.22; 2. water; 3. a supplementary sacrifice to atone for the defects in a principal one, अवभृताप्लुतो मुनिः R.xi.31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभृथस्नान
अवभृथ-स्नान <i>n.</i> bathing after a sacrificial ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभ्र|अवभ्रः
अवभ्र <i>m.</i> Abduction, carrying off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवम|अवमं|अवमः
अवम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Low, inferior, अलकानवमां पुरीम् R.ix.14; 2. undermost, lowest; 3. next, intimate; 4. last, youngest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमा
अवम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Low, inferior, अलकानवमां पुरीम् R.ix.14; 2. undermost, lowest; 3. next, intimate; 4. last, youngest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमत|अवमतं
अवमत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Despised, disregarded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमता
