अवमर्ष|अवमर्षः
अवमर्ष <i>m.</i> 1. Consideration, investigation; 2. one of the five principal parts of a play. (It is thus defined- यत्र मुख्यफलोपाय उद्भिन्नो गर्भतोधिकः शापाद्यैः सांतरायश्च सोऽवमर्षः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

