अवमानन|अवमाननं
अवमानन <i>n.</i> The same as अवमान q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

