अवमानिनी
अवमानिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Disregarding, slighting, धिङ्मां श्रेयोऽवमानिनम् Sak.vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

