अवमूर्धशय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Lying with the head hanging down, e.g. उत्तानशया देवा अवमूर्धशया मनुष्याः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमूर्धशया
अवमूर्धशय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Lying with the head hanging down, e.g. उत्तानशया देवा अवमूर्धशया मनुष्याः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=074-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमोचन|अवमोचनं
अवमोचन <i>n.</i> Loosening, setting at liberty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयव|अवयवः
अवयव <i>m.</i> 1. A limb, मुखावयवलूनां ताम् R.x.43, Am.S.40, 46; 2. a part, a portion; 3. a component part of a syllogism (in logic); (they are five, viz., प्रतिज्ञा, हेतु, उदाहरण, उपनय and निगमन^1); 4. the body.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251217. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयवार्थ|अवयवार्थः
अवयव-अर्थ <i>m.</i> the meaning of the component parts of a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयवशस्
अवयव-शस् <i>ind.</i> part by part, severally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयविन्
अवयविन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Having अवयव q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयविनी
अवयविन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Having अवयव q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयविन्
अवयविन् <i>(II) m.</i> A syllogism (in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवर|अवरं|अवरः
अवर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Low, inferior, दरेण ह्यवरं कर्म बुद्धियोगाद्धनंजय Bg.ii.49; 2. mean, unimportant, विद्यामाददीतावरादपि M.ii.238; 3. posterior, last, सामान्यमेषां प्रथमावरस्वम् K.S.vii.44; 4. least, त्र्यवरा परिषज्ज्ञेया M.xii.112; 5. younger; 6. western.(अवरतस् ‘below’ or ‘from below’ is used as an indeclinable.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरा
अवर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Low, inferior, दरेण ह्यवरं कर्म बुद्धियोगाद्धनंजय Bg.ii.49; 2. mean, unimportant, विद्यामाददीतावरादपि M.ii.238; 3. posterior, last, सामान्यमेषां प्रथमावरस्वम् K.S.vii.44; 4. least, त्र्यवरा परिषज्ज्ञेया M.xii.112; 5. younger; 6. western.(अवरतस् ‘below’ or ‘from below’ is used as an indeclinable.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवर|अवरं|अवरः
अवर <i>(II) n.</i> The hind thigh of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरार्ध|अवरार्धः
अवर-अर्ध <i>m.</i> 1. the minimum; 2. the last half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरावर
अवर-अवर <i>a.</i> lowest, न हि प्रकृष्टान् प्रेष्यांस्तु प्रेषयन्त्यवरावरान् Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोक्त
अवर-उक्त <i>a.</i> named last.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरज|अवरजः
अवर-ज <i>(I) a.</i> younger, junior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरज|अवरजः
अवर-ज <i>(II) m.</i> 1. a younger brother; 2. a Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरजा
अवर-जा <i>f.</i> a younger sister. विदर्भराजावरजा R.vi.58, 84, xii.82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरवर्ण|अवरवर्णः
अवर-वर्ण <i>(I) a.</i> belonging to a low caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरवर्ण|अवरवर्णः
