अवरीण|अवरीणं
अवरीण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> Despised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरीणा
अवरीण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> Despised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरुद्धि|अवरुद्धिः
अवरुद्धि <i>f.</i> 1. Restraint; 2. gaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरूप
अवरूप <i>a. (f. पा)</i> Deformed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरूपा
अवरूप <i>a. (f. पा)</i> Deformed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोचक|अवरोचकः
