अवरोध|अवरोधः
अवरोध <i>m.</i> 1. Obstruction; 2. restraint; 3. a siege; 4. the inner apartments of a palace, i.e. the seraglio; 5. the wives of a king taken collectively, अवरोधे महत्यपि R.i.32, iv.68, vi.46; 6. a covering; 7. a fence; 8. a watchman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=075-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

