अवार-पारीण <i>a.</i> 1. belonging to the ocean; 2. crossing a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवावट|अवावटः
अवावट <i>m.</i> The son of a woman by any man of the same caste, other than her first husband. (द्वितीयेन तु यः पित्रा सवर्णायां प्रजायत । अवावट इति ख्यातः शूद्रधर्मा स जातितः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवावन्
अवावन् <i>m.</i> A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवासस्
अवासस् <i>(I) a.</i> Unclad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवासस्
अवासस् <i>(II) m.</i> A Bauddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवि|अविः
अवि <i>(I) m.</i> A sheep जिनकार्मुकवस्तावीन् (दद्यात्) M.xi.1, iii.6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवि|अविः
अवि <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The sun; 2. wind; 3. a mountain; 4. an enclosure; 5. a rat; 6. a blanket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवि|अविः
अवि <i>(III) f.</i> 1. An ewe; 2. a woman in her courses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकटोरण|अविकटोरणः
अवि-कटोरण <i>m.</i> a kind of tribute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविपट|अविपटः
अवि-पट <i>m.</i> a woollen cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविपाल|अविपालः
अवि-पाल <i>m.</i> a shepherd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविस्थल
अवि-स्थल <i>n.</i> the name of a town, अविस्थलं वृकस्थलं माकन्दं वारणावतम् Ve.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविक|अविकं|अविकः
अविक <i>(I) m.</i> A sheep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविक|अविकं|अविकः
अविक <i>(II) n.</i> A diamond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकट|अविकटः
अविकट <i>m.</i> A flock of sheep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकत्थन
अविकत्थन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Not boasting, modest, R.xv.73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकत्थना
अविकत्थन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Not boasting, modest, R.xv.73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकल
अविकल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Full, entire, perfect, फलमाविकलं कामुकत्यस्य लब्ध्वा Megh.i.24, also i.34; 2. regular, कलमविकलतालं गायकैर्बोधंहतोः Sis.xi.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकला
अविकल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Full, entire, perfect, फलमाविकलं कामुकत्यस्य लब्ध्वा Megh.i.24, also i.34; 2. regular, कलमविकलतालं गायकैर्बोधंहतोः Sis.xi.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकल्प|अविकल्पः
अविकल्प <i>(I) a. (f. ल्पा)</i> Unchangeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकल्पा
अविकल्प <i>(I) a. (f. ल्पा)</i> Unchangeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकल्प|अविकल्पः
अविकल्प <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Absence of doubt; 2. absence of alternative or option; 3. a positive precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविकृति|अविकृतिः
अविकृति <i>f.</i> 1. Absence of change; 2. the inanimate principle called प्रकृति and considered to be the material cause of this universe (in Sāṅkhya phil.) मूलप्राकृतिरविकृतिः Sank.K.3. (See also Vāchaspati’s comment on it.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविक्रिय
अविक्रिय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> Immutable, unchangeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविक्रिया
अविक्रिय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> Immutable, unchangeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविक्रिय
अविक्रिय <i>(II) n.</i> Brahman (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविक्षत
अविक्षत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Entire, undiminished, unhurt, uninjured, e.g. विक्रेतुः प्रतिदेयं तत्तस्मिन्नेवाह्न्यविक्षतम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविक्षता
अविक्षत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Entire, undiminished, unhurt, uninjured, e.g. विक्रेतुः प्रतिदेयं तत्तस्मिन्नेवाह्न्यविक्षतम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविग्रह|अविग्रहः
अविग्रह <i>(I) a. (f. हा)</i> Bodiless, incorporeal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविग्रहा
अविग्रह <i>(I) a. (f. हा)</i> Bodiless, incorporeal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविग्रह|अविग्रहः
अविग्रह <i>(II) m.</i> A compound whose sense cannot be expressed by its component parts separately (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=077-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविघ्न
अविघ्न <i>n.</i> Freedom from obstacles, अविघ्नमस्तु ते स्थेयाः पितेव धुरि पुत्रिणाम् R.i.91. (Note. this word is neuter while विघ्न is masculine. Cf. अमित्र.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविचारित|अविचारितः
अविचारित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Not thought out, not considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविचारिता
अविचारित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Not thought out, not considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविचारितनिर्णय|अविचारितनिर्णयः
अविचारित-निर्णय <i>m.</i> a prejudiced opinion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविडीन|अविडीनं
अविडीन <i>n.</i> A direct flight (of birds).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवितथ|अवितथं
अवितथ <i>(I) a. (f. था)</i> Not false, true, तदवितथमवादीर्यन्मम त्वं प्रियेति Sis.xi.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवितथा
अवितथ <i>(I) a. (f. था)</i> Not false, true, तदवितथमवादीर्यन्मम त्वं प्रियेति Sis.xi.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवितथ|अवितथं
अवितथ <i>(II) n.</i> Truth, अवितथमाह प्रियंवदा Sak.iii.(This word is used adverbially also, M.ii.144.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवित्यज|अवित्यजं|अवित्यजः
अवित्यज <i>m.n.</i> quick-silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविदूर
अविदूर <i>(I) a.</i> Not distant, near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविदूर
अविदूर <i>(II) n.</i> Proximity. (The acc. inst. abl. and loc. singulars of this word, viz., अविदूरम्, अविदूरेण, अविदूरात् and अविदूरे are used as indeclinables in the sense of ‘not far.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविद्या
अविद्या <i>f.</i> 1. Ignorance; 2. spiritual ignorance; 3. illusion or Māyā (i.e. that principle which, according to the Vedāntists, makes us see the whole universe in Brahman (n.) which alone exists), अपि द्रागाविद्यद्रुमदलनदीक्षागुरुरिह प्रवाहस्तेन वाराम् G.L.2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविद्यामय
अविद्या-मय <i>a.</i> caused by ignorance or illusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविधवा
अविधवा <i>f.</i> A non-widow, a married woman whose husband is living, भर्तुर्मित्रं प्रियमविधवे विद्धि माम् Megh.ii.36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविनय|अविनयः
अविनय <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Rude behaviour, offence, अयमाचरत्यविनयं मुग्धासु तपस्विकन्यासु Sak.i.; 2. indecorum, impropriety of conduct; 3. arrogance, rudeness, अविनयमपनय विष्णो Śankara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविनय|अविनयः
अविनय <i>(II) a. (f. या)</i> Rude, immodest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविनया
अविनय <i>(II) a. (f. या)</i> Rude, immodest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविनाभाव|अविनाभावः
अविनाभाव <i>m.</i> 1. Non-separation; 2. inherent and inseparable connection; 3. connection in general (अविनाभावोऽत्र सम्बन्धमात्रं न तु नांतरीयकत्वम् K.Pr.ii.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविनीत|अविनीतः
अविनीत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Rude, immodest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविनीता
अविनीत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Rude, immodest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविभक्त|अविभक्तः
अविभक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Undivided, entire; 2. unpartitioned, joint in interest, as a family or property (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविभक्ता
अविभक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Undivided, entire; 2. unpartitioned, joint in interest, as a family or property (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविभाग|अविभागः
अविभाग <i>m.</i> 1. The not dividing; 2. undivided inheritance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविभाज्य|अविभाज्यं
अविभाज्य <i>n.</i> 1. Certain articles which are not divided at the time of partition; (they are enumerated thus- वस्त्रं पात्रमलंकारं कृतान्नमुदकं स्त्रियः । योगक्षेमं प्रचारं च न विभाज्यं प्रचक्षते M.ix.219); 2. indivisibility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविरत|अविरतं
अविरत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Not desisting from, (with abl.), uninterrupted, continual, अविरतोत्कण्ठमुत्कण्ठितेन Megh.ii.30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविरता
अविरत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Not desisting from, (with abl.), uninterrupted, continual, अविरतोत्कण्ठमुत्कण्ठितेन Megh.ii.30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविरतम्
अविरतम् <i>ind.</i> Eternally, continually, अविरतं परकार्यकृतां सताम् Bh.V.i.113.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविरति|अविरतिः
अविरति <i>f.</i> 1. Incontinence; 2. uninterruptedness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविरल|अविरलं
अविरल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Close; 2. substantial; 3. uninterrupted. (अविरलम् is also used adverbially in the sense of ‘closely, fast’ अविरलमालिंगितुं पवनः Sak.iii.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविरला
अविरल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Close; 2. substantial; 3. uninterrupted. (अविरलम् is also used adverbially in the sense of ‘closely, fast’ अविरलमालिंगितुं पवनः Sak.iii.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविलम्ब|अविलंब|अविलम्बः
अविलम्ब <i>m.</i> Absence of delay, quickness. (अविलम्बम् and अविलम्बेन are used adverbially in the sense of “without delay, quickly”).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविलम्बित|अविलंबित|अविलम्बितं|अविलम्बितः
अविलम्बित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Quick, without delay. (Also used adverbially.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविलम्बिता
अविलम्बित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Quick, without delay. (Also used adverbially.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविलम्बन|अविलम्बनं
अविलम्बन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> See अविलम्बित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविलम्बना
अविलम्बन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> See अविलम्बित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविला
अविला <i>f.</i> An ewe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविवक्षित
अविवक्षित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Unintentional, not intended (as in अत्र बहुत्वमविवक्षितम्); 2. undeclared, not to be said, or spoken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविवक्षिता
अविवक्षित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Unintentional, not intended (as in अत्र बहुत्वमविवक्षितम्); 2. undeclared, not to be said, or spoken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविविक्त
अविविक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Uninvestigated, not thought out; 2. indiscriminate; 3. public.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविविक्ता
अविविक्त <i>a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Uninvestigated, not thought out; 2. indiscriminate; 3. public.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविवेक|अविवेकः
अविवेक <i>m.</i> 1. Hastiness; 2. want of judgment or foresight, अविवेकः परमापदां पदम् Kir.ii.80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविशंकित|अविशङ्कित
अविशंकित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Without doubt, गृध्रवाक्यात् कथं मूढास्त्यजध्वमविशंकिताः K.Pr.iv.; 2. without fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविशंकिता
अविशंकित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Without doubt, गृध्रवाक्यात् कथं मूढास्त्यजध्वमविशंकिताः K.Pr.iv.; 2. without fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविशेष|अविशेषः
अविशेष <i>(I) a. (f. षा)</i> Alike, without any difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविशेषा
अविशेष <i>(I) a. (f. षा)</i> Alike, without any difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविशेष|अविशेषः
अविशेष <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Absence of difference, uniformity; 2. identity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविशेषज्ञ
अविशेष-ज्ञ <i>a.</i> not knowing the difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविष|अविषः
अविष <i>m.</i> 1. The ocean; 2. a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविषय|अविषयः
अविषय <i>m.</i> 1. Not the object (i.e. transcending, beyond), सकलवचनामविषयः M.M.i.; 2. disappearance, absence; 3. disregard of objects of sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविषी
अविषी^1 <i>f.</i> 1. A river; 2. the earth; 3. heaven.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251217. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102. note: headword change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवी
अवी <i>f.</i> A woman in her courses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवीचि|अवीचिः
अवीचि <i>m.</i> Name of a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवीरा
अवीरा <i>f.</i> A woman having neither husband nor son (पतिपुत्रवती नारी वीरा प्रोक्ता मनीषिभिः) अनर्चितं वृथा मांसमवीरायाश्च योषितः M.ix.213.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृत्ति|अवृत्तिः
अवृत्ति <i>(I) a.</i> Not being in, not existing in, e.g. साध्याभाववदवृत्तित्वम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृत्ति|अवृत्तिः
अवृत्ति <i>(II) f.</i> 1. Absence of any means of livelihood, आददीतामेवास्मादवृत्तावेकरात्रिकम् M.iv.223 or अवृत्तिकर्षिता हि स्त्री प्रदुष्येत्स्थितिमत्यपि M.ix.74, x.101; 2. absence of wages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृथा
अवृथा <i>ind.</i> Not in vain, successfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृष्टि|अवृष्टिः
अवृष्टि <i>f.</i> Drought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्षण|अवेक्षणं
अवेक्षण <i>n.</i> 1. Looking towards; 2. attention, care, वर्णाश्रमावेक्षणजागरूकः R.xiv.85; 3. regarding, considering, R.xiv.67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=078-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्षा
अवेक्षा <i>f.</i> The same as अवेक्षण q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेद्य|अवेद्यः
अवेद्य <i>(I) a. (f. द्या)</i> 1. Unknowable; 2. unobtainable, unattainable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेद्या
अवेद्य <i>(I) a. (f. द्या)</i> 1. Unknowable; 2. unobtainable, unattainable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेद्य|अवेद्यः
अवेद्य <i>(II) m.</i> A calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेल|अवेलः
अवेल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Untimely; 2. without any limit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेला
अवेल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Untimely; 2. without any limit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेल|अवेलः
अवेल <i>(II) m.</i> Concealment of knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवैध|अवैधं
अवैध <i>a. (f. धी)</i> 1. Irregular, not conformable to rule; 2. not sanctioned by the śāstra, eg. अवैद्यं पञ्चमं कुर्वन् राज्ञो दण्डेन शुद्ध्यति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवैधी
अवैध <i>a. (f. धी)</i> 1. Irregular, not conformable to rule; 2. not sanctioned by the śāstra, eg. अवैद्यं पञ्चमं कुर्वन् राज्ञो दण्डेन शुद्ध्यति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवोक्षण|अवोक्षणं
अवोक्षण <i>n.</i> Sprinkling with the slanting hand. (तिरश्चावोक्षणं स्मृतम्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवोद|अवोदं|अवोदः
अवोद <i>m.</i> Sprinkling, moistening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्द
अव्द <i>m.</i> The same as अब्द q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्त|अव्यक्तं|अव्यक्तः
अव्यक्त <i>(I) a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Not apparent, indistinct, e.g. फलमव्यक्तमब्रवीत्; 2. invisible; 3. undetermined, अव्यक्तोयमचिन्त्योयम् Bg.ii.25; 4. unknown as a quantity or number (in algebra).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्ता
अव्यक्त <i>(I) a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Not apparent, indistinct, e.g. फलमव्यक्तमब्रवीत्; 2. invisible; 3. undetermined, अव्यक्तोयमचिन्त्योयम् Bg.ii.25; 4. unknown as a quantity or number (in algebra).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्त|अव्यक्तं|अव्यक्तः
अव्यक्त <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Primary matter which has not yet entered into existence; 2. a name of Viṣṇu; 3. of Śiva; 4. of Kāmadeva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्त|अव्यक्तं|अव्यक्तः
अव्यक्त <i>(III) n.</i> 1. The primary germ of nature out of which all the phenomena of the material world are developed (in Sāṅkhya phil.). See Sank.K.10, बुद्धेरिवाव्यक्तमुदाहरन्ति R.xiii.60 or महतः परमव्यक्तमव्यक्तात्पुरुषः Katho.; 2. Brahman (n.); 3. the soul; 4. ignorance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तानुकरण
अव्यक्त-अनुकरण <i>n.</i> the imitating of unmeaning sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तादि
अव्यक्त-आदि <i>a.</i> whose beginning is inscrutable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तपद
अव्यक्त-पद <i>a.</i> inarticulate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तमूलप्रभव|अव्यक्तमूलप्रभवः
अव्यक्त-मूलप्रभव <i>m.</i> the tree of worldly existence (in Sāṅkhya phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तराग|अव्यक्तरागः
अव्यक्त-राग <i>(I) m.</i> the colour of the dawn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तराग|अव्यक्तरागः
अव्यक्त-राग <i>(II) a.</i> ruddy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तराशि|अव्यक्तराशिः
अव्यक्त-राशि <i>m.</i> an unknown number or quantity (in algebra).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तलक्षण|अव्यक्तलक्षणः
अव्यक्त-लक्षण <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तमार्ग
अव्यक्त-मार्ग, -वर्त्मन <i>a.</i> mysterious in his ways or dealings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तवर्त्मन्
अव्यक्त-मार्ग, -वर्त्मन <i>a.</i> mysterious in his ways or dealings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तवाच्
अव्यक्त-वाच् <i>a.</i> speaking indistinctly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्तसाम्य
अव्यक्त-साम्य <i>n.</i> equation of unknown quantities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यंग|अव्यङ्ग|अव्यङ्गः
अव्यंग <i>a. (f. गा)</i> Not mutilated, sound, perfect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यंगा|अव्यङ्गा
अव्यंग <i>a. (f. गा)</i> Not mutilated, sound, perfect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यञ्जन|अव्यंजन|अव्यञ्जनः
अव्यञ्जन <i>(I) n.</i> An animal without horns though of an age to have them.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यञ्जन|अव्यंजन|अव्यञ्जनः
अव्यञ्जन <i>(II) a. (f. ना)</i> Not having the distinctive marks of one’s sex or kind, e.g. अव्यंजना कन्या.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यञ्जना
अव्यञ्जन <i>(II) a. (f. ना)</i> Not having the distinctive marks of one’s sex or kind, e.g. अव्यंजना कन्या.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यथ|अव्यथः
अव्यथ <i>(I) a. (f. था)</i> Free from pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यथा
अव्यथ <i>(I) a. (f. था)</i> Free from pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यथ|अव्यथः
अव्यथ <i>(II) m.</i> A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यथिष|अव्यथिषः
अव्यथिष <i>m.</i> 1. the ocean; 2. mid-night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यभिचार|अव्यभिचारः
अव्यभि(भी)चार <i>m.</i> 1. Non-separation, M.ix.10; 2. fidelity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यभीचार|अव्यभीचारः
अव्यभि(भी)चार <i>m.</i> 1. Non-separation, M.ix.10; 2. fidelity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यभिचारिन्
अव्यभिचारिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Steady, permanent, faithful, e.g. भक्तिर्व्यभिचारिणी; 2. Virtuous, moral, chaste; 3. true in all cases, without any instance to the contrary, यदुच्यते आर्वति पापवृत्तये न रूपमित्यव्यभिचारि तद्वचः K.S.v.36, रंध्रोपनिपातिनोऽनर्था इति यदुच्यते तदव्यभिचारि वचः Sak.vi.; 4. not having the flaw called व्यभिचार q.v. (as a हेतु in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यभिचारिणी
अव्यभिचारिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Steady, permanent, faithful, e.g. भक्तिर्व्यभिचारिणी; 2. Virtuous, moral, chaste; 3. true in all cases, without any instance to the contrary, यदुच्यते आर्वति पापवृत्तये न रूपमित्यव्यभिचारि तद्वचः K.S.v.36, रंध्रोपनिपातिनोऽनर्था इति यदुच्यते तदव्यभिचारि वचः Sak.vi.; 4. not having the flaw called व्यभिचार q.v. (as a हेतु in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यय|अव्ययं|अव्ययः
अव्यय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Imperishable, immutable, विनाशमव्ययस्यास्य न कश्चित्कर्तुमर्हति Bg.ii.17; 2. eternal, everlasting, अश्वत्थं प्राहुरव्ययम् Bg.xv.1, (अकीर्ति) कथयिष्यन्ति तेऽव्ययाम् Bg.ii.34; 3. unexpended, unwasted; 4. economical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यया
अव्यय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Imperishable, immutable, विनाशमव्ययस्यास्य न कश्चित्कर्तुमर्हति Bg.ii.17; 2. eternal, everlasting, अश्वत्थं प्राहुरव्ययम् Bg.xv.1, (अकीर्ति) कथयिष्यन्ति तेऽव्ययाम् Bg.ii.34; 3. unexpended, unwasted; 4. economical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यय|अव्ययं|अव्ययः
अव्यय <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A name of Viṣṇu; 2. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यय|अव्ययं|अव्ययः
अव्यय <i>(III) n.</i> 1. An indeclinable (in gram.), (सदृशं त्रिषु लिंगेषु सर्वांसु च विभक्तिषु । वचनेषु च सर्वेषु यत्रव्येति तदव्ययम्.); 2. Brahman (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्ययात्मन्
अव्यय-आत्मन् <i>a.</i> of imperishable nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्ययवर्ग|अव्ययवर्गः
अव्यय-वर्ग <i>m.</i> the class of indeclinables.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्ययीभाव|अव्ययीभावः
अव्ययीभाव <i>m.</i> 1. One of the four principal compounds in Sanskrit grammar. (It is so called because it always forms indeclinables (अव्यय) from substantives, e.g. उपकुम्भम्; the other three compounds are द्वन्द्व, तत्पुरुष and बहुव्रीहि); 2. non-expenditure owing to poverty मद्गेहे नित्यमव्ययीभावः Ud. (where both the senses are intended); 3. imperishableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यलीक
अव्यलीक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Agreeable, having no disagreeable element, इत्थं गिरः प्रियतमा इव सोऽव्यलीकाः Sis.v.1; 2. true.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यलीका
अव्यलीक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Agreeable, having no disagreeable element, इत्थं गिरः प्रियतमा इव सोऽव्यलीकाः Sis.v.1; 2. true.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवधान
अव्यवधान <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Immediate, close; 2. open; 3. careless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवधाना
अव्यवधान <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Immediate, close; 2. open; 3. careless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवस्थ
अव्यवस्थ <i>a. (f. स्था)</i> 1. Disorderly, irregular; 2. not stable, moving, स्थलारविन्दश्रियमव्यवस्थाम् K.S.i.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवस्था
अव्यवस्थ <i>a. (f. स्था)</i> 1. Disorderly, irregular; 2. not stable, moving, स्थलारविन्दश्रियमव्यवस्थाम् K.S.i.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवस्था
अव्यवस्था <i>f.</i> 1. Irregularity, deviation from established rule; 2. an incorrect opinion on a point of civil or religious law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवस्थित|अव्यवस्थितः
अव्यवस्थित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Not conformable to law or practice; 2. ill-regulated; 3. fickle, unstable, e.g. अव्यवस्थिताचित्तस्य प्रसादोऽपि भयंकरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवस्थिता
अव्यवस्थित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Not conformable to law or practice; 2. ill-regulated; 3. fickle, unstable, e.g. अव्यवस्थिताचित्तस्य प्रसादोऽपि भयंकरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवहार्य|अव्यवहार्य्य|अव्यवहार्य्यं
अव्यवहार्य <i>a. (f. र्या)</i> 1. Not entitled to eat or drink with people of the same caste, out-casted, excommunicated; 2. not to be discussed at a law-court.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवहार्या
अव्यवहार्य <i>a. (f. र्या)</i> 1. Not entitled to eat or drink with people of the same caste, out-casted, excommunicated; 2. not to be discussed at a law-court.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवहित|अव्यवहितं
अव्यवहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Immediate, without any intervening thing, direct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यवहिता
अव्यवहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Immediate, without any intervening thing, direct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याकृत
अव्याकृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Not manifest, e.g. तद्धेदं तर्ह्यव्याकृतमासीत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याकृता
अव्याकृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Not manifest, e.g. तद्धेदं तर्ह्यव्याकृतमासीत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याकृत
अव्याकृत <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Elementary substance from which all things were created, considered as one with Brahman (n.) (in Vedānta phil.); 2. the primary germ of nature (See प्रधान) according to the Sāṅkhyas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=079-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याज|अव्याजं|अव्याजः
अव्याज <i>m.</i> 1. Absence of fraud, honesty; 2. reality, इदं किलाव्याजमनोहरं Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यापार|अव्यापारः
अव्यापार <i>m.</i> 1. Cessation from work; 2. business not practised or understood, अव्यपारेषु व्यापारं यो नरः कर्तुमिच्छति Panch.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याप्ति|अव्याप्तिः
अव्याप्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Inadequate pervasion or extent of a proposition (in logic); 2. the non-inclusion (exclusion) of part of the thing defined, इदं लक्षणमव्याप्त्यतिव्याप्तिदूषितम् R.G.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याप्य|अव्याप्यं
अव्याप्य <i>a. (f. प्या)</i> Not extending to the whole circumstances, not pervading the whole extent in Vaiśeṣika phil.) e.g. वह्निर्धूमस्याव्याप्यः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याप्या
अव्याप्य <i>a. (f. प्या)</i> Not extending to the whole circumstances, not pervading the whole extent in Vaiśeṣika phil.) e.g. वह्निर्धूमस्याव्याप्यः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याप्यवृत्ति|अव्याप्यवृत्तिः
अव्याप्य-वृत्ति <i>a.</i> a category of limited application or partial inherence as regards time or space. (in Vaiśeṣika phil.) अव्याप्यवृत्तिः क्षणिको विशेषगुण इष्यते Bh.P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याहत|अव्याहतं
अव्याहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Unobstructed, unhindered, obeyed, e.g. अव्याहताज्ञः सर्वत्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याहता
अव्याहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Unobstructed, unhindered, obeyed, e.g. अव्याहताज्ञः सर्वत्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्युत्पन्न|अव्युत्पन्नः
अव्युत्पन्न <i>(I) a. (f. न्ना)</i> 1. Having no proper derivation, e.g. अव्युत्पन्नोऽयं शब्दः (meaning अवयवार्थशून्यः); 2. inexperienced, not practised, as in अव्युत्पन्नमतिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्युत्पन्ना
अव्युत्पन्न <i>(I) a. (f. न्ना)</i> 1. Having no proper derivation, e.g. अव्युत्पन्नोऽयं शब्दः (meaning अवयवार्थशून्यः); 2. inexperienced, not practised, as in अव्युत्पन्नमतिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्युत्पन्न|अव्युत्पन्नः
अव्युत्पन्न <i>(II) m.</i> One not proficient in the grammar and idiom of a language, a superificial linguist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्रत
अव्रत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Not observing religious rites or obligations, अव्रतानाममन्त्राणां जातिमात्रोपजीविनाम् । नैषां प्रतिग्रहो देयो न शिला तारयेच्छिलाम् M.xii.114, iii.170.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्रता
अव्रत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Not observing religious rites or obligations, अव्रतानाममन्त्राणां जातिमात्रोपजीविनाम् । नैषां प्रतिग्रहो देयो न शिला तारयेच्छिलाम् M.xii.114, iii.170.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्
अश् <i>(I) vt. 5Ā (pp. अशित or अष्ट)</i> 1. To reach, to attain, to go to, e.g. सर्वमानन्त्य्मश्नुते Yaj.i.261; 2. to obtain, to acquire, न वेदफलमश्नुते M.i.109, or फलं दृशोरानशिरे महिष्यः Na.vi.43, R.vii.23, ix.9; 3. to pervade, to occupy, खं प्रावृषैरिव चानशेऽब्दैः Bt.ii.30.With उप-, to obtain, to acquire, क्रियाफ्लमुपाश्नुते M.vi.82.With वि-, to pervade, to occupy, प्रतापस्तस्य भानोश्च युगपद्व्यानशे दिशः R.iv.15, Bt.ix.4, xiv.96, xvii.60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्
अश् <i>(II) vt. 9P (pp. अशित)</i> 1. To eat, निवेद्य गुरवेऽश्रीयात् M.ii.51, iii.106; 2. to taste, to enjoy, अश्नन्ति दिव्यान् दिवि देवभोगान् Bg.ix.20, or यद्ददाति यदश्नाति तदेव धनिनो धनम् Hit.i.With प्र-, 1. to eat, प्राशुर्हुतोच्छिष्टम् Bt.i.13, xv.29, xvii.3; 2. to drink, e.g. न प्राश्नीतोदकमपि.With सम्-, 1. to eat, नक्तं चान्नं समाश्नीयात् M.vi.19; 2. to enjoy, यथा फलं समश्नाति Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=080-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

