अशोक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> Without sorrow, not feeling or causing sorrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोक|अशोकं|अशोकः
अशोक <i>(II) m.</i> Name of a tree famous in Sanskrit literature. (According to the convention of poets, this tree puts forth flowers when it receives kicks from young beautiful ladies. In allusion to this circumstance we have in the K.S.- असून सद्यः कुसुमान्यशोकः स्कन्धात् प्रभृत्येव सपल्लवानि । पादेन नापैक्षत सुन्दरीणां संस्पर्शमासिञ्जितनूपुरेण iii.26, and in the Megh.- एकः सख्यास्तव सह मया वामपादाभिलाषी ii.15. See also R.viii.62.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोक|अशोकं|अशोकः
अशोक <i>(III) n.</i> 1. The blossom of the Aśoka plant (the flower of this tree is considered as one of the five arrows of Kāmadeva. See अरविन्द); 2. quick-silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकाष्टमी
अशोक-अष्टमी <i>f.</i> the eighth day in the first half of Chaitra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकतरु|अशोकतरुः
अशोक-तरु, -नग, -पादप, -वृक्ष <i>m.</i> the Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकनग|अशोकनगः
अशोक-तरु, -नग, -पादप, -वृक्ष <i>m.</i> the Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकपादप
अशोक-तरु, -नग, -पादप, -वृक्ष <i>m.</i> the Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकवृक्ष|अशोकवृक्षः
अशोक-तरु, -नग, -पादप, -वृक्ष <i>m.</i> the Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकत्रिरात्र|अशोकत्रिरात्रं|अशोकत्रिरात्रः
अशोक-त्रिरात्र <i>n.</i> name of a feast which lasts during three nights.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकवनिकान्याय
अशोक-वनिकान्याय <i>m.</i> the maxim of the grove of aśoka trees. The maxim takes its origin from Rāvaṇa’s keeping Sītā in an aśoka grove and denotes that, where there are several connections possible, anyone of them is as good as another and the preference of one of them cannot be accounted for, as Rāvaṇa’s preference of an अशोकवनिका as a resort for Sītā could not be accounted for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोच्य|अशोच्यं
अशोच्य <i>a. (f. च्या)</i> Not to be lamented, अशोच्यानन्वशोचस्वम् Bg.ii.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोच्या
अशोच्य <i>a. (f. च्या)</i> Not to be lamented, अशोच्यानन्वशोचस्वम् Bg.ii.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौच|अशौचं
अशौच <i>n.</i> 1. Impurity, foulness; 2. defilement contracted by the death of a relation (called मृताशौच) or by a new birth in the family (called सूतिकाशौच), अहोरात्रमुपासीरन्नशौच M.xi.183.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्नीतपिबता
अश्नीतपिबता <i>f.</i> A feast at which people are invited to eat and drink, an invitation to eat and drink, Bt.v.92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मक|अश्मकः
