अश्रान्त <i>a. (f. न्ता)</i> 1. Unwearied; 2. incessant, continual.(अश्रान्तम् is used adverbially also in the sense of ‘continually.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=081-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

