अश्व-साद, -सादिन् <i>m.</i> a horse man, a horse-soldier, प्रतिप्रहाराक्षममश्वसादी R.vii.47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वसारथ्य
अश्व-सारथ्य <i>n.</i> management of horses and cars, charioteership, सूतानामश्वसारथ्यम् M.x.47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वस्थान
अश्व-स्थान <i>n.</i> a stable for horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वहृदय
