अश्वक|अश्वकः
अश्वक <i>m.</i> 1. A small horse; 2. a bad horse, a hack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वकिनी
अश्वकिनी <i>f.</i> The first lunar mansion (also अश्विनी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वत्थ|अश्वत्थः
अश्वत्थ <i>m.</i> The holy fig tree, सीमावृक्षांश्च कुर्वीतन्यग्रोधाश्चत्थाकिंशुकान् M.viii.246.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वस्तन
अश्वस्तन <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Of today, not of to-morrow; 2. making no provision for to-morrow, M.iv.7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वस्तनी
अश्वस्तन <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Of today, not of to-morrow; 2. making no provision for to-morrow, M.iv.7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वस्तनिक
अश्वस्तनिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> The same as अश्वस्तन q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वस्तनिकी
अश्वस्तनिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> The same as अश्वस्तन q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्विक
अश्विक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Drawn by horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्विकी
अश्विक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Drawn by horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्विन्
अश्विन् <i>(I) m.</i> A cavalier, a horse-tamer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्विन्
अश्विन् <i>(II) m. du.</i> The twin physicians of gods said to be the twin sons of the sun by a nymph in the form of a mare, e.g. किमश्विनौ सोमरसं पिपासू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्विनी
अश्विनी <i>f.</i> 1. A nymph considered as the mother of the Aśvins; 2. the first lunar mansion consisting of three stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्विनीकुमार
अश्विनी-कुमार, -पुत्र, -सुत <i>m.</i> the twin sons of Aśvinī. (See App. II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्विनीपुत्र
अश्विनी-कुमार, -पुत्र, -सुत <i>m.</i> the twin sons of Aśvinī. (See App. II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=082-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्विनीसुत
