अश्वीया
अश्वीय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> Relating to a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=083-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वीय|अश्वीयं|अश्वीयः
