अष्टका
अष्टक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> Eight-fold, consisting of eight parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=083-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टक|अष्टकः
अष्टक <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A whole consisting of eight parts; 2. a chapter of the Ṛgveda; 3. a group of eight, e.g. गंगाष्टकं पठति यः प्रयतः प्रभाते वाल्मीकिना विरचितम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=083-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

