अष्टतय
अष्टतय <i>n.</i> An aggregate of eight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=083-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टन्
अष्टन् <i>num. (always pl. nom. अष्ट or अष्टौ.)</i> Eight. (In composition with other numerals it often assumes the form अष्टा, e.g. अष्टाविंश).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=083-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टास्र|अष्टास्रः
