असत्|असन्त्
असत् <i>(I) a. (f. ती^1)</i> 1. Not really existing, unreal, आत्मनो ब्रह्मणा भेदमसंतं कः करिष्यति S.Sh.; 2. not being, असति त्वयि वारुणीमदः K.S.iv.12; 3. untrue, false, wrong, e.g. इति यत्केनचिदुक्तं तदसत्; 4. wicked, vile; 5. bad, R.i.10.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251217. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=085-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असती
असत् <i>(I) a. (f. ती^1)</i> 1. Not really existing, unreal, आत्मनो ब्रह्मणा भेदमसंतं कः करिष्यति S.Sh.; 2. not being, असति त्वयि वारुणीमदः K.S.iv.12; 3. untrue, false, wrong, e.g. इति यत्केनचिदुक्तं तदसत्; 4. wicked, vile; 5. bad, R.i.10.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251217. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=085-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असत्|असन्त्
