असदध्येतृ
असत्-अध्येतृ <i>m.</i> a student who neglects his own śākha (recension), and studies another. He is also called शाखारण्ड (स्वशाखां यः परित्यज्य अन्यत्र कुरुते श्रमम् । शाखारण्डः स विज्ञेयो वर्जयेत्तं क्रियासु च).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=085-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असदागम|असदागमः
असत्-आगम <i>m.</i> 1. a heterodox doctrine; 2. money obtained by foul means; 3. a foul means.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=085-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असदाचार|असदाचारः
