असत्त्व
असत्त्व <i>n.</i> 1. nonexistence; 2. wickedness, badness; 3. untruth, unreality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=085-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

