असुर|असुरः
असुर <i>m.</i> 1. An evil spirit, a demon; (the word is thus derived in the following stanza- सुराप्रतिग्रहाद्देवाः सुरा इत्यभिविश्रुताः । अप्रतिग्रहणात्तस्या दैतेयाश्चासुरास्तथा ॥), R.iii.54; 2. the sun; 3. an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=087-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

