असूय्
असूय् <i>vi. or vt. 1U (pp. असूयित)</i> 1. To detract, to scorn, to envy, (with the dative of the person envied); 2. to be angry with, असूयंति हि राजानो जनाननृतवादिनः Bh. With अभि-, to calumninate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=088-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असूयक|असूयकः
