असौष्ठव <i>(I) a. (f. वा)</i> 1. Void of loveliness, languid, शरीरमसौष्ठवम् M.M.i.; 2. ugly, deformed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=088-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

