अस्त|अस्तं|अस्तः
अस्त <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The western mountain behind which the sun is supposed to set, यात्येकतोऽस्तशिखरं पतिरोषधीनाम् Sak.iv., R.xvi.11; 2. sunset; 3. setting in general.(अस्तम् is used as an indeclinable with गम, इ, or या and means- (1) to set; (2) to disappear; (3) to be removed, विषयिणः कस्यापदोऽस्तंगताः Hit.ii.; (4) to die, अथ चास्तमिता त्वमात्मना R.viii.51.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=088-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

