अस्मद्
अस्मद् <i>pron.</i> It is the base of the first personal pronoun, and the abl. pl. of the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=089-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्मद्विध
