अस्मदीय
अस्मदीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Our, ours, महास्मदीयेरपि योधमुख्ये Bg.xii.26, Megh.ii.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=089-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्मदीया
अस्मदीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Our, ours, महास्मदीयेरपि योधमुख्ये Bg.xii.26, Megh.ii.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=089-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्मादृश्
अस्मादृश् <i>a.</i> Like us.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=089-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

