आकाश|आकाशं|आकाशः
आकाश <i>m.n.</i> 1. Light, clearness; 2. vacuity; 3. sky, atmosphere; 4. æther or atmosphere considered as the fifth element (See under अप्); 5. atmosphere considered as one of the nine substances (द्रव्य) by the Vaiśeṣikas. As such, it is the substratum of the quality ‘sound’ (शब्द; hence we have अथात्मनः शब्दगुणं गुणज्ञः पदम् (i.e. आकाशम्) विमानेन विगाहमानः R.xiii.1 and श्रुतिविषय गुणा या स्थिता व्याप्य विश्वम् Sak.i.; 6. Brahman (n.) as identical with æther, एतस्मिन्नु खल्वक्षरे हार्ग्याकाश ओतश्च प्रोतश्च Br.A.; 7. place, भवनाकाशमजायताम्बुराशिः Bh.V.i.165.(आकाशे (loc. sing.) ‘in the air,’ often occurs as a stage-direction in plays when a character on the stage asks some question to a character not on the stage and listens to a supposed speech in answer to it. The term is thus explained by Bharata- दूरस्थाभाषणं यत्स्यादशरीरनिवेदनम् । परोक्षान्तरितं वाक्यं तदाकाशे निगद्यते ॥ e.g. (परिक्रम्यावलोक्य च) (आकाशे) प्रियंवदं कस्येदमुशीरानुलेपनं मृणालवन्ति च नलिनीपत्राणि नीयन्ते (श्रुतिमभिनीय) किं ब्रवीषि &c. Sak.iii. or (आकाशे) युधिष्ठिर युधिष्ठिर … … सर्वं तदेकपद एव कथं निरस्तम् Ve.iii. or (दृष्ट्वा आकाशे) विहंगिके अपि श्वश्रूजनपादवन्दनं कृत्वा प्रतिनिवृत्ता भानुमती (कर्णं दत्वा) किं कथयसि &c. Ve.ii.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशेश|आकाशेशः
आकाश-ईश <i>m.</i> 1. any helpless person who has no other possession than the air; 2. Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशकक्षा
आकाश-कक्षा <i>f.</i> the horizon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशकल्प|आकाशकल्पः
आकाश-कल्प <i>m.</i> Brahman (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशग|आकाशगः
आकाश-ग <i>m.</i> a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशगंगा|आकाशगङ्गा
आकाश-गंगा <i>f.</i> the celestial Ganges, नदत्याकाशगंगायाः स्रोतस्युद्दामदिग्गजे R.i.73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशगा
आकाश-गा <i>f.</i> the celestial Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशचमस|आकाशचमसः
आकाश-चमस <i>m.</i> the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशजननी
आकाश-जननी <i>f.</i> a skylight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशदीप|आकाशदीपः
आकाश-दीप <i>m.</i> 1. a lamp lighted in honour of Lakṣmī, or Viṣṇu and elevated on a pole in the air at the Dīpālī festival; 2. a beacon, a lantern on a pole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशभाषित
आकाश-भाषित <i>n.</i> 1. speaking off the stage; (it is a supposed speech which is replied to as if it had been spoken, किं ब्रवीषीति यन्नाट्ये विना पात्रं प्रयुज्यते । श्रुत्येवानुक्तमप्यर्थं तत्स्यादाकाशभाषितम् S.D.vi.) (in dramaturgy); 2. a voice or sound in the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशमण्डल
आकाश-मण्डल <i>n.</i> the celestial sphere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशयान
आकाश-यान <i>n.</i> 1. a heavenly car; 2. one moving through the air; 3. moving or travelling through the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशरक्षिन्
आकाश-रक्षिन् <i>m.</i> a watchman on the outer battlements.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशवचन
आकाश-वचन <i>n.</i> 1. the same as आकाशभाषित q.v.; 2. a superhuman voice from heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशवर्त्मन्
आकाश-वर्त्मन् <i>n.</i> 1. the firmament; 2. the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशवाणी
आकाश-वाणी <i>f.</i> voice from heaven; it is also called अशरीरिणी वाणी ‘incorporeal speech,’ e.g. अशरीरिणी वाणी भवन्तमनृतादभिरक्षति Ve.iii., शरीरं विना छन्दोमय्या वाचया Sak.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशसलिल|आकाशसलिलं
आकाश-सलिल <i>n.</i> rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकाशस्फटिक|आकाशस्फटिकः
आकाश-स्फटिक <i>m.</i> hail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकिंचन|आकिञ्चन|आकिंचनं|आकिञ्चनं
आकिंचन(न्य) <i>n.</i> Want of any possession, poverty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकिंचन्य
आकिंचन(न्य) <i>n.</i> Want of any possession, poverty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकीर्ण|आकीर्णं|आकीर्ण्ण
आकीर्ण <i>a. (f. र्णा)</i> 1. Crowded, overspread, full of, आकीर्णमृषिपत्नीनामुटजद्वाररोधिभिःR.i.50, जनाकीर्णं मन्ये हुतवहपरीतं गृहमिव Sak.v.; 2. scattered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकीर्णा
आकीर्ण <i>a. (f. र्णा)</i> 1. Crowded, overspread, full of, आकीर्णमृषिपत्नीनामुटजद्वाररोधिभिःR.i.50, जनाकीर्णं मन्ये हुतवहपरीतं गृहमिव Sak.v.; 2. scattered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुञ्चन|आकुंचनं|आकुञ्चनं
आकुञ्चन <i>n.</i> 1. Compression, contraction; 2. contraction considered as one of the five karmans by the Vaiśeṣikas, उत्क्षेपणमवक्षेपणमाकुंचनं प्रसारणं गमनमिति कर्माणि Kaṇāda.); 3. collecting; 4. curving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुञ्चित
आकुञ्चित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Contracted, compressed, e.g. न तांसमाकुञ्चितसव्यपादम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुञ्चिता
आकुञ्चित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Contracted, compressed, e.g. न तांसमाकुञ्चितसव्यपादम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुण्ठित
आकुण्ठित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Confounded, rash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुण्ठिता
आकुण्ठित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Confounded, rash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुल|आकुलं
आकुल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Filled, full of, तस्यालापकुतूहलाकुलतरे श्रोत्रे Am.S.81; 2. confounded, agitated, disordered, e.g. द्रविणं परिमितमधिकव्ययिनं जनमाकुलीकुरुते; 3. irresolute, undetermined, अभिचैद्यं प्रतिष्ठासुरासीत् कार्य द्वयाकुलः Sis.ii.1; 4. overcome with, affected; 5. incoherent, contradictory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुला
आकुल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Filled, full of, तस्यालापकुतूहलाकुलतरे श्रोत्रे Am.S.81; 2. confounded, agitated, disordered, e.g. द्रविणं परिमितमधिकव्ययिनं जनमाकुलीकुरुते; 3. irresolute, undetermined, अभिचैद्यं प्रतिष्ठासुरासीत् कार्य द्वयाकुलः Sis.ii.1; 4. overcome with, affected; 5. incoherent, contradictory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुल|आकुलं
आकुल <i>(II) n.</i> An inhabited place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुलित
आकुलित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Distressed, confounded, agitated, मार्गाचलव्यतिकराकुलितेव सिन्धुः K.S.v.85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुलिता
आकुलित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Distressed, confounded, agitated, मार्गाचलव्यतिकराकुलितेव सिन्धुः K.S.v.85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकूणित
आकूणित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> little contracted, मदनशरशल्येवदनाकूणिताविभागेन Kad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकूणिता
आकूणित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> little contracted, मदनशरशल्येवदनाकूणिताविभागेन Kad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकूत|आकूतं
आकूत <i>n.</i> 1. Intention, purpose, e.g. तत्रान्यतरस्याकूतमवगम्यान्यतरः प्रवर्तते; 2. wish, desire; 3. feeling, state of the heart, चूडामण्डलबन्धनं तरलयत्याकूतजो वेपथुः Ut.vi., हृदयनिहितं भावाकूतं वमद्भिरिवेक्षणैः Am.S.4. (साकूतम् ‘feelingly’ often occurs as stage-direction in plays.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकृति|आकृतिः
आकृति <i>f.</i> 1. Form, figure, गोवर्धनस्याकृतिरन्वकारि Sis.iii.4; 2. the body, किमिव हि मधुराणां मण्डनं नाकृतीनाम् Sak.i.; 3. appearance (बहिराकार आकृति), often noble appearance, e.g. यत्राकृतिस्तत्र गुणा वसन्ति; 4. tribe, species.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकृतिगण|आकृतिगणः
आकृति-गण <i>m.</i> a list of words belonging to a certain grammatical rule which does not exhibit every word belonging to that rule but only specimens, e.g. स्वरादिगणः, चादिगणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=092-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकृष्टि|आकृष्टिः
आकृष्टि <i>f.</i> 1. Attraction, gravitation, आकृष्टिशक्तिश्च मही तया यत् खस्थं गुरु स्वाभिमिखं स्वशक्त्या । आकृष्यते तत्पतीव भाति समे समंतात् क्व पतत्वियं खे Bhāskara.; 2. bending of a bow, Am.S.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकेकर
आकेकर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> Half-shut (applied to eyes); (it is thus defined- दृष्टिराकेकरा किंचित्; स्फुटापांगे प्रसारिता मीलितार्धपुटालोके तारा व्यावर्तनोत्तरा Kir.viii.53, M.M.v., Mud.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकेकरा
आकेकर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> Half-shut (applied to eyes); (it is thus defined- दृष्टिराकेकरा किंचित्; स्फुटापांगे प्रसारिता मीलितार्धपुटालोके तारा व्यावर्तनोत्तरा Kir.viii.53, M.M.v., Mud.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकोकेर|आकोकेरः
आकोकेर <i>m.</i> The constellation Capricornus. (This is a word of Greek origin.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रन्द|आक्रंदः|आक्रन्दः
आक्रन्द <i>m.</i> 1. Calling, calling out; 2. a cry of lamentation; 3. sound; 4. war, fierce battle; 5. a friend, a defender; 6. a brother; 7. a king whose kingdom lies next but one, पार्ष्णिग्राहं च संप्रेक्ष्य तथाक्रन्दं च मण्डले M.vii.207.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रन्दन|आक्रंदनं
आक्रन्दन <i>n.</i> 1. A cry of lamentation; 2. calling out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रन्दिक|आक्रंदिक
आक्रन्दिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> One who goes to a place where sounds are heard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रन्दिकी
आक्रन्दिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> One who goes to a place where sounds are heard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रम|आक्रमः
आक्रम <i>m.</i> 1. Arriving, approaching; 2. overcoming, obtaining; 3. surpassing; 4. attacking; 5. overloading.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रमण|आक्रमणं
आक्रमण <i>n.</i> The same as आक्रम q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रान्ति|आक्रांतिः|आक्रान्तिः
आक्रान्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Stepping upon, आक्रान्तिसंमानितपादपीठम् K.S.iii.11; 2. going over or beyond, surpassing; 3. might, valour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रीड|आक्रीडः
आक्रीड <i>m.n.</i> 1. Sport, pleasure; 2. a pleasure-grove, a pleasure garden, कमप्याक्रीढमासाद्य तत्र विशिश्रमिषु D.K., आक्रीडपर्वतास्तेन कल्पिताः स्वेषु वेश्मसु K.S.ii.43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रुष्ट
आक्रुष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Cursed; 2. sounded, e.g. भेरीभिराक्रुष्टमहागुहामुखम्; 3. abused, censured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रुष्टा
आक्रुष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Cursed; 2. sounded, e.g. भेरीभिराक्रुष्टमहागुहामुखम्; 3. abused, censured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रुष्ट
आक्रुष्ट <i>(II) n.</i> A harsh cry, मार्जारमूषिकास्पर्शे आक्रुष्टे क्रोधसभवे Kat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रोश|आक्रोशः
