आखनिक|आखनिकः
आखनिक <i>m.</i> 1. A thief; 2. a hog; 3. a rat; 4. a spade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखर|आखरः
आखर <i>m.</i> 1. A spade; 2. a digger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

