आखूत्थ|आखूत्थः
आखु-उत्थ <i>n.</i> a swarm of rats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखुग|आखुगः
