आखुभुज्
आखु-भुज् <i>m.</i> a cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=093-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

