आखेट|आखेटः
आखेट <i>m.</i> Chase, hunting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखेटशीर्षक|आखेटशीर्षकं
आखेट-शीर्षक <i>n.</i> a cavern, a mine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखेटक|आखेटकः
आखेटक <i>m.</i> The same as आखेट q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखेटिक|आखेटिकः
आखेटिक <i>m.</i> 1. A hunter; 2. a hound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखोट|आखोटः
आखोट <i>m.</i> The walnut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्या
आख्या <i>f.</i> 1. Name, appellation, किं वा शकुन्ततेत्यस्य मातुराख्या Sak.vii., or पश्चादुमाख्यां सुमुखी जगाम K.S.i.26; 2. the title of a work, e.g. मेघदूताख्यं खण्डकाव्यम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्यात|आख्यातं
आख्यात <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Counted; 2. spoken, told; 3. made known; 4. conjugated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्याता
आख्यात <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Counted; 2. spoken, told; 3. made known; 4. conjugated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्यात|आख्यातं
आख्यात <i>(II) n.</i> A verb, भावप्रधानमाख्यातम् Yāska. (An आख्यात is thus defined- धात्वर्थेन विशिष्टस्य विधेयत्वेन बोधने । समर्थः स्वार्थयत्नस्य शब्दो वाऽऽख्यातमुच्यते.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्याति|आख्यातिः
आख्याति <i>f.</i> 1. Publication; 2. fame; 3. name, appellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्यान|आख्यानं
आख्यान <i>n.</i> 1. Speaking, declaring, making known; 2. allusion to some old legend; आख्यानं पूर्ववृत्तोक्तिः says the S.D. and gives the following illustration- देशः सोऽयमरातिशोणितजलैर्यास्मिन् ह्रदाः पूरिताः Ve.iii.); 3. a reply (as in प्रश्नाख्यानयोः of Pāṇini); 4. a differentiating property; 5. a story, a legend, अप्सराः पूरूरवसं चकम इत्याख्यानविद आचक्षते M.M.ii. or (श्रावयेत्) आख्यानानीतिहासांश्च पुराणानि खिलानि M.iii.232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्यानक|आख्यानकं
आख्यानक <i>n.</i> A tale, a short legendary narrative, काव्यनाटकाख्यायिकाख्यानकप्रभृतीनामपरिमितानां सुभाषितानामध्येता Kad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्यायक|आख्यायकः
आख्यायक <i>m.</i> A messenger, आख्यायकेभ्यः श्रुतसूनुवृत्तिः Bt.ii.44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्यायिका
आख्यायिका <i>f.</i> A species of prose composition. (Several writers on rhetoric divide prose composition Into कथा and आख्यायिका and try to distingaish them from each other; the हर्षचरित of Bāṇa is instanced as an आख्यायिका and the Kādambarī of the same author as a sample of कथा. The S.D. thus defines आख्यायिका- कवेर्वंशादिकीर्तनम् । अस्यामन्यकवीनां च वृत्तं गद्यं क्वचित् क्वचित् । कथांशानां व्यवच्छेद आश्वास इति बध्यते । आर्यावक्त्रापवक्त्राणां छंदसा येन केनचित् । अन्यापदेशेनाश्वासमुखे भाव्यर्थसूचनम्. Danḍin says there is no distinction at all between कथा and आख्यायिका. “तत्कथाख्यायिकेत्येका जातिः संज्ञाद्वयांकिता” K.D.i.28.) See the quotation under आख्यानक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्यायिन्
आख्यायिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> One who tells, informs or communicates, रहस्याख्यायीव स्वनसि मृदु कर्णान्तिकचरः Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्यायिनी
आख्यायिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> One who tells, informs or communicates, रहस्याख्यायीव स्वनसि मृदु कर्णान्तिकचरः Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्येय
आख्येय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Fit to be communicated, proper to be told. (शब्दाख्येय ‘fit to be communicated in words.’ Megh.ii.40.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आख्येया
आख्येय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Fit to be communicated, proper to be told. (शब्दाख्येय ‘fit to be communicated in words.’ Megh.ii.40.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगति|आगतिः
आगति <i>f.</i> 1. Arrival, e.g. इति निश्चिताप्रियतमागतयः (scil. अबलाः) Sis.ix.43; 2. return; 3. origin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगन्तु|आगंतु|आगन्तुः
आगन्तु <i>(I) a.</i> 1. Coming, arriving; 2. stray; 3. external; 4. incidental, adventitious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगन्तु|आगंतु|आगन्तुः
आगन्तु <i>(II) m.</i> A stranger, a guest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगन्तुज
आगन्तु-ज <i>a.</i> local (as a disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगन्तुक|आगंतुक|आगन्तुकं
आगन्तुक <i>(I) a. (f. का or की)</i> 1. Incidental, adventitious, e.g. आगन्तुका विकाराः; 2. coming uninvited, e.g. आगन्तुका वयम्; 3. stray, Yaj.ii.63; 4. spurious (as a reading), अत्र “गन्धर्वद्गन्धमादनामित्यागन्तुकः पाठः” Mall. on K.S.vi.46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगन्तुका
आगन्तुक <i>(I) a. (f. का or की)</i> 1. Incidental, adventitious, e.g. आगन्तुका विकाराः; 2. coming uninvited, e.g. आगन्तुका वयम्; 3. stray, Yaj.ii.63; 4. spurious (as a reading), अत्र “गन्धर्वद्गन्धमादनामित्यागन्तुकः पाठः” Mall. on K.S.vi.46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगन्तुकी
आगन्तुक <i>(I) a. (f. का or की)</i> 1. Incidental, adventitious, e.g. आगन्तुका विकाराः; 2. coming uninvited, e.g. आगन्तुका वयम्; 3. stray, Yaj.ii.63; 4. spurious (as a reading), अत्र “गन्धर्वद्गन्धमादनामित्यागन्तुकः पाठः” Mall. on K.S.vi.46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगन्तुक|आगंतुक|आगन्तुकं
आगन्तुक <i>(II) m.</i> A guest, a stranger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगम|आगमं|आगमः
आगम <i>m.</i> 1. Arrival, appearance, e.g. अव्यक्ताद् व्यक्त्यः सर्वाः प्रभवन्त्यहरागमे रात्र्यागमे प्रलीयन्ते Bg.viii.18, R.xiv.80; 2. addition; 3. birth, origin, आगमापायिनोऽनित्यास्तांस्तितिक्षस्व भारत Bg.ii.14; 4. the study of Śāstras, R.i.15; 5. lawful acquisition of anything, आगमेऽपि फलं नैव भुक्तिः स्तोकाऽपि Yaj.ii.27, also 28; 6. science, a system of philosophy, बहुधाप्यागमैर्भिन्नाः R.x.26; 7. a traditional doctrine or precept, अनुमानेन न चागमः क्षतः Kir.ii.28; 8. the Vedas, न्यायनिर्णीतसारत्वान्निरपेक्षामिवाग मे Kir.ii.39; 9. the last of the four kinds of proof of the Naiyāyikas, otherwise called शब्द (the word of a trustworthy man, the Vedas being considered as such); 10. knowledge; 11. theory, as op. to practice (प्रयोग); 12. affix.; 13. interposition of a letter (in gram.); 14. a grammatical augment; 14. voucher or written testimony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगमनीत
आगम-नीत <i>a.</i> studied, read, examined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगमवृद्ध
आगम-वृद्ध <i>m.</i> a learned man, प्रतीप इत्यागमवृद्धसेवी R.vi.41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगमवेदिन्
आगम-वेदिन् <i>a.</i> 1. knowing the Vedas; 2. learned in the śāstras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगमसापेक्ष
आगम-सापेक्ष <i>a.</i> supported by legal vouchers, आगमसापेक्षो भोगः प्रमाणमित्युक्तम् Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगमन|आगमनं
आगमन <i>n.</i> 1. Approach, arrival, R.xii.24; 2. return; 3. approaching a woman for sexual intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगस्
आगस् <i>n.</i> 1. Sin; 2. offence, fault, सहिष्ये शतमागांसि सूनोस्त इति यत्त्वया Sis.ii.108, सोहं तदागः परिमार्ष्टुकामः Na.iii.52, Am.S.41, 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगस्कृत्
आगस्कृत् <i>a.</i> giving offence, committing a mischief, अभ्यर्णमागस्कृतमस्पृशद्भिः R.ii.32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=094-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगस्ती
आगस्ती <i>f.</i> The South.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगाध|आगाधं
आगाध <i>a. (f. धा)</i> Very deep (lit. and fig.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगाधा
आगाध <i>a. (f. धा)</i> Very deep (lit. and fig.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगामिक
आगामिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Arriving, impending, future.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगामिकी
आगामिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Arriving, impending, future.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगामिन्
आगामिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> See आगामिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगामिनी
आगामिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> See आगामिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगामुक
आगामुक <i>a. (f. का)</i> See आगामिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगामुका
आगामुक <i>a. (f. का)</i> See आगामिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगार|आगारं
आगार <i>n.</i> A dwelling, a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगारदाहिन्
आगार-दाहिन् <i>a.</i> an incendiary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगारधूम
आगार-धूम <i>m.</i> smoke issuing from a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगू
आगू <i>f.</i> An agreement, promise, acceptance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आगूरण|आगूरणं
आगूरण <i>n.</i> A concealed suggestion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्निक
आग्निक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Belonging to fire or to a sacrifice performed with fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्निकी
आग्निक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Belonging to fire or to a sacrifice performed with fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्नीध्र|आग्नीध्रं|आग्नीध्रः
आग्नीध्र <i>(I) m.</i> The priest who kindles fire at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्नीध्र|आग्नीध्रं|आग्नीध्रः
आग्नीध्र <i>(II) n.</i> The place where a sacrificial fire is kindled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्नेय|आग्नेयं|आग्नेयः
आग्नेय <i>(I) a. (f. यी)</i> 1. Fiery; 2. offered or consecrated to fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्नेयी
आग्नेय <i>(I) a. (f. यी)</i> 1. Fiery; 2. offered or consecrated to fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्नेय|आग्नेयं|आग्नेयः
आग्नेय <i>(II) m.</i> An epithet of स्कन्द.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्नेय|आग्नेयं|आग्नेयः
आग्नेय <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Blood; 2. ghee; 3. gold; 4. a missile presided over by fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्नेयी
आग्नेयी <i>f.</i> 1. The wife of Agni; 2. the south-east quarter; (it is presided over by अग्नि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रभोजनिक|आग्रभोजनिकः
आग्रभोजनिक <i>m.</i> A Brāhmaṇa entitled to the foremost seat at a dinner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रयण|आग्रयणं|आग्रयणः
आग्रयण <i>m.</i> The first Soma libation at the अग्निष्टोम sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रह|आग्रहः
आग्रह <i>m.</i> 1. Insisting, e.g. चलेपि काकस्य पदार्पणाग्रहः; 2. attachment, determination, Mall. on K.S.v.7; 3. favour, patronage; 4. taking, seizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रहायण|आग्रहायणः
आग्रहायण <i>m.</i> A name of the month मार्गशीर्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रहायणी
आग्रहायणी <i>f.</i> 1. The full-moon day of मार्गशीर्ष; 2. the name of a constellation otherwise called मृगशिरस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रहायणिक|आग्रहायणिकः
आग्रहायणिक <i>m.</i> The same as आग्रहायण q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रहारिक
आग्रहारिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> One who appropriates to himself an अग्रहार q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आग्रहारिकी
आग्रहारिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> One who appropriates to himself an अग्रहार q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघट्टना
आघट्टना <i>f.</i> 1. Friction, contact; 2. shaking, moving, रणद्भिराघट्टनया नभस्वतः Sis.i.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघर्ष|आघर्षः
आघर्ष <i>m.</i> Rubbing, friction, गण्डस्थलाघर्षगलन्मदोदकद्रवद्रुमस्कन्धनिलायिनोऽलयः Sis.xii.64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघर्षण|आघर्षणं
आघर्षण <i>n.</i> The same as आघर्ष q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघाट|आघाटः
आघाट <i>m.</i> A limit, a boundary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघात|आघातः
आघात <i>m.</i> 1. Striking, a blow, a stroke, a wound, तीव्राघातप्रतिहततरुस्कन्धलग्नैकदन्तः Sak.i., अभ्यस्यन्ति तटाघातम् K.S.ii.50; 2. killing; 3. a misfortune; 4. a slaughter-house, आघातं नीयमानस्य वध्यस्येव Hit.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघातन|आघातनं
आघातन <i>n.</i> 1. Striking, killing; 2. a slaugher-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघार|आघारः
आघार <i>m.</i> 1. Sprinkling clarified butter on the fire at certain sacrifices; 2. clarified butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघूर्णन|आघूर्णनं
आघूर्णन <i>n.</i> 1. Rolling; 2. whirling round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघोष|आघोषः
आघोष <i>m.</i> Invocation, calling out to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघोषण|आघोषणं
आघोषणा <i>f.</i> A proclamation, a public announcement, अभूच्चाघोषणा (v.l. for घोषणा) श्वः कामोत्सव इति D.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आघ्राण|आघ्राणं
आघ्राण <i>n.</i> 1. Smelling; 2. satisfaction, satiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आंगार|आङ्गार|आंगारं|आङ्गारं
आंगार <i>n.</i> A multitude of fire brands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आंगिक|आङ्गिक|आङ्गिकः
आंगिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Bodily, corporeal; 2. expressed by bodily action (as अभिनय which is आंगिकी वाचिकमैव आहार्यः सात्विकस्तथा) (in dramaturgy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आंगिकी
आंगिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Bodily, corporeal; 2. expressed by bodily action (as अभिनय which is आंगिकी वाचिकमैव आहार्यः सात्विकस्तथा) (in dramaturgy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आंगिक|आङ्गिक|आङ्गिकः
आंगिक <i>(II) m.</i> A player on a tabor or drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आंगिरस|आङ्गिरस|आङ्गिरसः
आंगिरस <i>m.</i> A name of Bṛhaspati.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचक्षुस्
आचक्षुस् <i>m.</i> A learned man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचम|आचमः
आचम <i>m.</i> Rinsing the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचमन|आचमनं
आचमन <i>n.</i> Rinsing the mouth, sipping water before religious ceremonies, दद्यादाचमनं ततः Yaj.i.243.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचमनक|आचमनकं|आचमनकः
आचमनक <i>n.</i> A spitting-pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचय|आचयः
आचय <i>m.</i> 1. Collecting, gathering; 2. a collection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचरण|आचरणं
आचरण <i>n.</i> 1. Conduct; 2. usage, practice; 3. practising performing (as in मंगलाचरण); 4. example as op. to precept, Na.i.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचाम|आचामः
आचाम <i>m.</i> 1. The same as आचमन q.v.; 2. kānji.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार|आचारः
आचार <i>m.</i> 1. Any fixed rule of conduct in life, चतुर्णामपि वर्णानामाचारश्चैव शाश्वतः M.i.107; 2. a custom, usage, तस्मिन् देशो य आचारः पारंपर्यक्रमागतः M.ii.18, or आचार इत्यधिकृतेन मया गृहीता Sak.v.; 3. conduct, behaviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारदीप|आचारदीपः
आचार-दीप <i>m.</i> a lamp customarily waved about any person as a mark of auspiciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारधूमग्रहण
आचार-धूमग्रहण <i>n.</i> inhaling smoke as a customary rite, R.vii.27, K.S.vii.82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारभेद|आचारभेदः
आचार-भेद <i>m.</i> difference in customary law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारभ्रष्ट
आचार-भ्रष्ट <i>a.</i> fallen from established rules of conduct in life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारलाज
आचार-लाज <i>m.</i> fried grain thrown customarily on a king or any other important person, R.ii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारवेदी
आचार-वेदी <i>f.</i> Āryāvarta, the holy land.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारिक
आचारिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> conformable to rule or practice, authorized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचारिकी
आचारिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> conformable to rule or practice, authorized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्य|आचार्यः|आचार्य्य|आचार्य्यः
आचार्य <i>m.</i> 1. A preceptor, a teacher; 2. a spiritual preceptor; (he is thus defined- उपनीय तु यः शिष्यः वेदमध्यापयोद्विजः । सकल्पं सरहस्यं च तमाचार्यं प्रचक्षते M.ii.140) See under आध्यापक; 3. one who propounds any religious doctrine, (e.g. Śankara, Mādhava, Rāmānuja.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-43" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्योपासन|आचार्य्योपासन
आचार्य-उपासन <i>n.</i> waiting upon or serving the spiritual preceptor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-43" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्यमिश्र|आचार्य्यमिश्र
आचार्य-मिश्र <i>a.</i> venerable, honourable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=095-43" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्यक|आचार्य्यक
आचार्यक <i>n.</i> 1. The proficiency of a holy teacher; 2. teaching, instruction, आचार्यकं विजयि मान्मथमाविरासीत् M.M.i., लंकास्त्रीणां पुनश्चक्रे विलापाचार्यकं शरैः R.xii.78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्या|आचार्य्या
आचार्या <i>f.</i> A spiritual preceptress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचार्यानी
आचार्यानी <i>f.</i> The wife of a spiritual preceptor, शत्रुमूलमनुत्खातय न पुनर्र्द्रष्टुमुत्सहे । त्र्यंबकं देवमाचार्यमाचार्यानीं च पार्वतीम् Mv.iii. (said by Paraśurāma whose preceptor was Śiva).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचिख्यासा
आचिख्यासा <i>f.</i> Desire of communicating something.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचित|आचितं|आचितः
आचित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Covered, Kir.i.36; 2. heaped, accumulated; 3. strung, अर्धाचिता (रसना) R.vii.10, K.S.ii.61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचिता
आचित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Covered, Kir.i.36; 2. heaped, accumulated; 3. strung, अर्धाचिता (रसना) R.vii.10, K.S.ii.61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचित|आचितं|आचितः
आचित <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A weight equal to 80,000 tolās; 2. a cart-load.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचूषण|आचूषणं
आचूषण <i>n.</i> 1. Suction; 2. application of cupping glasses to the skin (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छाद|आच्छादः|आछाद
आच्छाद <i>m.</i> Cloth, clothes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छादन|आच्छादनं|आछादन
आच्छादन <i>n.</i> 1. Cloth, clothes, न धुभिश्च स्त्रियः पूज्या भूषणाच्छादनाशनैः Yaj.i.82; 2. covering, hiding; 3. a sheath, a covering; 4. wooden frame of a roof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छुक|आच्छुकः
आच्छुक <i>m.</i> A tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छुरित|आच्छुरितं|आछुरित
आच्छुरित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Scratched, irritated; 2. mixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छुरिता
आच्छुरित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Scratched, irritated; 2. mixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छुरित|आच्छुरितं|आछुरित
आच्छुरित <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A horselaugh; 2. making a noise with the finger-nails by rubbing them against one another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छुरितक|आच्छुरितकं|आछुरितक
आच्छुरितक <i>n.</i> 1. A scratch with a finger-nail; 2. a horselaugh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छेद|आच्छेदः
आच्छेद <i>m.</i> Excision, cutting off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छेदन|आच्छेदनं
आच्छेदन <i>n.</i> The same as आच्छेद q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छोटन|आच्छोटनं
आच्छोटन <i>n.</i> Cracking the fingers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छोदन|आच्छोदनं|आछोदन
आच्छोदन <i>n.</i> Hunting, chase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजक|आजकं
आजक <i>n.</i> A flock of goats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजगव|आजगवं
आजगव <i>n.</i> The same as अजगव q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजनन|आजननं
आजनन <i>n.</i> Famous birth, well-known origin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानेय|आजानेयः
आजानेय <i>m.</i> A horse of a good breed. (शक्तिभिर्भिन्नहृदयाः स्खलन्तश्च पदेपदे । आजानन्ति यतः संज्ञामाजानेयास्ततः स्मृताः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजि|आजिः
आजि <i>f.</i> 1. A fighting match^1, war, battle, ते तु यावन्त एवाजौ तावांश्च ददृशे स तैः R.xii.45; 2. battle-field.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251217. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीव|आजीवः
आजीव <i>m.</i> 1. Livelihood, subsistance, i.e. तैराजीवैस्तस्य वृत्तिः प्रदिष्टा (the word occurs in such compounds as स्त्र्याजीव, शस्त्राजीव, रूपाजीव); 2. a Jaina beggar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीवन|आजीवनं
आजीवन <i>n.</i> Livelihood, subsistence, भवत्याजीवनं तस्मात् Panch.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीविका
आजीविका <i>f.</i> The same as आजीव q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजू
आजू <i>f.</i> 1. A servant working without wages; 2. doomed residence in hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आज्ञप्ति|आज्ञप्तिः
आज्ञप्ति <i>f.</i> Order, command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आज्ञा
आज्ञा <i>f.</i> Order, command, अनतिक्रमणीया दिवस्पतेराज्ञा Sak.vi., पश्चाद्वनाय गच्छेति तदाज्ञां मुदितोग्रहीत् R.xii.7, K.S.iii.22, R.xvii.79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=096-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

