आतपोदक
आतप-उदक <i>n.</i> mirage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=097-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आतपत्र|आतपत्रं
