आतिदेशिकी
आतिदेशिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Relating to an अतिदेश q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=097-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

