आत्मयाजिन्
आत्मन्-याजिन् <i>m.</i> a learned man who studies his own nature and that of the soul with a view to attain final beatitude, e.g. सर्वभूतेषु चात्मानं सर्वभूतानि चात्मनि । समं पश्यन्नात्मयाजी स्वराज्यमधिगच्छति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=097-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

