आत्मविद्या
आत्मन्-विद्या <i>f.</i> spiritual knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=097-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

