आत्मन्-हित <i>a.</i> beneficial to one’s self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=097-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्मीय|आत्मीयः
आत्मीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> one’s own, belonging to one’s self, द्युतिमात्मीयां न बिभ्रति यथा पुरा … मुखानि वः K.S.ii.19, R.vii.68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=099-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

