आत्मनीन|आत्मनीनं|आत्मनीनः
आत्मनीन <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Belonging to self, one’s own; 2. beneficial to one’s self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=099-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

