आत्ययिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Pressing, urgent; 2. destructive, unpropitious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=099-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्रेय|आत्रेयः
