आपतिकी
आपतिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Accidental, unforeseen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=102-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आपतिक|आपतिकः
