आपद्धर्म|आपद्धर्मः|आपद्धर्म्म
आपद्-धर्म <i>m.</i> a practice or profession not usually proper to the caste but allowable in time of distress (in religious law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=102-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आपदा
