आपनिक|आपनिकः
आपनिक <i>m.</i> 1. An emerald; 2. a kirāta or barbarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=102-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आपन्न|आपन्नः
आपन्न <i>a. (f. न्ना)</i> 1. Distressed, आपन्नाभयसत्वेषु दीक्षिताः खलु पौरवाः Sak.iii.; 2. reduced to, fallen into (generally with acc.) as in दुःखमापन्नः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=102-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आपन्ना
