आपराह्णिक
आपराह्णिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Occurring in the afternoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=102-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

