आपस्
आपस् <i>n.</i> Water, e.g. आपोभिर्मार्जनं कृत्वा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=102-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आपात|आपातः
आपात <i>m.</i> 1. Rushing upon, descending, falling upon suddenly, तदापातभयात्पथि K.S.ii.45, R.xii.76; 2. the instant, the current month; hence first appearance, आपातरम्या विषयाः पर्यन्तपरितापिनः Kir.xi.2, Bh.V.i.115, Mal.v. (आपाततस् is often used adverbially in the sense of ‘at first sight’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=102-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

