आपृच्छा
आपृच्छा <i>f.</i> 1. Conversation; 2. curiosity; 3. bidding farewell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=103-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आपोशान|आपोशानः
आपोशान <i>(I) m.</i> Name of a kind of prayer repeated before and after eating (the mantra to be repeated before eating is- अमृतोपस्तरणमसि स्वाहा and that to be repeated after eating is- अमृतापिधानमसि स्वाहा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=103-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

