आप्त|आप्तः
आप्त <i>(I) a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Gained, obtained; 2. trusted, confidential; 3. true; 4. reasonable, sensible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=103-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आप्ता
आप्त <i>(I) a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Gained, obtained; 2. trusted, confidential; 3. true; 4. reasonable, sensible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=103-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आप्त|आप्तः
