आप्यान
आप्यान <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Stout, robust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=103-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आप्याना
आप्यान <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Stout, robust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=103-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

