आम्नात
आम्नात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Remembered; 2. learnt by heart; 3. spoken of, said to be, considered, समौ हि शिष्टैराम्नातौ वर्त्स्यन्तावामयः स च Sis.ii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

