आयःशूलिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Active, indefatigable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयःशूलिक|आयःशूलिकः
आयःशूलिक <i>(II) m.</i> A man who in order to obtain an object uses forcible instead of gentle means. (तीक्ष्णोपायेन योऽन्विच्छेत् स आयःशूलिको जनः), अयःशुलेनान्विच्छतीत्यायःशुलिकः K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयत|आयतः
आयत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Diffuse, prolix.; 2. long; 3. large, big; 4. drawn, attracted; 5. curbed, restrained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयता
आयत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Diffuse, prolix.; 2. long; 3. large, big; 4. drawn, attracted; 5. curbed, restrained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयताक्षी
आयत-अक्षी <i>f.</i> a woman with large eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयतापांग|आयतापाङ्ग
आयत-अपांग <i>a.</i> having long-cornered eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयतायति|आयतायतिः
आयत-आयति <i>f.</i> remote futurity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयतच्छदा
आयत-च्छदा <i>f.</i> the plaintain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयतस्तू
आयत-स्तू <i>m.</i> a panegyrist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयतन|आयतनं
आयतन <i>n.</i> 1. A resting place, a house, an abode; 2. the place of the sacred fire; 3. a sanctuary; 4. receptacle, abode, स्नेहस्तदेकायतनं जगाम K.S.vii.5, R.iii.36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयति|आयतिः
आयति <i>f.</i> 1. Length, extension; 2. futurity, भूयसी तव यदायतायतिः Sis.xiv.5, M.iv.70; 3. future consequence, आयतिं सर्वकार्याणां तदात्वं च विचारयेत् M.vii.76; 4. majesty, dignity; 5. accepting, obtaining; 6. work, e.g. मित्रं ध्रुवं लब्ध्वा कृशामप्यायतिक्षमम्; 7. restraint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयत्त|आयत्तः
आयत्त <i>a. (f. त्ता)</i> 1. Dependent, दैवायत्तं कुले जन्म मदधीनं तु पौरुषम् Ve.iii.; 2. docile, tractable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयत्ता
आयत्त <i>a. (f. त्ता)</i> 1. Dependent, दैवायत्तं कुले जन्म मदधीनं तु पौरुषम् Ve.iii.; 2. docile, tractable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयत्ति|आयत्तिः
आयत्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Dependence; 2. affection; 3. strength; 4. boundary; 5. expedient, remedy; 6. steadiness of conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयथातथ्य|आयथातथ्यं
आय(या)थातथ्य <i>n.</i> Unfitness, unsuitableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयाथातथ्य
आय(या)थातथ्य <i>n.</i> Unfitness, unsuitableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयमन|आयमनं
आयमन <i>n.</i> 1. Stretching; 2. length, extension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयल्लक|आयल्लकं|आयल्लकः
आयल्लक <i>n.</i> Impatience, longing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयस|आयसं
आयस <i>(I) a. (f. सी)</i> Made of iron, सखि मा जल्प तवायसी रसज्ञा Bh.V.ii.59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयसी
आयस <i>(I) a. (f. सी)</i> Made of iron, सखि मा जल्प तवायसी रसज्ञा Bh.V.ii.59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयस|आयसं
आयस <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Anything made of iron, अयस्कान्त इवायसम् R.xvii.68, K.S.vi.55; 2. iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयसी
आयसी <i>f.</i> A coat of mail, an armour for the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयान|आयानं
आयान <i>n.</i> 1. Coming, arrival; 2. natural temperament or disposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयाम|आयामः
आयाम <i>m.</i> 1. Stretching, extending; 2. restraint, प्राणायामपरायणाः Bg.iv.29; 3. length, expansion, तिर्यगायामशोभी Megh.i.57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयास|आयासः
आयास <i>m.</i> 1. Effort, exertion, मनस्तु तद्भावदर्शायासि Sak.ii., Bg.xviii.24; 2. weariness, fatigue, शोकहर्षौ तथायासः सर्वं स्नेहात् प्रवर्तते Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुक्त|आयुक्तः
आयुक्त <i>m.</i> A minister, an agent or deputy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुध|आयुधं|आयुधः
आयुध <i>m.n.</i> A weapon; (they are classed under three heads- (1) प्रहरण, e.g. a sword; (2) हस्तमुक्त, e.g. a disc; (3) यन्त्रमुक्त, e.g. an arrow), न मे त्वदन्येन विसोढमायुधम् R.iii.63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुधागार|आयुधागारं
आयुध-अगार <i>n.</i> an armoury, arsenal, अहमप्यायुधागारं प्रविश्यायुधसहायो भवामि Ve.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुधिक|आयुधिकः
आयुधिक <i>m.</i> A soldier, a warrior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुधिन्
आयुधिन् <i>m.</i> A warrior, a soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुधीय|आयुधीयः
आयुधीय <i>m.</i> The same as आयुधिन् q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुस्
आयुस् <i>n.</i> 1. Life, duration of life, चतुर्थमायुषो भागम् M.iv.1, दीर्घमायुः R.ix.62, xii.48; 2. vital power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुष्काम
आयुस्-काम <i>a.</i> wishing for life or health.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुष्टोम|आयुष्टोमः
आयुष्टोम <i>m.</i> a sacrifice to obtain longevity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुर्द्रव्य|आयुर्द्रव्यं
आयुस्-द्रव्य <i>n.</i> a medicament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुष्मत्|आयुष्मन्त्
आयुष्मत् <i>a.</i> 1. alive; 2. long-lived; (the word is often used in plays in addressing a nobly born person. A Brāhmaṇa is also so addressed in saluting. Manu says- आयुष्मान् भव सौम्येति वाच्यो विप्रो‍ऽभिवादने).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुर्वृद्धि|आयुर्वृद्धिः
आयुस्-वृद्धि <i>f.</i> longevity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुर्वेद|आयुर्वेदः|आयुर्व्वेदः
