आयुर्वेदिन्
आयुस्-वेदिक, -वेदिन् <i>m.</i> a physician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुःशेष|आयुःशेषः
आयुस्-शेष <i>m.</i> end of life, decline of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=105-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुष्य|आयुष्यं
आयुष्य <i>a. (f. ष्या)</i> Giving long life, preservative of life, इदं यशस्यमायुष्यमिदं निःश्रेयसं परम् M.i.105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयुष्या
आयुष्य <i>a. (f. ष्या)</i> Giving long life, preservative of life, इदं यशस्यमायुष्यमिदं निःश्रेयसं परम् M.i.105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयोग|आयोगः
आयोग <i>m.</i> 1. Appointment; 2. the performance of an act; 3. offering flowers, perfume &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयोगव|आयोगवः
आयोगव <i>m.</i> The son of a Śūdra by a Vaiśya wife. (His business is carpentry. See M.x.48.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयोजन|आयोजनं
आयोजन <i>n.</i> 1. Effort, exertion; 2. seizing, taking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आयोधन|आयोधनं
