आरकूट|आरकूटः
आर-कूट <i>m.n.</i> brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरक्ष|आरक्षं|आरक्षः
आरक्ष <i>m.</i> 1. Protection, preservation; 2. the junction of the frontal sinuses of an elephant; 3. an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरक्षक|आरक्षकः
