आरण्यी
आरण्य <i>(I) a. (f. ण्यी)</i> Wild, forest-born, (op. to ग्राम्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरण्य|आरण्यः
आरण्य <i>(II) m.n.</i> A forest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरण्यकुक्कुट|आरण्यकुक्कुटः
