आरण्यपशु|आरण्यपशुः
आरण्य-पशु <i>m.</i> a wild beast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

