आरण्यक <i>(II) m.</i> A forester, an inhabitant of the wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरण्यक|आरण्यकः
आरण्यक <i>(III) n.</i> One of a class of religious and philosophical writings which are either composed in forest or must be studied there. (अरण्येध्ययनादेव आरण्यकमुदाहृतम्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरति|आरतिः
आरति <i>f.</i> 1. Cessation; 2. waving lights before an image.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरनाल|आरनालं
आरनाल <i>n.</i> Gruel made from the fermentation of boiled rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरब्धि|आरब्धिः
आरब्धि <i>f.</i> Beginning, commencement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरभट|आरभटः
आरभट <i>m.</i> 1. A courageous man; 2. boldness, confidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरभटी
आरभटी <i>f.</i> 1. A branch of the dramatic art (See S.D.vi.420 ff.); 2. a kind of literary style; 3. a style of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरम्भ|आरंभः|आरम्भः
आरम्भ <i>m.</i> 1. Work, undertaking, आगमैः सदृशारम्भः R.i.15, Bg.xii.16; 2. beginning, commencement, नृत्यारम्भे हरपशुपतेरार्द्रनागाजिनेच्छाम् Megh.ii.36; 3. haste; 4. effort, exertion, Bg.xiv.12; 5. action, posture, चित्रार्पितारम्भ इवावतस्थे R.ii.31; 6. slaughter; 7. introduction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरम्भण|आरंभणं
आरम्भण <i>n.</i> The same as आरम्भ q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरव|आरवः
आर(रा)व <i>m.</i> 1. Sound; 2. howling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आराव|आरावः
आर(रा)व <i>m.</i> 1. Sound; 2. howling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरस्य|आरस्यं
आरस्य <i>n.</i> Insipidity, want of flavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरा
आरा <i>f.</i> 1. A shoe-maker’s awl; 2. a probe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरात्
आरात् <i>ind.</i> 1. From or to a distant place, remote, आरात्तिष्ठत मा मह्यं समीपपमुपसर्पत Bh.; 2. near (आराद्दूरसमीपयोः), R.ii.10. (This word is generally used with abl. in these senses, e.g. आराद्वनात् ‘near the forest or away from it.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आराति|आरातिः
आराति <i>m.</i> An enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरातीय
आरातीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Remote; 2. proximate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरातीया
आरातीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Remote; 2. proximate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरात्रिक|आरात्रिकं
आरात्रिक <i>n.</i> 1. Waving a light or a vessel containing it at night before an idol, e.g. आरात्रिकं भक्तजनस्तु कुर्यात्; 2. a light so waved, पात्रमारात्रिकस्य भ्रमयति मयि Śankara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आराधन|आराधनं
आराधन <i>n.</i> 1. Propitiation (as of a deity), आराधनायास्य सखीसमेतां समादिदेश K.S.i.59; 2. a means of pleasing, सतामाराधनं वपुः K.S.vi.13; 3. pleasing, satisfying, gratifying, जानकीमपि । आराधनाय लोकानां मुञ्चतो नास्ति मे व्यथा Ut.i.; 4. accomplishment; 5. cooking; 6. attainment, acquirement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आराधना
आराधना <i>f.</i> Service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आराधनी
आराधनी <i>f.</i> Worship, adoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आराम|आरामः
आराम <i>m.</i> 1. Delight, pleasure, इन्द्रियारामः Bg.iii.16, आत्मारामाः Ve.i.; 2. a garden, a grove, आरामाधिपतिर्विवेकविकलः Bh.V.i.31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरामिक|आरामिकः
आरामिक <i>m.</i> A gardener.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरालिक|आरालिकः
आरालिक <i>m.</i> A cook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरु|आरुः
आरु <i>m.</i> 1. A hog; 2. a crab.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरूढि|आरूढिः
आरूढि <i>f.</i> Rise, elevation (lit. and fig.), अन्यारूढिर्भवति महतामप्यपभ्रंशनिष्ठा Sak.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरेक|आरेकः
आरेक <i>m.</i> 1. Emptying; 2. contraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोग्य|आरोग्यं
आरोग्य <i>n.</i> Freedom from disease, good health.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोप|आरोपः
आरोप <i>m.</i> 1. Attributing the nature of one thing to another (in Vedānta phil.) वस्तुन्यवस्त्वारोपोऽध्यारोपः /Ved. Sāra./; 2. identification (as in सारोपा लक्षणा^1); 3. superimposition.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251217. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=106-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोपण|आरोपणं
आरोपण <i>n.</i> 1. The act of placing in or on, आर्द्राक्षतारोपणमन्वभूताम् R.vii.28; 2. planting; 3. the stringing of a bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोह|आरोहः
आरोह <i>m.</i> 1. One who mounts, a rider (as in अश्वारोह, गजारोह &c.); 2. ascent; 3. haughtiness, pride; 4. elevation, elevated place; 5. a mountain, a heap; 6. a woman’s waist, the buttocks, सा रमा न वरारोहा Ud.; 7. length; 8. measure; 9. ride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोहण|आरोहणं
आरोहण <i>n.</i> 1. The act of rising, ascending, आरोहणार्थं नवयौवनेन कामस्य सोपानमिव प्रयुक्तम् K.S.i.39; 2. a staircase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्कि|आर्किः
आर्कि <i>m.</i> (a son of Arka) An epithet (1) of the planet Saturn, (2) of Yama, (3) of Karṇa, (4) of Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्क्ष|आर्क्षः
आर्क्ष <i>a. (f. र्क्षी)</i> Stellar, regulated by the stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्क्षी
आर्क्ष <i>a. (f. र्क्षी)</i> Stellar, regulated by the stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्घा
आर्घा <i>f.</i> A sort of yellow bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्घ्य|आर्घ्यं
आर्घ्य <i>n.</i> Wild honey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्चिक|आर्च्चिक
आर्चिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Relating to the Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्चिकी
आर्चिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Relating to the Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्चिक|आर्च्चिक
आर्चिक <i>(II) n.</i> An epithet of Sāmaveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्जव|आर्जवं
आर्जव <i>n.</i> 1. Straightness; 2. rectitude of behaviour, honesty, sincerity, open heartedness, अहिंसा क्षान्तिरार्जवम् Bg.xiii.7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्त|आर्त्त|आर्त्तः
आर्त <i>a. (f. र्ता)</i> 1. Struck by calamity, afflicted, disturbed, R.ii.28, viii.31, xii.10, 32; 2. diseased, sick, आर्तस्य यथौषधम् R.i.28; 3. oppressed, unhappy, आर्तत्राणाय वः शस्त्रम् Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्ता
आर्त <i>a. (f. र्ता)</i> 1. Struck by calamity, afflicted, disturbed, R.ii.28, viii.31, xii.10, 32; 2. diseased, sick, आर्तस्य यथौषधम् R.i.28; 3. oppressed, unhappy, आर्तत्राणाय वः शस्त्रम् Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्तनाद|आर्तनादः|आर्त्तनाद
आर्त-नाद, -स्वर <i>m.</i> a cry of pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्तस्वर|आर्तस्वरः
आर्त-नाद, -स्वर <i>m.</i> a cry of pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्तबन्धु|आर्तबन्धुः|आर्त्तबन्धु
आर्त-बन्धु <i>m.</i> a friend of the distressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्तव|आर्तवः|आर्त्तव|आर्त्तवं|आर्त्तवः
