आर्तवी|आर्त्तवी
आर्तव <i>(I) a. (f. वी)</i> 1. Conforming or relating to the season, अभिभूय विभूतिमार्तवीम् R.viii.36; 2. menstrual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्तव|आर्तवः|आर्त्तव|आर्त्तवं|आर्त्तवः
आर्तव <i>(II) m.</i> A section of the year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्तव|आर्तवः|आर्त्तव|आर्त्तवं|आर्त्तवः
आर्तव <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Menstrual discharge, नोपगच्छेत्प्रमत्तोऽपि स्त्रियमार्तवदर्शने M.iv.41; 2. certain days after menstrual discharge favourable to conception; 3. a flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्तवी|आर्त्तवी
आर्तवी <i>f.</i> A mare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्तवेयी
आर्तवेयी <i>f.</i> A woman during her courses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्ति|आर्तिः|आर्त्ति|आर्त्तिः
