आर्थिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Significant; 2. rich; 3. wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्द्र|आर्द्रं
आर्द्र <i>a. (f. र्द्रा)</i> 1. Wet, moist, तन्त्रीमार्द्रां नयनसलिलैः Megh.ii.23, i.43; 2. fresh, new, e.g. कामीवार्द्रापराधः Am.S.2; 3. soft, tender; 4. loose, flaccid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्द्रा
आर्द्र <i>a. (f. र्द्रा)</i> 1. Wet, moist, तन्त्रीमार्द्रां नयनसलिलैः Megh.ii.23, i.43; 2. fresh, new, e.g. कामीवार्द्रापराधः Am.S.2; 3. soft, tender; 4. loose, flaccid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्द्रशाक|आर्द्रशाकं
आर्द्र-शाक <i>n.</i> fresh ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्द्रक|आर्द्रकं
आर्द्रक <i>n.</i> Ginger in its un-dried state.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्द्रा
आर्द्रा <i>f.</i> A constellation so called, consisting of one star.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्द्रालुब्धक|आर्द्रालुब्धकः
आर्द्रा-लुब्धक <i>m.</i> a name of Ketu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्धधातुक
आर्धधातुक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Applicable to half the root or to the shorter form of the verbal base (in gram.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्धधातुकी
आर्धधातुक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Applicable to half the root or to the shorter form of the verbal base (in gram.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्धधातुक
आर्धधातुक <i>(II) n.</i> The name of those terminations and affixes which belong to the six non-conjugational or general tenses (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्धिक|आर्धिकः
आर्धिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Sharing half, relating to half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्धिकी
आर्धिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Sharing half, relating to half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्धिक|आर्धिकः
आर्धिक <i>(II) m.</i> 1. One who ploughs the ground for half the crop; 2. one born of a Vaiśya woman but brought up by a Brāhmaṇa (वैश्यकन्यासमुत्पन्नो ब्राह्मणेन तु संस्कृतः । आर्धिकस्य तु विज्ञेयो भोज्तो विप्रैर्न संशयः Parāśara).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्य|आर्यः|आर्य्य|आर्य्यः
आर्य <i>(I) a. (f. र्या)</i> Noble, high respectable, स्त्रीणामार्यस्वभावानाम् Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्या|आर्य्या
आर्य <i>(I) a. (f. र्या)</i> Noble, high respectable, स्त्रीणामार्यस्वभावानाम् Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्य|आर्यः|आर्य्य|आर्य्यः
आर्य <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Name of the Hindu and the Iranian people as distinguished from अनार्य, दस्यु, दास (the distinction is very clearly seen in the Vedic literature); 2. name of the first three castes as opposed to Śūdra; 3. a master; 4. a preceptor; 5. a friend; 6. a father-in-law (as in आर्यपुत्र); 7. a man who is faithful to the religion and customary law of his country (कर्तव्यमाचरन् कार्यमकर्तव्यमनाचरन् । तिष्ठति प्रकृताचारे स वा आर्य इति स्मृतः); 8. a man of high birth; 9. a man of noble character; 10. a respectable man; 11. an honorific designation (in theatrical language). The following lines contain rules as to the use of this designation- (1) (वाच्यः) विप्र आर्येति चेतरैः, (2) वाच्यौ नटीसूत्रधारावार्यनाम्ना परस्परम्, (3) वयस्येत्युत्तमैर्वाच्यो मध्यैरार्येति चाग्रजः, (4) वक्तव्योऽमात्य आर्येति चेतरैः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यावर्त|आर्यावर्तः|आर्यावर्त्त|आर्य्यावर्त्त|आर्य्यावर्त्तः
आर्य-आवर्त <i>m.</i> name of the land extending from the eastern to the western sea, and bound on the north and south by the Himālaya and the Vindhya respectively; आसमुद्रात्तु वै पूर्वादासमुद्राच्च पश्चिमात् । तयोरेवान्तरं गिर्योः (i.e. हिमवद्विन्ध्ययोः) आर्यावर्तं विदुर्बुधाः M.ii.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यगृह्य|आर्य्यगृह्य
आर्य-गृह्य <i>a.</i> 1. easily accessible to an honourable man, तमार्यगृह्यं निगृहीतधेनुः R.ii.33; 2. deserving honour, respectable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यदेश|आर्यदेशः|आर्य्यदेश
आर्य-देश <i>m.</i> a region inhabited by Āryas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यपुत्र|आर्यपुत्रः|आर्य्यपुत्त्रः|आर्य्यपुत्र
आर्य-पुत्र <i>m.</i> 1. son of an honourable man; 2. the son of a spiritual preceptor; 3. an honourific designation of the son of an elder brother of a husband by his wife, or of a prince by his general; 4. son of the father-in-law, i.e. husband (in theatrical language). (In this sense, the word occurs in almost every play in speeches assigned to female characters.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यप्राय|आर्य्यप्राय
आर्य-प्राय <i>a.</i> 1. inhabited by the Āryas; 2. abounding with respectable persons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यमार्ग|आर्यमार्गः
आर्य-मार्ग <i>m.</i> the way of the honourable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यमिश्र|आर्यमिश्रः|आर्य्यमिश्र|आर्य्यमिश्रः
आर्य-मिश्र <i>(I) a.</i> distinguished, respectable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यमिश्र|आर्यमिश्रः|आर्य्यमिश्र|आर्य्यमिश्रः
आर्य-मिश्र <i>(II) m.</i> a gentleman, a man of consequence, a respectable man, a man of honour, एवमार्यमिश्रान् प्रणिपत्य विज्ञापयामि Pr.Ch.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यवृत्त|आर्य्यवृत्त
आर्य-वृत्त <i>n.</i> the behaviour of a nobleman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यसत्य
आर्य-सत्य <i>n.</i> a noble or sublime truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यहृद्य|आर्य्यहृद्य
आर्य-हृद्य <i>a.</i> beloved by the noble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=107-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यक|आर्यकः|आर्य्यक|आर्य्यकं|आर्य्यकः
आर्यक <i>m.</i> The same as आर्य q.v. (The feminine form of this word is either आर्यका or आर्यिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्या|आर्य्या
आर्या <i>f.</i> 1. A name of Pārvatī; 2. a mother-in-law; 3. a respectable lady; 4. a kind of metre. (See App. I.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्यागीति|आर्य्यागीति
आर्या-गीति <i>f.</i> See App. I.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्ष|आर्षः
आर्ष <i>(I) a. (f. र्षी)</i> 1. Relating or belonging to a Ṛshi; 2. Vedic, (op. to लौकिक or classical), e.g. आर्षः प्रयोगः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्षी
आर्ष <i>(I) a. (f. र्षी)</i> 1. Relating or belonging to a Ṛshi; 2. Vedic, (op. to लौकिक or classical), e.g. आर्षः प्रयोगः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्ष|आर्षः
आर्ष <i>(II) m.</i> One of the eight forms of marriage; in it the father of the bride receives one pair of kine from the bride-groom (आदायार्षस्तु गोद्वयम् Yaj.i.59); for the names of the eight forms, see आसुर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्ष|आर्षः
आर्ष <i>(III) n.</i> The holy text, i.e. the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्षभ्य|आर्षभ्यः
आर्षभ्य <i>m.</i> A steer fit to be let loose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्षेय
आर्षेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Relating or belonging to a Ṛshi; 2. venerable, respectable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्षेया
आर्षेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Relating or belonging to a Ṛshi; 2. venerable, respectable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्हत|आर्हतः
आर्हत <i>m.</i> A Jaina, a follower of the doctrines of Jina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्हन्ती
आर्हन्ती <i>f.</i> The same as अर्हन्ती q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आल|आलं|आलः
आल <i>n.</i> See अल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलगर्द|आलगर्दः|आलगर्द्द|आलगर्द्दः
आलगर्द <i>m.</i> A water-cobra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलभन|आलभनं
आलभन <i>n.</i> 1. Taking hold of; 2. killing; 3. touching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलम्ब|आलंब|आलम्बः
आलम्ब <i>m.</i> 1. Support, protection, तवालम्बादम्ब स्फुरदलघुगर्वेण सहसा Jag. or आलम्बे जगदालम्बे हेरंबचरणाम्बुजे Mall.; 2. a prop, a stay, इह हि पततां नास्त्यालम्बो न चापि निवर्तनम् Silhaṇa.; 3. receptacle; 4. the depending on or from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलम्बन|आलंबनं|आलम्बनं
आलम्बन <i>n.</i> 1. The depending on or from; 2. supporting; 3. a house; 4. a person or thing with reference to which a sentiment arises; 5. anything on which, as it were, a sentiment hangs (in rhetoric). There are two causes (विभाव) which give rise to a sentiment, viz., आलम्बन and उद्दीपन. In the karuṇa sentiment, for instance, the person dead is the आलम्बन of the sentiment and the attending circumstances which aggravate sorrow are its उद्दीपनानि or feeders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलम्भ|आलंभः|आलम्भः
आलम्भ <i>m.</i> 1. Touching, taking hold of; 2. killing, especially an animal at a sacrifice, as in गवालंभः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलय|आलयं|आलयः
आलय <i>m.n.</i> 1. A house, a dwelling, न हि दुष्टात्मनामार्या निवसन्त्यालये चिरम् Ram.; 2. a receptacle. (आलयं कृ ‘to dwell,’ ‘to live,’ सर्वाञ्जनस्थानकृतालयान् Ram.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलर्क
आलर्क <i>a.</i> Relating to a mad dog, canine, आलर्कं विषमिव सर्वतः प्रसृप्तम् Ut.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलवण्य|आलवण्यं
आलवण्य <i>n.</i> 1. Ugliness; 2. insipidity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलवाल|आलवालं
आलवाल <i>n.</i> A basin for water round the root of a tree, विश्वासाय विहंगानामालवालाम्बुपायिनाम् R.i.51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलस|आलसः
आलस <i>a. (f. सी)</i> The same as अलस q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलसी
आलस <i>a. (f. सी)</i> The same as अलस q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलस्य|आलस्यं|आलस्यः
आलस्य <i>(I) a. (f. स्या)</i> See आलस.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलस्या
आलस्य <i>(I) a. (f. स्या)</i> See आलस.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलस्य|आलस्यं|आलस्यः
आलस्य <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Idleness, want of energy; (Suśruta defines it thus- शक्तस्य चाप्यनुत्साहः कर्मस्वालस्यमुच्यते); 2. want of energy, considered as one of the 33 subordinate feelings (as in the following stanza- न तथा भूषयत्यंगं न तथा भाषते सखीम् । जृम्भते मुहुरासीना बाला गर्भभरालसा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=108-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

