आवाल <i>n.</i> A basin for water round the root of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवास|आवासः
आवास <i>m.</i> 1. A house; 2. a dwelling place, a place of refuge, आवासवृक्षोन्मुखबर्हिणानि R.ii.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवाहन|आवाहनं
आवाहन <i>n.</i> 1. Sending for, inviting; 2. invoking a deity to be present, (op. to विसर्जन in this sense); 3. offering oblation with fire, Yaj.i.251.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविक|आविकः
आविक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Relating to a sheep, M.ii.41, i.8; 2. woollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविकी
आविक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Relating to a sheep, M.ii.41, i.8; 2. woollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविक|आविकः
आविक <i>(II) n.</i> A woollen cloth, a blanket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविकसौत्रिक
आविक-सौत्रिक <i>a.</i> made of woollen thread, M.ii.44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविद्ध
आविद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. Curved, crooked; 2. thrown, put in motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविद्धा
आविद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. Curved, crooked; 2. thrown, put in motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविध|आविधः
आविध <i>m.</i> An awl, a drill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविर्भाव|आविर्भावः
आविर्भाव <i>m.</i> 1. Manifestation, presence, appearance; 2. an incarnation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविल
आविल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Turbid, foul, तस्याविलम्भः परिशुद्धिहेतोः R.xii.86; 2. impure, यथा त्वदीयैश्चरितैरनाविलैः K.S.v.37; 3. dim, obscure, विभ्रदाविलां मृगलेखामुषसीव चन्द्रमाः R.viii.42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविला
आविल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Turbid, foul, तस्याविलम्भः परिशुद्धिहेतोः R.xii.86; 2. impure, यथा त्वदीयैश्चरितैरनाविलैः K.S.v.37; 3. dim, obscure, विभ्रदाविलां मृगलेखामुषसीव चन्द्रमाः R.viii.42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविष्करण|आविष्करणं
आविष्करण <i>n.</i> Manifestation, making visible, असूया गुणेषु दोषाविष्करणम् S.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविष्कार|आविष्कारः
आविष्कार <i>m.</i> The same as आविष्करण q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविष्ट|आविष्टः
आविष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Entered; 2. occupied, engrossed; 3. possessed (by an evil spirit)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-43" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविष्टा
आविष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Entered; 2. occupied, engrossed; 3. possessed (by an evil spirit)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=109-43" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविस्
आविस् <i>ind.</i> A particle implying ‘before the eyes,’ ‘openly,’ ‘evidently.’ (usually prefixed to the roots कृ, भू and अस् e.g. आविष्कृतारुणपुरस्सर एकतोऽर्कः Sak.iv., आविर्बूभव कुशगर्भमुखं मृगाणां यूथम् R.ix.55, आचार्यकं विजयिमान्मथमाविरासीत् M.M.i.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवीत
आवीत <i>m.</i> The sacrificial cord worn in any particular manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवुक|आवुकः
आवुक <i>m.</i> A father (in theatrical language).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवुत्त|आवुत्तः
आवुत्त <i>m.</i> the same as आबुत्त q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्
आवृत् <i>f.</i> 1. Order; 2. method, mode, अनयैवावृता कार्यं पिण्डनिर्वपणं सुतैः M.iii.248; 3. a purificatory rite, M.ii.66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृति|आवृतिः
आवृति <i>f.</i> The same as आवरण q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्ति|आवृत्तिः
आवृत्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Return, reversion, तपोवनावृत्तिपथम् R.ii.18; 2. recurrence to the same point, उदयावृतिपथेन नारदः R.viii.33; 3. repetition; 4. repeated reading, study, आवृत्तिः सर्वशास्त्राणां बोधादपि गरीयसी Ud.; 5. repetition of birth and death, K.S.vii.77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृष्टि|आवृष्टिः
आवृष्टि <i>f.</i> Raining, a shower of rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेग|आवेगः
आवेग <i>m.</i> 1. Hurry; 2. flurry, agitation, Am.S.83; 3. agitation considered as one of the 33 subordinate feelings (in rhetoric).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेदन|आवेदनं
आवेदन <i>n.</i> 1. Representation; 2. stating a complaint (in law); 3. a plaint (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेश|आवेशः
आवेश <i>m.</i> 1. Entering, entrance; 2. entertaining, giving place to, तस्मै स्मयावेशविवर्जिताय R.v.19; 3. intent Bes, devotedness to an object; 4. pride, arrogance; 5. flurry, agitation; 6. demoniacal possession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेशन|आवेशनं
आवेशन <i>n.</i> 1. Entrance; 2. demoniacal possession; 3. passion, fury; 4. a work-shop, a manufactory; 5. a house, a dwelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेशिक|आवेशिकः
आवेशिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Own, peculiar; 2. inherent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेशिकी
आवेशिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Own, peculiar; 2. inherent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेशिक|आवेशिकः
आवेशिक <i>(II) m.</i> A guest, a visitor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेष्टक|आवेष्टकः
आवेष्टक <i>m.</i> A wall, a fence, an enclosure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेष्टन|आवेष्टनं
आवेष्टन <i>m.</i> 1. Wrapping round, tying; 2. a wrapper, an envelop; 3. a wall, a fence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश|आशः
आश <i>m.</i> 1. Eating (as in प्रातराश, सायमाश); 2. one who eats (in this sense, it occurs as last member of compounds, e.g. हुताश, आश्रयाश, पलाश).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशंसन|आशंसनं
आशंसन <i>n.</i> 1. Expecting, wishing; 2. declaring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशंसा
आशंसा <i>f.</i> 1. Desire, hope, निदधे विजयाशंसा चापे सीतां च लक्ष्मणे R.xii.44; 2. speech, declaration; 3. imagination, आशंसापरिकल्पितास्वपि भवत्यानन्दसान्द्रो लयः M.M.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशंसु|आशंसुः
आशंसु <i>a.</i> Desirous, hopeful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशंका|आशङ्का
आशंका <i>f.</i> 1. Fear, apprehension, नष्टांशका हरिणशिशवो मन्दमन्दं चरन्ति Sak.i., R.iv.21; 2. uncertainty (Gadādhara often uses the word in this sense); 3. suspicion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशय|आशयः
आशय <i>m.</i> 1. The seat of feelings, i.e. the mind, the heart, अहमात्मा गुडाकेश सर्वभूताशयस्थितः Bg.x.20; 2. meaning, purport, gist, प्रयोगे च पुल्लिंगता दृश्यत इत्याशयेनोक्तम् Mall. on K.S.vi.46; 3. a seat, a chamber, a place of residence, वायुर्गन्धानिवाशयात् Bg.xv.8; 4. a receptacle, a reservoir (as in रक्ताशय, आमाशय, मूत्राशय, जलाशय); 5. prosperity; 6. a barn; 7. will or pleasure; 8. fate, fortune; 9. a pit made for catching animus, आस्ते परमसन्तप्रो नूनं सिंह इवाशये Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशयाश|आशयाशः
आशय-आश <i>m.</i> fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशर|आशरः
आशर <i>m.</i> 1. Fire; 2. a demon, लंकाशरक्षतजपंकावरूषितशरम् Asv.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशव|आशवं
आशव <i>n.</i> 1. Speed, quickness; 2. distilled spirit (in this sense, more usually written आसव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशा
आशा <i>f.</i> 1. Desire, hope, expectation, आशा बलवती राजन् शल्यो जेष्यति पाण्डवान् Ve.v., मनो बभूवेन्दुमतीनिराशम् R.vi.2, आशां च सुरद्विषाम् R.xii.96; 2. a false hope or expectation; 3. a region, a quarter of the compass, अगस्त्यचरितामाशामनाशास्यजयो R.iv.44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशागज|आशागजः
आशा-गज <i>m.</i> an elephant presiding over any quarter. See under अष्टदिग्गज.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशादामन्
आशा-दामन् <i>n.</i> the fetters of hope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशापाल|आशापालः
आशा-पाल <i>m.</i> the regent of a quarter of the compass. (There are eight regents presiding over the eight principal quarters; they are- इन्द्रो वह्निः पितृपतिर्नैरृतो वरुणो मरुत् । कुबेर ईशः पतयः पूर्वादीनां दिशां क्रमात् Am.i.3.2.) See under अष्टदिक्पाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशापिशाचिका
आशा-पिशाचिका <i>f.</i> the demon of hope, i.e. a fallacious hope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशातंतु|आशातन्तु|आशातन्तुः
आशा-तंतु <i>m.</i> a thread of hope, slender hope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशाबन्ध|आशाबन्धः
आशा-बन्ध <i>m.</i> 1. bond of hope, आशाबन्धः कुसुमसदृशं प्रायशो ह्यंगनानाम् Megh.i.10; 2. consolation; 3. a spider’s web.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशाभंग|आशाभङ्ग|आशाभङ्गः
आशा-भंग <i>m.</i> disappointment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशित|आशितं
आशित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Eaten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिता
आशित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Eaten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशितंगवीन|आशितङ्गवीन|आशितङ्गवीनं
आशितंगवीन <i>a.</i> formerly grazed by cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशितंभव|आशितम्भव|आशितम्भवं
आशितंभव <i>n.</i> 1. food; 2. satisfaction, satiety, e.g. फलैर्यष्वाशितंभवम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिर|आशिरः
आशिर <i>m.</i> 1. Fire; 2. the sun; 3. a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिस्
आशिस् <i>f.</i> 1. Prayer, wish; 2. blessing, benediction (it is thus defined- वात्सल्याद्यत्र मान्येन कनिष्ठस्याभिधीयते । इष्टावधारकं वाक्यमाशीः सा परिकीर्तिता ॥ आशिस् differs from वर in as much as it is a mere expression of good wishes which possibly may not come off true, while वर is a boon sure of fulfilment. Thus we have in Sak. वरः खल्वेष नाशीः iv.) अर्घ्यानुपदमाशिषः R.i.44, K.S.v.76; 3. a serpent’s fang.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशीर्वाद|आशीर्वादः|आशीर्व्वादः
आशीर्वाद <i>m.</i> expression of a prayer or wish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशीर्वचन
आशीर्वचन <i>n.</i> a blessing, a benediction, आशीर्वचनसंयुक्तां नित्यं यस्मात् प्रकुर्वते S.D.vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशीर्विष|आशीर्विषः
आशीर्विष <i>m.</i> a snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=110-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशी
आशी <i>f.</i> 1. Wishing or bestowing a blessing; 2. a serpent’s fang, e.g. विषमाशीभिरनारतं वमन्तः; 3. a kind of venom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशीविष|आशीविषः
आशी-विष <i>m.</i> 1. a snake in general, गरुत्मदाशीविषभीमदर्शने R.iii.57; 2. a particular species of snakes, कर्णाशीविषभोगिनि प्रशमिते Ve.vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशु|आशुः
आशु <i>(I) ind.</i> Quickly, immediately, directly, कथमपि भवान् गन्तुमाशु व्य्वस्येत् Megh.i.22, वर्त्म भानोस्त्यजाशु 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशु|आशुः
आशु <i>(II) m.n.</i> Rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुकारिन्
आशु-कारिन् <i>n.</i> smart, active.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुग|आशुगः
आशु-ग <i>(I) a.</i> swift, fleet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुग|आशुगः
