आशुतोष|आशुतोषः
आशु-तोष <i>(I) a.</i> easily appeased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुतोष|आशुतोषः
आशु-तोष <i>(II) m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुव्रीहि|आशुव्रीहिः
आशु-व्रीहि <i>m.</i> rice ripening in the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशुशुक्षणि|आशुशुक्षणिः
