आश्मा
आश्म <i>a. (f. श्मा)</i> Stony, made of stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्मन|आश्मनः
आश्मन <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Stony, made of stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्मनी
