आश्मिकी
आश्मिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Made of stone; 2. carrying stones.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्यान
आश्यान <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Congealed; 2. partially dried, पथश्चाश्यानकर्दमान् R.iv.24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्याना
आश्यान <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Congealed; 2. partially dried, पथश्चाश्यानकर्दमान् R.iv.24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रपण|आश्रपणं
आश्रपण <i>n.</i> The act of cooking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रम|आश्रमं|आश्रमः
आश्रम <i>m.n.</i> 1. A hut, a hermitage, a dwelling of ascetics, रामगिर्याश्रमस्थः Megh.ii.38, i.1, R.i.48, 53, 58; 2. a period in the religious life of a Brāhmaṇa, of which there are four, viz., ब्रह्मचर्य, गार्हस्थ्य, वानप्रस्थ and संन्यास (the first three Āśramas are enjoined to Kṣatriyas and Vaiśyas also; according to some, they can even enter the fourth), स किलाश्रममन्त्यमाश्रितः R.viii.15; 3. a college, a school; 4. a wood or thicket where anchorites practise penance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमगुरु|आश्रमगुरुः
आश्रम-गुरु <i>m.</i> the head of a religious order, a preceptor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमधर्म|आश्रमधर्मः|आश्रमधर्म्म
आश्रम-धर्म <i>m.</i> 1. the special duties of each order or period of life; 2. the duties of one living an anchorite’s life, य इमामाश्रमधर्मे नियुंक्ते Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमपद
आश्रम-पद, -मण्डल, -स्थान <i>n.</i> a hermitage with the surrounding grounds, a penance-grove, शान्तमिदमाश्रमपदं स्फुरति च बाहुः Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

