आश्रमस्थान
आश्रम-पद, -मण्डल, -स्थान <i>n.</i> a hermitage with the surrounding grounds, a penance-grove, शान्तमिदमाश्रमपदं स्फुरति च बाहुः Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमभ्रष्ट
आश्रम-भ्रष्ट <i>a.</i> fallen from any religious order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमिक|आश्रमिकः
आश्रमिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Belonging to any of the four orders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रमिकी
आश्रमिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Belonging to any of the four orders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रय|आश्रयः
आश्रय <i>m.</i> 1. Substratum, receptacle, resting place, i.e. द्रव्याश्रयेष्वपि गुणेषु रराज नीलः or तमाश्रयं दुष्प्रसहस्य तेजसः R.iii.58; 2. an asylum, a place of refuge, तदहमाश्रयोन्मूलनेनैव त्वामकामां करोमि Mud.ii.; 3. prop, support, R.ix.60; 4. a quiver, बाणमाश्रयमुखात् R.xi.26; 5. assistance, help; 6. authority, sanction; 7. dependence; 8. patron, supporter, master, विनाश्रयं न तिष्ठन्ति पण्डिता वनिता लताः Ud.; 9. connection, association; 10. seeking protection (one of the six modes of foreign policy.) See आसन 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयाश|आश्रयाशः
आश्रय-आश, -भुज् <i>m.</i> fire, किं नाम खलसंसर्गः कुरुते नाश्रयाशवत् Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयभुज्
आश्रय-आश, -भुज् <i>m.</i> fire, किं नाम खलसंसर्गः कुरुते नाश्रयाशवत् Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=111-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आश्रयलिंग|आश्रयलिङ्ग
