आस्रप|आस्रपः
आस्र-प <i>m.</i> a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्रव|आस्रवः
आस्रव <i>m.</i> 1. Flowing, running; 2. discharge; 3. pain, affliction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्राव|आस्रावः
आस्राव <i>m.</i> 1. A wound; 2. flow, issue; 3. pain, affliction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्वाद|आस्वादः
आस्वाद <i>m.</i> 1. Flavour, taste, आस्वादवद्भिः कवलैस्तृणानाम् R.ii.5, or ज्ञातास्वादां विदृतजघनां को विहातुं समर्थः Megh.i.41; 2. enjoying, experiencing; 3. eating, tasting, चूतांकुरास्वादकषायकण्ठः K.S.iii.32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आस्वादन|आस्वादनं
आस्वादन <i>n.</i> Tasting, enjoying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह
आह <i>(I) ind.</i> An interjection- (1) of reproof; (2) of severity; (3) of command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह
आह <i>(II) ???.</i> An irregular verbal form of the third person singular present tense of a defective root meaning “to say, to speak,” (traced by native grammarians to ब्रू). There are altogether five forms of the root existing in the language, viz., आत्थ, आहतुः, आह, आहतुः and आहुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहत|आहतं|आहतः
आहत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Beaten, struck (as a drum); 2. struck (generally); 3. trodden, पादाहतं यद् (रजः) उत्थाय मूर्धानमधिरोहति Sis.ii.46; 4. rolled; 5. multiplied (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहता
आहत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Beaten, struck (as a drum); 2. struck (generally); 3. trodden, पादाहतं यद् (रजः) उत्थाय मूर्धानमधिरोहति Sis.ii.46; 4. rolled; 5. multiplied (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहत|आहतं|आहतः
आहत <i>(II) m.</i> A drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहत|आहतं|आहतः
आहत <i>(III) n.</i> 1. A new garment; 2. a nonsensical speech, an assertion of impossibility (for instance, वन्ध्यासुतोऽहम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहतलक्षण|आहतलक्षणः
आहत-लक्षण <i>a.</i> noted for good qualities. Cf. आहितलक्षण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहति|आहतिः
आहति <i>f.</i> 1. A blow, a hit; 2. killing; 3. multiplication (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहनन|आहननं
आहनन <i>n.</i> The same as आहति q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहर|आहरः
आहर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Taking, seizing, R.i.49; 2. accomplishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहरा
आहर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Taking, seizing, R.i.49; 2. accomplishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहरण|आहरणं
आहरण <i>n.</i> 1. Removing from one place to another, bringing, समिदाहरणाय प्रस्थिता वयम् Sak.i.; 2. performing, accomplishing (as a sacrifice); 3. a dowry given to a bride at the time of her marriage, सत्वानुरूपाहरणीकृतश्रीः R.vii.32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहव|आहवः
आहव <i>m.</i> 1. Sacrifice, तत्र नाभवदसौ महाहवे Sis.xiv.44; 2. battle, war, एवं विधेनाहवचेष्टितेन R.vii.67, Bg.i.13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहवकाम्या
आहव-काम्या <i>f.</i> desire of fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहवन|आहवनं
आहवन <i>n.</i> A sacrifice, द्रष्टुमाहवनमग्रजन्मनाम् Sis.xiv.38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहवनीय|आहवनीयः
आहवनीय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> To be offered as an oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहवनीया
आहवनीय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> To be offered as an oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहवनीय|आहवनीयः
आहवनीय <i>(II) m.</i> One of the three sacred fires (taken from the householder’s perpetual fire). See अग्नित्रेता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहार|आहारः
आहार <i>m.</i> 1. Taking, bringing; 2. taking food; 3. food, M.xi.77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहारविरह|आहारविरहः
आहार-विरह <i>m.</i> want of food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहारसम्भव|आहारसंभव|आहारसंभवः|आहारसम्भवः
आहार-सम्भव <i>m.</i> the juice of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहार्य|आहार्यः|आहार्य्य|आहार्य्यं|आहार्य्यः
आहार्य <i>(I) a. (f. र्या)</i> 1. To be taken or seized; 2. artificial, adventitious, e.g. आहार्यशोभारहितैरमायैः (also see Mall. on K.S.vii.21); 3. of which the speaker is aware (as the identification (आरोप) in such figures of speech as रूपक, अतिशयोक्ति &c.; in ससन्देह or भ्रान्तिमान्, on the other hand, the identification is not आहार्य generally); 4. accomplished or effected by decoration or ornamentation. (See under अभिनय.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहार्या
आहार्य <i>(I) a. (f. र्या)</i> 1. To be taken or seized; 2. artificial, adventitious, e.g. आहार्यशोभारहितैरमायैः (also see Mall. on K.S.vii.21); 3. of which the speaker is aware (as the identification (आरोप) in such figures of speech as रूपक, अतिशयोक्ति &c.; in ससन्देह or भ्रान्तिमान्, on the other hand, the identification is not आहार्य generally); 4. accomplished or effected by decoration or ornamentation. (See under अभिनय.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहाव|आहावः
आहाव <i>m.</i> 1. A trough near a well for watering cattle; 2. war, battle; 3. calling, invoking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहिण्डिक|आहिंडिकः|आहिण्डिकः
आहिण्डिक <i>m.</i> The son of a Nishāda father and Vaidehī mother (आहिण्डिको निषादेन वैदेह्यामेव जायते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहित|आहितः
आहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Placed, deposited; 2. made, done; 3. entertained, felt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहिता
आहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Placed, deposited; 2. made, done; 3. entertained, felt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहिताग्नि|आहिताग्निः
आहित-अग्नि <i>m.</i> a Brāhmaṇa who keeps sacred fire. Cf. अग्न्याहित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहितांक|आहिताङ्क
आहित-अंक <i>a.</i> marked, spotted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहितलक्षण|आहितलक्षणः
आहित-लक्षण <i>a.</i> noted for good qualities, ककुत्स्थ इत्याहितलक्षणोऽभूत् R.vi.71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=114-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहितुण्डिक|आहितुंडिकः|आहितुण्डिकः
आहितुण्डिक <i>m.</i> A juggler, a snake-catcher, अहं खल्वाहितुण्डिको जीर्णविषो नाम Mud.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहुति|आहुतिः
आहुति <i>f.</i> 1. Offering an oblation to a deity, होतुराहुतिसाधनम् R.i.82; 2. an oblation so offered, R.i.53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहूति|आहूतिः
आहूति <i>f.</i> Calling, invoking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहेय|आहेयं
आहेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Pertaining to a snake (as poison.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहेया
आहेय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Pertaining to a snake (as poison.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहो
आहो <i>ind.</i> An interjection expressing- (1) doubt, alternative (or), e.g. आहो निवस्यति समं हरिणांगनाभिः Sak.i. or दारत्यागी भवाम्याहो परस्त्रीस्पर्शपांशुलः Sak.v.; (2) interrogation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहोपुरुषिका
आहो-पुरुषिका <i>f.</i> 1. great self-respect (आहोपुरुषिका दर्पाद्या स्यात्सम्भावनात्मनि Am.ii.8.101); 2. military vaunting; 3. vaunting of one’s power, निजभुजबलाहोपुरुषिकाम् Bh.V.i.84, Bt.v.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहोस्वित्
आहो-स्वित् <i>ind.</i> a particle implying doubt, आहोस्वित् प्रसवो ममापचरितैर्विष्टम्भितो वीरुधाम् Sak.v. (Both आहो (1) and आहोस्वित् are usually the correlatives of किम् ‘whether’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्न|आह्नः
आह्न <i>n.</i> A series of days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्निक|आह्निकं
आह्निक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Daily, performed every day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्निकी
आह्निक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Daily, performed every day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्निक|आह्निकं
आह्निक <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A religious ceremony to be performed every day at a fixed hour; 2. daily work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्लाद|आह्लादः
आह्लाद <i>m.</i> Joy, delight, साह्लादं वचनम् Panch.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्लादन
आह्लादन <i>n.</i> Gladdening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्वय|आह्वयः
आह्वय <i>m.</i> 1. A law-suit arising from a dispute about games with animals (Rāghavānanda on M.viii.7 says- आह्वयः पणपूर्वकपक्षिमेषादियोधनम्; 2. appellation, name, काव्यं रामायणाह्वयम् Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्वयन
आह्वयन <i>n.</i> Appellation, name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्वा
आह्वा <i>f.</i> 1. Name, appellation; 2. calling, calling out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्वान|आह्वानं
आह्वान <i>n.</i> 1. A call or summons from government; 2. invocation of a deity; 3. challenge; 4. a call or invitation (in general), सुहृदाह्वानं प्रकुर्वीत Panch.iii.; 5. an appellation, a name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्वाय|आह्वायः
आह्वाय <i>m.</i> 1. A summons; 2. a name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आह्वायक|आह्वायकः
आह्वायक <i>m.</i> A messenger, आहूयकेभ्यः श्रुतसूनुवृत्तिः Bt.ii.44, (where आहूयकेभ्यः occurs as a variant for आख्यायकेभ्यः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इ|इः
इ <i>ind.</i> An interjection- (1) of anger; (2) of calling; (3) of compassion; (4) of reproach; (5) of wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इ|इः
इ <i>(I) vt. 1P (pp. इत)</i> To go, to go to or towards.With उद्-, to rise or ascend, अयमुदयति निद्राभंजनः पद्मिनीनां Ud. With अभ्युत्-, rise in the world, to prosper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इ|इः
इ <i>(II) vt. 2P (pp. इत)</i> To go, to go towards, e.g. ईयुर्भरद्वाजमुनेर्निकेतम्, (सविता) ताम्र एवास्तमेति च.With अति-, 1. to surpass, to excel, अग्निस्त्विषा नान्येति पूषणम् Sis.ii.23; 2. to pass, to spend time, e.g. अतीते चोत्तरायणे; 3. to depart, to go away or beyond, नयनविश्हयं यावदत्येति भानुः Megh.i.85.With अधि-, 1. to remember, to think of (often with the gen.) रामस्य दयमानोऽसावध्येति तव लक्ष्मणः Bt.viii.119, Kir.xi.74 (See (III) below).With अनु-, 1. to follow; 2. to imitate (in going); 3. to succeed.With अन्वा-, to follow, to come after.With अंतर्-, 1. to intervene; 2. to screen; 3. to obstruct. (See अंतरित.)With अप-, 1. to depart, to be deprived of, to be free from, with abl.) अवद्यादपेतः R.vii.70; 2. to perish.With अभि-, 1. to get; 2. to approach; 3. to serve.With अभ्या-, to approach.With अभ्युत्-, to flourish, to prosper.With अभ्युप-, 1. to arrive, व्यतीतकालस्त्वहमभ्युपेतः R.v.14; 2. to accept, अभ्युपेतार्थकृत्याः Megh.i.38; 3. to attain to, to be subject of, सत्यं न तद्यच्छलमभ्युपैति Hit.iv.With अभिप्र- to intend, to mean, कर्मणा यमाभिप्रैति स संप्रदानम् Pan. With अव-, to know, to be aware of, अवैमि ते सारम् K.S.iii.13.With आ-, to come.With उद्-, 1. to rise, to ascend, e.g. उदेति सवित ताम्रः; 2. to flourish.With उप-, 1. to go to, e.g. योगी परं स्थानमुपैति दिव्यम्; 2. to attain, उपैति शस्यं परिणामरम्यताम् Kir.iv.22.With निर्-, to set out, to go out.With परा-, 1. to depart life; 2. to run away, to retreat, e.g. यः परैति स जीवति ‘he who runs away, saves his life.’With परि-, 1. to go round, भक्तिनम्रः परीयाः Megh.i.56; 2. to surround, विषवल्लीभिः परीताभिर्महौषधीः R.xii.61; 3. to transform oneself, to change.With प्र-, to depart life, न प्रेत्यं संज्ञाऽस्ति Katho. With प्रति-, 1. to trust, to confide, सर्वोह्यात्मासिति प्रत्येति S.Bh.; 2. to go back to, प्रतीताय गुरोः सकाशम् R.v.35; 3. to be well-known, सोऽहं वतः श्याम इति प्रतीतः R.xiii.53; 4. to be pleased or satisfied, पतिः प्रतीतः R.iii.12, xvi.21. (The caus. प्रत्यायम् means to inspire confidence,’ ‘to convince,’ ताः स्वचारित्र्यमुद्दिश्य प्रत्याययतु मैथिली R.xv.73, मां प्रत्याययितुं विमूढहृदयं दिष्ट्या कथान्तं गता Ve.ii.).With प्रत्युत्-, to go to receive, सपर्यया प्रत्युदियाय पार्वती (तं) K.S.v.31.With वि-, 1. to expend; 2. to undergo a change, e.g. यत्र व्येति तदव्ययम्; 3. to go away, e.g. वीतशोकभयक्रोधः.With व्यति-, 1. to pass away, व्यतीतकालः R.v.14; 2. To go out, to transgress, रेखामात्रमपि क्षुण्णाद्वर्त्मनः … न व्यतीयुः प्रजास्तस्य R.i.17.With व्यप-, 1. to go away, e.g. व्यपैति ददतः स्वधा; 2. to seperate, to depart, स्मृत्याचारव्यपेतेन मार्गेण Yaj.ii.2.With विपरि-, to change (generally for the contrary or worse).With सम्-, to meet, to come together.With समनु-, to accompany.With समव-, 1. to be connected (in logic) (See समवाय); 2. to assemble, to meet, समवेताः युयुत्सयः Bg.i.1.With समा-, to come together, to unite, e.g. समेत्य च व्यपेयाताम्.With समुत्-, to collect.With समुप-, to obtain.With संप्रति-, to determine, to judge, विकल्पयंतोऽपि न संप्रतीयुः Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इ|इः
इ <i>(III) (with अधि always prefixed) vt. 2Ā (pp. अधीत; caus. अध्यापय्; desid. अधिजिगांस्)</i> To study, to learn, to read through, सोऽध्येष्ट वेदांस्त्रिदशानयष्ट Bt.i.2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=115-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

