इक्ष्वाकु|इक्ष्वाकुः
इक्ष्वाकु <i>m.</i> 1. The first king of the solar dynasty in Ayodhyā; 2. a descendent of इक्ष्वाकु e.g. गलितवयसामिक्ष्वाकूणामिदं हि कुलव्रतम् R.iii.70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इख्
इख् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pp. एखित)</i> To go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इख्
इख् <i>(II) vt. 1P (pp. इंखित)</i> To go, to move.With प्र-, to move to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इग्
इग् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pp. इंगित)</i> 1. To go, to go towards; 2. to move, to agitate, यथा दीपो निवातस्थो नेंगते Bg.vi.19, (used in the Atm. here).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंग|इङ्ग|इङ्गं|इङ्गः
इंग <i>(I) a. (f. गा)</i> 1. Moveable; 2. wonderful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंगा|इङ्गा
इंग <i>(I) a. (f. गा)</i> 1. Moveable; 2. wonderful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंग|इङ्ग|इङ्गं|इङ्गः
इंग <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A hint or sign; 2. an indication of a sentiment by gesture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंगन|इङ्गन|इंगनं
इंगन <i>n.</i> 1. Shaking; 2. an indication of a sentiment by gesture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंगित|इङ्गित|इङ्गितं
इंगित <i>n.</i> 1. Palpitation; 2. intention, purpose (इंगितं हृद्गतो भावः), अगूढसद्भावमितींगितज्ञया K.S.v.62; 3. motion of. the various parts of the body as indicating the intentions, आकारैरिंगितैर्गत्या … लक्ष्यतेऽन्तर्गतं मनः M.viii.26; 4. gestures suited to internal feelings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंगितकोविद|इङ्गितकोविद
इंगित-कोविद, -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> skilled in the interpretation of internal sentiments by external gestures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंगितज्ञ|इङ्गितज्ञ
इंगित-कोविद, -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> skilled in the interpretation of internal sentiments by external gestures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंगुद|इङ्गुद|इंगुदः|इङ्गुदः
इंगुद <i>m.</i> Name of a tree. (Also written इंगुदी, e.g. इंगुदीपादपः सोऽयम् Ut.i.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इच्छा
इच्छा <i>f.</i> 1. Wish, desire; 2. question or problem (in math.); 3. the desiderative form (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इच्छानिवृत्ति|इच्छानिवृत्तिः
