इच्छावसु|इच्छावसुः
इच्छा-वसु <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इच्छासंपद्|इच्छासम्पद्
इच्छा-संपद् <i>f.</i> fulfilment of wishes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इज्य|इज्यः
इज्य <i>m.</i> 1. Teacher; 2. an epithet बृहस्पति, the teacher of gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इज्या
इज्या <i>f.</i> 1. A sacrifice, सोहमिज्याविशुद्धात्मा R.i.68; 2. a gift, a donation; 3. an image; 4. a procuress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इज्याशील|इज्याशीलः
इज्या-शील <i>m.</i> a frequent sacrificer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इट्चर|इट्चरः
इट्चर <i>m.</i> An ox let loose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इडा
इडा(ला) <i>f.</i> 1. The earth; 2. speech; 3. a cow; 4. name of the wife of Budha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इला
इडा(ला) <i>f.</i> 1. The earth; 2. speech; 3. a cow; 4. name of the wife of Budha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

