इडा(ला)-गोल <i>m.</i> the globe, the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इलागोल
इडा(ला)-गोल <i>m.</i> the globe, the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इडिका
इडिका <i>f.</i> The earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतर|इतरः
इतर <i>a. (f. रा, n. रत्)</i> 1. Another; 2. different from, other than, इतरतापशतानि … वितर Ud. (often used with abl. like अन्य q.v.); 3. low, ordinary, इतर इव परिभूय ज्ञानं मन्मथेन जडीकृतः Kad.; 4. the remaining one of the two (in this sense it is often used as the last member of a compound, e.g. दक्षिणेतर) e.g. विजयायेतराय वै. (इतरतः and इतरत्र are used in the same senses as अन्यतः and अन्यत्र qq.vv.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरा
इतर <i>a. (f. रा, n. रत्)</i> 1. Another; 2. different from, other than, इतरतापशतानि … वितर Ud. (often used with abl. like अन्य q.v.); 3. low, ordinary, इतर इव परिभूय ज्ञानं मन्मथेन जडीकृतः Kad.; 4. the remaining one of the two (in this sense it is often used as the last member of a compound, e.g. दक्षिणेतर) e.g. विजयायेतराय वै. (इतरतः and इतरत्र are used in the same senses as अन्यतः and अन्यत्र qq.vv.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरत्
इतर <i>a. (f. रा, n. रत्)</i> 1. Another; 2. different from, other than, इतरतापशतानि … वितर Ud. (often used with abl. like अन्य q.v.); 3. low, ordinary, इतर इव परिभूय ज्ञानं मन्मथेन जडीकृतः Kad.; 4. the remaining one of the two (in this sense it is often used as the last member of a compound, e.g. दक्षिणेतर) e.g. विजयायेतराय वै. (इतरतः and इतरत्र are used in the same senses as अन्यतः and अन्यत्र qq.vv.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेतर|इतरेतरं
इतर-इतर <i>pron.</i> mutual (generally sing.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेतराश्रय
इतर-इतर˚आश्रय <i>m.</i> mutual dependence (in phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेतरयोग|इतरेतरयोगः
इतर-इतर˚योग <i>m.</i> 1. mutual connection; 2. a species of Dvandva compound, (op. to समाहार q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतरेद्युस्
इतरेद्युस् <i>ind.</i> On another day, the other day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=116-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतस्
इतस् <i>ind.</i> 1. From here, hence; 2. from this time; 3. from this world; 4. from this person, इतः स दैत्यः प्राफ्तश्रीर्नेत एवार्हति क्षयम् K.S.ii.55; 5. here, इतो निषीदेति विसृष्टभुमिः K.S.iii.2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इति|इतिः
इति <i>ind.</i> When placed at the end of a word merely to show what the form of that word is, the word is used without any case-ending, e.g. रामेति कूजन्तं मधुरं मधुराक्षरम् or कृष्णेति मंगलं नाम यस्य वाचि प्रवर्तते. When placed at the end of a substantive to indicate its meaning, the substantive is used in the nominative, e.g. क्रमादमुं नारद इत्य बोधि सः Sis.i.8, दशरथ इत्युदाहृतः Bt.i.1. When used to indicate the meaning of a sentence it is merely added on to that sentence, e.g. प्राप्तस्य बाधादित्येवं परिसंख्या त्रोदिषिका /M. Kārikā./ As a particle, it implies- (1) cause or purpose (because, since, that), पुराणमित्येव न साधु सर्वम् Mal.i. (in this sense it is often preceded by किं and then means ‘for what purpose’ and emphasizes the question, किमित्यपास्याभरणानि यौवने धृतं त्वया वार्धकशोभि वल्कलम् K.S.v.44.); (2) manner, method (so, thus), इति मदमदनाभ्यां रागिणः स्पष्टरागाः Sis.x.91; (3) manifestation, e.g. इतिहरि; (4) finis, e.g. इति रघुवंशे दशमः सर्गः; (5) capacity, relation, e.g. पितेति पूज्यः; (6) illustration (generally with आदि), e.g. गौः शुक्लश्चलो डित्थ इत्यादौ K.Pr.ii.; (7) a quotation or opinion, एकोऽपि दोषो गुणसन्निपाते निमज्जतीन्दोरिति यो बभाषे, इति पाणिनिः; (8) reporting (as follow), रामाभिधानो हरिरित्युक्त च R.xiii.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्यर्थ|इत्यर्थः
इति-अर्थ <i>m.</i> substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्यर्थम्
इति-अर्थम् <i>ind.</i> for this purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिकथा
इति-कथा <i>f.</i> a meaningless talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिकर्तव्य|इतिकर्त्तव्य
इति-कर्तव्य <i>n.</i> duty, obligation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिकर्तव्यतामूढ
इति-कर्तव्यतामूढ <i>a.</i> wholly at a loss what to do.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिमात्र
इति-मात्र <i>a.</i> of such extent or quality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिवृत्त
इति-वृत्त <i>n.</i> 1. occurrence, event; 2. a tale, a story.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिह
इतिह <i>ind.</i> Conformably to tradition, e.g. अत्र वटे यक्षस्तिष्टतीतिहोचुर्वृद्धाः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इतिहास|इतिहासः
इतिहास <i>m.</i> 1. History; 2. legend; 3. tradition recognized as a proof by the Paurāṇikas (इतिहास is thus defined- धर्मार्थकाममोक्षाणामुपदेशसमन्वितम् । पूर्ववृत्तं कथायुक्तमितिहासं प्रचक्षते ॥).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्थम्
इत्थम् <i>ind.</i> Thus, in this manner. (Sometimes such forms as इत्थंकारम्, इत्थंभावम् are used in the same sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्थंभूत|इत्थम्भूत
इत्थम्-भूत <i>a.</i> 1. so circumstanced; 2. true, faithful (as an account).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्थंविध
इत्थम्-विध <i>a.</i> 1. of such a kind; 2. endowed with such qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्य|इत्यः
इत्य <i>a. (f. त्या)</i> To be gone towards, e.g. इत्यः शिष्येण गुरुवत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्या
इत्य <i>a. (f. त्या)</i> To be gone towards, e.g. इत्यः शिष्येण गुरुवत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्वर|इत्वरः
इत्वर <i>(I) a. (f. री)</i> 1. Travelling; 2. cruel; 3. low, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्वरी
इत्वर <i>(I) a. (f. री)</i> 1. Travelling; 2. cruel; 3. low, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्वर|इत्वरः
इत्वर <i>(II) m.</i> A eunuch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इत्वरी
इत्वरी <i>f.</i> 1. A disloyal woman; 2. an abhisārikā q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इदम्
इदम् <i>pron. (m. अयम्, f. इयम्, n. इदम्)</i> 1. This, here, referring to something near the speaker (इदमस्तु सन्निकृष्टं रूपम्); 2. present, seen; 3. what the speaker has in mind. It often refers to something immediately following, e.g. इदमनुचितमक्रमश्च पुंसां यत् … जरास्वपि मन्मथा विकाराः K.Pr.vii. It occurs connected with यत्, तत्, एतत्, अदस् or किम् or a personal pronoun partly to point out anything more distinctly or prominently, partly pleonastically, e.g. अयमसौ भगवानुत पाण्डवः, अयमहं भोः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इयम्
इदम् <i>pron. (m. अयम्, f. इयम्, n. इदम्)</i> 1. This, here, referring to something near the speaker (इदमस्तु सन्निकृष्टं रूपम्); 2. present, seen; 3. what the speaker has in mind. It often refers to something immediately following, e.g. इदमनुचितमक्रमश्च पुंसां यत् … जरास्वपि मन्मथा विकाराः K.Pr.vii. It occurs connected with यत्, तत्, एतत्, अदस् or किम् or a personal pronoun partly to point out anything more distinctly or prominently, partly pleonastically, e.g. अयमसौ भगवानुत पाण्डवः, अयमहं भोः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इदानीम्
इदानीम् <i>ind.</i> Now, at this moment, in this case, इदानीमावयोर्मध्ये सरित्सागरभीधराः Ud., इदानीमौदास्यं यदि भजसि Jag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इदानींतन|इदानीन्तन|इदानीन्तनं
इदानीम्-तन <i>a.</i> of the present moment, coeval.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इद्ध|इद्धं|इद्धः
इद्ध <i>n.</i> 1. Sunshine; 2. refulgence; 3. wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इध्म|इध्मं|इध्मः
इध्म <i>n.</i> Fuel, especially that which is used for the sacred fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इध्मप्रव्रश्चन|इध्मप्रव्रश्चनः
इध्म-प्रव्रश्चन <i>m.</i> a hatchet, an axe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इध्या
इध्या <i>f.</i> Kindling, lighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन|इनः
इन <i>m.</i> 1. The sun; 2. a king, न न महीनमहीनपराक्रमम् R.ix.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दिन्दिर|इंदिंदिरः|इन्दिन्दिरः
इन्दिन्दिर <i>m.</i> A large bee, इन्दिन्दिरेषु निपतत्सु Bh.V.ii.183.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दिरा|इंदिरा
इन्दिरा <i>f.</i> An epithet of Lakṣmī, wife of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दिरालय|इन्दिरालयं
इन्दिरा-आलय <i>n.</i> the blue lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दिरामन्दिर|इन्दिरामन्दिरं|इन्दिरामन्दिरः
इन्दिरा-मन्दिर <i>(I) m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दिरामन्दिर|इन्दिरामन्दिरं|इन्दिरामन्दिरः
इन्दिरा-मन्दिर <i>(II) n.</i> a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दिरावर|इन्दिरावरं
इन्दिरा-वर <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंदिवर|इन्दिवर|इंदिवरं|इन्दिवरं
इंदि(दी)वर <i>n.</i> The blue lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंदीवर|इन्दीवर|इंदीवरं|इन्दीवरं
इंदि(दी)वर <i>n.</i> The blue lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इंदीवरिणी|इन्दीवरिणी
इंदीवरिणी <i>f.</i> a group of blue lotuses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दीवार|इन्दीवारं|इंदीवारः|इन्दीवारः
इन्दीवार <i>m.</i> A blue lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दु|इंदुः|इन्दुः
इन्दु <i>m.</i> 1. The moon; 2. the number ‘one’ (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुकमल|इन्दुकमलं
इन्दु-कमल <i>n.</i> the white lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुकला
इन्दु-कला <i>f.</i> a digit (i.e. the sixteenth part) of the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुकलिका
इन्दु-कलिका <i>f.</i> 1. a digit of the moon; 2. the ketakī flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुकान्त|इन्दुकान्तः
इन्दु-कान्त <i>m.</i> the moon-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुज|इन्दुजः
इन्दु-ज <i>m.</i> the planet Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुजा
इन्दु-जा <i>f.</i> name of the river रेवा or नर्मदा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=117-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुजनक|इन्दुजनकः
