इल्वला
इल्वला <i>f.</i> One of the five stars at the head of मृगशिरस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=118-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इव
इव <i>ind.</i> 1. Like, in the same manner as, वागर्थाविव संपृक्तौ R.i.1 (in this sense it indicates an उपमा); 2. as it were, as if, गुणागुणानुबन्धित्वात्तस्य सप्रसवा इव R.i.22 (in this sense it indicates an उत्प्रेक्ष); 3. in some measure, a little, e.g. कडार इवायम्; 4. nearly, almost, e.g. मुहूर्तमिव स्थित्वा.It is used with interrogative pronouns almost without any meaning, but with more elegance and force, किमिव हि मधुराणां मण्डनं नाकृतीनाम् Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=118-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इशीका
इशी(षी)का <i>f.</i> An elephant’s eyeball.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=119-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इषीका
इशी(षी)का <i>f.</i> An elephant’s eyeball.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=119-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्
इष् <i>(I) vt. 1U (pp. एषित)</i> To go.With अनु-, to follow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=119-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्
इष् <i>(II) vt. 4P (pp. इषित)</i> 1. To go; 2. to spread.With अनु-, to search, to go in search of, न रत्नमन्विष्यति मृग्यते हि तत् K.S.v.45.With प्र-, to send, e.g. गत्वा प्रैषीच्च रावणम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=119-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्
इष् <i>(III) vt. 6P (pp. इष्ट) (in conjugational tenses the base is इच्छ्)</i> 1. To wish; 2. to cherish; 3. to choose.With अनु-, to search, to try.With अभि-, to desire.With परि-, to search.With प्रति-, to receive, to accept, ततः प्रतीच्छ प्रहरेति वादिनी Śrīharsha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=119-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

