इष्टा
इष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Sought, wished for; 2. agreeable (as in इष्टगन्ध); 3. respected (as in इष्टदेवता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=119-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्ट|इष्टं|इष्टः
