इष्ट-आपत्ति <i>f.</i> a statement by a debater or controversialist which is favourable to his antagonist also, e.g. ‘इष्टापत्तौ दोषान्तरमाह.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=119-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टगन्ध|इष्टगन्धं|इष्टगन्धः
इष्ट-गन्ध <i>(I) a.</i> fragrant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=119-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इष्टगन्ध|इष्टगन्धं|इष्टगन्धः
