इष्टका-गृह <i>n.</i> a brick-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=119-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

