उत्कलिका-प्राय <i>n.</i> A style of prose-composition, which abounds with compounds and harsh-sounding letters. (भवेदुत्कलिकाप्रायं समासाढ्यं दृढाक्षरम् Ch.M.vi.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=124-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

