उत्तम-पुरुष <i>m.</i> 1. the last person in verbal conjugation corresponding to the first person in English grammar; 2. the supreme spirit; 3. an excellent man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमश्लोक
उत्तम-श्लोक <i>a.</i> of excellent fame, famous, illustrious, glorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमस्त्रीसंग्रह
उत्तम-स्त्रीसंग्रह <i>m.</i> intriguing with another man’s wife, addressing her privately &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमसाहस|उत्तमसाहसः
उत्तम-साहस <i>n.</i> the highest of the three fixed fines (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमा
उत्तमा <i>f.</i> An excellent woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमीय
उत्तमीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Uppermost, highest, best.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमीया
उत्तमीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Uppermost, highest, best.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तंभ|उत्तम्भ|उत्तंभः|उत्तम्भः
उत्तंभ <i>m.</i> 1. Upholding; 2. stopping, arresting; 3. a prop, a stay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तंभन|उत्तम्भन|उत्तंभनं
उत्तंभन <i>n.</i> 1. Upholding; 2. stopping, arresting; 3. a prop, a stay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तर|उत्तरं|उत्तरः
उत्तर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Upper, higher, तं वाहनादवनतोत्तरकायम् R.ix.60; 2. produced in the north, northern, M.v.92; 3. left; 4. later, latter, following, as in उत्तरमेघ or उत्तरमीमांसा M.ii.136; 5. superior, chief, (op. to अधर), धर्मोत्तरं मध्यममाश्रयंते R.xiii.7, xvii.12, K.S.v.61; 6. more, more than (generally as the last member of a compound in this sense), e.g. अष्टोत्तरं शतम्; 7. to be crossed over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरा
उत्तर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Upper, higher, तं वाहनादवनतोत्तरकायम् R.ix.60; 2. produced in the north, northern, M.v.92; 3. left; 4. later, latter, following, as in उत्तरमेघ or उत्तरमीमांसा M.ii.136; 5. superior, chief, (op. to अधर), धर्मोत्तरं मध्यममाश्रयंते R.xiii.7, xvii.12, K.S.v.61; 6. more, more than (generally as the last member of a compound in this sense), e.g. अष्टोत्तरं शतम्; 7. to be crossed over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तर|उत्तरं|उत्तरः
उत्तर <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Future time, futurity; 2. Viṣṇu; 3. Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तर|उत्तरं|उत्तरः
उत्तर <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Upper surface or cover; 2. the last part of a compound; 3. an answer, प्रचक्रमे च प्रतिवक्तुमुत्तरम् R.iii.47; 4. a defend, a rejoinder (in law); 5. the fourth member of an अधिकरण (in Mīmānsā). See under अधिकरण; 6. conclusion; 7. remainder.(The inst. sing. viz., उत्तरेण is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘to the north of,’ ‘on the left side of,’ and then governs the acc. or gen. of the place referred to, e.g. तत्रागारं धनपतिगृहानुत्तरेणास्मदीयम् Megh.ii.12. Cf. दक्षिणेन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तराधर
उत्तर-अधर <i>a.</i> superior and inferior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तराधिकार|उत्तराधिकारः
उत्तर-अधिकार <i>m.</i> heirship, inheritance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तराधिकारिन्
उत्तर-अधिकारिन् <i>m.</i> an heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरायण|उत्तरायणं
उत्तर-अयन <i>(changed into अयण) n.</i> the progress of the sun to the north, Bg.viii.24, Mall. on K.S.iii.25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरार्ध
उत्तर-अर्ध <i>m.</i> 1. the upper part of the body, R.xviii.51; 2. the latter half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तराह|उत्तराहः
उत्तर-अह <i>m.</i> the following day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तराभास|उत्तराभासः
उत्तर-आभास <i>m.</i> A false reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तराशा
उत्तर-आशा <i>f.</i> the northern quarter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तराषाढा
उत्तर-आषाढा <i>f.</i> the 21st lunar mansion consisting of three stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरासंग|उत्तरासङ्ग|उत्तरासङ्गः
उत्तर-आसंग <i>m.</i> an upper garment, K.S.v.16, Sis.ii.19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरेतर
उत्तर-इतर <i>a.</i> other than उत्तर, i.e. southern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरोत्तर
