उत्तरौष्ठ|उत्तरौष्ठः
उत्तर-ओष्ठ (ऋओर्मिन्ग् एइत्हेर् उत्तरोष्ठ ओर् उत्तरौष्ठ) <i>(forming either उत्तरोष्ठ or उत्तरौष्ठ) m.</i> the upper lip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरोष्ठ
उत्तर-ओष्ठ (ऋओर्मिन्ग् एइत्हेर् उत्तरोष्ठ ओर् उत्तरौष्ठ) <i>(forming either उत्तरोष्ठ or उत्तरौष्ठ) m.</i> the upper lip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरकाय|उत्तरकायः
उत्तर-काय <i>m.</i> the upper part of the body, R.ix.60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरकाल|उत्तरकालः
उत्तर-काल <i>m.</i> future time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरकुरु|उत्तरकुरुः
उत्तर-कुरु <i>m. pl.</i> the northern Kurus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरकोसल
उत्तर-कोसल <i>m. pl.</i> the northern Kosalas, पितुरनंतरमुत्तरकोसलात् R.ix.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरक्रिया
उत्तर-क्रिया <i>f.</i> funeral rites, obsequies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरच्छद|उत्तरच्छदः
उत्तर-च्छद <i>m.</i> a bed-covering, a covering, R.v.65, xvii.21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरज
उत्तर-ज <i>a.</i> born subsequently or afterwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरज्योतिष
उत्तर-ज्योतिष <i>m. pl.</i> the northern Jyotishas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरत्र
उत्तर-त्र <i>ind.</i> in what follows, subsequently, later on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरतस्
उत्तर-तस् <i>ind.</i> 1. from or on the north, to the north of (generally with gen.); 2. subsequently, later on. (Also उत्तरात्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

