उत्तरदिगीश
उत्तर-दिश्˚ईश, ˚पाल <i>m.</i> Kubera, the regent of the north.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरदिक्पाल
उत्तर-दिश्˚ईश, ˚पाल <i>m.</i> Kubera, the regent of the north.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरपक्ष|उत्तरपक्षः
उत्तर-पक्ष <i>m.</i> 1. the northern wing; 2. the dark half of a lunar month; 3. the second part of an argument, i.e. a reply, प्रापयन् पवनव्याधेर्गिरमुत्तरपक्षताम् Sis.ii.15; 4. demonstrated truth; 5. the fifth member of an अधिकरण (in Mīmānsā). See under अधिकरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरपट|उत्तरपटः
उत्तर-पट <i>m.</i> 1. an upper garment; 2. a bed-covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरपथ|उत्तरपथः
उत्तर-पथ <i>m.</i> the northern way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरपद
उत्तर-पद <i>n.</i> 1. the last member of a compound (in gram.); 2. a word capable of being compounded with another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरपश्चिमा
उत्तर-पश्चिमा <i>f.</i> the north-west.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरपूर्वा|उत्तरपूर्व्वा
उत्तर-पूर्वा <i>f.</i> the north-east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरप्रच्छद|उत्तरप्रच्छदः
उत्तर-प्रच्छद <i>m.</i> a cover-lid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरप्रत्युत्तर
उत्तर-प्रत्युत्तर <i>n.</i> 1. a dispute, a discussion; 2. the pleadings in a law-suit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरफल्गुनी
उत्तर-फल्गुनी <i>f.</i> the 12th lunar mansion consisting of two stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=125-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

