उत्तरंगा
उत्तरंग <i>a. (f. गा)</i> Inundated, washed over by waves, भागीरथीं शोण इवोत्तरंगः R.vii.36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=126-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरण|उत्तरणं
उत्तरण <i>n.</i> 1. Coming forth or out of; 2. landing, disembarking; 3. crossing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=126-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरम्
