उदन्
उदन् <i>n.</i> Water.(This word has no forms for the first five cases and is rarely used by itself. It is found only at the beginning, (with the final न् dropped), or at the end of compounds. It is not a separate word but only a substitute for उदक according to some authorities.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=129-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

