उपलिप्सा
उपलिप्सा <i>f.</i> Desire of obtaining, Sant.S.i.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=141-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलेप|उपलेपः
उपलेप <i>m.</i> 1. Anointing; 2. cleaning, white-washing; 3. the becoming dull of senses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=141-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलेपन|उपलेपनं
उपलेपन <i>n.</i> 1. Smearing, anointing; 2. an ointment, an unguent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=141-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवन|उपवनं
उपवन <i>n.</i> A grove, a garden, a planted forest, Megh.i.24, R.viii.73, M.ix.265, x.50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=141-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्ण|उपवर्णः
उपवर्ण <i>m.</i> Minute description, detail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्णन|उपवर्णनं
उपवर्णन <i>n.</i> Description, delineation, अतिशयिपवर्णनं व्याख्यानम् Suśruta., Yaj.i.320.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्तन|उपवर्तनं|उपवर्त्तन|उपवर्त्तनं
उपवर्तन <i>n.</i> 1. A place for exercise; 2. a district; 3. a kingdom; 4. a bog, a marshy place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवसथ|उपवसथः
उपवसथ <i>m.</i> A village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवस्त|उपवस्तं
उपवस्त <i>n.</i> A fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवास|उपवासः
उपवास <i>m.</i> 1. A fast, fasting, e.g. उपवासाद्वरं भिक्षा Yaj.i.175, iii.190, M.xi.195; 2. kindling a sacred fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

