उपव्याख्यान|उपव्याख्यानं
उपव्याख्यान <i>n.</i> A supplementary explanation or interpretation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपव्याघ्र|उपव्याघ्रः
