उपश्रुति <i>f.</i> 1. Giving ear to; 2. range of hearing; 3. a supernatural voice heard at night and personified as a nocturnal deity revealing the future (the Hārāvalī says- नक्तं निर्गत्य यत्किंचिच्छुभाशुभकरं वचः । श्रूयते तद्विदुर्धीरा देवप्रश्ननुपश्रुतिम्), परिजनोऽपि चास्याः सततमुपश्रुत्यै निर्जगाम Kad.; 4. promise, assent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्लेष|उपश्लेषः
