उपसंहार|उपसंहारः
उपसंहार <i>m.</i> 1. Drawing in or together; 2. withdrawing; 3. attacking, invading; 4. collection, assemblage; 5. summing up, a résumé; 6. death; 7. conclusion, e.g. उपक्रमोपसंहारौ हेतुस्तात्पर्यनिर्णये; 8. a peroration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंहारिन्
उपसंहारिन् <i>m.</i> A hetu which is not अनुपसंहारिन् q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंक्षेप
उपसंक्षेप <i>m.</i> A summary, an abstract, a résumé.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंख्यान
उपसंख्यान <i>n.</i> 1. Addition; 2. further enumeration (this word is technically applied to the vārtikas written by Kātyāyana to supply the defects of Pāṇini’s sūtras. See Mall. on Sis.ii.112. Cf. इष्टि); 3. a substitute in form or sense (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंग्रह
उपसंग्रह <i>m.</i> 1. Respectful salutation by touching the feet of the person saluted, स्फुरति रमसात्पाणिः पादोपसंग्रहणाय च Mv.ii.; 2. polite address; 3. collecting, joining; 4. taking, accepting (as wife), Yaj.i.56; 5. an appendage, a necessary article of use or decoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंग्रहण
उपसंग्रहण <i>n.</i> 1. Respectful salutation by touching the feet of the person saluted, स्फुरति रमसात्पाणिः पादोपसंग्रहणाय च Mv.ii.; 2. polite address; 3. collecting, joining; 4. taking, accepting (as wife), Yaj.i.56; 5. an appendage, a necessary article of use or decoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=142-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसत्ति|उपसत्तिः
उपसत्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Connection, union; 2. service, worship; 3. gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसद|उपसदः
उपसद <i>m.</i> 1. Approach; 2. gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसदन|उपसदनं
उपसदन <i>n.</i> 1. Becoming a pupil, तत्रोपसदनं चक्रे द्रोणस्येष्वस्त्रकर्मणि Bh.; 2. going near to; 3. neighbourhood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंतान|उपसन्तान|उपसंतानः
उपसंतान <i>m.</i> 1. Immediate connection; 2. a descendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंन्यास
उपसंन्यास <i>m.</i> Laying down, giving up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसमाधान|उपसमाधानं
उपसमाधान <i>n.</i> Gathering together, heaping (उपसमाधानं राशीकरणम् S.K.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंपन्न|उपसम्पन्न|उपसम्पन्नः
