उपसंपन्ना
उपसंपन्न <i>(I) a. (f. न्ना)</i> Killed at a sacrifice (as an animal).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

