उपस्कार|उपस्कारः
उपस्कार <i>m.</i> 1. Beautifying, ornamenting, Mall. on R.xi.48; 2. an ornament; 3. a collection; 4. a supplement, any thing additional; 5. an ellipsis, साकांक्षमनुपस्कारं विष्वग्गति निराकुलम् Kir.xi.38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपस्कृत
