उपस्कृता
उपस्कृत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Adorned; 2. modified; 3. collected, (pp. of कृ with उप q.v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

