उपस्थ|उपस्थः
उपस्थ <i>(II) m.n.</i> 1. The male organ of generation, स्नानं मौनोपवासेज्या स्वाध्यायोपस्थनिग्रहाः Yaj.iii.314; 2. the female organ of generation, स्थूलोपस्थस्थलीषु Bhartr.i.20 (in Yaj.iii.92, the word is used in senses 1 and 2); 3. the anus; 4. the haunch or hip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=143-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपस्थनिग्रह|उपस्थनिग्रहः
