उपहित
उपहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Placed, put, (pp. of धा with उप q.v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=144-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपहिता
उपहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Placed, put, (pp. of धा with उप q.v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=144-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपहूति|उपहूतिः
