उपाहित|उपाहितः
उपाहित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Connected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=145-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपाहिता
उपाहित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Connected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=145-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपाहित|उपाहितः
उपाहित <i>(II) m.</i> Danger or destruction from fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=145-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेक्षण|उपेक्षणं
उपेक्षण <i>n.</i> 1. Leaving, abandoning; 2. over-looking, disregarding, neglecting; 3. indifference, contempt, R.xiv.65; 4. neglect considered as one of the seven expedients against an enemy. See उपाय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=145-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

