उपोढा
उपोढ <i>a. (f. ढा)</i> 1. Arrayed for battle, an army; 2. brought near; 3. advanced, begun; 4. married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=145-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपोत्तम
उपोत्तम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> Last but one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=146-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपोत्तमा
उपोत्तम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> Last but one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=146-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपोद्घात|उपोद्घातः
उपोद्घात <i>m.</i> 1. A beginning; 2. an introduction, a preface; 3. occasion, medium, तत्प्रतिच्छंदकमुपोद्घातेन माधवांतिकमुपेयात् M.M.i.; 4. an apposite argument or illustration; 5. the ascertainment of the elements of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=146-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

