उभ्
उभ् <i>vt. 6P (pp. उंभित; pres. उभति, उंभति)</i> 1. To confine; 2. to compact together; 3. to fill with, जलकुंभमुंभितरसं सपदि सरस्याः समानयंत्यास्ते Bh.V.ii.144; 4. to cover over, सर्वमर्मसु काकुत्स्थामौंभत्तीक्ष्णैः शिलीमुखैः Bt.xvii.88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=146-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उभ
उभ <i>pron. (used in the dual only.)</i> Both, उभौ यदि व्योम्नि पृथक्प्रवाहावाकाशगंगापयसः Sis.iii.8, K.S.iv.43, M.ii.14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=146-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उभय|उभयं|उभयः
