उररी
उररी <i>ind.</i> 1. A particle implying- (1) assent, admission, acceptance; 2. extension. (It is used as a prefix to the roots, अस्, कृ and भू and is not treated as a separate word; hence we have उररीकृत्य, and not उररी कृत्वा. The word is used in the following forms also- उरी, उरुरी, ऊरी, ऊररी) गिरं न कां कामुररीचकार Bh.V.ii.13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=146-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

