ऋ
ऋ <i>(I) vt. 1P (pp. ऋत, caus. अर्पय्; desid. अरिरिष्) (In conjugational tenses the base of this root is ऋच्छ्)</i> To go, e.g. नरः पतनमृच्छति.With सम्-, (A) to join.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋ
ऋ <i>(II) vt. 3P (pp. ऋत) (mostly used in the Vedas)</i> 1. To go; 2. to meet; 3. to gain, to acquire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋ
ऋ <i>(III) vt. 5P (pp. ऋण)</i> 1. To hurt; 2. to attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

