ऋक्ष|ऋक्षं|ऋक्षः
ऋक्ष <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A bear; 2. the name of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्ष|ऋक्षं|ऋक्षः
ऋक्ष <i>(II) m.n.</i> 1. A sign of the zodiac; 2. a lunar mansion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्ष|ऋक्षं|ऋक्षः
ऋक्ष <i>(III) m. pl.</i> 1. The seven stars called the pleiades; 2. the seven Ṛshis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षचक्र
