ऋच्
ऋच् <i>vt. or vi. 6P (pp. अर्चित)</i> 1. To praise; 2. to shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्
