ऋज्वी
ऋजु <i>a. (f. जु or ज्वी)</i> 1. Straight (lit. and fig.); 2. favourable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुग|ऋजुगः
