ऋणदास|ऋणदासः
ऋण-दास <i>m.</i> one who is bought as a slave by payment of his debts (in law), ऋणमोचन दासत्वमभ्युगतः ऋणदासः Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणमत्कुण|ऋणमत्कुणः
ऋण-मत्कुण, -मार्गण <i>m.</i> a security, a bail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणमार्गण|ऋणमार्गणः
ऋण-मत्कुण, -मार्गण <i>m.</i> a security, a bail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणमुक्ति|ऋणमुक्तिः
