ऋणमोचन
ऋण-मोचन <i>n.</i> a discharge from debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणलेख्य
ऋण-लेख्य <i>n.</i> a bond acknowledging a debt (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणशोधन
ऋण-शोधन <i>n.</i> payment or discharge of a debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणिक|ऋणिकः
ऋणिक <i>m.</i> A debtor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणिन्
ऋणिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> One under any obligation, indebted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणिनी
ऋणिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> One under any obligation, indebted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋत|ऋतं|ऋतः
ऋत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Right, proper; 2. honest, true; 3. worshipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋता
ऋत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Right, proper; 2. honest, true; 3. worshipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋत|ऋतं|ऋतः
ऋत <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Fixed rule; 2. divine law. (this word is rarely met with in classics though its negative अनृत is common); 3. truth; 4. livelihood by picking grains in a field, ऋतमुंछशिलं वृत्तम् M.iv.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतधामन्
ऋत-धामन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=150-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतंभर|ऋतम्भर|ऋतंभरः
ऋतंभर <i>m.</i> God, the upholder of truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतम्
ऋतम् <i>ind.</i> Truly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतीया
ऋतीया <i>f.</i> Reproach, censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतु|ऋतुः
ऋतु <i>m.</i> 1. A period of the year, a season; there are six seasons in a Hindu year- शिशिरः पुष्यसमयो ग्रीष्मो वर्षा शरद्धिमः; 2. The menstrual evacuation; 3. the period favourable for conception, e.g. ऋतौ भार्यामुपेयात्; 4. fit season; 5. light; 6. the number ‘six.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुकाल|ऋतुकालः
ऋतु-काल <i>m.</i> 1. the duration of a season; 2. the time favourable for conception, viz., sixteen nights from menstrual evacuation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुगण|ऋतुगणः
ऋतु-गण <i>m.</i> the seasons collectively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुगामिन्
ऋतु-गामिन् <i>m.</i> having intercourse with a wife at a time favourable for conception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुपर्याय|ऋतुपर्यायः|ऋतुपर्य्याय
ऋतु-पर्याय <i>m.</i> the revolution of the seasons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुमती
ऋतु-मती <i>f.</i> a woman during her courses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुमुख
ऋतु-मुख <i>n.</i> the beginning of a season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुराज|ऋतुराजः
ऋतु-राज <i>m.</i> the spring, e.g. ऋतुराजं भ्रमरहितम् &c. R.G.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुलिंग|ऋतुलिङ्ग
ऋतु-लिंग <i>n.</i> 1. a characteristic of the season; 2. a symptom of menstruation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुवृत्ति|ऋतुवृत्तिः
ऋतु-वृत्ति <i>f.</i> revolution of the seasons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुसंधि|ऋतुसन्धि|ऋतुसन्धिः
ऋतु-संधि <i>m.</i> the junction of two seasons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतुस्नाता
ऋतु-स्नाता <i>f.</i> a woman who has bathed after menstruation and so prepared herself for sexual intercourse, R.i.76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋते
ऋते <i>ind.</i> Except, with the exception of, without, (with the acc., inst. or abl.), e.g. शक्तोऽन्यः सहितुं वेगमृते देवं पिनाकिनम्, अवेहि मां प्रीतमृते तुरंगमात् R.iii.63. (The instrumental is very rarely used with this preposition.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋत्विज्
ऋत्विज् <i>m.</i> A priest who officiates at a sacrifice. (They are 16 in number such as होता, ब्रह्मा &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋद्ध|ऋद्धं|ऋद्धः
ऋद्ध <i>(I) a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. Prosperous, thriving, R.ii.56; 2. stored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋद्धा
ऋद्ध <i>(I) a. (f. द्धा)</i> 1. Prosperous, thriving, R.ii.56; 2. stored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋद्ध|ऋद्धं|ऋद्धः
ऋद्ध <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Stored grain; 2. a demonstrated conclusion; 3. increase, growth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋद्धि|ऋद्धिः
ऋद्धि <i>f.</i> 1. Increase; 2. success, prosperity; 3. accomplishment; 4. supernatural power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋध्
ऋध् <i>vt. 4P, 5P (pp. ऋद्ध)</i> 1. To prosper; 2. to please.With सम्-, to prosper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋभु|ऋभुः
ऋभु <i>m.</i> A deity, a divinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋभुक्ष|ऋभुक्षः
ऋभुक्ष <i>m.</i> 1. A name of Indra; 2. heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋभुक्षिन्
ऋभुक्षिन् <i>m. (nom. ऋभुक्षाः, ˚क्षाणौ, ˚क्षाणः, acc. pl. ऋभुक्षः)</i> A name of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋल्लक|ऋल्लकः
ऋल्लक <i>m.</i> A player on a kind of musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋश्य|ऋश्यः
ऋश्य <i>m.</i> A white-footed antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋश्यकेतु|ऋश्यकेतुः
ऋश्य-केतु, -केतन <i>m.</i> 1. name of अनिरुद्ध, son of प्रद्युम्न; 2. an epithet of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋश्यकेतन|ऋश्यकेतनः
ऋश्य-केतु, -केतन <i>m.</i> 1. name of अनिरुद्ध, son of प्रद्युम्न; 2. an epithet of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्
ऋष् <i>vt. 6P (pp. ऋष्ट)</i> 1. To go, to approach; 2. to injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषभ|ऋषभः
ऋषभ <i>m.</i> 1. A bull; 2. the best or most excellent of any species (in this sense it is generally used as the last member of a compound, e.g. पुरुषर्षभ); 3. the second of the seven notes of the gamut; 4. a crocodile’s tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषभकूट|ऋषभकूटः
ऋषभ-कूट <i>m.</i> the name of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषभध्वज|ऋषभध्वजः
ऋषभ-ध्वज <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषभी
ऋषभी <i>f.</i> 1. A cow; 2. a masculine woman; 3. a widow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषि|ऋषिः
ऋषि <i>m.</i> 1. An inspired poet or sage; 2. an anchorite; 3. a ray of light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषिकुल्या
ऋषि-कुल्या <i>f.</i> a sacred river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषितर्पण
ऋषि-तर्पण <i>n.</i> a libation offered to the sages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषिपंचमी|ऋषिपञ्चमी
ऋषि-पंचमी <i>f.</i> name of a festival on the fifth day in the first half of the month of Bhādrapada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषिलोक|ऋषिलोकः
ऋषि-लोक <i>m.</i> the world of the Ṛshis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋषिस्तोम|ऋषिस्तोमः
ऋषि-स्तोम <i>m.</i> 1. praise of the Ṛshis; 2. a particular sacrifice completed in one day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्टि|ऋष्टिः
ऋष्टि <i>m.f.</i> 1. A double-edged sword; 2. any sword; 3. a weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्य|ऋष्यः
ऋष्य <i>m.</i> See ऋश्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्यकेतन|ऋष्यकेतनः
ऋष्य-केतन, -केतु <i>m.</i> a name of Aniruddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्यकेतु|ऋष्यकेतुः
ऋष्य-केतन, -केतु <i>m.</i> a name of Aniruddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्यमूक|ऋष्यमूकः
ऋष्य-मूक <i>m.</i> a mountain near the Pampā lake, the temporary abode of Rāma with the monkey-chief Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋष्यक|ऋष्यकः
ऋष्यक <i>m.</i> The white-footed antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ॠ
ॠ <i>ind.</i> An interjection of- (1) terror; (2) reproach; (3) compassion; (4) remembrance &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ॠ
ॠ <i>vt. 9P (pp. ईर्ण)</i> To go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=151-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ए
ए <i>ind.</i> An interjection of- (1) remembering; (2) envy; (3) contempt; (4) compassion; (5) calling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एक|एकं|एकः
एक <i>pron. (f. का)</i> 1. One, single; 2. unique, singular; 3. preeminent, excellent; 4. same, identical; 5. one of two or many, Megh.i.30, ii.15; 6. a, an (used as an indefinite article); 7. alone, only, Bhartr.iii.14; 8. unparalleled, peerless.(एक-अन्य or अपर ‘the one-the other,’ ‘some-others.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एका
एक <i>pron. (f. का)</i> 1. One, single; 2. unique, singular; 3. preeminent, excellent; 4. same, identical; 5. one of two or many, Megh.i.30, ii.15; 6. a, an (used as an indefinite article); 7. alone, only, Bhartr.iii.14; 8. unparalleled, peerless.(एक-अन्य or अपर ‘the one-the other,’ ‘some-others.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाक्ष|एकाक्षः
एक-अक्ष <i>(I) a.</i> 1. having only one axle; 2. having one eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाक्ष|एकाक्षः
एक-अक्ष <i>(II) m.</i> a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाग्र|एकाग्रः
एक-अग्र, -अग्र्य <i>a.</i> 1. closely attentive, e.g. एकाग्रमासीनम्; 2. undisturbed; 3. single-pointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाग्र्य|एकाग्र्यः
एक-अग्र, -अग्र्य <i>a.</i> 1. closely attentive, e.g. एकाग्रमासीनम्; 2. undisturbed; 3. single-pointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकांग|एकाङ्ग|एकाङ्गं|एकाङ्गः
एक-अंग <i>m.</i> 1. a body-guard; 2. the planet Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकानुदिष्ट
एक-अनुदिष्ट <i>n.</i> a funeral ceremony performed only for one ancestor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्त|एकान्तं|एकान्तः
एक-अन्त <i>(I) m.</i> 1. the exclusive aim or boundary; 2. a secret place; 3. monotheism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्त|एकान्तं|एकान्तः
एक-अन्त <i>(II) n.</i> exclusive recourse, तेजः क्षामा वा नैकान्तं कालज्ञस्य महीपतेः Sis.ii.83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्त|एकान्तं|एकान्तः
एक-अन्त <i>(III) a.</i> 1. invariable, perpetual, स्वायत्तमेकान्तगुणं (छादनम्) Bhartr.ii.7; 2. excessive. (एकान्तम् ind. means ‘exceedingly.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्ततस्
एक-अन्ततस् <i>ind.</i> thoroughly, wholly, Bhartr.iii.24, कस्यान्त्यंतं सुखमुपनतं दुःखमेकान्ततो वा Megh.ii.46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तर|एकान्तरः
एक-अन्तर <i>a.</i> next but one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तिक
एक-अन्तिक <i>a.</i> final, conclusive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकायन|एकायनः
एक-अयन <i>(I) a.</i> 1. closely attentive; 2. passable by one only.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकायन|एकायनः
एक-अयन <i>(II) n.</i> 1. a meeting place; 2. monotheism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकायनगत|एकायनगतः
एक-अयन˚गत <i>a.</i> See एकायन a.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकार्थ|एकार्थः
एक-अर्थ <i>m.</i> 1. the same intention; 2. the same thing; 3. the same meaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाह|एकाहः
एक-अह <i>m.</i> the period of one day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकातपत्र
एक-आतपत्र <i>a.</i> characterised by one umbrella (referring to universal sovereignty), एकातपत्रं जगतः प्रभुत्वम् R.ii.47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादेश|एकादेशः
एक-आदेश <i>m.</i> one substitute for two or more letters, as in the case of the word मुरारि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकावली
एक-आवली <i>f.</i> 1. a single string of pearls &c., एकावली कण्ठविभूषणं वः Vikr.Ch.i.30; 2. the name of a figure, thus defined- स्थाप्यतेऽपोह्यते वापि यथापूर्वं परम्परम् । विशेषणतया यत्र वस्तु सैकावली K.Pr.x. (in rhetoric).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोदक|एकोदकः
एक-उदक <i>m.</i> one connected by the offering of funeral oblations of water only to the same deceased ancestor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोदर|एकोदरः
एक-उदर <i>m. (fem. रा)</i> a uterine brother (or sister.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोद्दिष्ट|एकोद्दिष्टं
एक-उद्दिष्ट <i>n.</i> a funeral rite performed for one individual deceased, not including other ancestors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैक
एक-एक <i>a.</i> one by one, every single one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=152-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैकशस्
