एनस्वत् <i>a. (f. ती)</i> 1. Sinful; 2. wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=153-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्ड|एरंडः|एरण्डः
एरण्ड <i>m.</i> Castor-oil plant. It is a small tree; hence the well-known couplet, ‘निरस्तपादपे देशे एरण्डोऽपि द्रुमायते.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=153-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलक|एलकः
एलक <i>m.</i> A ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलवालु
एलवालु <i>n.</i> 1. A kind of perfume; 2. a kind of cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलविल|एलविलः
एलविल <i>m.</i> An epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एला
एला <i>f.</i> 1. A cardamom plant; 2. cardamom seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलापर्णी|एलापर्ण्णी
एलापर्णी <i>f.</i> A particular plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एलीका
एलीका <i>f.</i> Small cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एव|एवं|एवः
एव <i>ind.</i> 1. Just, exactly, e.g. एवमेव ‘exactly so’; 2. same, identical, e.g. स एवागतः; 3. only (implying exclusion), e.g. पार्थ एव धनुर्धरः (‘not others’ is the implication); 4. like, as (implying similarity), e.g. श्रीस्त एव मेऽस्तु; 5. it sometimes implies emphasis, e.g. अहमेव गच्छामि. It also implies ‘command,’ ‘restraint,’ ‘diminution’ according to some authorities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवम्
एवम् <i>ind.</i> So, in this way, thus, एवंवादिनि देवर्षौ पार्श्वे पितुरधोमुखी K.S.vi.84. Sometimes it implies assent (yes), एवमेतत् Ut.i. and rarely determination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवमवस्थ
एवम्-अवस्थ <i>a.</i> so situated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवंकारम्
एवम्-कारम् <i>ind.</i> in this manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवंगुण
एवम्-गुण <i>a.</i> possessing such qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवंप्राय
एवम्-प्राय <i>a.</i> of such a kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

