एवंरूप
एवम्-रूप <i>a.</i> of such a form or kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एवंविध
एवम्-विध <i>a.</i> of such a kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एष्
