एषण|एषणः
एषण <i>m.</i> An iron arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषणा
एषणा <i>f.</i> Desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषणिका
एषणिका <i>f.</i> A goldsmith’s balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एषा
एषा <i>f.</i> Desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐ
