ऐकद्यम्
ऐकद्यम् <i>ind.</i> At once.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकध्य|ऐकध्यं
