ऐकध्यम्
ऐकध्यम् <i>ind.</i> At once, ऐकध्यं च श्रपणम् Kat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकपत्य|ऐकपत्यं
ऐकपत्य <i>n.</i> Supreme power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकपद्य|ऐकपद्यं
