ऐकात्म्य|ऐकात्म्यं
ऐकात्म्य <i>n.</i> 1. Unity; 2. oneness with the supreme soul; 3. identity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकाधिकरण्य|ऐकाधिकरण्यं
ऐकाधिकरण्य <i>n.</i> 1. Existence in the same subjects; 2. co-extension (in logic), साधेन हेतोरैकाधिकरण्यं व्याप्तिरुच्यते Bh.P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकान्तिक|ऐकांतिक
