ऐकान्तिकी
ऐकान्तिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Absolute, perfect; 2. exclusive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकान्यिक|ऐकान्यिकः
