ऐकाहिक|ऐकाहिकं
ऐकाहिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Ephemeral; 2. of one day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकाहिकी
ऐकाहिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Ephemeral; 2. of one day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्य|ऐक्यं
ऐक्य <i>n.</i> 1. Oneness; 2. identity; 3. unanimity; 4. friendship; 5. an aggregate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्षव|ऐक्षवं
