ऐक्षुक|ऐक्षुकः
ऐक्षुक <i>m.</i> A carrier of sugar-cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्षुभारिक
ऐक्षुक <i>m.</i> A carrier of sugar-cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐक्ष्वाक|ऐक्ष्वाकः
ऐक्ष्वाक <i>m.</i> 1. A descendent of the इक्ष्वाकु, ऐक्ष्वाकेषु च मैथिलेषु च फलन्त्यस्माकमद्याशिषः Murāri.; 2. the country ruled by the Aikshvākas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=154-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

