कच्चित्
कच्चित् <i>ind.</i> A particle- (1) of interrogation (often implying ‘I hope,’ or ‘I hope not’), e.g. आपाद्यते न व्ययमंतरायैः कच्चिन्महर्षेस्त्रिविधं तपस्तत् R.v.5, 6; (2) of joy; (3) of auspiciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=160-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

