कच्छ|कच्छं|कच्छः
कच्छ <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A bank, any ground bordering on water, स्वच्छंदोच्छलदच्छकच्छकुहरच्छातेतरांबुच्छटामूर्छन्मोहमहर्षिहर्षविहितस्नाना K.Pr.i.; 2. a marsh, a morass; 3. a particular part of the tortoise; 4. a particular part of a ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=160-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छप|कच्छपः
