कच्छभू
कच्छ-भू <i>f.</i> marshy ground, a morass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=160-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

