कंठमणि|कण्ठमणि|कण्ठमणिः
कंठ-मणि <i>m.</i> 1. a jewel worn on the neck; 2. a dear or beloved object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=162-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंठवर्तिन्|कण्ठवर्तिन्
कंठ-वर्तिन् <i>a.</i> residing in the throat, i.e. at the point of departing, R.xii.54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=162-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंठशोष|कण्ठशोष|कण्ठशोषः
