कंठी
कंठी <i>f.</i> 1. Neck, throat; 2. a necklace, a collar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=162-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंठीरव|कण्ठीरव|कण्ठीरवः
कंठी-रव <i>m.</i> 1. a lion; 2. an elephant in rut, कंठीरवमहाग्रहेण D.K.; 3. a pigeon; 4. explicit mention, e.g. कंठीरवेणोक्तम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=162-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंठील|कण्ठील|कंठीलः|कण्ठीलः
