कंडन|कण्डन|कंडनं|कण्डनं
कंडन <i>n.</i> 1. Threshing, separating the chaff from the grain; 2. chaff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=162-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

