कदन्न|कदन्नं
कद्-अन्न <i>n.</i> bad food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदपत्य
कद्-अपत्य <i>n.</i> a bad child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदभ्यास|कदभ्यासः
कद्-अभ्यास <i>a.</i> a bad habit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदर्थ|कदर्थः
कद्-अर्थ <i>a.</i> 1. useless; 2. unmeaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदर्थन
कद्-अर्थन <i>n.</i> tormenting, torture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदर्थना
कद्-अर्थना <i>f.</i> tormenting, torture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदर्थित
कद्-अर्थित <i>(I) a.</i> 1. despised, disdained, कदर्थितस्यापि हि धैर्यवृत्तेर्न शक्यते धैर्यगुणः प्रमार्ष्टुम् Bhartr.ii.106; 2. teased, troubled, आःकदर्थितोऽहमेभिर्वारंवारं वीरसंवादविघ्नकारिभिः Ut.v.; 3. insignificant, mean; 4. bad, disagreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदर्थित
कद्-अर्थित <i>(II) m.</i> a miser, M.iv.210, 224, Yaj.i.161.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदर्थितभाव
कद्-अर्थित˚भाव <i>m.</i> avarice, stinginess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

