कदुष्ण|कदुष्णं
कद्-उष्ण <i>(I) a.</i> tepid, lukewarm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदुष्ण|कदुष्णं
कद्-उष्ण <i>(II) n.</i> lukewarmness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कद्रथ|कद्रथः
कद्-रथ <i>m.</i> a bad carriage, e.g. युधि कद्रथवद्भीमं बंभज ध्वजशालिनम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कद्वद|कद्वदः
