कदन|कदनं
कदन <i>n.</i> 1. Destruction, slaughter; 2. war; 3. Sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदंब|कदम्ब|कदम्बं|कदंबः|कदम्बः
कदंब <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A particular plant, कदंबगोलाकृतिमाश्रितः कथं विशुद्धमुग्धः कुलकन्यकाजनः M.M.vii., Bhartr.i.35, Megh.i.25, R.xii.99; 2. a kind of grass; 3. turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदंबक|कदम्बक|कदम्बकं|कदंबकः|कदम्बकः
कदंब <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A particular plant, कदंबगोलाकृतिमाश्रितः कथं विशुद्धमुग्धः कुलकन्यकाजनः M.M.vii., Bhartr.i.35, Megh.i.25, R.xii.99; 2. a kind of grass; 3. turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदंबक|कदम्बक|कदम्बकं|कदंबकः|कदम्बकः
