कदंबानिल|कदम्बानिल|कदम्बानिलः
कदंब-अनिल <i>m.</i> 1. a fragrant breeze, ते चोन्मीलितमालतीसुरभयः प्रौढः कदंबानिलाः K.Pr.i.; 2. spring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदंबकानिल
कदंब-अनिल <i>m.</i> 1. a fragrant breeze, ते चोन्मीलितमालतीसुरभयः प्रौढः कदंबानिलाः K.Pr.i.; 2. spring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदंबकोरकन्याय|कदम्बकोरकन्याय|कदम्बकोरकन्यायः
कदंब-कोरकन्याय <i>m.</i> the maxim of the Kadamba bud. It is applied to denote simultaneous rise or action, कदंबकोरकन्यायादुत्पत्तिः कस्यचिन्मते Bh.P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदंबककोरकन्याय
कदंब-कोरकन्याय <i>m.</i> the maxim of the Kadamba bud. It is applied to denote simultaneous rise or action, कदंबकोरकन्यायादुत्पत्तिः कस्यचिन्मते Bh.P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदंबवायु|कदम्बवायु|कदम्बवायुः
कदंब-वायु <i>m.</i> a fragrant breeze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=164-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदंबकवायु
