कदल|कदलः
कदल <i>m.</i> The plaintain tree, ऊरुद्वयं मृगदृशः कदलस्य कांडौ Am.S.95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=165-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदलक|कदलकः
कदल <i>m.</i> The plaintain tree, ऊरुद्वयं मृगदृशः कदलस्य कांडौ Am.S.95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=165-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदली
कदली <i>f.</i> 1. The plantain tree, कनककदलीवेष्टनप्रेक्षणीयः Megh.ii.14, यास्यत्यूरुः सरसकदलीस्तंभगौरश्चलत्वम् ii.33, R.xii.96, Yaj.iii.8; 2. a kind of deer; 3. a flag carried by an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=165-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कदा
कदा <i>ind.</i> When, at what time, e.g. कदा काश्यां गमिष्यामि कदा द्रक्ष्यामि शंकरम् । इति ब्रुवाणः सततं काशीवासफलं लभेत्.With अपि, it means ‘now and then,’ ‘sometimes,’ ‘at some time.’with a following चन, it means ‘at sometime,’ ‘at one time or another,’ M.ii.54, 144, iii.25, 101.with a following चित्, it means ‘once,’ ‘once upon a time,’ ‘at some time or other,’ R.ii.37, M.iv.65, 74, 169.(कदाचित्-कदाचित्, ‘now-now.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=165-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कद्रु|कद्रुः
कद्रु <i>(I) a. (f. द्रु or द्रू)</i> Tawny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=165-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कद्रू
कद्रु <i>(I) a. (f. द्रु or द्रू)</i> Tawny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=165-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

