कंबु-ग्रीवा <i>f.</i> 1. a neck marked with three lines like a shell (considered to be indicative of exalted fortune); 2. a lady having a neck like a conch shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=168-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

