कर|करः
कर <i>(I) a. (f. रा or री) (generally at the end of compounds)</i> Who or what does or makes or causes, e.g. भयंकर, वृद्धिकर, दुःखकर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=168-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

