कर्णिका|कर्ण्णिका
कर्णिका <i>f.</i> 1. An ear-ring; 2. the pericarp of a lotus; 3. the middle finger; 4. a fruit-stock; 5. the tip of an elephant’s trunk; 6. chalk; 7. a pen, a small brush.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

