कर्तृ|कर्त्तृ
कर्तृ <i>m.</i> 1. The supreme spirit; 2. an epithet of Brahman (m.); 3. of Viṣṇu; 4. of Śiva; 5. a doer in general; (it should be translated according to context. See M.iii.160, iv.172, viii.345, R.ii.64.); 6. agent (considered as the meaning of the nominative case) (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

