कर्पूरतैल|कर्पूरतैलं|कर्प्पूरतैल
कर्पूर-तैल <i>n.</i> Camphor-liniment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्फर|कर्फरः
कर्फर <i>m.</i> A mirror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्बु
कर्बु <i>a.</i> Variegated, Yaj.iii.166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्बुर|कर्बुरः|कर्ब्बुरं|कर्ब्बुरः
कर्बुर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Variegated, spotted, पवनैर्भस्म कपोतकर्बुरम् K.S.iv.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्बुरा|कर्ब्बुरा
कर्बुर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Variegated, spotted, पवनैर्भस्म कपोतकर्बुरम् K.S.iv.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्बुर|कर्बुरः|कर्ब्बुरं|कर्ब्बुरः
कर्बुर <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The variegated colour; 2. sin; 3. a demon; 4. the Dhattūra plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्बुर|कर्बुरः|कर्ब्बुरं|कर्ब्बुरः
कर्बुर <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Gold; 2. water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मन्|कर्म्मन्
कर्मन् <i>n.</i> 1. Action, deed; 2. performance, office; 3. moral duty; 4. a religious rite; (it is either नित्य, नैमित्तिक or काम्य); 5. product, result; 6. natural active property, as maturity of heat; 7. performance of religious rites, as opposed to speculative religion; 8. the object of an action (in gram.), कर्तुरीप्सिततमं कर्म Pan.; 9. motion considered as one of the seven categories of things (in the Vaiśeṣika phil.) (thus defined- एकद्रव्यमगुणं संयोगविभागेष्वनपेक्षकारणं कर्मः; it is five-fold- उत्प्रेक्षणं तथावक्षेपणमाकुंचनं तथा । प्रसारणं च गमनं कर्माण्येतानि पंच च); 10. fate, i.e. a certain consequence of former acts, e.g. कर्मणो गहना गतिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=171-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्माक्षम
कर्मन्-अक्षम <i>a.</i> incapable of business.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मांग|कर्माङ्ग|कर्म्माङ्ग
कर्मन्-अंग <i>n.</i> part of a sacrificial rite, as प्रयाज of the Darśa sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्माधिकार|कर्माधिकारः
कर्मन्-अधिकार <i>m.</i> the right of performing religious rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मानुरूप|कर्म्मानुरूप
कर्मन्-अनुरूप <i>a.</i> 1. according to action or function; 2. in accordance with actions done in a previous birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मांत|कर्मान्त|कर्मान्तः|कर्म्मान्त|कर्म्मान्तः
कर्मन्-अंत <i>m.</i> 1. work, administration of an office or business; 2. the end of any task; 3. a barn, a store of grain &c. M.vii.62; 4. cultivated ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मांतर|कर्मान्तर|कर्म्मान्तर
कर्मन्-अंतर <i>n.</i> 1. difference or contrariety of action; 2. penance; 3. expiation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मांतिक|कर्मान्तिक|कर्मान्तिकः|कर्म्मान्तिक
कर्मन्-अंतिक <i>(I) a.</i> final.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मांतिक|कर्मान्तिक|कर्मान्तिकः|कर्म्मान्तिक
कर्मन्-अंतिक <i>(II) m.</i> a workman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्माजीव|कर्माजीवः|कर्म्माजीव
कर्मन्-आजीव <i>m.</i> one who lives by the profession of an artisan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मात्मन्|कर्म्मात्मन्
कर्मन्-आत्मन् <i>(I) a.</i> endowed with principles of action, active, M.i.53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मात्मन्|कर्म्मात्मन्
कर्मन्-आत्मन् <i>(II) m.</i> the soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मेंद्रिय|कर्मेन्द्रिय|कर्म्मेन्द्रिय|कर्म्मेन्द्रियं
कर्मन्-इंद्रिय <i>n.</i> an organ of action; (they are- वाक्पाणिपादपायूपस्थानि, M.ii.91. See इंद्रिय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मोदार|कर्म्मोदार
कर्मन्-उदार <i>n.</i> any honourable or valiant act, magnanimity, prowess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मोद्युक्त|कर्म्मोद्युक्त
कर्मन्-उद्युक्त <i>a.</i> busily engaged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकर|कर्मकरः|कर्म्मकर|कर्म्मकरः
कर्मन्-कर <i>m.</i> 1. a hired labourer, a servant who is not a slave, कर्मकराः स्थपयादयः Panch.i.; 2. Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकर्तृ|कर्म्मकर्त्तृ
कर्मन्-कर्तृ <i>m.</i> an agent who is at the same time the object of the action (in gram.) (क्रियमाणं तु यत्कर्म स्वयमेव प्रसिद्यति । सुकरैः स्वैर्गुणैः कर्तुः कर्मकर्तेति तद्विदुः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकांड|कर्मकाण्ड|कर्मकाण्डः|कर्म्मकाण्ड
कर्मन्-कांड <i>m.n.</i> that department of the Veda which relates to ceremonial acts and sacrificial rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकार|कर्मकारः|कर्म्मकार|कर्म्मकारः
कर्मन्-कार <i>m.</i> 1. one who works for wages, a workman; 2. an artisan, a mechanic; 3. a blacksmith, हरिणाक्षि कटाक्षेण आत्मानमवलोकाय । न हि खड्गो विजानाति कर्मकारं स्वकारणम् Ud.; 4. a bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकारिन्|कर्म्मकारिन्
कर्मन्-कारिन् <i>m.</i> a labourer, a workman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकार्मुक|कर्मकार्मुकः|कर्म्मकार्म्मुक
कर्मन्-कार्मुक <i>m.n.</i> a strong bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मकीलक|कर्मकीलकः|कर्म्मकीलक|कर्म्मकीलकः
कर्मन्-कीलक <i>m.</i> a washerman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मक्षम|कर्म्मक्षम|कर्म्मक्षमः
कर्मन्-क्षम <i>a.</i> able to perform a task or duty, आत्मकर्मक्षमं देहं क्षात्रो धर्म इवाश्रितः R.i.13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मक्षेत्र|कर्म्मक्षेत्र
कर्मन्-क्षेत्र <i>n.</i> the land of religious acts, viz., भरतवर्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मघात|कर्मघातः
कर्मन्-घात <i>m.</i> leaving off work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मचंडाल|कर्मचण्डाल|कर्मचण्डालः|कर्म्मचण्डाल
कर्मन्-चंडाल <i>m.</i> 1. a name of Rāhu; 2. a man of low acts or deeds; (the following four persons are called कर्मचंडाल- असूयकः पिशुनश्च कृतघ्नो दीर्घरोषकः । चत्वारः कर्मचंडालाः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मचोदना|कर्म्मचोदना
कर्मन्-चोदना <i>f.</i> 1. the motive impelling to ritual acts; 2. any positive precept which enjoins a religious act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मज्ञ|कर्म्मज्ञ
कर्मन्-ज्ञ <i>m.</i> one acquainted with religious rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मत्याग|कर्मत्यागः|कर्म्मत्याग
कर्मन्-त्याग <i>m.</i> abandonment of worldly duties or ceremonial rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मदुष्ट|कर्म्मदुष्ट
कर्मन्-दुष्ट <i>a.</i> corrupt in action, immoral, disrespectable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मदोष|कर्मदोषः|कर्म्मदोष
कर्मन्-दोष <i>m.</i> 1. sin, vice, M.vi.61; 2. error, defect, M.i.104; 3. evil consequence of human acts; 4. discreditable conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मधारय|कर्मधारयः|कर्म्मधारय
कर्मन्-धारय <i>m.</i> name of a compound, a subdivision of तत्पुरुष, e.g. तत्पुरुष कर्मधारय येनाहं स्यां बहिव्रीहिः Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मध्वंस|कर्मध्वंसः|कर्म्मध्वंस
कर्मन्-ध्वंस <i>m.</i> 1. loss of benefit arising from religious acts; 2. disappointment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मनामन्
कर्मन्-नामन् <i>n.</i> a participial noun (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मनाशा|कर्म्मनाशा
कर्मन्-नाशा <i>f.</i> the name of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मनिष्ठ|कर्म्मनिष्ठ
कर्मन्-निष्ठ <i>a.</i> given to the performance of religious rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मपथ|कर्मपथः|कर्म्मपथ
कर्मन्-पथ <i>m.</i> a source of action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मपाक|कर्मपाकः
कर्मन्-पाक <i>m.</i> ripening of actions, recompense for acts done in a former life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मप्रवचनीय|कर्मप्रवचनीयः|कर्म्मप्रवचनीय
कर्मन्-प्रवचनीय <i>m.</i> a term for certain prepositions, particles, or adverbs not connected with a verb but with a case of a noun, e.g. अनु in ‘सर्वं मामनु ते.’ (See उपसर्ग, गति and निपात).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मन्यास|कर्मन्यासः|कर्म्मन्यास
कर्मन्-न्यास <i>m.</i> relinquishment of the results of religious rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मफल|कर्म्मफल|कर्म्मफलं
कर्मन्-फल <i>n.</i> recompensed actions, (e.g. pain, pleasure &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मबंध|कर्मबन्ध|कर्मबन्धः|कर्म्मबन्ध
कर्मन्-बंध <i>m.</i> confinement to repeated birth, as the result of good or bad acts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मबंधन|कर्मबन्धन|कर्म्मबन्धन
कर्मन्-बंधन <i>n.</i> confinement to repeated birth, as the result of good or bad acts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मभू|कर्म्मभू
कर्मन्-भू, भूमि <i>f.</i> 1. the land of religious rites, viz., भारतवर्ष; 2. ploughed ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मभूमि|कर्मभूमिः|कर्म्मभूमि|कर्म्मभूमिः
कर्मन्-भू, भूमि <i>f.</i> 1. the land of religious rites, viz., भारतवर्ष; 2. ploughed ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-43" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्ममीमांसा|कर्म्ममीमांसा
कर्मन्-मीमांसा <i>f.</i> the same as मीमांसा q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-44" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्ममूल|कर्म्ममूल|कर्म्ममूलं
कर्मन्-मूल <i>n.</i> a kind of sacred grass called कुश.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-45" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मयुग|कर्म्मयुग|कर्म्मयुगं
कर्मन्-युग <i>n.</i> the fourth age of the world, i.e. the Kaliyuga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=172-46" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मयोग|कर्मयोगः|कर्म्मयोग|कर्म्मयोगः
