कल-नाद <i>m.</i> a low sweet tone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=173-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलभाषण
कल-भाषण <i>n.</i> the prattle of childhood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=173-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलरव|कलरवः
