कलहंस|कलहंसः
कल-हंस <i>m.</i> 1. a gander, a swan, कुंदावदाताः कलहंसमालाः Bt.ii.18, R.viii.59, K.S.v.67; 2. the supreme soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=173-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

