कलम|कलमः
कलम <i>m.</i> 1. Rice which is sown in June and ripens in December, R.iv.37, Rt.iii.5; 2. a pen, a reed for writing with; 3. a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=174-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलंब|कलम्ब|कलंबः|कलम्बः
