कलविंग
कलविंक(ग) <i>m. (fem. ˚का)</i> A sparrow, M.v.12, Yaj.i.174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=174-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

