कलहांतरिता|कलहान्तरिता
कलह-अंतरिता <i>f.</i> a woman separated from her lover in consequence of a quarrel; (the S.D. thus describes her- चाटुकारमपि प्राणमाथं दोषादपास्य या । पश्चात्तापमवाप्नोति कलहांतरिता तु सा. See Git.G.ii.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=174-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

