कलिद्रुम|कलिद्रुमः
कलि-द्रुम, -वृक्ष <i>m.</i> the Bibhītaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=174-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

