कलुष <i>(I) a. (f. षा)</i> 1. Turbid, muddy, foul, गंगा रोधःपतनकलुषा गच्छतीव प्रसादम् Vikr.i., Ghat.13; 2. dark, opaque; 3. hoarse, choked, कंठः स्तंभितबाष्पवृत्तिकलुषः Sak.iv.; 4. wicked, bad, sinful; 5. lazy; 6. unable, incompetent, भावावबोधकलुषा दयितेव रात्रौ R.v.64; 7. censurable, blamable, R.xiv.73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=175-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

