कविराज|कविराजः
कवि-राज <i>m.</i> a great poet, श्रीहर्षं कविराजराजिमुकुटालंकारहीरः सुतं श्रीहीरः सुषुवे Na.i.145.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=176-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

