कव्य-वाह्, -वाह, -वाहन <i>m.</i> fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=176-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

