कश्य|कश्यं
कश्य <i>(I) a. (f. श्या)</i> Fit to be whipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कश्या
कश्य <i>(I) a. (f. श्या)</i> Fit to be whipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कश्य|कश्यं
कश्य <i>(II) n.</i> Spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कश्यप|कश्यपः
कश्यप <i>m.</i> 1. A tortoise; 2. name of a Ṛshi, the husband of Aditi and Diti and the father of gods and demons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष्
कष् <i>vt. 1P (pp. कषित)</i> 1. To rub with a touch-stone, to test, छदहेम कषन्निवालसत्कषयाषाणनिभे नभस्तले Na.ii.69; 2. to rub, to scrape, Bt.iii.49; 3. to injure, to destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष|कषः
कष <i>(I) a. (f. षा)</i> Rubbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषा
कष <i>(I) a. (f. षा)</i> Rubbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष|कषः
कष <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Rubbing; 2. a touchstone, छदहेम कषन्निवालसत्कषयाषाणनिभे नभस्तले Na.ii.69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषण|कषणः
कषण <i>n.</i> 1. Rubbing, marking, कषणकंपनिरस्तमहाहिभिः Kir.v.47; 2. test of gold by the touchstone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषा
कषा <i>f.</i> The same as कशा q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषाय|कषायः
कषाय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Astringent; 2. fragrant, स्फुटितकमलामोदमैत्रीकषायः Megh.i.31; 3. red, dark-red, चूतांकुरास्वादकषायकंठः K.S.iii.32; 4. brown; 5. improper, dirty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषाया
कषाय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Astringent; 2. fragrant, स्फुटितकमलामोदमैत्रीकषायः Megh.i.31; 3. red, dark-red, चूतांकुरास्वादकषायकंठः K.S.iii.32; 4. brown; 5. improper, dirty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषाय|कषायः
कषाय <i>(II) m.n.</i> 1. Astringent flavour; 2. the red colour; 3. a decoction which has one part of a drug with 8 or 16 parts of water, the whole being boiled down until one quarter is left, M.xi.153; 4. gum, resin, extract; 5. plastering, anointing; 6. perfuming the person, Rt.i.4; 7. dirt, uncleanliness; 8. attachment to worldly objects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषाय|कषायः
कषाय <i>(III) m.</i> 1. Passion, emotion; 2. the Kaliyuga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषायित
कषायित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Tinged, coloured, अमुनैव कषायितस्तनी K.S.iv.34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषायिता
कषायित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Tinged, coloured, अमुनैव कषायितस्तनी K.S.iv.34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषि|कषिः
कषि <i>a.</i> Injurious, mischievous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषेरुका
कषे(से)रुका <i>f.</i> The backbone, the spine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कसेरुका
कषे(से)रुका <i>f.</i> The backbone, the spine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष्ट|कष्टं|कष्टः
कष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Bad, evil, wrong, कष्टात्कष्टतरं गता R.xv.43, ‘gone from bad to worse’; 2. painful, grievous, मोहादभूत्कष्टतरः प्रबोधः R.xiv.56, or कष्टा वृत्तिः पराधीना कष्टो वासो निराश्रयः Cāṇakya.; 3. difficult, स्त्रीषु कष्टोऽधिकारः Vikr.iii., Yaj.iii.29; 4. difficult to subdue (as an enemy), M.vii.186, 210; 5. mischievous, injurious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष्टा
कष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Bad, evil, wrong, कष्टात्कष्टतरं गता R.xv.43, ‘gone from bad to worse’; 2. painful, grievous, मोहादभूत्कष्टतरः प्रबोधः R.xiv.56, or कष्टा वृत्तिः पराधीना कष्टो वासो निराश्रयः Cāṇakya.; 3. difficult, स्त्रीषु कष्टोऽधिकारः Vikr.iii., Yaj.iii.29; 4. difficult to subdue (as an enemy), M.vii.186, 210; 5. mischievous, injurious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष्ट|कष्टं|कष्टः
कष्ट <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Evil, difficulty, misery, suffering, uneasiness, अर्थार्थी याति कष्टानि Panch.ii.; 2. sin.(कष्टम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘alas,’ कष्टं युद्धे दश शेषाः श्रुता मे त्रयोऽस्माकं पांडवानां च सप्त Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

