कस्
कस् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pp. कसित)</i> 1. To go, to approach.With वि-, to open, to expand, विकसति हि पतंगस्योदये पुंडरीकम् M.M.i., Sis.ix.47, K.S.vii.55; (caus. pres. कासयति-ते).With निस्-, 1. to take out; 2. to drive out or away, to banish, to expel, निरकासयद्रविमपेतवसुं वियदालयादपरदिग्गणिका Sis.ix.10.With प्र-, to open, to cause to expand, घनमुक्तांबुलवप्रकाशितैः (कुसुमैः) Ghat.19.With वि-, to open, to cause to expand, इंदुर्विकासयति कैरविणीकुलानि Bhartr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=177-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

