कांड-स्पृष्ट <i>m.</i> a soldier, one who lives by arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=179-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

