कात्यायन|कात्यायनः
कात्यायन <i>m.</i> 1. Name of a sage and writer on civil and religious law, Yaj.i.4; 2. name of a writer on grammar who wrote Vārtikas to supplement Pāṇini’s Sūtras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=179-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कात्यायनी
