कादंब <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A kind of goose, R.xiii.55, Rt.iv.9; 2. an arrow; 3. a sugar-cane; 4. the Kadamba tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=179-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

