कादंबर <i>n.</i> A spirituous liquor distilled from the flowers of the कदंब tree, निषेव्य मधु माधवाः सरसमत्र कादंबरम् Sis.iv.66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कादंबरी|कादम्बरी
कादंबरी <i>f.</i> 1. A spirituous liquor distilled from the flowers of the कदंब tree; 2. wine in general, कादंदरीमदविघूर्णितलोचनस्य युक्तं हि लांगलभृतः Ud.; 3. the fluid issuing from the temples of an elephant; 4. Sarasvatī, the goddess of learning; 5. a female cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कादंबिनी|कादम्बिनी
