कानिष्ठिक <i>n.</i> The little finger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

