कांदिशीक|कान्दिशीक|कान्दिशीकः
कांदिशीक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Put to flight, running away, flying; 2. afraid, Bh.V.ii.178.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

