कापटिक|कापटिकः
कापटिक <i>(II) m.</i> A flatterer, a parasite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कापट्य|कापट्यं
कापट्य <i>n.</i> Wickedness, fraud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कापथ|कापथः
कापथ <i>m.</i> A bad road (lit. and fig.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कापाल|कापालं|कापालः
कापाल <i>m.</i> A follower of a certain Śaiva sect characterized by carrying skulls as ornaments and eating and drinking from them.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कापालिक|कापालिकः
कापाल <i>m.</i> A follower of a certain Śaiva sect characterized by carrying skulls as ornaments and eating and drinking from them.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कापालिन्
