कापोती
कापोत <i>(I) a. (f. ती)</i> Grey, of a dirty white colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कापोत|कापोतं|कापोतः
