कापोत-अंजन <i>n.</i> antimony applied to the eyes as collyrium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम्
काम् <i>ind.</i> An interjection used in calling out to another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम|कामं|कामः
काम <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Wish, desire, संतानकामाय R.ii.65, iii.67, M.ii.5; 2. attachment to worldly objects, Bg.ii.62, M.ii.94; 3. affection, love; 4. sexual pleasure considered as one of the four ends of life, (पुरुषार्थ), Cf. अर्थ 8, R.i.25; 5. lust, desire of carnal gratification, M.ii.214, 6. the god of love; 7. a species of the mango tree; 8. an epithet of Pradyumna; 9. of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काम|कामं|कामः
काम <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Object of desire; 2. semen virile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामाग्नि|कामाग्निः
काम-अग्नि <i>m.</i> 1. fire of passion, violent desire; 2. fire of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामाग्निसंदीपन
काम-अग्नि˚संदीपन <i>n.</i> 1. kindling the fire of lust; 2. an aphrodisiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामांकुश|कामाङ्कुश|कामाङ्कुशः
काम-अंकुश <i>m.</i> 1. a finger-nail; 2. the male organ of generation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामांग|कामाङ्ग|कामाङ्गः
काम-अंग <i>m.</i> the mango-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

