काम-अधिष्ठित <i>a.</i> overcome by love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामानल|कामानलः
काम-अनल <i>m.</i> See कामाग्नि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामांध|कामान्ध|कामान्धः
काम-अंध <i>(I) a.</i> blinded by love or passion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामांध|कामान्ध|कामान्धः
काम-अंध <i>(II) m.</i> the Indian cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामांधा|कामान्धा
काम-अंधा <i>f.</i> musk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

