कामारण्य|कामारण्यं
काम-अरण्य <i>n.</i> a pleasing grove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामारि|कामारिः
काम-अरि <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामार्थिन्
