कामावतार|कामावतारः
काम-अवतार <i>m.</i> an epithet of Pradyumna, son of Kṛṣṇa and Rukmiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामावसाय|कामावसायः
काम-अवसाय <i>m.</i> suppression of passion, stoicism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=180-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

