कामना
कामना <i>f.</i> Desire, wish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामनीय|कामनीयं
कामनीय <i>n.</i> Beauty, attractiveness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामम्
कामम् <i>ind.</i> 1. According to wish, according to inclination, at will, काममारणात्तिष्ठेत् गृहे कन्यर्तुमत्यपि M.ix.89; 2. willingly, joyfully, Sant.S.iv.4; 3. freely, without doubt, M.ii.189, Yaj.i.32; 4. well, very well (as a particle of assent), मनागनभ्यावृत्त्या वा कामं क्षाम्यतु यः क्षमी Sis.ii.43; 5. granted, no doubt, admitted that, [usually followed by तु or तथापि (yet, still) as its correlative] कामं प्रिया न सुलभा मनस्तु तद्भावदर्शनायासि Sak.ii., R.vi.22, iv.13, xii.75; 6. indeed, really, surely (implying at the same time a contradiction or unwillingness.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामयमान
कामयमान <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Lustful, libidinous, R.xix.50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामयमाना
कामयमान <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Lustful, libidinous, R.xix.50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

