कामिन्
कामिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Lustful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामिनी
कामिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Lustful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामिन्
कामिन् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A lover, a lustful man who pays attention to women, कामीवार्द्रापराधः स दहतु दुरितं शांभवो वः शराग्निः Am.S.2, Rt.i.3; 2. a uxorious husband; 3. a sparrow; 4. an epithet of Śiva; 5. the moon; 6. a pigeon; 7. a chakravāka bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामिनी
कामिनी <i>f.</i> 1. A woman in general, चतुरेव कामिनी R.ix.69, Rt.i.28; 2. a loving or affectionate woman; 3. a lovely woman, केषां नैषा कथय कविताकामिनी कौतुकायः Pr.R.1; 4. a timid woman; 5. spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामुक|कामुकः
कामुक <i>(I) a. (f. का or की)</i> 1. Wishing, desirous; 2. lustful, libidinous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामुका
कामुक <i>(I) a. (f. का or की)</i> 1. Wishing, desirous; 2. lustful, libidinous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

