कामुका
कामुका <i>f.</i> A woman desirous of wealth &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=182-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामुकी
