काश्मरी
काश्मरी <i>f.</i> A plant commonly called गांभारी^1, काश्मर्याः कृतमालमुद्गतदलं कोयष्टिकष्टीकत M.M.ix.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260721. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/313.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=187-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

