किम्-शारु <i>m.</i> 1. the beard of corn; 2. an arrow; 3. a heron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंसखि
किम्-सखि <i>m. (nom. sing. किंसखा)</i> a bad friend, स किंसखा साधु न शास्ति योऽधिपम् Kir.i.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्
किम् <i>(I) pron. (nom. sing. कः m., किम् n., का f.)</i> Who, what, कः पौरवे वसुमतीं शासति शासितरि दुर्विनीतानाम् । अयमाचरत्यविनयं मुग्धासु तपस्विकन्यासु Sak.i., करुणाविमुखेन मृत्युना हरंता त्वां वद किं न मे हतम् R.viii.67, तदात्मताध्यातधवारते च का चकार वा न स्वमनोभवोद्भवम् Na.i.30.The neuter sing. किम् is often used with an inst. in the sense of ‘what is the use of,’ व्याधितस्यौषधं पथ्यं नीरुजस्तु किमौषधैः Hit.i., or किं कुलेनोपदिष्टेन शीलमेवान्न कारणम् Mrich.ix.चिद्, अपि, चिदपि or चन is often suffixed to this prenoun to render its sense indefinite, कश्चिद् (यक्षः ‘a certain Yaksha’) कांताविरहगुरुणा स्वाधिकारात् प्रमत्तः Megh.i.1, काऽपि (a certain lady) तत एवागतवती M.M.i, अत्रैव कोऽपि कस्यापि तिष्ठतीति मामंगुलीदलविलासेनाख्यातवत्यः i., तस्याश्च कश्चिंश्चिदपि महाभागधेयजन्मनि … … … … मन्मथविकारमुपलक्षितवानस्मि i., वदसि यदि किंचिदपि दंतरुचिकौमुदी हरति दरतिमिरमतिधोरम् Git.G.x.किमपि, किंचित् also mean ‘a little,’ ‘something’, किंचिद्दत्वा पृथक्क्रिया Yaj.ii.116.With अपि-, it sometimes means, ‘indescribable,’ See अपि.इव is sometimes added to this word, to give elegance and force to the meaning and may be rendered by ‘what possibly,’ किमिव हि … नाकृतीनां मंडनं Sak.i. See इव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्
किम् <i>(II) ind.</i> 1. A particle of interrogation, e.g. किं व्याधा वनेऽस्मिन् संचरति ‘do hunters roam about in this wood’; 2. a particle expressing ‘why, wherefore,’ बहुलीभूतमेतत्किंन कथ्यते Sak.v.; 3. whether (generally as the correlative of किम् आहोस्वित्, उत, वा, किंवा, अथवा), किं येन सृजसि व्यक्तमुत येन बिभर्षि तत् K.S.vi.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमपि
किम्-अपि <i>ind.</i> 1. some what, to a considerable extent; 2. indescribably (as to quality, nature or quantity), hence much more, very much, धूमकेतुमिव किमपि करालम् Git.G.i., किमपि रमणीयं वपुरिदम् Sak.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमर्थ
किम्-अर्थ <i>a.</i> having what motive or aim, e.g. किमर्थोऽयमायासः, किमर्थोऽयंतवारंभः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमर्थम्
किम्-अर्थम् <i>ind.</i> why, wherefore, Am.S.18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमाख्य
किम्-आख्य <i>a.</i> having what name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमिति
किम्-इति <i>ind.</i> why, किमित्यपास्याभरणानि यौवने धृतं त्वया वार्धकशोभि वल्कलम् K.S.v.44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमु
किम्-उ, -उत <i>ind.</i> 1. why, प्रियसुहृत्सार्थः किमु त्यज्यते Am.S.31; 2. doubt or uncertainty (or), Am.S.9; 3. how much more, how much less, सर्वाविनयानामेकैकमप्यायतनं किमुत समवायः Kad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमुत
किम्-उ, -उत <i>ind.</i> 1. why, प्रियसुहृत्सार्थः किमु त्यज्यते Am.S.31; 2. doubt or uncertainty (or), Am.S.9; 3. how much more, how much less, सर्वाविनयानामेकैकमप्यायतनं किमुत समवायः Kad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंकर|किङ्कर|किङ्करः
किम्-कर <i>m.</i> a servant, a slave, अवेहि मां किंकरमष्टमूर्तेः R.ii.35, Am.S.100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंकरा
किम्-करा <i>f.</i> a female servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंकरी
किम्-करी <i>f.</i> the wife of a servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंकर्तव्यता
किम्-कर्तव्यता, -कार्यता <i>f.</i> any situation in which one asks himself what ought to be done, perplexity, किंकर्तव्यतामूढः क्षणमतिष्ठत् D.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंकार्यता
किम्-कर्तव्यता, -कार्यता <i>f.</i> any situation in which one asks himself what ought to be done, perplexity, किंकर्तव्यतामूढः क्षणमतिष्ठत् D.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंकारण
किम्-कारण <i>a.</i> having what reason or cause.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंकिल|किङ्किल
किम्-किल <i>ind.</i> what a pity (expressing dissatisfaction), e.g. तत्रभवान् किंकिल वृषलं याजयिष्यति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंक्षण|किङ्क्षण
किम्-क्षण <i>a.</i> a lazy fellow who does not value moments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंगोत्र
किम्-गोत्र <i>a.</i> belonging to what family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंच|किञ्च
किम्-च <i>ind.</i> moreover, further.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंचन|किञ्चन|किञ्चनः
किम्-चन <i>ind.</i> to a certain degree, a little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंचित्|किञ्चित्
किम्-चित् <i>ind.</i> to a certain degree, a little, किंचिद्विहस्यार्थपतिं बभाषे R.ii.46, xii.21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

