किम्-चित्˚ज्ञ <i>a.</i> a smatterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंचित्कर
किम्-चित्˚कर <i>a.</i> doing something, useful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंचित्काल
किम्-चित्˚काल <i>m.</i> sometime, a little time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंचित्प्राण
किम्-चित्˚प्राण <i>a.</i> having a little life left.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंचिन्मात्र
किम्-चित्˚मात्र <i>a.</i> only a little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंछंदस्|किञ्छन्दस्
किम्-छंदस् <i>a.</i> conversant with which Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्तर्हि
किम्-तर्हि <i>ind.</i> how, then, but, however.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंतु|किन्तु
