किंदेवत
किम्-देवत <i>a.</i> having what deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंनामधेय
किम्-नामधेय, -नामन् <i>a.</i> having what name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंनामन्
किम्-नामधेय, -नामन् <i>a.</i> having what name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंनिमित्त|किन्निमित्त
किम्-निमित्त <i>a.</i> having what cause or reason.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंनिमित्तम्
किम्-निमित्तम् <i>ind.</i> why, wherefore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंनु|किन्नु
किम्-नु <i>ind.</i> 1. whether, e.g. किंनु मे मरणं श्रेयो परित्यागो जनस्य वा; 2. much more, much less, अपि त्रैलोक्यराज्यस्य हेतोः किन्नु मंहीकृते Bg.i.35; 3. what indeed, e.g. किंन्नुमे राज्येनार्थः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किंनुखलु|किन्नुखलु
किम्-नुखलु <i>ind.</i> 1. how possibly, how is it that, किं नु खलु बालेऽस्मिन्नौरस इव पुत्रे स्निह्यति मे मनः Sak.vii.; 2. can it be that, किंनुखलु यथा वयमस्यामेवमियमप्यस्मात् प्रतिं स्यात् Sak.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

