किंपचान|किम्पचान|किम्पचानः
किम्-पच, -पचान <i>a.</i> miserly, niggardly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

