किंस्वित्
किम्-स्वित् <i>ind.</i> whether, how, अद्रेः शृंगं हरति पवनः किंस्विदित्युन्मुखीभिः Megh.i.14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=188-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कियत्|कियन्त्
कियत् <i>a. (nom. sing. कियान् m., कियती f., कियत् n.)</i> 1. How great, how far, how much, how many, भवेदमीभिः कमलोदयः कियान् Na.i.130, कियतीं याति न दशाम् Sant.S.i.25, निर्गतस्तावदवलोकयामि कियदवशिष्टं रजन्या इति Sak.iv.; राजेति कियती मात्रा ‘what (of what account) is a king’; 2. some, a little, a small number, निजहृदि विकसंतः संति संतः कियंतः Bhartr.ii.78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कियदेतिका
कियत्-एतिका <i>f.</i> effort, vigorous and persevering exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कियत्कालम्
कियत्-कालम् <i>ind.</i> 1. how long; 2. some little time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कियच्चिरम्
कियत्-चिरम् <i>ind.</i> how long, कियच्चिरं श्राम्यसि गौरि K.S.v.50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कियद्दूरम्
कियत्-दूरम् <i>ind.</i> for a short time, a little way, how far, how distant, प्रियः कियद्दूरमिति त्वयोदिते Na.i.137.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर|किरः
किर <i>m.</i> A hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरक|किरकः
किरक <i>m.</i> 1. A scribe; 2. a pig.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरण|किरणः
किरण <i>m.</i> 1. A ray or beam of light, a ray of the sun or moon, एको हि दोषो गुणसंनिपाते निमज्जतींदोः किरणेष्विवांकः K.S.i.3, R.v.74, Sis.iv.58; 2. a small particle of dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरणमय
किरण-मय <i>a.</i> radiant, refulgent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरणमालिन्
किरण-मालिन् <i>m.</i> the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरात|किरातः
किरात <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Name of a degraded mountain tribe who live by hunting, विंदंति मार्गं नखरंध्रमुक्तैर्मुक्ताफलैः केसरिनां किराताः K.S.i.6, 15; 2. savage; 3. a dwarf, पर्यंताश्रयिभिर्निजस्य सदृशं नात्रः किरातैः कृतम् Rat.ii.; 4. a groom, a horseman; 5. name of Śiva in the disguise of a Kirāta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरात|किरातः
किरात <i>(II) m. pl.</i> The name of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किराताशिन्
किरात-अशिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Garutla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=189-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किराती
किराती <i>f.</i> 1. A female Kirāta; 2. a woman who carries a fly-flap or chowrie, R.xvi.57; 3. a bawd, a procuress; 4. Pārvatī in the disguise of a Kirāti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरि|किरिः
किरि <i>m.</i> 1. A hog; 2. a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीट|किरीटं|किरीटः
किरीट <i>m.n.</i> A diadem, a crest, a tiara, किरीटबद्धांजलयः K.S.vii.92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीटधारिन्
किरीट-धारिन् <i>m.</i> a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीटमालिन्
किरीट-मालिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Arjuna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीटिन्
किरीटिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Wearing a diadem, Bg.xi.17, 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीटिनी
किरीटिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Wearing a diadem, Bg.xi.17, 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीटिन्
किरीटिन् <i>(II) m.</i> A name of Arjuna (thus explained in the Mahābhārata- पुरा शक्रेण मे बद्धं युध्यतो दानवर्षभैः । किरीटं मूर्ध्नि सूर्याभं तेनाहुर्मां किरीटिनम्) Bg.xi.35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्मीर|किर्मीरः|किर्म्मीर|किर्म्मीरः
किर्मीर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Variegated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्मीरा
किर्मीर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Variegated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्मीर|किर्मीरः|किर्म्मीर|किर्म्मीरः
किर्मीर <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Name of a Rākṣasa slain by Bhīma, Ve.vi.; 2. the variegated colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्मीरजित्|किर्म्मीरजित्
किर्मीर-जित्, -निषूदन, -सूदन <i>m.</i> an epithet of Bhīma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किर्मीरनिषूदन|किर्मीरनिषूदनः
