किर्मीर-जित्, -निषूदन, -सूदन <i>m.</i> an epithet of Bhīma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किल|किलः
किल <i>(I) m.</i> Play, trifling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलकिंचित|किलकिञ्चित|किलकिञ्चितं
किल-किंचित <i>n.</i> amorous agitation, weeping, laughing, being angry, &c. in the society of a lover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलकिंचित|किलकिञ्चित|किलकिञ्चितं
किल-किंचित <i>(II) ind.</i> A particle expressing- (1) certainty, इदं किलाव्याजमनोहरं वपुः Sak.i.; (2) report, tradition, बभूव योगी किल कार्तवीर्यः R.vi.38, जघान कंसं किल वासुदेवः P.Bh.; (3) dissatisfaction, dislike, एवं किल केचिद्वदंति G.M.; (4) contempt, त्वं किल योत्स्यते G.M.; (5) probability, पार्थः किल विजेष्यते कुरून् G.M.; (6) cause, reason, स किलैवमुक्तवान् ‘For he said so.’ G.M.; (7) feigned action, प्रसह्य सिंहः किल तां चकर्ष R.ii.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलकिल|किलकिलः
किलकिल <i>m.</i> A sound, a cry expressing joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलकिला
किलकिला <i>f.</i> A sound, a cry expressing joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलकिलाय्
किलकिलाय् <i>(denom. verb)</i> To make a noise, Bt.viii.102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलिंज|किलिञ्ज|किलिंजं|किलिञ्जः
किलिंज <i>n.</i> 1. A mat; 2. a thin plank of green wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किल्बिष|किल्बिषः
किल्बिष <i>n.</i> 1. Fault, offence, injury, guilt, M.viii.235; 2. sin, Bg.iii.13, vi.45; 3. a disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किल्विन्
किल्विन् <i>m.</i> A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किशलय|किशलयं|किशलयः
किशलय <i>m.n.</i> A sprout, a young shoot. See किसलय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किशोर|किशोरः
किशोर <i>m.</i> 1. A youth, a lad, a boy below fifteen, a minor in law; 2. a colt, the young of any animal; 3. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किशोरी
किशोरी <i>f.</i> A maiden, a young woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किष्किंध|किष्किन्ध|किष्किंधः|किष्किन्धः
किष्किंध(ध्य) <i>m.</i> 1. Name of a country; 2. name of a mountain situated in that country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किष्किंध्य|किष्किन्ध्य|किष्किंध्यः|किष्किन्ध्यः
किष्किंध(ध्य) <i>m.</i> 1. Name of a country; 2. name of a mountain situated in that country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किष्किंधा|किष्किन्धा
किष्किंधा(ध्या) <i>f.</i> Name of a city, the capital of Kishkindha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किष्किंध्या|किष्किन्ध्या
किष्किंधा(ध्या) <i>f.</i> Name of a city, the capital of Kishkindha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किष्कु|किष्कुः
किष्कु <i>(I) a.</i> Vile, contemptible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किष्कु|किष्कुः
किष्कु <i>(II) m.f.</i> 1. The forearm; 2. a cubit, a span.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किसल|किसलं|किसलः
किसल <i>n.</i> A sprout, a young and tender shoot, किसलयैः सलयैरिव पाणिभिः R.ix.35, करकिसलयतालैर्भुग्धया नर्त्यमानम् Ut.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किसलय|किसलयं|किसलयः
किसल <i>n.</i> A sprout, a young and tender shoot, किसलयैः सलयैरिव पाणिभिः R.ix.35, करकिसलयतालैर्भुग्धया नर्त्यमानम् Ut.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीकट|कीकटः
कीकट <i>(I) a. (f. टी)</i> 1. Poor, indigent; 2. miserly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीकटी
