कीकट|कीकटः
कीकट <i>(III) m.</i> A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीकस|कीकसं|कीकसः
कीकस <i>(I) a. (f. सा)</i> Hard, firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीकसा
कीकस <i>(I) a. (f. सा)</i> Hard, firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीकस|कीकसं|कीकसः
कीकस <i>(II) n.</i> A bone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीचक|कीचकः
कीचक <i>n.</i> 1. A hollow bamboo; 2. a whistling bamboo, स कीचकैर्मारुतपूर्णरंध्रैः R.ii.12, 73, K.S.i.8; 3. name of a people; 4. name of the commander-in-chief of king Virāṭa. (See App. II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

