कीट|कीटः
कीट <i>m.</i> 1. A worm, an insect, Rt.ii.13; 2. a term expressive of contempt (generally at the end of compounds, e.g. पक्षिकीट ‘a miserable bird.’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=190-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

