कुट्टाक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Who or what divides or cuts, इभकुंभकूटकुट्टाकपाणिकुलिशस्य हरेः प्रमादः M.M.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=193-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

