कुथा
कुथा <i>f.</i> 1. A painted cloth serving as an elephant’s housings; 2. a carpet in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=194-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्दार|कुद्दारः
