कुंत|कुन्त|कुंतः|कुन्तः
कुंत <i>m.</i> 1. A lance, a barbed dart, विरहिनिकृंतनकुंतमखाकृतिकेतकिदंतुरिताशे Git.G.i.; 2. a small animal, an inseet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=194-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंतल|कुन्तल|कुंतलः|कुन्तलः
कुंतल <i>(I) m.</i> 1. The hair of the head, a lock of hair, व्यालोलकुंतलकलापवतीं स्मरामि Ch.P.6; 2. a drinking cup; 3. a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=194-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंतल|कुन्तल|कुंतलः|कुन्तलः
कुंतल <i>(II) m. pl.</i> Name of a country and its inhabitants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=194-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंति|कुन्ति|कुंतिः|कुन्तिः
कुंति <i>(I) m. pl.</i> The name of a country and its people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=194-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंति|कुन्ति|कुंतिः|कुन्तिः
कुंति <i>(II) m.</i> Name of a king, son of क्रथ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=194-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंतिसुता
कुंति-सुता <i>[or कुंती] f.</i> Kuntī, the mother of the Pāṇḍavas and the adopted daughter of king Kunti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=194-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंथ्|कुन्थ्
कुंथ् <i>vi. 9P (pres. कुथ्नाति)</i> 1. To suffer pain; 2. to cling to; 3. to embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=194-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंद|कुन्द|कुंदं|कुंदः|कुन्दः
कुंद <i>(I) m.n.</i> A kind of jasmine, प्रातः कुंदप्रसवशिथिलं जीवितं धारयेथाः Megh.ii.50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=194-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंद|कुन्द|कुंदं|कुंदः|कुन्दः
