कुंदु|कुन्दु|कुंदुः|कुन्दुः
कुंदु <i>m.</i> A rat, a mouse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=195-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुप्
कुप् <i>vi. 4P (pp. कुपित)</i> 1. To be excited, to get strength, e.g. दोषाः प्रकुप्यंति; 2. to be angry (generally with the dative of the person who is the object of anger, but sometimes with the acc. or gen. also), चुकोप तस्मै स भृशम् R.iii.56, Sr.T.8.With अति-, to be angry, Bt.xv.55.With परि-, to be angry.With प्र-, 1. to be excited, to get strength; 2. to be angry, निमित्तमुद्दिश्य हि यः प्रकुप्यति ध्रुवं स तस्यापगमे प्रशाम्यति Panch.i.With सम्-, to be angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=195-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपिंद|कुपिन्द|कुपिंदः|कुपिन्दः
कुपिंद <i>m.</i> See कुविंद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=195-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपिनिन्
कुपिनिन् <i>m.</i> A fisherman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=195-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपिनी
कुपिनी <i>f.</i> A kind of net for catching small fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=195-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपूय|कुपूयः
कुपूय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Despised mean, contemptible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=195-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपूया
कुपूय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Despised mean, contemptible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=195-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

