कू <i>f.</i> A female imp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=199-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूच|कूचः
कूच <i>m.</i> The female breast, especially that of a young or unmarried woman. See कुच.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=199-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूचिका
कूचिका <i>f.</i> 1. A small brush of hair, a pencil; 2. a key.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूची
कूचिका <i>f.</i> 1. A small brush of hair, a pencil; 2. a key.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूज्
कूज् <i>vi. 1P (pp. कूजित)</i> To make any inarticulate sound, to coo, to warble, चुकूज कूले कलहंसमंडली Na.i.127, पुंस्कोकिलो यन्मधुरं चुकूज K.S.iii.32, Rt.vi.22, R.ii.12.With नि-, परि-, or वि-, to coo, to make an indistinct noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूज|कूजः
कूज <i>m.</i> 1. Cooing, warbling; 2. the rattling of wheels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजन|कूजनं
कूजन <i>n.</i> 1. Cooing, warbling; 2. the rattling of wheels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजित|कूजितं
कूजित <i>n.</i> 1. Cooing, warbling; 2. the rattling of wheels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूट|कूटः
कूट <i>(I) a. (f. टा)</i> 1. False, e.g. कूटाः स्युर्पूर्वसाक्षिणः; 2. immoveable, steady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटा
कूट <i>(I) a. (f. टा)</i> 1. False, e.g. कूटाः स्युर्पूर्वसाक्षिणः; 2. immoveable, steady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूट|कूटः
कूट <i>(II) m.n.</i> 1. The bone of the forehead with its projections, the crown of the head; 2. a prominence in general; 3. a horn; 4. end, corner, Yaj.iii.96; 5. a summit or peak of a mountain, शैलादाशु त्रिनयनवृषोत्खातकूटान्निवृत्तः Megh.ii.50, R.iv.71; 6. head, chief; 7. a heap, a multitude, e.g. अभ्रकूट ‘a multitude of clouds,’ अन्नकूट ‘a heap of food’; 8. a hammer, an iron-mallet; 9. a plough-share, the body of a plough; 10. a trap for catching deer; 11. a concealed weapon, as a dagger in a woollen case or a sword in a stick; 12. illusion, fraud; 13. a roguish scheme, a trick; 14. a knotty point, a puzzling question; 15. untruth, falsehood; 16. a water-jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूट|कूटः
कूट <i>(III) m.</i> 1. A house, a dwelling; 2. an epithet of Agastya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटाक्ष|कूटाक्षः
कूट-अक्ष <i>m.</i> a loaded or false die, कूटाक्षोपधिदेविनः Yaj.ii.202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटागार|कूटागारं
कूट-अगार <i>n.</i> an apartment on the top of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटार्थ|कूटार्थः
कूट-अर्थ <i>m.</i> ambiguity of meaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटार्थभाषा
कूट-अर्थ˚भाषा <i>f.</i> a tale, a fiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटोपाय|कूटोपायः
कूट-उपाय <i>m.</i> a trick, a stratagem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकार|कूटकारः
कूट-कार <i>m.</i> a rogue, a false witness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकृत्
कूट-कृत् <i>(I) a.</i> 1. cheating, bribing; 2. forging a document, Yaj.ii.70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकृत्
कूट-कृत् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. a man of the writer caste (कायस्थ); 2. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकार्षापण|कूटकार्षापणः
