कूटपाकल|कूटपाकलः
कूट-पाकल <i>m.</i> bilious fever to which eleplants are subject, अचिरेण वैकृतविवर्तदारुणः कलभं कठोर इव कूटपाकलः M.M.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटपालक|कूटपालकः
