कूण्
कूण् <i>(II) vi. 10Ā (pp. कूणित; pres. कूणयते)</i> To contract, to close.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूणिका
