कूद्दाल|कूद्दालः
कूद्दाल <i>m.</i> Mountain ebony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूप|कूपः
