कूर्च|कूर्चं|कूर्चः|कूर्च्च|कूर्च्चं|कूर्च्चः
कूर्च <i>(I) m.n.</i> 1. A bunch, a bundle; 2. a handful of kuśa grass; 3. a peacock’s feather; 4. the hair between the eyebrows; 5. beard, पूरयितव्यमनेन चित्रफलकं लंबकूर्चानां तापसानां कदंबैः Sak.vi.; 8. the tip of the thumb and the middle finger brought in contact; 7. a brush; 8. deceit, fraud; 9. boasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=200-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्च|कूर्चं|कूर्चः|कूर्च्च|कूर्च्चं|कूर्च्चः
