कोट्ट|कोट्टं|कोट्टः
कोट्ट <i>m.</i> A fort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=210-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोट्टवी
कोट्टवी <i>f.</i> 1. A naked woman with dishevelled hair; 2. an epithet of the goddess Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=210-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोट्टार|कोट्टारः
कोट्टार <i>m.</i> 1. A fortified town, a stronghold; 2. the stairs of a pond; 3. a libertine; 4. a well, a pond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=210-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोण|कोणः
कोण <i>m.</i> 1. A corner, an angle, युक्तमेतत्र तु पुनः कोणं नयनपद्मयोः Bh.V.ii.173; 2. an intermediate point of the compass; 3. the bow of a lute, a fiddle-stick; 4. the sharp edge of a weapon; 5. a stick, a club; 6. a name of the planet Mars; 7. a name of the planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=210-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोणकुण|कोणकुणः
