कोपवश|कोपवशः
कोप-वश <i>m.</i> subjection to anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=210-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपवेग|कोपवेगः
कोप-वेग <i>m.</i> violence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=210-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपन|कोपनः
