कोपिन्
कोपिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Angry, सत्यमेवासि यदि सुदति मयि कोपिनी Git.G.x.; 2. causing anger; 3. causing disorder of the humours of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=210-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोपिनी
