कोरक|कोरकं|कोरकः
कोरक <i>m.n.</i> 1. A bud, an unblown flower, संनद्धं यदपि स्थितं कुरुबकं तत्कोरकावस्था Sak.vi.; 2. any thing partially developed but not full grown, राधायाः स्तनकोरकोपरि चलन्नेत्री हरिः पातु वः Git.G.xii.; 3. the fibres of the stock of a lotus; 4. a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=210-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोरदूष|कोरदूषः
कोरदूष <i>m.</i> The same as कोद्रव q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=211-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोरित
कोरित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Budded, sprouted; 2. ground, pounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=211-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोरिता
