कोल|कोलं|कोलः
कोल <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A hog, Yaj.iii.273; 2. a raft, a boat; 3. the breast; 4. the haunch, the hip, the lap; 5. an embrace; 6. the planet Saturn; 7. name of a degraded tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=211-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

