कौटिल्य <i>(I) m.</i> An epithet of Cāṇakya, a celebrated writer on civil polity, and a prominent character in the Mudrārākshasa, कौटिल्यः कुटिलमतिः स एषः Mud.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=212-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौटिल्य|कौटिल्यं|कौटिल्यः
