कौमुदी
कौमुदी <i>f.</i> 1. Moonlight (lit.), शशिना सह याति कौमुदी K.S.iv.33, anything causing delight (fig.) या कौमुदी नयनयोर्भवतः सुजन्मा M.M.i., त्वमस्य लोकस्य च नेत्रकौमुदी K.S.v.71; 2. the full-moon day in kārtīka; 3. the full-moon day in Āśvina; 4. festivity in general; 5. a festive day on which temples streets, houses &c. are illuminated; 6. elucidation (at the end of titles of works, e.g. सांख्यतत्वकौमुदी, सिद्धांतकौनुदी, व्यंग्यार्थकौमुदी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=212-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

