कौलीन|कौलीनं|कौलीनः
कौलीन <i>(III) n.</i> 1. An evil report, a scandal, कौलीममात्माश्रयमाचचक्षे R.xiv.; 36, 84, मा कौलीनादसितनयने मय्यविश्वासिनी भूः Megh.ii.49; 2. an improper act, bad conduct, ख्याते तस्मिन् वितमसि कुले जन्म कौलीनमेतत् Ve.ii.; 3. a combat of animals; 4. war, battle; 5. The pudenda; 6. high birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=213-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

