क्रांति|क्रान्ति|क्रांतिः|क्रान्तिः
क्रांति <i>f.</i> 1. Going, proceeding; 2. surpassing, attacking, overcoming; 3. a step; 4. declination of a planet; 5. the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रांतिकक्ष|क्रान्तिकक्ष|क्रान्तिकक्षः
क्रांति-कक्ष <i>m.</i> the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रांतिमंडल|क्रान्तिमण्डल
क्रांति-मंडल <i>n.</i> the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रांतिवृत्त|क्रान्तिवृत्त
क्रांति-वृत्त <i>n.</i> the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रांतिपात|क्रान्तिपात|क्रान्तिपातः
क्रांति-पात <i>m.</i> the equinoctial points or nodes of the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रांतिवलय|क्रान्तिवलय|क्रान्तिवलयः
क्रांति-वलय <i>m.</i> 1. the ecliptic; 2. the tropical zone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रायक|क्रायकः
क्राय(यि)क <i>m.</i> 1. A purchaser; 2. a trader, a dealer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रायिक|क्रायिकः
क्राय(यि)क <i>m.</i> 1. A purchaser; 2. a trader, a dealer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिमि|क्रिमिः
क्रिमि <i>m.</i> 1. A worm; 2. an insect. See कृमि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिमिज|क्रिमिजं
क्रिमि-ज <i>n.</i> aloewood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिमिशैल|क्रिमिशैलः
क्रिमि-शैल <i>m.</i> an ant-hill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिया
क्रिया <i>f.</i> 1. Execution, performance, प्रत्युक्तं हि प्रणयिषु सतामीप्सितार्थक्रियैव Megh.ii.51; 2. an act, a business, an undertaking, M.ii.4; 3. activity, bodily action, labour; 4. worship; 5. teaching, education, क्रिया हि वस्तूपहिता प्रसीदति R.iii.29; 6. knowledge, शिष्टा क्रिया कस्यचिदात्मसंस्था Mal.i.; 7. practice, as op. to शास्त्र (theory); 8. medical treatment; 9. a literary work, शृणुत मनोभिरवहितैः क्रियामिमां कालिदासस्य Vikr.i.; 10. a purificatory rite, a religious rite or ceremony; 11. an expiatory rite; 12. ceremony of offering oblations to the deceased ancestors (श्राद्ध); 13. motion; 14. motion considered as one of the seven categories of the Vaiśeṣikas. See under कर्मन्; 15. judicial investigation by human means or ordeals (in law); 16. action or the general idea expressed by a verb (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियान्वित
क्रिया-अन्वित <i>a.</i> practising ritual observances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापवर्ग|क्रियापवर्गः
क्रिया-अपवर्ग <i>m.</i> 1. end of an affair, execution of a task, क्रियापवर्गेष्वनुजीवितात् कृताः Kir.i.14; 2. liberation from ceremonial acts, absolution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाभ्युपगम|क्रियाभ्युपगमः
क्रिया-अभ्युपगम <i>m.</i> special compact or agreement, क्रियाभ्युपगमात्वेतत् बीजार्थं ययत्प्रदीयते M.ix.53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावसन्न|क्रियावसन्नः
क्रिया-अवसन्न <i>a.</i> one who loses a law-suit through the statements of the witnesses &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियेंद्रिय|क्रियेन्द्रिय|क्रियेन्द्रियं
क्रिया-इंद्रिय <i>n.</i> the same as कर्मेंद्रिय q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाकलाप|क्रियाकलापः
क्रिया-कलाप <i>m.</i> 1. the body of ceremonies enjoined in the Hindu religious law; 2. all the particulars of any business.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाकार|क्रियाकारः
क्रिया-कार <i>m.</i> 1. an agent, a performer; 2. a beginner, a fresh student; 3. an agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाद्वेषिन्
क्रिया-द्वेषिन् <i>m.</i> a witness whose testimony is hurtful to the cause (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियानिर्देश|क्रियानिर्देशः|क्रियानिर्द्देश
क्रिया-निर्देश <i>m.</i> evidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापथ|क्रियापथः
क्रिया-पथ <i>m.</i> mode of medical treatment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापद
क्रिया-पद <i>n.</i> a verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापर
क्रिया-पर <i>a.</i> diligent in the performance of one’s duty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापाद|क्रियापादः
क्रिया-पाद <i>m.</i> the third division of a suit at law comprising witnesses, documents, and other proof advanced by the plaintiff or complainant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियायोग|क्रियायोगः
क्रिया-योग <i>m.</i> 1. connection with a verb; 2. the employment of expedients or instruments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियालोप|क्रियालोपः
क्रिया-लोप <i>m.</i> omission or discontinuance of any of the essential ceremonies of the Hindu religion, क्रियालोपाद् वृषलत्वं गताः M.x.43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावत्|क्रियावन्त्
क्रिया-वत् <i>a.</i> engaged in actual work, or practice, e.g. यः क्रियावान् स पंडितः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावश|क्रियावशः
क्रिया-वश <i>m.</i> necessity, necessary influence of acts done or to be done.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावाचक
क्रिया-वाचक, -वाचिन् <i>a.</i> expressing any action, as a verbal noun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावाचिन्
क्रिया-वाचक, -वाचिन् <i>a.</i> expressing any action, as a verbal noun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावादिन्
क्रिया-वादिन् <i>m.</i> a plaintiff, a complainant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाविधि|क्रियाविधिः
क्रिया-विधि <i>m.</i> a rule of action, mode of performing any rite, M.ix.220.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाविशेषण
क्रिया-विशेषण <i>n.</i> 1. an adverb; 2. a predicative adjective.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियासंक्रांति
क्रिया-संक्रांति <i>f.</i> teaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियासमभिहार|क्रियासमभिहारः
क्रिया-समभिहार <i>m.</i> the repetition of any act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्री
क्री <i>vt. 9U (pp. क्रीत)</i> 1. To buy, to purchase, महता पुण्यपण्येन क्रीतेयं कायनौस्त्वया Sant.S.iii.1, क्रयक्रीतं च मैथुनम् Hit.i., M.viii.222; 2. to barter, to exchange, e.g. कच्चित्सहस्रैर्मूर्खाणामेकं क्रीणाति पंडितम्.With आ-, to buy.With निस्-, to buy off, to redeem.With परि-, 1. (in the Atm.) to buy, संभोगाय परिक्रीतः कर्तास्मि तव नाप्रियम् Bt.viii.72; 2. to hire, to purchase for a time, (with inst. or dat.), शतेन शताय वा परिक्रीतः S.K.; 3. return, to repay, क्रेतेनापकृतं वायोः परिक्रीणानमुत्थितम् Bt.viii.8.With वि-, 1. to sell (in the Atm.) काचमूल्येन विक्रीतो हंत चिंतामणिर्मया Sant.S.i.12, M.viii.222; 2. to barter, to exchauge, ना कस्माच्छांडिलीमाता विक्रीणाति तिलैस्तिलान् Panch.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=215-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीड्
क्रीड् <i>vi. 1P (pp. क्रीडित)</i> 1. To play, to amuse oneself, वानराः क्रीडितुमारब्धाः Panch.i.; 2. to gamble, बहुविधं द्यूतं क्रीडतः Mrich.ii., नाक्षैः क्रीडेत्कदाचिद्धि M.iv.74; 30. trifle with, एवमाशाग्रहग्रस्तैः क्रीडंति धनिनोऽर्थिभिः K.Pr.vii., अतिप्रसक्तैः पुरुषैर्यतस्ताः क्रीडंति काकैरिव लूनपक्षैः Panch.i.With सम्-, 1. (Atm.) to play, to amuse oneself, साधु संक्रीडमानानि पश्य वृंदानि पक्षिणाम् Bt.xii.10; 2. (Par.) to make noise, संक्रीडंति चक्रम् S.K. (The root is in the Atm. with the prepositions अनु, सम्, परि and आ prefixed to it).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीड|क्रीडः
क्रीड <i>m.</i> 1. Sport, pastime, pleasure; 2. jest, joke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडन|क्रीडनं
क्रीडन <i>n.</i> 1. Playing, sporting; 2. a plaything, a toy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनक|क्रीडनकं|क्रीडनकः
क्रीडनक <i>m.n.</i> A plaything, a toy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनीय|क्रीडनीयं
क्रीडनीय <i>n.</i> A plaything, a toy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनीयक|क्रीडनीयकं
क्रीडनीयक <i>n.</i> A plaything, a toy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडा
क्रीडा <i>f.</i> 1. Sport, pastime, pleasure, तोयक्रीडानिरतयुवतिस्नानतिक्तैर्मरुद्भिः Megh.i.33, 61; 2. jest, joke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडागृह
क्रीडा-गृह <i>n.</i> a pleasure-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडाशैल|क्रीडाशैलः
क्रीडा-शैल <i>m.</i> an artificial hill as a pleasure resort, क्रीडाशैलः कनककदलीवेष्टनप्रेक्षणीयः Megh.ii.14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडानारी
क्रीडा-नारी <i>f.</i> a prostitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडाकोप|क्रीडाकोपः
क्रीडा-कोप <i>m.</i> feigned anger, Am.S.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडामयूर|क्रीडामयूरः
क्रीडा-मयूर <i>m.</i> a peacock kept for pleasure, R.xvi.14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडारत्न|क्रीडारत्नं
क्रीडा-रत्न <i>n.</i> Rati, wife of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीत|क्रीतः
क्रीत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Bought, (pp. of क्री q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीता
क्रीत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Bought, (pp. of क्री q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीत|क्रीतः
क्रीत <i>(II) m.</i> One of the twelve kinds of sons amongst the Hindus. He is a son purchased from his natural parents (क्रीतश्च ताभ्यां विक्रीतः Yaj.ii.131, M.ix.174).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीतानुशय|क्रीतानुशयः
क्रीत-अनुशय <i>m.</i> returning a thing purchased to the vendor admissible in some cases by law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुंच्|क्रुञ्च्
क्रुंच् <i>m.</i> A curlew, a heron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुंच|क्रुञ्च|क्रुंचः|क्रुञ्चः
क्रुंच् <i>m.</i> A curlew, a heron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुध्
क्रुध् <i>vi. (but with a preposition vt., e.g. कृध्यंतं न प्रतिकृध्येत् M.iv.48) 4P (pp. कृद्ध)</i> To be angry, (with the dat. of the person who is the object of anger, e.g. हरये क्रुध्यति); but sometimes with certain prepositions also, e.g. पुत्रस्योपैर् क्रुद्धः or न मां प्रति क्रुद्धो गुरुः).With प्रति-, to be angry in return, M.iv.48.With सम्-, to get angry with, संक्रुध्यति मृषा किं त्वं दिदृक्षुं माम् Bt.viii.76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुध्
क्रुध् <i>f.</i> Anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुश्
क्रुश् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pp. क्रुष्ट)</i> 1. To cry, to weep, to lament, क्रोशंत्यस्तं कपिस्त्रियः Bt.vi.124; 2. to cry out, to yell, to call out, अतीव चक्रोश जीवनाशं ननाश च Bt.xiv.31.With अनु-, to pity, to take compassion on.With अभि-, to bewail.With आ-, 1. to cry, to cry aloud, e.g. अये गौरीनाथ त्रिपुरहर शंभो त्रिनयन प्रसीदेत्याक्रोशन्; 2. to revile, to abuse, शतं ब्राह्मणमाक्रुश्य क्षत्रियो दंडमर्हति M.viii.267.With परि-, to lament.With प्रत्या-, to revile in turn.With वि-, 1. to call aloud, to cry out, Bt.xvi.32, xiv.42; 2. to utter, (with an acc.); 3. to call out to, (with an acc.); 4. to resound.With व्या-, to lament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुष्ट|क्रुष्टं
क्रुष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Cried out; 2. called out to, (pp. of क्रुश् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुष्टा
क्रुष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Cried out; 2. called out to, (pp. of क्रुश् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुष्ट|क्रुष्टं
क्रुष्ट <i>(II) n.</i> Crying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूर|क्रूरः
क्रूर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Cruel, wicked, hard-hearted, तस्याभिषेकसंभारं कल्पितं क्रूरनिश्चया R.xii.4, Megh.ii.42; 2. hard, rough; 3. formidable, terrible, destructive; 4. wounded, hurt; 5. strong; 6. hot, sharp, disagreeable, M.ii.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरा
क्रूर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Cruel, wicked, hard-hearted, तस्याभिषेकसंभारं कल्पितं क्रूरनिश्चया R.xii.4, Megh.ii.42; 2. hard, rough; 3. formidable, terrible, destructive; 4. wounded, hurt; 5. strong; 6. hot, sharp, disagreeable, M.ii.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=216-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

