क्वाण|क्वाणः
क्वण <i>m.</i> 1. A sound in general; 2. the tone of any musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वथ्
क्वथ् <i>vt. 1P (pp. क्वथित)</i> 1. To boil, to decoct; 2. to digest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वथ|क्वथः
क्वथ <i>m.</i> A decoction, a solution prepared with a gentle heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

