क्वथ <i>m.</i> A decoction, a solution prepared with a gentle heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वाचित्क
क्वाचित्क <i>a. (f. त्की)</i> Met with occasionally, rare, uncommon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्वाचित्की
क्वाचित्क <i>a. (f. त्की)</i> Met with occasionally, rare, uncommon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष|क्षः
