क्षण्
क्षण्(न्) <i>vt. 8U (pp. क्षत)</i> 1. To hurt, to injure, इमां हृदि व्यायतपातमक्षणोत् K.S.v.54; 2. to break, (धनुः) त्वं किलानमितपूर्वाक्षणोः R.xi.72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षन्
क्षण्(न्) <i>vt. 8U (pp. क्षत)</i> 1. To hurt, to injure, इमां हृदि व्यायतपातमक्षणोत् K.S.v.54; 2. to break, (धनुः) त्वं किलानमितपूर्वाक्षणोः R.xi.72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षण|क्षणं|क्षणः
क्षण <i>m.n.</i> 1. An instant, a measure of time equal to 4/5 of a second, क्षणमात्रमृषिस्तस्यौ सुप्तमीन इव ह्रदः R.i.73, ii.60, Megh.i.26, M.viii.344; 2. leisure, अहमपि लब्धक्षणः स्वगेहं गच्छामि Mal.i.; 3. a fit moment, an opportunity, रहो नास्ति क्षणो नास्ति नास्ति प्रार्थयिता नरः Panch.i., Megh.i.62; 4. a festival, joy; 5. an auspicious or lucky moment; 6. dependence, servitude; 7. the centre, the middle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षणांतरे|क्षणान्तरे
क्षण-अंतरे <i>ind.</i> the next moment, after a little while.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षणक्षेप|क्षणक्षेपः
