क्षणविध्वंसिन्
क्षण-विध्वंसिन् <i>m.</i> a sect of atheistic philosophers who deny the continued identity of any part of nature and maintain that the universe perishes and undergoes a new creation every instant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

