क्षणिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Having leisure; 2. momentary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

