क्षणिनी <i>f.</i> Night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

