क्षता
क्षत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Wounded, hurt, injured, bitten, (pp. of क्षण् q.v.), R.i.28, ii.56, iii.53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत|क्षतं
