क्षतारि
क्षत-अरि <i>a.</i> victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

