क्षत-उदर <i>n.</i> dysentery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षतकास|क्षतकासः
क्षत-कास <i>m.</i> a cough produced by injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षतज|क्षतजं
