क्षति|क्षतिः
क्षति <i>f.</i> 1. Injury, wound; 2. damage, loss, e.g. का नः क्षतिः; 3. destruction, cutting, विस्रब्धं क्रियतां वराहततिभिर्मुस्ताक्षतिः पल्वले Sak.ii.; 4. decay, diminution, प्रतापक्षतिशीतलाः K.S.ii.24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्तृ
क्षत्तृ <i>m.</i> 1. One who cuts or carves anything; 2. an attendant, a doorkeeper; 3. charioteer; 4. a man born of a Śūdra man and Kṣatriya woman; 5. the son of a female slave, (e.g. विदुर); 6. a fish; 7. Brahman (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्र|क्षत्त्रं|क्षत्त्रः|क्षत्रं|क्षत्रः
क्षत्र <i>m.n.</i> 1. Dominion, supremacy, might; 2. a man of the kshatriya caste, or the kshatriya caste (collectively), e.g. क्षतात्किल त्रायत इत्युदग्रः क्षत्रस्य शब्दो भुवनेषु रूढः R.ii.53, M.ix.322, R.xi.69, 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

