क्षत्रबंधु|क्षत्रबन्धु|क्षत्त्रबन्धुः|क्षत्रबन्धुः
क्षत्र-बंधु <i>m.</i> 1. a Kṣatriya by caste, M.ii.38; 2. a vile Kṣatriya (as a term of abuse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

