क्षत्रियका
क्षत्रियका <i>f.</i> A woman of the kshatriya caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

