क्षत्रियका <i>f.</i> A woman of the kshatriya caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्रियाणी
क्षत्रियाणी <i>f.</i> 1. A woman of the kshatriya caste; 2. the wife of a Kṣatriya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=218-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षत्रियी
क्षत्रियी <i>f.</i> The wife of a kshatriya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=219-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षंतृ|क्षन्तृ
