क्षर्
क्षर् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pp. क्षरित)</i> 1. To flow, to glide; 2. to stream forth, to pour out, to run, Bt.ix.8; 3. to drop, to trickle, to ooze; 4. to perish, to become useless, to have no effect, यज्ञोऽनृतेन क्षरति तपः क्षरति विस्मयात् M.iv.237; 5. to slip from, to be deprived of.With वि-, to dissolve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=219-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

