क्षुर-प्र <i>m.</i> 1. an arrow with a sharp horse-shoe-shaped head, निशितैः क्षुरप्रैः R.ix.62, xi.29; 2. a sort of hoe, a weeding spade; 3. a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरमर्दिन्|क्षुरमर्द्दिन्
क्षुर-मदिन्, -मुंडिन् <i>m.</i> a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरमुंडिन्|क्षुरमुण्डिन्
क्षुर-मदिन्, -मुंडिन् <i>m.</i> a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरिका
क्षुरिका <i>f.</i> A knife, a dagger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरी
क्षुरिका <i>f.</i> A knife, a dagger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरिणी
क्षुरिणी <i>f.</i> The wife of a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरिन्
क्षुरिन् <i>m.</i> A barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्ल|क्षुल्लः
क्षुल्ल <i>a. (f. ल्ला)</i> Small, little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्ला
क्षुल्ल <i>a. (f. ल्ला)</i> Small, little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्लतात|क्षुल्लतातः
क्षुल्ल-तात <i>m.</i> the younger brother of a father. Cf. खुल्ल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्लक|क्षुल्लकः
क्षुल्लक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Little, minute; 2. low, vile; 3. poor; 4. wicked, malicious; 5. young.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्लका
क्षुल्लक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Little, minute; 2. low, vile; 3. poor; 4. wicked, malicious; 5. young.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्र|क्षेत्रं
क्षेत्र <i>n.</i> 1. Landed property, soil, a field, e.g. चीयते बालिशस्यापि सत्क्षेत्रपतिता कृषिः Mud.i., M.x.114; 2. place, region, कपटशतमयं क्षेत्रमप्रत्ययानाम् Bhartr.i.77, Sant.S.ii.3, Megh.i.16; 3. a sacred spot, a place of pilgrimage, क्षेत्रं क्षुत्रप्रधनंपिशुनं कौरवं तद्भजेथाः Megh.i.46, Bg.i.1; 4. an enclosed spot of ground; 5. fertile soil; 6. place of origin; 7. the body considered as the abode of the soul, योगिनो यं विचिन्वंति क्षेत्राभ्यंतरवर्तिनम् K.S.vi.77, Bg.xiii.1, 2; 8. the mind; 9. a wife, तौ तु जातौ परक्षेत्रे M.iii.175; 10. a house, a town; 11. a plain figure (in Geometry), a diagram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्राधिदेवता
क्षेत्र-अधिदेवता <i>f.</i> the tutelary deity of any consecrated piece of ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्राजीव|क्षेत्राजीवः
क्षेत्र-आजीव, -कर <i>m.</i> a cultivator, a husbandman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रकर|क्षेत्रकरः
क्षेत्र-आजीव, -कर <i>m.</i> a cultivator, a husbandman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रगणित
क्षेत्र-गणित <i>n.</i> Geometry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रगत
क्षेत्र-गत <i>a.</i> geometrical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रोपपत्ति
क्षेत्र-उपपत्ति <i>f.</i> geometrical proof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज|क्षेत्रजः
क्षेत्र-ज <i>(I) a.</i> 1. produced in a field; 2. born from the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज|क्षेत्रजः
क्षेत्र-ज <i>(II) m.</i> the offspring of the wife by a kinsman duly appointed to raise up issue to the husband, M.ix.167, Yaj.i.69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रजात
क्षेत्र-जात <i>a.</i> begotten on the wife of another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज्ञ|क्षेत्रज्ञः
क्षेत्र-ज्ञ <i>(I) a.</i> 1. knowing localities; 2. clever, dexterous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज्ञ|क्षेत्रज्ञः
क्षेत्र-ज्ञ <i>(II) m.</i> 1. the soul; 2. the supreme soul, Bg.xii.2; 3. a libertine; 4. a husbandman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रपति|क्षेत्रपतिः
क्षेत्र-पति <i>m.</i> a land-owner, a landlord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रपद
क्षेत्र-पद <i>n.</i> a place sacred to a deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रपाल|क्षेत्रपालः
क्षेत्र-पाल <i>m.</i> 1. a man employed to guard a field; 2. a deity protecting fields; 3. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रफल
क्षेत्र-फल <i>n.</i> the superficial contents of a figure (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रभक्ति|क्षेत्रभक्तिः
क्षेत्र-भक्ति <i>f.</i> the division of a field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रभूमि|क्षेत्रभूमिः
क्षेत्र-भूमि <i>f.</i> cultivated land.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रराशि|क्षेत्रराशिः
क्षेत्र-राशि <i>m.</i> the quantity represented by geometrical figures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रविद्
क्षेत्र-विद् <i>(I) a.</i> See क्षेत्रज्ञ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रविद्
क्षेत्र-विद् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. a husbandman; 2. a sage who possesses spiritual knowledge, K.S.iii.50; 3. the soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रस्थ
क्षेत्र-स्थ <i>a.</i> residing at a sacred place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिक|क्षेत्रिकः
क्षेत्रिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Relating to a field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिकी
क्षेत्रिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Relating to a field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिक|क्षेत्रिकः
क्षेत्रिक <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A farmer, M.viii.241, 243; 2. a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिन्
क्षेत्रिन् <i>m.</i> 1. An agriculturist, Yaj.ii.161; 2. a husband; 3. the soul; 4. the supreme soul, Bg.xiii.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=222-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिय|क्षेत्रियं|क्षेत्रियः
क्षेत्रिय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Relating to a field; 2. curable in a future body, i.e. incurable in the present life, e.g. आवेदयति नितांतं क्षेत्रियरोगं सखि हृदंतः K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिया
क्षेत्रिय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> 1. Relating to a field; 2. curable in a future body, i.e. incurable in the present life, e.g. आवेदयति नितांतं क्षेत्रियरोगं सखि हृदंतः K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिय|क्षेत्रियं|क्षेत्रियः
क्षेत्रिय <i>(II) n.</i> 1. An organic disease; 2. meadow, grass, pasturage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिय|क्षेत्रियं|क्षेत्रियः
क्षेत्रिय <i>(III) m.</i> An adulterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेप|क्षेपः
क्षेप <i>m.</i> 1. Throwing, tossing, moving, भ्रूक्षेपमात्रानुमितप्रवेशाम् K.S.iii.60, Megh.i.47; 2. sending, striking down; 3. transgressing; 4. passing away (time), delay, dilatoriness; 5. insult, abuse, क्षेपं करोति चेद्दण्ड्यः Yaj.ii.204; 6. disrespect, contempt; 7. pride, haughtiness; 8. nosegay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपक|क्षेपकः
क्षेपक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. A thrower, a sender; 2. interpolated; 3. abusive, disrespectful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपका
क्षेपक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. A thrower, a sender; 2. interpolated; 3. abusive, disrespectful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपक|क्षेपकः
क्षेपक <i>(II) m.</i> A spurious or interpolated passage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपण|क्षेपणं
क्षेपण <i>n.</i> 1. Throwing, sending; 2. spending (as time); 3. omitting; 4. abusing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपणि|क्षेपणिः
क्षेपणि <i>f.</i> 1. An oar; 2. a net for fishing; 3. a sling or any instrument with which missiles are thrown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेम|क्षेमं|क्षेमः
क्षेम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Conferring happiness, ease or benefit, धार्तराष्ट्रा रणे हन्युस्तन्मे क्षेमतरं भवेत् Bg.i.45; 2. prosperous, secure, happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमा
क्षेम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Conferring happiness, ease or benefit, धार्तराष्ट्रा रणे हन्युस्तन्मे क्षेमतरं भवेत् Bg.i.45; 2. prosperous, secure, happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेम|क्षेमं|क्षेमः
क्षेम <i>(II) m.n.</i> 1. Safety, peace, happiness, well-being, दधतु वः क्षेमं कटाक्षोर्मयः Git.G.iii., वितन्वति क्षेममदेवमातृकाश्चिराय तस्मिन् कुरवश्च्कासते Kir.i.17, M.ii.127; 2. preserving, protecting, R.xv.6; 3. keeping what is acquired, Cf. योग; 4. final beatitude, eternal happiness; 5. a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमकर|क्षेमकरः
क्षेमकर <i>a.</i> propitious, causing peace and security.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमंकर|क्षेमङ्कर|क्षेमङ्करः
क्षेमकर <i>a.</i> propitious, causing peace and security.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमिन्
क्षेमिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> Safe, secure, happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमिणी
क्षेमिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> Safe, secure, happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षै
क्षै <i>vi. 1P (pp. क्षात; pres. क्षायति)</i> To wane, to waste away, to become emaciated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षैण्य|क्षैण्यं
क्षैण्य <i>n.</i> 1. Destruction; 2. leanness, slenderness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षैत्र|क्षैत्रं
क्षैत्र <i>n.</i> 1. A multitude of fields; 2. a field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=223-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोड|क्षोडः
