खन्
खन् <i>vt. 1U (pp. खात; pass. खन्यते or खायते)</i> To dig up, to delve, to excavate, M.ii.218, Rt.i.17.With अभि-, to dig.With उद्-, to dig out, to root out, to eradicate (lit. and fig.), R.iv.37, Bt.xii.5, xv.55, Megh.i.52, R.iv.33, 36, xiv.73.With नि-, to dig, to dig up; 2. to bury, वसुधायां निचख्नतुः R.xii.30, Yaj.iii.1, Bt.xvi.22; 3. to fix, to implant, to pierce, निचखान शरं भुजे R.iii.55, xii.90, Bt.iii.8.With परि-, to dig round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=226-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

