ख्या
ख्या <i>vt. or vi. 2P (in the non-conjugational tenses U) (pp. ख्यात)</i> 1. To tell, to communicate; (with the dat. of the person addressed); 2. to be known.With अभि-, to be known, Yaj.iii.301.With आ-, 1. to tell, to narrate, to communicate, इदमाख्याहि शतशः Ve.vi., तथेति प्रतिपन्नाय नृपायाचख्यौ R.xv.72, Bg.xi.31, xviii.63, R.xii.42, 91, ii.11; 2. to call, to denominate, R.x.21.With परि-, to be well known.With प्र-, to be well known.With प्रत्या-, 1. to decline, to refuse, to reject; 2. to deny; 3. to interdict; 4. to surpass, to excel.With वि-, to be famous.With व्या-, 1. to explain, e.g. व्याख्यातुं कुशलाः केचित् ग्रंथान्; 2. to tell, to communicate, Bt.xiv.113; 3. to call, to name, e.g. (विद्वद्व्रूंदैः) व्याख्याता सा विद्युन्माला.With सम्-, 1. to enumerate, to count, to sum up, to calculate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=228-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्या
ख्या <i>Pass. (ख्यायते)</i> to be known, to be named, Bt.vi.97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=228-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

