गाह्
गाह् <i>vt. 1Ā (pp. गाढ or गाहित)</i> 1. To dive into, to bathe, to plunge into, गाहंतां महिषा निपानसलिलं शृंगैर्मुहुस्ताडितम् Sak.ii., जगाहिरेऽंबुधि नागाः Bt.xiv.67; 2. to penetrate, to enter deeply into, to roam, to range, ऊनं न सत्वेष्वधिको बबाधे तस्मिन्वनं गोप्तरि गाहमाने R.ii.14, छायया गाहमानः Megh.i.48; 3. to be absorbed in; 4. to entertain, मनस्तु मे संशयमेव गाहते K.S.v.46; 5. to churn, to stir, to agitate; 6. to destroy.With अव-, (sometimes changed into व, पूर्वापरौ तोयनिधी वगाह्य K.S.i.1) 1. to penetrate into, to enter, K.S.i.1; 2. to plunge into, to bathe, स्वप्नेऽवगाहतेऽत्यर्थं जलम् Yaj.i.272.With उप-, to break in.With वि-, 1. to plunge into, to bathe in, तमसां विगाह्य R.xiv.76, xix.9; 2. to agitate or stir about, विगाह्यमानां सरयूं च नौभिः R.xiv.30; 3. to enter, to pervade, to penetrate into, R.xiii.1.With सम्-, to enter, to penetrate into, to go to, समगाहिष्ट चांबरम् Bt.xv.59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=242-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाह|गाहः
गाह <i>m.</i> 1. Diving into, plunging, bathing; 2. depth, interior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=242-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाहन|गाहनं
गाहन <i>n.</i> The act of diving into, bathing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=242-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

