गीता
गीता <i>f.</i> A term applied to certain sacred writings in verse, in the form of a dialogue and containing an exposition of certain religious doctrines, e.g. भगवद्गीता, रामगीता. The term, however, is specially applied to the Bhagavadgītā, उपनिषदः परिपीता गीतापि च हंत मतिपथं नीता Bh.V.ii.40, गीता सुगीता कर्तव्या किमन्यैः शास्त्रविस्तरैः । या स्वयं पद्मनाभस्य मुखपद्माद्विनिःसृता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=243-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

