गुणीभूतव्यंग्य
गुणीभूत-व्यंग्य <i>n.</i> the second of the three divisions of kāvya (poetry) (in rhetoric). In it, the charm of the suggested sense is subordinate to that of the expressed meaning. (It is thus defined by S.D.- अपरं तु गुणीभूतव्यंग्यं वाच्यादनुत्तमे व्यंग्ये; eight subdivisions of this division of kāvya are mentioned. See K.Pr.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=245-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

