गुध् <i>(I) vt. 4P (pres. गुध्यति)</i> To wrap up, to cover, to clothe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुध्
गुध् <i>(II) vt. 9P (pres. गुध्नाति)</i> To be angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुध्
