गुप्
गुप् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pp. गोपयति or गुप्त; pres. गोपायति)</i> 1. To guard, to protect, to defend, जुगोप गोरूपधरामिवोर्वीम् R.ii.3, Bt.xvii.80; 2. to conceal, किं वक्षश्चरणानतिव्यतिकरव्याजेन गोपाय्यते Am.S.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्
गुप् <i>(II) vt. or vi. 1Ā (pres. जुगुप्सते in the first sense, गोपते in the second)</i> 1. To censure, to despise, (with an abl.); 2. to conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्
गुप् <i>(III) vi. 4P (pres. गुप्यति)</i> To be confused or disturbed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्
गुप् <i>(IV) vt. or vi. 10U (pres. गोपयति-ते)</i> 1. To shine; 2. to speak, to declare; (the Kavirahasya puts together all these roots in the following stanza- गोपायति क्षितिमिमां चतुरब्धिसीमां पापाज्जुगुप्सत उदारमतिः सदैवः । वित्तं न गोपयति यस्तु वणीयकेभ्यो धीरो न गुप्यति महत्यपिकार्यजाते ॥).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुपिल|गुपिलः
गुपिल <i>m.</i> 1. A king; 2. a protector.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्त|गुप्तं|गुप्तः
गुप्त <i>(I) a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Protected, guarded; 2. hidden, concealed, secret; 3. invisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्ता
गुप्त <i>(I) a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Protected, guarded; 2. hidden, concealed, secret; 3. invisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्त|गुप्तं|गुप्तः
गुप्त <i>(II) m.</i> An appellation (especially but not necessarily) suffixed to the name of a Vaiśya. (शर्मन् is suffixed to the name of a Brāhmaṇa; वर्मन् to that of a Kṣatriya, गुप्त to that of a Vaiśya and दास to that of a Śūdra. This rule about the use of these appellations, is not, however, strictly observed).(गुप्तम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘privately, secretly.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्तकथा
गुप्त-कथा <i>f.</i> a confidential communication, a secret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्तगति|गुप्तगतिः
गुप्त-गति <i>m.</i> a spy, an emissary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्तचर|गुप्तचरः
गुप्त-चर <i>(I) a.</i> who or what goes secretly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्तचर|गुप्तचरः
गुप्त-चर <i>(II) m.</i> 1. an epithet of Balarāma; 2. a spy, an emissary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्तदान
गुप्त-दान <i>n.</i> a hidden gift or present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्तवेश|गुप्तवेशः
गुप्त-वेश <i>m.</i> a disguise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्तक|गुप्तकः
गुप्तक <i>m.</i> A preserver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्ता
गुप्ता <i>f.</i> One of the principal female characters in poetical composition. She is represented as married to another and as concealing her lover’s endearment, either past, present or future.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्ति|गुप्तिः
गुप्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Preserving, protection, M.i.94, 99; 2. concealing, hiding; 3. covering, sheathing, असिधारासु कोषगुप्तिः Kad.; 4. a hole in the ground, a cavern, a sink; 5. digging a hole in the ground; 6. a means of protection, a fortification, a rampart; 7. a prison, सरभस इव गुप्तिस्फोटमर्कः करोति Sis.xi.60; 8. the lower deck of a boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुफ्
गुफ् <i>vt. 6P (pp. गुंफित; pres. गुंफति)</i> 1. To string together, to tie, to wind round, Bt.vii.105; 2. to compose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुफित|गुफितः
गुफित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Strung together, tied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुफिता
गुफित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Strung together, tied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुंफ|गुम्फ|गुंफः|गुम्फः
गुंफ <i>m.</i> 1. Tying, stringing together; (hence) 2. composing; 3. a bracelet; 4. a whisker, a mustache.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुंफना
गुंफना <i>f.</i> 1. Stringing together; 2. composing; 3. good composition (वाक्ये शब्दार्थयोः सम्यग्रचना गुंफना स्मृता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्
गुर् <i>(I) vi. 6Ā (pp. गूर्ण)</i> To make an effort or exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्
गुर् <i>(II) vt. 4Ā (pp. गूर्ण)</i> 1. To kill, to injure; 2. to go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरण|गुरणं
गुरण <i>n.</i> Effort, porseverance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरु|गुरुः
गुरु <i>(I) a. (f. रु or र्वी; compar. गरीयस्, super. गरिष्ठ)</i> 1. Heavy, weighty, Rt.i.7, R.xii.102; 2. great, large, extended; 3. difficult, arduous, कांताविरहगुरुणा Megh.i.1, तेन धूर्जगतो गुर्वी सचिवेषु निचिक्षिपे R.i.34, ii.35; 4. violent, excessive, गुरुः प्रहर्षः प्रबभूवनात्मनि R.iii.17, Bg.vi.22; 5. important, momentous, स्वार्थात् सतां गुरुतरा प्रणयिक्रियैव Vikr.iv.; 6. long (in duration), गुरुषु दिवसेष्वेषु गच्छत्सु Megh.ii.20; 7. best, excellent; 8. dear, beloved; 9. venerable, respectable; 10. haughty, proud (as a speech); 11. (a syallable) long by nature or position (as मा in मान् or म in मत्सर); it is usually represented by the letter ग (in prosody), e.g. अगुरुचतुष्कं भवति गुरू द्वौ घनकुचयुग्मे शशिवदनाऽसौ Sr.B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्वी|गुर्व्वी
गुरु <i>(I) a. (f. रु or र्वी; compar. गरीयस्, super. गरिष्ठ)</i> 1. Heavy, weighty, Rt.i.7, R.xii.102; 2. great, large, extended; 3. difficult, arduous, कांताविरहगुरुणा Megh.i.1, तेन धूर्जगतो गुर्वी सचिवेषु निचिक्षिपे R.i.34, ii.35; 4. violent, excessive, गुरुः प्रहर्षः प्रबभूवनात्मनि R.iii.17, Bg.vi.22; 5. important, momentous, स्वार्थात् सतां गुरुतरा प्रणयिक्रियैव Vikr.iv.; 6. long (in duration), गुरुषु दिवसेष्वेषु गच्छत्सु Megh.ii.20; 7. best, excellent; 8. dear, beloved; 9. venerable, respectable; 10. haughty, proud (as a speech); 11. (a syallable) long by nature or position (as मा in मान् or म in मत्सर); it is usually represented by the letter ग (in prosody), e.g. अगुरुचतुष्कं भवति गुरू द्वौ घनकुचयुग्मे शशिवदनाऽसौ Sr.B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरु|गुरुः
गुरु <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A father, स राज्यं गुरुणा दत्तं प्रतिपद्याधिकं बभौ R.iv.1, iii.31, 48; 2. any venerable or respectable person, an elderly relative, गुरुजनभयमद्विलोकनांतःसमुदयदाकुलभावमुद्वहंत्या Bh.V.ii.7, 18, 19, 49, Bg.ii.5; 3. a teacher, a preceptor; 4. a spiritual preceptor, a religious teacher, तौ दंपती वसिष्ठस्य गुरोर्जग्मतुराश्रमम् R.i.35, 57, especially one who performs purificatory ceremonies over a boy and initiates him into the sacred lore, Yaj.i.34; 5. head, chief, गुरुर्नृपाणां गुरवे निवेद्य R.ii.68; 6. the constellation called Pushya; 7. the propounder of a new doctrine; 8. name of Bṛhaspati, the preceptor of gods; 9. the planet Jupiter, गुरुकाव्यानुगां बिभ्रच्चांद्रीमभिनभःश्रियम् Sis.ii.2; 10. an epithet of Droṇa, the teacher of the Pāṇḍavas and Kauravas; 11. an epithet of Prabhākara, the leader of that school of the Mīmānsākas which goes by his name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्वर्थ|गुर्वर्थः|गुर्व्वर्थ
गुरु-अर्थ <i>m.</i> a preceptor’s fee for instructing a pupil, गुर्वर्थमाहर्तमहं यतिष्ये R.v.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरूत्तम|गुरूत्तमः
गुरु-उत्तम <i>(I) a.</i> highly revered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरूत्तम|गुरूत्तमः
गुरु-उत्तम <i>(II) m.</i> the supreme soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुकार|गुरुकारः
गुरु-कार <i>m.</i> worship, adoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुक्रम|गुरुक्रमः
गुरु-क्रम <i>m.</i> instruction handed down to a series of teachers, traditional instruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुजन|गुरुजनः
गुरु-जन <i>m.</i> any venerable person, an elderly relative, Bh.V.ii.7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुतल्प|गुरुतल्पः
गुरु-तल्प, -तल्पग, -तल्पिन् <i>m.</i> 1. one who defiles his step-mother; 2. a violator of his preceptor’s bed. (these are regarded as अतिपातकानि in Hindu religious law), M.xi.103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुतल्पग|गुरुतल्पगः
गुरु-तल्प, -तल्पग, -तल्पिन् <i>m.</i> 1. one who defiles his step-mother; 2. a violator of his preceptor’s bed. (these are regarded as अतिपातकानि in Hindu religious law), M.xi.103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुतल्पिन्
गुरु-तल्प, -तल्पग, -तल्पिन् <i>m.</i> 1. one who defiles his step-mother; 2. a violator of his preceptor’s bed. (these are regarded as अतिपातकानि in Hindu religious law), M.xi.103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

