गुरुदैवत|गुरुदैवतः
गुरु-दैवत <i>m.</i> the constellation Pushya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुपाक
गुरु-पाक <i>a.</i> difficult of digestion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुभ
गुरु-भ <i>n.</i> 1. the constellation Pushya; 2. a bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुमर्दल|गुरुमर्दलः|गुरुमर्द्दल
गुरु-मर्दल <i>m.</i> a kind of drum or tabor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=246-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुरत्न|गुरुरत्नं
