गै
गै <i>vt. 1P (pp. गीत; pres. गायति)</i> 1. To sing, to sing a song, न नृत्येदथवा गायेत् M.iv.64, or ग्रीष्मसमयमधिकृत्य गीयताम् Sak.i.; 2. to speak in a singing manner; 3. to relate in metrical language, e.g. गीतस्छायमर्थोऽंगिरसा Ve.ii.; 4. to relate, to call, to describe, प्रभवस्यस्य गीयसे K.S.ii.5.With अनु-, to follow in singing, अनुगायति काचिदुदंचितपंचमरागम्म् Git.G.i.With अव-, to censure, to blame.With उद्-, to sing aloud, to sing in a high tone, गेयमुद्गातुकामा Megh.ii.23, उद्गीयमानं वनदेवताभिः R.ii.12.With उप-, to sing, to sing near, e.g. शिष्यप्रशिष्यैरुपगीयमानमवेहि तन्मंडलमिश्रधाम.With परि-, to sing, to relate, to describe.With वि-, to censure, to blame, to reproach, विगीयसे मन्मथदेहदाहिना Na.i.79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=250-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

