ग्रंथि|ग्रन्थि|ग्रंथिः|ग्रन्थिः
ग्रंथि <i>m.</i> 1. A knot, a protuberance in general, स्तनौ मांसग्रंथी कनककलशावित्युपमितौ Bhartr.iii.20; 2. a tie, a knot of a cord, Bhartr.i.57, M.ii.43; 3. the joint or knot of a reed, cane &c.; 4. a joint of the body; 5. crookedness, distortion; 6. falsehood; 7. wealth, property, e.g. कुसीदाद्दारिद्र्यं परकरगतग्रंथिशमनात्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=254-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

