ग्रंथिपर्ण|ग्रन्थिपर्ण|ग्रन्थिपर्णं|ग्रन्थिपर्णः
ग्रंथि-पर्ण <i>n.</i> 1. name of a tree, न ग्रंथिपर्णप्रणयाश्चरंति कस्तूरिकागंधमृगास्तृणेषु Vikr.Ch.i.17; 2. a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=254-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रंथिबंधन|ग्रन्थिबन्धन
ग्रंथि-बंधन <i>n.</i> tying together the garments of the bride and the bridegroom at the marriage ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=254-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रंथिहर|ग्रन्थिहर|ग्रन्थिहरः
ग्रंथि-हर <i>m.</i> a minister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=254-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रंथिक|ग्रन्थिक|ग्रन्थिकं|ग्रंथिकः|ग्रन्थिकः
ग्रंथिक <i>m.</i> 1. An astrologer, a fortune-teller; 2. the name Assumed by Nakula when at the palace of Virāṭa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=254-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रंथित|ग्रन्थित|ग्रन्थितं
