ग्रंथिन्|ग्रन्थिन्
ग्रंथिन् <i>m.</i> One who reads books, bookish, अज्ञेभ्यो ग्रंथिनः श्रेष्ठा ग्रंथिभ्यो धारिणो वराः M.xii.103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=254-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

