ग्लानि <i>f.</i> 1. Exhaustion, fatigue, हरति सुरतग्लानिमंगानुकूलः शिप्रावातः Megh.i.31, Sant.S.iv.4; 2. debility, sickness, weakness; 3. decay, decline, यदा यदा हि धर्मस्य ग्लानिर्भवति भारत Bg.iv.7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=256-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लास्नु|ग्लास्नुः
ग्लास्नु <i>a.</i> Languid, wearied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=256-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लुच्
ग्लुच् <i>vt. 1P (pp. ग्लुक्त; pres. ग्लोचति)</i> 1. To go, to move; 2. to steal, to rob; 3. deprive of, बहूनामग्लुचत् प्राणानग्लोचीच्च रणे यशः Bt.xv.30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=256-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लै
ग्लै <i>vi. 1P (pp. ग्लान; pres. ग्लायति)</i> 1. To feel aversion or dislike, to be disinclined to do anything; 2. to languid or weary, to despond, Bt.vi.12; 3. to fade away, to faint, Bt.vi.43; 4. to decline. (caus. ग्लपयति or ग्लापयति.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=256-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्लौ
ग्लौ <i>m.</i> 1. The moon; 2. camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=256-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ|घः
घ <i>(I) a. (f. घा) (used only as the last member of compounds)</i> Killing, striking, destroying (as in जीवघ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घा
घ <i>(I) a. (f. घा) (used only as the last member of compounds)</i> Killing, striking, destroying (as in जीवघ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घ|घः
घ <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A pitcher; 2. rattling, gurgling or tinkling noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्
घट् <i>vi. 1Ā (pp. घटित)</i> 1. To be intently occupied about, to be busy with, to endeavour after, दयितां त्रातुमलं घटस्व Bt.x.40, अंगदेन समं योद्धुमघटिष्ट xv.77, xii.26, xx.24; 2. to reach, to come to; 3. to happen, to be possible, e.g. यथा स्वभावशुद्धस्फटिकस्य रागो न जपासंयोगं विना घटते तथैव नित्यशुद्धादिस्वभावस्य पुरुषस्योपाधिसंयोगं विना दुःखसंयोगो न घटते.With प्र-, 1. to be occupied in, Bt.xxi.17; 2. to commence, Bt.xiv.77.With वि-, 1. to be disunited, to be separated; 2. to be spoiled, to break down, to come to a standstill.With सम्-, to be united.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्
घट् <i>Caus. (घटयति-ते)</i> 1. to bring together, to unite, अनेन भैमीं घटयिष्यतः Na.i.46, नारीर्घटयितुमलं कामिभिः Sis.ix.87, Bt.xi.11; 2. to bring close to, to put on, घटय जघने कांचीम् Git.G.xii.; 3. to work out, to form, to shape, कथं घटितवानुपलेन चेतः Sr.T.3, घटय भुजबंधनम् Git.G.x.; 4. to accomplish, to effect, तटस्थः स्वानर्थान् घटयति च मौनं च भजते M.M.i.; 5. to impel, to excite, स्नेहौघो घटयति मां तथापि वक्तुम् Bt.x.73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्
घट् <i>(II) vt. or vi. 10U (pp. घटित)</i> 1. To kill, to hurt, to injure; 2. to collect together, to unite, to put together.With उद्-, 1. to open, निरयनगरद्वारमुद्घाटयन्ती Bhartr.i.63; 2. to reveal, to make known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्
घट् <i>(III) ??? 10U (pres. घण्टयति-ते)</i> To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट|घटः
घट <i>m.</i> 1. A large earthen water-jar, a pitcher, M.viii.319, Yaj.iii.144; 2. the sine Aquarius of the zodiac, otherwise called कुंभ; 3. an elephant’s front-sinus; 4. suspending the breath as a religious exercise; 5. a measure equal to 20 droṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटाटोप|घटाटोपः
घट-आटोप <i>m.</i> covering for a carriage or any article of furniture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटोद्भव|घटोद्भवः
घट-उद्भव, -ज, -योनि, -संभव <i>m.</i> an epithet of the sage अगस्त्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटज|घटजः
घट-उद्भव, -ज, -योनि, -संभव <i>m.</i> an epithet of the sage अगस्त्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटयोनि|घटयोनिः
घट-उद्भव, -ज, -योनि, -संभव <i>m.</i> an epithet of the sage अगस्त्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटसंभव
घट-उद्भव, -ज, -योनि, -संभव <i>m.</i> an epithet of the sage अगस्त्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटोध्नी
घटोध्नी <i>f.</i> a cow with a full udder, गाः कोटिशः स्पर्शयता घटोघ्नीः R.ii.49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटकर्पर|घटकर्परः
घट-कर्पर <i>m.</i> 1. the name of a poet; 2. a piece of a broken jar, जीयेय येन कविना यमकैः परेण तस्मैः वहेयमुदकं घटकर्परेण Ghat.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटकार|घटकारः
घट-कार, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a potter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटकृत्
घट-कार, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a potter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटग्रह|घटग्रहः
घट-ग्रह <i>m.</i> a water-bearer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटदासी
घट-दासी <i>f.</i> a procuress. (Cf. कुंभदासी.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटपर्यसन|घटपर्य्यसन
घट-पर्यसन <i>n.</i> the ceremony of performing the obsequies of an apostate while he is yet alive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटभेदनक
घट-भेदनक <i>n.</i> an instrument used in making pots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटराज|घटराजः
घट-राज <i>m.</i> a water-jar of baked clay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटस्थापन
घट-स्थापन <i>n.</i> placing a water-pot as the type of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटक|घटकः
घटक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. Exerting one’s self; 2. accomplishing, bringing about, एके सत्पुरुषाः परार्थघटकाः स्वार्थं परित्यज्य ये Bhartr.ii.74; 3. constituting a substantial part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटका
घटक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. Exerting one’s self; 2. accomplishing, bringing about, एके सत्पुरुषाः परार्थघटकाः स्वार्थं परित्यज्य ये Bhartr.ii.74; 3. constituting a substantial part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटक|घटकः
घटक <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A tree that produces fruit without apparent flowers; 2. a match-maker, an agent who negotiates matrimonial alliances; 3. a genealogist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटन|घटनं
घटन <i>n.</i> 1. Effort, exertion; 2. happening, occurring; 3. accomplishment, effecting, अघटितघटनापटीयसी विभुता Par.P.i.; 4. joining, mixing, bringing together, e.g. त्पतेन तप्तमयसा घटनाय योग्यम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटना
घटना <i>f.</i> 1. Effort, exertion; 2. happening, occurring; 3. accomplishment, effecting, अघटितघटनापटीयसी विभुता Par.P.i.; 4. joining, mixing, bringing together, e.g. त्पतेन तप्तमयसा घटनाय योग्यम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटा
घटा <i>f.</i> 1. Effort, endeavour; 2. a colletion, an assemblage, तदीयमातंगघटाविघट्टितैः Sis.i.64; 3. a troop of elephants assembled for martial purposes; 4. an assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिक|घटिकं|घटिकः
घटिक <i>(I) m.</i> A waterman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिक|घटिकं|घटिकः
घटिक <i>(II) n.</i> The hip, the posteriors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिका
घटिका <i>f.</i> 1. A small water-pot, a small vessel of clay, e.g. एष क्रीडति कूपयंत्रघटिकान्यायप्रसक्तो इव वर्जनीयाः; 2. a measure of time equal to 24 minutes, e.g. चतस्रो घटिकाः प्रातररुणोदय उच्यते; 3. a water-pot used in calculating the ghaṭikās of the day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिन्
घटिन् <i>m.</i> The sign Aquarius of the zodiac also called कुंभ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिंधम|घटिन्धम|घटिंधमः
घटिंधम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> One who blows or sounds into a jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिंधमा
घटिंधम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> One who blows or sounds into a jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिंधम|घटिन्धम|घटिंधमः
घटिंधम <i>(II) m.</i> A potter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिंधय|घटिन्धय
घटिंधय <i>a. (f. या)</i> One who drinks a pitcherful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटिंधया
घटिंधय <i>a. (f. या)</i> One who drinks a pitcherful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटी
घटी <i>f.</i> 1. A small jar; 2. a measure of time equal to 24 minutes; 3. a small vessel used in measuring the time of the days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटीकार|घटीकारः
घटी-कार <i>m.</i> a potter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटीग्रह
घटी-ग्रह, -ग्राह <i>a.</i> the same as घटग्रह q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटीग्राह
घटी-ग्रह, -ग्राह <i>a.</i> the same as घटग्रह q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटीयंत्र|घटीयन्त्र|घटीयन्त्रं
घटी-यंत्र <i>n.</i> 1. an Indian contrivance for raising water; 2. a contrivance to measure the time of the day. See घटी 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=257-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्ट्
घट्ट् <i>(I) vt. 1Ā (pp. घट्टित)</i> 1. To shake, to stir round, e.g. (लताः) नृत्यन्ते वायुघट्टिताः; 2. to touch, to rub, विटजननखघट्टितेव वीणा Mrich.i., Bt.xiv.2; 3. to speak spitefully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=258-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्ट्
घट्ट् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pp. घट्टित)</i> 1. To shake, to stir; 2. to disturb.With अव-, to open.With परि-, to strike, Sis.ix.64.With वि-, 1. to strike, Sis.i.64; 2. to rub, to rub against, K.S.i.9, Rt.iii.8, Kir.viii.45, Sis.viii.24; 3. to open (as a door).With सम्-, 1. to rub, to rub against, R.vi.73; 2. to strike; 3. to bring together, to gather, to collect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=258-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्ट|घट्टः
घट्ट <i>m.</i> 1. A Ghaut, a landing place, steps on the side of a river leading to the waters; 2. a toll-station; 3. stirring, moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=258-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्टकुटी
घट्ट-कुटी <i>f.</i> a toll-station.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=258-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्टकुटीप्रभातन्याय
घट्ट-कुटी˚प्रभातन्याय <i>m.</i> the maxim of day-break near a toll-station. This maxim indicates the occurrence of what one studiously tries to avoid. It originates in the attempt of one who, at night, takes an unfrequented road in order to avoid a toll but finds himself near the toll-station at daybreak and has to pay it after all; तदिदं घट्टकुटीप्रभातवृत्तांतमनुवदति Kh.Kh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=258-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घट्टजीविन्
