घुष् <i>(I) vt. 1P, 10U (pp. घुषित or घुष्ट)</i> 1. To sound; 2. to proclaim aloud, to announce publicly, to declare, e.g. इति घोषयतीव डिंडिमः करिणो हस्तिपकाहताः क्वणन्, or घोषयतु मन्मथनिदेशम् (रसना) Git.G.x., R.ix.10.With आ-, to announce publicly (according to some authorities), Bt.iii.2, to weep (according to others).With उद्-, to proclaim aloud, to announce publicly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=259-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुष्
घुष् <i>(II) vi. 1Ā (pres. घुषते)</i> To be beautiful or brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=259-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

