घूर्ण्
घूर्ण् <i>vi. 6U (pp. घूर्णित)</i> To move to and fro, to shake, to whirl, to turn round, अद्यापि तां सुरतजागरघूर्णमानाम् Ch.P.5, भयात्केचिदघूर्णिषु Bt.xv.32, 118.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=260-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

