चक्षुष्य <i>a. (f. ष्या)</i> 1. Good-looking, agreeable to the eyes, beautiful; 2. beneficial to the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=262-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्या
चक्षुष्य <i>a. (f. ष्या)</i> 1. Good-looking, agreeable to the eyes, beautiful; 2. beneficial to the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=262-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्या
