चक्षुस्
चक्षुस् <i>n.</i> 1. The eye, निवातपद्मस्तिमितेन चक्षुसा R.iii.17, i.55, M.ii.8; 2. the faculty of seeing, sight, look, M.iv.41, 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=262-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्पथ|चक्षुष्पथः
चक्षुस्-पथ <i>m.</i> the horizon, the range of sight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=262-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

