चक्षुर्दान
चक्षुर्दान <i>f.</i> the ceremony of anointing the eyes of an image at the time of consecration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=262-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्मल
चक्षुर्मल <i>n.</i> the excretion of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=262-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्विषय|चक्षुर्विषयः
चक्षुर्विषय <i>m.</i> 1. visibility, presence, M.ii.198; 2. an object of sight, any visible object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=262-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षूराग|चक्षूरागः
चक्षूराग <i>m.</i> 1. redness in eye; 2. lore or liking as expressed by exchange of glances, चक्षूरागः कोकिलेषु न परकलत्रेषु Kad. (where the word is used in both the senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=262-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षूरोग|चक्षूरोगः
चक्षूरोग <i>m.</i> a disease of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=262-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्मत्|चक्षुष्मन्त्
