चन
चन <i>ind. (according to some authorities, चन is not a separate word but a combination of the particles च and न)</i> Not, also not, even not.(चन is not used by itself. It occurs in combination with the pronoun किम् or with कद्, कथम्, कदा, कुतस्, क्व &c. and imparts indefiniteness to the sense of the word it follows. Cf. चित् II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=265-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

