चंपक <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A tree bearing yellow fragrant flowers; 2. a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=266-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चंपक|चम्पक|चम्पकं|चंपकः|चम्पकः
चंपक <i>(II) n.</i> A flower of this tree, अद्यापि तां कनकचंपकदामगौरीम् Ch.P.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=266-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चंपकमाला|चम्पकमाला
चंपक-माला <i>f.</i> 1. name of a neck-ornament worn by women; 2. a kind of metre. (See App. I.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=266-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चंपकरंभा|चम्पकरम्भा
चंपक-रंभा <i>f.</i> a species of plantain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=266-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चंपकालु|चम्पकालु|चंपकालुः|चम्पकालुः
चंपकालु <i>m.</i> The jack or breadfruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=266-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चंपकावती
चंपकावती <i>f.</i> Name of an ancient city, the capital of the Angas. (It is identifier with the modern Bhagalpur.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=266-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चंपा|चम्पा
चंपकावती <i>f.</i> Name of an ancient city, the capital of the Angas. (It is identifier with the modern Bhagalpur.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=266-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

