चरमूर्ति|चरमूर्तिः
चर-मूर्ति <i>f.</i> an idol which is carried about in procession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=267-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरक|चरकः
चरक <i>m.</i> 1. A spy; 2. a wandering mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=267-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरट|चरटः
चरट <i>m.</i> The wagtail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=267-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरण|चरणं|चरणः
चरण <i>(I) m.n.</i> 1. A foot, (न्यधायिषातां) सुतेन धातुश्चरणौ भुवस्तले Sis.i.13, Megh.i.55; 2. a pillar, a prop; 3. the root of a tree; 4. the single line of a stanza; 5. a school or branch of any of the Vedas; 6. a quarter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=267-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरण|चरणं|चरणः
