चरणन्यास|चरणन्यासः
चरण-न्यास <i>m.</i> a footstep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=267-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

