चित्या <i>f.</i> 1. A funeral pile; 2. piling up, building (as an altar).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=273-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

