चूर्ण्
चूर्ण् <i>vt. 10U (pp. चूर्णित; pres. चूर्णयति-ते)</i> 1. To reduce to powder, to pulverise; 2. to bruise, to crush.With सम्-, to bruise, to crash, संचूर्णयामि गदया न सुयोधनोरू Ve.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=276-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

