चूर्णित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Pounded; 2. crushed, bruised, shattered, K.S.v.24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=276-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

