चेष्ट्
चेष्ट् <i>vt. or vi. 1Ā (pp. चेष्टित; pres. चेष्टते)</i> 1. To be endowed with life or vitality, यदा स देवो जागर्ति तदेदं चेष्टते जगत् M.i.52; 2. to move the limbs, to stir, to make effort, to be active; 3. to act, to behave.With वि-, 1. to move, to stir, to be in motion; 2. to act, to behave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=277-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

