च्यु
च्यु <i>vi. 1Ā (pp. च्युत; pres. च्यवते)</i> 1. To drop down, to slip; 2. to swerve from, to fall off or away from, M.xii.71, 72; 3. to be deprived of, हॄतभार्ये च्युते राज्याद्रामे Bt.vii.92; 4. to disappear, to perish, M.xii.96; 5. to come out from, to drop from, स्वतश्च्युतं वह्निमिवाद्भिरंबुदः R.iii.58.With परि- or प्र-, 1. to go from, to proceed from; 2. to fall off, to swerve; 3. to be deprived of; 4. to drop down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=278-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

च्युत्
च्युत् <i>vi. 1P (pres. च्योतति)</i> 1. To drop, to flow, to trickle, to ooze, इदं शोणितमब्यग्रं संप्रहारेऽच्युतत् तयोः Bt.vi.28; 2. to drop down, to fall down, इदं कवचमच्योतीत् Bt.vi.29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=278-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

