छत्वर <i>m.</i> 1. A bottte; 2. a bower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=278-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छद्
छद् <i>(I) vt. 1U, 10U (pp. छन्न or छदित; pres. छदति-ते, छदयति-ते, छादयति-ते)</i> 1. To cover, to close, छादिता शरदभ्रेण चंद्रलेखेव दृश्यते Mrich.i., चक्षुःखेदात्सलिलगुरुभिः पक्ष्मभिश्छादयंतीम् Megh.ii.27, Ghat.6, Megh.ii.13; 2. to spread anything as a cover; 3. to conceal, to keep secret, छादयामास तां कन्यां पुमानिति च सोऽब्रवीत् Bh. With अव-, to cover, to conceal.With आ-, 1. to cover, आच्छादिते रवौ मेघैराच्छन्नाः स्युर्गभस्तयः Panch.ii.; 2. to clothe, M.iii.27; 3. to conceal.With उद्-, to uncover, to undress.With उप-, 1. to cover; 2. to conceal, to hide.With परि-, 1. to cover; 2. to conceal, to hide.With प्र-, 1. to cover, to envelop, to wrap up, यथा रश्मिभिरादित्यः प्राच्छादयत मेदिनीम् Bh.; 2. to conceal, to hide, to disguise, व्रतेन पापं प्रच्छाद्य M.iv.198, x.40, Ch.P.4; 3. to be in the way, to be an obstacle; 4. to put on, to clothe oneself with.With प्रति-, 1. to cover, to envelop; 2. to conceal.With सम्-, 1. to cover, to wrap up; 2. to conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छद्
छद् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pres. छंदयति-ते)</i> 1. To cover; 2. to please; 3. to persuade.With उप-, 1. to present anyone (acc.) with anything (inst.), त्वयाऽयं तावत् प्रथममुपच्छंदित उदकेन Sak.iv.; 2. to persuade, to coax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छद|छदः
छद <i>m.</i> 1. A covering (as in उत्तरच्छद); 2. a wing, छदहेम कषन्निवालसत् Na.ii.69; 3. a leaf; 4. a sheath, scabbard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छदन|छदनं
छदन <i>n.</i> 1. A covering (as in उत्तरच्छद); 2. a wing, छदहेम कषन्निवालसत् Na.ii.69; 3. a leaf; 4. a sheath, scabbard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छदि|छदिः
छदि <i>f.</i> 1. The roof of a carriage; 2. the thatch of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छदिस्
छदिस् <i>n.</i> 1. The roof of a carriage; 2. the thatch of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छद्मन्
छद्मन् <i>n.</i> 1. A deceptive dress, a disguise; 2. a plea, a pretext (कर्णमूलमागत्य) फलितच्छद्मना जरा R.xii.2, Sis.ii.21; 3. fraud, dishonesty, deceit, M.iv.199, ix.72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छद्मतापस|छद्मतापसः
छद्मन्-तापस <i>m.</i> a religious hypocrite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छद्मरूपेण
छद्मन्-रूपेण <i>ind.</i> under disguise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छद्मवेशिन्
छद्मन्-वेशिन् <i>m.</i> a player, a cheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छद्मिन्
छद्मिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Fraudulent, deceitful; 2. disguised (at the end of compounds), e.g. ब्राह्मनच्छद्मिन् ‘disguised as a Brāhmaṇa.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छद्मिनी
छद्मिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Fraudulent, deceitful; 2. disguised (at the end of compounds), e.g. ब्राह्मनच्छद्मिन् ‘disguised as a Brāhmaṇa.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छनच्छन्
छनच्छन् <i>ind.</i> An imitative sound, expressive of the noise of falling drops, छनच्छनिति बाष्पकणाः पतंति Am.S.89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छंद|छन्द|छन्दः
छंद <i>m.</i> 1. Wish, desire, fancy, Yaj.iii.203; 2. free will, free or wilful conduct, स्वच्छंदं व्रज सुंदरीभिरभितः प्रत्यंगमालिंगितः Git.G.i., Yaj.ii.195; 3. meaning, intention, purport; 4. poison; 5. subjection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छंदस्|छन्दस्
छंदस् <i>n.</i> 1. Wish, desire (गृह्णीयात्) मूर्खं छंदोनुवृत्तेन तथा तथ्येन पंडितम् Cāṇakya.33; 2. free will, free and independent conduct; 3. meaning, intention; 4. fraud, deceit; 5. the Vedas, the sacred text of the Vedic hymns, प्रणवश्छंदसमिव R.i.11, or जलांते छंदसां कुर्यादुत्सर्गम् Yaj.i.143, M.iv.95; 6. a metre, ऋक्छंदसा आशास्ते Sak.iv. or गायत्री छंदसामहम् Bg.x.35, xiii.4; 7. metrical science; this is regarded as one of the six Vedāṅgas (auxiliaries to the Vedas), the other five being शिक्षा, व्याकरण, कल्प, निरुक्त and ज्योतिष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छंदस्कृत|छन्दस्कृत
छंदस्कृत <i>n.</i> any metrical part of the Vedas or other sacred compositions, यथोदितेन विधिना नित्यं छंदस्कृतं पठेत् M.iv.100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छंदोग|छन्दोग|छन्दोगः
छंदोग <i>m.</i> 1. a reciter in metre; 2. a student of the Sāmaveda, M.iii.145 (छंदोगः सामवेदाध्यायी Medhātithi).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छंदोभंग
छंदस्-भंग <i>m.</i> a violation of the laws of prosody.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छंदोविचिति|छन्दोविचिति|छन्दोविचितिः
छंदस्-विचिति <i>f.</i> a collection of metres, a treatise on prosody (said to be the title of a treatise on prosody written by Danḍin), K.D.i.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छन्न|छन्नं|छन्नः
छन्न <i>a. (f. न्ना)</i> 1. Covered; 2. concealed, secret, retired, (pp. of छद् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छन्ना
छन्न <i>a. (f. न्ना)</i> 1. Covered; 2. concealed, secret, retired, (pp. of छद् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छमंड|छमण्ड|छमंडः|छमण्डः
छमंड <i>m.</i> An orphan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छर्द्
छर्द् <i>vt. 10U (pp. छर्दित)</i> To vomit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छर्द|छर्दः|छर्द्द|छर्द्दं
छर्द <i>m.</i> Vomiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छर्दन|छर्दनं|छर्दनः|छर्द्दन|छर्द्दनं
छर्दन <i>n.</i> Vomiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छर्दि|छर्दिः|छर्द्दि|छर्द्दिः
छर्दि <i>f.</i> Vomiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छर्दिका|छर्द्दिका
छर्दिका <i>f.</i> Vomiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छर्दिस्
छर्दिस् <i>f.</i> Vomiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छल|छलं|छलः
छल <i>m.n.</i> 1. Fraud, trick, deception, delusion, छलमत्र न गृह्यते Mrich.ix., Am.S.16, M.viii.49, Yaj.i.61; 2. plea, pretext, semblance, guise, प्रत्यर्प्य पूजामुपदाछलेन R.vii.30, Bt.i.1, Am.S.15; (in this sense the word is often used to indicate an उत्प्रेक्षा, R.vi.54, xvi.28); 3. roguery, knavery; 4. wickedness; 5. a fallacy; 6. design, device.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छलय्
छलय् <i>vt. (denom. pres. छलयति)</i> To deceive, to cheat, बलिं छलयते Git.G.i., द्यूतं छलयतामस्मि Bg.x.36, Am.S.41, R.xvi.61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छलिक|छलिकं
छलिक <i>n.</i> A kind of drama, e.g. छलिकं दुष्रयोज्यमुदाहरंति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छलन|छलनं
छलन <i>n.</i> Deceiving, cheating, outwitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छलना
छलना <i>f.</i> Deceiving, cheating, outwitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छलिन्
छलिन् <i>m.</i> A cheat, a swindler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छल्लि|छल्लिः
छल्लि <i>f.</i> 1. Bark, skin; 2. a spreading creeper; 3. offspring, progeny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छल्ली
छल्लि <i>f.</i> 1. Bark, skin; 2. a spreading creeper; 3. offspring, progeny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छवि|छविः
छवि <i>f.</i> 1. Skin, hide; 2. colour of the skin, हिमकरोदयपांडुमुखच्छविः R.ix.38, Megh.i.33; 3. colour in general; 4. beauty, splendour, (अधरः) मधूकच्छविः Git.G.x.; 5. light, lustre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=279-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छाग|छागः
छाग <i>(I) a. (f. गी)</i> Relating to a goat, Yaj.i.258.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागी
छाग <i>(I) a. (f. गी)</i> Relating to a goat, Yaj.i.258.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छाग|छागः
छाग <i>(II) m. (fem. ˚गी)</i> 1. A goat, M.iii.269; 2. the sign Aries of the Zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छाग|छागः
छाग <i>(III) n.</i> The milk of a she-goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागभोजिन्
छाग-भोजिन् <i>m.</i> a wolf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागमुख|छागमुखः
छाग-मुख <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागरथ|छागरथः
छाग-रथ, -वाहन <i>m.</i> an epithet of Agni, the deity of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागवाहन|छागवाहनः
छाग-रथ, -वाहन <i>m.</i> an epithet of Agni, the deity of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागण|छागणः
छागण <i>m.</i> A fire of dried cow-dung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागल|छागलः
छागल <i>(I) a. (f. ली)</i> Coming from or relating to a goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागली
छागल <i>(I) a. (f. ली)</i> Coming from or relating to a goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छागल|छागलः
छागल <i>(II) m.</i> A goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छात|छातः
छात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Cut, divided; 2. thin, emaciated, feeble, (pp. of छो q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छाता
छात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Cut, divided; 2. thin, emaciated, feeble, (pp. of छो q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छात्र|छात्त्रः|छात्रं|छात्रः
छात्र <i>(I) m.</i> A pupil, a disciple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छात्र|छात्त्रः|छात्रं|छात्रः
छात्र <i>(II) n.</i> A kind of honey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छात्रगंड|छात्रगण्ड|छात्रगण्डः
छात्र-गंड <i>m.</i> an indifferent student of poetry knowing only the beginnings of stanzas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छात्रदर्शन|छात्रदर्शनं
छात्र-दर्शन <i>n.</i> fresh butter prepared from milk one day old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=280-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छात्रव्यंसक|छात्रव्यंसकः
