छिदिर <i>m.</i> 1. An axe; 2. a sword; 3. fire; 4. a rope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=281-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

