जड|जडं|जडः
जड <i>(I) a. (f. डा)</i> 1. Cold, frigid; 2. paralysed, motionless, जडीकृतस्त्र्यंबकवीक्षणेन R.ii.42; 3. apathetic, inappreciative, वेदाभ्यासजडः कथं नु विषयव्यावृत्तकौतूहलः Vikr.i.; 4. senseless, stupid, dull, irrational, जडे परिजने दीर्घां कथां कुर्वंति Am.S.75; 5. unable to learn the Vedas; 6. dumb; 7. stupifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=283-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

