जन्य <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Production, oreation; 2. a created thing, an effect, (op. to जनक), e.g. जनकस्य स्वभावो हि जन्ये तिष्ठति निश्चितम्, or जन्यानां जनकः कालः; 3. a market, a fair; 4. war, battle, तत्र जन्यं रघोर्घोरं पारवतीयैर्गणैरभूत् R.iv.77; 5. censure, abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=284-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जन्या
जन्या <i>f.</i> 1. The friend of a mother; 2. the relation of a bride, a bride’s maid, याहीति जन्यामवदत्कुमारी R.vi.30; 3. pleasure, happiness; 4. affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=284-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जन्यु|जन्युः
जन्यु <i>m.</i> 1. Birth; 2. a creature, a living being; 3. fire; 4. the creator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=284-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जप्
जप् <i>vt. 1P (pp. जपित; pres. जपति)</i> 1. To utter in a low voice, to mutter, हरिरिति हरिरिति जपति सकामम् Git.G.iv.; 2. to mutter (prayers or incantations), M.xi.194.With उप-, to whisper into the ears, to bring over to one’s party by secretly suggesting anything in the ear, to rouse to rebellion, उपजप्यानुजपेत् M.vii.197.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=284-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जप|जपः
जप <i>m.</i> 1. Repeating prayers in a murmuring tone; 2. repeating passages of the Veda, M.iii.74; 3. a muttered prayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपपरायण|जपपरायणः
जप-परायण <i>a.</i> engaged in muttering prayers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपमाला
जप-माला <i>f.</i> a rosary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जपा
जपा <i>f.</i> The China rose (either the plant or its flower), सांध्यं तेजः प्रतिनवजपापुष्परक्तं दधानः Megh.i.36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जप्य|जप्यः
जप्य <i>m.n.</i> A muttered prayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जभ्
जभ् <i>(I) vi. 1P (pres. जभति, जंभति)</i> To copulate. Cf. यभ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जभ्
जभ् <i>(II) vt. 1Ā (pres. जभते)</i> To yawn, to gape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जम्
जम् <i>vt. 1P (pres. जमति)</i> To eat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जमन|जमनं
जमन <i>n.</i> The same as जेमन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जंपती|जम्पती
जंपती <i>m. du.</i> Man and wife. Cf. दंपती and जायापती.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जंबाल|जम्बाल|जंबालः|जम्बालः
