जंबीर|जम्बीर|जंबीरः|जम्बीरः
जंबीर <i>(II) n.</i> A citron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जंबु|जम्बु|जम्बुः
जंबु <i>f.</i> The rose apple and its fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जंबू|जम्बू
जंबु <i>f.</i> The rose apple and its fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

