जंभरिपु
जंभ-अराति, -द्विष्, -भेदिन्, -रिपु <i>m.</i> an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जंभारि|जम्भारि|जम्भारिः
