जय|जयः
जय <i>n.</i> 1. Conquest, triumph, victory, R.iii.57; 2. winning (as a game or lawsuit); 3. curbing, restraining, as in इंद्रियविजय; 4. an epithet of Jayanta, son of Indra; 5. of Yudhiṣṭhira, the first Pāṇḍava prince; 6. name of an attendant of Viṣṇu; 7. an epithet of Arjuna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जयावह
जय-आवह <i>a.</i> conferring victory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जयोद्धुर
