जयकोलाहल|जयकोलाहलः
जय-कोलाहल <i>m.</i> 1. a shout of victory; 2. a kind of game with dice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जयघोष|जयघोषः
