जयवाहिनी
जय-वाहिनी <i>f.</i> an epithet of Śachī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जयशब्द|जयशब्दः
