जयिन्
जयिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Conquering, victorious, पौरस्त्यानेवमाक्रामंस्ताञ्जनपदाञ्जयी R.iv.34; 2. winning (as a lawsuit); 3. captivating, taking possession of the heart, जगति जयिनस्ते ते भावा नवेंदुकलादयः M.M.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=285-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जयिनी
