जातु
जातु <i>ind.</i> A particle meaning- (1) ever, at any time, at all, न जातु कामः कामानामुपभिगेन शाम्यति M.ii.94; (2) at some time, some day, once upon a time, once.जातु is used with a potential form in the sense of ‘not putting up with,’ e.g. जातु वृषलं याजयेन्न मर्षयामि; and with a present indicative to imply censure, e.g. जातु वृषलं याजयति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

