जातुष|जातुषं
जातुष <i>a. (f. षी)</i> 1. Made of lac, covered with lac; 2. sticky, adhesive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जातुषी
