जात्य|जात्यः
जात्य <i>a. (f. त्या)</i> 1. Of the same family, related; 2. noble, well-born, of noble birth, जात्यस्तेनाभिजातेन शूरः शौर्यवता कुशः R.xvii.4; 3. lovely, beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जात्या
