जानपद|जानपदः
जानपद <i>m.</i> 1. An inhabitant of the country, a rustic, a peasant, (op. to पौर); 2. a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

