जायिनी
जायिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Conquering, subduing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जायिन्
जायिन् <i>(II) m.</i> The burden of a song (in music).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जायु|जायुः
जायु <i>m.</i> Medicine, drug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जार|जारः
