जारज|जारजः
जार-ज, -जन्मन्, -जात <i>a.</i> a bastard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जारजन्मन्
जार-ज, -जन्मन्, -जात <i>a.</i> a bastard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जारजात|जारजातः
