जाल|जालं|जालः
जाल <i>n.</i> 1. A net, a snare; 2. a cob-web; 3. a coat of mail, a helmet made of wire; 4. a lattice, a window, धूपैर्जालविनिःसृतैर्वलभयः संदिग्धपारावताः Vikr.iii., K.S.vii.60; 5. a collection, an assemblage, K.S.vii.89, Sis.iv.56, Am.S.58; 6. magic; 7. illusion, deception; 8. an unblown flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जालाक्ष|जालाक्षः
जाल-अक्ष <i>m.</i> a loop-hole, a window.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जालकर्मन्
