जालपाद्
जाल-पाद्, -पाद <i>m.</i> a goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जालपाद|जालपादः
जाल-पाद्, -पाद <i>m.</i> a goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=289-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जालप्राया
