जिघांसु|जिघांसुः
जिघांसु <i>(I) a.</i> Desirous of killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=290-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिघांसु|जिघांसुः
जिघांसु <i>(II) m.</i> An enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=290-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिघृक्षा
जिघृक्षा <i>f.</i> Desire of taking or seizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=290-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिघ्र|जिघ्रः
जिघ्र <i>a. (f. घ्रा)</i> 1. Smelling; 2. conjecturing, guessing, e.g. मनोजिघ्रः सपत्नीजनः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=290-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिघ्रा
जिघ्र <i>a. (f. घ्रा)</i> 1. Smelling; 2. conjecturing, guessing, e.g. मनोजिघ्रः सपत्नीजनः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=290-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

