जीवन|जीवनं|जीवनः
जीवन <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Principle of life, vitality, Bg.vii.9; 2. life, existence; 3. water, जीवनं (3) जीवनं (1) हंति प्राणान् हंति समीरणः Ud.; 4. livelihood, profession, M.xi.76; 5. butter made from milk one day old; 6. marrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=292-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

