जुगुप्सन|जुगुप्सनं
जुगुप्सन <i>n.</i> 1. Censure, reproach; 2. dislike, aversion, disgust; 3. disgust considered as the feeling which gives rise to the bībhatsa sentiment (in rhetoric); (the S.D. thus defines जुगुप्सा- दोषेक्षणादिभिर्गर्हा जुगुप्सा विषयोद्भवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=292-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जुगुप्सा
जुगुप्सा <i>f.</i> 1. Censure, reproach; 2. dislike, aversion, disgust; 3. disgust considered as the feeling which gives rise to the bībhatsa sentiment (in rhetoric); (the S.D. thus defines जुगुप्सा- दोषेक्षणादिभिर्गर्हा जुगुप्सा विषयोद्भवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=292-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

