जोटिंग|जोटिङ्ग|जोटिंगः|जोटिङ्गः
जोटिंग <i>m.</i> An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जोष|जोषं|जोषः
जोष <i>n.</i> Happiness, pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जोषम्
जोषम् <i>ind.</i> 1. According to one’s liking, with ease; 2. silently, जोषं जोषं जोषमेवावतस्थे Bh.V.ii.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जोषा
जोषा <i>f.</i> A woman. Cf. योषा, योषित्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जोषित्
जोषा <i>f.</i> A woman. Cf. योषा, योषित्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जोषिका
जोषिका <i>f.</i> 1. A cluster of young buds; 2. a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञ|ज्ञः
ज्ञ <i>(I) a. (f. ज्ञा) (at the end of compounds)</i> Knowing, familiar with, R.i.92, M.iv.102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञा
ज्ञ <i>(I) a. (f. ज्ञा) (at the end of compounds)</i> Knowing, familiar with, R.i.92, M.iv.102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञ|ज्ञः
ज्ञ <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A wise and learned man, a paṇḍit; 2. the sentient soul; 3. the planet Mercury; 4. the planet Mars; 5. an epithet of Brahman (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञंमन्य
ज्ञंमन्य <i>a.</i> thinking oneself wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञपित|ज्ञपितः
ज्ञपित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Made known, informed, expounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञपिता
ज्ञपित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Made known, informed, expounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञप्ति|ज्ञप्तिः
ज्ञप्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Understanding, intellect; 2. promulgating, making known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञा
ज्ञा <i>vt. 9U (pp. ज्ञात; pres. जानाति, जानीते)</i> 1. To know, to become acquainted with, ज्ञास्यसि कियुद्भुजो मे रक्षति मौर्वीकिणांक इति Sak.i.; 2. to apprehend, to understand, to experience; 3. to ascertain, to investigate, आपत्सु मित्रं जानीयात् Cāṇakya.; 4. to recognize, न त्वं दृष्ट्वा न पुनरलकां ज्ञास्यसे Megh.i.63; 5. to regard, to consider, to know as, तस्य मां तनयां सर्वे जानीत Bh.; 6. to be conversant or familiar with, to be aware of, नामधेयस्य ये केचिदभिवादंन जानते M.ii.123, जाने तपसो वीर्यम् Sak.ii.; 7. to act, to engage in, (with the gen. of the instrument, e.g. सर्पिषो जानीते ‘he engages in sacrifice with clarified butter’).With अनु-, 1. to permit, to allow, to assent to, M.iii.210; 2. to promise, मां जातमात्रां धनमित्रनाम्नेऽन्वजानाद्भार्यां मे पिता D.K.; 3. to acknowledge.With अप-, (in the Atm.) to conceal, आत्मानमपजानानः शशमात्रोऽनयद्दिनम् Bt.viii.26.With अभि-, 1. to know, to understand, to be acquainted with, Bg.xviii.55; 2. to regard, to consider, to know as; 3. to recognize.With अव-, to disregard, to neglect, अवजानंति मां मूढा मानुषीं तनुमाश्रितम् Bg.ix.11, R.i.77, Bt.iii.8.With आ-, to know, to understand, to ascertain.With परि-, 1. to know, to be acquainted with, to be aware of, परिज्ञायते कतमेन दिग्विभागेन गतः स जाल्मः Vikr.i., M.viii.126; 2. to learn, to ascertain.With प्रति-, (in the Atm.) 1. to promise, प्रतिजज्ञे स्वयं चैव सुग्रीवो रक्षसां वधम् Bt.xiv.64; 2. to confirm.With वि-, 1. to know, to be aware of; 2. to understand, to learn, to ascertain; 3. to consider, to regard, to know as.With सम्-, (in the Atm.) 1. to recognize; 2. to agree together, to live in harmony (used with the acc. or inst., e.g. पित्रा पितरं वा संजानीते); 3. to know, to understand; 4. to watch for, Bt.viii.27; 5. (in the Par.) to think of, to remember, e.g. मातरं संजानाति or मातुः संजानाति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञा
ज्ञा <i>Caus. (ज्ञापयति or ज्ञपयति)</i> 1. to make known, to make acquainted with, to inform, to announce; 2. (in the Atm.) to request, to ask.With आ-, 1. to command, to order, to direct; 2. to give leave.With वि-, 1. to request, R.v.20; 2. to say, to speak, to communicate to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञा
ज्ञा <i>Desid. (जिज्ञासते)</i> to desire to know, R.ii.26, Bt.viii.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=293-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञात|ज्ञातं
ज्ञात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Known, ascertained, understood, Sis.ii.12, (pp. of ज्ञा q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञाता
ज्ञात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Known, ascertained, understood, Sis.ii.12, (pp. of ज्ञा q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञातसिद्धांत|ज्ञातसिद्धान्त|ज्ञातसिद्धान्तः
ज्ञात-सिद्धांत <i>m.</i> a man completely versed in any Śāstra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञाति|ज्ञातिः
ज्ञाति <i>m.</i> 1. A father; 2. the agnatic relatives (collectively).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञातिभाव|ज्ञातिभावः
ज्ञाति-भाव <i>m.</i> relationship, kin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञातिभेद|ज्ञातिभेदः
ज्ञाति-भेद <i>m.</i> disunion among relatives.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञातेय|ज्ञातेयं
ज्ञातेय <i>n.</i> Relationship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञातृ
ज्ञातृ <i>m.</i> 1. A wise man; 2. an acquaintance; 3. a bail, a surety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञान|ज्ञानं
ज्ञान <i>n.</i> 1. Knowing, understanding, knowledge, ज्ञाने मौनं क्षमा शक्तौ R.i.22, M.vii.211; 2. sacred knowledge derived from meditation which enables man to understand his own nature and to see the way to be reunited to the supreme spirit (as op. to कर्मन्), Bg.iii.3; 3. cognizance, consciousness; 4. the organ of intelligence, sense; 5. learning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानानुत्पाद|ज्ञानानुत्पादः
