ज्ञान-चक्षुस् <i>(II) n.</i> the mind’s eye, intellectual vision, (op. to चर्मचक्षुस्), सर्वं तु समवेक्ष्येदं निखिलं ज्ञानचक्षुसा M.ii.8, iv.24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानतत्व
ज्ञान-तत्व <i>n.</i> true knowledge, i.e. knowledge of god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानतपस्
ज्ञान-तपस् <i>n.</i> penance consisting in the cultivation of true knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=294-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

