डंबरा
डंबर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Famous, renowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=297-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डंबर|डम्बर|डम्बरः
डंबर <i>(II) m.</i> An assemblage, a mass, as in मेघडंबर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=297-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डयन|डयनं
डयन <i>n.</i> 1. Flight; 2. a litter carried upon men’s shoulders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डवित्थ|डवित्थः
डवित्थ <i>m.</i> A wooden antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डाकिनी
डाकिनी <i>f.</i> A kind of female imp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डांकृति
डांकृति <i>f.</i> The clang of a bell, dingdong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डामर|डामरः
डामर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Terrific, पर्याप्तं मयि रमणीयडामरत्वं संधत्ते गगनतलप्रयाणवेगः M.M.v.; 2. beautiful, variegated (?), (चिकुरे) शिखंडिशिखंडकडामरे Git.G.xii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डामरा
डामर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Terrific, पर्याप्तं मयि रमणीयडामरत्वं संधत्ते गगनतलप्रयाणवेगः M.M.v.; 2. beautiful, variegated (?), (चिकुरे) शिखंडिशिखंडकडामरे Git.G.xii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डामर|डामरः
