डिंबिका|डिम्बिका
डिंबिका <i>f.</i> 1. A libidinous woman; 2. a bubble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिंभ|डिम्भ|डिंभः|डिम्भः
