डी
डी <i>vi. 1Ā, 4Ā (pp. डीन)</i> 1. To fly, to pass through the air; 2. to go.With उद्-, to fly up, सर्वैः … … उड्डीयताम् Hit.i., (हंसैः) उदडीयत वैकृतात्करग्रहजादस्य विकस्वरस्वरैः Na.ii.5.With प्र-, to fly up, हंसैः प्रडीनैरिव Mrich.v.With प्रोद्-, to fly up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डीन|डीनं
डीन <i>n.</i> The flight of a bird; (there are several varieties of it as उड्डीन, अवडीन, महाडीन, सुडीन, अभिडीन, संडीन &c., the special mode of flight being expressed by the word prefixed to डीन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डुंडुभ|डुण्डुभ|डुंडुभः|डुण्डुभः
डुंडुभ <i>m.</i> A species of snakes not poisonous. (See अहि.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डुलि|डुलिः
डुलि <i>f.</i> A small turtle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डोम|डोमः
डोम <i>m.</i> A man of a very low caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढक्का
ढक्का <i>f.</i> A large or double drum, e.g. ननाद डक्का नवपंचवारम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढामरा
ढामरा <i>f.</i> A goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढाल|ढालं
ढाल <i>n.</i> A shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढालिन्
ढालिन् <i>m.</i> A warrior armed with a shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढुंढि|ढुण्ढि|ढुंढिः|ढुण्ढिः
ढुंढि <i>m.</i> An epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढोल|ढोलः
ढोल <i>m.</i> A large dram or tabor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढौक्
ढौक् <i>vt. 1Ā (pp. ढौकित)</i> 1. To go, to approach, यांतं वने रात्रिचरी डुढौके Bt.ii.23, xiv.71, xv.79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढौक्
ढौक् <i>Caus. (ढौकयति-ते)</i> 1. to bring near, to cause to approach, Bt.xvii.103; 2. to offer.With उप-, to offer, to present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढौकन|ढौकनं
ढौकन <i>n.</i> 1. Offering; 2. a present, a bribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ण|णः
ण Note. Many roots which really begin with न are written in the Dhātupāṭha with ण to indicate that the dental nasal is liable to be changed into the cerebral one when preceded by prepositions like प्र, परि &c. These roots will be found under न.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=298-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्
तक् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pp. तकित or तंकित)</i> 1. To bear, to endure; 2. to live in distress; 3. to laugh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तकिल|तकिलः
तकिल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> Fraudulent, crafty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तकिला
तकिल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> Fraudulent, crafty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्र|तक्रं
तक्र <i>m.</i> Buttermilk, Yaj.iii.37, 322.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्राट|तक्राटः
तक्र-अट <i>m.</i> a churning stick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्रसार
तक्र-सार <i>n.</i> fresh butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्ष्
तक्ष् <i>vt. 1P, 5P (pp. तष्ट)</i> 1. To cut, to pare, to chisel, to split, निधय तक्ष्यते यत्र काष्ठे काष्ठं स उद्घनः Am.iii.2.35; 2. to wound; 3. to fashion, to form out of wood &c. to create; 4. to form in the mind, to invent.With सम्-, 1. to pare, to chisel; 2. to strike, to wound, निस्त्रिंशाभ्यां सुतीक्ष्णाभ्यामन्योन्यं संततक्षतुः Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षक|तक्षकः
तक्षक <i>m.</i> 1. A carpenter, a wood-cutter (by caste or profession, सूचकाद्विप्रकन्यायां जातस्तक्षक उच्यते Uśanas); 2. a name of the divine architect (विश्वकर्मन्); 3. the chief actor in the prelude of a drama (सूत्रधार); 4. the name of a principal serpent, son of Kaśyapa and Kadru.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षण|तक्षणं
तक्षण <i>n.</i> Cutting, तक्षणं दारुशृंगास्थ्नाम् Yaj.i.185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षन्
तक्षन् <i>m.</i> 1. A wood-cutter, a carpenter [by caste or profession, क्वचित्तात्कर्म्यात्, यथा अतक्षा तक्षा K.Pr.ii. “sometimes the identification (necessary for a लक्षणा) proceeds from ‘acting like,’ for example, one who is not a तक्षा by caste is called तक्षा, because he follows that profession”]; 2. a name of the architect of gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तग्
तग् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pp. तंगित)</i> 1. To go; 2. to shake, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तगर|तगरं|तगरः
तगर <i>m.</i> A kind of plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तंक|तङ्क|तंकः|तङ्कः
तंक <i>m.</i> 1. Living in distress; 2. grief produced by separation from a beloved object; 3. fear, terror; 4. a stone-cutter’s chisel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तंकन
तंकन <i>n.</i> Living in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तंच्|तञ्च्
तंच् <i>vt. 7P (pp. तंचित; pres. तनक्ति)</i> To contract, to shrink, तनच्मि व्योम विस्तृतम् Bt.vi.38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट|तटं|तटः
तट <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A slope, a declivity, a precipice; 2. the sky or horizon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट|तटं|तटः
तट <i>(II) m.n.</i> 1. A shore or bank, सिंधोस्तटावोघ इव प्रवृद्धः K.S.iii.6; 2. certain parts of the body which have sloping sides, श्रोणीतट, कुचतट, ललाटतट, कटितट &c.), निःशेषच्युतचंदनं स्तनतटम् K.Pr.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट|तटं|तटः
तट <i>(III) n.</i> A field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाघात|तटाघातः
तट-आघात <i>m.</i> striking against or digging at a bank or declivity, अभ्यस्यंति तटाघातं निर्जितैरावता गजाः K.S.ii.50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटस्थ|तटस्थं|तटस्थः
तट-स्थ <i>a.</i> 1. situated on a declivity or on a bank (lit.); 2. indifferent, neutral, standing aloof (fig.), e.g. मया तटस्थस्त्वमुपद्रुतोऽसि Na.iii.55 (where तटस्थ is used in both the senses), or तटस्थः स्वानर्थान् घटयति च मौनं च भजते M.M.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटा
तटा <i>f.</i> The same as तट I, II q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाक|तटाकं|तटाकः
तटाक <i>m.n.</i> A pond deep enough for the lotus and other aquatic plants, e.g. नदीर्वापीस्तटाकानि पल्वलानि सरांसि च.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटिनी
तटिनी <i>f.</i> A river, तटिनी चिराय विचारय Bh.V.i.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटी
तटी <i>f.</i> The same as तट II q.v., राजति तटीयमभिहतदानवरासातिपातिसारावनदा K.Pr.x., पद्मापयोधरतटीपरिरंभलग्नकाश्मीरमुद्रितमुरो मधुसूदनस्य Git.G.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तड्
तड् <i>(I) vt. or vi. 10U (pp. ताडित)</i> 1. To beat, to strike, to punish by beating, लालयेत्पंचवर्षाणि दशवर्षाणि ताडयेत् Cāṇakya., पुत्रं शिष्यं च ताडयेत् Yaj.i.155; 2. to beat (as a drum), (केन) दुंदुभिस्ताडितोऽयम् Ve.i.; 3. to strike the wires of any musical instrument, वितंत्रीरिव ताड्यमाना K.S.i.45; 4. to strike against in general, गाहंतां महिषा निपानसलिलं शृंगैर्मुहुस्ताडितम् Sak.ii., or समुद्रमध्ये नौः पूर्णा ताडिता मारुतैर्यथा Ram.; 5. to shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तड्
तड् <i>(II) vt. 1Ā (pp. तंडित; pres. तंडते)</i> To strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडग|तडगः
तडग <i>m.</i> The same as तडाग q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाग|तडागं|तडागः
तडाग(क) <i>m.</i> A pond, a deep pool, तडागारामविक्रयः R.iii.237.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाक|तडाकः
तडाग(क) <i>m.</i> A pond, a deep pool, तडागारामविक्रयः R.iii.237.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाघात|तडाघातः
तडाघात <i>m.</i> The same as तटाघात q.v. (उच्चैः करिकराक्षेपे तडाघातं विदुर्बुधाः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडित्
तडित् <i>f.</i> Lightning, पक्ष्मालीपिंगलिम्नः कण इव तडितां यस्य कृत्स्नः समूहः M.M.i., R.vi.65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिद्गर्भ|तडिद्गर्भः
तडित्-गर्भ <i>m.</i> a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिन्मय
तडित्-मय <i>a.</i> consisting of lightning, K.S.v.25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिल्लता
तडित्-लता <i>f.</i> forked lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिल्लेखा
तडित्-लेखा <i>f.</i> a streak of lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिद्वत्
तडित्-वत् <i>(I) a.</i> having lightning, तडिद्वतीं शरदंबुदसंहतिम् Kir.v.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिद्वत्
तडित्-वत् <i>(II) m.</i> a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तंडक|तण्डक|तंडकः|तण्डकः
तंडक <i>m.</i> The Khanjana bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तंडुल|तण्डुल|तंडुलः|तण्डुलः
तंडुल <i>m.n.</i> Grain after thrashing, winnowing and unhusking (especially rice); the following stanza distinguishes between शस्य, धाण्य, तंडुल and अन्न- शस्यं क्षेत्रगतं प्रोक्तं सतुषं धान्यमुच्यते । निस्तुषस्तंडुलः प्रोक्तः स्विन्नमन्नमुदाहृतम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=299-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत|ततं|ततः
तत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Spread, commenced, (pp. of तन् q.v.), सततगास्ततगानगिरोऽलिभिः Sis.vi.50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तता
तत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Spread, commenced, (pp. of तन् q.v.), सततगास्ततगानगिरोऽलिभिः Sis.vi.50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत|ततं|ततः
तत <i>(II) n.</i> Any stringed musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततस्
ततस् <i>ind. (sometimes used for the abl. forms of तद्)</i> 1. Thence, from that, प्राप्यते ह्यमृतं ततः M.xii.85; 2. there, thither; 3. thereupon, then, afterwards, ततस्ततस्त्या विनियंतुमक्षमा Kir.i.27, ततो नु त्वं प्रेयान् वयमपि हताशाः प्रियतमाः Am.S.66; 4. in consequence of that, therefore; 5. beyond that, other than that, more than that, ततो दुःखतरं नु किम् Bg.ii.36, vi.22; 6. further, moreover; 7. then (as a correlative of यदि), अमोच्यमश्वं यदि मन्यसे प्रभो ततः समाप्ते विधिनैव कर्माणि &c. R.iii.65.ततस्ततस् 1. ‘here and there,’ e.g. नैशानि सर्वभूतानि प्रचरंति ततस्ततः; 2. ‘what next,’ ‘what further’; (in this sense it often occurs in plays).ततःप्रभृति (correlatire of यतःप्रभृति) ‘from that time forward,’ तृष्णा ततःप्रभृति मे द्विगुणत्वमेति Am.S.68.ततःकिम् ‘what then,’ ‘what matters it,’ ‘what use is it,’ कल्पं स्थितं तनुभृतां तनुभिस्ततःकिम् Sant.S.iv.2, Bhartr.iii.73, 74.यतः-ततः 1. ‘where-there,’ यतश्च भयमाशंकेत्ततो विस्तारयेद्बलम् M.vii.188; 2. ‘since-then.’यतोयतः-ततस्ततः ‘wher-ever-there,’ यतोयतः षट्चरणोऽभिवर्तते ततस्ततः प्रेरितवामलोचना Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ततस्त्य|ततस्त्यं
ततस्-त्व <i>a.</i> coming from that, proceeding thence, Kir.i.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तति|ततिः
तति <i>(I) pron. (declined only in the plural nom. and acc. तति)</i> So many, e.g. तति पुरुषान् पश्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तति|ततिः
तति <i>(II) f.</i> 1. A series, a row, a line, विस्रब्धं क्रियतां वराहततिभिर्मुस्ताक्षतिः पल्वले Sak.ii.; 2. a number, a troop; 3. a sacrificial act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्व|तत्वं
तत्व <i>n.</i> 1. True state, real condition, वयं तत्वान्वेषान्मधुकर हताः Sak.i.; 2. truth, reality; 3. essential nature, संन्यासस्य महाबाहो तत्वमिच्छामि वेदितुम् Bg.xviii.1, M.iv.92; 4. the real nature of the human soul or the world as being identical with the supreme spirit pervading the universe; 5. a first principle; 6. an element, a primary substance; 7. the mind; 8. a kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्व|तत्त्वं
तत्व <i>n.</i> 1. True state, real condition, वयं तत्वान्वेषान्मधुकर हताः Sak.i.; 2. truth, reality; 3. essential nature, संन्यासस्य महाबाहो तत्वमिच्छामि वेदितुम् Bg.xviii.1, M.iv.92; 4. the real nature of the human soul or the world as being identical with the supreme spirit pervading the universe; 5. a first principle; 6. an element, a primary substance; 7. the mind; 8. a kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्वाभियोग
तत्व-अभियोग <i>m.</i> a positive charge or declaration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वाभियोग|तत्त्वाभियोगः
तत्व-अभियोग <i>m.</i> a positive charge or declaration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्वार्थ
तत्व-अर्थ <i>m.</i> truth, reality, the real nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वार्थ|तत्त्वार्थः
तत्व-अर्थ <i>m.</i> truth, reality, the real nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्वज्ञ
तत्व-ज्ञ, -विद् <i>a.</i> 1. a philosopher; 2. knowing the true nature of Brahman (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वज्ञ|तत्त्वज्ञः
तत्व-ज्ञ, -विद् <i>a.</i> 1. a philosopher; 2. knowing the true nature of Brahman (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्वविद्
तत्व-ज्ञ, -विद् <i>a.</i> 1. a philosopher; 2. knowing the true nature of Brahman (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वविद्
तत्व-ज्ञ, -विद् <i>a.</i> 1. a philosopher; 2. knowing the true nature of Brahman (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्वतस्
तत्व-तस् <i>ind.</i> truly, accurately, M.vii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वतस्
तत्व-तस् <i>ind.</i> truly, accurately, M.vii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्वन्यास
तत्व-न्यास <i>m.</i> the ceremony of applying mystical letters and marks to the body performed in honour of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वन्यास|तत्त्वन्यासः
तत्व-न्यास <i>m.</i> the ceremony of applying mystical letters and marks to the body performed in honour of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्र
तत्र <i>ind. (sometimes used for the loc. forms of तद्, Bg.xviii.16, M.ii.112)</i> 1. There, yonder, thither; 2. on that occasion, then, under those circumstances; 3. for that, in that, यस्मदीयाः प्रजास्तत्र हेतुस्त्वद्ब्रह्मवर्चसम् R.i.63.तत्रापि ‘even then, nevertheless’ (a correlative of यद्यपि).तत्रतत्र ‘in various places or cases,’ ‘here and there,’ अध्यक्षान्विविधान्कुर्यात् तत्रतत्र विपश्चितः M.vii.81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रत्य|तत्रत्यः
तत्र-त्य <i>a.</i> produced there, belonging to that place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रभवत्|तत्रभवन्त्
तत्र-भवत् <i>pron.</i> his honour, his reverence (used of a person not near the speaker) (पूज्ये तत्रभवानत्रभवांश्च भगवानपि), असाधुदर्शी खलु तत्रभवान् काश्यपः य इमामाश्रमधर्मे नियुंक्ते Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्रस्थ
तत्र-स्थ <i>a.</i> standing there, belonging to that place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथा
तथा <i>ind.</i> 1. In that manner, so, in the same manner (a correlative of यथा), यथा नदीनदाः सर्वे सागरे यांति संस्थितिम् । तथैवाश्रमिणः सर्वे गृहस्थे यांति संस्थितिम् M.vi.90; (in this sense, the word is sometimes omitted, its relative यथा being only used, e.g. स्वप्नेपि समरेषु त्वां विजयश्रीर्न मुंचति । प्रभावप्रभवं कांतं स्वाधीनपतिका यथा K.Pr.x.); 2. true, just so, exactly so, यदात्थ राजन्यकुमार तत्तथा R.iii.48; 3. in such manner as, तस्मान्मुच्ये यथा तात संविधातुं तथार्हसि R.i.72, iii.66; 4. so also, and also, as well as, श्रुतस्य यायादयमंततमर्भकस्तथा परेषां युधि च R.iii.21; 5. as surely as, e.g. यथाहं नैषधान्यं मनसापि न चिंतये । तथायं पततां क्षुद्रः.With a following अपि, it is a correlative of यद्यपि and means ‘even then,’ ‘nevertheless,’ ‘yet,’ वपुःप्रकर्षादजयद्गुरुं रघुस्तथापि नीचैर्विनयाददृश्यत R.iii.34, 62.With a following इति, it expresses ‘assent or promise,’ e.g. तथेति प्रतिज्ञाय, or तथेति निष्क्रांतः R.i.92, iii.67.तथैव ‘even so, just so, exactly so.’तथाच ‘and likewise, so it has been said.’तथाहि ‘for so,’ ‘for instance,’ ‘for so it has been said,’ ‘to illustrate,’ तथाहि सर्वे तस्यासन् परार्थैकफला गुणाः R.i.29.यथायथा-तथातथा ‘in whatever manner-in that manner,’ ‘in whatever degree-in that degree,’ ‘the more-the more,’ ‘the less-the less,’ यथायथा चेयं चपला दीप्यते तथातथा दीपशिखेव कज्जलमलिनमेव, कर्म केवलमुद्वमति Kad., M.iv.20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाकृत
तथा-कृत <i>a.</i> thus done.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथागत|तथागतः
तथा-गत <i>(I) a.</i> 1. being in such a state or condition; 2. of such a quality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथागत|तथागतः
तथा-गत <i>(II) m.</i> an epithet of Buddha, काले मितं वाक्यमुदर्कपथ्यं तथागतस्य जनः सुचेताः Sis.xx.81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथागुण
तथा-गुण <i>a.</i> endowed with such qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथात्व|तथात्वं
तथा-त्व <i>n.</i> 1. such a condition; 2. true state, true nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाभूत
तथा-भूत <i>a.</i> 1. of such qualities, of such a nature; 2. in that condition, तथाभूतां दृष्ट्वा नृपसदसि पांचालतनयाम् Ve.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाराज|तथाराजः
तथा-राज <i>m.</i> an epithet of Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथारूप
तथा-रूप, -रूपिन् <i>a.</i> thus shaped, looking thus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथारूपिन्
तथा-रूप, -रूपिन् <i>a.</i> thus shaped, looking thus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाविध
तथा-विध <i>a.</i> of such a sort, of such a nature, R.iii.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथाविधम्
तथा-विधम् <i>ind.</i> 1. thus, in this manner; 2. likewise, equally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=300-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथ्य|तथ्यं
तथ्य <i>(I) a. (f. थ्या)</i> True, real, genuine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथ्या
तथ्य <i>(I) a. (f. थ्या)</i> True, real, genuine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथ्य|तथ्यं
तथ्य <i>(II) n.</i> Truth, reality, सा तथ्यमेवाभिहिता हरेण K.S.iii.53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्
तद् <i>(I) pron. (nom. sing. सः m., सा f., and तत् n.)</i> 1. He, she, it; 2. that, referring to something not present (तदिति परोक्षे विजानीयात्); 3. that (relating to something seen or experienced before), तन्मंजु मंदहसितं श्वसितानि तानि सा वै कलंकविधुरा मधुराननश्रीः Bh.V.ii.5; 4. that (meaning well-known or celebrated), सा रम्या नगरी महान्स नृपतिः सान्तचक्रं च तत् Bhartr.iii.37.With a following एव, तद् means ‘the same, identical, that very.’ It is sometimes used with the 1st and 2nd personal pronouns as well as with demonstratives and relatives for the sake of emphasis, सोऽहमिज्याविशुद्धात्मा R.i.68.When repeated, it has the sense of ‘various,’ ‘several’ Bg.vii.20.(The inst. sing. तेन is used as an indeclinable, in the sense of ‘therefore, for that reason, on that account.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्
तद् <i>(II) ind.</i> 1. Thither; 2. then, at that time, in that case; 3. therefore, consequently, Megh.i.7; 4. then (as a correlative of यदि), यदि मामप्रतीकारमशस्त्रं शस्त्रपाणयः । धार्तराष्ट्रा रणे हन्युस्तन्मे क्षेमतरं भवेत् Bg.i.45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदनंतरम्|तदनन्तरम्
तद्-अनंतरम् <i>ind.</i> immediately after that, thereupon, then.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदनु
तद्-अनु <i>ind.</i> after that, तदनु ववृषुः पुष्पमाश्चर्यमेघाः R.xvi.87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदंत|तदन्त
तद्-अंत <i>a.</i> perishing in that, ending thus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदर्थ
तद्-अर्थ, -अर्थीय <i>a.</i> intended for that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदर्थीय
तद्-अर्थ, -अर्थीय <i>a.</i> intended for that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदर्ह
तद्-अर्ह <i>a.</i> meriting that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदवधि
तद्-अवधि <i>ind.</i> 1. so far, up to that period, till then, तदवधि कुशली पुराणशास्त्रस्मृतिशतचारुविचारजो विवेकः Bh.V.ii.14; 2. from that time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदेकचित्त
तद्-एकचित्त <i>a.</i> having the mind exclusively fixed on that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्काल|तत्कालः
तद्-काल <i>m.</i> the current moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कालधी
तद्-काल˚धी <i>a.</i> having presence of mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्कालम्
तद्-कालम् <i>ind.</i> instantly, immediately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्क्षण|तत्क्षणः
तद्-क्षण <i>m.</i> the current moment, R.i.51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्क्षणम्
तद्-क्षणम् <i>ind.</i> instantly, immediately, R.iii.14, Sis.ix.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्क्रिय|तत्क्रियः
तद्-क्रिय <i>a.</i> working without wages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्गत|तद्गतः
तद्-गत <i>a.</i> directed to that, intent on that, belonging to that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्गुण|तद्गुणः
तद्-गुण <i>m.</i> a figure of speech thus defined- स्वमुत्सृज्य गुणैर्योगादत्युज्ज्वलगुणस्य यत् । वस्तु तद्गुणतामेति भण्यते स तु तद्गुणः K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तज्ज
तद्-ज <i>a.</i> immediate, instantaneous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तज्ज्ञ|तज्ज्ञः
तद्-ज्ञ <i>m.</i> a knowing or intelligent man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्तृतीय
तद्-तृतीय <i>a.</i> doing that for the third time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्धन|तद्धनः
तद्-धन <i>a.</i> miserly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पर|तत्परः
तद्-पर <i>a.</i> 1. following that, coming after that, inferior; 2. having that as the highest aim, totally devoted to that, eagerly engaged in that, R.i.66, ii.5, Megh.i.10, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्परायण|तत्परायणः
तद्-परायण <i>a.</i> solely attached to that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पुरुष|तत्पुरुषः
तद्-पुरुष <i>m.</i> 1. the original or supreme spirit; 2. a class of compounds in which the last member is defined or qualified by the first without losing its original independence, तत्पुरुष कर्मधारय येनाहं स्यां बहुव्रीहिः Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्पूर्व|तत्पूर्व्व
तद्-पूर्व <i>a.</i> 1. happening for the first time, तत्पूर्वभंगो वितथप्रयत्नः R.ii.42; 2. prior, former.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्प्रथम
तद्-प्रथम <i>a.</i> doing that for the first time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्बल|तद्बलः
तद्-बल <i>m.</i> a kind of arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्मय
तन्मय <i>a.</i> 1. made up of that; 2. absorbed in or identical with that, become one with that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्मात्र|तन्मात्रं
तन्मात्र <i>n.</i> 1. merely that, i.e. only a trifle; 2. a subtile and primary element (in Phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वत्|तद्वन्त्
तद्-वत् <i>(I) a.</i> containing or possessed of that, e.g. तद्वानपोहो वा शब्दार्थः K.Pr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वत्|तद्वन्त्
तद्-वत् <i>(II) ind.</i> 1. like that, in that manner, thus; 2. equally, likewise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्वाचक
तद्-वाचक <i>a.</i> signifying that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्विद्
तद्-विद् <i>a.</i> 1. knowing that; 2. knowing the truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्विध
तद्-विध <i>a.</i> of that kind, of that nature, R.ii.22, K.S.v.73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदा
तदा <i>ind.</i> 1. At that time, then; 2. in that case, M.i.55.तदा प्रभृति ‘from that time forward,’ K.S.i.53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदात्व|तदात्वं
तदा-त्व <i>n.</i> the present time, the time being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदामुख|तदामुखं
तदा-मुख <i>a.</i> commenced, begun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदानीम्
तदानीम् <i>ind.</i> At that time, then.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदानींतन
तदानीम्-तन <i>a.</i> belonging to that time, तदानींतनश्च संवृतः Ut.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=301-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदीय
तदीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Belonging to him, her or that, R.i.81, ii.28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=302-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदीया
तदीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Belonging to him, her or that, R.i.81, ii.28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=302-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन|तनः
तन <i>(I) vt. 8U (pp. तत; pres. तनोति, तनुते; pass. तन्यते, तायते; desid. तितंसति, तितासति, तितानिषति.)</i> 1. To spread, to extend, to stretch, Bt.xv.91, x.22; 2. to cover, स तमीं तमोभिरभिगम्य तताम् Sis.ix.23; 3. to do, to accomplish, to perform (as a sacrifice), नवतिं नवाधिकां महाक्रतूनां महनीयशासनः । समारुरुक्षुर्दिवमायुषः क्षये ततान सोपानपरंपरामिव R.iii.69; 4. to cause, to grant, to bestow, to give, पितुर्मुदं तेन ततान सोऽर्भकः R.iii.25; 5. to compose (as a work), e.g. तनुते टीकाम्; 6. to bend (as a bow); 7. to propagate; 8. to spin out, to weave.With अव-, 1. to cover; 2. to descend.With आ-, 1. to stretch, मौर्वी धनुषि चातता R.i.19; 2. to cause, to create, to make; 3. to diffuse, to spread.With प्र-, 1. to spread, यशांसि कवयो दिक्षु प्रतन्वंति नः Bhartr.iii.24; 2. to cause, to create; 3. to perform (as a sacrifice); 4. to cover; 5. to show, to exhibit, to show off, तद्भरीकृत्य कृतिभिर्वाचस्पत्यं प्रतायते Sis.ii.30.With वि-, 1. to cover, यो वितन्य स्थितः खम् Megh.i.58; 2. to spread; 3. to form, श्रेणीबंधाद्वितन्वद्भिरस्तंभां तोरणस्रजम् R.i.41; 4. to stretch (as a bow), वितत्य शार्ङ्गम् Bt.iii.47; 5. to cause, to give, to bestow; 6. to perform (as a sacrifice); 7. to compose (as a work), e.g. भावदीपो वितन्यते.With सम्-, to continue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=302-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन|तनः
तन <i>(II) vt. 1P, 10U (pres. तनति, तानयति-ते)</i> 1. To confide, to have faith in; 2. to assist, to aid; 3. to afflict with disease.With वि-, to spread, to extend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=302-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनय|तनयः
