तनु|तनुः
तनु <i>(I) a. (f. नु or न्वी)</i> 1. Thin, emaciated; 2. small, puny, tiny, scanty, तनुवाग्विभवोऽपि सन् R.i.9, iii.2; 3. delicate, fine; 4. little, unimportant, trifling, Am.S.27; 5. shallow (as a river).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=302-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

