तरल|तरलः
तरल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Trembling, shaking, tremulous, घन इव तरलबलाके Git.G.v., R.xiii.76; 2. fickle, unsteady, प्रकृतितरले का नः पीडा गते हतजीविते Am.S.27; 3. splendid, glittering; 4. liquid; 5. libidinous, wanton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=305-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरला
तरल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Trembling, shaking, tremulous, घन इव तरलबलाके Git.G.v., R.xiii.76; 2. fickle, unsteady, प्रकृतितरले का नः पीडा गते हतजीविते Am.S.27; 3. splendid, glittering; 4. liquid; 5. libidinous, wanton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=305-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरल|तरलः
तरल <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The central gem of a necklace, हारांस्तारांस्तरलगुटिकान् Megh.i. (considered to be interpolated by Mall.); 2. a necklace; 3. a level surface; 4. bottom, depth; 5. a diamond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=305-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलय्
