तर्षिता
तर्षित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Thirsty; 2. wishing, desiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्हि
तर्हि <i>ind.</i> At that time, then, in that case.यदा-तर्हि ‘when-then.’यदि-तर्हि ‘if-then.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल|तलं|तलः
तल <i>(I) m.n. (the word is sometimes used at the end of compounds almost without any meaning, as in हिमधाम्नि दर्पणतले च मुहुः स्वमुखश्रियं मृगदृशो ददृशुः Sis.ix.53)</i> 1. A surface, भुवस्तलमिव व्योम कुर्वन् व्योमेव भूतलम् R.iv.29, K.S.i.55, Rt.i.3; 2. the palm of the hand or the sole of the foot, R.vi.18, Bhartr.i.20; 3. the fore-arm; 4. a slap with the hand; 5. lowness, inferiority of position; 6. lower part, bottom, छायामिवादर्शतलं प्रविष्टाम् R.xvi.6; 7. the ground under a tree or any other object, Rt.i.13; 8. a hole, a pit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल|तलं|तलः
तल <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The hilt of a sword; 2. the palmyra tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल|तलं|तलः
तल <i>(III) n.</i> 1. A pond; 2. a forest; 3. cause, origin, motive; 4. a leathern fence wound round the left arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलांगुलि
तल-अंगुलि <i>f.</i> a toe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलाची
तल-अची <i>f.</i> a mat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलातल|तलातलं
तल-अतल <i>n.</i> the fourth of the seven infernal regions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलेक्षण|तलेक्षणः
