तलोदा
तल-उदा <i>f.</i> a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलघात|तलघातः
तल-घात <i>m.</i> a slap with the palm of the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलतस्
तल-तस् <i>ind.</i> from the bottom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलताल|तलतालः
तल-ताल <i>m.</i> a kind of musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलत्र
तल-त्र, -त्राण, -वारण <i>n.</i> the leathern glove of an archer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

