तलप्रहार|तलप्रहारः
तल-प्रहार <i>m.</i> slap with the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलसारक|तलसारकं
