तल्प|तल्पं|तल्पः
तल्प <i>m.n.</i> 1. A couch, a bed, a sofa, सपदि विगतनिद्रस्तल्पमुज्झांचकार R.v.75; 2. a wife, as in गुरुतल्पग; 3. the seat of a carriage; 4. an upper story, a turret, a tower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

