ताक्षण्य|ताक्षण्यः
ताक्षण्य <i>m.</i> The son of a carpenter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताक्ष्ण|ताक्ष्णः
ताक्षण्य <i>m.</i> The son of a carpenter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताच्छीलिक|ताच्छीलिकः
