तातल|तातलः
तातल <i>m.</i> 1. A disease; 2. an iron club; 3. cooking or maturing; 4. heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=306-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताति|तातिः
ताति <i>(I) m.</i> Offspring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=307-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताति|तातिः
