तात्कालिकी
तात्कालिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Simultaneous; 2. immediate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=307-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

