ताल <i>m.</i> 1. The palmyra tree, R.xv.23; 2. a banner formed of the palm; 3. clapping the hands together; 4. beating time (in music), Megh.ii.16; 5. a kind of musical instrument made of bell-metal, R.ix.71; 6. the palm of the hand; 7. a lock, a bolt; 8. the hilt of a sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=308-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताल|तालं|तालः
