तिरस्
तिरस् <i>ind.</i> A particle meaning- (1) crookedly, obliquely, e.g. तिरो गत्वा समीक्षेत; (2) invisible, unseen [in classics, it is not used by itself but in composition with the roots कृ, M.iv.49, R.iii.8, xvi.20, Am.S.81), धा (R.x.48), and भू (Bt.xiv.44) qq.vv.].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=310-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

