तीर्थ-काक, -ध्वांक्ष <i>m.</i> a crow at a sacred bathing-place, i.e. too greedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=311-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

