तीव्र <i>(I) a. (f. व्रा)</i> 1. Severe, intense, sharp, acute, violent, pungent; 2. hot, warm; 3. flashing; 4. much, excessive, endless, (op. to मंद), विलंघिताधोरणतीव्रयत्नाः R.v.48; 5. horrible, dreadful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=311-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीव्रा
