तीव्र|तीव्रं|तीव्रः
तीव्र <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Heat, pungency; 2. a shore; 3. iron, steel; 4. tin.(तीव्रम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘violently, sharply, excessively.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=311-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीव्रानंद|तीव्रानन्द|तीव्रानन्दः
