तुष्
तुष् <i>vi. 4P (pp. तुष्ट; pres. तुष्यति; caus. तोषयति-ते)</i> To be contented or delighted with anything, Bt.xv.8, ii.13, M.iii.207.With परि-, to be contented, satisfied or delighted, अस्मत्कृते च परितुष्यति काचिदन्या Bhartr.ii.2.With सम्-, to be satisfied or contented, तृष्णे जृंभसि पापकर्मनिरते नाद्यापि संतुष्यसि Bhartr.iii.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=313-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

