त्रियंबक|त्रियम्बक
त्र्यंबक <i>m. (the latter is rare in classics; See the quotation below)</i> an epithet of Śiva (having three eyes), त्रियंबकं संयमिनं ददर्श K.S.iii.44, 42, iii.49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्र्यंबकसख|त्र्यम्बकसख|त्र्यम्बकसखः
