त्र्यब्द
त्रि-अब्द <i>(II) n.</i> three years (collectively).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

