त्रिकाल
त्रि-काल <i>n.</i> 1. the three times, viz., the past, present and future, or morning, noon and evening; 2. the three tenses (the past, present and future) of a verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

