त्रिगत
त्रि-गत <i>a.</i> 1. tripled; 2. done in three ways.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिगर्त|त्रिगर्त्त|त्रिगर्त्तः
