त्रि-जीवा, -ज्या <i>f.</i> the sine of three signs or 90°, a radius.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिणता
