त्रिणवन्
त्रि-णव, -णवन् <i>a. pl.</i> three times nine, i.e. ‘27’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रितक्ष|त्रितक्षं
त्रि-तक्ष <i>n.</i> three carpenters (collectively).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रितक्षी
त्रि-तक्षी <i>f.</i> three carpenters (collectively).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रितय|त्रितयं
त्रि-तय <i>(I) a. (f. यी)</i> threefold, consisting of three parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रितयी
त्रि-तय <i>(I) a. (f. यी)</i> threefold, consisting of three parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=318-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रितय|त्रितयं
