दक्षिणाचार|दक्षिणाचारः
दक्षिण-आचार <i>a.</i> 1. honest, well-behaved; 2. a worshipper of Śakti according to the right hand ritual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=322-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

