दंडपोण|दण्डपोण
दंड-पोण <i>n.</i> a filtering machine with a handle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=323-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

