दंडयात्रा|दण्डयात्रा
दंड-यात्रा <i>f.</i> 1. a solemn procession; 2. warlike expedition, conquest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=323-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंडयाम|दण्डयाम|दण्डयामः
