दंड-वादिन्, -वासिन् <i>m.</i> a doorkeeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=323-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

