दंडक|दण्डक|दंडकः|दण्डकः
दंडक <i>m. (often used in the plural)</i> Name of a district in the Dekkan between the Narmadā and Godāvarī, uninhabited in the time of Rāma, प्राप्तानि दुःखान्यपि दंडकेषु R.xiv.25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=323-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंडका|दण्डका
