ददा
दद <i>a. (f. दा)</i> Giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=324-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ददन|ददनं
ददन <i>n.</i> Gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=324-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दध्
