दध्यन्न
दधि-अन्न, -ओदन <i>n.</i> boiled rice mixed with dadhi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=324-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दध्योदन
दधि-अन्न, -ओदन <i>n.</i> boiled rice mixed with dadhi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=324-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दध्युत्तर|दध्युत्तरं
