दंतुरित|दन्तुरित
दंतुरित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Having prominent teeth; 2. toothed, notched, bristling, केतकिदंतुरिताशे Git.G.i., विपुलपुलकभरदंतुरितम् xi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=325-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंतुरिता
दंतुरित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Having prominent teeth; 2. toothed, notched, bristling, केतकिदंतुरिताशे Git.G.i., विपुलपुलकभरदंतुरितम् xi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=325-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंत्य|दन्त्य|दन्त्यः
दंत्य <i>m.</i> A letter of the dental class; See दंतमूलीय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=325-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंदश|दन्दश|दंदशः|दन्दशः
दंदश <i>m.</i> A tooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=325-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंदशूक|दन्दशूक|दन्दशूकः
दंदशूक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> Venomous, mischievous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=325-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंदशूका
दंदशूक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> Venomous, mischievous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=325-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंदशूक|दन्दशूक|दन्दशूकः
दंदशूक <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A demon, इषुमति रघुसिंहे दंदशूकाञ्जिघांसौ Bt.i.26; 2. a snake; 3. a reptile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=325-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंभ्|दम्भ्
दंभ् <i>vt. 5P (pp. दब्ध; pres. दभ्नोति; desid. धिप्सति, धीप्सति, दिदंभिषति)</i> 1. To injure, to hurt; 2. to go; 3. to deceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=325-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंभ्|दम्भ्
