दल्
दल् <i>vi. or vt. 1P (pp. दलित)</i> 1. To burst open, to split, to crack, दलति हृदयं गाढोद्वेगं द्विधा तु न भिद्यते M.M.ix., दलति न सा हृदि विरहभरेण Git.G.vii., Am.S.38; 2. to expand, to open (as a flower), अयि दलदरविंद Bh.V.i.5, 15.With वि-, 1. to break, to split, to crack, Na.iv.88; 2. to dig.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=327-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

