दहन-उल्का <i>f.</i> a fire-brand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=328-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दहनकेतन|दहनकेतनं|दहनकेतनः
दहन-केतन <i>m.</i> smoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=328-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दहनप्रिया
दहन-प्रिया <i>f.</i> Svāhā, wife of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=328-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दहनसारथि|दहनसारथिः
दहन-सारथि <i>m.</i> wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=328-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दहर|दहरं|दहरः
दहर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Small, fine, thin; 2. young in age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=328-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दहरा
दहर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Small, fine, thin; 2. young in age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=328-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दहर|दहरं|दहरः
