दाक्षिणी
दाक्षिण <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Relating to a sacrificial gift; 2. relating to the south.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=329-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाक्षिण
