दाक्षिणात्य|दाक्षिणात्यः
दाक्षिणात्य <i>(I) a. (f. त्या)</i> Belonging to or living in the South, southern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=329-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाक्षिणात्या
