दाक्षिणात्य <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A southerner, a native of the Dekkan, e.g. आरंभशूराः खलु दाक्षिणात्याः; 2. the cocoanut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=329-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

