दापित|दापितः
दापित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Caused to be given; 2. condemned to pay, fined; 3. adjudged. (Also दायित.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=330-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दापिता
