दामन्
दामन् <i>n.</i> 1. A string, a thread, a rope; 2. a chaplet, a garland, कनकचंपकदामगौरीम् Ch.P.1; 3. a streak, a line, Megh.i.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=330-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

