दाय|दायः
दाय <i>m.</i> 1. A gift, a present, अस्वामिना कृतो यस्तु दायो विक्रय एव वा M.viii.199; 2. a nuptial present given to the bride or the bride-groom; 3. delivery, handing over; 4. share, portion, inheritance, patrimony, अनपत्यस्य पुत्रस्य माता दायमवाप्नुयात् M.ix.217; 5. dividing, distributing; 6. loss, destruction; 7. irony; 8. site, place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=330-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

