दिक्करी
दिक्करिका <i>f.</i> a youthful girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिक्करिन्
दिक्करिन् <i>m.</i> any of the eight elephants who are said to preside over the eight quarters. (See अष्टदिग्गज.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्गज|दिग्गजः
दिक्करिन् <i>m.</i> any of the eight elephants who are said to preside over the eight quarters. (See अष्टदिग्गज.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्दंतिन्|दिग्दन्तिन्
दिक्करिन् <i>m.</i> any of the eight elephants who are said to preside over the eight quarters. (See अष्टदिग्गज.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्वारण|दिग्वारणः
दिक्करिन् <i>m.</i> any of the eight elephants who are said to preside over the eight quarters. (See अष्टदिग्गज.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्ग्रहण
दिग्ग्रहण <i>n.</i> observation of the quarters of the compass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिक्चक्र
दिक्चक्र <i>n.</i> 1. the horizon; 2. the whole world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्जय|दिग्जयः
दिग्जय <i>m.</i> the conquest of various countries in all directions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्विजय|दिग्विजयः
दिग्जय <i>m.</i> the conquest of various countries in all directions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्दर्शन
दिग्दर्शन <i>n.</i> 1. pointing out the direction, showing the way or manner; 2. a general survey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिङ्नाग|दिङ्नागः
दिङ्नाग <i>m.</i> 1. an elephant presiding over a quarter of the compass; 2. name of a poet, a rival of Kālidāsa (according to some). See Megh.i.14, and Mall. on it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्भाग|दिग्भागः
