दिङ्मुख
दिङ्मुख <i>n.</i> any quarter or path of the heavens, Am.S.54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्वस्त्र|दिग्वस्त्रः
दिग्वस्त्र <i>(I) a.</i> stark naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्वस्त्र|दिग्वस्त्रः
दिग्वस्त्र <i>(II) m.</i> 1. an epithet of Śiva; 2. a Jaina mendicant of the Digambara order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्विभावित
दिग्विभावित <i>a.</i> celebrated or known in all quarters.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिशा
दिशा <i>f.</i> Direction, region, quarter of the compass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिशागज|दिशागजः
दिशा-गज <i>m.</i> See दिग्गज.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=333-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिशापाल|दिशापालः
