दुह्
दुह् <i>vt. 2U (pp. दुग्ध; pres. दोग्धि, दुग्धे; desid. दुधुक्षति) (This is one of those roots, which take two accusatives भास्वंति रत्नानि महौषधीश्च पृथूपदिष्टां दुदुहुर्धरित्रीम् K.S.i.2)</i> 1. To milk, पयो घटोद्घ्नरिपि गा दुहंति Bt.xii.73, राजन् दुधुक्षसि यदि क्षितिधेनुमेताम् Bhartr.ii.56; 2. to squeeze out, to draw anything out of another; 3. to make a profit or extract gain out of anything, दुदोह गां स यज्ञाय शस्याय मघवा दिवम् R.i.26; 4. to enjoy; 5. to yield, e.g. कामान्दुग्धे विप्रकर्षत्यलक्ष्मीम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=338-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुहितृ
दुहितृ <i>f.</i> A daughter, दुरतिक्रमा दुहितरो विपदः Panch.i., M.ii.215.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुहितुःपति|दुहितुःपतिः
दुहितुःपति <i>m.</i> a son-in-law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुहितृपति|दुहितृपतिः
दुहितुःपति <i>m.</i> a son-in-law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दू
दू <i>vt. or vi. 4Ā (pp. दून; pres. दूयते)</i> 1. To suffer pain, to be afflicted, K.S.v.12, R.viii.57; 2. to be sorry, न दूये सात्वतीसूनूर्यन्मह्यपराध्यति Sis.ii.11; 3. to inflict pain, दूयते दीनं खलजनः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

