दूतक|दूतकः
दूत <i>m.</i> A messenger, an envoy, a negotiator, Cāṇakya.106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतमुख
दूत-मुख <i>a.</i> speaking by an ambassador.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतकमुख
दूत-मुख <i>a.</i> speaking by an ambassador.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतिका
दूतिका <i>f.</i> 1. A female messenger, a confidante, a go-between; (the final ती of दुती is sometimes shortened, See K.S.iv.16, and Mall. on it), R.xviii.53, xix.18; 2. a gossiping, mischief-making woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूती
दूतिका <i>f.</i> 1. A female messenger, a confidante, a go-between; (the final ती of दुती is sometimes shortened, See K.S.iv.16, and Mall. on it), R.xviii.53, xix.18; 2. a gossiping, mischief-making woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूत्य|दूत्यं
दूत्य <i>n.</i> 1. Employment of an envoy; 2. an embassy; 3. a message.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दून|दूनः
दून <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Pained, afflicted, distressed, fatigued, कथमथ वंचयसे जनमनुगतमसमशरज्वरदूनम् Git.G.viii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूना
दून <i>a. (f. ना)</i> Pained, afflicted, distressed, fatigued, कथमथ वंचयसे जनमनुगतमसमशरज्वरदूनम् Git.G.viii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूर|दूरं
दूर <i>(I) a. (f. रा; compar. दवीयस्, super. दविष्ठ)</i> Distant, remote, long, न योजनशतं दूरं वाद्यमानस्य तृष्णया Hit.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरा
दूर <i>(I) a. (f. रा; compar. दवीयस्, super. दविष्ठ)</i> Distant, remote, long, न योजनशतं दूरं वाद्यमानस्य तृष्णया Hit.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूर|दूरं
दूर <i>(II) n.</i> Distanee, remoteness.(दूरम् is used adverbially in the sense of- (1) to a distance, far away, far from, (with an abl. or gen., e.g. ग्रामात् or ग्रामस्य दूरम्); (2) high above; (3) far below; (4) highly, in a high degree, very, completely, नेत्रे दूरमनंजने K.Pr.i., Megh.i.55. दूरेण is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘far, from a distant place, from afar, by far,’ स्तुतिभ्यो व्यतिरिच्यंते दूरेण चरितानि ते R.x.30, Bg.ii.49. दूरात् in the sense of- (1) from a distance, from afar, e.g. प्रक्षालनाद्धि पंकस्य दूरादस्पर्शनं वरम्, or नदीयमभितः क्रूराशया … … दूरात्परित्यज्यताम् Bhartr.i.81, R.i.61; (2) in a remote degree; (3) from a remote period. दूरतस् in the sense of, ‘from afar, from a distance, far away,’ दोषं विमुंचति दूरतः Git.G.ii., रात्रौ च वृक्षमूलानि दूरतः परिवर्जयेत् iv.73. दूरे in the sense of ‘far, far away, in a distant place,’ न मे दूरे किंचित्क्षणमपि न पार्श्वे रथजवात् Sak.i. दूरीकृ 1. to separate, to deprive of, न्यायेन दुरीकृता Mrich.ix.; 2. to ward off; 3. to remove, to take away, दुरीकरोति कुमतिम् Bh.V.i.122; 4. to surpass, to distance. दूरीभू ‘to be away from, to be separated from,’ दूरीभूते मयि सहचरे चक्रवाकीमिवैकाम् Megh.ii.20.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरांतरित|दूरान्तरित
दूर-अंतरित <i>a.</i> separated by a wide space.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

