दूर-आपात <i>m.</i> shooting from afar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूराप्लाव
दूर-आप्लाव <i>a.</i> jumping or leaping far.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरारूढ
दूर-आरूढ <i>a.</i> 1. mounted high; 2. far advanced, intense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरेरितेक्षण|दूरेरितेक्षणः
दूर-ईरितेक्षण <i>a.</i> squinting, squint-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरग्रहण
दूर-ग्रहण <i>n.</i> the supernatural faculty of perceiving objects from afar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरगत
दूर-गत <i>a.</i> 1. far removed, distant; 2. far advanced, intense, दूरगतमन्मथा अक्षमेयं कालहरणस्य Sak.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरेत्य
दूरेत्य <i>a.</i> being far off, come from afar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदर्शन|दूरदर्शनः
दूर-दर्शन <i>m.</i> 1. a vulture; 2. a learned man, a paṇḍit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदर्शिन्
दूर-दर्शिन् <i>(I) a.</i> far-seeing, prudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदर्शिन्
दूर-दर्शिन् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. a vulture; 2. a learned man; 3. a prophet, a sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदृष्टि|दूरदृष्टिः
दूर-दृष्टि <i>f.</i> 1. long-sightedness; 2. foresight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरपात|दूरपातः
दूर-पात <i>m.</i> 1. a long flight; 2. falling from a great height.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरपात्र
दूर-पात्र <i>a.</i> having a wide channel or bed (as a river).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरपार|दूरपारः
दूर-पार <i>a.</i> 1. very broad (as a river); 2. difficult to be crossed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरबंधु|दूरबन्धु
दूर-बंधु <i>a.</i> banished from wife and relatives.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरभाज्
दूर-भाज् <i>a.</i> distant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरवर्तिन्
दूर-वर्तिन् <i>a.</i> being in the distance, far removed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरवस्त्रक
दूर-वस्त्रक <i>a.</i> naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरविलंबिन्|दूरविलम्बिन्
