दूरवेधिन्
दूर-वेधिन् <i>a.</i> piercing from afar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरसंस्थ
दूर-संस्थ <i>a.</i> being in the distance, remote, away, कंठाश्लेषप्रणयिनि जने किं पुनर्दूरसंस्थे Megh.i.3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=339-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूर्य|दूर्यं|दूर्य्य|दूर्य्यं
