दृप्ता
दृप्त <i>a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Proud, arrogant; 2. mad, wild.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=340-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

