दृष्ट|दृष्टं
दृष्ट <i>(II) n.</i> Danger from dacoits &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=341-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

