दृष्टि-पथ <i>m.</i> the range of sight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=341-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृष्टिपूत
दृष्टि-पूत <i>a.</i> kept pure by the sight, i.e. watched that no impurity is contracted, दृष्टिपूतं न्यसेत्पादम् M.vi.46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=341-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

