द्रव्यौघ|द्रव्यौघः
द्रव्य-ओघ <i>m.</i> abundance of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यपरिग्रह|द्रव्यपरिग्रहः
