द्रव्यवत्|द्रव्यवन्त्
द्रव्य-वत् <i>a.</i> rich, wealthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यवाचक
द्रव्य-वाचक <i>n.</i> a substantive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रष्टव्य
द्रष्टव्य <i>a. (f. व्या)</i> 1. What ought to be seen; 2. pleasing to the sight, beautiful, द्रष्टव्येषु किमुत्तमम् Bhartr.i.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रष्टव्या
द्रष्टव्य <i>a. (f. व्या)</i> 1. What ought to be seen; 2. pleasing to the sight, beautiful, द्रष्टव्येषु किमुत्तमम् Bhartr.i.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रष्टृ
द्रष्टृ <i>m.</i> 1. One who sees mentally, a seer, e.g. मंत्रद्रष्टृ; 2. a judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रह|द्रहः
द्रह <i>m.</i> A deep lake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रा
द्रा <i>vi. 2P (pp. द्राण; pres. द्राति)</i> 1. To nin, to fly; 2. to sleep.With नि-, to sleep, नीरे नीरचरैः समं स भगवान्निद्राति नारायणः Bh.V.i.41, Na.i.121.With वि-, to run away, to retreat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्
