द्राग्भृतक
द्राग्भृतक <i>n.</i> water just drawn from a well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्षा
द्राक्षा <i>f.</i> Vine, grape (either the creeper or the fruit), R.iv.65, Bh.V.i.14, iv.39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्षारस|द्राक्षारसः
द्राक्षा-रस <i>m.</i> grape-juicc, wine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघय्
द्राघय् <i>vt. (denom. pres. द्राघयति)</i> To lengthen, to increase, to make intense, द्राघयंति हि मे शोकं स्मर्यमाणा गुणास्तव Bt.xviii.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघिमन्
द्राघिमन् <i>m.</i> 1. Length; 2. a degree of longitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघिष्ठ|द्राघिष्ठः
द्राघिष्ठ <i>a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> Longest, (super. of दीर्घ q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघिष्ठा
द्राघिष्ठ <i>a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> Longest, (super. of दीर्घ q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघीयस्
द्राघीयस् <i>a. (f. सी)</i> Longer, (compar. of दीर्घ q.v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघीयसी
द्राघीयस् <i>a. (f. सी)</i> Longer, (compar. of दीर्घ q.v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राण|द्राणः
द्राण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Flown, run away; 2. sleeping, sleepy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राणा
द्राण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Flown, run away; 2. sleeping, sleepy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राण|द्राणः
द्राण <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Running away, retreat; 2. sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राप|द्रापः
द्राप <i>m.</i> 1. Mud, mire; 2. the sky; 3. a fool, an idiot; 4. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रामिल|द्रामिलः
द्रामिल <i>m.</i> An epithet of Cāṇakya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राव|द्रावः
द्राव <i>m.</i> 1. Flight, retreat; 2. speed; 3. running, flowing; 4. heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावक|द्रावकं|द्रावकः
द्रावक <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A flux to assist diffusion of metals; 2. the moon-gem; 3. a thief; 4. a sharp or clever man, a wit; 5. a libertine, a lecher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावक|द्रावकं|द्रावकः
द्रावक <i>(II) n.</i> Wax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावण|द्रावणं
द्रावण <i>m.</i> 1. Putting to flight; 2. fusing; 3. distilling; 4. the clearing-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविड|द्राविडः
द्राविड <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A Drāviḍian; 2. a Brāhmaṇa of any of the five southern tribes, viz., द्राविड, कर्णाट, गुर्जर, महाराष्ट्र and तैलंग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविड|द्राविडः
द्राविड <i>(II) m. pl.</i> The Drāviḍa country and its people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविडक|द्राविडकं|द्राविडकः
द्राविडक <i>(I) m.</i> Zedoary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविडक|द्राविडकं|द्राविडकः
द्राविडक <i>(II) n.</i> Black salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविडी
द्राविडी <i>f.</i> Cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रु|द्रुः
द्रु <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pp. द्रुत; pres. द्रवति; desid. दुद्रूषति)</i> 1. To flow, to run, to run away, to retreat, to fly (often with an acc.) यथा नदीनां बहवोंबुवेगाः समुद्रमेवाभिमुखं द्रवंति Bg.xi.28, रक्षांसि भीतानि दिशो द्रवंति 36; 2. to rush, to attack, to assault quickly, Bt.ix.59; 3. to become fluid, to dissolve, to melt, Bt.ii.12, Sis.ix.9.With अनु-, to follow, to run after, R.iii.38, xii.67.With अभि-, to attack, गजा इवान्योन्यमभुद्रवंतः Mrich.v.; 2. to befall.With उप-, to attack, R.xv.23.With प्र-, to run, to run away, to retreat, (with an acc. generally), Bt.xv.79.With प्रति-, to run to, to go to, Bt.vi.17.With वि-, to run, to ran away, to retreat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रु|द्रुः
द्रु <i>(II) vt. 5P (pres. द्रुणोति)</i> 1. To hurt, to injure, तं दुद्रायाद्रिणा कपिः Bt.xiv.81, 85; 2. to repent; 3. to go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रु|द्रुः
द्रु <i>Caus. (द्रावयति-ते)</i> 1. to put to flight; 2. to fuse.With वि-, to tear, to scatter, Bh.V.i.52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=348-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रु|द्रुः
