धन्य|धन्यः
धन्य <i>(I) a. (f. न्या)</i> 1. Bestowing wealth, M.iii.106; 2. opulent, wealthy; 3. fortunate, happy, lucky, blessed, धन्या केयं स्थिता ते शिरसि Mud.i.; 4. good, virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=353-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धन्या
धन्य <i>(I) a. (f. न्या)</i> 1. Bestowing wealth, M.iii.106; 2. opulent, wealthy; 3. fortunate, happy, lucky, blessed, धन्या केयं स्थिता ते शिरसि Mud.i.; 4. good, virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=353-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धन्य|धन्यः
धन्य <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A lucky man, तांबूलीदलपूगपूरितमुखा धन्याः सुखं शेरते Bhartr.i.41; 2. a worthy man, an extraordinary man, धन्यः कोपि न विक्रियां कलयति प्राप्ते नवे यौवने Bhartr.i.72; 3. an infidel, an atheist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=353-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

