धन्यंमन्य
धन्यंमन्य <i>a.</i> considering oneself happy or fortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=353-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

