धन्या
धन्या <i>f.</i> A nurse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=353-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धन्याक|धन्याकं
धन्याक <i>n.</i> 1. A plant bearing a small pungent seed used as a condiment; 2. the seed of this plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=353-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धन्व|धन्वं|धन्वः
