धन्वन्
धन्वन् <i>(I) n.</i> A substitute for धनुस् at the end of Bahu. compounds, अधिज्यधन्वा विचचार दावम् R.ii.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=353-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धन्वन्
धन्वन् <i>(II) m.n.</i> A dry soil, a desert, a waste, एवं धन्वनि चंपकस्य सकले संहारहेतावपि Bh.V.i.31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=353-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धन्वदुर्ग|धन्वदुर्गं
