धन्वंतर|धन्वन्तर|धन्वंतरं
धन्वंतर <i>n.</i> A measure of length equal to four hastas, (the same as दंड q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=354-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

