धिषणा
धिषणा <i>f.</i> 1. Speech; 2. praise, hymn; 3. intellect; 4. the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=360-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धिष्ण्य|धिष्ण्यं|धिष्ण्यः
धिष्ण्य <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A place for the sacrificial fire, अमी वेदिं परितः कॢप्तधिष्ण्याः Sak.i.; 2. an epithet of Śukra, the preceptor of the demons; 3. the planet Venus; 4. power, strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=360-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धिष्ण्य|धिष्ण्यं|धिष्ण्यः
धिष्ण्य <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A seat, an abode, a house, न भौमान्येव धिष्ण्यानि हित्वा ज्योतिर्मयान्यपि R.xv.59; 2. a meteor, a star; 3. fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=360-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धी
धी <i>f.</i> 1. Intellect, understanding, धियः समग्रैः स गुणैरुदारधीः R.iii.30; 2. the mind, उदारधीः R.iii.30, Bg.ii.54; 3. thought, idea, imagination, न धियां पथि वर्तसे K.S.vi.22; 4. devotion, prayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=360-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धींद्रिय|धीन्द्रिय|धीन्द्रियं
धी-इंद्रिय <i>m.</i> an organ of perception (ज्ञानेंद्रिय q.v., मनः कर्णस्तथा नेत्रं रसना च त्वचा सह । नासिका चेति षट् तानि धींद्रियाणि प्रचक्षते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=360-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धियांपति|धियाम्पति|धियाम्पतिः
