धौतकट|धौतकटः
धौत-कट <i>m.</i> a bag of coarse cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौतकोषज|धौतकोषजं
धौत-कोषज, -कोषेय <i>n.</i> bleached or purified silk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौतकौषेय|धौतकौषेयं
धौत-कोषज, -कोषेय <i>n.</i> bleached or purified silk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौतशिल|धौतशिलं
धौत-शिल <i>n.</i> rock-crystal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौम्र|धौम्रः
धौम्र <i>m.</i> 1. Greyness; 2. a place for building (prepared in a particular way).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौरितक|धौरितकं
धौरितक <i>n.</i> A horse’s trot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौरेय|धौरेयः
