धौरेयी
धौरेय <i>(I) a. (f. यी)</i> Fit for a burden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौरेय|धौरेयः
धौरेय <i>(II) m.</i> A beast of burden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौर्तक|धौर्तकं|धौर्त्तक
धौर्तक <i>n.</i> Fraud, dishonesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौर्तिक|धौर्तिकं|धौर्त्तिक|धौर्त्तिकं
धौर्तक <i>n.</i> Fraud, dishonesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धौर्त्य|धौर्त्यं
धौर्तक <i>n.</i> Fraud, dishonesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्मा
ध्मा <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pp. ध्मात; pres. धमति; caus. ध्मापयति)</i> 1. To breathe out, to exhale; 2. to blow (as a wind-instrument), शंखान् दध्मुः पृथक् पृथक् Bg.i.18, 12, R.vii.63; 3. to blow a fire, to excite sparks, e.g. को धमेच्छांतं च पावकम्; 4. to manufacture by blowing; 5. to cast, to throw away.With आ-, to fill with air, to blow (as a wind instrument).With उप-, to excite by blowing, नाग्निं मुखेनोपधमेत् M.iv.53.With निस्-, to blow out of something.With प्र-, to blow (as a wind-instrument), Bg.i.14.With वि-, to disperse, to destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्माकार|ध्माकारः
ध्माकार <i>m.</i> A black-smith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्मांक्ष|ध्माङ्क्ष|ध्माङ्क्षः
ध्मांक्ष <i>m.</i> Another form of ध्वांक्ष q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=363-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्मात
ध्मात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Blown (as a wind-instrumen t); 2. blown, fanned, excited; 3. puffed, puffed up, (pp. of ध्मा q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्माता
ध्मात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Blown (as a wind-instrumen t); 2. blown, fanned, excited; 3. puffed, puffed up, (pp. of ध्मा q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्मापित
ध्मापित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Reduced to ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्मापिता
ध्मापित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Reduced to ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यात|ध्यातं
ध्यात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Thought of, meditated upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्याता
ध्यात <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Thought of, meditated upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यान|ध्यानं
ध्यान <i>n.</i> 1. Meditation, reflection, contemplation, ध्यानलयेन पुरः परिकल्प्य भवंतमतीव दुरापम् Git.G.iv., M.i.12; 2. religious meditation, R.i.73; 3. divine intuition or discernment; 4. mental representation of the personal attributes of a deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यानगम्य
ध्यान-गम्य <i>a.</i> attainable by meditation only.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यानतत्पर
ध्यान-तत्पर, -निष्ठ, -पर <i>a.</i> lost in thought, absorbed in meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्याननिष्ठ
ध्यान-तत्पर, -निष्ठ, -पर <i>a.</i> lost in thought, absorbed in meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यानपर
ध्यान-तत्पर, -निष्ठ, -पर <i>a.</i> lost in thought, absorbed in meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यानयोग|ध्यानयोगः
ध्यान-योग <i>m.</i> profound meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यानस्थ
ध्यान-स्थ <i>a.</i> absorbed in meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यानिक
ध्यानिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> Sought or obtained by pious contemplation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यानिका
ध्यानिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> Sought or obtained by pious contemplation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्याम|ध्यामं
ध्याम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> Unclean, dirty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यामा
ध्याम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> Unclean, dirty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्याम|ध्यामं
ध्याम <i>(II) n.</i> A kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यामन्
ध्यामन् <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Measure; 2. light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यामन्
ध्यामन् <i>(II) m.</i> Meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्यै
ध्यै <i>vt. 1P (pp. ध्यात; pres. ध्यायति; desid. दिध्यासति; pass. ध्यायते)</i> To think of, to meditate, to reflect upon, to ponder over, to imagine, to recollect, ध्यायतो विषयान् पुंसः Bg.ii.62, ध्यायंति चान्यं धिया Panch.i., चिरमनुचरो राजराजस्य दध्यौ Megh.i.3.With अनु-, to think of, to remember, to wish well to, R.xiv.60.With अप-, to disregard.With अभि-, to desire, Yaj.iii.134.With अव-, to disregard.With नि-, 1. to think of, to remember, Bt.xiv.65; 2. to meditate deeply upon.With निस्-, to think of, to meditate upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्राडि|ध्राडिः
ध्राडि <i>m.</i> Gathering flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रुव|ध्रुवं|ध्रुवः
ध्रुव <i>(I) a. (f. वा)</i> 1. Fixed, firm, immovable, stable, permanent, इति ध्रुवेच्छामनुशासती सुताम् K.S.v.5; 2. perpetual, unchangeable, ध्रुवेण भर्त्रा K.S.viii.85; 3. certain, sure, जातस्य हि ध्रुवोर्मृत्युर्ध्रुवं जन्म मृतस्य च Bg.ii.27; 4. tenacious, retentive, (e.g. ध्रुवा स्मृतिः).(धृवम् ‘surely, certainly.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रुवा
ध्रुव <i>(I) a. (f. वा)</i> 1. Fixed, firm, immovable, stable, permanent, इति ध्रुवेच्छामनुशासती सुताम् K.S.v.5; 2. perpetual, unchangeable, ध्रुवेण भर्त्रा K.S.viii.85; 3. certain, sure, जातस्य हि ध्रुवोर्मृत्युर्ध्रुवं जन्म मृतस्य च Bg.ii.27; 4. tenacious, retentive, (e.g. ध्रुवा स्मृतिः).(धृवम् ‘surely, certainly.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रुव|ध्रुवं|ध्रुवः
ध्रुव <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The polar star, R.xvii.35, K.S.vii.85; 2. the pole of any great circle; 3. the distance of a planet from the beginning of the sidereal zodiac; 4. the Indian fig tree; 5. a post; 6. the introductory stanza of a song which is repeated as a kind of chorus; (See any Aṣṭapadī of Jayadeva); 7. time, epoch, era; 8. a stem, a trunk; 9. an epithet of Brahman (m.); 10. of Viṣṇu; 11. of Śiva; 12. name of the son of Uttānapāda and grandson of the first Manu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रुव|ध्रुवं|ध्रुवः
ध्रुव <i>(III) n.</i> The sky, atmosphere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रुवावर्त|ध्रुवावर्त्त
ध्रुव-आवर्त <i>m.</i> the point on the crown of the head, from which the hair radiate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रुवतारा
ध्रुव-तारा <i>f.</i> the polar star.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रुवतारक
ध्रुव-तारक <i>n.</i> the polar star.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रुवक|ध्रुवकः
ध्रुवक <i>m.</i> The introductory stanza of a song repeated as a sort of chorus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रुवा
ध्रुवा <i>f.</i> A wooden ladle used in sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्रौव्य|ध्रौव्यं
ध्रौव्य <i>n.</i> 1. Fixedness, firmness; 2. duration; 3. certainty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वंस्
ध्वंस् <i>vt. or vi. 1Ā (pp. ध्वस्त; pres. ध्वंसते)</i> 1. To fall down, to fall to pieces, to be reduced to dust, Bt.xv.93; 2. to perish; 3. to become eclipsed.With प्र-, to perish, to be destroyed.With वि-, 1. to fall to pieces; 2. to be dispersed; 3. to perish, to be destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वंस|ध्वंसः
ध्वंस <i>m.</i> 1. Falling down, falling to pieces; 2. loss, destruction, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वंसन|ध्वंसनं
ध्वंसन <i>n.</i> 1. Falling down, falling to pieces; 2. loss, destruction, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वंसि|ध्वंसिः
ध्वंसि <i>m.</i> The hundredth part of a muhūrta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वंसी
ध्वंसी <i>f.</i> A mote in a sunbeam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वज|ध्वजः
ध्वज <i>(I) m.n.</i> A flag, a banner, a standard, R.vii.40; (the word is used in this sense at the end of compounds to indicate high or distinguished position, e.g. कुलध्वज ‘the flag or ornament of a family’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वज|ध्वजः
ध्वज <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A flag-staff; 2. a mark, a sign, a symbol, e.g. वृषभध्वज; 3. the attribute of a deity; 4. the sign of a tavern, any trademark; 5. the organ of generation (of any animal male or female); 6. a liquor-shop-keeper; 7. pride; 8. a house situated to the east of any object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजांशुक
ध्वज-अंशुक <i>n.</i> a flag, R.xii.85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजपट|ध्वजपटः
ध्वज-पट <i>m.</i> a flag, R.xii.85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजाहृत
ध्वज-आहृत <i>a.</i> taken possession of on the battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजगृह
ध्वज-गृह <i>n.</i> a room in which banners are kept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजद्रुम|ध्वजद्रुमः
ध्वज-द्रुम <i>m.</i> the palm tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजप्रहरण|ध्वजप्रहरणः
ध्वज-प्रहरण <i>m.</i> air, wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजयंत्र|ध्वजयन्त्र
ध्वज-यंत्र <i>n.</i> any contrivance to which a flag-staff is fastened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजयष्टि|ध्वजयष्टिः
ध्वज-यष्टि <i>f.</i> a flag-staff, M.ix.285.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजवत्|ध्वजवन्त्
ध्वज-वत् <i>(I) a.</i> 1. adorned with flag; 2. having the mark of a criminal, branded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजवत्|ध्वजवन्त्
ध्वज-वत् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. a standard-bearer; 2. a vendor of spirituous liquors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजिन्
ध्वजिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Having the mark of a liquor-vessel, M.xi.92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजिनी
ध्वजिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Having the mark of a liquor-vessel, M.xi.92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजिन्
ध्वजिन् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A standard-bearer; 2. a distiller or vendor of spirituous liquors, Yaj.i.141; 3. a car, a chariot; 4. a mountain; 5. a snake; 6. a peacock; 7. horse; 8. a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=364-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजिनी
ध्वजिनी <i>f.</i> An army, R.vii.40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वजीकरण|ध्वजीकरणं
ध्वजीकरण <i>n.</i> 1. Raising a standard, hoisting a flag; 2. making anything a plea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वन्
ध्वन् <i>vi. 1P (pp. ध्वनित; pres. ध्वनति)</i> To sound, to produce or utter sounds, to buzz, to echo, to thunder, अयं धीरं धीरं ध्वनति नवनीलो जलधरः Bh.V.i.60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वन्
ध्वन् <i>Caus. (ध्वनयति, ध्वानयति)</i> to ring (a bell).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वन|ध्वनः
ध्वन <i>m.</i> Sound, tune, hum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वनमोदिन्
ध्वन-मोदिन् <i>m.</i> a bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वनन|ध्वननं
ध्वनन <i>n.</i> 1. Sounding; 2. hinting at, suggesting, implying (as a meaning); 3. the operation by which a word or sentence yields a sense different from its primary or secondary meaning (in rhetoric). See व्यंजना.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वनि|ध्वनिः
ध्वनि <i>m.</i> 1. Sound, echo, noise, R.ii.72, iv.72; 2. tone, tune; 3. the sound of a musical instrument, R.ix.71; 4. the thunder of a cloud; 5. a word; 6. allusion, hint; 7. the first and best of the three divisions of poetry in which the direct or expressed sense of the passage is subordinate to that implied or suggested (in rhetoric) (इदमुत्तममतिशयिनि व्यंग्ये वाच्याद्ध्वनिर्बुधैः कथितः K.Pr.1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वनिग्रह|ध्वनिग्रहः
ध्वनि-ग्रह <i>m.</i> 1. the ear; 2. the sense of hearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वनिनाला
ध्वनि-नाला <i>f.</i> 1. a sort of trumpet; 2. a lute; 3. a fife, a pipe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वनिविकार|ध्वनिविकारः
ध्वनि-विकार <i>m.</i> a change of voice (through some emotion). See काकु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=365-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

