नदीष्ण|नदीष्णः
नदी-ष्ण <i>a.</i> 1. bathing in rivers; 2. knowing the dangerous spots in rivers, their depth &c., ततः समाज्ञापयदाशु सर्वानानायिनस्तद्विचये नदीष्णान् R.xvi.75; (hence) 3. experienced, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=367-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

