नंदिनी|नन्दिनी
नंदिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Happy, delighted; 2. making happy, gladdening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=368-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नंदिन्|नन्दिन्
