नमस्
नमस् <i>ind. (the word has the sense of a noun; but it is very generally used as an indeclinable either by itself or as a prefix to verbs).</i> Bowing, salutation, adoration, obeisance, (with a dat. when used by itself, e.g. नमः शिवाय; but with an acc. when used as a prefix to a verb, e.g. मुनित्रयं नमस्कृत्य S.K.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=369-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस्कार|नमस्कारः
