नश्
नश् <i>vt. 4P (pp. नष्ट; pres. नश्यति, प्रणश्यति; caus. नाशयति; desid. निनङ्क्षति, निनशिषति)</i> 1. To be lost, to disappear, to become invisible, to vanish, विद्युद्भिः क्षणनष्टदृष्टतिमिरं प्रच्छादिताशामुखम् Mrich.v.; 2. to be destroyed, to perish, M.viii.247, Bg.xviii.73; 3. to become unsuccessful; 4. to run away, to escape, नेशुश्चित्रा निशाचराः Bt.xiv.112; (the root is often used with the prepositions प्र and वि, without any change in meaning).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=372-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

