नह्
नह् <i>vt. 4U (pp. नद्ध; pres. नह्यति-ते, प्रणह्यति-ते; desid. निनत्सति-ते)</i> 1. To tie, to bind, to gird round, to bind together, e.g. बाला नह्यति किं निजालकभरं किंवा मदीयं मनः Mukundānanda; 2. (Atm.) to put on (oneself), to dress, to arm oneself.With अप-, to untie.With अपि-, (sometimes changed into पि-) 1. to fasten; 2. to cover, कुसुममिव पिनद्धं पांडुपत्रोदरेण Sak.i.; 3. to wear, to put on, कवचं पिनह्य Bt.iii.47.With उद्-, to tie up, to bind up, R.xvii.23.With परि-, to entwine, to surround, R.vi.64.With सम्-, 1. to tie, to bind, to fasten; 2. to put on, to dress; 3. to put on an armour, to arm, e.g. संनद्धः कवची खड्गी; 4. (Atm. and intransitive) to prepare oneself, to make oneself ready, छेत्तुं वज्रमणीञ्शिरीषकुसुमप्रांतेन संनह्यते Bhartr.ii.6, Megh.i.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=372-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नहि
नहि <i>ind.</i> Surely not, certainly not, by no means, नहि स्वात्मारामं विषयमृगतृष्णा भ्रमयति Mahimastotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=372-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

