नांदी|नान्दी
नांदी <i>f.</i> 1. Joy, satisfaction; 2. prosperity; 3. praise of a deity at the commencement of any religious ceremony; 4. a benedictory verse or verses at the opening of a drama. (नांदी is thus defined- आशीर्वचनसंयुक्ता नित्यं यस्मात्प्रयुज्यते । देवद्विजनृपादीनां तस्मान्नांदीति कीर्तिता.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=374-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

