नांदीवादिन्|नान्दीवादिन्
नांदी-वादिन् <i>m.</i> 1. the speaker of the prologue to a drama; 2. a drummer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=374-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

