नापित|नापितः
नापित <i>m.</i> A barber, a shaver, M.iv.253.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=374-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नापितशाला
नापित-शाला <i>f.</i> a shaving house, a hair-cutting saloon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=374-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

