नाभि|नाभिः
नाभि <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The nave of a wheel; 2. the centre, focus, chief point; 3. chief, head, कृत्स्नस्य नाभिर्नृपमंडलस्य R.xviii.20; 4. near relationship; 5. a near relation; 6. a paramount sovereign, R.ix.16; 7. a Kṣatriya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=374-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

