नाभ्य <i>(II) m.</i> An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=374-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाम
नाम <i>ind.</i> A particle expressing- (1) namely, by name, named, called, हिमालयो नाम नगाधिराजः K.S.i.1, R.i.11; (2) indeed, certainly, really, विनीतवेषेण प्रवेष्टव्यानि तपोवनानि नाम Sak.i.; (3) possibly, perhaps, probably, ये नाम केचिदिह नः प्रथयंत्यवज्ञाम् M.M.i.; (4) granted, granting, it may be that, if you like, (with implied disapprobation), यदि गर्जति वारिधरो गर्जतु तन्नाम निष्ठुराः पुरुषाः Mrich.v.; (5) wonder, e.g. अंधो नाम पर्वतमारोहति G.M.; (6) censure, त्वया नाम मुनिर्विमान्यः Sak.v.; (7) anger, ममापि नाम दशाननस्य परैः परिभवः G.M.; (8) pretence, अहं च भितो नामवाप्लुतः D.K. नाम, like इव, is used with किं and its derivatives to add elegance and force to the meaning and may be rendered by ‘possibly,’ ‘indeed,’ को नाम राज्ञां प्रियः Panch.i., को नाम पाकाभिमुखस्य जन्तुर्द्वाराणि दैवस्य पिधातुमीष्टे Ut.vii. For अपिनाम and कथंनाम, See under अपि and कथम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=374-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामन्
नामन् <i>n.</i> 1. Name, appellation, R.i.87, M.ii.128, 199; (नाम्ना, नामतस् ‘by name,’ चकार नाम्ना रघुमात्मसंभवम् R.iii.21, v.36, R.xv.32, M.viii.255); 2. a noun, a substantive, (सत्वप्रधानानि नामानि Nir.i.); 3. a synonym, e.g. इति पृथिवीनामानि; 4. the mere name, trace, संतप्तायसि संस्थितस्य पयसो नामापि न ज्ञायते Bhartr.ii.67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामांक|नामाङ्क
नामन्-अंक <i>a.</i> marked with name, R.xii.103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामानुशासन
नामन्-अनुशासन <i>n.</i> a lexicon, a dictionary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामापराध|नामापराधः
नामन्-अपराध <i>m.</i> abusing anyone by name, calling names.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामावलि
नामन्-आवलि <i>f.</i> list of the names of a god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामकरण|नामकरणं
नामन्-करण, -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> the ceremony of naming a child after birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामकर्मन्
नामन्-करण, -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> the ceremony of naming a child after birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामग्रह|नामग्रहः
नामन्-ग्रह <i>m.</i> remembrance of name, addressing by name, Am.S.83, R.vii.41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामग्रहण
नामन्-ग्रहण <i>n.</i> remembrance of name, addressing by name, Am.S.83, R.vii.41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामग्राहम्
नामन्-ग्राहम् <i>ind.</i> naming, mentioning by name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामधातु|नामधातुः
नामन्-धातु <i>m.</i> a verbal base derived from a noun, a denominative base, (e.g. तपस्य from तपस्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामधारक
नामन्-धारक <i>a.</i> bearing only the name of, only in name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामधेय|नामधेयं
नामन्-धेय <i>f.</i> a name, a title, an appellation, नामधेयसदृशं विचेष्टितम् R.xi.8, i.45, x.67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामनिर्देश|नामनिर्देशः
नामन्-निर्देश <i>m.</i> pointing out by name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाममाला
नामन्-माला <i>f.</i> a vocabulary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाममुद्रा
नामन्-मुद्रा <i>f.</i> a seal-ring, a ring with a name on it, नाममुद्राक्षराण्यनुवाच्य Sak.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नामवर्जित
