नामि|नामिः
नामि <i>m.</i> An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

