नारक|नारकः
नारक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Hellish, infernal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नारकी
नारक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Hellish, infernal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नारक|नारकः
