नारंग <i>(I) m.</i> 1. The orange tree; 2. a libertine; 3. a twin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नारंग|नारङ्ग|नारङ्गं|नारंगः|नारङ्गः
नारंग <i>(II) n.</i> 1. The fruit of the orange tree; 2. a carrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नारा
