नाराच|नाराचः
नाराच <i>m.</i> 1. An iron arrow, तत्र नाराचदुर्दुनम् R.iv.41; 2. an arrow in general; 3. a water-elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाराचिका
