नारिकेर(ल) <i>m.</i> The same as नालिकेर q.v. (Also नाडिकेर and नाडीकेर.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

