नारीरत्न
नारी-रत्न <i>n.</i> a jewel of a woman, an excellent woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=375-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

