नि|निः
नि <i>ind. (It is not used as an adverb or separable preposition)</i> As a prefix to verbs and nouns, it implies- (1) lowness, ‘down,’ (e.g. निषद्); (2) inclusion, ‘into,’ (e.g. निपीत); (3) intensity, fulness, (e.g. निग्रह); (4) group, (e.g. निकर); (5) order, (e.g. निदेश); (6) continuance, (e.g. निविश्); (7) skill, (e.g. निपुण); (8) proximity, (e.g. निकट); (9) restraint, (e.g. निबंध), (10) resort, (e.g. निलय), (11) cessation, (e.g. निवृत्), (12) wrong, (e.g. निकृ), (13) doubt, (14) certainty, affirmation &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=376-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

