निकर्षण|निकर्षणं
निकर्षण <i>n.</i> 1. An open space for recreation near a town; 2. a court at the entrance of a house; 3. a plot of ground not ploughed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=377-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

