निकामम्
निकामम् <i>ind.</i> 1. According to wish or desire; 2. to one’s satisfaction, to one’s heart’s content; 3. exceedingly, e.g. निकामं क्षामांगी.(The word is also treated as a noun (n.); as the first member of compounds, it loses its final म्, K.S.v.28, Sis.iv.54.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=377-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकाय|निकायः
