निक्षिप्ता
निक्षिप्त <i>a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Thrown down, put down; 2. rejected, abandoned; 3. pledged, pawned, deposited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=377-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निक्षेप|निक्षेपः
