निगम|निगमः
निगम <i>m.</i> 1. The Veda, निगमकल्पतरोर्गलितं फलम् Bhag.i.1; 2. any passage or word quoted from it; 3. a treatise explanatory of the Vedas, M.iv.19; 4. a root (as the source of a word); 5. a sacred precept; 6. logic; 7. certainty, assurance; 8. a market, a fair; 9. trade, traffic; 10. a caravan of itinerent merchants; 11. a town; 12. a road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=378-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निगमन|निगमनं
