निग्रह|निग्रहः
निग्रह <i>m.</i> 1. Keeping in check, coercion, restraint, subjection, M.viii.175; 2. overtaking, seizing, arresting, तन्निग्रहे तु वरगात्रि न मे प्रयत्नः Mrich.i.; 3. confinement, imprisonment; 4. dispelling, removing, R.ix.25; 5. punishment, chastisement, R.xi.55, 90; 6. aversion, dislike; 7. a fault in a syllogism, a flaw in an argument. (in Nyava phil.); 8. a handle; 9. a boundary, a limit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=378-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

