निचुल|निचुलः
निचुल <i>m.</i> 1. A kind of reed; 2. name of a poet, a friend of Kālidāsa (according to some), स्थानादस्मात् सरसनिचुलादुत्पतोदङ्मुखः खम् Megh.i.14; (where the word is used in both the senses according to Mall.); 3. an upper garment, a cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=378-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

