निज्
निज् <i>vt. or vi. 3U (pp. निक्त; pres. नेनेक्ति, नेनेक्ते, प्रणेनेक्ति)</i> 1. To wash, to cleanse, to purify; 2. to be purified; 3. to nourish.With अव-, to wash, to sprinkle water.With निस्-, to clean, to purify, to wash, M.v.127, R.xvii.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=378-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

