निञ्ज् <i>vt. 2Ā (pres. निङ्क्ते, प्रणिङ्क्ते)</i> To wash.With प्र-, to wash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=378-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निटल|निटलं
निटल <i>n.</i> The forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निटलाक्ष|निटलाक्षः
निटल-अक्ष <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva. (This word is sometimes written निटिलाक्ष.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निडीन|निडीनं
निडीन <i>n.</i> The downward flight of a bird. See under डीन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितंब|नितम्ब|नितंबः|नितम्बः
नितंब <i>m.</i> 1. the buttocks, especially of a woman, the circumference of the hip and loins, नितंबबिंबैः सदुकूलमेखलैः Rt.i.4, Bhartr.i.5, R.iv.52, vi.17, Megh.i.41; 2. the ridge or side of a mountain, सेव्या नितंबाः किमु भूधराणां किंवा स्मरस्मेरविलासिनीनाम् Bhartr.i.19 (where the word is used in this sense and in sense 1), Bt.ii.8; 3. the sloping bank of a river; 4. the shoulder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितंबबिंब|नितम्बबिम्ब
नितंब-बिंब <i>n.</i> round hips, Rt.i.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितंबवत्
नितंब-वत् <i>a.</i> having beautiful hips.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितंबवती|नितम्बवती
नितंब-वती <i>f.</i> a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितंबिन्|नितम्बिन्
नितंबिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Having beautiful hips, R.xix.26; 2. having beautiful sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितंबिनी|नितम्बिनी
नितंबिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Having beautiful hips, R.xix.26; 2. having beautiful sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितंबिनी|नितम्बिनी
नितंबिनी <i>f.</i> A woman with large and handsome hips, K.S.iii.7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितराम्
नितराम् <i>ind.</i> 1. Completely, entirely, Bhartr.i.96; 2. excessively, extremely, नितरां कृशासि Am.S.10, भवंति नितरां स्फीताः सिल्षेत्रे कंटकद्रुमाः Mrich.ix.; 3. always, continually, eternally; 4. at all events.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितल|नितलं
नितल <i>n.</i> One of the seven divisions of the lower regions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितांत|नितान्त|नितान्तं
नितांत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Extraordinary, excessive, much, नितांतकठिनां रुजं मम न वेद सा मानसीम् Vikr.ii.(नितांतम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘excessively, exceedingly, in a high degree.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नितांता
नितांत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Extraordinary, excessive, much, नितांतकठिनां रुजं मम न वेद सा मानसीम् Vikr.ii.(नितांतम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘excessively, exceedingly, in a high degree.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्य|नित्यं|नित्यः
नित्य <i>(I) a. (f. त्या)</i> 1. Continual, perpetual, constant, यत्रोन्मत्तभ्रमरमुखराः पादपा नित्यपुष्पा हंसश्रेणीरचितरशना नित्यपद्मा नलिन्यः । केकोत्कंठा भवनशिखिनो नित्यभास्वत्कलापा नित्यज्योत्स्नाः प्रतिहततमोवृत्तिरम्याः प्रदोषाः Megh.ii. (considered to be an interpolation by Mall.), M.ii.206; 2. invariable, regular, fixed, regularly prescribed, (op. to नैमित्तिक); 3. necessary, obligatory; 4. ordinary, usual, (op. to नैमित्तिक); 5. (at the end of a compound) constantly dwelling in or engaged in, e.g. अरण्यनित्य, तपोनित्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्या
नित्य <i>(I) a. (f. त्या)</i> 1. Continual, perpetual, constant, यत्रोन्मत्तभ्रमरमुखराः पादपा नित्यपुष्पा हंसश्रेणीरचितरशना नित्यपद्मा नलिन्यः । केकोत्कंठा भवनशिखिनो नित्यभास्वत्कलापा नित्यज्योत्स्नाः प्रतिहततमोवृत्तिरम्याः प्रदोषाः Megh.ii. (considered to be an interpolation by Mall.), M.ii.206; 2. invariable, regular, fixed, regularly prescribed, (op. to नैमित्तिक); 3. necessary, obligatory; 4. ordinary, usual, (op. to नैमित्तिक); 5. (at the end of a compound) constantly dwelling in or engaged in, e.g. अरण्यनित्य, तपोनित्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्य|नित्यं|नित्यः
नित्य <i>(II) m.</i> The ocean.(नित्यम् is used adverbially in the sense of ‘daily, constantly, always, ever, perpetually,’ M.i.104.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यानध्याय|नित्यानध्यायः
नित्य-अनध्याय <i>m.</i> invariable suspension of Vedic study.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यानित्य
नित्य-अनित्य <i>a.</i> eternal and perishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यर्तु
नित्य-ऋतु <i>a.</i> regularly recurring at the seasons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यकर्मन्|नित्यकर्म्मन्
नित्य-कर्मन्, -कृत्य न्।, -क्रिया ऋ। <i>n.</i> a regular or necessary act or duty, a daily rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यकृत्य
नित्य-कर्मन्, -कृत्य न्।, -क्रिया ऋ। <i>n.</i> a regular or necessary act or duty, a daily rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यक्रिया
