नित्यप्रलय|नित्यप्रलयः
नित्य-प्रलय <i>m.</i> sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

