नित्यशंकित|नित्यशङ्कित
नित्य-शंकित <i>a.</i> perpetually alarmed, always suspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यशस्
नित्य-शस् <i>ind.</i> always, constantly, eternally, Bg.viii.14, M.ii.96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यसमास|नित्यसमासः
नित्य-समास <i>m.</i> a compound whose component parts cannot be used separately to convey its meaning (in gram.), e.g. जमदग्नि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदद्रु|निदद्रुः
निदद्रु <i>m.</i> A man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदर्शक
निदर्शक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Seeing, perceiving; 2. pointing out, proclaiming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदर्शका
निदर्शक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Seeing, perceiving; 2. pointing out, proclaiming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदर्शन|निदर्शनं
निदर्शन <i>n.</i> 1. View, insight, vision; 2. pointing to, showing; 3. evidence; 4. an example, an illustration, निदर्शनमसाराणां लघुर्बहुतृणं नरः Sis.ii.50; 5. a prognostic, a sign, an omen; 6. a scheme, a system; 7. precept, scriptural authority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदर्शना
