निदाघकर|निदाघकरः
निदाघ-कर <i>m.</i> the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदाघकाल|निदाघकालः
निदाघ-काल <i>m.</i> See निदाघ (2) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदान|निदानं
निदान <i>f.</i> 1. A rope, a halter; 2. a first or primary cause, निदानमिक्ष्वाकुकुलस्य संततेः R.iii.1; 3. a cause in general, मुंच मयि मानमनिदानम् Git.G.x.; 4. end, termination; 5. purity, purification; 6. inquiring into the internal causes of disease, pathology (in medicine); 7. diagnosis (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

