निदिग्धा
निदिग्ध <i>a. (f. ग्धा)</i> Increased, accumulated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदिग्धा
