निदिध्यास|निदिध्यासः
निदिध्यास <i>m.</i> Profound and repeated meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=379-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निदिध्यासन|निदिध्यासनं
