निपात|निपातः
निपात <i>m.</i> 1. Falling down, descending, alighting, पयोधरोत्सेधनिपातचूर्णिताः K.S.v.24; 2. attacking, R.ii.60; 3. casting, hurling, K.S.iii.15; 4. death, M.vi.31; 5. accidental occurrence or mention; 6. irregular form, irregularity, e.g. परनिपात, पूर्वनिपात; 7. a particle, an indeclinable (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=380-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपातन|निपातनं
