निपान|निपानं
निपान <i>n.</i> 1. Drinking off; 2. any reservoir of water, a pool, a puddle, गाहंतां महिषा निपानसलिलं शृंगैर्मुहुस्ताडितम् Sak.ii.; 3. a well; 4. a milk-pail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=380-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपीडन|निपीडनं
