निबंध <i>m.</i> 1. Binding, attachment, Bg.xvi.5; 2. composing, recording; 3. any literary composition or treatise, especially a compendium; 4. restraint, obstruction, confinement; 5. supresssion of urine; 6. a bond, a fetter; 7. a grant of property, an assignment of money &c. for support, भुर्या पितामहोपात्ता निबंधो द्रव्यमेव वा Yaj.ii.121; 8. foundation, origin; 9. cause, reason.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=380-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निबंधन|निबन्धन|निबंधनं|निबन्धनं
निबंधन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of fastening; 2. constructing, building; 3. restraining, checking, confining; 4. bond, fetter; 5. a receptacle; 6. support, as in जीवितनिबंधन; 7. the leg of a lute; 8. cause, origin, reason, M.ix.27; 9. syntax (in gram.); 10. composing, K.S.vii.60; 11. a composition, a treatise; 12. a grant, an assignment, सद्वृत्तिः संनिबंधना Sis.ii.112 (where the word is used in the last two senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=380-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

