निभृत|निभृतः
निभृत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Placed down, lowered; 2. concealed, secret, unperceived; 3. modest, humble, mild, gentle; 4. lonely, solitary; 5. still, silent; 6. firm, immovable; 7. on the point of setting, R.viii.15; 8. filled with, full of.(निभृतम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) privately, secretly, imperceptibly; (2) silently.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

