निमित्तकृत्
निमित्त-कृत् <i>m.</i> a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमित्तविद्
निमित्त-विद् <i>a.</i> knowing good or bad omens.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमिष|निमिषः
निमिष <i>m.</i> 1. Winking, shutting the eye; 2. twinkling of the eye as a measure of time, a moment; 3. the shutting (of flowers); 4. morbid twinkling of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमिषांतर|निमिषान्तर
निमिष-अंतर <i>n.</i> the interval of a moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीलन|निमीलनं
निमीलन <i>n.</i> 1. Shutting the eyelids, winking, Am.S.33; 2. death; 3. total eclipse (in astronomy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीला
निमीला <i>f.</i> 1. Shutting the eyes; 2. conniving at anything; 3. fraud, pretence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीलिका
निमीला <i>f.</i> 1. Shutting the eyes; 2. conniving at anything; 3. fraud, pretence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमूल|निमूलं
