निमेष-कृत् <i>f.</i> lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेषरुच्
निमेष-रुच् <i>m.</i> a firefly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्न|निम्नं
निम्न <i>(I) a. (f. म्ना)</i> 1. Deep (lit. or fig.), चकितहरिणीप्रेक्षणा निम्ननाभिः Megh.ii.19, निम्ननाभिसरसीषु निपंते Sis.x.58; 2. low, depressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्ना
निम्न <i>(I) a. (f. म्ना)</i> 1. Deep (lit. or fig.), चकितहरिणीप्रेक्षणा निम्ननाभिः Megh.ii.19, निम्ननाभिसरसीषु निपंते Sis.x.58; 2. low, depressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्न|निम्नं
निम्न <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Depth, low ground, low land, (कः) पयश्च निम्नाभिमुखं प्रतीपयेत् K.S.v.5, न च निम्नादिव सलिलं निवर्तते मे ततो चेतः Sak.iii.; 2. a slope, a declivity; 3. a gap, a chasm in the ground; 4. a depression, जलनिबिडितवस्त्रव्यक्तनिम्नोन्नताभिः M.M.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्नोन्नत
निम्न-उन्नत <i>a.</i> low and high, depressed and protuberant, uneven, undulating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्नगत
निम्न-गत <i>n.</i> a low place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्नगा
निम्न-गा <i>f.</i> a river, a mountain-stream, R.viii.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निंब|निम्ब|निंबः|निम्बः
निंब <i>m.</i> A tree with bitter fruits, यन्निंबानां परिणतफलस्फीतिरास्वादनीया K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्लोच|निम्लोचः
निम्लोच <i>m.</i> Sunset.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियत|नियतः
नियत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Curbed, restrained; 2. subdued, self-governed; 3. abstemious, temperate; 4. attentive; 5. constant, steady; 6. certain, inevitable; 7. positive, definite.(नियतम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) always, constantly; (2) positively, certainly, inevitably.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियता
नियत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Curbed, restrained; 2. subdued, self-governed; 3. abstemious, temperate; 4. attentive; 5. constant, steady; 6. certain, inevitable; 7. positive, definite.(नियतम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) always, constantly; (2) positively, certainly, inevitably.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियति|नियतिः
नियति <i>f.</i> 1. Restraint, restriction; 2. destiny, fate, नियतिकृतनियमरहिताम् K.Pr.i., Sis.iv.34; 3. a religious duty or obligation; 4. self-command, self-restraint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियंतृ|नियन्तृ
नियंतृ <i>m.</i> 1. A charioteer; 2. a governor, a ruler, a master, R.i.17, xv.51; 3. a punisher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियंत्रण|नियन्त्रण|नियंत्रणं
नियंत्रण <i>n.</i> 1. Checking, restraint, अनियंत्राणानुयोगो नाम तपस्विजनः Sak.i.; 2. restricting, confining to, अनेकार्थस्य शब्दस्यैकार्थे नियंत्रणरूपं विशेषम् S.D.ii.; 3. guiding, governing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियंत्रणा
नियंत्रणा <i>f.</i> 1. Checking, restraint, अनियंत्राणानुयोगो नाम तपस्विजनः Sak.i.; 2. restricting, confining to, अनेकार्थस्य शब्दस्यैकार्थे नियंत्रणरूपं विशेषम् S.D.ii.; 3. guiding, governing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियंत्रित|नियन्त्रित|नियन्त्रितः
नियंत्रित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Curbed, checked; 2. guided, governed; 3. restricted, confined to, अनेकार्थस्य शब्दस्य वाचकत्वे नियंत्रिते K.Pr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियंत्रिता
नियंत्रित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Curbed, checked; 2. guided, governed; 3. restricted, confined to, अनेकार्थस्य शब्दस्य वाचकत्वे नियंत्रिते K.Pr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=381-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियम|नियमः
नियम <i>m.</i> 1. Restraining, checking, restraint, M.viii.122; 2. restriction, limitation; 3. rule, precept; 4. certainty, ascertainment; 5. agreement, engagement, vow, promise; 6. a rule or precept which enjoins what would, in its absence, be only optional (in Mīmānsā phil.); See परिसंख्या and विधि; 7. any self-imposed religious observance, R.i.94; 8. duties prescribed to Brāhmaṇas but not so obligatory as यम; (they are thus given by Atri- शौचमिज्या तपो दानं स्वाध्यायोपस्थनिग्रहः । व्रतमौनोपवासं च स्नानं च नियमा दश); 9. the second of the eight steps of meditation in Yoga, the restraint of the mind; 10. a common place in poetry, a poetic convention, (e.g. the peacock’s cry in the rains).(नियमेन ‘as a rule, invariably.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियमनिष्ठा
नियम-निष्ठा <i>f.</i> rigid observance of prescribed rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियमवती
नियम-वती <i>f.</i> a woman having the monthly courses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियमस्थिति|नियमस्थितिः
नियम-स्थिति <i>f.</i> steady observance of religious obligations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियमन|नियमनं
नियमन <i>n.</i> 1. Checking, restraining, subduing, नियमनादसतां च नराधिपः R.ix.6; 2. restriction, limitation; 8. a precept, a fixed rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियमित|नियमितः
नियमित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Checked, restrained; 2. governed, guided; 3. regulated, prescribed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियमिता
नियमित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Checked, restrained; 2. governed, guided; 3. regulated, prescribed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियाम|नियामः
नियाम <i>m.</i> 1. Restraint; 2. a religious vow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

