नियामक|नियामकः
नियामक <i>(I) a. (f. मिका)</i> 1. Restraining, checking; 2. guiding, governing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियामिका
नियामक <i>(I) a. (f. मिका)</i> 1. Restraining, checking; 2. guiding, governing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=382-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियामक|नियामकः
