निर्विण्ण <i>a. (f. ण्णा)</i> 1. Despondent, depressed; 2. overcome with fear or sorrow; 3. emaciated with grief; 4. abused, degraded; 5. disgusted with anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

