निलिंपिका|निलिम्पिका
निलिंपा <i>f.</i> A cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निलीन|निलीनं
निलीन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Involved, encompassed; 2. destroyed, perished; 3. changed, transformed, (pp. of ली with नि q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निलीना
निलीन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Involved, encompassed; 2. destroyed, perished; 3. changed, transformed, (pp. of ली with नि q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवचने
निवचने <i>ind.</i> Not speaking; (it is considered either as a prefix or as a separate word, hence निवचने कृत्वा or निवचनेकृत्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवपन|निवपनं
निवपन <i>n.</i> 1. Scattering or throwing down; 2. sowing; 3. an offering to the Manes, को नः कुले निवपनानि नियच्छतीति Sak.vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवरा
निवरा <i>f.</i> A virgin, an unmarried girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवर्तक
निवर्तक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Returning, turning back; 2. stopping, seizing; 3. abolishing, expelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवर्तका
निवर्तक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Returning, turning back; 2. stopping, seizing; 3. abolishing, expelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवर्तन|निवर्त्तन
निवर्तन <i>n.</i> 1. Returning, turning back, इह हि पततां नास्त्यालंबो न चापि निवर्तनम् Sant.S.iii.2; 2. not happening, ceasing; 3. desisting from a work, inactivity; 4. repenting; 5. a measure of land equal to 20 rods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवसति|निवसतिः
निवसति <i>f.</i> Residence, house, habitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवसथ|निवसथः
निवसथ <i>m.</i> A village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवसन|निवसनं
निवसन <i>n.</i> 1. A house, a habitation; 2. a garment, R.xix.41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=389-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवह|निवहः
निवह <i>m.</i> 1. A multitude, a quantity, म्लेच्छनिवहनिधने कलयसि करवालम् Git.G.i.; 2. one of the seven courses of wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=390-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवात|निवातः
निवात <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Protected against the wind, not windy, calm, R.xix.42; 2. unhurt, uninjured; 3. secure, safe; 4. accoutred in strong mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=390-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवाता
निवात <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Protected against the wind, not windy, calm, R.xix.42; 2. unhurt, uninjured; 3. secure, safe; 4. accoutred in strong mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=390-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवात|निवातः
निवात <i>(II) m.</i> 1. An asylum, a refuge; 2. an impenetrable coat of mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=390-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवात|निवातः
निवात <i>(III) n.</i> 1. A place sheltered from the wind, निवातपद्मस्थिमितेन चक्षुसा R.iii.17, xiii.52, K.S.iii.48, Bg.vi.19; 2. a secure spot; 3. a strong armour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=390-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवाप|निवापः
निवाप <i>m.</i> 1. Seed, grain; 2. an oblation to the deceased parents or relatives, an offering at the śrāddha, निवापांजलिदनेन Ve.iii., निवापदत्तिभिः R.viii.86, v.8, xv.91; 3. a gift in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=390-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवार|निवारः
निवार <i>m.</i> 1. Keeping off, preventing, hindering, दंशनिवारणैश्च R.xi.5; 2. prohibition, impediment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=390-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवारण|निवारणं
निवारण <i>n.</i> 1. Keeping off, prerenting, hindering, दंशनिवारणैश्च R.xi.5; 2. prohibition, impediment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=390-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवास|निवासः
निवास <i>m.</i> 1. Living, dwelling; 2. passing the night; 3. abode, house, resting place, Sis.iv.63, Bg.ix.18; 4. dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=390-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निवासन|निवासनं
