निस्
निस् <i>ind.</i> As a prefix to verbal themes it implies- (1) separation, outside of, away from, (e.g. निर्गम्); (2) certainty, (e.g. निरुक्त); (3) thoroughness, (e.g. निर्जित); (4) enjoyment, (e.g. निर्विश्) &c.It is prefixed to nouns not immediately derived from verbs to form nouns or adjectives in the sense of- (1) out of, away from, (e.g. निष्कौषांबि); 2. not, without, (e.g. निर्मल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=393-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

