निस्पं(ष्यं)द <i>m.</i> 1. Flowing, trickling down, dropping, streaming, oozing; 2. a discharge, a flux; 3. stream, a fluid that trickles down, R.iii.41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=394-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

