निहार <i>m.</i> The same as नीहार q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=395-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निहिंसन|निहिंसनं
निहिंसन <i>n.</i> Killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=395-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निहित|निहितं
निहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Laid, lodged, situated, deposited; 2. bestowed upon; 3. inserted, infixed; 4. treasured up; 5. uttered in a deep tone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=395-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निहिता
निहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Laid, lodged, situated, deposited; 2. bestowed upon; 3. inserted, infixed; 4. treasured up; 5. uttered in a deep tone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=395-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

