नीकाश|नीकाशः
नीकाश <i>a.</i> The same as निकाश q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=396-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीच|नीचः
नीच <i>a. (f. चा)</i> 1. Low, short, little, dwarfish; 2. situated below, being in a low position, M.ii.198; 3. lowered (as the voice); 4. low, vile, base, नीचस्त्वदन्योऽस्ति कः Bh.V.i.48; 5. insignificant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=396-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचा
नीच <i>a. (f. चा)</i> 1. Low, short, little, dwarfish; 2. situated below, being in a low position, M.ii.198; 3. lowered (as the voice); 4. low, vile, base, नीचस्त्वदन्योऽस्ति कः Bh.V.i.48; 5. insignificant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=396-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचगा
