नु|नुः
नु <i>ind.</i> A particle used to express ‘doubt, uncertainty,’ e.g. स्वप्नो नु माया नु मतिभ्रमो नु Sak.vi., क्षालितं नु शमितं नु वधूनां द्रावितं नु हृदयं मधुवारैः Sis.x.14.It is often used in combination with interogatives in the sense of ‘possibly, indeed,’ किंत्वेतत्स्यात्किमन्यदितोऽथवा M.M.i.(For the use of नु with न, किम्, कथम् &c., See ननु, किन्नु, कथंनु &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=397-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नु|नुः
नु <i>vt. 2P (pp. नुत; pres. नौति, प्रणौति; caus. नावयति; desid. नुनूषति)</i> To praise, to commend, Bt.xiv.112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=397-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुति|नुतिः
नुति <i>f.</i> 1. Praise, eulogium, परगुणनुतिभिः (v.l.) स्वान् गुणान् ख्यापयंतः Bhartr.ii.69; 2. worship, reverence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=397-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुद्
नुद् <i>vt. 6U (pp. नुत्त or नुन्न; pres. नुदति-ते, प्रणुदति)</i> 1. To push, to impel, मंदं मंदं नुदति पवनश्चानुकूलो यथा त्वाम् Megh.i.9; 2. to incite, to urge on; 3. to remove (संशयं) केयूरबंधोच्छ्वसितैर्नुनाद R.vi.68; 4. to throw, to send.With अप-, to drive away.With निस्-, 1. to reject, धाना मत्स्यान्पयो मांसं शाकं चैव न निर्नुदेत् M.iv.250; 2. to remove.With प्र-, to drive off, to dispel.With वि-, 1. to strike; 2. to play (on a musical instrument).With सम्-, 1. to collect; 2. to find.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=397-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुद्
नुद् <i>Caus. (नोदयति-ते)</i> to push on, to drive, to incite.With वि-, 1. to drive away, to dispel, to remove; 2. to pass away, to spend (as time); 3. to divert, to amuse, to entertain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=397-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूतन|नूतनः
नूतन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. New, R.viii.15; 2. fresh, young; 3. present; 4. instantaneous; 5. modern; 6. curious, strange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=397-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूतना
नूतन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. New, R.viii.15; 2. fresh, young; 3. present; 4. instantaneous; 5. modern; 6. curious, strange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=397-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूनम्
नूनम् <i>ind.</i> 1. Probably, most probably, अद्यापि नूनं हरकोपवह्निस्त्वपि ज्वलत्यौर्वं इवांबुराशौ Sak.iii.; 2. surely, certainly, indeed, Megh.i.9, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=397-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

