पंगु|पङ्गु|पङ्गुः
पंगु <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A lame man, जडानंधान्पंगून्प्रकृतिबधिरानुक्तिविकलान् G.L.15; 2. an epithet of Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंगुग्राह|पङ्गुग्राह|पङ्गुग्राहः
पंगु-ग्राह <i>m.</i> 1. a crocodile; 2. Capricornus, the tenth sign of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंगुल|पङ्गुल|पङ्गुलः
पंगुल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> Lame, crippled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंगुला
पंगुल <i>a. (f. ला)</i> Lame, crippled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंच्|पञ्च्
पंच् <i>(I) vt. or vi. 1U (pp. पक्व; pres. पचति-ते; desid. पिपक्षति) (This is one of those roots which take two accusatives, e.g. तंडुलानोदनं पचति; but as such it is of rare occurrence.)</i> 1. To cook, to bake, to roast, M.iii.118, Bhartr.i.85; 2. to bake or burn (as bricks); 3. to digest, प्राणापानसमायुक्तः पचाम्यन्नं चतुर्विधम् Bg.xv.14; 4. to ripen, to mature; 5. to bring to perfection, to derelop; 6. (in the Atm.) to cook for oneself.With परि-, to mature, to develop.With वि-, 1. to mature, to ripen; 2. to digest; 3. to cook thoroughly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंच्|पञ्च्
पंच् <i>(II) vt. 1Ā (pres. पचते)</i> To make evident or clear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंच्|पञ्च्
पंच् <i>(III) vt. 10U (pres. पंचयति-ते)</i> To spread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचत|पचतः
पचत <i>m.</i> 1. The sun; 2. fire; 3. an epithet of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचन|पचनं|पचनः
पचन <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Cooking; 2. maturing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचना
पचन <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Cooking; 2. maturing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचन|पचनं|पचनः
पचन <i>(II) m.</i> Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचन|पचनं|पचनः
पचन <i>(III) n.</i> The act of cooking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचपच|पचपचः
पचपच <i>m.</i> An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचा
पचा <i>f.</i> The act of cooking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचि|पचिः
पचि <i>m.</i> Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचेलिम|पचेलिमः
पचेलिम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Ripening naturally; 2. cooking quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचेलिमा
पचेलिम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Ripening naturally; 2. cooking quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचेलिम|पचेलिमः
पचेलिम <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Fire; 2. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचेलुक|पचेलुकः
पचेलुक <i>m.</i> A cook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पज्झटिका
पज्झटिका <i>f.</i> A small bell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचक|पञ्चक|पञ्चकं|पञ्चकः
पंचक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. Bought with five; 2. consisting of five; 3. made of five; 4. relating to five; 5. taking five per cent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचका
पंचक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. Bought with five; 2. consisting of five; 3. made of five; 4. relating to five; 5. taking five per cent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचक|पञ्चक|पञ्चकं|पञ्चकः
पंचक <i>(II) m.n.</i> An aggregate of five, e.g. यतिपंचकम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचत्|पञ्चत्
पंचत् <i>f.</i> A pentad, a collection of five.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचथु|पञ्चथु|पंचथुः|पञ्चथुः
पंचथु <i>m.</i> 1. Time; 2. the Indian cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचन्|पञ्चन्
पंचन् <i>num. (always pl.; nom. and acc. पंच)</i> Five.(As the first member of compounds पंचन् drops it final न्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांश|पञ्चांश|पञ्चांशः
पंचन्-अंश <i>m.</i> the fifth part, a fifth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचाग्नि|पञ्चाग्नि|पञ्चाग्निः
पंचन्-अग्नि <i>m.</i> 1. the aggregate of the five sacred fires (viz., अन्वाहार्यपचन, गार्हपत्य, आहवनीय, सभ्य and आवसथ्य); 2. a householder who maintains these five sacred fires.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांग|पञ्चाङ्ग|पञ्चाङ्गं|पञ्चाङ्गः
पंचन्-अंग <i>(I) a.</i> five membered, having five parts, e.g. पंचांगः प्रणामः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांग|पञ्चाङ्ग|पञ्चाङ्गं|पञ्चाङ्गः
पंचन्-अंग <i>(II) m.</i> 1. a turtle; 2. a species of horse with five spots on his body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांग|पञ्चाङ्ग|पञ्चाङ्गं|पञ्चाङ्गः
पंचन्-अंग <i>(III) n.</i> a calender, an almanack; (it is so called because it treats of five things- तिथिर्वारश्च नक्षत्रं योगः करणमेव च । पंचांगमेतदुद्दिष्टम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांगगुप्त|पञ्चाङ्गगुप्त|पञ्चाङ्गगुप्तः
पंचन्-अंग˚गुप्त <i>m.</i> a turtle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांगशुद्धि|पञ्चाङ्गशुद्धि
पंचन्-अंग˚शुद्धि <i>f.</i> the favourable state of five important points, viz., तिथि, वार, नक्षत्र, योग and करण (in astrology).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांगी|पञ्चाङ्गी
पंचन्-अंगी <i>f.</i> a bit for horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांगुल|पञ्चाङ्गुल|पञ्चाङ्गुलः
पंचन्-अंगुल <i>a. (f. ला or ली)</i> measuring five fingers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांगुला
पंचन्-अंगुल <i>a. (f. ला or ली)</i> measuring five fingers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचांगुली|पञ्चाङ्गुली
पंचन्-अंगुल <i>a. (f. ला or ली)</i> measuring five fingers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचाज|पञ्चाज
पंचन्-अज <i>n.</i> the fire products of the goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचामृत|पञ्चामृत|पञ्चामृतं
पंचन्-अमृत <i>n.</i> an aggregate of five sweet things (दुग्धं च शर्करा चैव घृतं दधि तथा मधु । पंचामृतमिदं प्रोक्तम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचार्चिस्|पञ्चार्चिस्|पञ्चार्च्चिस्
पंचन्-अर्चिस् <i>m.</i> the planet Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचावयव|पञ्चावयव
पंचन्-अवयव <i>a.</i> five-membered (as a syllogism in Nyāya). For the five members of a syllogism, See न्याय 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचावस्थ|पञ्चावस्थ|पञ्चावस्थः
पंचन्-अवस्थ <i>m.</i> a corpse; (so called because it is supposed to resolve into the five elements).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचाविक|पञ्चाविक
पंचन्-अविक <i>n.</i> the five products of the sheep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचाशीति|पञ्चाशीति|पञ्चाशीतिः
पंचन्-अशीति <i>f.</i> eighty-five.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचाह|पञ्चाह|पञ्चाहः
पंचन्-अह <i>m.</i> a period of five days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचातप|पञ्चातप
पंचन्-आतप <i>a.</i> doing penance with four fires and the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचानन|पञ्चानन|पञ्चाननः
पंचन्-आनन, -आस्य, -मुख, -वक्त्र <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Śiva; 2. (with the mouth wide open) a lion.(The word is used at the end of names of learned men to express veneration or high scholarship, e.g. जगन्नाथतर्कपंचानन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचास्य|पञ्चास्य|पञ्चास्यः
पंचन्-आनन, -आस्य, -मुख, -वक्त्र <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Śiva; 2. (with the mouth wide open) a lion.(The word is used at the end of names of learned men to express veneration or high scholarship, e.g. जगन्नाथतर्कपंचानन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचमुख|पञ्चमुख|पञ्चमुखः
पंचन्-आनन, -आस्य, -मुख, -वक्त्र <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Śiva; 2. (with the mouth wide open) a lion.(The word is used at the end of names of learned men to express veneration or high scholarship, e.g. जगन्नाथतर्कपंचानन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचवक्त्र|पञ्चवक्त्र|पञ्चवक्त्रः
पंचन्-आनन, -आस्य, -मुख, -वक्त्र <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Śiva; 2. (with the mouth wide open) a lion.(The word is used at the end of names of learned men to express veneration or high scholarship, e.g. जगन्नाथतर्कपंचानन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचेंद्रिय|पञ्चेन्द्रिय|पञ्चेन्द्रियं
पंचन्-इंद्रिय <i>n.</i> the aggregate of the five organs of sense or of action. (See इंद्रिय.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचेषु|पञ्चेषु|पञ्चेषुः
पंचन्-इषु <i>m.</i> an epithet of the god of love, यावज्ज्वलति नांगेषु स्वतः पंचेषुपावकः Bhartr.i.62. (For the five arrows of the god of love, See under अरविंद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचोष्मन्|पञ्चोष्मन्
पंचन्-उष्मन् <i>m. pl.</i> the five digestive fires supposed to be in the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचकर्मन्|पञ्चकर्मन्|पञ्चकर्म्मन्
पंचन्-कर्मन् <i>n.</i> five kinds of treatment, viz., (1) वमन ‘giving emetics,’ (2) रेचन ‘purging,’ (3) नस्य ‘giving sternutatories,’ (4) निरूह ‘administering an enema not oily,’ (5) अनुवासन ‘administering an oily enema’ (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचकृत्वस्|पञ्चकृत्वस्
पंचन्-कृत्वस् <i>ind.</i> five times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचकोण|पञ्चकोण|पञ्चकोणः
पंचन्-कोण <i>n.</i> a pentagon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=402-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पंचकोल|पञ्चकोल|पञ्चकोलं
