पट्
पट् <i>Caus. (पाटयति-ते)</i> 1. to split, to tear up, to tear asunder, to divide, एष पाट्यतां क्रकचेन वा Mrich.ix.; 2. to break, अन्यासु भित्तिषु मया निशि पाटितासु Mrich.iii.; 3. to pierce, to penetrate, दर्भपाटिततलेन पाणिना R.xi.31.With उद्-, 1. to tear out, दंतैर्नोत्पाटयेन्नखान् M.iv.69; 2. to pull out, to extract; 3. to eradicate.With वि-, 1. to tear, (केतकबर्हं) विपाटयामास युवा नखाग्रैः R.vi.17; 2. to pull out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=404-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

