पटल|पटलं|पटलः
पटल <i>(I) n.</i> 1. A roof, a thatch, दार्भं मुंचत्युटजपटलं वीतनिद्रो मयूरः Sak.iv.; 2. a cover, a veil, a coating; 3. a film over the eyes; 4. a basket; 5. a heap, a mass, a quantity, a multitude, धूपायतीव पटलैर्नवनीरदानाम् Sis.iv.52, R.iv.63; 6. retinue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

