पटि|पटिः
पटि <i>f.</i> 1. Cloth; 2. the curtain of a stage; 3. a screen of a cloth surrounding a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटी
