पटिक्षेप|पटिक्षेपः
पटि-क्षेप <i>m.</i> tossing aside the curtain of the stage. (As a stage-direction, it denotes a hurried and precipitate entrance on the stage.) See अपटीक्षेप.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटीक्षेप
