पट्ट|पट्टं|पट्टः
पट्ट <i>m.n.</i> 1. A slab, a tablet, a plate, Am.S.88; 2. a royal grant or edict; 3. a diadem, R.xviii.44; 4. a grinding stone; 5. a place where four roads meet; 6. a city, a town; 7. a throne; 8. a shield; 9. an upper garment, Bt.x.60; 10. a stool; 11. silk; 12. a bandage, a ligature (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

