पठ्
पठ् <i>vt. 1P (pp. पठित; pres. पठति; desid. पिपठिषति)</i> 1. To read, to recite, to rehearse; 2. to study, to peruse, अत ऊर्ध्वं तु छंदांसि शुक्लेषु नियतः पठेत् M.iv.98; 3. to mention, to cite, to quote; 4. to describe, to declare, उष्ण तक्ष्णिं च पठितं विषम् Suśruta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पठ्
पठ् <i>Caus. (पाठयति-ते)</i> With परि-, to teach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पठन|पठनं
पठन <i>n.</i> 1. Reading; 2. mentioning; 3. studying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पठि|पठिः
पठि <i>f.</i> Reading, perusal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पड्
पड् <i>(I) vt. 1Ā (pp. पंडित; pres. पंडते)</i> To go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पड्
पड् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pres. पंडयति-ते)</i> To heap together, to pile up, to collect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पण्
पण् <i>vt. or vi. 1Ā (pp. पणित or पणायित; pres. पणाते in the first two senses, and पणायति in the third sense, the root being conjugated, in the Par. in that sense)</i> 1. To deal in, to barter, to bargain, to transact business; 2. to bet or stake at play; (in these senses it is generally used with a gen., प्राणानामपणिष्टासौ Bh.V.iii.121, but sometimes with an acc.); 3. to praise.With वि-, to sell, to barter, आभीरदेशे किल चंद्रकांतं त्रिभिर्वराटैर्विपणंति गोपाः Panch.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पण|पणः
पण <i>m.</i> 1. A game played for a stake; 2. the thing staked; 3. a stipulation, a treaty; 4. wages, hire; 5. price; 6. a coin equal in value to eighty cowries (अशीतिभिर्वराटकैः पण इत्यभिधीयते); 7. wealth, property; 8. a commodity for sale; 9. a vendor; 10. a shop; 11. a distiller; 12. a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पणांगना|पणाङ्गना
