पणन|पणनं
पणन <i>n.</i> 1. Betting; 2. bartering; 3. sale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=405-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पणव|पणवः
पणव <i>m.</i> A sort of musical instrument, Bg.i.13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=406-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पणाया
