पथिप्रज्ञ
पथिन्-प्रज्ञ <i>a.</i> acquainted with roads.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=408-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पथिवाहक|पथिवाहकः
पथिन्-वाहक <i>(I) a.</i> cruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=408-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पथिवाहक|पथिवाहकः
