पथिल <i>m.</i> A traveller, a way-farer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=408-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पथ्य|पथ्यं|पथ्यः
