पथ्या
पथ्य <i>(I) a. (f. थ्या)</i> 1. Wholesome, salutary, beneficial (as diet or advice), Yaj.iii.65; 2. fit, proper, suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=408-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

