परच्छंदानुवर्तन|परच्छन्दानुवर्तन
पर-च्छंद˚अनुवर्तन <i>n.</i> following the will of another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परछिद्र|परच्छिद्र|परच्छिद्रं
