परंजन|परञ्जन|परंजनः|परञ्जनः
परंजन <i>m.</i> an epithet of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परंजय|परञ्जय|परंजयः|परञ्जयः
