परजित|परजितः
पर-जित <i>(I) a.</i> conquered by another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परजित|परजितः
पर-जित <i>(II) m.</i> the Indian cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परतंत्र|परतन्त्र|परतन्त्रः
