परतस्
पर-तस् <i>ind.</i> 1. from another; 2. from an enemy, R.iii.48; 3. after, over, beyond; 4. otherwise, differently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्र|परत्रं
पर-त्र <i>ind.</i> 1. elsewhere, in a future birth, in another world, परत्रेह च शर्मणे R.i.69, K.S.iv.37; 2. further on, in the sequel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्रभीरु|परत्रभीरुः
पर-त्र˚भीरु <i>m.</i> a pious man (who stands in awe of the next world).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदार|परदारः
पर-दार <i>m. pl.</i> another’s wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदारिन्
पर-दारिन् <i>m.</i> an adulterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परदुःख|परदुःखं
