परनिपात|परनिपातः
पर-निपात <i>m.</i> the irregular posteriority of a word in a compound (as in राजदंत where the sense is दंतानां राजा) (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परंतप|परन्तप|परंतपः|परन्तपः
