पर-संज्ञक <i>m.</i> the soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परसवर्ण
पर-सवर्ण <i>a.</i> homogenous with a following letter (in gram.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परसेवा
पर-सेवा <i>f.</i> service of another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्त्री
पर-स्त्री <i>f.</i> another’s wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्व
पर-स्व <i>n.</i> another’s property, R.ii.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परस्वहरण
पर-स्व˚हरण <i>n.</i> seizing another’s property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परहन्
पर-हन् <i>a.</i> killing enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परहित
पर-हित <i>n.</i> the welfare of another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=411-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परकीय|परकीयं
परकीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Belonging to another, यद्यपि न कापि हानिः परकीयां चरति रासभे द्राक्षाम् Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परकीया
परकीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Belonging to another, यद्यपि न कापि हानिः परकीयां चरति रासभे द्राक्षाम् Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परकीया
परकीया <i>f.</i> A woman not one’s own (in poetic composition). For further information, See अन्यस्त्री.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परम|परमः
परम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Highest, most excellent, प्राप्नोति परमां गतिम् M.iv.14; 2. chief, principal, primary, M.ix.319; 3. extreme, exceeding; 4. adequate, sufficient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमा
परम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Highest, most excellent, प्राप्नोति परमां गतिम् M.iv.14; 2. chief, principal, primary, M.ix.319; 3. extreme, exceeding; 4. adequate, sufficient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परम|परमः
परम <i>(II) n.</i> The utmost, the chief part, कामोपभोगपरमा एतावदिति निश्चिताः Bg.xvi.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमांगना|परमाङ्गना
परम-अंगना <i>f.</i> an excellent woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाणु|परमाणुः
परम-अणु <i>m.</i> an atom, an infinitesimal particle, R.xv.42, Yaj.iii.104.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाद्वैत|परमाद्वैतः
परम-अद्वैत <i>n.</i> 1. pure unitarianism; 2. the supreme spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमान्न|परमान्नं
परम-अन्न <i>n.</i> rice boiled in milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्थ|परमार्थः
परम-अर्थ <i>m.</i> 1. the highest or most sublime truth, i.e. knowledge about Brahman (n.); 2. truth, reality, परिहासविजल्पितं सखे परमार्थेन न गृह्यतां वचः Sak.ii.; 3. any excellent object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्थतस्
परम-अर्थ˚तस् <i>ind.</i> really, truly, properly, विकारं खलु परमार्थतोऽज्ञात्वा अनारंभः प्रतिकारस्य Sak.iii., उवाच चैनं परमार्थतो हरं न वेत्सि K.S.v.75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमार्थमत्स्य
परम-अर्थ˚मत्स्य <i>m.</i> a real fish, R.vii.40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमाह|परमाहः
परम-अह <i>m.</i> an excellent day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमात्मन्
परम-आत्मन् <i>m.</i> the supreme spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमापद्
परम-आपद् <i>f.</i> the greatest misfortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेश|परमेशः
परम-ईश <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेश्वर|परमेश्वरः
परम-ईश्वर <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Viṣṇu; 2. of Indra; 3. of Śiva; 4. the supreme being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमर्षि|परमर्षिः
परम-ऋषि <i>m.</i> a great sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमैश्वर्य
परम-ऐश्वर्य <i>n.</i> supremacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमगति|परमगतिः
परम-गति <i>f.</i> final beatitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमगव|परमगवः
परम-गव <i>m.</i> an excellent bull or cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमपद|परमपदः
परम-पद <i>n.</i> 1. the highest rank; 2. final beatitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमपुरुष|परमपुरुषः
परम-पुरुष, -पूरुष <i>m.</i> the supreme spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमपूरुष|परमपूरुषः
