परमप्रख्य
परम-प्रख्य <i>a.</i> renowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमब्रह्मन्
परम-ब्रह्मन् <i>m.</i> the supreme spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=413-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेष्ठ|परमेष्ठः
