परिसमाप्ति <i>f.</i> Finishing, completing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसमूहन|परिसमूहनं
