परिसर|परिसरः
परिसर <i>m.</i> 1. Verge, border, neighbourhood, environs, especially of a river or mountain, वृंदावनविपिने परिसरपरिगतयमुनाजलपूते Git.G.i., or वृक्षवाटिकापरिसरे संधिं कृत्वा Mrich.iii.; 2. death; 3. a rule, a precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

