परिसर्प|परिसर्पः
परिसर्प <i>m.</i> 1. Going about; 2. following, pursuing; 3. surrounding, encircling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसर्पण|परिसर्पणं
परिसर्पण <i>n.</i> 1. Creeping about; 2. running to and fro, constantly moving, पतगपतेः परिसर्पणे च तुल्यः Mrich.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

