परिस्फुटा
परिस्फुट <i>a. (f. टा)</i> 1. Quite plain, very manifest; 2. fully developed, fully blown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुरण|परिस्फुरणं
परिस्फुरण <i>n.</i> 1. Quivering, shooting; 2. budding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्यंद|परिस्यन्द|परिस्यंदः|परिस्यन्दः
परिस्यंद <i>m.</i> 1. Oozing, trickling; 2. flow, stream; 3. train, retinue; 4. decoration of the hair with flowers &c. Cf. परिष्यंद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रव|परिस्रवः
