परिहत
परिहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Loosened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहता
परिहत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Loosened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहरण|परिहरणं
परिहरण <i>n.</i> 1. Leaving, abandoning; 2. refuting; 3. seizing, taking away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=421-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहार|परिहारः
