पशु|पशुः
पशु <i>m.</i> 1. Cattle (singly and collectively), M.ix.327; 2. an animal in general; 3. a brute, a beast; (sometimes contemptuously applied to a man, e.g. पुरुषपशोश्च पशोश्चको विशेषः); 4. name of a subordinate deity, one of Śiva’s followers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=425-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

