पशुगायत्री
पशु-गायत्री <i>f.</i> a mantra whispered into the car of an animal about to be sacrificed. (It is this- पशुपाशाय विद्महे विश्वकर्मणे धीमहि । तत्रो जीवः प्रचोदयात्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=425-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

