पश्चात्
पश्चात् <i>ind. (used either absolutely or with a gen. or abl.)</i> 1. From behind, behind, पश्चादुच्चैर्भवति हरिणः स्वांगमायच्छमानः Sak.iv.; 2. after, afterwards, subsequently, पश्चादद्रिग्रहणगुरुभिर्गर्जितैर्नर्तयेथाः Megh.i.44, 30, R.xii.7, 17, 39; 3. at last, lastly; 4. from the west, westward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=426-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चार्ध|पश्चार्द्धः|पश्चार्धः
पश्चार्ध <i>m.</i> 1. the hinder part of the body, पश्चार्धेन प्रविष्टः शरपतनभयाद्भूयता पूर्वकायम् Sak.i.; 2. the latter half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=426-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चात्कृत
पश्चात्-कृत <i>a.</i> put into the shade, defeated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=426-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चात्ताप|पश्चात्तापः
पश्चात्-ताप <i>m.</i> repentance, remorse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=426-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिम|पश्चिमं
पश्चिम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Being behind, hindmost; 2. last, पश्चिमाद्यामिनीयामात्प्रसादमिव चेतना R.xvii.1, स्मरंतः पश्चिमामाज्ञां भर्तुः संग्रामयायिनः xvii.8, xix.1, M.vii.145; 3. westerly, western.(The inst. sing. पश्चिमेन is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) behind, after, (with an acc.); (2) in the west.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=426-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमा
पश्चिम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Being behind, hindmost; 2. last, पश्चिमाद्यामिनीयामात्प्रसादमिव चेतना R.xvii.1, स्मरंतः पश्चिमामाज्ञां भर्तुः संग्रामयायिनः xvii.8, xix.1, M.vii.145; 3. westerly, western.(The inst. sing. पश्चिमेन is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) behind, after, (with an acc.); (2) in the west.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=426-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमार्ध|पश्चिमार्धः
