पाणिंधय|पाणिन्धय|पाणिन्धयः
पाणिंधम <i>a.</i> blowing through the hands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=428-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिपीडन|पाणिपीडनं
पाणि-पीडन <i>n.</i> marriage, पाणिपीडनविधेरनंतरम् K.S.viii.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=428-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिप्रणयिनी
पाणि-प्रणयिनी <i>f.</i> a wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=428-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिबंध|पाणिबन्ध|पाणिबन्धः
पाणि-बंध <i>m.</i> marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=428-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिभुज्
पाणि-भुज् <i>m.</i> the sacred fig tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=428-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिमुक्त|पाणिमुक्तं
पाणि-मुक्त <i>n.</i> a missile thrown with the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=428-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिरुह्
पाणि-रुह्, -रुह <i>m.</i> a finger-nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=428-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिरुह|पाणिरुहः
पाणि-रुह्, -रुह <i>m.</i> a finger-nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=428-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाणिवाद|पाणिवादः
पाणि-वाद <i>m.</i> 1. clapping the hands together; 2. playing on a drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=428-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

