पाताल|पातालं|पातालः
पाताल <i>n.</i> 1. The last of the seven regions under the earth tenanted by Nāgas (the seven regions are- अतल, वितल, सुतल, रसातल, तलातल, महातल and पाताल.), R.i.80; 2. the lower world generally, R.xv.84; 3. an excavation, a hole; 4. submarine fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=429-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

