पिष् <i>vt. 7P (pp. पिष्ट; pres. पिनष्टि; caus. पेषयति-ते)</i> 1. To grind, to pound, to crush, यत्पिंषतामपि नृणां पिष्टोऽपि तनोषि परिमलैः पुष्टिम् Bh.V.i.12, Bt.vi.37, xii.18; 2. to hurt, to injure, to destroy.With निस्-, 1. to pound, to powder, to reduce to atoms, शिलानिष्पिष्टमुद्गरः R.xii.73; 2. to injure, to bruise, Bt.vi.120.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=439-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

