पुनर्
पुनर् <i>ind.</i> 1. Again, once more, निवार्यतामालि किमप्ययं वटुः पुनर्विवक्षुः K.S.v.82, iii.69, R.i.86, ii.23; 2. on the other hand, but, on the contrary, nevertheless, however, अथवा काममननुरूपमस्या वपुषो वल्कलं न पुनरलंकाराश्रियं न पुष्णाति Sak.i.पुनरपि 1. even, again, also; 2. and, on the other hand.किंपुनः ‘how much more, how much less,’ Megh.i.17.पुनःपुनः ‘again and again, repeatedly,’ पुनःपुनः सूतनिषिद्धचापलं हरंतमश्वं रथरश्मिसंयतम् R.iii.42.(पुनर्गम् ‘to go back.’ पुनर्दा ‘to give back.’ पुनर्भू ‘to become a wife again.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=443-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

