पुनर्-भव <i>m.</i> 1. transmigration, repeated birth, ममाफि च क्षपयतु नीललोहितः पुनर्भवं परिगतशक्तिरारात्मभूः Sak.vii., K.S.iii.5; 2. a finger-nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=443-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

