पुरतस्
पुरतस् <i>ind.</i> 1. Before, in front, in the presence of, e.g. पत्या पुरतः सरता; 2. afterwards, प्रारब्धा पुरतो यथा मनसिजस्याज्ञा तथा वर्तितुम् Am.S.43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरंध्रि|पुरन्ध्रि|पुरंध्रिः|पुरन्ध्रिः
पुरंध्रि(ध्री) <i>f.</i> 1. An elderly married woman, K.S.vi.32, vii.2; 2. a woman whose husband and children are living, R.vii.28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरंध्री
