पुरस्
पुरस् <i>ind.</i> 1. Before, in front, in the presence of, (with a gen.), तावंत्येव कृतागसो द्रुततरं व्याहृत्य पत्युः पुरः Am.S.43, R.ii.36, Megh.i.3, K.S.iv.3 (in this sense it is often prefixed to कृ, भू and गम्; hence such forms as पुरस्कृत्य &c.); 2. in the east, from the east, eastward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्करण|पुरस्करणं
पुरस्-करण <i>n.</i> 1. placing in front; 2. treating with honour, deference; 3. preference; 4. accompanying, attending; 5. preparing, making ready; 6. accusation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्कार|पुरस्कारः
