पुरोजन्मन् <i>a.</i> born before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोडाश्
पुरोडाश् <i>m.</i> 1. an oblation in general; 2. a sacrificial cake of ground rice, M.vi.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोडाश|पुरोडाशः
पुरोडाश् <i>m.</i> 1. an oblation in general; 2. a sacrificial cake of ground rice, M.vi.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोधस्
पुरोधस् <i>m.</i> a family-priest, especially that of a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोधान|पुरोधानं
पुरोधान <i>n.</i> priestly ministration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोधिका
पुरोधिका <i>f.</i> a favourite wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोभाग|पुरोभागः
पुरोभाग <i>(I) a.</i> 1. obtrusive; 2. fault-finding, प्रायः समानविद्याः परस्परयशः पुरोभागाः Mal.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोभाग|पुरोभागः
पुरोभाग <i>(II) m.</i> 1. the front part; 2. officiousness; 3. envy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरःपाक
पुरस्-पाक <i>a.</i> having fulfilment at hand, K.S.vi.90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरःप्रहर्तृ
पुरस्-प्रहर्तृ <i>m.</i> one who fights in the front line, R.xiii.72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरःफल
पुरस्-फल <i>a.</i> promising fruit, having fruit in the near future, R.ii.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोभागिन्
पुरोभागिन् <i>a.</i> 1. obtrusive, officious; 2. fault-finding; 3. jealous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोमारुत|पुरोमारुतः
पुरोमारुत <i>m.</i> a wind blowing in front.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोवात|पुरोवातः
पुरोमारुत <i>m.</i> a wind blowing in front.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरःसर|पुरःसरः
पुरस्-सर <i>(I) a.</i> moving in front.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरःसर|पुरःसरः
पुरस्-सर <i>(II) m.</i> 1. a servant, an attendant, मा भूदाश्रमपीडेति परिमेयपुरःसरौ R.i.37; 2. a leader, one who leads the way, K.S.vi.49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरःस्थायिन्
पुरस्-स्थायिन् <i>a.</i> standing in front.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोहित|पुरोहितः
पुरोहित <i>(I) a.</i> 1. placed in front; 2. charged, commissioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोहित|पुरोहितः
पुरोहित <i>(II) m.</i> a family-priest who conducts all the ceremonials of the family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरस्तात्
पुरस्तात् <i>ind.</i> 1. In front of, before, (with gen. or abl.), K.S.vii.30, R.ii.44, Megh.i.15; 2. in the first place; 3. previously, formerly; 4. eastward, in the east, Bg.xi.40; 5. further on, in the sequel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरा
पुरा <i>ind.</i> 1. In former times, of yore, पुरा शक्रमुपस्थाय तवोर्वीं प्रति यास्यतः R.i.75, M.i.199; 2. continually, hitherto; 3. in the first place, at first; 4. in a short time, ere long, (in this sense, it gives a future sense to the present tense, आलोके ते निपतति पुरा Megh.ii.22, or पुरा दूषयति स्थलीम् R.xii.30, Na.i.18).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरोपनीत
पुरा-उपनीत <i>a.</i> formerly possessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराकथा
पुरा-कथा <i>f.</i> in old legend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराकल्प|पुराकल्पः
पुरा-कल्प <i>m.</i> 1. a fomier creation; 2. an old story, a story of the past, द्यूतमेतत्पुराकल्पे दृष्टं वैरकरं महत् M.ix.227.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराकृत|पुराकृतं
पुरा-कृत <i>a.</i> done formerly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरातन|पुरातनः
पुरा-तन <i>(I) a.</i> 1. old, ancient, Bg.iv.3, K.S.vi.9; 2. worn out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरातन|पुरातनः
पुरा-तन <i>(II) m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरायोनि|पुरायोनिः
पुरा-योनि <i>a.</i> of ancient origin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरावसु|पुरावसुः
पुरा-वसु <i>m.</i> an epithet of Bhīṣma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराविद्
पुरा-विद् <i>a.</i> acquainted with the past, knowing the events of former times, K.S.vi.9, R.xi.10, K.S.v.28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरावृत्त|पुरावृत्तं
पुरा-वृत्त <i>(I) a.</i> 1. what occurred in former times; 2. referring to times of yore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरावृत्त|पुरावृत्तं
पुरा-वृत्त <i>(II) n.</i> 1. historic; 2. an old or legendary event.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=444-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरा
पुरा <i>f.</i> 1. An epithet of the Ganges; 2. a kind of perfume; 3. the east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराण|पुराणं|पुराणः
पुराण <i>(I) a. (f. णा or णी)</i> 1. Ancient, old, belonging to olden times, पुराणमित्येव न साधु सर्वं न चापि काव्यं नवमित्यवद्यम् Mal.i., or अजो नित्यः शाश्वतोऽयं पुराणः Bg.ii.20; 2. worn out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराणा
पुराण <i>(I) a. (f. णा or णी)</i> 1. Ancient, old, belonging to olden times, पुराणमित्येव न साधु सर्वं न चापि काव्यं नवमित्यवद्यम् Mal.i., or अजो नित्यः शाश्वतोऽयं पुराणः Bg.ii.20; 2. worn out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराणी
पुराण <i>(I) a. (f. णा or णी)</i> 1. Ancient, old, belonging to olden times, पुराणमित्येव न साधु सर्वं न चापि काव्यं नवमित्यवद्यम् Mal.i., or अजो नित्यः शाश्वतोऽयं पुराणः Bg.ii.20; 2. worn out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराण|पुराणं|पुराणः
पुराण <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A past event; 2. any legendary tale; 3. the name of a certain class of sacred works ascribed to Vyāsa and containing the whole body of Hindu mythology.(पुराण is thus defined- सर्गश्च प्रतिसर्गश्च वंशो मन्वंतराणि च । वंशानुचरितं चैव पुराणं पंचलक्षणम्. There are eighteen principal Purāṇas- अश्ग्टादशपुराणानि पुराणज्ञः प्रचक्षते । ब्राह्मं पाद्मं वैष्णवं च शैवं भागवतं तथा । तथान्यन्नारदीयं च मार्कंडेयं च सप्तमम् । आग्नेयमष्टमं चैव भविष्यं नवमं स्मृतम् । वाराहं द्वादशं चैव स्कांदं चैव त्रयोदशम् । चतुर्दशं वामनं च कौर्मं पंचदशं स्मृतम् । मात्स्यं च गारुडं चैव ब्रह्मांडं च ततः परम्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराण|पुराणं|पुराणः
पुराण <i>(III) m.</i> A coin equal to eighty cowries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराणांत|पुराणान्त|पुराणान्तः
पुराण-अंत <i>m.</i> an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराणोक्त
पुराण-उक्त <i>a.</i> enjoined by the Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराणग|पुराणगः
पुराण-ग <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Brahman (m.); 2. a reader of the Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुराणपुरुष|पुराणपुरुषः
पुराण-पुरुष <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरि|पुरिः
पुरि <i>f.</i> 1. A city; 2. a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरी
पुरी <i>f.</i> 1. A city, a town, शशासैकपुरीमिव R.i.30, Megh.i.30; 2. a stronghold; 3. the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरीमोह|पुरीमोहः
पुरी-मोह <i>m.</i> the Dhattūra plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरीतत्
पुरी-तत् <i>m.n.</i> 1. name of an intestine near the heart; 2. the entrails in general; (also read पुरितत, perhaps wrongly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरीष|पुरीषं
पुरीष <i>n.</i> 1. Feces, ordure, M.iv.36, iv.80, v.138; 2. rubbish, mould.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरीषोत्सर्ग|पुरीषोत्सर्गः
पुरीष-उत्सर्ग <i>m.</i> the voiding of excrement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरीषनिग्रहण
पुरीष-निग्रहण <i>a.</i> obstructing the bowels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरीषण|पुरीषणः
पुरीषण <i>(I) m.</i> Feces, ordure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरीषण|पुरीषणः
पुरीषण <i>(II) n.</i> Evacuation by stool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरीषण|पुरीषणः
पुरीषण <i>m.</i> The black kidney-bean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरु|पुरुः
पुरु <i>(I) a. (f. रु or र्वी)</i> Much, many, abundant; (in this sense, it is rarely used in classics; the Bhagavata has it in several places.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुर्वी
पुरु <i>(I) a. (f. रु or र्वी)</i> Much, many, abundant; (in this sense, it is rarely used in classics; the Bhagavata has it in several places.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरु|पुरुः
पुरु <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The pollen of a flower; 2. heaven; 3. name of a son of Yayāti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरुजित्
पुरु-जित् <i>m.</i> 1. a name of king Kuntibhoja; 2. an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरुद
पुरु-द <i>n.</i> gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरुदंशक|पुरुदंशकः
पुरु-दंशक <i>m.</i> a goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरुलंपट|पुरुलम्पट
पुरु-लंपट <i>a.</i> very lascivious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरुह|पुरुहं
पुरु-ह, -हू <i>a.</i> much, many.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरुहू
पुरु-ह, -हू <i>a.</i> much, many.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुरुहूत|पुरुहूतः
पुरु-हूत <i>(I) a.</i> invoked by many.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=445-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

