पूर्
पूर् <i>(I) vt. 4Ā (pp. पूर्ण; pres. पूर्यते)</i> 1. To fill, to fill out; 2. to please, to satisfy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=448-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्
पूर् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pp. पूरित; pres. पूरयति-ते)</i> 1. To fill, to fill out, माथुरस्य पांशुना चक्षुषी पूरयित्वा Mrich.ii.; 2. to fill with wind, to blow; 3. to cover, to surround, Bt.vii.30; 4. to fill with sound, to make resonant; 5. to intensify, to strengthen.With आ-, 1. to fill, to fill up, to make full, R.xvi.65, Bg.xi.30; 2. to blow, to fill with wind; 3. to cover, to envelop, to intertwine, (केशान्) आपूरयंति वनिता नवमालतीभिः Rt.iii.18.With परि-, to fill, to fill completely.With प्र-, 1. to fill; 2. to enrich, to load with riches.With सम्-, to fill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=448-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

