पूर्णपात्र|पूर्णपात्रं
पूर्ण-पात्र <i>m.n.</i> 1. a full cup; 2. a cup-full; 3. a measure of capacity equal to 250 handfuls; 4. a vessel full of valuable things which is scrambled for by servants or relatives on occasions of joy, (हर्षादुत्सवकाले यदलंकारांशुकादिकम् । आकृष्य गृह्यते पूर्णपात्रं स्यात्पूर्णकं च तत् Jaṭādhara); 5. a present given to the bringer of good news, तत्कामं प्रभवति पूर्णपात्रवृत्त्या स्वीकर्तुं मम हृदयं च जीवितं च M.M.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=449-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

