पृ
पृ <i>Caus. (पारयति-ते)</i> With व्या-, 1. to cause to work, to engage in, व्यापारयामास करं किरीटे R.vi.19, or व्यापारयामास विलोचनानि K.S.iii.67; 2. to appoint, व्यापारितः शूलभृता विधाय सिंहत्वमंकागतसत्ववृत्ति R.ii.38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=451-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृ
पृ <i>(II) vt. 3P (pp. पूर्ण; pres. पिपर्ति)</i> 1. To bring out of, to deliver from; 2. to protect; 3. to promote, to advance; 4. to fill. (This root is very rarely used in classics.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=451-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृ
पृ <i>(III) vt. 10U (pres. पारयति-ते)</i> 1. To reach the other side of anything, to accomplish, to achieve, to bring to a conclusion (as a vow or promise); 2. to be able to bear; 3. to extricate, to rescue, to save.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=451-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृ
पृ <i>(IV) vt. 5P (pres. पृणोति)</i> 1. To delight, to gratify; 2. to be delighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=451-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

