पृच्
पृच् <i>(II) vt. 7P (pp. पृक्त; pres. पृणक्ति)</i> 1. To bring into contact, to unite, to join, अपृणग्धनुषा शरम् Rt.vi.39; 2. to satisfy, to satiate; 3. to increase, to augment.With सम्-, to bring in contact with, to mix, to unite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=451-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृच्
