प्रकरण|प्रकरणं
प्रकरण <i>n.</i> 1. Opportunity, occasion; 2. subject, topic; 3. a section or chapter of a book; 4. an introduction, a prologue; 5. a species of dramatic composition (thus described by S.D.- भवेत्प्रकरणे वृत्तं लौकिकं कविकल्पितम् । शृंगारोऽंगी नायकोऽस्ति विप्रोऽमात्योऽथवा वणिक् । सापायधर्मकामार्थपरो धीरप्रशांतकः), e.g. मृच्छकटिक, मालतीमाधव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=455-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरणिका
प्रकरणिका <i>f.</i> A minor drama of the same character as the प्रकरण, (thus described by the S.D.- नाटिकैव प्रकरणिका सार्थवाहादिनायिका । समानवंशजा नेतुर्भवेद्यत्र च नायिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरणी
प्रकरणिका <i>f.</i> A minor drama of the same character as the प्रकरण, (thus described by the S.D.- नाटिकैव प्रकरणिका सार्थवाहादिनायिका । समानवंशजा नेतुर्भवेद्यत्र च नायिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरिका
प्रकरिका <i>f.</i> An interlude inserted in a drama to explain what is to follow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरी
प्रकरी <i>f.</i> 1. An interlude inserted in a drama to explain what is to follow; 2. theatrical dress; 3. an open piece of ground; 4. a place where four roads meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्ष|प्रकर्षः
प्रकर्ष <i>m.</i> 1. Intensity, eminence, excellence, वपुः प्रकर्षादजयद्गुरुं रघुः R.iii.34, वर्णप्रकर्षे सति K.S.iii.28; 2. strength, power; 3. length, protractedness.(The inst. and abl. singulars, viz., प्रकर्षेण and प्रकर्षात् are used as indeclinables in the sense of ‘eminently, exceedingly, in a high degree.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षण
प्रकर्षण <i>n.</i> 1. The act of dragging away; 2. the act of ploughing; 3. excellence, superiority; 4. duration, length.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकला
प्रकला <i>f.</i> A minute portion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्पना
प्रकल्पना <i>f.</i> Settlement, allotment, M.viii.211.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्पित
प्रकल्पित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Made; 2. settled, allotted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्पिता
प्रकल्पित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Made; 2. settled, allotted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्पिता
प्रकल्पिता <i>f.</i> A kind of riddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकांड|प्रकाण्ड|प्रकांडं|प्रकांडः|प्रकाण्डः
प्रकांड <i>(I) m.n.</i> 1. The trunk of a tree from the root to the branches; 2. (at the end of a compound) anything excellent of its kind, दंतप्रकांडेषु सितेषु शुभ्रतां कुंभेषु दानांबुघनेषु पंकताम् K.S.xv.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकांड|प्रकाण्ड|प्रकांडं|प्रकांडः|प्रकाण्डः
प्रकांड <i>(II) m.</i> A branch, a shoot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकांडक|प्रकाण्डक|प्रकांडकः|प्रकाण्डकः
प्रकांडक <i>m.</i> The same as प्रकांड q.v., Bt.v.6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकांडर|प्रकाण्डर|प्रकांडरः|प्रकाण्डरः
प्रकांडर <i>m.</i> A tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाम|प्रकामं|प्रकामः
प्रकाम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Much, excessive, to the heart’s content, R.ii.11, K.S.ii.24; 2. amorous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकामा
प्रकाम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Much, excessive, to the heart’s content, R.ii.11, K.S.ii.24; 2. amorous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाम|प्रकामं|प्रकामः
प्रकाम <i>(II) m.</i> Desire, pleasure.(प्रकामम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) exceedingly, R.vi.44; (2) to the heart’s content; (3) willingly, voluntarily.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकामभुज्
प्रकाम-भुज् <i>a.</i> eating till satisfied, R.i.66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकार|प्रकारः
प्रकार <i>m.</i> 1. Sort, kind, variety, मणिप्रकाराः सरसं च चंदनम् Rt.i.2, Yaj.iii.216; 2. manner, mode, fashion; 3. similitude; 4. property, quality, speciality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश|प्रकाशं|प्रकाशः
प्रकाश <i>(I) a. (f. शा)</i> 1. Visible, manifest, Bg.vii.25; 2. bright, shining, प्रकाशश्चाप्रकाशश्च लोकालोक इवाचलः R.i.68, v.2; 3. open, public; 4. famous, renowned, R.iii.48; 5. expanded, open; 6. open, denuded of trees, R.iv.31; 7. (at the end of a compound) looking like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशा
प्रकाश <i>(I) a. (f. शा)</i> 1. Visible, manifest, Bg.vii.25; 2. bright, shining, प्रकाशश्चाप्रकाशश्च लोकालोक इवाचलः R.i.68, v.2; 3. open, public; 4. famous, renowned, R.iii.48; 5. expanded, open; 6. open, denuded of trees, R.iv.31; 7. (at the end of a compound) looking like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश|प्रकाशं|प्रकाशः
प्रकाश <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Lustre, light, splendour, brightness; 2. sunshine; 3. fame, renown, celebrity; 4. manifestation, display; 5. an open spot; 6. a golden mirror; 7. a chapter or section of a book; 8. (at the end of titles of works) elucidation, e.g. काव्यप्रकाश, भावप्रकाश &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश|प्रकाशं|प्रकाशः
प्रकाश <i>(III) n.</i> Brass.[प्रकाशम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) openly, publicly, स हंतव्यः प्रकाशं विविधैर्वधैः M.viii.193; (2) aloud, audibly (used as a stage-direction in this sense).]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशात्मक
प्रकाश-आत्मक <i>a.</i> shining, brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशात्मन्
प्रकाश-आत्मन् <i>m.</i> 1. the sun; 2. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशेतर
प्रकाश-इतर <i>a.</i> invisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशक्रय|प्रकाशक्रयः
प्रकाश-क्रय <i>m.</i> an open purchase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशनारी
