प्रकाशक|प्रकाशकः
प्रकाशक <i>(I) a. (f. शिका)</i> 1. Making apparent, discovering, disclosing; 2. explaining; 3. luminous, giving light; 4. brilliant, shining; 5. noted, renowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशिका
प्रकाशक <i>(I) a. (f. शिका)</i> 1. Making apparent, discovering, disclosing; 2. explaining; 3. luminous, giving light; 4. brilliant, shining; 5. noted, renowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशक|प्रकाशकः
प्रकाशक <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The sun; 2. a discoverer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशकज्ञातृ
प्रकाशक-ज्ञातृ <i>m.</i> 1. the sun; 2. a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशन|प्रकाशनः
प्रकाशन <i>(I) n.</i> 1. Illuminating, making bright; 2. making manifest, making known; 3. displaying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशन|प्रकाशनः
प्रकाशन <i>(II) m.</i> An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशित|प्रकाशितं
प्रकाशित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Made evident, manifested; 2. illuminated, enlightened; 3. published.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशिता
प्रकाशित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Made evident, manifested; 2. illuminated, enlightened; 3. published.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

