प्रकीर्ण|प्रकीर्णं|प्रकीर्णः
प्रकीर्ण <i>(I) a. (f. र्णा)</i> 1. Scattered about, dispersed, scattered forth, प्रकीर्णः पुष्पाणां हरिचरणयोरंजलिरयम् Ve.i.; 2. published, spread; 3. disordered, confused; 4. agitated, excited; 5. miscellaneous, e.g. the प्रकीर्णकांड of the Bhaṭṭikāvya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

