प्रकीर्णक <i>(II) m.n.</i> A chowrie, a fly-flap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

