प्रकीर्तित <i>n.</i> 1. Proclaiming, announcing; 2. praising, extolling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

