प्रकुपिता
प्रकुपित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Very angry, enraged; 2. stimulated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=456-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकुल|प्रकुलं
