प्रक्रम-भंग <i>m.</i> want of regularity in expression considered as a fault of composition; (as an instance may be cited the stanza, गाहंतां महिषा निपानसलिलम् &c. (Sak.ii.) where there is an irregularity of expression in the third line which may be relieved by reading it as विश्रब्धा रचयंतु शूकरवरा मुस्ताक्षतिं पल्वले. See K.Pr.vii.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=457-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

