प्रचायिका <i>f.</i> Gathering in turn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचार|प्रचारः
प्रचार <i>m.</i> 1. Going, going forth, wandering, K.S.iii.42; 2. appearance, manifestation; 3. use, currency, विलोक्य तैरप्यधुना प्रचारमयं प्रयत्नः पुरुषोत्तमस्य Trik.i.1; 4. conduct, behaviour; 5. custom, usage; 6. a play-ground; 7. a pasture-ground; 8. a path, a footpath, e.g. प्रचारं च न विभाज्यं प्रचक्षते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचाल|प्रचालः
प्रचाल <i>m.</i> The neck of the ludian lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचालन|प्रचालनं
प्रचालन <i>n.</i> Stirring, moving, shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचित
प्रचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Gathered, plucked; 2. amassed, accumulated; 3. covered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचिता
प्रचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Gathered, plucked; 2. amassed, accumulated; 3. covered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुर|प्रचुरं|प्रचुरः
प्रचुर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Much, abundant, plentiful, नित्यव्यया प्रचुरनित्यधनागमा च Bhartr.ii.47, Rt.ii.21; 2. (at the end of a compound) replete with, abounding in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरा
प्रचुर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Much, abundant, plentiful, नित्यव्यया प्रचुरनित्यधनागमा च Bhartr.ii.47, Rt.ii.21; 2. (at the end of a compound) replete with, abounding in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुर|प्रचुरं|प्रचुरः
प्रचुर <i>(II) m.</i> A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरपुरुष|प्रचुरपुरुषः
प्रचुर-पुरुष <i>(I) a.</i> populous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरपुरुष|प्रचुरपुरुषः
प्रचुर-पुरुष <i>(II) m.</i> a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेतस्
प्रचेतस् <i>m.</i> 1. An epithet of Varuṇa, K.S.ii.21; 2. name of an ancient sage who was a law-giver, M.i.35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेतृ
प्रचेतृ <i>m.</i> A charioteer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेल|प्रचेलं
