प्रचोद|प्रचोदः
प्रचोद <i>m.</i> Inciting, instigating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदन|प्रचोदनं
प्रचोदन <i>n.</i> 1. Instigating, inciting; 2. ordering, enjoining; 3. a rule, a precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदित|प्रचोदितः
