प्रचोदिता
प्रचोदित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Instigated, incited; 2. prescribed, directed; 3. determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छ्|प्रछ्
प्रच्छ् <i>vt. 6P (pp. पृष्ट; pres. पृच्छति; caus. प्रच्छयति; desid. पिपृच्छिषति) (This is one of those roots which take two accusatives, e.g. माणवकं पंथानं पृच्छति)</i> 1. To ask, to question, to interrogate, पृच्छामि त्वां धर्मसंमूढचेताः Bg.ii.7, R.iii.5, Bt.vi.8; 2. to seek, to seek for.With अनु-, to question about.With आ-, 1. to ask, to question; 2. (Atm.) to take leave of, to bid adieu to, आपृच्छस्व प्रियसखममुं तुंगमालिंग्य शैलम् Megh.i.12.With परि-, to ask, to question, to inquire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छद|प्रच्छदः|प्रछद
प्रच्छद <i>m.</i> A cover, a wrapper, a bed-cover, R.xix.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

