प्रच्छन|प्रच्छनं
प्रच्छन <i>n.</i> Inquiry, interrogation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

