प्रच्छना <i>f.</i> Inquiry, interrogation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छन्न|प्रच्छन्नं
प्रच्छन्न <i>(I) a. (f. न्ना)</i> 1. Covered, enveloped; 2. private, secret; 3. concealed, hidden, (pp. of छद् with प्र q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

