प्रच्छन्न|प्रच्छन्नं
प्रच्छन्न <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A private door; 2. a lattice, a window.(प्रच्छन्नम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘secretly, covertly.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छन्नतस्कर|प्रच्छन्नतस्करः
