प्रच्छादित|प्रच्छादितं
प्रच्छादित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Hidden, concealed; 2. covered, enveloped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छादिता
प्रच्छादित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Hidden, concealed; 2. covered, enveloped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

