प्रच्युत
प्रच्युत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Fallen from; 2. displaced, degraded; 3. put to flight, routed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

