प्रच्युत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Fallen from; 2. displaced, degraded; 3. put to flight, routed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्युति|प्रच्युतिः
प्रच्युति <i>f.</i> 1. Fall, ruin; 2. loss, deprivation, नित्यं प्रच्युतिशंकया क्षणमपि स्वर्गे न मोदामहे Sant.S.iv.20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

