प्रजल्प|प्रजल्पः
प्रजल्प <i>m.</i> Prattle, gossip, the frivolous words of a lover. (असूयेर्षामदयुजा योवधीरणमुद्रया । प्रियस्य कौशलोद्गारः प्रजल्पः स तु कथ्यते.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजल्पन|प्रजल्पनं
प्रजल्पन <i>n.</i> Talking, speaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-40" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजविन्
प्रजविन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Rapid, swift, speedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजविनी
प्रजविन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Rapid, swift, speedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजविन्
प्रजविन् <i>(II) m.</i> An express, a courier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-41" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजा
प्रजा <i>f. (this word is changed into प्रजस् when used as the last member of a Bahu. compound with अ, दुस् or सु as the first member, R.xviii.29, viii.32)</i> 1. Propagation, generation; 2. offspring, progeny, issue, e.g. प्रजाः प्रजाः स्वा इव तन्त्रयित्वा (where the word is used in this sense. and also in sense 4), M.iv.156, iii.42; 3. semen; 4. subjects, न व्यतीयुः प्रजास्तस्य नियंतुर्नेमिवृत्तयः R.i.17, M.i.89, R.ii.73, iv.3; 5. mankind, people, M.i.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजांतक|प्रजान्तक|प्रजान्तकः
