प्रजेश्वर|प्रजेश्वरः
प्रजा-ईश, -ईश्वर <i>m.</i> a king, a sovereign, R.xviii.29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजोत्पत्ति|प्रजोत्पत्तिः
प्रजा-उत्पत्ति <i>f.</i> the rising up of progeny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=459-42" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

