प्रत्ता
प्रत्त <i>a. (f. त्ता)</i> 1. Given, presented, offered; 2. given in marriage, married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=469-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

