प्रत्यक्षप्रमाण
प्रत्यक्ष-प्रमाण <i>n.</i> evidence of the senses, ocular proof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=469-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षफल
प्रत्यक्ष-फल <i>a.</i> having visible consequences.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=469-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षवादिन्
प्रत्यक्ष-वादिन् <i>m.</i> a Buddhist who admits no other evidence than perception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=469-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

