प्रथ्
प्रथ् <i>(I) vi. 1Ā (pres. प्रथते)</i> 1. To become well-known, to become famous, तीर्थं पावनं भुवि पप्रथे R.xv.101, K.S.v.7, Megh.i.24; 2. to increase; 3. to spread abroad, तथा यशोऽस्य प्रथते M.xi.15; 4. to appear, to arise, श्रमानुत्तासां मदनो नु पप्रथे Kir.viii.53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=471-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथ्
प्रथ् <i>(II) vt. or vi. 10U (pres. प्रथयति-ते)</i> 1. To be famous or well-known; 2. to spread abroad, Bt.xvii.160; 3. to evince, to show, to manifest, प्रथयितुं विभुतामभिनिर्मितम् Kir.v.3; 4. to increase, to augment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=471-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथन|प्रथनं
प्रथन <i>n.</i> 1. Spreading, spreading out; 2. showing, evincing; 3. throwing, projecting; 4. a place where anything is spread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=471-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथम|प्रथमः
प्रथम <i>a. (f. मा) (the nom. pl. m. of this word is either प्रथमे or प्रथमाः)</i> 1. First, foremost, R.iii.44; 2. earliest, most ancient; 3. previous, prior, earlier, R.x.67; 4. chief, principal, most eminent, incomparable, matchless; 5. the third (person) (in gram.).(प्रथमम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) firstly, at first, K.S.vii.24; (2) previously, already, R.iii.68; (3) immediately. at once; (4) before, यात्राये चोदयामास तं शक्तेः प्रथमं शरत् R.iv.24, उत्तिष्ठेत्प्रथमं चास्य चरमं चैव संविशेत् M.ii.194. प्रथमम्-अनंतरम्, ततः or पश्चात् ‘first-afterwards.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=471-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथमा
प्रथम <i>a. (f. मा) (the nom. pl. m. of this word is either प्रथमे or प्रथमाः)</i> 1. First, foremost, R.iii.44; 2. earliest, most ancient; 3. previous, prior, earlier, R.x.67; 4. chief, principal, most eminent, incomparable, matchless; 5. the third (person) (in gram.).(प्रथमम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) firstly, at first, K.S.vii.24; (2) previously, already, R.iii.68; (3) immediately. at once; (4) before, यात्राये चोदयामास तं शक्तेः प्रथमं शरत् R.iv.24, उत्तिष्ठेत्प्रथमं चास्य चरमं चैव संविशेत् M.ii.194. प्रथमम्-अनंतरम्, ततः or पश्चात् ‘first-afterwards.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=471-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

