प्रयोज्य <i>(I) a. (f. ज्या)</i> 1. To be practised; 2. to be produced; 3. to be appointed; 4. to be thrown (as an अस्त्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=477-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

