प्रवेशिता
प्रवेशित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Introduced, brought in, led into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=480-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेष्ट|प्रवेष्टः
प्रवेष्ट <i>m.</i> 1. An arm; 2. the wrist; 3. the back of an elephant; 4. an elephant’s gums; 5. an elephant’s housings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=480-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्यक्त|प्रव्यक्तं
