प्रशंसा <i>f.</i> 1. Description (as in अप्रस्तुतप्रशंसा); 2. praise, eulogy, applause, M.x.127; 3. fame, reputation, glory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=480-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसोपमा
प्रशंसा-उपमा <i>f.</i> a kind of Upamā according to Danḍin who thus defines and illustrates- ब्रह्मणोऽप्युद्भवः पद्मश्चंद्रः शंभुशिरोधृतः । तौ तुल्यौ त्वन्मुखेनेति सा प्रशंसोपमोच्यते K.D.ii.31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=480-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसित
