प्रशंसित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Praised, eulogised, applauded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=480-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

