प्रशाम|प्रशामः
प्रशाम <i>f.</i> 1. Tranquillity, calm, composure; 2. quenching, extinguishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=480-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

