प्रशोष|प्रशोषः
प्रशोष <i>m.</i> The becoming dry, aridity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=481-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

