प्रस्थ-पुष्प <i>m.</i> a variety of holy basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=484-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

