प्रस्थान|प्रस्थानं
प्रस्थान <i>n.</i> 1. Departing, proceeding, going forth, departure, प्रस्थानं वलयैः कृतं प्रियसखैरस्त्रैरजस्रं गतम् Am.S.31, Megh.i.41, R.iv.88; 2. the march of an assailant; 3. method, system; 4. dying, death; 5. a kind of inferior drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=484-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थापन|प्रस्थापनं
