प्रस्थापित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Sent away, dispatched; 2. established, proved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=484-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

