प्रहीण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> Abandoned, quitted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहीणा
प्रहीण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> Abandoned, quitted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहीण|प्रहीणः
प्रहीण <i>(II) n.</i> Destruction, loss, removal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहुत|प्रहुतं|प्रहुतः
प्रहुत <i>m.n.</i> One of the five daily Yajnyas consisting in the offerings of food to all created beings (भूतयज्ञ). See M.iii.74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृत
प्रहृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Struck, beaten, wounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृता
प्रहृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Struck, beaten, wounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृत
प्रहृत <i>(II) n.</i> A stroke, a blow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृष्ट
प्रहृष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Rejoiced, pleased, overjoyed; 2. bristling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृष्टा
प्रहृष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Rejoiced, pleased, overjoyed; 2. bristling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृष्टात्मन्
प्रहृष्ट-आत्मन्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> rejoiced in mind, delighted at heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृष्टमनस्
प्रहृष्ट-आत्मन्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> rejoiced in mind, delighted at heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृष्टक|प्रहृष्टकः
प्रहृष्टक <i>m.</i> A crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेणक|प्रहेणकं
प्रहेणक <i>n.</i> A kind of cake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेलक|प्रहेलकं|प्रहेलकः
प्रहेलक <i>n.</i> 1. A riddle, an enigma, a puzzling question; 2. a kind of cake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेला
प्रहेला <i>f.</i> Playful dalliance, loose behaviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेलि|प्रहेलिः
प्रहेलि <i>f.</i> A poetic riddle, thus defined by Dharmadāsa- व्यक्तीकृत्य कमप्यर्थं स्वरूपार्थस्य गोपनात् । यत्र बाह्यांतरावर्थौ कथ्येते सा प्रहेलिका. [The following is an instance- तरुण्यालिंगितः कंठे नितंबस्थलमाश्रितः । गुरूणां संनिधानेऽपि कः कूजति मुहुर्मुहुः, the intended answer being ईषदूनजलपूर्णकुंभ.] Danḍin mentions sixteen kinds of Prahelikā. See K.D.iii.96-124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेलिका
प्रहेलि <i>f.</i> A poetic riddle, thus defined by Dharmadāsa- व्यक्तीकृत्य कमप्यर्थं स्वरूपार्थस्य गोपनात् । यत्र बाह्यांतरावर्थौ कथ्येते सा प्रहेलिका. [The following is an instance- तरुण्यालिंगितः कंठे नितंबस्थलमाश्रितः । गुरूणां संनिधानेऽपि कः कूजति मुहुर्मुहुः, the intended answer being ईषदूनजलपूर्णकुंभ.] Danḍin mentions sixteen kinds of Prahelikā. See K.D.iii.96-124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्राद|प्रह्रादः
प्रह्रा(ह्ला)द <i>m.</i> 1. Joy, pleasure, happiness; 2. noise, sound; 3. name of a son of Hiraṇyakaśipu. (See App. II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लाद|प्रह्लादः
प्रह्रा(ह्ला)द <i>m.</i> 1. Joy, pleasure, happiness; 2. noise, sound; 3. name of a son of Hiraṇyakaśipu. (See App. II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्रादन
प्रह्रा(ह्ला)दन <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Causing joy, gladdening, R.xiii.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लादन
प्रह्रा(ह्ला)दन <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Causing joy, gladdening, R.xiii.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्रादना
प्रह्रा(ह्ला)दन <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> Causing joy, gladdening, R.xiii.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्रादन
प्रह्रा(ह्ला)दन <i>(II) n.</i> The act of causing joy, gladdening, यथा प्रह्लादनाच्चंद्रः R.iv.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लादन
प्रह्रा(ह्ला)दन <i>(II) n.</i> The act of causing joy, gladdening, यथा प्रह्लादनाच्चंद्रः R.iv.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लन्न|प्रह्लन्नः
प्रह्लन्न <i>a. (f. न्ना)</i> Pleased, joyful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लन्ना
प्रह्लन्न <i>a. (f. न्ना)</i> Pleased, joyful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्व|प्रह्वः
प्रह्व <i>a. (f. ह्वा)</i> 1. Sloping, slanting, inclining; 2. bowing humbly, stooping, भक्तिप्रह्वविलोकनप्रणयिनी (नेत्रे तनुर्वा हरेः) K.Pr.ix.; 3. devoted to, engaged in; 4. submissive, humble, R.xvi.80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वा
प्रह्व <i>a. (f. ह्वा)</i> 1. Sloping, slanting, inclining; 2. bowing humbly, stooping, भक्तिप्रह्वविलोकनप्रणयिनी (नेत्रे तनुर्वा हरेः) K.Pr.ix.; 3. devoted to, engaged in; 4. submissive, humble, R.xvi.80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वांजलि|प्रह्वाञ्जलि
प्रह्व-अंजलि <i>a.</i> putting to the forehead the palms of the hands in token of respect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वलीका
प्रह्वलीका <i>f.</i> The same as प्रहेलिका q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वाय|प्रह्वायः
प्रह्वाय <i>m.</i> Summoning, invocation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रांशु|प्रांशुः
प्रांशु <i>(I) a.</i> High, tall, lofty, शालप्रांशुर्महाभुजः R.i.13, xv.19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रांशु|प्रांशुः
प्रांशु <i>(II) m.</i> A man of great stature, a tall man, प्रांशुलभ्ये फले लोभादुद्बाहुरिव वामनः R.i.3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राक्
प्राक् <i>ind. (generally with an abl.)</i> 1. Already, before, प्रमन्यवः प्रागपि कोसलेंद्रे R.vii.34, प्राक् सृष्टेः केवलात्मने K.S.ii.4, R.xiv.78; 2. in front; 3. as far as, up to, e.g. प्राक् कडारात् ‘up to the word kadāru’ Pan.; 4. in the east; 5. previously, in the previous portion (of a book), M.i.79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकट्य|प्राकट्यं
प्राकट्य <i>n.</i> Publicity, notoriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकरणिक
प्राकरणिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Belonging to the subject under discussion, relevant to the matter in hand; (the word is sometimes used in the sense of Upameya in rhetorical works).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकरणिकी
प्राकरणिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Belonging to the subject under discussion, relevant to the matter in hand; (the word is sometimes used in the sense of Upameya in rhetorical works).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकर्षिक
प्राकर्षिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Deserving preference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकर्षिकी
प्राकर्षिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Deserving preference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकषिक|प्राकषिकः
प्राकषिक <i>m.</i> 1. A man supported by another’s wife; 2. a catamite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकाम्य|प्राकाम्यं
प्राकाम्य <i>n.</i> 1. Irresistible will considered as one of the eight superhuman powers of Śiva or the supreme being; (See under शक्ति and ईशिता); 2. freedom of will, प्राकाम्यं ते विभूतिषु K.S.ii.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकार|प्राकारः
प्राकार <i>m.</i> A wall, a rampart, R.xii.71, M.vii.74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकारस्थ
प्राकार-स्थ <i>a.</i> stationed on a rampart, M.vii.74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकारीय
प्राकारीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Fit for a wall (as bricks); 2. surrounded by a wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकारीया
प्राकारीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Fit for a wall (as bricks); 2. surrounded by a wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकाश्य|प्राकाश्यं
प्राकाश्य <i>n.</i> 1. Publicity; 2. fame, renown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृत|प्राकृतः
प्राकृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता or ती)</i> 1. Original, natural, unmodified; (in this sense the word is applied to the sovereign of an adjacent country, who, in politics, is considered a natural enemy; See Sis.ii.36 (and Mall. on it); 2. common, ordinary, uncultivated, vulgar, Bg.xviii.24; 3. derived from प्रकृति (q.v.) (in Sāṅkhya phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृता
प्राकृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता or ती)</i> 1. Original, natural, unmodified; (in this sense the word is applied to the sovereign of an adjacent country, who, in politics, is considered a natural enemy; See Sis.ii.36 (and Mall. on it); 2. common, ordinary, uncultivated, vulgar, Bg.xviii.24; 3. derived from प्रकृति (q.v.) (in Sāṅkhya phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृत|प्राकृतः
प्राकृत <i>(II) m.</i> A low man, an ordinary man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृत|प्राकृतः
प्राकृत <i>(III) n.</i> A vernacular dialect, derived from Sanskrit; (many of these dialects are used in Sanskrit plays in speeches assigned to female characters and to low personages), भोः कार्यवशात्प्रयोगवशाच्चाहं प्राकृतभाषी संव्रुत्तः Mrich.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृतारि|प्राकृतारिः
प्राकृत-अरि <i>m.</i> a natural enemy, i.e. the sovereign of an adjacent country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृतोदासीन|प्राकृतोदासीनः
प्राकृत-उदासीन <i>m.</i> a natural neutral, i.e. a king whose dominions lie beyond those of the natural ally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृतज्वर|प्राकृतज्वरः
प्राकृत-ज्वर <i>m.</i> a common fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृतप्रलय|प्राकृतप्रलयः
प्राकृत-प्रलय <i>m.</i> total destruction of the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृतमित्र|प्राकृतमित्रं
प्राकृत-मित्र <i>n.</i> natural ally, e.g. a sovereign whose kingdom lies next to that of the natural enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=485-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृतिक|प्राकृतिकः
प्राकृतिक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Natural; 2. illusory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=486-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

