प्राच्यक
प्राच्यक <i>a. (f. का)</i> Eastern, easterly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=487-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राच्यका
प्राच्यक <i>a. (f. का)</i> Eastern, easterly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=487-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राछ्|प्राच्छ्
