प्राज्ञ|प्राज्ञः
प्राज्ञ <i>(I) a. (f. ज्ञा or ज्ञी)</i> 1. Intellectual; 2. wise, learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=487-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राज्ञा
प्राज्ञ <i>(I) a. (f. ज्ञा or ज्ञी)</i> 1. Intellectual; 2. wise, learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=487-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राज्ञ|प्राज्ञः
