प्राज्ञा
प्राज्ञा <i>f.</i> 1. Understanding, intelligence; 2. a clever woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=487-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

