प्रीणा
प्रीण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Pleased, satisfied; 2. old, ancient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=493-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीणन|प्रीणनं
