प्लुष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> Burnt, consumed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=496-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

