प्लो(प्रो)षण <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> Burning, reducing to ashes, पुरारेस्तद्वतु मदनप्लोषणं लोचनं वः M.M.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=496-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

