फक्किका
फक्किका <i>f.</i> 1. A position, an assertion or argument to be proved, a thesis to be maintained, फणिभाषितभाष्यफक्किका Na.ii.95; 2. a preconceived opinion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

