फटा
फटा <i>f.</i> The expanded hood of a serpent, निर्विषेणापि कर्तव्या सर्पेण महती फटा । विषं भवतु वा नास्तु फटाटोपो भयंकरः Panch.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

