फण्
फण् <i>vt. 1P (pp. फणित)</i> 1. To go, to go about, to move, रुरुजुर्भ्रेजिरे फेणुर्बहुधा हरिराक्षसाः Bt.xiv.78; 2. to produce easily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फण|फणः
फण <i>m.</i> The expanded hood of a cobra, विप्रकृतः पन्नगः फणं कुरुते Sak.vi., R.xiii.12, K.S.vi.68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणकर|फणकरः
फण-कर <i>m.</i> a snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणधर|फणधरः
फण-धर <i>m.</i> 1. a snake; 2. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणभृत्
