फणितल्पग|फणितल्पगः
फणिन्-तल्पग <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu whose bed is the serpent Śeṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिपति|फणिपतिः
