फणिप्रिय|फणिप्रियः
फणिन्-प्रिय <i>m.</i> wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिफेन|फणिफेनः
फणिन्-फेन <i>m.</i> opium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिभाष्य
