फत्कारिन्
फत्कारिन् <i>m.</i> A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

