फर <i>n.</i> A shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फरुबक|फरुबकं
फरुबक <i>n.</i> A betel-box.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=497-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

