बदरीतपोवन
बदरी-तपोवन <i>n.</i> the penance-grove at Badarī, बदरीतपोवनमिवास निरतम् Kir.xii.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=499-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बदरीफल
बदरी-फल <i>n.</i> the fruit of the jujube tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=499-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

