बंधनालय|बन्धनालय|बन्धनालयः
बंधन-आलय <i>n.</i> a gaol, a prison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=501-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

