बंधुजीवक|बन्धुजीवक|बन्धुजीवकः
बंधु-जीवक <i>(II) n.</i> the flower of this tree, बंधुजीवपृथुभिः प्रदूषिताम् R.xi.25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=501-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंधुता|बन्धुता
