बंधूरा
बंधूर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Undulating, uneven; 2. bent, inclined; 3. lovely, beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंधूर|बन्धूर|बन्धूरः
