बंध्य|बन्ध्य|बन्ध्यः
बंध्य <i>a. (f. ध्या)</i> 1. To be fettered, to be confined, Yaj.ii.243; 2. to be joined together, to be built, to be constructed; 4. barren, fruitless, unproductive (lit. and fig.), अबंध्यकोपस्य विहंतुरापदाम् Kir.i.33; 5. not having the menstmal courses; 6. destitute of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंध्या
बंध्य <i>a. (f. ध्या)</i> 1. To be fettered, to be confined, Yaj.ii.243; 2. to be joined together, to be built, to be constructed; 4. barren, fruitless, unproductive (lit. and fig.), अबंध्यकोपस्य विहंतुरापदाम् Kir.i.33; 5. not having the menstmal courses; 6. destitute of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंध्यफल|बन्ध्यफल
बंध्य-फल <i>a.</i> useless, idle, vain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंध्या
बंध्या <i>f.</i> 1. A barren woman, e.g. न हि बंध्या विजानाति गुर्वीं प्रसववेदनाम्; 2. a barren cow; 3. a kind of perfume, (बाला).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंध्यातनय
बंध्या-तनय, -पुत्र, -सुत <i>m.</i> the son of a barren woman, i.e. an impossibility, e.g. अयं बंध्यासुतो याति खपुष्पकृतशेखरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंध्यापुत्र
बंध्या-तनय, -पुत्र, -सुत <i>m.</i> the son of a barren woman, i.e. an impossibility, e.g. अयं बंध्यासुतो याति खपुष्पकृतशेखरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंध्यासुत
बंध्या-तनय, -पुत्र, -सुत <i>m.</i> the son of a barren woman, i.e. an impossibility, e.g. अयं बंध्यासुतो याति खपुष्पकृतशेखरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंध्यादुहितृ
बंध्या-दुहितृ <i>f.</i> the daughter of a barren woman, i.e. a thing that does not exist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बंध्र|बन्ध्र|बंध्रं
