बभ्रु|बभ्रुः
बभ्रु <i>(I) a. (f. भ्रु or भ्रू)</i> 1. Brown, tawny, बबंध बालारुणबभ्रु वल्कलम् K.S.v.8, R.xv.16, xix.25; 2. bald-headed through disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बभ्रू
बभ्रु <i>(I) a. (f. भ्रु or भ्रू)</i> 1. Brown, tawny, बबंध बालारुणबभ्रु वल्कलम् K.S.v.8, R.xv.16, xix.25; 2. bald-headed through disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बभ्रु|बभ्रुः
बभ्रु <i>(II) m.</i> 1. An ichneumon; 2. fire; 3. the tawny colour; 4. a man with brown hair; 5. an epithet of Śiva; 6. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बभ्रुधातु|बभ्रुधातुः
