बर्ह्
बर्ह् <i>vt. 1Ā (pres. बर्हते)</i> 1. To hurt, to kill; 2. to give; 3. to spread; 4. to speak.With नि-, to destroy, to kill, Sis.i.29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बर्ह|बर्हं|बर्हः
बर्ह <i>m.n.</i> 1. The tail of a bird, especially that of a peacock, कं हरेदेष बर्हः Vikr.iv., Megh.i.15, R.xvi.14; 2. a feather, especially a peacock’s feather, Megh.i.44; 3. a leaf, आपांडुरं केतकबर्हमन्यः R.vi.17; 4. train, retinue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बर्हभार|बर्हभारः
