बर्हिध्वजा
बर्हिन्-ध्वजा <i>f.</i> an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=502-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

