बहु <i>(II) ind.</i> 1. Much, exceedingly, greatly, in a high degree; 2. very nearly, almost, e.g. बहुतृणम्.(बहु मन् ‘to value, to prize, to esteem highly,’ अस्माकमुक्तं बहु मन्यसे चेत् Bt.iii.53, बहु मन्येत राघवम् Bt.v.84, R.xii.89, Bg.ii.35.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=504-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

