बहुव्रीहि|बहुव्रीहिः
बहु-व्रीहि <i>(II) m.</i> one of the four classes of compounds; in it, the last member loses independence and together with the other members serves to qualify an altogether different word; it is either a noun or an adjecctive, but in its original, character of qualifying another word, it is always an adjective; the word बहुव्रीहि itself is an example, तत्पुरुष कर्मधारय येणाहं स्यां बहुव्रीहिः Ud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=504-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

