बहुल <i>(I) a. (f. ला; compar. बंहीयस्; super. बंहिष्ठ)</i> 1. Thick, dense, compact; 2. ample, large, capacious; 3. abundant, much, many, numerous; 4. born under the Pleiades; 5. black; 6. full of, क्रियाविशेषबहुलां भोगैश्वर्यगतिं प्रति Bg.ii.43; 7. accompanied by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=505-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुला
बहुल <i>(I) a. (f. ला; compar. बंहीयस्; super. बंहिष्ठ)</i> 1. Thick, dense, compact; 2. ample, large, capacious; 3. abundant, much, many, numerous; 4. born under the Pleiades; 5. black; 6. full of, क्रियाविशेषबहुलां भोगैश्वर्यगतिं प्रति Bg.ii.43; 7. accompanied by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=505-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुल|बहुलं|बहुलः
