बहुल|बहुलं|बहुलः
बहुल <i>(III) n.</i> 1. The sky; 2. white pepper.(बहुलीभू ‘to get abroad, to be published, to become public,’ बहुलीभूतोऽयमर्थः Sak.vi., पौरेषु सोऽहं बहुलीभवंतम (अवर्णम्) R.xiv.38; बहुलीकृ 1. to make public, to divulge; 2. to increase, to aggrandize; 3. to thresh, to winnow.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=505-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

