ब्रह्मन्-चर्य <i>(II) m.</i> a religious student.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=512-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

