ब्रह्मसृज्
ब्रह्मन्-सृज् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=512-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मस्तेय
ब्रह्मन्-स्तेय <i>n.</i> obtaining a knowledge of the Vedas by illicit means.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=512-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मस्व|ब्रह्मस्वं
