ब्रह्मिन् <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> Relating to Brahman (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मिन्
ब्रह्मिन् <i>(II) m.</i> An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मिष्ठ
ब्रह्मिष्ठ <i>a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> Thoroughly conversant with the Vedas, ब्रह्मिष्ठमाधाय निजेऽधिकारे ब्रह्मिष्ठमेव स्वतनुप्रसूतम् R.xviii.28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मिष्ठा
ब्रह्मिष्ठ <i>a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> Thoroughly conversant with the Vedas, ब्रह्मिष्ठमाधाय निजेऽधिकारे ब्रह्मिष्ठमेव स्वतनुप्रसूतम् R.xviii.28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मिष्ठा
