ब्राह्मणघ्न|ब्राह्मणघ्नः
ब्राह्मण-घ्न <i>m.</i> the killer of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणचांडाल|ब्राह्मणचाण्डाल|ब्राह्मणचाण्डालः
ब्राह्मण-चांडाल <i>m.</i> 1. the son of a Śūdra father by a Brāhmaṇa mother; 2. a degraded Brāhmaṇa, M.ix.87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

