ब्राह्मण-जात <i>n.</i> the Brāhmaṇa caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणजाति|ब्राह्मणजातिः
ब्राह्मण-जाति <i>f.</i> the Brāhmaṇa caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणजीविका
ब्राह्मण-जीविका, -वृत्ति <i>f.</i> the means of subsistence allowed to a man of the Brāhmaṇa caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणवृत्ति
ब्राह्मण-जीविका, -वृत्ति <i>f.</i> the means of subsistence allowed to a man of the Brāhmaṇa caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणत्रा
ब्राह्मण-त्रा <i>ind.</i> to or to the disposition of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणद्रव्य
ब्राह्मण-द्रव्य, -स्व <i>n.</i> the property of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणस्व
ब्राह्मण-द्रव्य, -स्व <i>n.</i> the property of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

