ब्राह्मण-निंदक <i>m.</i> a reviler of Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणबध
ब्राह्मण-बध, -वध <i>m.</i> the murder of a Brāhmaṇa, Brāhmaṇīcide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणवध|ब्राह्मणवधः
ब्राह्मण-बध, -वध <i>m.</i> the murder of a Brāhmaṇa, Brāhmaṇīcide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणब्रुव|ब्राह्मणब्रुवः
ब्राह्मण-ब्रुव <i>m.</i> one who is a Brāhmaṇa only in name and does not attend to the duties of his caste, सममब्राह्मणे दानं द्विगुणं ब्राह्मणब्रुवे M.vii.85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणभूयिष्ठ
ब्राह्मण-भूयिष्ठ <i>a.</i> chiefly consisting of Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणाच्छंसिन्
ब्राह्मणाच्छंसिन् <i>m.</i> a particular priest at a Soma sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणसंतर्पण
ब्राह्मण-संतर्पण <i>n.</i> feeding Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणसात्
ब्राह्मण-सात् <i>ind.</i> to the disposition of the Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=515-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणक|ब्राह्मणकः
ब्राह्मणक <i>m.</i> 1. A vile Brāhmaṇa; 2. name of a country inhabited by warlike Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=516-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणी
ब्राह्मणी <i>f.</i> 1. A woman of the Brāhmaṇa caste; 2. the wife of a Brāhmaṇa; 3. intellect; 4. a kind of wasp; 5. a kind of lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=516-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मणीगामिन्
