ब्राह्मण्य|ब्राह्मण्यः
ब्राह्मण्य <i>(I) a. (f. ण्या)</i> Suitable for a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=516-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मण्या
ब्राह्मण्य <i>(I) a. (f. ण्या)</i> Suitable for a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=516-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मण्य|ब्राह्मण्यः
ब्राह्मण्य <i>(II) m.</i> An epithet of the planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=516-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्राह्मण्य|ब्राह्मण्यः
ब्राह्मण्य <i>(III) n.</i> 1. A multitude of Brāhmaṇas; 2. the rank of a Brāhmaṇa, M.iii.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=516-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

