भज्
भज् <i>(I) vt. 1U (pp. भक्त; pres. भजति-ते)</i> 1. To share, to divide, to allot, to distribute, M.ix.119, 209; 2. (Atm.) to obtain as one’s share; 3. to take possession of; 4. to betake oneself to, to resort to, to practise, to have recourse to, भेजे धर्ममनातुरः R.i.21, अपथमपकृष्टोऽपि भजते Sak.v.; 5. to enjoy, to possess, to entertain, to have, to suffer, न भेजिरे भीमविषेण भीतिम् Bhartr.ii.80, अभितप्तमयोऽपि मार्दवं भजते R.viii.43; 6. to enjoy carnally; 7. to choose, to select; 8. to honour, to worship, to adore; 9. to fall to the lot of anyone; 10. to be attached to.(The meanings of this root are variously modified according to the noun it is joined with.)With वि-, 1. to divide, to distribute, पत्रिणां व्यभजदाश्रमाद्बहिः R.xi.29, x.54; 2. to effect a partition, to separate in interest; 3. to distinguish.With संवि-, to admit to a share, e.g. धर्मषष्ठांशभागेन तेपि संविभजंति तम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=518-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भज्
भज् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pres. भाजयति-ते)</i> 1. To cook; 2. to give, to bestow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=518-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भज्
भज् <i>(III) vt. 10U (pres. भंजयति-ते)</i> To illumine, to brighten, to make resplendent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=518-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

