भजन|भजनं
भजन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of sharing; 2. possession; 3. adoration, worship, reverence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=518-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

