भल्
भल् <i>vt. 10Ā (pres. भालयते)</i> To see, to behold.With नि-, (Atm. and Par.) to see, to behold, to look at, यन्मां न भामिनि निभालयसि प्रभातनीलारविंदमदभंगिपदैः कटाक्षैः Bh.V.iii.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=521-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भल्ल्
भल्ल् <i>vt. 1Ā (pp. भल्लित; pres. भल्लते)</i> 1. To describe, to tell; 2. to wound, to kill; 3. to give.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=521-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भल्ल|भल्लं|भल्लः
