भवाब्धि|भवाब्धिः
भव-अब्धि, -अर्णव, -समुद्र, -सिंधु <i>m.</i> the ocean of worldly existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=521-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भवार्णव|भवार्णवः
भव-अब्धि, -अर्णव, -समुद्र, -सिंधु <i>m.</i> the ocean of worldly existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=521-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भवसमुद्र|भवसमुद्रः
