भवायनी
भव-अयनी <i>f.</i> the Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=521-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

