भवात्मज|भवात्मजः
भव-आत्मज <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Kārtikeya; 2. of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=521-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भवोच्छेद|भवोच्छेदः
भव-उच्छेद <i>m.</i> destruction of all existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=521-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भवक्षिति|भवक्षितिः
भव-क्षिति <i>f.</i> the place of birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=521-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भवघस्मर|भवघस्मरः
