भाण|भाणः
भाण <i>m.</i> A sort of dramatic composition in which only one actor appears on the scenes (the D.R. explains it thus- भाणस्तु धूर्तचरितं स्वानुभूतं परेन वा । यत्रोपवर्णयेदेको निपुणः पंडितो विटः iii.44; See also the two following stanzas), e.g. वसंततिलक, मुकुंदानंद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=523-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

