भाल|भालं
भाल <i>n.</i> 1. The forehead, the brow, यद्धात्रा निजभालपट्टलिखितं स्तोकं महद्वा धनम् Bhartr.ii.49; 2. darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=524-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भालांक|भालाङ्क|भालाङ्कः
भाल-अंक <i>m.</i> 1. a man born with lucky signs on his forehead; 2. an epithet of Śiva; 3. a saw; 4. a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=524-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भालचंद्र|भालचन्द्र|भालचन्द्रः
