भावशबलत्व
भाव-शबलत्व <i>n.</i> a mixture of various emotions; for an illustration, See Bh.V.ii.63, and our note thereon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=524-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भावशून्य
भाव-शून्य <i>a.</i> void of affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=524-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भावशुद्धि|भावशुद्धिः
