भावका
भावक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. Effecting; 2. promoting anyone’s welfare; 3. imagining, fancying; 4. having a poetical taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=525-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भावक|भावकः
