भास <i>m.</i> 1. Brightness, lustre, sheen; 2. fancy; 3. a cock; 4. a vulture; 5. a cow-shed; 6. name of a poet, भासो हासः कविकुलगुरुः कालिदासो विलासः Pr.R.i., Mal.i., Har.Ch.Intr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=527-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भासक|भासकः
