भासुर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Shining, splendid, Kir.v.5, R.v.30; 2. terrible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=527-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

