भिक्षणा
भिक्षणा <i>f.</i> Asking alms, begging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=527-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिक्षा
भिक्षा <i>f.</i> 1. Asking, begging, M.vi.56; 2. anything given as alms; 3. wages, hire; 4. service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=527-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

