भूतिकाल|भूतिकालः
भूति-काल <i>m.</i> a happy hour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=533-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

