भूमन्
भूमन् <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Abundance, plenty, भूमानमातन्वते M.M.v.; 2. wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=533-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूमन्
भूमन् <i>(II) n.</i> 1. The earth; 2. a piece of ground; 3. a being.(भूम्ना is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘abundantly, for the most part,’ भूम्ना रसानां गहनाः प्रयोगाः M.M.i.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=533-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

