भूयस्
भूयस् <i>(I) a. (f. सी)</i> 1. More numerous, more abundnt; 2. greater, larger; 3. very great, तस्मिंस्तु भूयसीं वृद्धिं नभस्ये ता इवाययुः R.xvii.41; 4. abounding in, स्वकृतिमेवंप्रायगुणभूयसीमस्माकमर्पितवान् M.M.i., (compar. of बहु q.v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूयसी
भूयस् <i>(I) a. (f. सी)</i> 1. More numerous, more abundnt; 2. greater, larger; 3. very great, तस्मिंस्तु भूयसीं वृद्धिं नभस्ये ता इवाययुः R.xvii.41; 4. abounding in, स्वकृतिमेवंप्रायगुणभूयसीमस्माकमर्पितवान् M.M.i., (compar. of बहु q.v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूयस्
भूयस् <i>(II) ind.</i> 1. Very much, exceedingly, largely; 2. further moreover, again, भूयः स भूतेश्वरपार्श्ववर्ती (बभाषे) R.ii.46, Megh.ii.48, Bg.xiv.1; 3. frequently, repeatedly.(भूयसा is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) very much, in a high degree, for the most part, पश्चार्धेन प्रविष्टः शरपतनभयाद्भूयसा पूर्वकायम् Sak.i.; (2) generally, as a rule. भूयोभूयस् ‘again and again,’ भूयोभूयः सविधनगरीरथ्यया पर्यटंतम् M.M.i.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूयोदर्शन
