भूयोविद्य
भूयोविद्य <i>a.</i> very learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूयशस्
भूयशस् <i>ind.</i> 1. Generally, as a rule; 2. very much, in a high degree; 3. again, further.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूयिष्ठ|भूयिष्ठं
भूयिष्ठ <i>a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> 1. Most abundant, most numerous; 2. most important; 3. very great, very much; 4. chiefly consisting of, mostly characterized by (generally at the end of a compound), e.g. अभिरूपभूयिष्ठा परिषद् Sak.i., R.iv.70; 5. nearly, almost (particularly after a past passive participle), निर्वाणभूयिष्ठमथास्य वीर्यं संधुक्षयंतीव वपुर्गुणेन K.S.iii.56, (super. of बहु q.v.).(भूयिष्ठम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) in the highest degree, very much, भूयिष्ठमासीदुपमेयकांतिर्मयूरपृष्ठाश्रयिणा गृहेन R.vi.4, xiii.14; (2) mostly, for the most part.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूयिष्ठा
भूयिष्ठ <i>a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> 1. Most abundant, most numerous; 2. most important; 3. very great, very much; 4. chiefly consisting of, mostly characterized by (generally at the end of a compound), e.g. अभिरूपभूयिष्ठा परिषद् Sak.i., R.iv.70; 5. nearly, almost (particularly after a past passive participle), निर्वाणभूयिष्ठमथास्य वीर्यं संधुक्षयंतीव वपुर्गुणेन K.S.iii.56, (super. of बहु q.v.).(भूयिष्ठम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) in the highest degree, very much, भूयिष्ठमासीदुपमेयकांतिर्मयूरपृष्ठाश्रयिणा गृहेन R.vi.4, xiii.14; (2) mostly, for the most part.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूर्
भूर् <i>ind.</i> The first of the three mystical syllables uttered by a Brāhmaṇa at the commencement of his daily prayers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

