भूष्
भूष् <i>vt. 1P, 10U (pp. भूषित; pres. भूषति, भूषयति-ते)</i> 1. To adorn, to decorate, भूषयांगं प्रमाणं चेद्रामो गंतुं यत स्व च Bt.xx.15; 2. (Atm.) to adorn oneself, e.g. भूषयते कन्या स्वयमेव; 3. to spread with.With वि-, to adorn, to decorate, केयूरा न विभूषयंति पुरुषम् Bhartr.ii.19, Rt.iii.20, Sis.ix.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूषण|भूषणं|भूषणः
भूषण <i>(I) m.</i> An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूषण|भूषणं|भूषणः
भूषण <i>(II) n.</i> 1. the act of decorating; 2. an ornament, an article of embellishment, शररिसादादसमग्रभूषणा R.iii.2, xiii.57, Vikr.Ch.i.25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूषा
भूषा <i>f.</i> 1. Adorning, decorating; 2. an ornament, जगति विदुषां कंठभूषात्वमेतु Vikr.Ch.xviii.102; 3. a jewel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=534-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूषित|भूषितः
भूषित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Adorned, emblished, ornamented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=535-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूषिता
भूषित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Adorned, emblished, ornamented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=535-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूष्णु|भूष्णुः
भूष्णु <i>a.</i> 1. Being, becoming, विनाप्यस्मदलंभूष्णुरिज्यायै तपसः सुतः Sis.ii.9; 2. wising for happiness or prosperity, M.iv.135.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=535-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृ
भृ <i>vt. 1U, 3U (pres. भरति-ते, बिभर्ति, बिभृते; pass. भ्रियते; desid. बिभरिषति or बुभूर्षति)</i> 1. To support, to bear, to bear up, खिन्नोसि मुंच शैलं बिभृमो वयम् Vas.D., or कूर्मो बिभर्ति धरणीं खलु पृष्ठकेन Ch.P.50; 2. to nourish, to keep, to foster, to protect, to take care of; 3. to hold, to have, to possess, बलित्रयं चारु बभार बाला K.S.i.39, कौस्तुभाख्यमपां सारं बिभ्राणां बृहतोरसा R.x.10, शाकुंतनीडनिचितं बिभ्रज्जटामंडलम् Sak.vii., इंदोर्दैन्यं त्वदनुसरणक्लिष्टकांतेर्बिभर्ति Megh.ii.21, बिभ्रत्यनन्यविषयां लोकपाल इति श्रुतिम् K.D.ii.331; 4. to endure, to suffer, संत्रासमबिभः शक्रः Bt.xvii.108; 5. to bestow, to confer, to produce, e.g. यौवने सदलंकाराः शोभां बिभ्रति सुध्रुवः; 6. to hire, M.xi.62; 7. to fill, to fill with, अभार्षीद्‌ध्वनिना लोकान् Bt.xv.24.With उद्-, to support, to bear, भूगोलमुद्बिभ्रते Git.G.i.With सम्-, 1. to collect, to hoard, to place together, to bring together, त्यागाय संभृतार्थानाम् R.i.7, v.5; 2. to make ready, to prepare; 3. to offer, to present; 4. to maintain, to nourish; 5. to effect, to accomplish, to produce, to bring on, Kir.ix.49, R.viii.51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=535-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृकुंश|भृकुंशः
भृकुंश(स) <i>m.</i> A male actor in female attire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=535-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृकुंस|भृकुंसः
