भ्रंश्
भ्रंश् <i>vi. 1Ā, 4P (pp. भ्रष्ट; pres. भ्रंशते, भ्रश्यति; caus. भ्रंशयति-ते)</i> 1. To fall, to drop down, नीवाराः शुकगर्भकोटरमुखभ्रष्टास्तरूणामधः Sak.i.; 2. to decline, to decrease; 3. to fall from, to be separated from, to be deprived of, (with an abl.), बंभ्रंशेऽसौ धृतेस्ततः Bt.xiv.71; 4. to escape, to flee from, (with an abl.), संग्रामाद्बभ्रशुः केचिद्ययाचुश्चापरेऽभयम् Bt.xiv.105, xv.59.With परि-, 1. to drop down, to tumble; 2. to go astray; 3. to fall away from; 4. to be deprived of.With प्र-, to drop down, प्रभ्रश्यमानाभरणप्रसूना R.xiv.54.With वि-, 1. to drop down; 2. to be free from; 3. to stray, to go astray.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=538-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रंश|भ्रंशः
भ्रंश(स) <i>m.</i> 1. Falling off, dropping down, कनकवलयभ्रंशरिक्तप्रकोष्ठः Megh.i.2; 2. decay, overthrow, ruin; 3. decline, decrease; 4. disappearance; 5. loss, deprivation (as in जातिभ्रंश), स्मृतिभ्रंशाद्बुद्धिनाशः Bg.ii.63, सेहेऽस्य न भ्रंशमतो न लोभात् R.xvi.74; 6. Straying, deviation (as in शीलभ्रंश); 7. running away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=538-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रंस|भ्रंसः
भ्रंश(स) <i>m.</i> 1. Falling off, dropping down, कनकवलयभ्रंशरिक्तप्रकोष्ठः Megh.i.2; 2. decay, overthrow, ruin; 3. decline, decrease; 4. disappearance; 5. loss, deprivation (as in जातिभ्रंश), स्मृतिभ्रंशाद्बुद्धिनाशः Bg.ii.63, सेहेऽस्य न भ्रंशमतो न लोभात् R.xvi.74; 6. Straying, deviation (as in शीलभ्रंश); 7. running away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=538-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रंशथु|भ्रंशथुः
भ्रंशथु <i>m.</i> The same as प्रभ्रंशथु q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=538-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रंशन
भ्रंश(स)न <i>n.</i> 1. The act of dropping down; 2. of being deprived of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=538-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रंसन
भ्रंश(स)न <i>n.</i> 1. The act of dropping down; 2. of being deprived of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=538-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रंशिन्
