भ्रंशिनी
भ्रंशिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Falling down, falling from; 2. decaying; 3. ruining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=538-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

