मतल्लिका
मतल्लिका <i>f. (at the end of a compound only)</i> Anything excellent of its kind, e.g. गोमतल्लिका ‘an excellent cow.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=545-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतल्ली
