मथुरा
मथु(थू)रा <i>f.</i> Name of an ancient city situated on the right bank of the Yamunā; it is one of the seven sacred cities and is celebrated as being the birth-place of Kṛṣṇa; it is said to have been founded by Śatrughna, निर्ममे निर्ममोऽर्थेषु मथुरां मधुराकृतिः R.xv.28, कलिंदकन्या मथुरां गतापि गंगोर्मिसंसक्तजलेव भाति R.vi.48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=546-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मथूरा
