मदापनयन
मद-अपनयन <i>n.</i> removal of intoxication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=547-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदांबर|मदाम्बर|मदाम्बरः
