मदोदग्र
मद-उदग्र <i>a.</i> 1. intoxicated; 2. furious, excited with passion, मदोदग्राः ककुद्मंतः सरितां कूलमुद्रुजाः R.iv.22; 3. haughty, arrogant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=547-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

