मध्यवयस्
मध्य-वयस् <i>a.</i> middle-aged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=549-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

