मध्यमपद
मध्यम-पद <i>n.</i> the middle member (of a compound word).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=550-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

