मध्ये-नगरम् <i>ind.</i> inside the city.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=550-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मध्येनदि
