मध्येसभम्
मध्ये-सभम् <i>ind.</i> at an assembly, before an assembly, Na.vi.76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=550-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मध्व|मध्वः
मध्व <i>m.</i> Name of the founder of a sect of Vaishṇavas. He has written a Bhāshya on the Vedāntasūtra, like Śankara and Rāmānuja.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=550-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मध्वक|मध्वकः
