मंत्रदृश्|मन्त्रदृश्
मंत्र-दृश् <i>m.</i> 1. a counsellor, an adviser; 2. a seer of Vedic hymns.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रदेवता|मन्त्रदेवता
मंत्र-देवता <i>f.</i> the deity invoked in a Mantra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रनिर्णय|मन्त्रनिर्णय|मन्त्रनिर्णयः
मंत्र-निर्णय <i>m.</i> final determination after deliberation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

