मंत्र-पद <i>n.</i> the words of a hymn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रपूत|मन्त्रपूत|मन्त्रपूतः
मंत्र-पूत <i>a.</i> purified by Mantras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रप्रयोग|मन्त्रप्रयोग|मन्त्रप्रयोगः
मंत्र-प्रयोग <i>m.</i> application of charms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रबीज|मन्त्रबीज
मंत्र-बीज, -वीज <i>n.</i> the essence of a charm; (generally the first syllable of a spell is considered to be its essence).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रवीज|मन्त्रवीज
मंत्र-बीज, -वीज <i>n.</i> the essence of a charm; (generally the first syllable of a spell is considered to be its essence).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रभेद|मन्त्रभेद|मन्त्रभेदः
मंत्र-भेद <i>m.</i> breach of counsel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रमूर्ति|मन्त्रमूर्ति|मन्त्रमूर्तिः|मन्त्रमूर्त्ति
मंत्र-मूर्ति <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रमूल|मन्त्रमूल
मंत्र-मूल <i>n.</i> magic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रयंत्र|मन्त्रयन्त्र
मंत्र-यंत्र <i>n.</i> a mystical diagram with a Mantra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रयोग|मन्त्रयोग|मन्त्रयोगः
मंत्र-योग <i>m.</i> 1. the employment of Mantras; 2. magic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रवत्|मन्त्रवत्|मन्त्रवन्त्
मंत्र-वत् <i>a.</i> attended with incantations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंत्रवर्जम्|मन्त्रवर्जम्
