मंत्रविद्|मन्त्रविद्
मंत्र-विद् <i>m.</i> 1. a Brāhmaṇa learned in the Vedas; 2. a counsellor; 3. a spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=553-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

