महा-नाद <i>(I) m.</i> 1. a great drum; 2. a thunder-cloud; 3. a lion; 4. the ear; 5. an elephant; 6. a camel; 7. a shell; 8. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानाद|महानादः
महा-नाद <i>(II) n.</i> a musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानिद्रा
