महानियम|महानियमः
महा-नियम <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानिर्वाण
