महापथ|महापथः
महा-पथ <i>m.</i> 1. a high road, a principal road, K.S.vii.3; 2. name of certain precipices from which people used to throw themselves to obtain entrance into heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापद्म|महापद्मः
महा-पद्म <i>(I) m.</i> 1. a particular high number; 2. name of one of the nine treasures of Kubera; 3. an epithet of Nanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापद्म|महापद्मः
महा-पद्म <i>(II) n.</i> 1. a white lotus; 2. name of a city.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

