महा-प्रभु <i>m.</i> 1. a great lord; 2. a king, a sovereign; 3. an epithet of Śiva; 4. of Viṣṇu; 5. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

