महा-ब्रह्म, -ब्रह्मन् <i>n.</i> the supreme spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

