महाभाग
महा-भाग <i>a.</i> 1. illustrious, highly distinguished, महाभाग सुश्लिष्टगुणतया रमणीय एष वः सुमनसां सन्निवेशः M.M.i., M.iii.192; 2. very fortunate; 3. highly virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

