महाभाष्य
महा-भाष्य <i>n.</i> a great commentary; (the word is especially applied to the great commentary of Patanjali on the sūtras of Pāṇini).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभीम|महाभीमः
