महाभीरु|महाभीरुः
महा-भीरु <i>m.</i> a sort of beetle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभूत|महाभूतं|महाभूतः
