महामनस्
महा-मनस्, मनस्क <i>(I) a.</i> 1. high-minded, magnanimous; 2. proud, haughty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

