महाराष्ट्रक
महा-राष्ट्रक <i>m. pl.</i> the Marāṭhās.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

