महावाक्य|महावाक्यं
महा-वाक्य <i>n.</i> 1. any continuous composition, any literary work; 2. a long sentence; 3. a principal sentence, e.g. तत्त्वमसि, अहं ब्रह्मास्मि (in Vedānta phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=560-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

