मात्सर
मात्सर <i>a. (f. री)</i> Jealous, envious, malicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=567-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्सरी
