मानिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Considering, regarding, being of opinion (at the end of compounds); 2. honouring, esteeming; 3. proud, haughty, परवृद्धिमत्सरि मनो हि मानिनाम् Sis.xv.1; 4. highly esteemed or honoured, Bt.xix.24; 5. resentful, angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=569-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मानिनी
मानिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Considering, regarding, being of opinion (at the end of compounds); 2. honouring, esteeming; 3. proud, haughty, परवृद्धिमत्सरि मनो हि मानिनाम् Sis.xv.1; 4. highly esteemed or honoured, Bt.xix.24; 5. resentful, angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=569-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

