मानिनी
मानिनी <i>f.</i> 1. A woman offended with her lover, माधवे मा कुरु मानिनि मानमये Git.G.ix.; 2. a resolute woman, a woman having self-respect, इयं महेंद्रप्रभृतीनधिश्रियश्चतुर्दिगीशानवमत्य मानिनी K.S.v.53, R.xiii.38; 3. a kind of odoriferous plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=569-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

