माया
माया <i>f.</i> 1. Trick, illusion, artifice, deceit; 2. an illusory image, a phantasm, a phantom, मायां मयोद्भाव्य परीक्षितोऽसि R.ii.62, Bt.xvii.107; 3. political artifice, diplomacy; 4. wickedness; 5. the Pradhāna of the Sāṅkhyas (q.v.); 6. illusion which makes one see the supreme spirit and the universe to be two distinct realities (in Vedānta phil.); 7. pity, compassion.; 8. name of the mother of Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=569-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

