मार्ग्
मार्ग् <i>(I) vt. 1P, 10U (pres. मार्गति, मार्गयति-ते)</i> 1. To seek, to seek for; 2. to strive to obtain; 3. to strive after, e.g. आत्मोत्कर्षं न मार्गेत परेषां परिनिंदया; 4. to solicit, to beg, वरं वरेण्यो नृपतेरमार्गीत् Bt.i.12; 5. to ask in marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=570-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्ग्
