मार्ग|मार्गः
मार्ग <i>m.</i> 1. Way, road, path, track, मार्गं तावच्छृणु कथयतस्तत्प्रयाणानुरूपम् Megh.i.13, R.ii.72; 2. passage, passing over, सारंगास्ते जललवमुचः सूचयिष्यंति मार्गम् Megh.i.21; 3. search, inquiry, inrestigation; 4. the path of a planet; 5. the anus; 6. a means; 7. the right way, the proper course to follow, Cf. अमार्ग; 8. mode, method, course, manner, usage, R.vii.71; 9. style, diction, वाचां विचित्रमार्गाणां निबबंधुः क्रियाविधिम् K.D.i.9; 10. musk; 11. the constellation मृगशिरस्; 12. the month Mārgaśīrṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=570-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

