मालिनी <i>f.</i> 1. A female florist; 2. name of the city of Champā; 3. a girl seven years old personating Durgā at the festival of that goddess; 4. the celestial Ganges; 5. name of a metre. (See App. I.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मालिन्य|मालिन्यं
मालिन्य <i>n.</i> 1. Foulness, dirtiness, impurity; 2. blackness; 3. sinfulness; 4. trouble, affliction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मालु|मालुः
मालु <i>f.</i> 1. A woman; 2. a kind of plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मालुधान|मालुधानः
मालु-धान <i>m.</i> a kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मालूर|मालूरः
मालूर <i>m.</i> 1. The Bilva tree; 2. the Kapittha tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मालेया
मालेया <i>f.</i> Great cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माल्य|माल्यं
माल्य <i>n.</i> 1. A flower, दिव्यमाल्यांबरधरम् Bg.xi.11; 2. a wreath, a garland, माल्येन तां निर्वचनं जघान K.S.vii.19; 3. a wreath worn on the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माल्यापण|माल्यापणः
