माल्यवृत्ति|माल्यवृत्तिः
माल्य-वृत्ति <i>m.</i> a garland-maker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माल्ल|माल्लः
