माल्लवी
माल्लवी <i>f.</i> A wrestling match.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माष|माषः
माष <i>m.</i> 1. A kind of bean; (the sing. is used for the plant, the pl. for the seed); 2. a fool, a blockhead; 3. a particular weight, (माषो विंशति मो भागः पणस्य परिकीर्तितः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माषाद|माषादः
माष-अद, -आद <i>m.</i> a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माषाद|माषादः
