माषीण|माषीणं
माषीण <i>n.</i> A field of kidney-beans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माष्य|माष्यं
