मास्
मास् <i>m.</i> The same as मास q.v.(This word has no forms for the first five cases; according to some, it is not a separate word but an optional substitute for मास.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मास|मासं|मासः
मास <i>m.n.</i> 1. A month (either चांद्र, सौर, सावन, नाक्षत्र or बार्हस्पत्य), मासान् गमय चतुरो लोचने मालयित्वा Megh.ii.47; 2. the number ‘twelve.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

