मासोपवासिनी
मास-उपवासिनी <i>f.</i> 1. a woman who fasts for a whole month (lit.), 2. a procuress, a bawd (fig.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासजात
मास-जात <i>a.</i> born a month ago.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासज्ञ|मासज्ञः
