मासदेय
मास-देय <i>a.</i> to be paid in a month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासप्रमित|मासप्रमितः
