मासमान|मासमानः
मास-मान <i>m.</i> a year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासक|मासकः
मासक <i>m.</i> A month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासर|मासरः
मासर <i>m.</i> The scum of boiled rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासल|मासलः
मासल <i>m.</i> A year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासिक|मासिकं|मासिकः
मासिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Relating to a month; 2. happening every month; 3. lasting for a month; 4. payable in a month; 5. engaged for a month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासिकी
मासिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Relating to a month; 2. happening every month; 3. lasting for a month; 4. payable in a month; 5. engaged for a month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासिक|मासिकं|मासिकः
