मासीना
मासीन <i>a. (f. ना)</i> 1. One month old; 2. monthly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मासुरी
मासुरी <i>f.</i> A beard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माह्
