माहात्मिक
माहात्मिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> High-minded, magnanimous, noble, glorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माहात्मिकी
माहात्मिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> High-minded, magnanimous, noble, glorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माहात्म्य|माहात्म्यं
माहात्म्य <i>n.</i> 1. Greatness, magnanimity, dignity; 2. a hymn extolling the merits of any holy object, e.g. देवामाहात्म्य, मणिकर्णिकामाहात्म्य; 3. the peculiar virtue of any divinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माहाराजिक
माहाराजिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Imperial, royal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माहाराजिकी
माहाराजिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Imperial, royal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

