माहेयी
माहेयी <i>f.</i> A cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

