मि
मि <i>vt. 5U (pres. मिनोति, मिनुते)</i> 1. To cast, to throw, to scatter; 2. to measure; 3. to observe, to perceive. (This root is rarely used in classics.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=572-39" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिच्छ्|मिछ्
