मितवाच्
मित-भाषिन्, -वाच् <i>a.</i> speaking little, महीयांसः प्रकृत्या मितभाषिणः Sis.ii.13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=573-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

