मिथस्
मिथस् <i>ind.</i> 1. Secretly, privately, in secret, अथ विश्वात्मने गौरी संदिदेश मिथः सखीम् K.S.vi.1, R.xiii.1, M.viii.195; 2. mutually, reciprocally, M.ii.147.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=573-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिथिल|मिथिलः
