मिद्
मिद् <i>(II) vt. or vi. 1U, 4U, 10U (pres. मेदते, मिंदति, मेद्यति-ते, मिंदयति-ते, मेदयति-ते)</i> 1. To be greasy or unctuous; 2. to be fat; 3. to melt; 4. to love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=573-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

