मिन्व्
मिन्व् <i>vt. 1P (pres. मिन्वति)</i> 1. To moisten; 2. to honour, to worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=573-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिल्
मिल् <i>vt. or vi. 6U (pp. मिलित; pres. मिलति-ते)</i> 1. To meet, to associate, to meet tegether, to come together, याताः किं न मिलंति सुंदरि पुनश्चिंता त्वया मत्कृते नो कार्या Am.S.10, मिलितशिलीमुखपाटलिपटलकृतस्मरतूणाविलासे Git.G.i.; 2. to join, to accompany; 3. to clash; 4. to happen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=573-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिलन|मिलनं
मिलन <i>n.</i> 1. Being mixed with, coming in contact with, व्यालनिलयमिलनेन गरलमिव कलयति मलयसमीरम् Git.G.iv.; 2. meeting, encountering; 3. contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=573-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

