मिलित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. United, combined; 2. met, encountered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=573-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिलिता
मिलित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. United, combined; 2. met, encountered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=573-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिलिंदक|मिलिन्दक|मिलिंदकः|मिलिन्दकः
