मिश्र <i>(I) a. (f. श्रा)</i> 1. Mixed, mingled, combined, R.xvi.32; 2. diverge, manifold; 3. intertwined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=574-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिश्रा
मिश्र <i>(I) a. (f. श्रा)</i> 1. Mixed, mingled, combined, R.xvi.32; 2. diverge, manifold; 3. intertwined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=574-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिश्र|मिश्रं|मिश्रः
मिश्र <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A kind of elephant; 2. a title of respect affixed to the names of scholars and great men, e.g. कृष्णमिश्र, मित्रमिश्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=574-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

