मिष्
मिष् <i>(II) vt. 6P (pres. मिषति)</i> 1. To rival, to emulate, to contend with; 2. to look at, to look on, जातवेदोमुखान्मायी मिषतागाच्छिनति K.S.ii.46.With उद्-, 1. to open the eyes, उन्मिषन्निमिषन्नपि Bg.v.8, K.S.iv.2; 2. to blossom; 3. to shine, to look splendid.With नि-, to shut the eyes, Bg.v.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=574-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

