मिष|मिषं|मिषः
मिष <i>(II) n.</i> Pretext, false appearance, trick, fraud; (the word is employed in this sense to indicate an Utprekshā), वदने विनिवेशिता भुजंगी पिशुनानां रसनामिषेण धात्रा Bh.V.i.111.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=574-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

