मीनाघातिन्
मीन-आघातिन्, -घातिन् <i>m.</i> 1. a fisherman; 2. a crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=574-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

