मुद्
मुद् <i>(I) vt. 10U (pres. मोदयति-ते)</i> To clean, to cleanse, to wipe off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=577-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुद्
मुद् <i>(II) vi. 1Ā (pp. मुदित; pres. मोदते; desid. मुमुदिषते or मुमोदिषते)</i> To be glad, to be joyous, देववद्दिविमोदते M.ii.232, Bt.xv.97, Bg.xvi.15.With अनु-, to allow, to permit, to approve.With आ-, 1. to be glad or joyous; 2. to be fragrant.With प्र-, to be glad or joyous, R.vi.86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=577-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुद
मुद <i>f.</i> Joy, delight, pleasure, gladness, पितुर्मुदं तेन ततान सोऽर्भकः R.iii.25, करिणां मुदे नसलदानलदाः Kir.v.25, तपोधनाभ्यागमसंभवा मुदः Sis.i.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=577-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

