मुदित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Glad, happy, delighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=577-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

