मुद्रा
मुद्रा <i>f.</i> 1. A seal, a seal-ring, नाममुद्राक्षराण्यनुवाच्य Sak.i.; 2. a ring in general; 3. stamp, impression, mark, तदर्पिताधरतटीसिंदूरमुद्रांकितो बाहुर्गोपतनोस्तनोतु भवतां कंसद्विषः Git.G.iv.; 4. a coin, a piece of money; 5. a medal, a medallion; 6. closing, sealing, shutting, क्षिपन्निद्रामुद्राम् M.M.ii.; 7. a sign, a badge, a token; 8. a mystery; 9. a particular position of fingers in religious worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

