मुर-जित्, -द्विष्, -भिद्, -मर्दन, -रिपु, -वैरिन्, -हन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa, इति चटुलचाटुपटु चारु सुरवैरिणो राधिकामधि वचनजातम् Git.G.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरहन्
मुर-जित्, -द्विष्, -भिद्, -मर्दन, -रिपु, -वैरिन्, -हन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa, इति चटुलचाटुपटु चारु सुरवैरिणो राधिकामधि वचनजातम् Git.G.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरज|मुरजः
मुरज <i>m.</i> 1. A kind of drum, निर्ह्रादस्ते मुरज इव चेत् कंदरेषु ध्वनिः स्यात् Megh.i.56, संगीताय प्रहतमुरजाः ii.1, K.S.vi.40; 2. a stanza the letters of which can be arranged in the form of a drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरजफल|मुरजफलः
मुरज-फल <i>m.</i> the bread-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरजबंध|मुरजबन्ध
मुरज-बंध <i>m.</i> See (2) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरजा
मुरजा <i>f.</i> 1. Name of the wife of Kubera; 2. a great drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरंदला|मुरन्दला
मुरंदला <i>f.</i> Name of a river identified with the Narmadā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरला
मुरला <i>f.</i> Name of a river in the Keralas, मुरलामारुतोद्धूतमगमत्कैतकं रजः R.iv.55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरली
मुरली <i>f.</i> A flute, a pipe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरलीधर|मुरलीधरः
मुरली-धर, -वादन <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुरलीवादन
मुरली-धर, -वादन <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुर्च्छ्
मुर्च्छ् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pp. मूर्त or मूर्च्छित; pres. मूर्च्छति)</i> 1. To settle into a solid form; 2. to thicken, to become dense, तमसां निशि मूर्च्छतां निहंत्रे Vikr.iii.; 3. to faint away, to swoon, to become senseless, तेनामूर्च्छीदसौ क्षतः Bt.xv.55, मूर्च्छितजनाघातेन किं पौरुषम् Git.G.iii.; 4. to prevail against, to take effect on, न पादपोन्मूलनशक्ति रंहः शिलोच्चये मूर्च्छति मारुतस्य R.ii.34, छाया न मूर्च्छति मलोपहतप्रसादे शुद्धे तु दर्पणतले सुलभावकाशा Sak.vii.; 5. to become strong or powerful, to acquire vehemence, to increase, मुमूर्च्छ सहजं तेजो हविषेव हविर्भुजाम् R.x.79, मुमूर्च्छ सख्यं रामस्य (हरौ)R.xi.67; 6. to be frequent; 7. to sound loudly.With सम्-, to acquire vehemence, to be strong, to be powerful, to be intense, Kir.v.41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=578-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुर्मुर|मुर्मुरः
मुर्मुर <i>m.</i> 1. A fire made of chaff, स्मरहुताशनमुर्मुरचूर्णतां दधुरिवाम्रवणस्य रकःकणाः Sis.vi.6, मुर्मुरमिव वर्षति समंतात् Vas.D.; 2. the god of love; 3. name of one of the horses of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुर्व्
मुर्व् <i>vt. 1P (pres. मूर्वति)</i> To tie, to bind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुशली
मुश(स)ली <i>f.</i> A house-lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसली
मुश(स)ली <i>f.</i> A house-lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्
मुष् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pres. मोषति)</i> To injure, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्
मुष् <i>(II) vt. 4P (pres. मुष्यति)</i> 1. To break, to destroy; 2. to steal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्
मुष् <i>(III) vt. 9P (pp. मुषित; pres. मुष्णाति; desid. मुमुषिषति) (This is one of those roots which take two accusatives, e.g. देवदत्तं शतं मुष्णाति; but as such it is of rare occurrence)</i> 1. To steal, to plunder, to rob, to carry off, मुषाण रत्नानि हरामरांगनाः Sis.i.51, Bt.xv.16; 2. to captivate, to enrapture; 3. to surpass, to excel, e.g. मुष्णञ् श्रियमशोकानां रक्तैः परिजनांबरैः; 4. to cover, to envelop, सैन्यरेणुमुषितार्कदीधितिः R.xi.51.With परि-, to rob, to carry off, परिमुषितरत्नं त्रिभुवनम् M.M.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुषक|मुषकः
मुषक <i>m.</i> A mouse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुषल|मुषलः
मुषल <i>m.n.</i> The same as मुसल q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुषा
मुषा(षी) <i>f.</i> A crucible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुषी
मुषा(षी) <i>f.</i> A crucible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुषित|मुषितं
मुषित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Stolen, plundered, robbed; 2. carried off, ravished; 3. deceived, cheated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुषिता
मुषित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Stolen, plundered, robbed; 2. carried off, ravished; 3. deceived, cheated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुषितक|मुषितकं
मुषितक <i>n.</i> Stolen property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्क|मुष्कः
मुष्क <i>m.</i> 1. The scrotum; 2. a testicle; 3. a thief; 4. a heap, a multitude; 5. a stout person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्कदेश|मुष्कदेशः
मुष्क-देश <i>m.</i> the region of the scrotum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्कशून्य|मुष्कशून्यः
मुष्क-शून्य <i>m.</i> a eunuch, a person who is emasculated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्कशोफ|मुष्कशोफः
मुष्क-शोफ <i>m.</i> swelling of the testicles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टि|मुष्टिः
मुष्टि <i>m.f.</i> 1. The clenched hand, कृतांतस्य मुष्टिं पृथगिव स्थितम् R.xv.21, ix.58; 2. a handful, अंतर्गूढं क्षितिरिव नभोबीजमुष्टिं दधाना R.xix.57, K.S.vii.69; 3. a hilt; 4. a particular measure, viz., a pala; 5. the penis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिदेश|मुष्टिदेशः
मुष्टि-देश <i>m.</i> the middle of a bow which is grasped in the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिद्यूत|मुष्टिद्यूतं
मुष्टि-द्यूत <i>n.</i> a kind of game.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिंधय|मुष्टिन्धय|मुष्टिंधयः|मुष्टिन्धयः
मुष्टिंधय <i>m.</i> a child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिपात|मुष्टिपातः
मुष्टि-पात <i>m.</i> boxing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिबंध|मुष्टिबन्ध|मुष्टिबन्धः
मुष्टि-बंध <i>m.</i> 1. clenching the fist; 2. a handful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिबंधन
मुष्टि-बंधन <i>n.</i> clenching the fist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टीमुष्टि
