मुष्टियुद्ध
मुष्टि-युद्ध <i>n.</i> a pugilistic encounter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिक|मुष्टिकः
मुष्टिक <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A goldsmith; 2. a particular position of the hands; 3. name of a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिक|मुष्टिकः
मुष्टिक <i>(II) n.</i> A pugilistic encounter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिकांतक|मुष्टिकान्तक|मुष्टिकान्तकः
मुष्टिक-अंतक <i>m.</i> an epithet of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुष्टिका
मुष्टिका <i>f.</i> The fist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

