मुसल|मुसलं|मुसलः
मुसल <i>m.n.</i> 1. A mace, a club; 2. a pestle used for cleaning rice, M.vi.56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसलायुध|मुसलायुधः
मुसल-आयुध <i>m.</i> an epithet of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसलोलूखल
मुसल-उलूखल <i>n.</i> a pestle and mortar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसलामुसलि
मुसलामुसलि <i>ind.</i> club against club.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसलिन्
मुसलिन् <i>m.</i> 1. An epithet of Balarāma; 2. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसल्य|मुसल्यः
मुसल्य <i>a. (f. ल्या)</i> To be put to death with a club.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसल्या
मुसल्य <i>a. (f. ल्या)</i> To be put to death with a club.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुस्त्
मुस्त् <i>vt. 10U (pres. मुस्तयति-ते)</i> To heap up, to accumulate, to gather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुस्त|मुस्तं|मुस्तः
मुस्त <i>m.n.</i> A kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुस्ता
मुस्ता <i>f.</i> The same as मुस्त q.v., विश्रब्धं क्रियतां वराहततिभिर्मुस्ताक्षतिः पल्वले Sak.ii., R.ix.59, xv.19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुस्ताद|मुस्तादः
मुस्ता-अद, -आद <i>m.</i> a hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुस्ताद|मुस्तादः
मुस्ता-अद, -आद <i>m.</i> a hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुस्र|मुस्रं
मुस्र <i>n.</i> 1. A pestle; 2. a tear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुह
मुह <i>vi. 4P (pp. मूढ or मुग्ध; pres. मुह्यति)</i> 1. To faint, to lose consciousness, स शुश्रुवांस्तद्वचनं मुमोह Bt.i.20; 2. to be bewildered, to lose presence of mind; 3. to err, to mistake; 4. to be foolish.With प्र-, to be infatuated, to be stupefied.With वि-, 1. to be perplexed, to be confused, to be embarrassed, नैनां प्राप्य विमुह्यति Bg.ii.72; 2. to be foolish.With सम्-, to be foolish, to be ignorant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=579-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुह
