मूल्
मूल् <i>(II) vi. 10U (pres. मूलयति-ते)</i> To rear, to cause, to grow.With उद्-, 1. to root out, to extirpate; 2. to destroy.With निस्-, to eradicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=581-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

