यज्ञीय|यज्ञीयः
यज्ञीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Sacrificial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञीया
यज्ञीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Sacrificial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञीयब्रह्मपादप|यज्ञीयब्रह्मपादपः
यज्ञीय-ब्रह्मपादप <i>m.</i> the Vikankata tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्वन्
यज्वन् <i>(I) a. (f. ज्वरी)</i> Sacrificing, worshipping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्वरी
यज्वन् <i>(I) a. (f. ज्वरी)</i> Sacrificing, worshipping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्वन्
यज्वन् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. One who performs sacrifices agreeably to the ritual of the Vedas, ग्रामेष्वात्मविसृष्टेषु यूपचिह्नेषु R.i.44, K.S.ii.46; 2. a name of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्|यन्त्
यत् <i>vi. 1Ā (pres. यतते)</i> 1. To endeavour, to strive after, to be eager for, प्रियतमा यतमानमपाहरत् R.ix.7; 2. to exert oneself, to persevere, यततो ह्यपि कौंतेय पुरुषस्य विपश्चितः (the Par. is epic) Bg.ii.60; 3. to be cautious or watchful.With प्र-, to strive.With सम्-, to struggle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्|यन्त्
यत् <i>Caus. (यातयति-ते)</i> 1. to requite, to recompense; 2. to prepare; 3. to torture, to distress; 4. to despise; 5. to encourage.With निस्-, 1. to restore, M.xi.164; 2. to requite, e.g. रामलक्ष्मणयोर्वैरं स्वयं निर्यातयामि वै.With वि-, to punish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत|यतः
यत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Bound; 2. restrained, curbed, controlled, (pp. of यम् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यता
यत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Bound; 2. restrained, curbed, controlled, (pp. of यम् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत|यतः
यत <i>(II) n.</i> The stirring of an elephant by means of the rider’s feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतात्मन्
यत-आत्मन् <i>a.</i> self-restrained, curbing the senses, तपसे यतात्मा K.S.i.54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यताहार
यत-आहार <i>a.</i> abstemious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतेंद्रिय|यतेन्द्रिय
यत-इंद्रिय <i>a.</i> of subdued passion, chaste, pure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतचित्त
यत-चित्त, -मानस <i>a.</i> subdued in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतमानस
यत-चित्त, -मानस <i>a.</i> subdued in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतवाच्
यत-वाच् <i>a.</i> observing silence, reticent. (Also वाग्यत.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतव्रत
यत-व्रत <i>a.</i> observing vows, keeping to engagements.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतन|यतनं
यतन <i>n.</i> Effort, endeavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतम|यतमः
यतम <i>a. (f. मा; n. मत्)</i> Who or which (out of many.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतमा
यतम <i>a. (f. मा; n. मत्)</i> Who or which (out of many.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतमत्
यतम <i>a. (f. मा; n. मत्)</i> Who or which (out of many.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतर|यतरः
यतर <i>a. (f. रा; n. रत्)</i> Which of the two.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतरा
यतर <i>a. (f. रा; n. रत्)</i> Which of the two.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतरत्
यतर <i>a. (f. रा; n. रत्)</i> Which of the two.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतस्
यतस् <i>ind.</i> 1. From where, from which place, from which quarter, यतश्च भयमाशंकेत्तते । विस्तारयेद्बलम् M.vii.188; 2. where, अर्घ्यमर्घ्यमितिवादिनं नृपं सोऽनवेक्ष्य भरताग्रश्चो यतः R.xi.69; 3. from which time forward; 4. because, since, whereas, उवाच चैनं परमार्थतो हरं न वेत्सि नूनं यत एवमात्थ माम् K.S.v.75, R.viii.76; 5. from whom, यतस्त्वया ज्ञानमशेषमाप्तम् R.v.4.(यतस्ततस् 1. from any place whatsoever; 2. from any person; 3. on this side and that, on all sides, मुहुरंगानि यतस्ततः क्षिपंती Bh.V.ii.26; यतोयतस् 1. from whatever place; 2. from any person; 3. wherever, Bg.vi.26.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतोभव
यतोभव <i>a.</i> produced from which.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतोमूल
यतोमूल <i>a.</i> originating in or from which.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यति|यतिः
यति <i>(I) pron. (declined only in the plural; nom. and acc. यति)</i> How many, as many.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यति|यतिः
यति <i>(II) f.</i> 1. Restraint, check; 2. guidance; 3. stopping, rest; 4. a pause in music, a cæsura (in prosody), (यतिर्जिह्वेष्टविश्रामस्थानं कविभिरुच्यते Ch.M.i.); 5. a widow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यति|यतिः
यति <i>(III) m.</i> One who has abandoned the world, an ascetic, a twice-born in the fourth order of life, यतिपार्थिवलिंगधारिणौ R.viii.16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=590-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतित
यतित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Attempted, tried, striven after, endeavoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिता
यतित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Attempted, tried, striven after, endeavoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिन्
यतिन् <i>m.</i> An ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिनी
यतिनी <i>f.</i> A widow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्न|यत्नः
यत्न <i>m.</i> 1. Effort, exertion, diligence, zeal, महान् हि यत्नस्तव देवदारौ R.ii.56; 2. labour, work, pains, अस्मिन् द्वये रूपविधानयत्नः पत्युः प्रजानां वितथोऽभविष्यत् R.vii.14, K.S.vii.66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्र
यत्र <i>ind.</i> 1. In which place, where, K.S.i.7, 9, 10, 11, 14; 2. when, यत्र काले त्वनावृत्तिमावृत्तिं चैव योगिनः Bg.viii.23; 3. whereas, because, as that, since.With कुत्र or क्व, it means- 1. in whatever place or time, wheresoever; 2. whensoever; 3. hither and thither.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रस्थ
यत्र-स्थ <i>a.</i> dwelling in which place, of which place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथा
यथा <i>ind. (used by itself)</i> 1. As, as for example, e.g. यत्र यत्र धूमस्तत्र तत्र वह्निर्यथा महानसे; 2. like, as (often used in a simile to express the relation of similarity), नवपल्लवसंस्तरे यथा रचयिष्यामि तनुं विभावसौ K.S.iv.34; 3. it is used to introduce a direct assertion or a subordinate clause in the direct construction, आज्ञापितोऽस्मि परिषदा यथाद्य त्वया … नाटकं नाटयितव्यमिति Mud.i., K.S.iv.36 (in such cases, इति is often used at the end of the clause); (used with its correlative तथा which sometimes is omitted); 4. in which manner, just as, as, यदि यथा वदति क्षितिपस्तथा त्वमसि किं पुनरुत्कुलया त्वया Sak.iv., यथाज्ञापयति देवः i.; 5. so that, in order that, तस्मान्मुच्ये यथा तात संविधातुं तथार्हसि R.i.72; 6. since, because, मंदं मंदं नुदति पवनश्चानुकूलो यथा त्वाम् Megh.i.9; 7. as surely as, as much as, e.g. न तथा बाधते शीतं यथा बाधति बाधते. (See under तथा for other senses.)(It is generally followed by its correlative तथा, but sometimes by such words as एवम्, एवम् तद्वत्.)(In composition with nouns, यथा forms Avyay. compounds and has then the sense of ‘not going beyond,’ ‘according to.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथांशतस्
यथा-अंशतस् <i>ind.</i> proportionately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाधिकारम्
यथा-अधिकारम् <i>ind.</i> according to authority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाधीत
यथा-अधीत <i>a.</i> as read, according to the text.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुपूर्वम्
यथा-अनुपूर्वम्, -अनुपूर्व्यम्, -अनुपूर्व्या <i>ind.</i> in regular order, successively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुपूर्व्यम्
यथा-अनुपूर्वम्, -अनुपूर्व्यम्, -अनुपूर्व्या <i>ind.</i> in regular order, successively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुपूर्व्या
यथा-अनुपूर्वम्, -अनुपूर्व्यम्, -अनुपूर्व्या <i>ind.</i> in regular order, successively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुभूतम्
यथा-अनुभूतम् <i>ind.</i> by previous experience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुरूपम्
यथा-अनुरूपम् <i>ind.</i> in exact conformity, properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिप्रेत
यथा-अभिप्रेत, -अभिमत, -अभिलषित, -अभीष्ट <i>a.</i> as wished or intended, as desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिमत
यथा-अभिप्रेत, -अभिमत, -अभिलषित, -अभीष्ट <i>a.</i> as wished or intended, as desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिलषित
यथा-अभिप्रेत, -अभिमत, -अभिलषित, -अभीष्ट <i>a.</i> as wished or intended, as desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभीष्ट
यथा-अभिप्रेत, -अभिमत, -अभिलषित, -अभीष्ट <i>a.</i> as wished or intended, as desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थ|यथार्थं
यथा-अर्थ <i>a.</i> 1. true, actual, real, सौम्येति चाभाष्य यथार्थभाषी स्थितं निदेशे पृथगादिदेश R.xiv.44, K.S.ii.16; 2. right, appropriate, करिष्यत्रिव नामास्य यथार्थमरिनिग्रहात् R.xv.6, Kir.viii.49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थनामन्
यथा-अर्थ˚नामन् <i>a.</i> whose name is appropriate, i.e. whose acts conform with his name, परंतपो नाम यथार्थनामा R.vi.21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थवर्ण
यथा-अर्थ˚वर्ण <i>m.</i> a spy (probably a corruption of यथार्हवर्ण q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्ह|यथार्हं
यथा-अर्ह <i>a.</i> 1. as deserving; 2. appropriate, just.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्हवर्ण|यथार्हवर्णः
यथा-अर्ह˚वर्ण <i>m.</i> a spy, a secret agent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्हणम्
यथा-अर्हणम् <i>ind.</i> 1. according to merit; 2. according to propriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावकाशम्
यथा-अवकाशम् <i>ind.</i> 1. according to space; 2. in the proper place, प्रालंबमुत्कृष्य यथावकाशं निनाय साचीकृतचारुवक्त्रः R.vi.14; 3. according to propriety or leisure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावस्थम्
यथा-अवस्थम् <i>ind.</i> according to condition or circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाख्यात
यथा-आख्यात <i>a.</i> before-mentioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाख्यानम्
यथा-आख्यानम् <i>ind.</i> as stated before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथागतम्
यथा-आगतम् <i>ind.</i> by the same way as one came, यथागतं मातलिसारथिर्ययौ R.iii.67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाचारम्
यथा-आचारम् <i>ind.</i> as usual or customary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाम्नातम्
यथा-आम्नातम्, -आम्नायम् <i>ind.</i> according to the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाम्नायम्
यथा-आम्नातम्, -आम्नायम् <i>ind.</i> according to the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथारंभम्|यथारम्भम्
यथा-आरंभम् <i>ind.</i> according to the commencement, in regular succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावासम्
यथा-आवासम् <i>ind.</i> each to his own abode, according to dwelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशयम्
यथा-आशयम् <i>ind.</i> according to intention or stipulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाश्रमम्
यथा-आश्रमम् <i>ind.</i> according to the Āśrama or period of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेच्छ
यथा-इच्छ, -ईप्सित <i>a.</i> agreeably to desire, as much as wanted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेप्सित|यथेप्सितं
यथा-इच्छ, -ईप्सित <i>a.</i> agreeably to desire, as much as wanted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेच्छम्
यथा-इच्छम्, -ईप्सितम् <i>ind.</i> according to wish, at pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेप्सितम्
यथा-इच्छम्, -ईप्सितम् <i>ind.</i> according to wish, at pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेष्ट|यथेष्टं
यथा-इष्ट <i>a.</i> as desired, as wished for, as loved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेष्टम्
यथा-इष्टम् <i>ind.</i> according to wish, to the heart’s content, उन्मत्तवन्मधुकरः कमलं यथेष्टम् Ch.P.3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेक्षितम्
यथा-ईक्षितम् <i>ind.</i> as beheld actually.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोक्त
यथा-उक्त <i>a.</i> as said or told previouly, above-mentioned, प्रातर्यथोक्तव्र्तपारणांते R.ii.70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोचित|यथोचितं
यथा-उचित <i>a.</i> proper, suitable, becoming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोचितम्
यथा-उचितम् <i>ind.</i> suitably, properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोत्तरम्
यथा-उत्तरम् <i>ind.</i> in regular succession, one after another, श्रैष्ठ्यमेषां यथोत्तरम् M.xii.38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोत्साहम्
यथा-उत्साहम् <i>ind.</i> according to power, with all one’s might.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोदितम्
यथा-उदितम् <i>ind.</i> as mentioned before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोद्दिष्टम्
यथा-उद्दिष्टम्, -उद्देशम् <i>ind.</i> in the manner pointed out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोद्देशम्
यथा-उद्दिष्टम्, -उद्देशम् <i>ind.</i> in the manner pointed out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपजोषम्
यथा-उपजोषम् <i>ind.</i> according to desire or pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपदेशम्
यथा-उपदेशम् <i>ind.</i> according to advice or orders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपयोगम्
यथा-उपयोगम् <i>ind.</i> according to use or requiements.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथर्तु
यथा-ऋतु <i>ind.</i> according to the season, at the right season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकर्म
यथा-कर्म <i>ind.</i> according to action, duties, or circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकामम्
यथा-कामम् <i>ind.</i> as one likes, at pleasure, to the heart’s content, स निर्विश्य यथाकामं तटेष्वालीनचंदनौ R.iv.51, i.6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकालम्
यथा-कालम् <i>ind.</i> at the right moment, सोऽपसर्पैर्जजगार यथाकालं स्वपन्नपि R.xvii.51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकृत
यथा-कृत <i>a.</i> as agreed, done according to custom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाक्रमम्
यथा-क्रमम्, -क्रमेण <i>ind.</i> in due succession, regularly, properly, यथाक्रमं पुंसवनादिकाः क्रियाः R.iii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाक्रमेण
यथा-क्रमम्, -क्रमेण <i>ind.</i> in due succession, regularly, properly, यथाक्रमं पुंसवनादिकाः क्रियाः R.iii.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाक्षमम्
यथा-क्षमम् <i>ind.</i> according to ability, as much as possible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाजात|यथाजातः
यथा-जात <i>a.</i> senseless, foolish, barbarous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाज्ञानम्
यथा-ज्ञानम् <i>ind.</i> to the best of one’s knowledge or judgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाज्येष्ठम्
यथा-ज्येष्ठम् <i>ind.</i> by seniority, according to rank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथ|यथातथं
यथा-तथ <i>(I) a.</i> 1. right, true; 2. accurate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथ|यथातथं
यथा-तथ <i>(II) n.</i> a detailed or minute account of events.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथम्
यथा-तथम् <i>ind.</i> 1. precisely, exactly; 2. fitly, in a suitable manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादिक्
यथा-दिक्, -दिशम् <i>ind.</i> in all directions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादिशम्
यथा-दिक्, -दिशम् <i>ind.</i> in all directions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानिर्दिष्ट
यथा-निर्दिष्ट <i>a.</i> as mentioned before, ततः प्रविशति यथानिर्दिष्टपरिवारो राजा Sak.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथान्यायम्
यथा-न्यायम् <i>ind.</i> according to justice, rightly, properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथापुरम्
यथा-पुरम् <i>ind.</i> as before, as on former occasions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथापूर्वम्
यथा-पूर्वम् <i>ind.</i> 1. as before, सर्वाणि ज्ञातिकर्माणि यथापूर्वं समाचरेत् M.xi.187; 2. in succession, one after another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रदेशम्
यथा-प्रदेशम् <i>ind.</i> 1. according to precept; 2. in a suitable or proper place, आसम्जयामास यथाप्रदेशं कंठे गुणं मूर्तमिवानुरागम् R.vi.83, K.S.i.49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रधानम्
यथा-प्रधानम्, -प्रधानतस् <i>ind.</i> according to precedence, according to rank or position, आलोकमात्रेण सुरानशेषान् संभावयामास यथाप्रधानम् K.S.vii.46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रधानतस्
यथा-प्रधानम्, -प्रधानतस् <i>ind.</i> according to precedence, according to rank or position, आलोकमात्रेण सुरानशेषान् संभावयामास यथाप्रधानम् K.S.vii.46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्राणम्
यथा-प्राणम् <i>ind.</i> with all one’s might.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रार्थितम्
यथा-प्रार्थितम् <i>ind.</i> as requested, by request.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाबलम्
यथा-बलम् <i>ind.</i> with all one’s might, to the best of one’s ability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभागम्
यथा-भागम् <i>ind.</i> 1. according to share, proportionately; 2. each in his respective place, in the proper place, यथाभागमवस्थिताः Bg.i.11, कश्चिद्यथाभागमवस्थितेऽपि R.vi.19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभूतम्
यथा-भूतम् <i>ind.</i> according to what had happened, according to truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथामुखीन|यथामुखीनः
यथा-मुखीन <i>a.</i> looking straight, (with a gen.), (मृगः) यथामुखीनः सीतायाः पुप्लुवे बहु लोभयत् Bt.vi.48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायथम्
यथा-यथम् <i>ind.</i> 1. rightly, fitly, properly; 2. in regular order, severally, gradually, e.g. विप्रकीर्णा यथायथम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायुक्तम्
यथा-युक्तम्, -योगम् <i>ind.</i> suitably, according to circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायोगम्
यथा-युक्तम्, -योगम् <i>ind.</i> suitably, according to circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायोग्य
यथा-योग्य <i>a.</i> proper, right, fit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथारुचम्
यथा-रुचम्, -रुचि <i>ind.</i> according to taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथारुचि
यथा-रुचम्, -रुचि <i>ind.</i> according to taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथारूपम्
यथा-रूपम् <i>ind.</i> 1. according to form or appearance; 2. properly, duly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावत्
यथा-वत् <i>ind.</i> 1. properly, truly, correctly, लिपेर्यथावद् ग्रहणेन वाङ्मयं नदीमुखेनेव समुद्रमाविशत् R.iii.28; 2. according to law, वने वसेत्तु नियतो यथावद्विजितेंद्रियः M.vi.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावस्तु
यथा-वस्तु <i>ind.</i> accurately, exactly, truly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाविधि
यथा-विधि <i>ind.</i> according to precept or rule, duly, अथ स विषयव्यावृत्तात्मा यथाविधि सूनवे R.iii.70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाविभवम्
यथा-विभवम् <i>ind.</i> according to means, in proportion to wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावृत्त
यथा-वृत्त <i>(I) a.</i> as happened, as acted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावृत्त
यथा-वृत्त <i>(II) n.</i> 1. a previous event; 2. the details of an event.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशक्ति
यथा-शक्ति, -शक्त्या <i>ind.</i> as far as possible, to the utmost of one’s power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशक्त्या
यथा-शक्ति, -शक्त्या <i>ind.</i> as far as possible, to the utmost of one’s power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशास्त्रम्
यथा-शास्त्रम् <i>ind.</i> according to the precepts, as the law ordains, M.ii.70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाश्रुतम्
यथा-श्रुतम् <i>ind.</i> 1. as heard or reported; 2. according to the injunction of the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासंख्य
यथा-संख्य <i>n.</i> a figure of speech in rhetoric, thus defined- and illustrated by Jayadeva- यथासंख्यं क्रमेनैव क्रमिकाणां समन्वयः । शत्रुं मित्रं विपत्तिं च जय रंजय भंजय Ch.L.v.107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासंख्यम्
यथा-संख्यम्, -संख्येन <i>ind.</i> number for number, respectively, Yaj.i.21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासंख्येन
यथा-संख्यम्, -संख्येन <i>ind.</i> number for number, respectively, Yaj.i.21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासमयम्
यथा-समयम् <i>ind.</i> 1. according to agreement or custom; 2. at the proper time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासंभव|यथासम्भव
यथा-संभव <i>a.</i> possible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासुखम्
यथा-सुखम् <i>ind.</i> at ease, comfortably, अथ यथासुखमार्तवमुत्सवं समनुभूय विलासवतीसखः R.ix.48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्थितम्
यथा-स्थितम् <i>ind.</i> 1. according to circumstances; 2. truly, properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्वम्
यथा-स्वम् <i>ind.</i> 1. every one his own, अध्यासते चीरभृतो यथास्वम् R.viii.22; 2. each for himself or on his own account; 3. rightly, properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=591-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्
यद् <i>(I) pron. (nom. sing. यः m., या f., यत् n.)</i> The relative pronoun corresponding to ‘who, which or what,’ (its correlative being तद्, एतद्, इदम् or अदम्; sometimes it is used without any correlative which, then, is to be supplied); when repeated it means, ‘whoever or whatever,’ इति नरपतिरस्त्रं यद्यदाविश्चकार Sis.xx.76; it is often joined with the interrogative pronoun or in derivatives to express ‘any, whatever,’ e.g. येन केन प्रकारेण प्रसिद्धः औरुषो भवेत्.(यत्किंचन or यत्किंचित् ‘a trifle, a worthless thing.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=592-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्
यद् <i>(II) ind.</i> 1. Used, (with or without इति), at the begining of a subordinate sentence in the sense of ‘that,’ न किल श्रुतं युवाभ्यां यद्वासंतिकैस्तरुभिरपि &c. Sak.vi., सत्योऽयं जनप्रवादो यत्संपत्संपदमनुबध्नातीति Kad.; 2. because, since, व्यावृत्ता यत्परस्वेभ्यः श्रुतौ तस्करता स्थिता R.i.27, or किं शेषस्य भरव्यथा न वपुषि क्ष्मां न क्षिपस्येव यत् Mud.ii.; (in this sense, it is often followed by तत् or ततः Na.xxii.46).With a following अपि, it means ‘although, not withstanding,’ वक्रः पंथा यदपि भवतः प्रस्थितस्योत्तराशाम् Megh.i.29.(यदर्थम्, यदर्थे ind. (1) on which account, wherefore, why, श्रूयतां यदर्थमस्मि हरिणा भवत्सकाशं प्रेषितः Sak.vii., (2) since, because, e.g. नूनं दैवं न शक्यमतिवर्तितुं यदर्थं य्त्नवानेव विप्रतां न लभे. यत्कारणम् ind. (1) on which account, for which reason; (2) because. यत्कृते ind. wherefore, why, for whom. यद्वा ind. ‘or, or else, whether,’ न चैतद्विद्मः कतरन्नो गरीयो यद्वा जयेम यदिवा नो जयेयुः Bg.ii.6. यत्सत्यम् ‘to speak the truth, to be sure, verily,’ इह … यत्सत्यं स्वर्गायत इदं गेहम् Mrich.iv.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=592-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्भविष्य
यद्-भविष्य <i>m.</i> a fatalist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=592-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदा
यदा <i>ind.</i> 1. When, whenever, Na.xxii.55; 2. since, whereas, if, पत्रं नैव यदा करीरविटपे दोषो वसन्तस्य किम् Bhartr.ii.93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदि
यदि <i>ind.</i> 1. If, in case that, अमोच्यमश्वं यदि मन्यसे प्रभो R.iii.65; 2. whether, विचार्यतां यदि काचिदापन्नसत्वा तस्य भार्यासु स्यात् Sak.vi., K.S.v.44; 3. provided that, when; 4. perhaps, perchance, पूर्वं स्पष्टं यदि किल भवेदंगमेभिस्तवेति Megh.ii.44.(यदि is generally followed by तर्हि or तथापि, or sometimes even by अत्र, किमत्र चित्रं यदि विशाखे शाशांकलेखामनुवर्तेते Sak.iii.)यद्यपि ‘although,’ Sis.xvi.82; यदिवा ‘or,’ निन्दन्तु नीतिनिपुणा यदिवा स्तुवन्तु Bhartr.ii.83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदु|यदुः
यदु <i>m.</i> Name of an ancient king. (See App. II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदुकुलोद्भव|यदुकुलोद्भवः
यदु-कुलोद्भव, -नंदन, -श्रेष्ठ <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदुनंदन|यदुनन्दन|यदुनन्दनः
यदु-कुलोद्भव, -नंदन, -श्रेष्ठ <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदुश्रेष्ठ|यदुश्रेष्ठः
यदु-कुलोद्भव, -नंदन, -श्रेष्ठ <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छा
यदृच्छा <i>f.</i> 1. Self-will, independence; 2. accident, chance; (in this sense generally used in the instrumental singular, वसिष्ठधेनुश्च यदृच्छयाऽऽगता श्रुतप्रभावा ददृशेऽथ नंदिनी R.iii.40, यदृच्छया त्वं सकृदप्यवंध्ययोः पथि स्थिता सुंदरि यस्य नेत्रयोः Vikr.i.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छाभिज्ञ|यदृच्छाभिज्ञः
यदृच्छा-अभिज्ञ <i>m.</i> a voluntary or self-offered witness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छातस्
यदृच्छा-तस् <i>ind.</i> by accident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छासंवाद|यदृच्छासंवादः
यदृच्छा-संवाद <i>m.</i> accidental or spontaneous conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्तृ|यंतृ
यन्तृ <i>m.</i> 1. A governor, a ruler, a manager; 2. a driver, a charioteer, अथ यन्तारमादिश्य धुर्यान्विश्रामयेति सः R.i.54; 3. an elephant-driver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्र्|यन्त्र्
यंत्र् <i>vt. 1U, 10U (pp. यंत्रित; pres. यंत्रति-ते, यंत्रयति-ते)</i> To restrain, to bind, to confine, शापयंत्रिरपौलस्त्यबलात्कारकचग्रहैः R.x.47.With नि-, to restrain, to chain.With सम्-, to stop, to check, संयन्त्रितो मया रथः Sak.vii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्र|यन्त्र|यंत्रं|यन्त्रं
यंत्र <i>n.</i> 1. A prop, a support, गृहयंत्रपताकाश्रीरपौरादरनिर्मिता K.S.vi.41; 2. a fetter, a cord, a fastening; 3. any instrument or machine, a contrivance, हिंस्रयंत्रविधानं च व्यसनान्यात्मविक्रमः Yaj.iii.240; 4. a surgical instrument, especially any blunt instrument, (op. to शस्त्र); 5. a lock, a bolt; 6. restraint, force; 7. an amulet, a mystical diagram used as a charm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रोपल|यन्त्रोपल|यन्त्रोपलः
यंत्र-उपल <i>n.</i> a mill-stone, a mill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रकरंडिका|यन्त्रकरण्डिका
यंत्र-करंडिका <i>f.</i> a kind of magical basket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रकर्मकृत्|यन्त्रकर्मकृत्
यंत्र-कर्मकृत् <i>m.</i> an artizan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रगृह|यन्त्रगृह|यन्त्रगृहं
यंत्र-गृह <i>n.</i> an oil-mill, a manufactory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रचेष्टित|यन्त्रचेष्टित
यंत्र-चेष्टित <i>n.</i> any magical operation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रनाल|यन्त्रनाल
यंत्र-नाल <i>n.</i> a mechanical pipe or tube.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रपुत्रक|यन्त्रपुत्रक|यन्त्रपुत्रकः
यंत्र-पुत्रक <i>m.</i> a mechanical doll, a puppet fitted with any contrivance to move the limbs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रपुत्रिका|यन्त्रपुत्रिका
यंत्र-पुत्रिका <i>f.</i> a mechanical doll, a puppet fitted with any contrivance to move the limbs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रप्रवाह|यन्त्रप्रवाह|यन्त्रप्रवाहः
यंत्र-प्रवाह <i>m.</i> a machine for watering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रमार्ग|यन्त्रमार्ग|यन्त्रमार्गः
यंत्र-मार्ग <i>m.</i> an aqueduct, a canal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रशर|यन्त्रशर|यन्त्रशरः
यंत्र-शर <i>m.</i> a missile shot off by machinery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रक|यन्त्रक|यन्त्रकं|यंत्रकः|यन्त्रकः
यंत्रक <i>(I) m.</i> One acquainted with machinery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रक|यन्त्रक|यन्त्रकं|यंत्रकः|यन्त्रकः
यंत्रक <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A bandage (in medicine); 2. a turner’s lathe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रण|यन्त्रण|यंत्रणं|यन्त्रणं
यंत्रण <i>n.</i> 1. Restriction, restraint, ह्रीयंत्रणामानशिरे मनोज्ञामन्योन्यलोलानि विलोचनानि R.vii.23, K.S.vii.175; 2. fastening, निबिडपीनकुचद्वययंत्रणा तमपराधमधात् प्रतिबध्नती Na.iv.10; 3. constraint, pain, anguish, अलमलमुपचारयंत्रणया Mal.v.; 4. guarding, protecting (only n. in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रणा
यंत्रणा <i>f.</i> 1. Restriction, restraint, ह्रीयंत्रणामानशिरे मनोज्ञामन्योन्यलोलानि विलोचनानि R.vii.23, K.S.vii.175; 2. fastening, निबिडपीनकुचद्वययंत्रणा तमपराधमधात् प्रतिबध्नती Na.iv.10; 3. constraint, pain, anguish, अलमलमुपचारयंत्रणया Mal.v.; 4. guarding, protecting (only n. in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रणी
यंत्रणी <i>f.</i> A wife’s younger sister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रिणी
यंत्रणी <i>f.</i> A wife’s younger sister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यंत्रिन्|यन्त्रिन्
यंत्रिन् <i>m.</i> 1. A horse furnished with harness or trappings; 2. a tormentor; 3. one having an amulet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यम्
यम् <i>vt. 1P (pp. यत; pres. यच्छति; desid. यियंसति)</i> 1. To restrain, to curb, to suppress, यच्छेद्वाङ्मनसी प्राज्ञः S.Bh.i.; 2. to cut, to pare.With आ-, 1. to stop, to restrain, बाणमुद्यतमायंसीदिक्ष्वाकुकुलनन्दनः Bt.vi.119; 2. to suppress (as breath), प्राणानप्सु त्रिरायम्य घृतं प्राश्य विशुध्यति M.xi.149; 3. (Atm.) to draw, to bend (as a bow); 4. (Atm.) to spread, to stretch; 5. (Atm.) to possess, to have, श्रियमायच्छमानाभिरुत्तमाभिरनुत्तमाम् Bt.viii.47.With उद्-, (Atm) 1. to lift up, to brandish, R.xi.17; 2. to govern; 3. to endeavour, to be ready, नित्यमुद्यच्छमानाभिः स्मरसंभोगकर्मसु Bt.viii.47, R.xvi.29.With उप-, (Atm.) 1. to marry, मेनां मुनीनामपि माननीयामात्मानुरूपां विधिनोपयेमे K.S.i.18; 2. to take, to possess, वेदोंगवांस्तैरखिलोऽध्यगायि शस्त्राण्युपायंसत जित्वराणि Bt.i.15.With नि-, 1. to restrain, to curb, to dissuade, (सुतां) शशाक मेना न नियन्तुमुद्यमात् K.S.v.5; 2. to hold in, to suppress (as breath); 3. to conceal, न कथंचन दुर्योनिः प्रकृतिं स्वां नियच्छति M.x.59; 4. to punish, सोऽज्येष्ठः स्यादभागश्च नियंतव्यश्च राजभिः M.ix.213; 5. to assume, to attain, संनियम्य तु तान्येव ततः सिद्धिं नियच्छति M.ii.93.With सम्-, 1. to restrain, to bind, वानरं मास्म संयसीर्व्रज तूर्णमशंकितः Bt.ix.50; 2. (Atm.) to subdue, to govern, M.xii.2; 3. (Atm.) to gather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यम्
यम् <i>Caus. (यमयति-ते)</i> With नि-, to control, to check, to regulate, नियमयसि विमार्गप्रस्थिताना तदंडः Sak.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=593-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यम|यमः
यम <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Restraining, restraint; 2. self-control; 3. observance of several moral and religious duties which are variously enumerated; (usually they are enumerated as ten, but the order and the names are not the same everywhere; (1) ब्रह्मचर्यं दया क्षान्तिर्दानं सत्यमकल्कता । अहिंसास्तेयमाधुर्ये दमश्चेति यमाः स्मृताः Yaj.iii.313; (2) आनृशंस्यं दया सत्यमहिंसा क्श्जांतिरार्जवम् । प्रीतिः प्रसादो माधुर्यं मार्दवं च यमा दश (Atri.); 3. the first of the eight steps of Yoga (in Yoga phil.); (See योगांग); 4. a twin, one of the couple, यमयोश्चैव गर्भेषु जन्मतो ज्येष्ठता स्मृता M.ix.126; 5. the god of death, son of Vivasvat, अनुययौ यमपुण्यजनेश्वरौ R.ix.6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यम|यमः
यम <i>(II) n.</i> A pair, a couple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमानुचर|यमानुचरः
यम-अनुचर <i>m.</i> a servant or attendant of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमान्तक|यमान्तकः
यम-अन्तक <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमकिंकर
यम-किंकर <i>m.</i> a messenger of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमज|यमजः
यम-ज <i>a.</i> twin-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमदूत|यमदूतः
यम-दूत <i>m.</i> 1. a messenger of death; 2. a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमद्वितीया
यम-द्वितीया <i>f.</i> the seccnd day in the bright half of Kārtīka when sisters entertain their brothers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमधानी
यम-धानी <i>f.</i> Yama’s abode, विशति यमधानीजवनिकाम् Bhartr.ii.112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमभगिनी
यम-भगिनी <i>f.</i> the river Yamunā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमयातना
यम-यातना <i>f.</i> 1. the torture inflicted after death by Yama (lit.); 2. an extreme torture (fig.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमराज्
यम-राज् <i>m.</i> the god of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमवत्|यमवन्त्
यम-वत् <i>a.</i> one who has subdued his passions, यमवतामवतां च धुरि स्थितः R.ix.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमसात्
यम-सात् <i>ind.</i> to the power of Yama, in the hands of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमसूर्य|यमसूर्य्य
यम-सूर्य <i>n.</i> a building with two halls one with a western and the other with a northern aspect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमक|यमकं|यमकः
यमक <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Restraint, check; 2. a twin; 3. a religious observance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमक|यमकं|यमकः
यमक <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A double bandage; 2. repetition of the same syllables or words at the beginning, middle or end of a verse, rhyme (in rhetoric), (आवृत्तिं वर्णसंघातगोचरां यमकं विदुः K.D.i.61).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमन|यमनं|यमनः
यमन <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Restraining, governing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमनी
यमन <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Restraining, governing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमन|यमनं|यमनः
यमन <i>(II) m.</i> Yama, the god of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमन|यमनं|यमनः
यमन <i>(III) n.</i> 1. The act of restraining or binding; 2. cessation, rest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमनिका
यमनिका <i>f.</i> A curtain, a screen. Cf. जवनिका and यवनिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमल|यमलं|यमलः
यमल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> Twin, one of the pair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमला
यमल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> Twin, one of the pair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमल|यमलं|यमलः
यमल <i>(II) m.</i> the number ‘two.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमल|यमलं|यमलः
यमल <i>(III) n.</i> A pair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमली
यमली <i>f.</i> A pair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमुना
यमुना <i>f.</i> Name of a celebrated river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमुनाभ्रातृ
यमुना-भ्रातृ <i>m.</i> Yama, the god of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ययावर|ययावरः
ययावर <i>m.</i> The same as यायावर q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ययि|ययिः
