यर्हि
यर्हि <i>ind.</i> 1. When, while, whenever; 2. because. (It is the proper correlative of तर्हि but is rarely used in classics.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यव|यवः
यव <i>m.</i> 1. Barley, K.S.vii.82; 2. a barleycorn, the weight of a barleycorn; 3. a measure of length equal to 1/8 of an Angula; 4. a mark on the palm of the hand resembling a barleycorn and supposed to indicate good future (in palmistry).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवाग्रयण
