यवफल|यवफलः
यव-फल <i>m.</i> a bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवलास|यवलासः
