यवनानी
यवनानी <i>f.</i> The writing or language of the Yavanas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनिका
यवनिका <i>f.</i> 1. A Yavana woman, यवनीमुखपद्मानां सेहे मधुमदं न सः R.ii.61; (formerly Yavana girls vere employed as personal attendants on kings, usually carrying their bows and quivers, एष बाणासनहस्ताभिर्यवनीभिः परिवृत इत एवागच्छति प्रियवयस्यः Sak.ii.); 2. a curtain; (in this sense probably a corruption of जवनिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनी
यवनिका <i>f.</i> 1. A Yavana woman, यवनीमुखपद्मानां सेहे मधुमदं न सः R.ii.61; (formerly Yavana girls vere employed as personal attendants on kings, usually carrying their bows and quivers, एष बाणासनहस्ताभिर्यवनीभिः परिवृत इत एवागच्छति प्रियवयस्यः Sak.ii.); 2. a curtain; (in this sense probably a corruption of जवनिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=594-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवस|यवसं
