यवागू
यवागू <i>f.</i> Sour gruel made of rice or any other grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवानिका
यवानिका <i>f.</i> Bad barley, (दुष्टो यवो यवानी S.K.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

