यविष्ठा
यविष्ठ <i>(I) a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> Youngest, very young, (super. of युवन् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यविष्ठ|यविष्ठः
