यवीयस्
यवीयस् <i>(I) a. (f. सी)</i> Younger, (compar. of युवन् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवीयसी
यवीयस् <i>(I) a. (f. सी)</i> Younger, (compar. of युवन् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवीयस्
यवीयस् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A younger brother; 2. a Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्
यशस् <i>n.</i> Glory, fame, reputation, यशस्तु रक्ष्यं परतो यशोधनैः R.iii.48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्कर|यशस्करः
यशस्कर <i>a.</i> conferring fame, glorious, M.viii.387.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

