यष्टिनिवास|यष्टिनिवासः
यष्टि-निवास <i>m.</i> 1. a pole serving as a perch for birds; 2. a pigeon house standing on upright poles, वृक्षेशया यष्टिनिवासभङ्गात् R.xvi.14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिप्राण
यष्टि-प्राण <i>a.</i> powerless, feeble, out of breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिक|यष्टिकः
यष्टिक <i>m.</i> A lapwing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिका
यष्टिका <i>f.</i> 1. A staff, a stick; 2. a pearl necklace of one string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टी
यष्टी <i>f.</i> The same as यष्टि q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टृ
यष्टृ <i>m.</i> A worshiper, a sacrificer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यस्
यस् <i>vi. 1P, 4P (pp. यस्त; pres. यसाति, यस्यति)</i> To strive, to endeavur, to labour.With आ-, 1. to endeavour; 2. to be afflicted, e.g. नायस्यसि तपस्यंती गुरून् सम्यगतूतुषः.With प्र-, 1. to strive, to endeavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यस्
यस् <i>Caus. (यासयति-ते)</i> With आ-, to torment, to trouble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

या
या <i>vt. 2P (pp. यात; pres. याति; desid. यियासति)</i> 1. To go, to walk, to travel, किं यासि बालकदलीव विकंपमाना Mrich.i.; 2. to invade, M.vii.183; 3. to go away, to withdraw; 4. to pass away, to elapse (as time), क्रीडामुखैरिह तु यातु मदीयकालः Ch.P.36; 5. to last; 6. to come to pass; 7. to go or be reduced to any condition, to become; 8. to have carnal intercourse with; 9. to request, to solicit; 10. to discover, to perceive; 11. to attempt, न स्वस्य सिद्धौ यास्यामि सर्गव्यापारमात्मना K.S.ii.54.(The senses of या vary according to the word with which it is joined : thus अग्रे or पुरो या ‘to go before, to lead.’ अस्तं या ‘to go down, to set.’ पदं या ‘to attain to the position of.’ पारं या ‘to surmount, to accomplish.’ वशं या ‘to submit, to fall into the hands of.’ वाच्यतां या ‘to incur blame.’ विपर्यासं या ‘to change, to wear a different aspect.’)With अति-, 1. to transgress; 2. to surpass.With अधि-, 1. to escape, कुतोऽधियास्यसि क्रूर निहतस्तेन पत्रिभिः Bt.viii.90.With अनु-, 1. to follow, अनुयास्यन् मुनितनयां सहसा विनयेन वारितप्रसरः Sak.i.; 2. to imitate, न किलानुययुस्तस्य राजानो रक्षितर्यशः R.i.27.With अनुसम्- to visit in succession.With अप-, to fly away, to retreat.With अभि-, 1. to approach, अभिययौ स हिमाचलमुच्छ्रितम् Kir.v.1; 2. to invade, R.v.30.With आ-, 1. to come, to approach; 2. to undergo, to obtain, M.xii.69.With उप-, 1. to go to, to approach; 2. to attain; 3. to salute, to bow, e.g. तं व्याससूनुमुपयामि गुरुं मुनिनाम्.With निस्-, to go out or out of, R.xii.83.With परि-, to go round, to circum-ambulate.With प्र-, to march on, to set out.With प्रति-, to return, R.i.75.With प्रत्युद्-, to go to meet, to welcome, तानर्घानर्घ्यमादाय दूरात्प्रत्युद्ययौ गिरिः K.S.vi.50, R.i.49.With विनिस्-, to go away, to pass away, e.g. हास्यं नास्याद्विनिर्याति.With सम्-, 1. to enter, तथा शरीराणि विहाय जीर्णान्यन्यानि संयाति नवानि देही Bg.ii.22; 2. to go away, to depart, गृहीत्वैतानि संयाति वायुर्गंधानिवाशयात् xv.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

या
या <i>Caus. (यापयति-ते)</i> 1. to drive away, to remove, R.ix.31; 2. to pass, to spend, तावत्कोकिल विरसान् यापय दिवसान् वनाण्तरे निवसन् Bh.V.i.7; 3. to support.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=595-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याग|यागः
याग <i>m.</i> An offering, a sacrifice, any ceremony in which oblations are presented, R.viii.30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याच्
याच् <i>vt. 1U (pp. याचित; pres. याचति-ते) (This is one of those roots which take two accusatives, e.g. बलिं याचते वसुधाम्)</i> To ask, to solicit, to request, ययाचुश्चापरेऽभयम् Bt.xiv.105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचक|याचकः
याचक <i>m. (fem. ˚की)</i> A petitioner, a beggar, e.g. तृणादपि लघुस्तूलस्तूलादपि च याचकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचन|याचनं
याचन <i>n.</i> The act of asking or soliciting, begging, request, बध्यतामभययाचांजलिः R.xi.78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचना
याचना <i>f.</i> The act of asking or soliciting, begging, request, बध्यतामभययाचांजलिः R.xi.78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचनक|याचनकः
याचनक <i>m.</i> A petitioner, a suitor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचिष्णु
याचिष्णु <i>a.</i> Habitually begging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचित|याचितं
याचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Begged, requested, entreated, (pp. of याच् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचिता
याचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Begged, requested, entreated, (pp. of याच् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचितक|याचितकं
याचितक <i>n.</i> A thing obtained by begging, i.e. without a consideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याच्ञा
याच्ञा <i>f.</i> Begging, solicitation, mendicancy, request, entreaty, याच्ञा मोघा वरमधिगुणे नाधमे लब्धकामा Megh.i.6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजक|याजकः
याजक <i>m.</i> 1. A sacrificer, a sacrificing priest; 2. a royal elephant, an elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजन|याजनं
याजन <i>n.</i> The act of performing a sacrifice, M.i.88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञसेनी
याज्ञसेनी <i>f.</i> A patronymic of Draupadī, Ve.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञिक|याज्ञिकः
याज्ञिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Relating to a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञिकी
याज्ञिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Relating to a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञिक|याज्ञिकः
याज्ञिक <i>(II) m.</i> A sacrificer, a sacrificing priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्य|याज्यं|याज्यः
याज्य <i>(I) a. (f. ज्या)</i> 1. One for whom a sacrifice is performed; 2. one privileged to sacrifice, R.i.86; 3. to be sacrificed, sacrificial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्या
याज्य <i>(I) a. (f. ज्या)</i> 1. One for whom a sacrifice is performed; 2. one privileged to sacrifice, R.i.86; 3. to be sacrificed, sacrificial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्य|याज्यं|याज्यः
याज्य <i>(II) m.</i> A sacrificer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्य|याज्यं|याज्यः
याज्य <i>(III) n.</i> The presents obtained by an officiating priest at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात|यातं|यातः
यात <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Gone, walked; 2. gone away, departed, (pp. of या q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याता
यात <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Gone, walked; 2. gone away, departed, (pp. of या q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात|यातं|यातः
यात <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Going, motion; 2. the past time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातयाम|यातयामं
यात-याम, -यामन् <i>a.</i> 1. stale, used, spoiled; 2. raw, half-ripe, half-cooked, यातयामं गतरसं भोजनं तामसप्रियम् Bg.xvii.10; 3. exhausted, aged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातयामन्
यात-याम, -यामन् <i>a.</i> 1. stale, used, spoiled; 2. raw, half-ripe, half-cooked, यातयामं गतरसं भोजनं तामसप्रियम् Bg.xvii.10; 3. exhausted, aged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातन|यातनं
यातन <i>n.</i> 1. Requital, retaliation, recompense; 2. revenge, vengeance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातना
यातना <i>f.</i> 1. Requital, recompense; 2. acute pain, torment, agony; 3. punishment inflicted by Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातु|यातुः
यातु <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A traveller, a wayfarer; 2. wind; 3. time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातु|यातुः
यातु <i>(II) m.n.</i> An evil spirit, a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातुधान|यातुधानः
यातु-धान <i>m.</i> an evil spirit, a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातृ
यातृ <i>f.</i> A husband’s brother’s wife, R.xii.45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रा
यात्रा <i>f.</i> 1. Going, journey, R.xviii.16; 2. a march or expedition of an army, मार्गशीर्षे शुभे मासि यायाद् यात्रां महीपतिः M.vii.182; 3. a pilgrimage; 4. a company of pilgrims; 5. a festival, a festive procession, a fair, कालप्रियनाथस्य यात्राप्रसंगेन M.M.i.; 6. a road; 7. support of life, livelihood, subsistence, शरीरयात्रापि च ते न प्रसिध्येदकर्मणः Bg.iii.8; 8. passing away (as time); 9. intercourse, दायाद्यस्य प्रदानं च यात्रा चैव हि लौकिकी M.xi.184; 10. way, means; 11. a vehicle in general; 12. custom, practice, एषोदिता लोकयात्रा नित्यं स्त्रीपुंसयोः शुभा M.ix.25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रिक|यात्रिकः
यात्रिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Relating to a campaign or a journey; 2. requisite for the support of life; 3. customary, usual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रिकी
यात्रिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Relating to a campaign or a journey; 2. requisite for the support of life; 3. customary, usual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रिक|यात्रिकः
यात्रिक <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A march, an expedition; 2. provisions, supplies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याथातथ्य|याथातथ्यं
याथातथ्य <i>n.</i> 1. Reality, truth; 2. rectitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याथार्थ्य|याथार्थ्यं
याथार्थ्य <i>n.</i> 1. Real nature, truth, स्वपतो जागरूकस्य याथार्थ्यं वेद कस्तव R.x.24, K.S.v.77; 2. suitableness; 3. attainment of an object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादव|यादवः
यादव <i>m.</i> A descendant of Yadu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादस्
यादस् <i>n.</i> Any large aquatic animal, a sea-monster, वरुणो यादसामहम् Bg.x.29, R.i.16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादसांपति|यादसाम्पति|यादसांपतिः
यादसांपति <i>m.</i> 1. the ocean; 2. name of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादसांनाथ
यादसांपति <i>m.</i> 1. the ocean; 2. name of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादःपति|यादःपतिः
यादसांपति <i>m.</i> 1. the ocean; 2. name of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादोनाथ|यादोनाथः
यादसांपति <i>m.</i> 1. the ocean; 2. name of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृक्ष|यादृक्षः
यादृक्ष <i>a. (f. क्षी)</i> What-like, of what nature, Bg.xiii.3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृक्षी
यादृक्ष <i>a. (f. क्षी)</i> What-like, of what nature, Bg.xiii.3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृच्छिक|यादृच्छिकः
यादृच्छिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Voluntary, independant; 2. accidental, unexpected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृच्छिकी
यादृच्छिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Voluntary, independant; 2. accidental, unexpected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यान|यानं|यानः
यान <i>n.</i> 1. Marching, attacking, M.vii.160, 2. going, a journey, a voyage, समुदयानकुशला देशकालार्थदर्शिनः M.viii.157; 3. a procession; 4. a carriage, a chariot, a vehicle in general, यानादवातरददूरमहीतलेन R.xiii.69, K.S.vi.76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानपात्र|यानपात्रं
यान-पात्र <i>n.</i> a ship, a boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=596-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

