यु
यु <i>(I) vt. 2P (pp. युत; pres. यौति; desid. यियविषति or युयूषति)</i> 1. To join, to mix.; 2. to separate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=597-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यु
यु <i>(II) vt. 9U (pres. युनाति, युनीते)</i> To bind.With व्यति-, to mix, अन्योन्यं स्म व्यतियुतः शब्दाञ् शब्दैस्तु भीषणान् Bt.viii.6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=597-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्त|युक्तं|युक्तः
युक्त <i>(I) a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Primitive, not derived from another word; 2. attentive, absorbed in, meditative; 3. experienced, skilful; 4. active; 5. proper, fit, (with a gen. or loc.); 6. yoked, e.g. भानुः सकृद्युक्ततुरंग एव; 7. accompanied, (pp. of युज् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=597-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

