युता
युत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Joined with, united with, together with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

