युयुत्सा <i>f.</i> Desire to fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युयुत्सु|युयुत्सुः
युयुत्सु <i>a.</i> Warring, hostile, ambitious, धर्मक्षेत्रे कुरुक्षेत्रे समवेता युयुत्सवः Bg.i.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवति|युवतिः
युवति(ती) <i>f.</i> A young woman, युवतिजनकथामूकभावः परेषाम् Bhartr.ii.26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवती
युवति(ती) <i>f.</i> A young woman, युवतिजनकथामूकभावः परेषाम् Bhartr.ii.26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवन्
युवन् <i>(I) a. (f. युवति-ती or यूनी; compar. यवीयम् or कनीयस्; super. यविष्ठ or कनिष्ठ)</i> 1. Young, youthful, arrived at puberty, R.iii.70; 2. strong; 3. excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवति|युवतिः
युवन् <i>(I) a. (f. युवति-ती or यूनी; compar. यवीयम् or कनीयस्; super. यविष्ठ or कनिष्ठ)</i> 1. Young, youthful, arrived at puberty, R.iii.70; 2. strong; 3. excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवन्
युवन् <i>(II) m. (nom. युवा-वानौ-वानः; acc. pl. यूनः)</i> 1. A young man, यूनां मनः सुवदने नियतं हरंति Rt.vi.21; 2. a younger descendant, the elder being alive, (जीवति तु वंश्ये युवा Pan.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवखलति
युवन्-खलति <i>a. (f. ति, ती)</i> bald in youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवखलति
युवन्-खलति <i>a. (f. ति, ती)</i> bald in youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवखलती
युवन्-खलति <i>a. (f. ति, ती)</i> bald in youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवराज्
युवन्-राज्, -राज <i>m.</i> an heir apparent, a crown prince, निसर्गसंस्कारविनीत इत्यसौ नृपेण चक्रे युवराजशब्दभाक् R.iii.35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवराज|युवराजः
युवन्-राज्, -राज <i>m.</i> an heir apparent, a crown prince, निसर्गसंस्कारविनीत इत्यसौ नृपेण चक्रे युवराजशब्दभाक् R.iii.35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मद्
युष्मद् <i>pron. (the second personal pronoun) (nom. त्वम्, युवां, यूयम्)</i> You, thou.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूक|यूकः
यूक <i>m.</i> A louse, M.i.45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूका
यूका <i>f.</i> A louse, M.i.45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूति|यूतिः
यूति <i>f.</i> Mixing, union, connection, करोमि वो बहिर्यूतीन् पिदध्वं पाणिभिर्दृशः Bt.vii.69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथ|यूथं
यूथ <i>n.</i> A herd, a multitude, a troop of beasts, स्त्रीरत्नेषु ममोर्वशी प्रियतमा यूथे तवेयं वशा Vikr.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथनाथ|यूथनाथः
यूथ-नाथ, -प, -पति <i>m.</i> 1. a keeper of a troop, a chief; 2. the leader of a herd, गजयूथप यूथिकाशबलकेशी Vikr.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथप|यूथपः
यूथ-नाथ, -प, -पति <i>m.</i> 1. a keeper of a troop, a chief; 2. the leader of a herd, गजयूथप यूथिकाशबलकेशी Vikr.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथपति|यूथपतिः
यूथ-नाथ, -प, -पति <i>m.</i> 1. a keeper of a troop, a chief; 2. the leader of a herd, गजयूथप यूथिकाशबलकेशी Vikr.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथिका
यूथिका <i>f.</i> A kind of jasmine, नवजलकणैर्यूथिकाजालकानि Megh.i.26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथी
यूथिका <i>f.</i> A kind of jasmine, नवजलकणैर्यूथिकाजालकानि Megh.i.26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूप|यूपः
यूप <i>m.</i> A sacrificial post of bamboo or Khadira wood to which the victim is tied, ग्रामेष्वात्मविसृष्टेषु यूपचिह्नेषु यज्वनाम् R.i.44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूष|यूषं|यूषः
यूष <i>m.n. (यूषन् is optionally substituted for this word in some cases)</i> Broth, pease-soup.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

येन
येन <i>ind. (inst. sing. of यत्, used as an adverb)</i> 1. By which means, whereby, wherefore, धुरि स्थिता त्वं पतिदेवतानां किं तत्र येनासि ममानुकंप्या R.xiv.74; 2. as, so that, मम चैतावांल्लोभविरहो येन स्वहस्तस्थमपि सुवर्णकंकणं यस्मैकस्मैचिदातुमिच्छामि Hit.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योक्त्र|योक्त्रं
योक्त्र <i>n.</i> A cord, a rope for tying the yoke of a plough or carriage, M.viii.292.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योग|योगः
योग <i>m.</i> 1. Junction, union, अन्योन्यशोभापरिवृद्धये वां योगस्तडित्तोयदयोरिवास्तु R.vi.65; 2. connection, contact, ततस्तदीयाधरयावयोगादुदेति बिंबारुणबिंब एषः Na.xxii.46; 3. a yoke; 4. a conveyance, a carriage; 5. application, use, means, नय इव पणबंधव्यक्तयोगैरुपायैः R.x.86, M.ix.10; 6. connection, consequence, स प्रीतियोगाद्विकसन्मुखश्रीः K.S.vii.55, Kir.v.52; 7. an annour; 8. propriety; 9. artifice, fraud, M.viii.165; 10. charm, spell, magic; 11. remedy, cure; 12. wealth, acquisition; 13. occupation, work; 14. association, mixture; 15. religious and abstract meditation, contemplation of the Supreme Spirit, (defined by Patanjali as (चित्तवृत्तिनिरोध) वार्धकेमुनिवृत्त्तीनां योगेनांते तनुत्वजाम् R.i.8; 16. the system of philosophy established by Patanjali, in which abstract meditation of the Supreme Being is inculcated as the only way to absolution and rules for its practice are laid down), यद्वेदाध्ययनं तथोपनिषदां सांख्यस्य योगस्य च ज्ञानम् M.M.i.; 17. an artificial astronomical division of time; 18. the principal star in a lunar mansion; 19. a spy; 20. a violator of truth; 21. etymological meaning of word (as op. to रूढि), e.g. योगाद् रूढिर्बलीयसी; 22. mutual connection of words, dependance of one word upon another; 23. a rule, a precept; 24. endeavour, zeal, इंद्रियाणां जये योगं समातिष्ठद्दिवानिशम् M.vii.44; 25. addition (in math.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगांग|योगाङ्ग
योग-अंग <i>n.</i> a means of attaining Yoga; (these are eight- यम, नियम, आसन, प्राणायाम, प्रत्याहार, धारणा, ध्यान and समाधि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाचार|योगाचारः
योग-आचार <i>m.</i> 1. the observance of Yoga; 2. a follower of that Buddhist sect which maintains the eternal existence of intelligence alone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाचार्य|योगाचार्यः
योग-आचार्य <i>m.</i> 1. a teacher of magic; 2. a teacher of the Yoga philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाधमन|योगाधमनं
योग-आधमन, -आवापक <i>n.</i> a fraudulent pledge, M.viii.165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगावापक
योग-आधमन, -आवापक <i>n.</i> a fraudulent pledge, M.viii.165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगासन|योगासनं
योग-आसन <i>n.</i> the posture fitted for profound and abstract meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगेंद्र|योगेन्द्र|योगेन्द्रः
योग-इंद्र, -ईश, -ईश्वर <i>m.</i> 1. an adept in Yoga; 2. one who has obtained superhuman faculties; 3. an epithet of Śiva; 4. of Yājnyavalkya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगेश|योगेशः
योग-इंद्र, -ईश, -ईश्वर <i>m.</i> 1. an adept in Yoga; 2. one who has obtained superhuman faculties; 3. an epithet of Śiva; 4. of Yājnyavalkya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगेश्वर|योगेश्वरः
योग-इंद्र, -ईश, -ईश्वर <i>m.</i> 1. an adept in Yoga; 2. one who has obtained superhuman faculties; 3. an epithet of Śiva; 4. of Yājnyavalkya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगक्षेम|योगक्षेमं|योगक्षेमः
योग-क्षेम <i>(I) m.</i> 1. security of property, welfare, prosperity, मुग्धाया मे जनन्या योगक्षेमं वहस्व Mal.iv.; 2. the charge for securing property, insurance; 3. property, gain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगक्षेम|योगक्षेमं|योगक्षेमः
योग-क्षेम <i>(II) m. or n. du. (or n. sing.)</i> gain and security, maintenance of the old and acquisition of the new, (अलभ्यलाभो योगः । लब्धपरिपालनं क्षेमः Vijnyāneśvara on Yaj.i.100), तेषां नित्याभियुक्तानां योगक्षेमं वहाम्यहम् Bg.ix.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगचूर्ण
योग-चूर्ण <i>m.n.</i> magical powder, फणिमुखकाकलीसंदंशकपुरुषशीर्षकयोगचूर्णयोगवर्तिकाप्रभृत्यनेकोपकरणयुक्तः D.K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगतारका
योग-तारका, -तारा <i>f.</i> the chief star in a constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगतारा
योग-तारका, -तारा <i>f.</i> the chief star in a constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगदान|योगदानं
योग-दान <i>n.</i> 1. communicating the Yoga doctrine; 2. a fraudulent gift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगधारणा
योग-धारणा <i>f.</i> perseverance in devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगनाथ|योगनाथः
योग-नाथ, -पति <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva or Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपति|योगपतिः
योग-नाथ, -पति <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva or Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगनिद्रा
योग-निद्रा <i>f.</i> 1. a state of half contemplation and half sleep; 2. the sleep of Viṣṇu at the end of the world, R.x.14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपट्ट|योगपट्टं
योग-पट्ट <i>n.</i> a cloth thrown over the back and knees of an ascetic during meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगबल
योग-बल <i>n.</i> 1. supernatural power, the power of devotion; 2. power of magic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगमाया
योग-माया <i>f.</i> 1. the personified power of God in the creation of the world; 2. a name of the goddess Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरंग|योगरङ्ग|योगरङ्गः
योग-रंग <i>m.</i> the orange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरूढ|योगरूढः
योग-रूढ <i>m.</i> a word which retains only a part of its etymological meaning; (the word पंकज, for instance, may etymologically mean ‘anything produced in mud,’ but its meanings are restricted to only some of the thing so produced).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरोचना
योग-रोचना <i>f.</i> a magical ointment having the power of making one invisible or invulnerable, तेन च परितुष्टेन योगरोचना मे दत्ता Mrich.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवर्तिका|योगवर्त्तिका
योग-वर्तिका <i>f.</i> a magical lamp, a magical lantern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=599-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

