योग्यता
योग्य-ता <i>f.</i> 1. propriety, appropriateness; (in Nyāya philosophy योग्यता is defined as the capability of a word to be used in a certain sense in a certain context); 2. ability, capability, धारणासु योग्यता मनसः Yoga.S.ii.53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=600-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

