रक्ष्
रक्ष् <i>vt. 1P (pp. रक्षित; pres. रक्षति)</i> 1. To guard, to protect, असृष्ट यो यश्च भयेष्वरक्षीत् Bt.iii.4; 2. to preserve, to save, रक्षंतस्तपसि बलं च लोकपालाः Kir.v.50, R.ii.50; 3. to take care of, to watch, भवानिमां प्रतिकृतिं रक्षसु Sak.vi.(The root is often used with सम् without any change in meaning.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=602-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

