रच्
रच् <i>vt. 10U (pp. रचित; pres. रचयति-ते)</i> 1. To make, to fabricate; 2. to create, to effect, माधुर्यं मधुबिंदुना रचयितुं क्षारांबुधेरीहते Bhartr.ii.6; 3. to prepare, to arrange, to contrive, रचयति शयनं सचकितनयनं पश्यति तव पंथानम् Git.G.v.; 4. to compose, to write, उन्नमितैकभ्रूलतमाननमस्याः पदानि रचयंत्याः Sak.iii.; 5. to place in or on, to fix on, K.S.iv.34; 6. to decorate, to adorn, Megh.ii.3.With वि-, 1. to arrange; 2. to effect, Bh.V.i.30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=603-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

