रजोहर|रजोहरः
रजोहर <i>m.</i> a washerman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=603-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजसानु|रजसानुः
रजसानु <i>m.</i> 1. A cloud; 2. soul, heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=603-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्वल|रजस्वलः
रजस्वल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Dusty, covered with dust, R.xi.50; 2. full of passion, M.vi.77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=603-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्वला
रजस्वल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Dusty, covered with dust, R.xi.50; 2. full of passion, M.vi.77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=603-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

