रजस्वला
रजस्वला <i>f.</i> 1. A woman during her courses, रजस्वलामुखास्वादः सुरापानसमानि च Yaj.iii.229, R.xi.60; 2. a marriageable girl, one above ten years of age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=603-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रज्जु|रज्जुः
रज्जु <i>f.</i> 1. A rope, a cord; 2. a sinew proceeding from the vertibral column; 3. a lock of braided hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=603-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रज्जुदालक|रज्जुदालकः
