रंज्|रञ्ज्
रंज् <i>vt. or vi. 1U, 4U (pp. रक्त; pres. रजति-ते, रज्यति-ते; pass. रज्यते)</i> 1. To be coloured, to be dyed, to redden, Na.iii.120; 2. to dye, to colour, to tinge; 3. to be attached or devoted to, (with a loc.), निर्गुणानपि न द्वेष्टि न रजयति गुणेष्वपि S.D.iii.; 4. to be affected or excited, to feel passion for; 5. to be pleased or delighted with.With अनु-, 1. to redden; 2. to be fond of, to love, (with a loc.), M.iii.73; 3. to be attached, Bg.xi.36.With अप-, 1. to be discoloured, बिभ्रत्कांचनमेकमेव वलयं श्वासापरक्ताधरः Sak.vi.; 2. to become discontented with, (with an abl.), नयहीनादपरज्यते जनः Kir.ii.49.With उप-, 1. to be eclipsed, उपरज्यते किल भगवांश्चंद्र इति Mud.i.; 2. to be afflicted, to suffer calamity.With वि-, 1. to grow discoloured of soiled; 2. to be disinclined, to dislike, चिरानुरक्तोऽपि विरज्यते जनः Mrich.i., Bt.xviii.22; 3. to be disgusted with the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=603-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंज्|रञ्ज्
रंज् <i>Caus. (रंजयति-ते)</i> 1. to colour, to paint, to redden, च्रणौ रंजयंस्त्वस्याश्चूडामणिमरीचिभिः K.S.vi.81; 2. to gratify, to please, ज्ञानलवदुर्विदग्धं ब्रह्मापि नरं न रंजयति Bhartr.ii.3; 3. to conciliate, M.vii.19; 4. (रजयति) to hunt deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=603-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंजक|रञ्जक|रञ्जकं|रञ्जकः
रंजक <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A painter; 2. a stimulus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंजक|रञ्जक|रञ्जकं|रञ्जकः
रंजक <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Red sandal; 2. vermilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंजन|रञ्जन|रञ्जनं|रञ्जनः
रंजन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of colouring or painting; 2. colour, dye; 3. pleasing, delighting, gratifying, तथैव सोभूदन्वर्थो राजा प्रकृतिरंजनात् R.iv.12; 4. red sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंजनी
रंजनी <i>f.</i> The Indigo plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रट्
रट् <i>vi. 1P (pp. रटित; pres. रटति)</i> 1. To shout, to roar, to yell, पपात राक्षसो भूमौ रराट च भयंकरम् Bt.xiv.81; 2. to call out, to proclaim aloud; 3. to shout with joy, to applaud.With आ-, to call to, प्रियसहचरमपश्यन्त्यातुरा चक्रवाक्यारटति Sak.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रटन|रटनं
रटन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of crying or shouting; 2. a shout of applause or approbation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रण्
रण् <i>vi. 1P (pp. रणित; pres. रणति)</i> To sound, to ring, to gingle, चरणरणितमणिनूपुरया परिपूरितसुरतवितानम् Git.G.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रण|रणं|रणः
रण <i>(I) m.n.</i> 1. War, combat, fight, रणः प्रववृते तत्र भीमः प्लवगरक्षसाम् R.xii.72; 2. a battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रण|रणं|रणः
रण <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Sound, noise; 2. the bow of a lute; 3. motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

