रण-रंक <i>m.</i> the space between the tusks of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरंग|रणरङ्ग|रणरङ्गः
रण-रंग <i>n.</i> a battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरण|रणरणं|रणरणः
रण-रण <i>(I) m.</i> a gnat, a musquito.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरण|रणरणं|रणरणः
रण-रण <i>(II) n.</i> 1. longing, anxious desire; 2. regret for a lost object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरणक|रणरणकः
रण-रणक <i>(I) m.n.</i> 1. regret for some beloved object, रणरणकविवृद्बिंबिभ्रदावर्तमानम् M.M.i.; 2. desire, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरणक|रणरणकः
