रण-वाद्य <i>n.</i> a military instrument of music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणशिक्षा
रण-शिक्षा <i>f.</i> the art or science of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणसंकुल|रणसङ्कुल|रणसङ्कुलं
