रणसज्जा
रण-सज्जा <i>f.</i> military accoutrements.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणस्तंभ|रणस्तम्भ|रणस्तम्भः
