रणत्कार|रणत्कारः
रणत्कार <i>m.</i> A rutting sound, a sound in general, humming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणित|रणितं
रणित <i>n.</i> Gingling, rattling, ringing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रण्ड|रंड|रण्डः
रण्ड <i>m.</i> 1. A man who dies without male issue; 2. a barren tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रण्डा
रण्डा <i>f.</i> 1. A widow; 2. a slut, a term of abuse in addressing women, केशेष्वाकृष्य तां रण्डां पाखंडेषु नियोजय Pr.Ch.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=604-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत|रतं
