रथ्य|रथ्यः
रथ्य <i>m.</i> 1. A chariot-horse, धावन्त्यमी मृगजवाक्षमयेव रथ्याः Sak.i.; 2. a part of a chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथ्या
रथ्या <i>f.</i> 1. A road for carriages, a high road, वशी विवेश चायोध्यां रथ्यासंस्कारशोभिनीम् R.xv.88; 2. a plain where several roads meet; 3. an assemblage of carriages or chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

