रध्
रध् <i>vt. 4P (pp. रद्ध; pres. रध्यति; caus. रंधयति)</i> 1. To injure, to torment, to kill, अक्षं रधितुमारेभे रद्धा लंकानिवासिनाम् Bt.ix.29; 2. to cook, to prepare (food).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्तु|रंतुः|रन्तुः
