रंधन|रन्धन|रंधनं|रन्धनं
रंधन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of destroying; 2. of cooking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंधि|रन्धि|रंधिः|रन्धिः
रंधि <i>f.</i> 1. The act of destroying; 2. of cooking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंध्र|रन्ध्र|रंध्रं
रंध्र <i>n.</i> 1. A hole, an aperture, an opening, a cavity, हंसद्वारं भृगुपतियशोवर्त्म यत्क्रौंचरंध्रम् Megh.i.57, R.xv.82; 2. a defect, a weak poiut, a fault, an imperfection, रंध्रान्वेषणदक्षाणां द्विषामामिषतां ययौ R.xii.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंध्रबभ्रु|रन्ध्रबभ्रु|रन्ध्रबभ्रुः
