रंध्रवंश|रन्ध्रवंश|रन्ध्रवंशः
रंध्र-वंश <i>m.</i> a hollow bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रभ्
रभ् <i>vt. 1Ā (pp. रब्ध; pres. रभते; caus. रंभयति-ते; desid. रिप्सते)</i> To be in.With आ- or प्रा-, 1. to begin, to commence, आरेभिरे जितात्मानः पुत्रियामिष्टिमृत्विजः R.x.4; 2. to set about, to attempt, देवेन प्रतिषिद्धे वसंतोत्सवे त्वमाम्रकलिकाभंगं किमारभसे Sak.vi., R.viii.45.With परि-, to embrace, उवाच मेना परिरभ्य वक्षसा K.S.v.3.With सम्-, 1. to be exasperated, to be enraged, R.xvi.16; 2. to be agitated or overwhelmed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रभस|रभसः
रभस <i>(I) a. (f. सा)</i> 1. Violent, fierce, wild; 2. eager, powerful, strong, अथ जयाय नु मेरुमहीभृतो रभसया नु दिगंतदिदृक्षया Kir.v.1, R.ix.61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रभसा
रभस <i>(I) a. (f. सा)</i> 1. Violent, fierce, wild; 2. eager, powerful, strong, अथ जयाय नु मेरुमहीभृतो रभसया नु दिगंतदिदृक्षया Kir.v.1, R.ix.61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रभस|रभसः
रभस <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Violence, vehemence, speed, haste, त्वदभिसरणरभसेन वलन्ती Git.G.vi.; 2. precipitation, rashness, अतिरभसकृतानां कर्मणामाविपत्तेर्भवति हृदयदाही शल्यतुल्यो विपाकः Bhartr.ii.99; 3. regret, sorrow; 4. passion, rage; 5. joy, pleasure, विलसति रभसहसितवदने Git.G.xi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=605-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्
रम् <i>vi. 1Ā (pp. रत; pres. रमते; desid. रिरंसते)</i> 1. To rest, to remain quiet, to stay, to use; 2. to be pleased or lighted, to rejoice at, लोलापांगैर्यदि न रमसे लौचनैर्वचितोसि Megh.i.27; 3. to play, to sport with, मत्तो मांतर्धियाः सीते मा रस्था जीवितेन नः Bt.vi.15; 4. to have sexual intercourse with, स्वच्छंदं बहुवल्लभः स रमते Git.G.vii.With अभि-, to rejoice, to be delighted, Bg.xviii.45.With आ-, 1. to cease, to rest, M.ii.73; 2. to take pleasure in, Bt.viii.52.With उप-, 1. to cease, to stop, to end, यत्रोपरमते चित्तं निरुद्धं योगसेवया Bg.vi.20; 2. to desist from, उपारंसीच्च संपश्यन्वानरस्तं चिकीर्षितात् Bt.viii.54; 3. to die.With परि-, (Par.) to be delighted, Bt.viii.53.With वि-, 1. to cease, to end, अविदित गतयामा रात्रिरेव व्यरंसीत् Ut.i.; 2. to desist, to stop, ज्वरज्वाला शांता तदपि न वराकी विरमति Bhartr.iii.67; (often with an abl., वत्सैतस्माद्विरम विरमातः परं न क्षमोस्मि Ut.i.).With सम्-, to rejoice, Bt.xix.30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्
रम् <i>Caus. (रमयति-ते)</i> to please, to delight, to amuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम|रमः
रम <i>m.</i> 1. Joy; 2. a lover, husband; 3. the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमठ|रमठं
रमठ <i>n.</i> Asa Fœtida.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमठध्वनि|रमठध्वनिः
रमठ-ध्वनि <i>m.</i> the same as रमठ q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमण|रमणं|रमणः
रमण <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> Pleasing, delightful, charming, Bt.vi.77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणी
रमण <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> Pleasing, delightful, charming, Bt.vi.77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमण|रमणं|रमणः
रमण <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A lover, a husband, प्रायेणैते रमणविरहेष्वंगनानां विनोदाः Megh.ii.24, R.xiv.27; 2. the god of love; 3. an ass; 4. a testicle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमण|रमणं|रमणः
रमण <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Sporting; 2. dalliance, amorous sport; 3. coition; 4. pleasure in general; 5. the hip and the loins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणा
रमणा <i>f.</i> 1. A charming woman; 2. a wife, a mistress, रतिश्रांता शेते रजनिरमणी गाढमुरसि K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणी
रमणा <i>f.</i> 1. A charming woman; 2. a wife, a mistress, रतिश्रांता शेते रजनिरमणी गाढमुरसि K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणीय|रमणीयं
रमणीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Pleasant, delightful, handsome, charming, प्रियायाः साबाधं तदपि रमणीयं वपुरिदम् Sak.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणीया
रमणीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Pleasant, delightful, handsome, charming, प्रियायाः साबाधं तदपि रमणीयं वपुरिदम् Sak.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमा
रमा <i>f.</i> 1. A wife, a mistress; 2. an epithet of Lakṣmī, the wife of Viṣṇu and the goddess of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमाकान्त|रमाकान्तः
रमा-कान्त, -नाथ, -पति <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमानाथ|रमानाथः
रमा-कान्त, -नाथ, -पति <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमापति|रमापतिः
