रम्भोरू
रम्भा-ऊरु <i>a. (f. रु or रू)</i> having thighs as full and round as a plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=606-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

