रसाभास|रसाभासः
रस-आभास <i>m.</i> the semblance or mere appearance of a sentiment, the sentiment when its manifestation is degrading or improper (in rhetoric).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसास्वाद|रसास्वादः
रस-आस्वाद <i>m.</i> the perception of a sentiment in poetry, sense of poetical beauty, e.g. संसारविषवृक्षस्य द्वे एव रसवत्फलैः । काव्यामृतरसास्वादः संगश्च सुजनैः सह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसेंद्र|रसेन्द्र|रसेन्द्रः
