रस-प्रबन्ध <i>m.</i> any poetical composition, especially a drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसफल|रसफलः
रस-फल <i>m.</i> the cocoanut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसभंग|रसभङ्ग|रसभङ्गः
रस-भंग <i>m.</i> the interruption or cessation of a sentiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसराज|रसराजः
रस-राज <i>m.</i> quick-silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसवत्|रसवन्त्
रस-वत् <i>(I) a.</i> 1. juicy; 2. tasteful, savoury, well-flavoured; 3. moist, well-watered; 4. charming, elegant; 5. possessing love and other sentiments; 6. spirited, witty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसवत्|रसवन्त्
रस-वत् <i>(II) n.</i> a figure in which a subordinate sentiment is employed to heighten the principal one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसवती
रस-वती <i>f.</i> a kitchen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसविक्रय|रसविक्रयः
रस-विक्रय <i>m.</i> the sale of liquors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

