रस-सिद्धि <i>f.</i> skill in alchemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसन|रसनं|रसनः
रसन <i>n.</i> 1. Crying, roaring, sound, noise; 2. rumbling of clouds, thunder; 3. taste, flavour, सन्धिः शबलता चेति सर्वेपि रसनाद्रसाः S.D.iii.; 4. the organ of taste, the tongue, श्रोत्रं चक्षुः स्पर्शनं च रसनं घ्राणमेव च Bg.xv.9; 5. a perception, apprehension, sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसना
रसना <i>f.</i> 1. The tongue, सोऽपूर्वो रसनाविपर्ययविधिस्तत्कर्नयोश्चापलम् K.Pr.x.; 2. a zone, a woman’s girdle, रसतु रसनापि तव घनजघनमण्डले Git.G.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=607-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसनारद|रसनारदः
