रहस्
रहस् <i>(I) n.</i> 1. Solitude, privacy, secrecy, R.iii.3; 2. a lonely place, a hiding-place; 3. a secret, a mystery; 4. copulation; 5. a privity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=608-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रहस्
रहस् <i>(II) ind.</i> Secretly, clandestinely, in secret, अतः परीक्ष्य कर्तव्यं विशेषात्संगतं रहः Sak.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=608-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रहस्य|रहस्यं
रहस्य <i>(I) a. (f. स्या)</i> 1. Secret, clandestine; 2. mysterious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=608-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रहस्या
रहस्य <i>(I) a. (f. स्या)</i> 1. Secret, clandestine; 2. mysterious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=608-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रहस्य|रहस्यं
रहस्य <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A secret, रहस्याख्यायीव स्वनसि मृदु कर्णान्तिकचरः Sak.i.; 2. the secret of conduct, र्हस्यं साधूनामनुपत्धि व्शुद्धं विजयते Ut.ii.; 3. any esoteric teaching, भक्तोऽसि मे सखाचेति रहस्यं ह्येतदुत्तमम् Bg.iv.3.(रहस्यम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of secretly, privately,’ अनभिख्यातदोषास्तु रहस्यं व्रतमाचरेत् Yaj.iii.301.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=608-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रहस्यभेद|रहस्यभेदः
रहस्य-भेद, -विभेद <i>m.</i> disclosure of a secret or mystery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=608-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रहस्यविभेद|रहस्यविभेदः
रहस्य-भेद, -विभेद <i>m.</i> disclosure of a secret or mystery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=608-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

