राज्
राज् <i>vi. 1U (pp. राजित; pres. राजति-ते)</i> 1. To be eminent or splendid, to shine, to glitter, प्रचीयमानावयवा रराज सा R.iii.7; 2. to appear as, to appear like, तोयान्तभास्करालीव रेजे मुनिपरंपरा K.S.vi.49.With निस्-, to shine, to be brilliant, दिव्यास्त्रस्फुरदुग्रदाधीतिशिखानीराजितज्यं धनुः Ut.vi.With वि-, to shine, to appear like, R.ii.20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=608-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राज्
राज् <i>Caus. (राजयति-ते)</i> With निस्-, 1. to adorn, to make brilliant, to illuminate; 2. to wave lights before an idol or a king (as an act of worship), नीराजयंति भूपालाः पादपाठान्तभुतलम् Pr.Ch.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=608-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

