रामठ <i>m.n.</i> Asa Fœtida.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रामणीयक|रामणीयकं
रामणीयक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Beautiful, pleasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रामणीयकी
रामणीयक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> Beautiful, pleasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रामणीयक|रामणीयकं
रामणीयक <i>(II) n.</i> Loveliness, charmingness, beauty, सा रामणीयकनिधेरधिदेवता M.M.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रामा
रामा <i>f.</i> 1. A beautiful woman, a young and charming woman; 2. a woman in general, रामा हरंति हृदयं प्रसभं नराणाम् Rt.vi.25; 3. a woman of low origin; 4. vermilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रांभ|राम्भ|रांभः|राम्भः
रांभ <i>m.</i> A staff of bamboo carried by an ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राव|रावः
राव <i>m.</i> 1. A cry, a roar, the cry of any animal; 2. a sound in general, श्रुणु रमणीयतरं तरुणीजनमोहनमधुरिपुरावम् Git.G.ix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रावण|रावणः
रावण <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> Crying, roaring, bewailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रावणी
रावण <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> Crying, roaring, bewailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रावण|रावणः
रावण <i>(II) m.</i> Name of a demon, king of Lankā, and enemy of Rāma. (See App. II.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रावणि|रावणिः
रावणि <i>m.</i> An epithet of Indrajit, एष रावणिरापादि वानराणां भयंकरः Bt.xv.89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राशि|राशिः
राशि <i>m.</i> 1. A heap, a pile, a mass, a multitude, मृदुनि मृगशरीरे पुष्पराशाविवाग्निः Sak.i.; 2. the number or figures put down for an arithmetical calculation; 3. a sign of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राश्यधिप|राश्यधिपः
राशि-अधिप <i>m.</i> the regent of an astrological house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राशिचक्र|राशिचक्रं
राशि-चक्र <i>n.</i> the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राशित्रय
राशि-त्रय <i>n.</i> the rule of three.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राशिभाग|राशिभागः
राशि-भाग <i>m.</i> a fraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राशिभागानुबंध|राशिभागानुबन्ध
राशि-भाग˚अनुबंध <i>m.</i> the addition of fractions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राशिभोग|राशिभोगः
राशि-भोग <i>m.</i> the passage of the sun or any planet through a sign of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राष्ट्र|राष्ट्रं|राष्ट्रः
राष्ट्र <i>(I) n.</i> 1. A kingdom, a realm, राष्ट्रिकैः सह तद्राष्ट्रं क्षिप्रमेव विनश्यति M.x.61; 2. a district, a territory, गौडं राष्ट्रमनुत्तमम् Pr.Ch.ii.; 3. people, a nation, M.ix.254.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राष्ट्र|राष्ट्रं|राष्ट्रः
राष्ट्र <i>(II) m.n.</i> Any public calamity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राष्ट्रिक|राष्ट्रिकः
राष्ट्रिक <i>m.</i> 1. An inhabitant of a country, a subject, M.x.61; 2. the ruler of a kingdom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राष्ट्रिय|राष्ट्रियः
राष्ट्रिय <i>m.</i> 1. the ruler of a territory, a king, एष राष्ट्रियश्यालः कुपितो भणति Mrich.ix.; 2. a queen’s brother (in theatrical language).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रास्
रास् <i>vi. 1Ā (pres. रासते)</i> To cry, to make a sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रास|रासः
रास <i>m.</i> 1. Uproar, din, sound in general; 2. a kind of dance danced by cowherds, especially by Kṛṣṇa and the Gopīs of Vṛndāvana, रासरसे सह नृत्यपरा हरिणा युवतिः प्रशशंसे, or रासोल्लासभरेन विभ्रमभृतामाभीरवामभ्रुवाम् Git.G.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रासक्रीडा
रास-क्रीडा <i>f.</i> a sportive dance, the circular dance of Kṛṣṇa and the Gopīs of Vṛndāvana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रासमंडल|रासमण्डल|रासमण्डलं
रास-मंडल <i>n.</i> a sportive dance, the circular dance of Kṛṣṇa and the Gopīs of Vṛndāvana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रासक|रासकं
रासक <i>n.</i> A kind of minor drama in one act. See S.D.548.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रासभ|रासभः
रासभ <i>m.</i> An ass, a donkey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहित्य|राहित्यं
राहित्य <i>n.</i> The being without anything, destitution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहु|राहुः
राहु <i>m.</i> 1. An eclipse or the moment of obscuration; 2. a demon supposed to swallow the sun and moon for a time and thus to cause their eclipses; (he is regarded as one of the nine planets in astrology), तान्प्रत्येष विशेषविक्रमरुची राहुर्न वैरायते Bhartr.ii.34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुग्रसन
राहु-ग्रसन न्।, -ग्रास म्।, -दर्शन न्।, -संस्पर्श म्। <i>n.</i> an eclipse of the sun or moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुग्रास|राहुग्रासः
राहु-ग्रास <i>m.</i> an eclipse of the sun or moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुदर्शन|राहुदर्शनं
राहु-ग्रसन न्।, -ग्रास म्।, -दर्शन न्।, -संस्पर्श म्। <i>n.</i> an eclipse of the sun or moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुसंस्पर्श|राहुसंस्पर्शः
राहु-संस्पर्श <i>m.</i> an eclipse of the sun or moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुसूतक
राहु-सूतक <i>m.</i> the birth of Rāhu, i.e. an eclipse, Yaj.i.146.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रि
रि <i>vi. 6P (pp. रीण; pres. रियति)</i> To go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्त|रिक्तं
रिक्त <i>(I) a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Divided; 2. abandoned; 3. joined; 4. emptied, evacuated, (pp. of रिच् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्ता
रिक्त <i>(I) a. (f. क्ता)</i> 1. Divided; 2. abandoned; 3. joined; 4. emptied, evacuated, (pp. of रिच् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्त|रिक्तं
रिक्त <i>(II) n.</i> 1. An empty space, a vacuum; 2. a desert, a wilderness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तपाणि
रिक्त-पाणि, -हस्त <i>a.</i> empty-handed, bringing no present, अरिक्तपाणिनाऽस्मादृशजनेनार्थपतिर्द्रष्टव्यः Mal.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तहस्त
रिक्त-पाणि, -हस्त <i>a.</i> empty-handed, bringing no present, अरिक्तपाणिनाऽस्मादृशजनेनार्थपतिर्द्रष्टव्यः Mal.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तक|रिक्तकं
रिक्तक <i>a.</i> The same as रिक्त q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्ता
रिक्ता <i>f.</i> A name of the fourth, ninth and fourteenth days of a lunar fortnight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थ|रिक्थं
रिक्थ <i>n.</i> 1. Property left at death, inheritance, bequest, ननु गर्भः पित्र्यं रिक्थमर्हति Sak.vi.; 2. property in general, possessions, wealth, विभजेरन् सुताः पित्रोरूर्ध्वं रिक्थमृणं समम् Yaj.ii.117; 3. gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थाद
रिक्थ-आद, -ग्राह, -भागिन्, -हर, -हारिन् <i>m.</i> an heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थग्राह
रिक्थ-आद, -ग्राह, -भागिन्, -हर, -हारिन् <i>m.</i> an heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थभागिन्
रिक्थ-आद, -ग्राह, -भागिन्, -हर, -हारिन् <i>m.</i> an heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थहर
रिक्थ-आद, -ग्राह, -भागिन्, -हर, -हारिन् <i>m.</i> an heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थहारिन्
रिक्थ-आद, -ग्राह, -भागिन्, -हर, -हारिन् <i>m.</i> an heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=611-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिख्
रिख् <i>vi. 1P (pres. रिंखति, रिंगति)</i> 1. To creep, to crawl; 2. to go slowly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिग्
रिख् <i>vi. 1P (pres. रिंखति, रिंगति)</i> 1. To creep, to crawl; 2. to go slowly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिंखण|रिङ्खण|रिंखणं|रिङ्खणं
रिंखण <i>n.</i> 1. Crawling, creeping on all fours like children; 2. deviating from rectitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिंगण|रिङ्गण|रिंगणं|रिङ्गणं
रिंखण <i>n.</i> 1. Crawling, creeping on all fours like children; 2. deviating from rectitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिच्
रिच् <i>(I) vt. 1P, 10P (pres. रेचति, रेचयति-ते)</i> 1. To divide, to separate, to abandon; 2. to join, to mix.With आ-, to cause to dance, to move, to contract, बद्धश्चिरं तिष्ठतु सुंदरीणामारेचितभ्रूचतुरैः K.S.iii.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिच्
रिच् <i>(II) vt. 7U (pp. रिक्त; pres. रिणक्ति, रिंक्ते)</i> To empty, to evacuate, to purge, रिणच्मि जलधेस्तोयं विविनच्मि दिवः सुरान् Bt.ii.36.With अति-, to exceed, to surpass, (with an abl.), संभावितस्य चाकीर्तिर्मरणादतिरिच्यते Bg.ii.34.With उद्-, to exceed, to surpass, to overflow.With व्यति-, to exceed, R.x.30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिटि|रिटिः
रिटि <i>m.</i> Name of an attendant of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिपु|रिपुः
रिपु <i>m.</i> An enemy, a foe, R.ii.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्
रिष् <i>vt. 1P (pp. रिष्ट; pres. रेषति)</i> 1. To injure, to hurt, तेन यायात्सतं मार्गं तेन गच्छन्न रिष्यते M.iv.178; 2. to kill, to destroy, Bt.ix.31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्ट|रिष्टं|रिष्टः
रिष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Injured; 2. unlucky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्टा
रिष्ट <i>(I) a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Injured; 2. unlucky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्ट|रिष्टं|रिष्टः
रिष्ट <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Mischief, harm; 2. misfortune, bad luck; 3. sin; 4. good luck, well-being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्टि|रिष्टिः
रिष्टि <i>(I) f.</i> See रिष्ट (II) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्टि|रिष्टिः
रिष्टि <i>(II) m.</i> A sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

री
री <i>(I) vi. 4Ā (pp. रीयते)</i> To ooze, to flow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

री
री <i>(II) vt. or vi. 9U (pp. रीण; pres. रिणाति, रिणीते; caus. रेपयति-ते)</i> 1. To go. to move; 2. to howl; 3. to injure, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीज्या
रीज्या <i>f.</i> 1. Reproach, sensure; 2. shame, modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीढक|रीढकः
रीढक <i>m.</i> The back-bone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीढा
रीढा <i>f.</i> Disrespect, contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीण|रीणं
रीण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> Oozed, dropped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीणा
रीण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> Oozed, dropped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीति|रीतिः
रीति <i>f.</i> 1. Motion, course; 2. a stream, a river; 3. a line, a boundary; 4. general way, method, manner, fashion, पुत्रादपि धनभाजां भीतिः सर्वत्रैषा विहिता रीतिः M.Mud.2; 5. usage, practice; 6. style, diction, (they are वैदर्भी, गौडी, पांचाली and लाटिका or मागधी), पदसंघटनारातिरंगसंस्थाविशेषवत् S.D.624; 7. brass, bell-metal; (also रीती in this sense); 8. oxide of any metal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रु|रुः
रु <i>vi. 2P (pp. रुत; pres. रौति)</i> To cry, to roar, to shout, to sound in general, मांसं हतानामिव राक्षसानामाशंसवः क्ररगिरो रुवन्तः Bt.xii.72.With वि-, 1. to sound, कथं जीणत्वाद् गृहस्य विरौति कपाटः Mrich.iii.5; 2. to cry, to lament, घ्राणं करेण विरुणद्धि विरौति चोच्चैः Rt.vi.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

