रुच्
रुच् <i>vi. 1Ā (pp. रुचित; pres. रोचते)</i> 1. To shine beautifully, to appear good; 2. to be agreeable, to please (generally with a dat., यदेवाय रोचते Mal.i., but sometimes with a gen., विज्ञानं चास्य रोचते M.iv.20).With अभि-, to please, यदभिरुचितं वयस्याय M.M.i.With वि-, to shine, R.xvii.14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुच्
रुच् <i>f.</i> 1. Light, lustre, बलभिदो धनुः पुरयितुं भवन्ति विभवः शिखरमणिरुचः Kir.v.43; 2. beauty, loveliness; 3. appearance. colour, कुसुमोत्खचितान् वलीभृतश्च्लयन्भृंगरुचस्तवालकान् R.viii.53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=612-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

