रुद्राणी <i>f.</i> A name of Pārvatī, wife of Rudra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुध्
रुध् <i>vt. 7U (pp. रुद्ध; pres. रुणाद्धि, रुंद्रे; desid. रुरुत्सति-ये)</i> 1. To stop, to arrest, to obstruct, to oppose, हस्तं कम्पवती रुणद्धि रशनाव्यापारलोलांगुलिम् Mal.iv.; 2. to hold, to keep, to sustain, सद्यःपाति प्रणयिहृदयं विप्रयोगे रुणद्धि Megh.i.10; 3. to shut, to block up, to confine, to bind, व्यालं बालमृणालतन्तुभिरसौ रोद्धुं समुज्जृम्भते Bhartr.ii.6; 4. to besiege, to invest, to enclose, अरुणद्यवनः साकेतम् P.Bh., Bt.xiv.29; 5. to cover, to obscure; 6. to harass, to oppress.With अनु-, (also 4Ā) (pres. अनुरुध्यते) 1. to comply with, to approve; 2. to obey, e.g. अनुरुध्यस्व भगवतो वसिष्ठस्यादेशमिति विज्ञापयामि; 3. to love, नानुरोत्स्ये जगल्लक्ष्मीम् Bt.xvi.23.With अव-, 1. to implant, to infix, e.g. ईश्वरः सद्योः हृद्यवरुध्यतेत्र कृतिभिः शुश्रूषिभिस्तत्क्षणात्.With उप-, 1. to confine, to restrain; 2. to obstruct, to block up, R.iv.83; 2. to molest, यथा न मे सैनिकास्तपोवनमुपरुन्धन्ति तथा निषेद्धव्याः Sak.ii.With नि-, 1. to obstruct, to stop, Bt.xvi.20; 2. to confine, M.xi.176.With वि-, to obstruct, to quarrel with, to oppose.With सम्-, 1. to obstruct, to check, स चेत्तु पथि संरुद्धः पशुभिर्वा रथेन वा M.viii.295; 2. to fetter, नृणमिव लघु लक्ष्मीर्नैव तान् संरुणद्धि Bhartr.ii.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिर|रुधिरं|रुधिरः
रुधिर <i>(I) m.</i> The planet Mars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिर|रुधिरं|रुधिरः
रुधिर <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Blood, R.ix.23; 2. saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिराशन|रुधिराशनः
रुधिर-अशन <i>m.</i> a Rākṣasa, a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरामय|रुधिरामयः
रुधिर-आमय <i>m.</i> hemorrhage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुरु|रुरुः
रुरु <i>m.</i> A kind of deer, R.ix.51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुश्
रुश् <i>vt. 6P (pres. रुशति)</i> To hurt, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुशती
रुशती <i>f.</i> A disagreeable speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुष्
रुष् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pres. रोषति)</i> 1. To injure, to kill; 2. to vex.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुष्
रुष् <i>(II) vi. 4U (pp. रुष्ट or रुषित; pres. रुष्यति-ते)</i> To be vexed or offended, to be angry, मानानुभूः स्वकान् दोषान्मा मुहो मा रुषोऽधुना Bt.xv.16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुष्
रुष् <i>f.</i> Anger, wrath, प्रह्वेष्वनिर्यश्वरुषो हि सन्तः R.xvi.80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुषा
रुष् <i>f.</i> Anger, wrath, प्रह्वेष्वनिर्यश्वरुषो हि सन्तः R.xvi.80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुह्
रुह् <i>vi. 1P (pp. रूढ; pres. रोहति; desid. रुरुक्षति)</i> 1. To rise, to ascend; 2. to grow, to increase, to be developed, छिन्नोपि रोहति तरुः Bhartr.ii.87.With अधि-, to ascend, to ride.With अव-, to descend.With आ-, to ascend, to mount.With प्र-, to grow, to germinate. (The senses of this root with or without a preposition are variously modified according to the noun with which it is joined; but all of them express the notion of ‘motion upwards’ either literal or metaphorical).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुह्
रुह् <i>Caus. (रोहयति-ते, रोपयति-ते)</i> 1. to elevate, to raise up; 2. to plant, to put in, to fix.; 3. to commit to the care of, to entrust, गुणवत्सुतरोपितश्रियः R.viii.11.With आ-, 1. to ascribe, to attribute; 2. to put, to enter.With वि-, to heal (as a wound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुहा
रुहा <i>f.</i> The dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्ष|रूक्षं|रूक्षः
रूक्ष <i>m. (fem. क्षा)</i> 1. Rough, not smooth or soft, K.S.vii.17; 2. rough to the taste or feeling, harsh, रूक्षस्वरं वाशति वायसोयम् Mrich.ix.; 3. uneven, difficult, uncouth, austere; 4. cruel, unkind, नितान्तरूक्षाभिनिवेशमीशम् R.xiv.43; 5. dry, arid, स्निग्धश्यामाः क्वचिदपरतो भीषणाभोगरूक्षाः Ut.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=613-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षण|रूक्षणं
रूक्षण <i>n.</i> 1. The act of making dry or thin; 2. treatment for reducing fat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढ|रूढं|रूढः
रूढ <i>a. (f. ढा)</i> 1. Mounted, risen; 2. born, produced; 3. grown, increased; 4. large, great; 5. spread about, diffused; 6. ascertained; 7. traditional, conventional (as a meaning of a word); (in this sense, it is opposed to etymological or यौगिक meaning), क्षतात्किल त्रायत इत्युदग्रः क्षत्रस्य शब्दां भुवनेषु रूढः R.ii.58, Sis.x.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढा
रूढ <i>a. (f. ढा)</i> 1. Mounted, risen; 2. born, produced; 3. grown, increased; 4. large, great; 5. spread about, diffused; 6. ascertained; 7. traditional, conventional (as a meaning of a word); (in this sense, it is opposed to etymological or यौगिक meaning), क्षतात्किल त्रायत इत्युदग्रः क्षत्रस्य शब्दां भुवनेषु रूढः R.ii.58, Sis.x.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढि|रूढिः
रूढि <i>f.</i> 1. Rise, ascent; 2. germination, birth; 3. growth, increase; 4. fame, notoriety; 5. tradition, customary usage; 6. conventional acceptation of a word, व्यंग्येन रहिता रूढौ सहिता तु प्रयोजने K.Pr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्
रूप् <i>vt. 10U (pp. रूपित; pres. रूपयति-ते)</i> To represent in gesture, to act, to feign, शेषास्तथेति शैलाधिरोहणं रूपयित्वा स्थिताः Vikr.i.With नि-, 1. to represent, to act, to gesticulate; 2. to look out, to see; 3. to consider, to ponder; 4. to investigate; 5. to appoint.With वि-, to disfigure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप|रूपं
रूप <i>n.</i> 1. Form, shape, रूपं शूर्पणखा नाम्नः सदृशं प्रत्यपद्यत R.xii.38; 2. a handsome form, beauty, elegance, विद्या नाम नरस्य रूपमधिकं प्रच्छन्नगुप्तं धनम् Bhartr.ii.20; 3. the quality of colour which is of seven kinds (in Nyāya phil.), (चक्षुर्मात्रग्राह्यो गुणो रूपम् T.S.); 4. any visible object, a thing; 5. similitude, resemblance, image; 6. natural condition or disposition, nature, essence, characteristic; 7. sign, symptom; 8. kind, species; 9. type, pattern; 10. arithmetical unit, integer (in math.); 11. a play, a dramatic composition; See under रूपक; 12. cattle; 13. a sound, a word; 14. acquiring familiarity with any book by frequent recitation; 15. an affix to nouns and adjectives meaning, ‘having the figure or appearance of,’ ‘consisting of,’ ‘namely’; 16. the form of a noun or verb inflected by declension or conjugation (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपाधिबोध|रूपाधिबोधः
रूप-अधिबोध <i>m.</i> the perception of form and colour of things by the senses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपाजीवा
रूप-आजीवा <i>f.</i> a harlot, a prostitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपेंद्रिय|रूपेन्द्रिय
रूप-इंद्रिय <i>n.</i> the organ perceiving form and colour, the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकार|रूपकारः
रूप-कार, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a sculptor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकृत्
रूप-कार, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a sculptor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपतत्व
रूप-तत्व <i>n.</i> inherent property, essence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपवत्|रूपवन्त्
रूप-वत् <i>a.</i> 1. having a form or body, embodied; 2. handsome, beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपविपर्यय|रूपविपर्ययः
रूप-विपर्यय <i>m.</i> morbid change of bodily form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपसंपत्ति
रूप-संपत्ति <i>f.</i> perfection or excellence of form, beauty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपक|रूपकं|रूपकः
रूपक <i>(I) m.</i> A coin, a rupee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपक|रूपकं|रूपकः
रूपक <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Any manifestation or representation, a sign; 2. a kind, a species; 3. a figure of speech in which the Upameya is identified with the Upamāna, a metaphor; (for further information, See K.Pr.x. under रूपक); 4. a dramatic composition, a play of which ten principal and eighteen minor varieties are enumerated. (दृश्यं तत्राभिनेयं तद्रूपारोपात्तु रूपकम् S.D.273-6); 5. a particular time in music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपण|रूपणं
रूपण <i>n.</i> 1. A figurative illustration, metaphorical description; 2. investigation, proof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्य|रूप्यं
रूप्य <i>(I) a. (f. प्या)</i> Beautiful, elegant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्या
रूप्य <i>(I) a. (f. प्या)</i> Beautiful, elegant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्य|रूप्यं
रूप्य <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Silver; 2. wrought silver bearing a stamp, a coin, a rupee; 3. wrought gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूष्
रूष् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pp. रूषित; pres. रूषति)</i> 1. To decorate; 2. to smear, to cover with dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूष्
रूष् <i>(II) vi. 10U (pres. रूषयति-ते)</i> 1. To tremble; 2. to burst.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूषित|रूषितं
रूषित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Adorned; 2. smeared, overspread; 3. made rough or rugged; 4. powdered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूषिता
रूषित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Adorned; 2. smeared, overspread; 3. made rough or rugged; 4. powdered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रे
रे <i>ind.</i> A vocative particle, रे रे चातक सावधानमनसा मित्र क्षणं श्रूयताम् Bhartr.ii.51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेख
रेख <i>m.</i> 1. A line, a streak, सरसां पश्य वयस्य रागरेखाम् Mal.iii.; 2. a row, a series; 3. the prime meridian drawn from Lankā to Meru through Ujjayinī; 4. fullness, satisfaction; 5. deceit; 6. drawing, delineating, तथापि तस्या लावण्यं रेखया किंचिदन्वितम् Sak.vi.; 7. a small portion, a jot, R.i.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखा
रेखा <i>f.</i> 1. A line, a streak, सरसां पश्य वयस्य रागरेखाम् Mal.iii.; 2. a row, a series; 3. the prime meridian drawn from Lankā to Meru through Ujjayinī; 4. fullness, satisfaction; 5. deceit; 6. drawing, delineating, तथापि तस्या लावण्यं रेखया किंचिदन्वितम् Sak.vi.; 7. a small portion, a jot, R.i.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखांश|रेखांशः
रेखा-अंश <i>m.</i> a degree of longitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखान्तर
रेखा-अन्तर <i>n.</i> distance east or west from the first meridian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखाकर
रेखा-आकर <i>a.</i> formed in lines, striped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखागणित|रेखागणितः
रेखा-गणित <i>n.</i> geometry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचक|रेचकं|रेचकः
रेचक <i>(I) a. (f. चिका)</i> 1. Emptying; 2. purgative; 3. emptying the lungs, emitting the breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=614-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचिका
