लक्ष् <i>(I) vt. 1Ā (pres. लक्षते)</i> To perceive, to apprehend, to see, to observe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=616-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्
लक्ष् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pp. लक्षित; pres. लक्षयति-ते)</i> 1. To mark, to denote, to characterise, to indicate, बीजलक्षणलक्षिता M.ix.35; 2. to signify or mean secondarily, अत्र गोशब्दः वाहीकार्थं लक्षयति S.D.ii.; 3. to consider, to regard, to think; 4. to perceive, to observe, योगप्रभावो न च लक्ष्यते ते R.xvi.7, ix.72.With आ-, to observe, to notice, to perceive, शोच्या च प्रियदर्शना च मदनक्लिष्टेयमालक्ष्यते Sak.iii., R.xv.18.With उप-, 1. to mark, to characterise, Kull. on M.ii.170; 2. to include or to denote secondarily, नक्षत्रशब्देन ज्योतिःशास्त्रमुपलक्ष्यते Kull. on M.iii.162; 3. to perceive, to observe; 4. to think, to consider, to regard as.With वि-, 1. to see, to observe; 2. to become bewildered or contused; 3. to distinguish, to characterise.With सम्-, 1. to see, to perceive, to observe; 2. to distinguish; 3. to test, to prove, हेम्नः संलक्ष्यते ह्यग्नौ विशुद्धिः श्यामिकापि वा R.i.10; 4. to learn, to understand, to know, संलक्ष्यते न च्छिदुरोपि हारः R.xvi.62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=616-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष|लक्षं
लक्ष <i>(I) m.n.</i> 1. One hundred thousand, एकोनत्रिंशल्लक्षानि तथा नव शतानि च Yaj.iii.101, त्रयो लक्षास्तु विज्ञेयाः 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष|लक्षं
लक्ष <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A mark, a token; 2. a target, a butt; 3. pretence, show, fraud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षाधीश|लक्षाधीशः
लक्ष-अधीश <i>m.</i> a person possessing a lāc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षशस्
