लक्षका
लक्षक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> Expressing secondarily, indicating indirectly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षक|लक्षकं
लक्षक <i>(II) n.</i> One hundred thousand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षण|लक्षणं|लक्षणः
लक्षण <i>(I) n.</i> 1. A mark, a sign, token, a characteristic, an indication (पुरुषलक्षण ‘the organ of virility’), अव्याक्षेपो भविष्यंत्याः कार्यसिद्धेर्हि लक्षणम् R.x.6, दृष्टशुभगर्भलक्षणा R.xix.55, Megh.ii.17; 2. an attribute, a quality; 3. an accurate definition (in phil.); 4. a mark indicative of good or bad fortune, क्व तद्विधस्त्वं क्व च पुण्यलक्षणा K.S.v.73, M.xi.53; 5. a symptom of disease; 6. a fixed rate, M.viii.406; 7. designation, appellation, तेषां दिक्षु प्रथितविदिशालक्षणां राजधानीम् Megh.i.24; 8. subject, head, topic; 9. cause, occasion; 10. effect, operation; 11. excellence, qualification, virtue, merit, ककुत्स्थ इत्याहितलक्षणोऽभूत् R.vi.71; 12. an auspicious mark on the body of a person; (they are 32 in number).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षण|लक्षणं|लक्षणः
