लक्ष्य|लक्ष्यं|लक्ष्यः
लक्ष्य <i>(I) a. (f. क्ष्या)</i> 1. To be marked; 2. to be defined; 3. to be aimed at; 4. to be regarded as; 5. to be looked at, R.vi.11; 6. to be denoted indirectly; 7. to be known, to be traced, K.S.v.81; 8. recognizable by, (with an inst.), दूराल्लक्ष्यं सुरपतिधनुश्चारुणा तोरणेन Megh.ii.12, K.S.v.74, R.iv.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्या
लक्ष्य <i>(I) a. (f. क्ष्या)</i> 1. To be marked; 2. to be defined; 3. to be aimed at; 4. to be regarded as; 5. to be looked at, R.vi.11; 6. to be denoted indirectly; 7. to be known, to be traced, K.S.v.81; 8. recognizable by, (with an inst.), दूराल्लक्ष्यं सुरपतिधनुश्चारुणा तोरणेन Megh.ii.12, K.S.v.74, R.iv.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्य|लक्ष्यं|लक्ष्यः
लक्ष्य <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A butt, a target, a mark aimed at, दृष्टलक्ष्यमिदः शराः R.i.61, K.S.iii.64; 2. one hundred thousand; 3. secondary meaning, one derived by Lakshaṇa (q.v.), K.Pr.ii.; 4. the thing defined, उपकारापकारौ हि लक्ष्यं लक्षणमेतयोः Sis.ii.37; 5. a sign, a token; 6. pretence, sham, किं लक्ष्यसुप्तमुत परमार्थसुप्तमिदं द्वयम् Mrich.iii., रोमांचलक्ष्येण स गात्रयष्टिं भित्वा निराक्रामदरालकेश्याः R.vi.81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्यक्रम
लक्ष्य-क्रम <i>a.</i> having the order perceptible, (said of Dhvani in rhetorical works).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=617-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्यभेद|लक्ष्यभेदः
