लघय्
लघय् <i>vt. (denom. pres. लघयति)</i> 1. To make light, नितांतागुर्वीं लघयिष्यता धुरम् R.iii.35; 2. to lessen, to diminish, to mitigate; 3. to bring low, to make inferior, Kir.v.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=618-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

