लघिमन् <i>m.</i> 1. Lightness, absence of weight; 2. insignificance, smallness; 3. lowness, meanness, Bt.iii.7; 4. the power of assuming excessive lightness at will, considered as one of the eight supernatural faculties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=618-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

