लघु|लघुः
लघु <i>(I) a. (f. घु or घ्वी)</i> 1. Quick, swift, nimble, संहारविक्षेपलघुक्रियेण R.v.45, Megh.i.16; 2. light, not heavy, विषाणपरिमोक्षलघूत्तमांगान् R.ix.62, रिक्तः सर्वो भवति हि लघुः पूर्णता गौरवाय Megh.i.20; 3. easy, not difficult, R.xii.66; 4. easy of digestion; 5. small, little, diminutive, Sis.ix.38; 6. trifling, trivial, unimportant; 7. mean, contemptible, low; 8. soft, gentle; 9. young; 10. beautiful, handsome; 11. pure, clean; 12. short (as a vowel) (in prosody); 13. agreeable, pleasant, दर्शनेन लघुना यथा तयोः R.xi.12, 80; 14. brief, लघुसंदेशपदा सरस्वती R.viii.77.(In many of these senses, लघु is also used as an indeclinable. लघुलघु ind. ‘very early.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=618-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

