लघ्वी
लघ्वी <i>f.</i> 1. A delicate woman; 2. a light carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लंका|लङ्का
लंका <i>f.</i> 1. Name of the capital and habitation of Rāvaṇa; (it is identified with the chief town in Ceylon or with the whole island; in the opinion of some, Lankā was much larger than the present island of Ceylon), लंकेश्वरेणोषितमा प्रसादात् R.vi.40, xii.61, 63, 66, 84; 2. a branch; 3. a kind of grain; 4. a harlot, a prostitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लंकाधिप
लंका-अधिप, -अधिपति, -ईश, -ईश्वर, -नाथ, -पति <i>m.</i> lord of Lankā, i.e. Rāvaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लंकाधिपति|लङ्काधिपति|लङ्काधिपतिः
