लंकादाहिन्|लङ्कादाहिन्
लंका-दाहिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Hanūmat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लंखनी|लङ्खनी
लंखनी <i>f.</i> The bit of a bridle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लंग|लङ्ग|लंगः|लङ्गः
लंग <i>m.</i> 1. A lover, a paramour; 2. union, association; 3. lameness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लंगक|लङ्गक|लंगकः|लङ्गकः
लंगक <i>m.</i> A lover, a paramour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

