लज्
लज् <i>(I) vi. 1Ā (pres. लजते)</i> To be ashamed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्
लज् <i>(II) vt. 1P (pres. लंजति)</i> 1. To blame, to calumniate; 2. to roast to fry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्
लज् <i>(III) vi. 10U (pres. लजयति-ते)</i> To seem, to appear, to shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्
लज् <i>(IV) vt. 10U (pres. लाजयति-ते)</i> To cover, to conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्
लज् <i>(V) vt. or vi. 10U (pres. लंजयति-ते)</i> 1. To speak; 2. to injure, to kill; 3. to give; 4. to be powerful, to be strong; 5. to dwell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जका
लज्जका <i>f.</i> The wild cotton-plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जा
लज्जा <i>f.</i> 1. Shame, feeling of shame, लज्जा तिरश्चां यदि चेतसि स्यात् K.S.i.48, R.ii.40; 2. bashfulness, modesty, लज्जावती लाजविसर्गमग्नौ R.vii.25, K.S.iii.7; 3. name of a sensitive plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जान्वित
लज्जा-अन्वित <i>a.</i> modest, lashful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

