लज्जाकरी
लज्जा-कर <i>a. (f. रा or री)</i> occasioning shame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जाशील|लज्जाशीलः
लज्जा-शील <i>a.</i> bashful, modest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=619-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

