लट्व|लट्वः
लट्व <i>m.</i> 1. a horse; 2. a dancing boy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=620-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्वा
लट्वा <i>f.</i> 1. A kind of musical instrument; 2. a curl on the forehead; 3. a sparrow; 4. safflower; 5. an unchaste woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=620-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लड्
लड् <i>(I) vt. or vi. 1P (pres. लडति)</i> 1. To sport, to frolic, to dally; 2. to loll the tongue; 3. to harass, to annoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=620-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लड्
लड् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pres. लाडयति-ते)</i> 1. To fondle, to caress; 2. to spread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=620-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लड्
लड् <i>(III) vt. 1P, 10U (pres. लंडति, लंडयति-ते)</i> 1. To speak; 2. to throw upwards, to toss up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=620-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

