लभ्य|लभ्यं
लभ्य <i>a. (f. भ्या)</i> 1. Capable of being acqured, attainable, obtainable, प्रांशुलभ्ये फले लोभादुद्वाहुरिव वामनः R.i.3, K.S.v.18; 2. fit, proper, suitable; 3. intelligible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=621-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

