लंब्|लम्ब्
लंब् <i>vt. or vi. 1Ā (pres. लंबते)</i> 1. To hang down, to hang from, to depend from, स्तनाभोगे पतन्भाति कपोलात्कुटिलोऽलकः । शशांकबिंबतो मेरौ लंबमान इवोरगाः R.G.; 2. to be attached to, to rest on; 3. to stretch out, करेण वातायनलंबितेन R.xiii.21; 4. to lag behind, to fall behind, Sis.ix.20; 5. to go down, to decline, to set; 6. to delay, प्रस्थानं ते कथमपि सखे लंबमानस्य भावि Megh.i.41; 7. to sound.With अव-, 1. to hang from, to descend; 2. to cling to, to support oneself by, ययौ तदियामवलंब्य चांगुलिम् R.iii.25, Sis.ix.39; 3. to depend upon; 4. to hold, हस्तेन तस्थाववलंब्य वासः R.vii.9; 5. to bear up against sorrow or calamity, हृदयं न त्ववलंबितुं क्षमाः R.viii.60; 6. to assume, to take, अभ्यर्थनाभंगभयेन साधुर्माध्यस्थ्यमिष्टेऽप्यवलंबतेऽर्थे K.S.i.52.With आ-, 1. to rest upon; 2. to hang from, to depend from; 3. to support, आधोरणालंबितमग्र्यवेशम् R.xviii.39; 4. to take refuge with, to depend on, आलंबे जगदालंबे हेरंबचरणंबुजे Mall.; 5. to take hold of, अथालंब्य धनू रामो जगर्ज गजविक्रमः Bt.vi.35; 6. to assume, to take.With उद्-, to stand erect, पादेनैलेन गगने द्वितीयेन च भूतले तिष्ठाम्युल्लंबितः Mrich.ii.With वि-, 1. to hang from, R.x.62; 2. to decline, to set; 3. to stay, to remain, K.S.vii.13; 4. to delay, विलंबितफलैः कालं स निनाय मनोरथैः R.i.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=621-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लंब|लम्ब|लम्बः
लंब <i>(I) a. (f. बा)</i> 1. Hanging down, depending, मुखमसकलव्यक्ति लंबालकत्वात् Megh.ii.21; 2. attached; 3. spacious, great, large; 4. long, tall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=621-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

