लव|लवं|लवः
लव <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Plucking, mowing; 2. a section, a fragment; 3. a drop, a small quantity, a little, आचामति स्वेदलवान्मुखे ते R.xiii.20, भ्रूक्षेपलक्ष्मीलवक्रीते Git.G.xi., आरुक्षाम नृपप्रसादकणिकामद्राक्ष्म लक्ष्मीलवान् Vikr.Ch.xviii.103, R.vi.57, xvi.66; 4. wool, hair; 5. loss, destruction; 6. sport; 7. a minute division of time equal to the sixtieth part of a twinkling; 8. the numerator of a fraction; 9. a degree (in astronomy); 10. name of a son of Rāma; (See App. II.), R.xv.97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=623-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

