लस्
लस् <i>vi. 1P (pp. लसित; pres. लसति)</i> 1. To embrace; 2. to shine, to glitter, to flash, अंतर्हासलसत्कपोलफलकां धूर्तोऽपरां चुंबति Am.S.16, लसद्बिंबमिवेंदुबिंबम् Na.xxii.53; 3. to appear, to arise; 4. to play, to sport, to skip about.With उद्-, 1. to shine, to glitter, रुचमुल्लसमानवैनतेयद्युतिभिन्नाः फणभारिणो मणीनाम् Sis.xx.56; 2. to arise, to appear, Sis.iv.58; 3. to blow, to open, to expand.With परि-, to shine, to appear gaudy, परिलसंति वाजिव्रजाः R.G. With वि-, 1. to shine, to glitter, to flash, उपरि विलसत् कृष्णसारप्रभाणाम् Megh.i.47, R.xiii.76; 2. to appear, to arise, to be manifested, Sis.ix.87; 3. to be sportive or wanton, to play, to sport, हरिरिह मुग्धवधूनिकरे विलासिनि विलसति केलिपरे Git.G.i.; 4. to sound, to echo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=623-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

