लावणिक|लावणिकं|लावणिकः
लावणिक <i>(III) n.</i> A salt-cellar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावण्य|लावण्यं
लावण्य <i>a.</i> 1. Saltness; 2. beauty, loveliness, charm, पुपोष लावण्यमयान् विशेषान् K.S.i.25, vii.18, (मुक्ताफलेषु छायायास्तरलत्वामिवांतरा । प्रतिभात यदंगेषु तल्लावण्यमिहोच्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावण्यार्जित|लावण्यार्जितं
लावण्य-अर्जित <i>n.</i> the private property of a married woman presented to her at the time of marriage by her father or mother-in-law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावाणक|लावाणकः
लावाणक <i>m.</i> Name of a district near Magadha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाविक|लाविकः
लाविक <i>m.</i> A buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाषुक
लाषुक <i>a. (f. का or की)</i> Covetous, greedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाषुका
लाषुक <i>a. (f. का or की)</i> Covetous, greedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाषुकी
लाषुक <i>a. (f. का or की)</i> Covetous, greedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लास|लासः
लास <i>m.</i> 1. Jumping, sporting; 2. dalliance, wanton sport; 3. dancing as practised by women; 4. soup, broth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासक|लासकं|लासकः
