लासिका
लासक <i>(I) a. (f. सिका)</i> Playing, sporting, moving hither and thither.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासक|लासकं|लासकः
लासक <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A dancer; 2. a peacock; 3. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासक|लासकं|लासकः
लासक <i>(III) n.</i> A room on the top of a building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासकी
लासकी <i>f.</i> A female dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासिका
लासिका <i>f.</i> 1. A female dancer; 2. a prostitute, a harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लास्य|लास्यं|लास्यः
लास्य <i>(I) n.</i> 1. Dancing, a dauce, R.xvi.14; 2. a dance. accompanied with singing and instrumental music; 3. a dance in which the emotions of love are represented mimically.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लास्य|लास्यं|लास्यः
