लिक्षा
लिक्षा <i>f.</i> 1. A nit, the egg of a louse; 2. a very minute measure of weight, (जालांतरगते भानौ यच्चाणु दृश्यते रजः । तैश्चतुर्भिर्भवेल्लिक्षा). See, however, Yaj.i.362. (The word is also written लिक्का.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिक्षिका
लिक्षिका <i>f.</i> A nit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिख्
लिख् <i>(I) vt. 6P (pres. लिखति)</i> 1. To scratch, to scrape, to tear up, मूर्ध्ना दिवमिवालिखत् Bt.xv.22; 2. to draw a line, to make a mark, to write, to write down, to inscribe, संचिंत्य गीतिक्षममर्थबंधं दिवौकसस्त्वच्चरितं लिखंति Sak.vii.; 3. to draw, to sketch, to portray, to paint, मत्सादृश्यं विरहतनु वा भावगम्यं लिखंती Megh.ii.22, पाणौ खड्गलेखां लिलेख K.Pr.x.; 4. to touch; 5. to make smooth; 6. to unite sexually with a female.With आ-, 1. to scratch; 2. to write; 3. to paint, त्वामालिख्य प्रणयकुपितां धातुरागैः शिलायाम् Megh.ii.42, R.xix.19.With उद्-, 1. to scratch, to scrape; 2. to carve; 3. to polish, त्वष्ट्रेव यत्नोल्लिखितो विभाति R.vi.32;.With प्रति-, to write in return, to reply.With वि-, 1. to scratch, to scrape, पादेन हैमं विलिलेख पीठम् R.vi.15, वेदिप्रांतात्खुरविलिखितात् Sak.iv., K.S.ii.23; 2. to write; 3. to paint, to draw, to delineate, विलिखति रहसि कुरंगमदेन भवंतमसमशरभूतम् Git.G.iv.; 4. to implant, to infix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिख्
लिख् <i>(II) vt. 1P (pres. लिंखति)</i> To go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखन|लिखनं
लिखन <i>n.</i> 1. Scratching; 2. writing, inscribing; 3. a manuscript, a written document.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखित|लिखितं|लिखितः
लिखित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Scratched, scraped; 2. written; 3. painted, (pp. of लिख् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखिता
लिखित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Scratched, scraped; 2. written; 3. painted, (pp. of लिख् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=625-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

