लिग्
लिग् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pres. लिंगति)</i> To go, to move.With आ-, to embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

