लिग् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pres. लिंगयति-ते)</i> To paint, to variegate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिगु|लिगुः
लिगु <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A deer; 2. a fool, a blockhead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिगु|लिगुः
लिगु <i>(II) n.</i> The heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंग|लिङ्ग|लिंगं|लिङ्गं
लिंग <i>n.</i> 1. A sign, a token, a mark, a characteristic, मुनिर्दोहदलिंगदर्शी R.xiv.71, M.i.30, viii.25; 2. a badge or mark assumed with a view to deceive, स वर्णिलिंगी विदितः समाययौ युधिष्ठिरं द्वैतवने वनेचरः Kir.i.1, किंगैर्मुदः संवृतविक्रियाते R.vii.30; 3. a mark of disease, a symptom; 4. the predicate of a proposition; See हेतु; 5. a means of proof, evidence; 6. a sign of sex; 7. the male organ of generation; 8. gender (in gram.); 9. Śiva’s genital organ worshipped as a representative of him; 10. the image of a god, an idol; 11. an indication which fixes the meaning of a word in a particular context, as in कुपितो मकरध्वजः, where कुपितत्व leads one to understand मकरध्वज in the sense of ‘काम’ K.Pr.ii.; 12. one of the five sheaths that encase the soul (in Vedānta phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगाग्र|लिङ्गाग्र
लिंग-अग्र <i>m.</i> glans penis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगानुशासन|लिङ्गानुशासन
लिंग-अनुशासन <i>n.</i> the laws of grammatical gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगार्चन|लिङ्गार्चन|लिङ्गार्च्चन
लिंग-अर्चन <i>n.</i> worship of Śiva in the shape of a Linga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगदेह|लिङ्गदेह|लिङ्गदेहः
लिंग-देह <i>m.n.</i> See (12) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगशरीर|लिङ्गशरीर
लिंग-शरीर <i>n.</i> See (12) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगनाश|लिङ्गनाश|लिङ्गनाशः
लिंग-नाश <i>m.</i> 1. loss of characteristic marks; 2. loss of the penis; 3. a particular disease of the cye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगपरामर्श|लिङ्गपरामर्श|लिङ्गपरामर्शः
लिंग-परामर्श <i>m.</i> the consideration of a sign or Hetu (in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगपुराण|लिङ्गपुराण
लिंग-पुराण <i>n.</i> name of one of the eighteen Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगप्रतिष्ठा|लिङ्गप्रतिष्ठा
लिंग-प्रतिष्ठा <i>f.</i> 1. the establishment of a Linga; 2. the consecration of a Linga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगविपर्यय|लिङ्गविपर्यय|लिङ्गविपर्ययः
लिंग-विपर्यय <i>m.</i> change of gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगवृत्ति|लिङ्गवृत्ति|लिङ्गवृत्तिः
लिंग-वृत्ति <i>m.</i> a religious hypocrite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगवेदी|लिङ्गवेदी
लिंग-वेदी <i>f.</i> the pedestal of a Linga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगक|लिङ्गक|लिंगकः|लिङ्गकः
लिंगक <i>m.</i> The Kapittha tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगन|लिङ्गन|लिंगनं
लिंगन <i>n.</i> Embracing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगिन्|लिङ्गिन्
लिंगिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Having a mark or characteristic; 2. characterized by; 3. bearing false marks, hypocrite; 4. furnished with a Linga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगिनी|लिङ्गिनी
लिंगिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Having a mark or characteristic; 2. characterized by; 3. bearing false marks, hypocrite; 4. furnished with a Linga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिंगिन्|लिङ्गिन्
लिंगिन् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A Brāhmaṇa ascetic; 2. the worshipper of a Linga; 3. a pretending devotee; 4. the subject of a proposition (in logic); 5. an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्
लिप् <i>vt. 6U (pp. लिप्त; pres. लिंपति-ते)</i> 1. To anoint, to besmear, Bt.xix.11; 2. to cover, to spread over; 3. to inflame, to kindle, तस्यालिपत शोकाग्निः स्वांतं काष्ठमिव ज्वलन् Bt.vi.22; 4. to stain, to pollute, to contaminate, न मां कर्माणि लिंपंति Bg.iv.14.With अनु-, 1. to besmear, to anoint, वपुरन्वलिप्त परिरंभसुखव्यवधानभीरुकतया न वधूः Sis.ix.51; 2. to cover, to envelop, R.x.10.With अव-, 1. to smear, to anoint; 2. (pass.) to be puffed up.With आ-, 1. to anoint, to besmear; 2. to contaminate.With चि-, to anoint, to besmear, Bt.iii.20, K.S.v.79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपि|लिपिः
लिपि(पी) <i>f.</i> 1. Anointing, besmearing; 2. writing, transcribing; 3. painting, drawing; 4. alphabet, लिपेर्यथावद्ग्र्हणेन वाङ्मयं नदीमुखेनेव समुद्रेमाविशत् R.iii.28, xviii.46; 5. a document, a letter, a manuscript, a writing, लिपिं ललाटेऽर्थिजनस्य जाग्रतीम् Na.i.35, 138.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपी
लिपि(पी) <i>f.</i> 1. Anointing, besmearing; 2. writing, transcribing; 3. painting, drawing; 4. alphabet, लिपेर्यथावद्ग्र्हणेन वाङ्मयं नदीमुखेनेव समुद्रेमाविशत् R.iii.28, xviii.46; 5. a document, a letter, a manuscript, a writing, लिपिं ललाटेऽर्थिजनस्य जाग्रतीम् Na.i.35, 138.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

