लिह्
लिह् <i>vt. 2U (pp. लीढ; pres. लेढि, लीढे; desid. लिलिक्षति-ते)</i> 1. To lick, लेढि जिग्रति संक्षिप्य करोत्युन्नतमासनम् Bh.V.i.99, Kir.v.38; 2. to taste, to sip.With अव-, to lick, to chew, दर्भैरर्धावलीढैः Sak.i.With आ-, 1. to lick; 2. to pierce, to wound, सेनान्यमालीढमिवासुरास्त्रैः R.ii.37.With उद्-, to polish, मणिः शाणोल्लीढः Bhartr.ii.44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=626-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ली
ली <i>(I) vt. 1P (pres. लयति)</i> To melt, to liquefy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ली
ली <i>(II) vi. 4Ā (pp. लीन; pres. लीयते)</i> 1. To adhere or stick together, to cling to; 2. to lurk in, to hide in, to rest on, कुमुदमपि गतेऽस्तं लीयते चंद्रबिंबे Rt.iii.22, R.iii.9; 3. to be dissolved; 4. to be sticky; 5. to be devoted to; 6. to vanish, to disappear.With अभि-, to cover, to spread over, पश्चादुच्चैर्भुजतरुवनं मंडलेनाभिलीनः Megh.i.36.With आ-, 1. to cover, to besmear, तटेष्वालीनचंदनौ R.iv.51; 2. to lurk in, to hide in.With नि-, 1. to lie down, to alight, सरोजैश्च निलीनभृंगैः Bt.ii.5, xiv.76; 2. to conceal oneself, (with an abl.), गुहास्वन्ये न्यलेषत Bt.xv.22; 3. to perish.With प्र-, 1. to be absorbed in, रात्र्यागमे प्रलीयंते तत्रैवाव्यक्तसंज्ञके Bg.viii.18; 2. to disappear, to vanish.With वि-, 1. to cleave to, to cling to; 2. to settle on, पुरोऽस्य यावन्न भुवि व्यलीयत Sis.i.12; 3. to be dissolved, to melt away; 4. to vanish, to disappear, to perish.With सम्-, 1. to cling to; 2. to lie down, to be concealed; 3. to melt away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ली
ली <i>(III) vi. 9P (pres. लिनाति)</i> 1. To adhere; 2. to melt, to be absorbed.With to melt away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ली
ली <i>Caus. (लीनयति-ते, लालयति-ते, लापयति-ते, लाययति-ते)</i> to melt, to liquefy, to dissolve. (According to Pāṇini, the form लापयते is used in the sense of ‘to obtain honour,’ e.g. जटाभिर्लापयते.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

