लीला-नटन <i>n.</i> a sportive dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलामनुष्य|लीलामनुष्यः
लीला-मनुष्य <i>m.</i> a sham man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलामात्र
लीला-मात्र <i>n.</i> mere sport, mere play (implying thorough facility).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलारति|लीलारतिः
लीला-रति <i>f.</i> sport, amusement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलावती
लीला-वती <i>f.</i> 1. a name of Durgā; 2. a wanton woman; 3. a charming woman, e.g. लीलावतीनां सहजा विलासाः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलावापी
लीला-वापी <i>f.</i> a pleasure-tank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलाशुक|लीलाशुकः
लीला-शुक <i>m.</i> a parrot kept for pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलायित|लीलायितं
लीलायित <i>n.</i> Play, sport, amusement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुक्
लुक् <i>ind.</i> A technical term in Pāṇini’s grammar employed to express the disappearance of affixes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुच्
लुच् <i>vt. 1P (pres. लुंचति)</i> 1. To pluck, to pare, to peel; 2. to pluck out, to tear off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंचन|लुञ्चन|लुंचनं
लुंचन <i>n.</i> Plucking, paring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंचित|लुञ्चित
लुंचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Plucked, plucked out, torn off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंचिता
लुंचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Plucked, plucked out, torn off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुट्
लुट् <i>(I) vt. or vi. 1P (pres. लुंटति)</i> 1. To rob, to deprive of; 2. to go, to move; 3. to be lame, to be crippled; 4. to be idle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुट्
लुट् <i>(II) vt. or vi. 1Ā (pres. लोटते)</i> 1. To shine; 2. to resist, to oppose; 3. to suffer pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुट्
लुट् <i>(III) vt. or vi. 4P (pres. लुट्यति)</i> 1. To be connected with; 2. to rob, to deprive of; 3. to roll on the ground, to wallow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुट्
लुट् <i>(IV) vt. 10U (pres. लोटयति-ते)</i> 1. To speak; 2. to illumine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठ्
लुठ् <i>(I) vt. 1Ā (pres. लोठते)</i> 1. To resist, to oppose; 2. to suffer pain; 3. to roll on the ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठ्
लुठ् <i>(II) vt. 1P (pres. लोठति)</i> To strike, to knock down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठ्
लुठ् <i>(III) vt. or vi. 6P (pres. लुठति)</i> To roll, to roll about, to roll on the ground, त्वं पादांते लुठसि न च मे मन्युमोक्षः खलायाः Am.S.43, हारोऽयं हरिणाक्षीणां लुठति स्तनमंडलेन Am.S.100, लुठति धरणिशयने Git.G.v.With वि-, to roll about, to move to and fro on the ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठ्
लुठ् <i>(IV) vt. 10U (pres. लोठयति-ते)</i> To steal, to rob.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठन|लुठनं
लुठन <i>n.</i> Rolling, wallowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठित|लुठितः
लुठित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Rolled down, rolling on the ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठिता
लुठित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Rolled down, rolling on the ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुड्
लुड् <i>(I) vt. 1P (लोडति)</i> To stir, to churn, to disturb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुड्
लुड् <i>Caus. (लोडयति-ते)</i> to set in motion, to agitate, (generally used with आ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुड्
लुड् <i>(II) vt. or vi. 6P (pres. लुडति)</i> 1. To cover; 2. to adhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=627-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंट्|लुण्ट्
लुंट् <i>vt. 1P, 10U (pres. लुंटति, लुंटयति-ते)</i> 1. To rob, to plunder; 2. to disregard, to despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंटाक|लुण्टाक|लुण्टाकः
लुंटाक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Stealing, robbing, तरुणानां हृदयलुंटाकीम् K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंटाकी
लुंटाक <i>a. (f. की)</i> Stealing, robbing, तरुणानां हृदयलुंटाकीम् K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंठ्|लुण्ठ्
लुंठ् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pres. लुंठति)</i> 1. To go; 2. to agitate, to set in motion; 3. to be idle; 4. to be lame; 5. to steal, to rob, to plunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंठक|लुण्ठक|लुंठकः|लुण्ठकः
लुंठक <i>m.</i> A thief, a robber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंठन|लुण्ठन|लुंठनं|लुण्ठनं
लुंठन <i>n.</i> Robbing, plundering, यदस्य दैत्या इव लुंठनाया काव्यार्थचौराः प्रगुणीभवंति Vikr.Ch.i.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंठा|लुण्ठा
लुंठा <i>f.</i> 1. stealing, robbing; 2. rolling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंठाक|लुण्ठाक|लुंठाकः|लुण्ठाकः
लुंठाक <i>m.</i> 1. A robber; 2. a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंठि|लुण्ठि|लुंठिः|लुण्ठिः
लुंठि(ठी) <i>f.</i> Plundering, robbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंठी|लुण्ठी
लुंठि(ठी) <i>f.</i> Plundering, robbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंड्|लुण्ड्
लुंड् <i>vt. 10U (pres. लुंडयति-ते)</i> To rob, to steal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंडिका|लुण्डिका
लुंडिका <i>f.</i> 1. A round mass; 2. fitting conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंडी|लुण्डी
लुंडी <i>f.</i> Fitting conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुथ्
लुथ् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pres. लुंथति)</i> 1. To hurt, to kill; 2. to suffer pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्
लुप् <i>(I) vi. 4P (pres. लुप्यति)</i> 1. To be confused or disordered; 2. to vanish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्
लुप् <i>(II) vt. 6U (pp. लुप्त; pres. लुंपति-ते; freq. लोलुप्यते)</i> 1. To break, to cut off, to mutilate; 2. to rob, to plunder, to deprive of; 3. to seize, to pounce upon; 4. to suppress, to cause to disappear.With वि-, 1. to cut off, to break off; 2. to carry away, to seize, to rob, to plunder; 3. to destroy, to ruin, क्रव्याद्भिरंगलतिका नियतं विलुप्ता Ut.iii, R.xv.2; 4. to efface, to wipe off, Na.xxii.54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्त|लुप्तं
लुप्त <i>(I) a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Broken, cut off, injured, destroyed; 2. robbed, deprived of; 3. lost, disappeared; 4. omitted, neglected, (pp. of लुप् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्ता
लुप्त <i>(I) a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Broken, cut off, injured, destroyed; 2. robbed, deprived of; 3. lost, disappeared; 4. omitted, neglected, (pp. of लुप् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्त|लुप्तं
लुप्त <i>(II) n.</i> Stolen property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तोपमा
लुप्त-उपमा <i>f.</i> an elliptical simile (i.e. one in which one or more of the four requisites are not expressed). See पूर्णोपमा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तप्रतिज्ञ
लुप्त-प्रतिज्ञ <i>a.</i> false to one’s promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तप्रतिभ
लुप्त-प्रतिभ <i>a.</i> deprived of reason.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुब्
लुब् <i>vt. 1P, 10U (pres. लुंबति, लुंबयति-ते)</i> To harass, to torment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुब्ध|लुब्धः
लुब्ध <i>(I) a. (f. ब्धा)</i> 1. Covetous, greedy; 2. desirous of, longing for, (pp. of लुभ् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुब्धा
लुब्ध <i>(I) a. (f. ब्धा)</i> 1. Covetous, greedy; 2. desirous of, longing for, (pp. of लुभ् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुब्ध|लुब्धः
लुब्ध <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A hunter; 2. a libertine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुब्धक|लुब्धकः
लुब्धक <i>m.</i> 1. A hunter, लुब्धकधावरपिशुना निष्कारणवैरिणा जगति Bhartr.ii.61; 2. a greedy man; 3. a libertine; 4. the star Sirius; 5. a tiger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुभ्
लुभ् <i>vt. or vi. 4P (pp. लुब्ध; pres. लुभ्यति)</i> 1. To desire eagerly, to long for anything, (with a dat. or loc.); 2. to allure; 3. to go astray, to be perplexed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुभ्
लुभ् <i>Caus. (लोभयति-ते)</i> 1. to excite desire, यथामुखीनः सीतायाः पुप्लुवे बहु लोभयन् Bt.v.48; 2. to attract, to seduce, to allure, लोभ्यमाननयनः श्लथांशुकैर्मेखलागुणपदैर्नितंबिभिः R.xix.26; 3. to excite lust; 4. to disturb, to derange.With प्र-, to allure.With वि-, 1. to attract, to allure, अंगनास्तमधिकं व्यलोभयन्नर्पितप्रकृतकांतिभिर्मुखैः R.xix.10, K.S.iv.20; 2. to divert, to amuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुंबिका|लुम्बिका
लुंबिका <i>f.</i> A kind of musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुल्
लुल् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pres. लोलति)</i> 1. To move hither and thither, to roll about, लोलद्भुजाकारबृहत्तरंगम् Sis.iii.7; 2. to stir, to agitate, to make tremulous.With वि-, 1. to shake, to make tremulous; 2. to move to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुलाप|लुलापः
लुलाप <i>m.</i> A buffalo, कंचित्पश्वधमं लुलायहतकं व्याजं वितन्वन् कृतावाधास्ये शतपद्यकम् M.S.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुलाय|लुलायः
लुलाप <i>m.</i> A buffalo, कंचित्पश्वधमं लुलायहतकं व्याजं वितन्वन् कृतावाधास्ये शतपद्यकम् M.S.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुलित|लुलितः
लुलित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Shaken, tossed about, tremulous, moved to and fro, अंभस्त्रिस्रोतसं नौलुलितं ववंदे R.xvi.24; 2. disturbed, लुलितमकरंदो मधुकरैः Ve.i.; 3. injured, destroyed; 4. coming in contact, touching, अनतिलुलितज्याघातांकं मुहुर्मणिबंधनात् कनकवलयं भ्रष्टं भ्रष्टं मया प्रतिसार्यते Sak.iii.; 5. elegant, agreeable, beautiful, वनं लुलितपल्लवम् Bt.ix.56; 6. drooping, languid, अलसलुलितमुग्धान्यध्वसंजातखेदात् (अंगकानि) Ut.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुलिता
लुलित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Shaken, tossed about, tremulous, moved to and fro, अंभस्त्रिस्रोतसं नौलुलितं ववंदे R.xvi.24; 2. disturbed, लुलितमकरंदो मधुकरैः Ve.i.; 3. injured, destroyed; 4. coming in contact, touching, अनतिलुलितज्याघातांकं मुहुर्मणिबंधनात् कनकवलयं भ्रष्टं भ्रष्टं मया प्रतिसार्यते Sak.iii.; 5. elegant, agreeable, beautiful, वनं लुलितपल्लवम् Bt.ix.56; 6. drooping, languid, अलसलुलितमुग्धान्यध्वसंजातखेदात् (अंगकानि) Ut.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

