लू
लू <i>vt. 1U (pp. लून; pres. लुनाति, लुनीते; desid. लुलूषति-ते)</i> 1. To cut, to cut off, to sever, to divide, to pluck, पुरीमवस्कंदं लुनीहि नंदनम् Sis.i.51, किसलयमलूनं कररुहैः Sak.ii., शरासनज्यामलुनाद्बिडौजसः K.S.iii.61; 2. to cut off, to destroy, लोकानलावीद्विजितांश्च तस्य Bt.ii.53.With आ-, to pluck, K.S.ii.41.With विप्र-, to pluck off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=628-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

