लेप|लेपः
लेप <i>m.</i> 1. Anointing, smearing, plastering, Yaj.i.188; 2. unguent, ointment; 3. plaster of any kind; 4. food; 5. the wipings of the hand after offering funeral oblations to the first three ancestors; (these wipings are offered to the three paternal ancestors immediately preceding the Sapiṇḍas) (in law), (लेपभाजश्चतुर्थाद्याः पित्राद्याः पिंडभागिनः); 6. defilement, pollution, impurity; 7. sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=629-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

