वचनग्राहिन्
वचन-कारिन्, -ग्राहिन् <i>a.</i> obedient, compliant, submissive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=634-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

