वंठर <i>m.</i> 1. A rope for tying; 2. the tail of a dog; 3. the sheath that envelops the young bamboo; 4. the shoot of a tāla tree; 5. the female breast; 6. a cloud, (पयोधर being interpreted in two ways).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंड|वण्ड|वण्डः
वंड <i>(I) a. (f. डा)</i> 1. Crippled, maimed; 2. unmarried; 3. emasculated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंडा|वण्डा
वंड <i>(I) a. (f. डा)</i> 1. Crippled, maimed; 2. unmarried; 3. emasculated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंड|वण्ड|वण्डः
वंड <i>(II) m.</i> A man who has no prepuce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंडर|वण्डर|वंडरः|वण्डरः
वंडर <i>m.</i> 1. A miser; 2. a eunuch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंडा|वण्डा
वंडा <i>f.</i> An unchaste woman. Cf. रंडा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्
वत् <i>(I) a. (f. ती)</i> An affix added to nouns to form possessive adjectives, e.g. विद्यावत्, भास्वत्; added to past passive participles form past active participles, e.g. कृतवत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वती
वत् <i>(I) a. (f. ती)</i> An affix added to nouns to form possessive adjectives, e.g. विद्यावत्, भास्वत्; added to past passive participles form past active participles, e.g. कृतवत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्
वत् <i>(II) ind.</i> An affix, translatable by ‘as, like,’ added to noun to form adverbs, e.g. दुरालोकः स समरे निदाघांबररत्नवत् K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत
वत <i>ind.</i> The same as बत q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वतंस|वतंसः
वतंस <i>m.</i> The same as अवतंस q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वतोका
वतोका <i>f.</i> A woman barren or childless, or one who has miscarried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

