वत्सतर|वत्सतरः
वत्स-तर <i>m.</i> a weaned calf, a steer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सतरी
वत्स-तरी <i>f.</i> a heifer, M.xi.137.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सनाभ|वत्सनाभः
वत्स-नाभ <i>m.</i> 1. name of a tree; 2. a kind of strong poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सपाल|वत्सपालः
वत्स-पाल <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Kṛṣṇa; 2. of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=636-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सक|वत्सकं|वत्सकः
वत्सक <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A little calf; 2. a child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सक|वत्सकं|वत्सकः
वत्सक <i>(II) n.</i> Black sulphate of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सर|वत्सरः
वत्सर <i>m.</i> 1. A year, M.ix.76; 2. an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सरांतक|वत्सरान्तक|वत्सरान्तकः
