वत्सल|वत्सलः
वत्सल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Affectionate, affectionate towards offspring, R.ii.69, viii.41; 2. longing for, fond of, devoted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सला
वत्सल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Affectionate, affectionate towards offspring, R.ii.69, viii.41; 2. longing for, fond of, devoted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सल|वत्सलः
वत्सल <i>(II) m.</i> A fire fed with grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सल|वत्सलः
वत्सल <i>(III) n.</i> Affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

