वदन-आसव <i>m.</i> saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

