वदन्य|वदन्यः
वदन्य <i>a.</i> The same as वदान्य q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदर|वदरं|वदरः
वदर <i>m.</i> The same as बदर q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदाल|वदालः
वदाल <i>m.</i> 1. A whirlpool; 2. a kind of sheat-fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदावद|वदावदः
वदावद <i>a. (f. दा)</i> Eloquent, talkative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=637-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

