वंदिन्|वन्दिन्
वंदिन् <i>n.</i> 1. A panegyrist, a bard; (there is a separate caste of bards said to have sprung from a Kṣatriya father and a Śūdra mother); 2. a captive, a prisoner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=639-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंदी
