वपुस्
वपुस् <i>n.</i> 1. Body, person, गुरुत्वाद्वपुषो नरेंद्रः R.ii.18, कांतमिदं वपुश्च ii.47; 2. form, figure, लिखितवपुषौ संखपद्मौ च दृष्ट्वा Megh.ii.17; 3. beauty, beautiful appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=639-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वपुर्धर
