वम्रि <i>f.</i> An ant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=640-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वम्रिकूट
वम्रि-कूट <i>n.</i> an ant-hill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=640-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वय्
