विदर्भ|विदर्भः
विदर्भ <i>(I) m. pl.</i> 1. Name of a district now called Berar, अस्ति दक्षिणापथे विदर्भेषु पद्मपुरं नाम नगरम् M.M.i.; 2. the natives of this country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=663-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

