विदार|विदारः
विदार <i>m.</i> 1. Cutting asunder, rending; 2. war, battle; 3. a flood, an inundation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=664-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदारक|विदारकं|विदारकः
विदारक <i>m.</i> 1. A tree or rock in the middle of a stream; 2. a hole sunk in the bed of a dry river for water; 3. a divider.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=664-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदारण|विदारणं|विदारणः
विदारण <i>(I) m.</i> 1. War, battle; 2. the Karṇikāra tree; 3. a tree or rock in the middle of a stream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=664-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदारण|विदारणं|विदारणः
विदारण <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Splitting, tearing, breaking, युवजनहृदयविदारणमनसिजनखरुचिकिंशुकजाले Git.G.i.; 2. afflicting; 3. killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=664-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदारणा
विदारणा <i>f.</i> War, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=664-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदारु|विदारुः
विदारु <i>m.</i> A lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=664-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

