विदित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Known, understood; 2. informed; 3. promised, agreed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=664-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदित|विदितं|विदितः
