विशेषक|विशेषकः
विशेषक <i>(I) m.n.</i> 1. Any distinguishing characteristic; 2. a mark on the forehead made with sandal; 3. painting the person with perfumes, विरचिता मधुनोपवनश्रियामभिनवा इव पत्रविशेषकाः R.ix.29, Sis.x.84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=678-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विशेषक|विशेषकः
