विशेषण|विशेषणं
विशेषण <i>n.</i> 1. Distinguishing, discriminating; 2. distinction; 3. a distinguishing mark, an attribute; 4. a word which particularizes another, an adjective (in gram.), (op. to विशेष्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=678-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

