विषम <i>(I) a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Uneven, rough, rugged, रेवां द्रक्षस्युपलविषमे विंध्यपादे विशीर्णाम् Megh.i.19; 2. odd (as a number); 3. irregular, unequal; 4. difficult, hard to understand; 5. rough, coarse; 6. troublesome, vexatious; 7. unequal, unparalleled; 8. fearful; 9. dishonest; 10. adverse, unpropitious, e.g. विषमो दैवदुर्विपाकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषम|विषमं|विषमः
विषम <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Unevenness; 2. oddness; 3. a precipice; 4. a difficulty, a misfortune, कुतस्त्वा कश्मलमिदं विषमे समुपस्थितम् Bg.ii.2; 5. a figure of speech consisting in the description of some incompatibility of cause and effect. See K.Pr.x.40, 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

