विषाण <i>m.n.</i> 1. A horn, तैलाभ्यक्तविषाणा बद्धाः प्रवहणबलीवर्दाः Mrich.iv., कदाचिदपि पर्यटञ् शशविषाणमासादयेत् Bhartr.ii.5; 2. the tusk of an elephant or boar, न जातु वैनायकमेकमुद्धृतं विषाणमद्यापि पुनः प्ररोहति Sis.i.60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषाणी
विषाणी <i>f.</i> 1. A horn, तैलाभ्यक्तविषाणा बद्धाः प्रवहणबलीवर्दाः Mrich.iv., कदाचिदपि पर्यटञ् शशविषाणमासादयेत् Bhartr.ii.5; 2. the tusk of an elephant or boar, न जातु वैनायकमेकमुद्धृतं विषाणमद्यापि पुनः प्ररोहति Sis.i.60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषाणिन्
विषाणिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Having horns; 2. having tusks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषाणिनी
विषाणिन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Having horns; 2. having tusks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषाणिन्
विषाणिन् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A bull; 2. an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषाद|विषादः
विषाद <i>m.</i> 1. Dejection, depression, despondency, languor; 2. disappointment, despair, विषादलुप्तप्रतिपत्ति विस्मितं कुमारसैन्यं सपदि स्थितं च तत् R.iii.40; 3. sorrow, affliction, तदपोहितुर्महसि मे R.viii.54; 4. dulness, insensibility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषादिन्
विषादिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Dejected, sad, disconsolate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषादिनी
विषादिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Dejected, sad, disconsolate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषार|विषारः
विषार <i>m.</i> A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषालु
विषालु <i>a.</i> Poisonous, venomous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषु
विषु <i>ind.</i> 1. In two equal parts; 2. differently, variously; 3. same, like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषुप|विषुपं
विषुप <i>n.</i> The equinox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषुव|विषुवं
विषुव <i>n.</i> The first point of Aries or Libra into which the sun enters at the vernal or autumnal equinox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषुवछाया|विषुवच्छाया
विषुव-छाया <i>f.</i> the shadow of the gnomon at noon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषुवदिन
विषुव-दिन <i>n.</i> the day of the equinox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=680-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषुवरेखा
