विषुवत्|विषुवन्त्
विषुवत् <i>n.</i> The equinoctial point.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

