विष्क्
विष्क् <i>vt. 10Ā (in the first sense), 10U (in the second) (pres. विष्कयति-ते)</i> 1. To kill, to injure; 2. to see, to perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्कंद|विष्कन्द|विष्कंदः|विष्कन्दः
विष्कंद <i>m.</i> Dispersing, going away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्कंभ|विष्कम्भ|विष्कंभः|विष्कम्भः
विष्कंभ <i>m.</i> 1. Obstacle, impediment; 2. the supporting pillar of a house; 3. the bolt of a door; 4. a post; 5. a tree; 6. an interlude between the acts of a drama performed by one or more inferior actors who explain to the audience what is supposed to have happened between the acts or what is likely to happen afterwards, (वृत्तवर्तिष्यमाणानां कथांशानां निदर्षकः । संक्षिप्तार्थस्तु विष्कंभ आदावंकस्य दर्शितः । मध्येन मध्यमाभ्यां वा पात्राभ्यां संप्रजितः । शुद्धः स्यात् सा तु संकीर्णो नीचमध्यमकल्पितः); 7. the diameter of a circle; 8. a particular posture practised by Yogins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्कंभक|विष्कम्भक
विष्कंभक <i>m.</i> The same as विष्कंभ q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्कंभिन्|विष्कम्भिन्
विष्कंभिन् <i>m.</i> The bolt of a door.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्किर|विष्किरः
विष्किर <i>m.</i> 1. Scattering about; 2. a cock; 3. a bird in general, छायापस्किरमाणविष्किरमुखव्याकृष्टकीटत्वचः Ut.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टप|विष्टपं|विष्टपः
