विष्टब्ध
विष्टब्ध <i>a. (f. ब्धा)</i> 1. Fixed firmly, well-supported; 2. obstructed, hindered; 3. made motionless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

