विष्टंभ|विष्टम्भ|विष्टंभः|विष्टम्भः
विष्टंभ <i>m.</i> 1. Obstruction, impediment; 2. stopping, staying; 3. obstruction of the urine or feces; 4. paralysis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टर|विष्टरः
