विष्ठल|विष्ठलं
विष्ठल <i>n.</i> A place situated at a distance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्ठा
