विष्णु|विष्णुः
विष्णु <i>m.</i> 1. Name of the second deity of the Hindu triad, regarded as the preserver of the universe; (the word is thus derived- यस्माद्विश्वमिदं सर्वं तस्य शक्त्या महात्मनः । तस्मादेवोच्यते विष्णुर्विशधातोः प्रवेशनात्; for his ten incarnations, See under अवतार); 2. an epithet of fire; 3. a pious man; 4. name of a law-giver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

