विष्णुतैल|विष्णुतैलं
विष्णु-तैल <i>n.</i> a kind of medicinal oil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=681-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

