वृज्
वृज् <i>(I) vt. 7P (pres. वृणक्ति)</i> 1. To choose; 2. to lose, to abandon, to avoid; 3. to purify, तन्मेरेतः पिता वृंक्तामित्यस्यैतन्निदर्शनम् M.ix.20. (This root is very rarely used in classics; in the quotation from Manu, the word occurs not as Manu’s own but as part of a Vedie text.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=686-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

