वृज्
वृज् <i>(III) vt. 1P, 10U (pres. वर्जति, वर्जयति-ते)</i> 1. To abandon, to give up; 2. to abstain from, M.ii.177; 3. to shun, to avoid.With आ-, to bend, to incline, नूनमावर्ज्य दृष्टीः Megh.i.46; 2. to offer, R.i.62.With परि-, to avoid.With वि-, 1. to avoid; 2. to be destitute of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=686-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

