वृता
वृत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Surrounded, covered, screened; 2. chosen, selected; 3. agreed, assented to; 4. hired; 5. vitiated, spoiled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=687-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृति|वृतिः
