वृत्त|वृत्तं|वृत्तः
वृत्त <i>(I) a. (f. त्ता)</i> 1. Turned; 2. round, circular, K.S.i.35, R.vi.32; 3. occurred, passed, finished, R.ii.58; 4. been, existed; 5. done, performed, acted; 6. dead, deceased; 7. fixed, firm; 8. studied, read through; 9. chosen, selected, (pp. of वृत् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=687-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृत्ता
वृत्त <i>(I) a. (f. त्ता)</i> 1. Turned; 2. round, circular, K.S.i.35, R.vi.32; 3. occurred, passed, finished, R.ii.58; 4. been, existed; 5. done, performed, acted; 6. dead, deceased; 7. fixed, firm; 8. studied, read through; 9. chosen, selected, (pp. of वृत् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=687-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृत्त|वृत्तं|वृत्तः
वृत्त <i>(II) m.</i> A tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=687-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृत्त|वृत्तं|वृत्तः
वृत्त <i>(III) n.</i> 1. A circle, a circumference; 2. event, occurrence; 3. occupation, mode of life, practice, अनेन विप्रो वृत्तेन वर्तयन् वेदशास्त्रवित् M.iv.260; 4. behaviour, demeanour; 5. observance of any established rule or usage; 6. a metre regulated by the number of syllables, तच्च वृत्तं जातिरिति द्विधा K.D.i.11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=687-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृत्तानुसार|वृत्तानुसारः
वृत्त-अनुसार <i>m.</i> 1. conformity to prescribed practice; 2. conformity to metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=687-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृत्तांत|वृत्तान्त|वृत्तान्तः
वृत्त-अंत <i>m.</i> 1. occurrenee, event, यथा च वृत्तांतमिमं सदोगत … … तवैव संदेशहर द्विशापतिः शृणोति लोकेश तथा विधायताम् R.iii.66; 2. news, tidings, वृत्तांतेन श्रवणविषयप्रापिणा तेन R.xiv.87; 3. a tale, a narrative, a story; 4. topic, subject; 5. the whole, totality; 6. kind, sort; 7. mode, manner; 8. rest, leisure, opportunity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=687-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृत्तेर्वारु|वृत्तेर्वारुः|वृत्तेर्व्वारुः
वृत्त-इर्वारु <i>m.</i> the water-melon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=687-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

