वृथा
वृथा <i>ind.</i> 1. Uselessly, unnecessarily, fruitlessly, in vain, to no purpose, अनिर्लोडितकार्यस्य वाग्जालं वाग्मिनो वृथा Sis.ii.27, iii.52; 2. foolishly, idly; 3. wrongly, incorrectly.(In composition with nouns, वृथा means ‘idle, false, vain, useless &c.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=688-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

