वृथा-मति <i>a.</i> foolish-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=688-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृथामांस|वृथामांसं
