वृष्
वृष् <i>(I) vt. or vi. 1P (pp. वृष्ट; pres. वर्षति)</i> 1. To rain, (either used impersonally or with such words as इंद्र, मेघ, पर्जन्य, देव as the subject), मेघा वर्षंतु गर्जंतु मूंचंत्वशनिमेव वा Mrich.v., or उन्नमति नमति वर्षंति गर्जंति मेघः करोति तिमिरौघम् ibid, or गर्ज वा वर्ष वा शक्र मुंच वा शतशोऽशनिम् ibid; 2. to shower down, to pour down, e.g. पुष्पवृष्टिमवर्षन्; 3. to give, to bestow; 4. to be capable of generating; 5. to have supreme power.With अभि-, 1. to shower, to rain; 2. to give, to bestow.With प्र-, to rain, to shower, प्रवर्षंति प्रेयसि चंद्रिकाभिश्चकोरचंचूचुलुकां प्रतीन्दुः Na.xxii.41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=689-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृष्
वृष् <i>(II) vi. 10Ā (pres. वर्षयते)</i> 1. To be powerful; 2. to have the power of generation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=689-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृष|वृषं|वृषः
