वेदत्रय
वेद-त्रय <i>n.</i> the three Vedas, (ऋग्यजुःसामानि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=690-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

