वेदविद्
वेद-विद् <i>m.</i> a Brāhmaṇa conversant with the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=690-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदविहित
वेद-विहित <i>a.</i> enjoined by the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=690-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदव्यास|वेदव्यासः
वेद-व्यास <i>m.</i> an epithet of Vyāsa as being the arranger of the Vedas, वेदव्यासः स नव दश यो वेद वेदाक्षराणि Venkaṭādhvari.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=690-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदसंन्यास|वेदसन्न्यास|वेदसंन्यासः
