वेदन|वेदनं
वेदन <i>n.</i> 1. Knowledge, perception; 2. acquisition, wealth, property; 3. marrying, marriage, M.iii.44; 4. sensation, experiencing.(वेदना is used also in the sense of ‘pain, agony, torment,’ सहतां हतजीवितं मम प्रबलामात्मकृतेन वेदनाम् R.viii.50.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदना
वेदना <i>f.</i> 1. Knowledge, perception; 2. acquisition, wealth, property; 3. marrying, marriage, M.iii.44; 4. sensation, experiencing.(वेदना is used also in the sense of ‘pain, agony, torment,’ सहतां हतजीवितं मम प्रबलामात्मकृतेन वेदनाम् R.viii.50.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदार|वेदारः
वेदार <i>m.</i> A lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदि|वेदिः
वेदि <i>(I) m.</i> A learned man, a paṇḍit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदि|वेदिः
वेदि <i>(II) f.</i> 1. An altar, one prepared for a sacrifice; 2. a quadrangular spot before a temple or a palace; 3. a seal-ring, मध्येन सा वेदिविलग्नमध्या K.S.i.39 (against Mall. who renders वेदि by परिष्कृता भूमिः); 4. an epithet of Sarasvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदिजा
वेदि-जा <i>f.</i> an epithet of Draupadī who was born from the midst of an altar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदिका
वेदिका <i>f.</i> 1. A raised spot of ground prepared for auspicious purposes, K.S.iii.44; 2. an open shade in the middle of a courtyard; 3. a bower, an arbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदिन्
वेदिन् <i>m.</i> 1. A teacher; 2. a learned Brāhmaṇa; 3. an epithet of Brahman (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदी
वेदी <i>f.</i> The same as वेदि II q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेद्य|वेद्यं
वेद्य <i>a. (f. द्या)</i> 1. To be known; 2. to be taught; 3. to be married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेद्या
वेद्य <i>a. (f. द्या)</i> 1. To be known; 2. to be taught; 3. to be married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेध|वेधः
वेध <i>m.</i> 1. Piercing, penetrating, perforating; 2. wounding; 3. depth (of any excavation); 4. a particular division of time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधक|वेधकं|वेधकः
वेधक <i>(I) m.</i> Name of a division of hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधक|वेधकं|वेधकः
वेधक <i>(II) n.</i> Rice in the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधन|वेधनं
वेधन <i>n.</i> 1. Piercing, perforating; 2. wounding; 3. excavation; 4. depth (of an excavation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधनिका
वेधनिका <i>f.</i> A pointed instrument for perforating jewels or shells.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधनी
वेधनी <i>f.</i> 1. A pointed instrument for perforating jewels or shells; 2. an instrument for piercing an elephant’s ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधस्
वेधस् <i>m.</i> 1. An epithet of Brahman (m.), तं वेधा विदधे नूनं महाभूतसमाधिना K.S.ii.6, v.41; 2. of Śiva; 3. of Viṣṇu; 4. the sun; 5. a learned man; 6. a species of the Arka plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधस|वेधसं
वेधस <i>n.</i> The part of the hand under the thumb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधित|वेधितः
वेधित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Pierced, perforated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेधिता
वेधित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Pierced, perforated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेन्
वेन् <i>vt. 1U (pres. वेनति-ते)</i> The same as वेण् q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेन|वेनः
वेन <i>m.</i> The same as वेण (2) q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेन्ना
वेन्ना <i>f.</i> The same as वेणा q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेप्
वेप् <i>vi. 4Ā (pp. वेपित; pres. वेपते)</i> To shake, to quiver, to tremble, वेपमानजननीशिरश्चिदा प्रागजीयत घृणा ततो मही R.xi.65.With प्र-, to quiver, to tremble, to shake, K.S.v.27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेपथु|वेपथुः
वेपथु <i>m.</i> Tremor, trembling, वेपथुश्च शरीरे मे रोमहर्षश्च जायते Bg.i.29, K.S.v.85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेपन|वेपनं
वेपन <i>n.</i> Tremor, trembling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेम|वेमः
वेम <i>m.</i> A loom, मह सिवेम्नः सहकृत्वरी बहुम् Na.i.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेमन्
वेमन् <i>m.n.</i> A loom, मह सिवेम्नः सहकृत्वरी बहुम् Na.i.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेर|वेरं|वेरः
वेर <i>m.n.</i> 1. The body; 2. saffron; 3. the egg-plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेरट|वेरटः
वेरट <i>(I) m.</i> A low man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेरट|वेरटः
वेरट <i>(II) n.</i> The fruit of the jujube.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=691-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल्
वेल् <i>(I) vt. or vi. 1P (pres. वेलति)</i> 1. To go, to move; 2. to shake, to tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल्
वेल् <i>(II) vi. 10U (pres. वेलयति-ते)</i> To count the time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल|वेलं|वेलः
वेल <i>n.</i> A garden, a grove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेला
वेला <i>f.</i> 1. Time, इमामुग्रातपां वेलाम् Sak.ii., or ग्रहणसमयवेला वर्तते शीतरश्मेः Sr.T.6; 2. opportunity, season; 3. tide, flow, current; 4. the seashore, स वेलावप्रवलयां परिखीकृतसागराम् R.i.30, viii.80, xiii.15; 5. limit, boundary; 6. speech; 7. easy death; 8. the gums.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेलाकूल|वेलाकूलं
