वेलामूल
वेला-मूल <i>n.</i> the seashore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल्ल्
वेल्ल् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pres. वेल्लति)</i> To move, यस्मिन् वेल्लति Bh.V.i.55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल्ल|वेल्लं|वेल्लः
वेल्ल <i>m.</i> 1. Shaking, moving; 2. rolling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल्लन|वेल्लनं
वेल्लन <i>n.</i> 1. Shaking, moving; 2. rolling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल्लहल|वेल्लहलः
वेल्लहल <i>m.</i> A libertine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल्लि|वेल्लिः
वेल्लि <i>f.</i> A creeper. Cf. वल्लि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल्लित|वेल्लितं|वेल्लितः
वेल्लित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Tremulous, shaken; 2. carved, crooked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेल्लिता
वेल्लित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Tremulous, shaken; 2. carved, crooked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=692-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

