व्यध् <i>vt. 4P (pp. विद्ध; pres. विध्यति)</i> 1. To strike, to hurt, to stab, शब्दायमानमव्यार्सीद् भयदं क्षणदाचरम् Bt.v.52, R.ix.60; 2. to pick; 3. to pierce, to perforate (as a jewel).With अनु-, 1. to pierce, to wound; 2. to intertwine.With अप-, 1. To cast away, to throw away; 2. to pierce, हृदयमशरणं मे पक्ष्मलाक्ष्याः कटाक्षैरपहृतमपविद्धं पीतमुन्मूलितं च M.M.i.With आ-, to throw, to pierce.With परि-, to pierce, to wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=697-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

