व्यभि(भी)चार <i>m.</i> 1. Going away from, deviating, deviation, मां च योऽव्यभिचारेण भक्तियोगेन सेवते Bg.xiv.26; 2. error, transgression, crime; 3. faithlessness, infidelity (of a wife or husband), वाङ्महझ्कर्मभिः पत्यौ व्यभिचारो यथा न मे । तथा विश्वंभरे देवि मामंतर्धातुमर्हसि R.xv.81; 4. irregularity, anomaly; 5. a fallacious Hetu, one without the Sādhya (in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=697-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

