व्यय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> Mutable, liable to decay, perishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यया
व्यय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> Mutable, liable to decay, perishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यय|व्ययं|व्ययः
