व्ययशुद्धि|व्ययशुद्धिः
व्यय-शुद्धि <i>f.</i> defraying of expenses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययित|व्ययितः
