व्यलीक|व्यलीकं|व्यलीकः
व्यलीक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. False; 2. disagreeable, displeasing, offensive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यलीका
व्यलीक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> 1. False; 2. disagreeable, displeasing, offensive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यलीक|व्यलीकं|व्यलीकः
