व्यवधान|व्यवधानं
व्यवधान <i>n.</i> 1. Intervention, interposition; 2. screening, hiding from sight, दृष्टिं विमानव्यवधानमुक्तां पुनस्सहस्रार्चिषि सन्निधत्ते R.xiii.44; 3. a screen, a partition; 4. a cover, a covering; 5. interval, space.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

