व्यवसाय|व्यवसायः
व्यवसाय <i>m.</i> 1. Resolve, settled determination, Bg.ii.41, x.36; 2. exertion, effort, industry, perseverance, K.S.iv.45; 3. action, performance, व्यवसायः प्रतिपत्तिनिष्ठुरः R.viii.65; 4. conduct, behaviour; 5. trade, business; 6. plan, device; 7. boasting; 8. an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

