व्यवस्थिता
व्यवस्थित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Standing apart; 2. adjusted properly, arranged in order; 3. fixed, settled; 4. decided, declared, determined; 5. extracted, (pp. of स्था with व्यव q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

