व्यवहर्तृ|व्यवहर्त्तृ
व्यवहर्तृ <i>m.</i> 1. The manager of a business; 2. a litigant, one who institutes an action at law; 3. a judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहार|व्यवहारः
व्यवहार <i>m.</i> 1. Practice, conduct, behaviour; 2. business, profession; 3. affair; 4. trade, commerce; 5. custom, usage; 6. a contract; 7. administration of justice, judicial procedure, व्यवहारपराधीनतया दुष्करं खलु परचित्तग्रहणमधिकरणिकैः Mrich.ix.; 8. a lawsuit, a legal dispute, ददर्श संशयच्छेद्यान् व्यवाहारानतंद्रितः R.xvii.39; 9. a title of legal procedure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=698-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

