व्यसन|व्यसनं
व्यसन <i>n.</i> 1. Separation; 2. violation, infraction; 3. loss, destruction, स्वबलव्यसनेऽतिपीड्यमानम् Kir.xiii.15; 4. misfortune, calamity, ill-luck, मुमूर्च्छ सख्यं रामस्य समानव्यसने हरौ R.xii.57, K.S.iii.73; 5. vice, evil habit, bad practice, यो हीनसंसर्गपराङ्मुखत्वाद् युवाप्यनर्थैर्व्यसनैर्विहीनः R.xviii.14; 6. sin; 7. punishment; 8. fruitless effort; 9. air, wind; 10. inability, incompetence; 11. fall, (op. to उदय), तेजोद्वयस्य युगपद् व्यसनोदयाभ्याम् Sak.iv.; 12. intent application.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=699-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

