व्याघात|व्याघातः
व्याघात <i>m.</i> 1. A blow, a stroke; 2. obstacle, impediment, hindrance; 3. contradiction; 4. a figure of speech, thus defined by Mammata- यद्यथा साधितं केनाप्यपरेण तदन्यथा । तथैव यद्विधीयेत स व्याघात इति स्मृतः K.Pr.x.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=699-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

