व्याघ्र <i>m. (fem. ˚घ्री)</i> 1. A tiger, R.ix.63; 2. the red castor-oil plant; 3. (at the end of a compound) best, preeminent, (e.g. पुरुषव्याघ्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=699-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

