व्याम <i>m.</i> A measure equal to the space between the tips of the fingers of either hand, the arms being extended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=700-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

