व्रज्
व्रज् <i>vt. 1P (pres. व्रजति)</i> 1. To go, to proceed, न चोच्छिष्टः क्वचिद् व्रजेत् M.ii.56; 2. to pass away (as time). (This verb is used in many of the senses of गम् q.v.).With अनु-, 1. to follow, M.xi.111; 2. to perform.With परि-, to wander about as a mendicant.With प्र-, 1. to go into exile; 2. to renounce the world, to enter on the fourth stage of life, to become a Sannyāsin, M.vi.39.With प्रति-, to go to or towards, Bt.viii.96.With प्रत्युद्-, to go out to meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=702-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रज|व्रजं|व्रजः
