शक्य|शक्यः
शक्य <i>a. (f. क्या)</i> 1. Possible, capable, practicable, capable of being effected (generally with an inf.), शक्योऽस्य मन्युर्भवता विनेतुम् R.xi.49, 54, Bg.vi.36; 2. fit to be effected or accomplished; 3. directly expressed (as the meaning of a word).(शक्यम् is sometimes used adverbially with a noun in any gender, and an inf., e.g. शक्यमरविंदसुरभि … अविरलमालिंगितुं पवनः Sak.iii., न हि देहभृता शक्यं त्यक्तुं कर्माण्यशेषतः Bg.xviii.11.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्या
शक्य <i>a. (f. क्या)</i> 1. Possible, capable, practicable, capable of being effected (generally with an inf.), शक्योऽस्य मन्युर्भवता विनेतुम् R.xi.49, 54, Bg.vi.36; 2. fit to be effected or accomplished; 3. directly expressed (as the meaning of a word).(शक्यम् is sometimes used adverbially with a noun in any gender, and an inf., e.g. शक्यमरविंदसुरभि … अविरलमालिंगितुं पवनः Sak.iii., न हि देहभृता शक्यं त्यक्तुं कर्माण्यशेषतः Bg.xviii.11.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

