शंक्|शङ्क्
शंक् <i>vt. or vi. 1Ā (pp. शंकित; pres. शंकते)</i> 1. To doubt, to be uncertain, to hesitate, e.g. शंके जीवति वा न वा; 2. to fear, to dread, to be afraid, नाशंकिष्ट विवस्वतः Bt.xv.39; 3. to suspect, to think probable, to believe, शंकस्व संकेतनिकेतमाप्ताः Na.xxii.42, Bt.iii.26; 4. to propound a doubt or objection, न च ब्रह्मणः प्रमाणांतरगम्यत्वं शंकितुं शक्यम् Sar.D. With अभि-, to doubt, to be doubtful, M.viii.96.With आ-, 1. to fear, to suspect, to think, to believe, यतश्च भयमाशंकेत् M.vii.188, आशंकसे यदग्निं तदिदं स्पर्शक्षमं रत्नम् Sak.i.; 2. to expect, भरतागमनं पुनः । आशंक्योत्सुकसारंगां चित्रकूटस्थलीं जहौ R.xii.24; 3. to entertain doubts about, Bt.xxi.1.With परि-, 1. to doubt, to entertain doubts about; 2. to suspect, to believe, पत्रेऽपि संचारिणि प्राप्तं त्वां परिशंकते Git.G.vi.With वि-, to fear, to suspect, to entertain suspicions about, विशंकते भीरु यतोऽवधीरणाम् Sak.iii., जनोऽभ्यथा भर्तृमतीं विशंकते v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंक|शङ्क|शंकः|शङ्कः
शंक <i>m.</i> A draught-ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकर|शङ्कर|शंकरः|शङ्करः
शंकर <i>(I) a. (f. रा or री)</i> Conferring happiness or prosperity, propitious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकरा
शंकर <i>(I) a. (f. रा or री)</i> Conferring happiness or prosperity, propitious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकरी
शंकर <i>(I) a. (f. रा or री)</i> Conferring happiness or prosperity, propitious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकर|शङ्कर|शंकरः|शङ्करः
