शंकरावास
शंकर-आवास <i>m.</i> 1. Kailāsa, the abode of Śiva; 2. a kind of camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकरी
शंकरी <i>f.</i> 1. An epithet of Pārvatī, wife of Śiva; 2. the Śamī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंका|शङ्का
शंका <i>f.</i> 1. Doubt, uncertainty; 2. an objection started in disputation; 3. fear, misgiving, apprehension, नालं विकर्तुं जनितेंद्रशंकं सुरांगनाविभ्रमचेष्टितानि R.xiii.42, xii.2, Megh.ii.6; 4. suspicion, expectation, त्वदुपावर्तनशंकि मे मनः R.viii.53; 5. belief, understanding, impression, परिसरविषयेषु लीढमुक्ता हरिततृणोद्गमशंकया मृगीभिः Kir.ii.38, कुर्वन् वधूजनमनः सु शशांकशंकाम् v.42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकित|शङ्कित|शङ्कितः
शंकित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Doubted, doubtful, uncertain; 2. alarmed, frightened; 3. distrustful, suspicious, (pp. of शंक् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकिता
शंकित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Doubted, doubtful, uncertain; 2. alarmed, frightened; 3. distrustful, suspicious, (pp. of शंक् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=705-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

