शंखध्मा|शङ्खध्मा
शंख-ध्म, -ध्मा <i>m.</i> a shell-blower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंखध्वनि|शङ्खध्वनि|शङ्खध्वनिः
शंख-ध्वनि <i>m.</i> the sound of a conch (lit.), a noise expressive of fear or disappointment (fig.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंखभृत्|शङ्खभृत्
शंख-भृत् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंखमुख|शङ्खमुख|शङ्खमुखः
