शंखनक|शङ्खनक|शंखनकः|शङ्खनकः
शंखनक(ख) <i>m.</i> A small conch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंखनख|शङ्खनख|शंखनखः|शङ्खनखः
