शची(चि)-पति, -भर्तृ <i>m.</i> an epithet of Indra. Cf. सचि and सची.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

