शंड|शण्ड|शण्डं|शंडः|शण्डः
शंड <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A eunuch, an impotent man; 2. a bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंड|शण्ड|शण्डं|शंडः|शण्डः
