शतानंद|शतानन्द|शतानन्दः
शत-आनंद <i>m.</i> 1. an epithet of Brahman (m.); 2. an epithet of Kṛṣṇa; 3. the car of Viṣṇu; 4. name of a son of Gotama and Ahalyā, the family-priest of king Janaka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतायुस्
