शतपद्
शत-पद्, -पाद् <i>a.</i> having a hundred feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपाद्
शत-पद्, -पाद् <i>a.</i> having a hundred feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

