शत-रूपा <i>f.</i> 1. name of the wife of Brahman (m.); 2. of his daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतवेधिन्
शत-वेधिन् <i>m.</i> a sort of sorrel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतशस्
शत-शस् <i>ind.</i> 1. a hundred times, इदमाख्याहि शतशः Ve.vi.; 2. hundredfold, multifariously, Bg.xi.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतसहस्र|शतसहस्रं
शत-सहस्र <i>n.</i> a hundred thousand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतसाहस्र
शत-साहस्र <i>a.</i> 1. containing or consisting of a hundred thousand; 2. bought with a hundred thousand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतह्रदा
शत-ह्रदा <i>f.</i> 1. lightning, K.S.vii.39; 2. Indra’s thunderbolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=706-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतक|शतकः
शतक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> Containing a hundred, a hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतका
शतक <i>(I) a. (f. का)</i> Containing a hundred, a hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतक|शतकः
शतक <i>(II) n.</i> A collection of hundred, a century, e.g. अमरुशतक ‘a collection of one hundred stanzas composed by Amaru.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतिक|शतिकः
शतिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Relating to a hundred; 2. bought with a hundred; 3. charged for a hundred; 4. effecting anything with a hundred; 5. containing or consisting of a hundred, Yaj.ii.208.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतिकी
शतिक <i>a. (f. की)</i> 1. Relating to a hundred; 2. bought with a hundred; 3. charged for a hundred; 4. effecting anything with a hundred; 5. containing or consisting of a hundred, Yaj.ii.208.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतिन्
शतिन् <i>m.</i> The owner of a hundred, e.g. निःस्वो वष्टि शतं शती दशशतम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रि|शत्त्रिः
शत्रि <i>m.</i> An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रु|शत्रुः
शत्रु <i>m.</i> 1. A destroyer, a conqueror; 2. an enemy, a foe; 3. a hostile neighbouring king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रूपजाप|शत्रूपजापः
शत्रु-उपजाप <i>m.</i> the treacherous whispering of an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुकक्ष
शत्रु-कक्ष <i>m.</i> 1. the side of an enemy; 2. an antagonist, an enemy, an opponent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुंजय|शत्रुञ्जय|शत्रुंजयः|शत्रुञ्जयः
शत्रुंजय <i>m.</i> an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुदमन
शत्रु-दमन <i>a.</i> subduing an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुंतप|शत्रुन्तप|शत्रुन्तपः
शत्रुंतप <i>a.</i> subduing or destroying enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुहत्या
शत्रु-हत्या <i>f.</i> foe-slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्वरी
शत्वरी <i>f.</i> Night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शद्
शद् <i>(I) vi. 1P (but Atm. in conjugational tenses) (pp. शत्र; pres. शीयते; caus. शातयति-ते)</i> To perish, to wither, to decay, to fall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शद्
शद् <i>(II) vi. 1P (pres. शदति) (generally with आ)</i> To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शद्रि|शद्रिः
शद्रि <i>m.</i> 1. A cloud; 2. an elephant; 3. a name of Arjuna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शद्रु|शद्रुः
शद्रु <i>a.</i> 1. Falling, perishing; 2. going, moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनकैस्
शनकैस् <i>ind.</i> The same as शनैस् q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनि|शनिः
शनि <i>m.</i> 1. The planet Saturn; (he is the son of the Sun and represented as of a black colour or dressed in dark clothes); 2. Saturday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनिज
शनि-ज <i>n.</i> black pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनिप्रदोष|शनिप्रदोषः
शनि-प्रदोष <i>m.</i> worship of Śiva on the 13th day of a lunar fortnight when it falls on a Saturday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनिप्रिय|शनिप्रियं
शनि-प्रिय <i>n.</i> sapphire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनिवार|शनिवारः
शनि-वार, -वासर <i>m.</i> Saturday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनिवासर|शनिवासरः
शनि-वार, -वासर <i>m.</i> Saturday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनैस्
शनैस् <i>ind.</i> 1. Slowly, tardily; 2. mildly, softly; 3. gradually, litte by little, शनैः कृतप्राणविमुक्तिरीशः K.S.iii.51; 4. in order, successively, M.i.15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनैश्चर|शनैश्चरः
शनैश्चर <i>(I) a.</i> moving slowly, शनैश्चराभ्यां पादाभ्याण् रेजे ग्रहमयीव सा Bhartr.i.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शनैश्चर|शनैश्चरः
शनैश्चर <i>(II) m.</i> an epithet of the planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शप्
शप् <i>vt. or vi. 1U, 4U (pp. शप्त; pres. शपति-ते, शप्यति-ते)</i> 1. To curse, to imprecate, न भविष्यति मत्प्रसूतिमनाराध्य प्रजेति त्वां शशाप सा R.i.77, अशपद्भव मानुषीति ताम् R.viii.80, ix.78; 2. to take an oath, to swear, to promise by oath, भावानुरक्तवनितासुरतैः शपेयम् Ghat.22; (in this sense, शप् sometimes governs a cognate accusative, e.g. नैतन्मतं मत्कमिति ब्रुवाणः सहस्रशोऽसौ शपथानशप्यत् Bt.iii.32; but generally it takes the accusative of the person to whom a promise is made, and the instrumental of the object by which it is made; when used intransitively it governs the dative of the object or person by which the oath is taken, प्रेमजिज्ञासमानाभ्यस्ताभ्योऽशप्सत Bt.viii.33; 3. to blame, (with a dat., e.g. कृष्णाय शपे).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शप|शपः
शप <i>m.</i> 1. An imprecation, a curse; 2. an oath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=707-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शपत्र
शपत्र <i>n.</i> 1. An imprecation, curse; 2. an oath; 3. abuse, abusive language.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शपथ|शपथः
शपथ <i>m.</i> 1. An imprecation, a curse; 2. an oath, an asseveration by oath or ordeal, M.viii.109; 3. conjuration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शपन|शपनं
शपन <i>n.</i> The same as शपथ q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शप्त|शप्तः
शप्त <i>a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Cursed; 2. sworn; 3. abused, (pp. of शप् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शप्ता
शप्त <i>a. (f. प्ता)</i> 1. Cursed; 2. sworn; 3. abused, (pp. of शप् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शफ|शफं|शफः
शफ <i>m.n.</i> 1. A hoof; 2. the root of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शफर|शफरः
शफर <i>m. (fem. ˚री)</i> A kind of small glittering fish, त्रस्यंती चलशफरीविघट्टितोरूः Sis.viii.24, K.S.iv.39, Rt.iii.3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शफराधिप|शफराधिपः
शफर-अधिप <i>m.</i> the Illīśa fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शबर|शबरः
शबर <i>m.</i> The same as शवर q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शबल|शबलः
शबल <i>a.</i> The same as शवल q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शबला
शबला <i>f.</i> A spotted cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शबली
शबला <i>f.</i> A spotted cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्द्
शब्द् <i>vt. 10U (pp. शब्दित; pres. शब्दयति-ते)</i> 1. To sound, to make any noise; 2. to call, to call out to, to speak, विततमृदुकराग्रः शब्दयंत्या वयोभिः परिपतति दिवोऽंके हेलया बालसूर्यः Sis.xi.47.With प्र-, to explain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्द|शब्दः
शब्द <i>m.</i> 1. Sound, noise, स शब्दस्तुमुलोऽभवत् Bg.i.13, विश्वासोपगमादभिन्नगतयः Sak.i.; 2. sound (considered as the property of आकाश); See R.xiii.1; 3. the sound of a musical instrument, K.S.i.45; 4. a word, a significant word, क्षत्रस्य शब्दो भुवनेषु रूढः R.ii.53; 5. a declinable word, a substantive (in gram.); 6. verbal authority (considered as a प्रमाण by the Naiyāyikas); 7. title, epithet, नृपेण चक्रे युवराजशब्दभाक् R.iii.35, ii.64, iii.49, v.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दातीत
शब्द-अतीत <i>a.</i> beyond the reach of language, indescribable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दाधिष्ठान|शब्दाधिष्ठानं
शब्द-अधिष्ठान <i>n.</i> the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दाध्याहार|शब्दाध्याहारः
शब्द-अध्याहार <i>m.</i> supplying an ellipsis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दानुशासन
शब्द-अनुशासन <i>n.</i> the science of words, i.e. grammar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दार्थ|शब्दार्थः
शब्द-अर्थ <i>(I) m. du.</i> a word and its sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दार्थ|शब्दार्थः
शब्द-अर्थ <i>(II) m.</i> the meaning of a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दालंकार|शब्दालङ्कार|शब्दालंकारः
शब्द-अलंकार <i>m.</i> a figure of speech depending on words or sound; (such an अलम्कार vanishes if the words on which it depends are substituted by others of the same meaning; for instances, See K.Pr.ix.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दाख्येय
शब्द-आख्येय <i>(I) a.</i> fit to be communicated in words, Megh.ii.40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दाख्येय
शब्द-आख्येय <i>(II) n.</i> a verbal massage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दाडंबर|शब्दाडम्बर|शब्दाडम्बरः
शब्द-आडंबर <i>m.</i> verbosity, bombast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दकोश|शब्दकोशः
शब्द-कोश <i>m.</i> a dictionary, a lexicon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दगत
