शब्दचित्र
शब्द-चित्र <i>n.</i> one of the two subdivisions of the last division of poetry; in it, the charm consists in the fanciful use of words giving pleasure to the ear by mere sound; the following is an instance, मित्रात्रिपुत्रनेत्राय त्रयीशात्रवशत्रेव । गोत्रारिगोत्रजैत्राय गोत्रात्रे ते नमो नमः R.G.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=708-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

