शिष्
शिष् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pres. शेषति)</i> To hurt, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=720-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्
शिष् <i>(II) vt. 1P, 10U (pres. शेषति, शेषयति-ते)</i> To leave a residue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=720-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्
शिष् <i>(III) vt. 7P (pp. शिष्ट; pres. शिनष्टि)</i> 1. To leave, to leave remaining; 2. to distinguish from others.With अव-, to leave remaining, कियदवशिष्टं रजन्याः Sak.iv., स्तंबेन नीवार इवावशिष्टः R.v.15.With परि-, to leave remaining.With वि-, 1. to distinguish from others, to individualize, R.xvii.62; 2. to augment, पुनरकांडविवर्तनदारुणो विधिरहो विशिनष्टि (v.l.) मनोरुजम् M.M.iv.; 3. (in the pass.) to be preferable or superior, (with an abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=720-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्
शिष् <i>Caus. (शेषयति-ते)</i> With वि-, to excel, to surpass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=720-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्ट|शिष्टः
