शील्
शील् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pres. शीलयति-ते)</i> 1. To honour, to worship; 2. to study, to exercise, to practise repeatedly, श्रुतिशतमपि भूयः शीलितं भारतं वा Bh.V.ii.35; 3. to visit, to go to, स्मेरानना सपदि शीलय सौधमौलिम् Bh.V.ii.4; 4. to put on, to wear, चल सखि कुंजं सतिमिरपुंजं शीलय नीलनिचोलम् Git.G.v.(This root often used with अनु and परि, without any change of meaning.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=722-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

