शुच्
शुच् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pres. शोचति)</i> 1. To bewail, to grieve for, to be sorry, मा शुचः संपदं दैवीमभिजातोऽसि पांडव Bg.xvi.5, Bt.xv.71; 2. to regret, to repent.With अनु-, to bewail, अशोच्यानन्वशोचस्त्वं प्रज्ञावादांश्च भाषते । गतासूनगतासूंश्च नानुशोचंति पंडिताः Bg.ii.11.With परि-, to bewail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=723-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

