शुचि-द्रुम <i>m.</i> the sacred fig tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=723-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुचिमणि|शुचिमणिः
