शुचि-स्मित <i>a.</i> having a sweet smile, K.S.v.20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=723-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुचिस्
