शुच्य्
शुच्य् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pres. शुच्यति)</i> 1. To bathe; 2. to distil; 3. to churn; 4. to press, to squeeze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=723-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुटीर|शुटीरः
