शुठ्
शुठ् <i>(I) vt. or vi. 1P (pres. शोठति)</i> 1. To be impeded; 2. to be lame; 3. to resist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=723-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुठ्
शुठ् <i>(II) vi. 10U (pres. शोठयति-ते)</i> To be idle, to be lazy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=723-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुठ्
