शुद्ध|शुद्धं|शुद्धः
शुद्ध <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Pure spirit; 2. rock salt; 3. black pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=723-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धांत|शुद्धान्त|शुद्धान्तः
शुद्ध-अंत <i>m.</i> a king’s private apartments, a harem, a seraglio, स तैराक्रमयामास शुद्धांतं शुद्धकर्मभिः K.S.vi.52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=723-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

