शुनासी(शी)र <i>m.</i> 1. An epithet of Indra; 2. an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=724-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

