शुभ्
शुभ् <i>(I) vi. 1Ā (pres. शोभते)</i> 1. To look beautiful or handsome, to be beautiful, अधिकं शुशुभे शुभंयुना द्वितयेन द्वयमेव R.viii.6; 2. to appear to advantage, सुखं हि दुःखान्यनुभूय शोभते Mrich.i.; 3. to shine.With वि-, to shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=724-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुभ्
शुभ् <i>(II) vt. or vi. 6P (pres. शुंभति)</i> 1. To look beautiful; 2. to shine; 3. to hurt, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=724-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

