शोभन <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A planet; 2. a burnt offering for the achievement of good; 3. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=729-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभन|शोभनं|शोभनः
शोभन <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Brilliance, beauty; 2. a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=729-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभना
शोभना <i>f.</i> 1. A virtuous or beautiful woman, K.S.iv.44; 2. turmeric; 3. a kind of pigment called गोरोचना.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=729-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभा
