श्रथ्
श्रथ् <i>(III) vt. or vi. 1Ā (pres. श्रंथते)</i> 1. To be loose; 2. to loosen, to relax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रथ्
श्रथ् <i>(IV) vi. 10U (pres. श्रथयति-ते)</i> 1. To make effort, to be busy; 2. to gladden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रथन|श्रथनं
