श्रद्धा
श्रद्धा <i>f.</i> 1. Faith, belief, confidence; 2. composure of mind; 3. belief in divine revelation, श्रद्धेव साक्षाद्विधिनोपपन्ना R.ii.16, Bg.vi.37; 4. respect, reverence; 5. vehement desire, प्राणानाम् सततं प्रयाणपटहश्रद्धा न विश्राम्यति Vikr.Ch.xviii.106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

