श्रद्धालु|श्रद्धालुः
श्रद्धालु <i>(I) a.</i> 1. Faithful, believing; 2. wishing, desirous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

