श्रमणा
श्रमण <i>(I) a. (f. णा or णी)</i> 1. Labouring, toiling; 2. base, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रमणी
श्रमण <i>(I) a. (f. णा or णी)</i> 1. Labouring, toiling; 2. base, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रमण|श्रमणः
श्रमण <i>(II) m.</i> 1. An ascetic, a devotee, a religious mendicant; 2. a Buddhist ascetic (as in ब्राह्मणश्रमणम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रमणा
श्रमणा <i>f.</i> 1. A female mendicant, a female devotee; 2. a handsome woman; 3. a woman of low caste; 4. the Bengal madder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रमणी
श्रमणा <i>f.</i> 1. A female mendicant, a female devotee; 2. a handsome woman; 3. a woman of low caste; 4. the Bengal madder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रंभ्|श्रम्भ्
श्रंभ् <i>vi. 1Ā (pp. श्रब्ध; pres. श्रंभते)</i> 1. To err; 2. to be inattentive, to be negligent.With वि-, to confide in, to put faith in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रय|श्रयः
