श्रवणोदर
श्रवण-उदर <i>n.</i> the hollow of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=731-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

