श्रि
श्रि <i>vt. 1U (pp. श्रित; pres. श्रयति-ते; desid. शिश्रायिषयि-ते or शिश्रीषति-ते)</i> 1. To have recourse to, to go to, to approach, शिश्रिये श्रुतवतामपश्चिमः पश्चिमे वयसि नैमिषं वशी R.xix.1, iii.70; 2. to take, to assume, to undergo, द्विपेंद्रभावं कलभः श्रयन्निव R.iii.32; 3. to cling to, to depend on; 4. to honour, to worship; 5. to dwell in.With अधि-, to ascend.With आ-, 1. to go to, to have recourse to, to take refuge with; 2. to enter; 3. to undergo, to assume, to take, एको रसः करुण एव निमित्तभेदाद्भिन्नः पृथक् पृथगिवाश्रयेति विवर्तान् Ut.iii.; 4. to follow; 5. to choose; 6. to inhabit, M.vii.72; 7. to depend upon, M.i.17; 8. to use.With उद्-, to raise.With सम्-, 1. to have recourse to; 2. to depend on; 3. to get, to obtain, to attain, M.x.60; 4. to see.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=732-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रित|श्रितः
श्रित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Gone to, approached, approached for protection; 2. rested on, clung to; 3. joined with, connected with; 4. protected; 5. honoured, worshipped; 6. overspread; 7. auxiliary, subservient; 8. collected, assembled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=732-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रिता
श्रित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Gone to, approached, approached for protection; 2. rested on, clung to; 3. joined with, connected with; 4. protected; 5. honoured, worshipped; 6. overspread; 7. auxiliary, subservient; 8. collected, assembled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=732-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

