श्रु
श्रु <i>(II) vt. 5P (pp. श्रुत; pres. शृणोति; pass. श्रूयते)</i> 1. To hear, to listen to, to give ear to, कथमालि शृणोषि सादरं विपरीतार्थविदो हि योषितः Bh.V.ii.177, श्रोष्यत्यस्मात् परमहिता Megh.ii.37, R.i.10; 2. to be obedient, to obey.With अनु-, to hear, M.ix.100.With अभि-, to listen, to hear.With आ-, to promise, (with the dat. of the person to whom the promise is made).With उपा-, 1. to hear, to listen; 2. to learn from, केशिना हृतामुर्वशीं नारदादुपश्रुत्य Vikr.i.With प्रति-, to promise, (with the dat. of the person to whom the promise is made), प्रतिश्रुश्राव काकुत्स्थस्तेभ्यो विघ्नप्रतिक्रियाम् R.xv.4.With सम्-, (Atm. when used intransitively) to hear, to listen to, हितान्न यः संशृणुते स किं प्रभुः Kir.i.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रु
श्रु <i>Caus. (श्रावयति-ते)</i> to recite to, to communicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रु
श्रु <i>Desid. (शुश्रूषते)</i> 1. to desire to hear; 2. to obey, to be obedient to; 3. to wait upon, शुश्रूषस्व गुरून् कुरु प्रियसखीवृत्तिं सपत्नीजने Sak.iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुघ्निका
श्रुघ्निका <i>f.</i> Natron, alkali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुत|श्रुतं|श्रुतः
श्रुत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Heard, listened to; 2. heard of; 3. well-known, reputed; 4. understood, ascertained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुता
श्रुत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Heard, listened to; 2. heard of; 3. well-known, reputed; 4. understood, ascertained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुत|श्रुतं|श्रुतः
श्रुत <i>(II) n.</i> 1. The object of hearing; 2. the Veda, revelation, श्रुतप्रकाशं यशसा प्रकाशः R.v.2; 3. learning in general, श्रुतस्य यायादयमंतमर्भकः R.iii.21, v.22, Bt.x.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुताध्ययन
श्रुत-अध्ययन <i>n.</i> study of the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतार्थ|श्रुतार्थः
श्रुत-अर्थ <i>m.</i> a fact orally communicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतकीर्ति|श्रुतकीर्त्ति|श्रुतकीर्त्तिः
श्रुत-कीर्ति <i>m.</i> 1. a divine sage; 2. a generous man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतदेवी
श्रुत-देवी <i>f.</i> an epithet of Sarasvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुति|श्रुतिः
श्रुति <i>f.</i> 1. Hearing, श्रुतिमभिनयि Sak.i.; 2. the ear, विहाय भृंगाः श्रुतिहारिनिस्वनाः Rt.ii.14; 3. rumour, report, intelligence; 4. a quarter tone or interval (in music), Sis.xi.1; 5. a sound in general; 6. that which was revealed, i.e. the Veda; (see under वेद); 7. a Vedic text; 8. the constellation Śrāvaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुत्यनुप्रास|श्रुत्यनुप्रासः
श्रुति-अनुप्रास <i>m.</i> a kind of alliteration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुत्युक्त
श्रुति-उक्त, -उदित <i>a.</i> enjoined by the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुत्युदित
श्रुति-उक्त, -उदित <i>a.</i> enjoined by the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिकट|श्रुतिकटः
श्रुति-कट <i>m.</i> 1. a snake; 2. penance, expiation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिकटु|श्रुतिकटुः
श्रुति-कटु <i>m.</i> a harsh sound (regarded as a fault in rhetoric).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिचोदन|श्रुतिचोदनः
श्रुति-चोदन <i>n.</i> a Vedic precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिचोदना
श्रुति-चोदना <i>f.</i> a Vedic precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिजीविका
श्रुति-जीविका <i>f.</i> a code of laws.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिद्वैध
श्रुति-द्वैध <i>n.</i> contradiction of two Vedic texts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिनिदर्शन
श्रुति-निदर्शन <i>n.</i> the evidence of revelation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिप्रामाण्य
श्रुति-प्रामाण्य <i>n.</i> the authority of the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिमूल
श्रुति-मूल <i>n.</i> the root of the ear, कापि कपोलतले मिलिता लपितुं किमपि श्रुतिमूले Git.G.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिमूलक
श्रुति-मूलक <i>a.</i> founded on the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिविषय|श्रुतिविषयः
श्रुति-विषय <i>m.</i> 1. sound, the object of the sense of hearing; 2. the subject matter of the Vedas; 3. the reach of the ear, e.g. श्रुतिविषयमापतितमेव; 4. the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिवेध|श्रुतिवेधः
श्रुति-वेध <i>m.</i> the boring of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुतिस्मृति
श्रुति-स्मृति <i>f. du.</i> the Veda and the institutes of law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुव|श्रुवः
श्रुव <i>m.</i> A sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुवा
श्रुवा <i>f.</i> A sacrificial ladle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रुवावृक्ष|श्रुवावृक्षः
श्रुवा-वृक्ष <i>m.</i> the Vikankata tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेढी
श्रेढी <i>f.</i> A progression (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेढीफल
श्रेढी-फल <i>n.</i> the sum of a progression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेणि|श्रेणिः
श्रेणि <i>m.f.</i> 1. A line, row, वीचिक्षोभस्तवितविहगश्रेणिकांचीगुणायाः Megh.i.28, मधुकरश्रेणिदीर्घान् कटाक्षान् Megh.i.35; 2. a flock, a multitude; 3. a baling vessel; 4. a guild or company of artizans or traders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेणी
श्रेणी <i>f.</i> 1. A line, row, वीचिक्षोभस्तवितविहगश्रेणिकांचीगुणायाः Megh.i.28, मधुकरश्रेणिदीर्घान् कटाक्षान् Megh.i.35; 2. a flock, a multitude; 3. a baling vessel; 4. a guild or company of artizans or traders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेणीधर्म
श्रेणी-धर्म <i>m. pl.</i> the customs of trades or guilds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=733-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेणिका
श्रेणिका <i>f.</i> A tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेयस्
श्रेयस् <i>(I) a. (f. सी)</i> 1. Better, preferable, श्रेयो भोक्तुं भैक्ष्यमपीह लोके Bg.ii.5; 2. more fortunate; 3. more beloved; 4. excellent, best, (compar. of प्रशस्य q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेयसी
श्रेयस् <i>(I) a. (f. सी)</i> 1. Better, preferable, श्रेयो भोक्तुं भैक्ष्यमपीह लोके Bg.ii.5; 2. more fortunate; 3. more beloved; 4. excellent, best, (compar. of प्रशस्य q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेयस्
श्रेयस् <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Virtue, moral merit; 2. prosperity, bliss, happiness, प्रतिबध्नाति हि श्रेयः पूज्यपूजाव्यतिक्रमः R.i.79; 3. final emancipation or beatitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेयोर्थिन्
श्रेयोर्थिन् <i>a.</i> 1. seeking happiness; 2. wishing well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेयस्कर
श्रेयस्-कर <i>a.</i> 1. auspicious, propitious; 2. conferring happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेष्ठ|श्रेष्ठं|श्रेष्ठः
श्रेष्ठ <i>(I) a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> 1. Excellent; 2. most prosperous; 3. most beloved; 4. oldest, senior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेष्ठा
श्रेष्ठ <i>(I) a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> 1. Excellent; 2. most prosperous; 3. most beloved; 4. oldest, senior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेष्ठ|श्रेष्ठं|श्रेष्ठः
श्रेष्ठ <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A Brāhmaṇa; 2. a king; 3. an epithet of Kubera; 4. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेष्ठ|श्रेष्ठं|श्रेष्ठः
श्रेष्ठ <i>(III) n.</i> Cow’s milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेष्ठाश्रम|श्रेष्ठाश्रमः
श्रेष्ठ-आश्रम <i>m.</i> the best order of life, viz., that of a householder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेष्ठवाच्
श्रेष्ठ-वाच् <i>a.</i> eloquent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेष्ठिन्
श्रेष्ठिन् <i>m.</i> An artist of eminent birth, the head of a company of traders, स खलु श्रेष्ठिचत्वरे प्रतिवसति Mrich.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रै
श्रै <i>vi. 1P (pres. श्रायति)</i> 1. To perspire; 2. to cook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोण्
श्रोण् <i>vi. 1P (pres. श्रोणति)</i> To be gathered, to be collected, to be accumulated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोण|श्रोणः
श्रोण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> Crippled, lame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणा
श्रोण <i>(I) a. (f. णा)</i> Crippled, lame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोण|श्रोणः
श्रोण <i>(II) m.</i> A kind of disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणा
श्रोणा <i>f.</i> 1. Rice-gruel; 2. the constellation Śrāvaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणि|श्रोणिः
श्रोणि <i>f.</i> 1. The hip and loins, the buttocks, श्रोणीभारादलसगमना स्तोकनम्रा स्तनाभ्याम् Megh.ii.19; 2. a road, a way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणी
श्रोणि <i>f.</i> 1. The hip and loins, the buttocks, श्रोणीभारादलसगमना स्तोकनम्रा स्तनाभ्याम् Megh.ii.19; 2. a road, a way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणितट|श्रोणितटः
श्रोणि-तट <i>m.</i> the slope of the hips.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणीतट
श्रोणि-तट <i>m.</i> the slope of the hips.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणिफलक|श्रोणिफलकं
श्रोणि-फलक <i>n.</i> the buttocks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणीफलक
श्रोणि-फलक <i>n.</i> the buttocks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणिबिंब|श्रोणिबिम्ब|श्रोणिबिम्बं
श्रोणि-बिंब <i>n.</i> a waist-band.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणीबिंब
श्रोणि-बिंब <i>n.</i> a waist-band.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणिसूत्र|श्रोणिसूत्रं
श्रोणि-सूत्र <i>n.</i> a string worn round the loins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोणीसूत्र
श्रोणि-सूत्र <i>n.</i> a string worn round the loins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोतस्
श्रोतस् <i>n.</i> 1. The ear; 2. the trunk of an elephant; 3. an organ of sense; 4. the current of a river (Cf. स्रोतस्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोतोरंध्र
श्रोतोरंध्र <i>n.</i> an aperture of the proboscis, Megh.i.42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोतृ
श्रोतृ <i>m.</i> 1. A hearer; 2. a pupil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोत्र|श्रोत्रं
श्रोत्र <i>n.</i> 1. The ear, श्रोष्यसि श्रोत्रपेयम् Megh.i.13; 2. the Veda; 3. conversancy with the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोत्रमूल
श्रोत्र-मूल <i>n.</i> the root of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोत्रिय|श्रोत्रियः
श्रोत्रिय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> Learned in the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोत्रिया
श्रोत्रिय <i>(I) a. (f. या)</i> Learned in the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोत्रिय|श्रोत्रियः
श्रोत्रिय <i>(II) m.</i> A Brāhmaṇa versed in the Vedas, ते श्रोत्रियास्तत्वविनिश्चयाय भूरि श्रुतं शाश्वतमाद्रियंते M.M.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रोत्रियस्व
श्रोत्रिय-स्व <i>n.</i> the property of a learned Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रौत|श्रौतं|श्रौतः
श्रौत <i>(I) a. (f. ती)</i> 1. Relating to the ear; 2. relating to or prescribed by the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रौती
श्रौत <i>(I) a. (f. ती)</i> 1. Relating to the ear; 2. relating to or prescribed by the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रौत|श्रौतं|श्रौतः
श्रौत <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Vedic ritual; 2. any observance enjoined by the Veda; 3. preservation of the sacred fire; 4. the three sacred firte collectively, (viz., गार्हपत्य, आहवनीय and दक्षिण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रौतकर्मन्
श्रौत-कर्मन् <i>n.</i> a Vedic rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रौतसूत्र
श्रौत-सूत्र <i>n.</i> name of a class of Sūtra writings based on the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रौत्र|श्रौत्रं
श्रौत्र <i>n.</i> 1. The ear; 2. acquaintance with the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रौषट्
श्रौषट् <i>ind.</i> An exclamation used in making an offering to the gods or departed spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लक्
श्लक् <i>vt. 1Ā (pres. श्लंकते)</i> To go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लक्ष्ण|श्लक्ष्णं
श्लक्ष्ण <i>a. (f. क्ष्णा)</i> 1. Fine, thin, minute; 2. smooth, polished; 3. gentle, amiable; 4. charming, beautiful; 5. candid, sincere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लक्ष्णा
श्लक्ष्ण <i>a. (f. क्ष्णा)</i> 1. Fine, thin, minute; 2. smooth, polished; 3. gentle, amiable; 4. charming, beautiful; 5. candid, sincere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लक्ष्णक|श्लक्ष्णकं
श्लक्ष्णक <i>n.</i> The Areca-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लग्
श्लग् <i>vt. 1P (pres. श्लंगति)</i> To go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लथ्
श्लथ् <i>vt. or vi. 10U (pres. श्लथयति-ते)</i> 1. To be loose; 2. to slacken, to relax, to loosen, भवत्या हि व्रात्याधमपतितपाषंदपरिषत्परित्राणस्नेहः श्लथयितुमशक्यः खलु यथा G.L.37; 3. to be weak; 4. to hurt, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लथ
श्लथ <i>a. (f. था)</i> 1. Untied, unfastened; 2. loose, loosened, वृंताच्छ्लथं हरति पुष्पमनोकहानाम् R.v.69, ix.37; 3. dishevelled, K.S.v.47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लथा
श्लथ <i>a. (f. था)</i> 1. Untied, unfastened; 2. loose, loosened, वृंताच्छ्लथं हरति पुष्पमनोकहानाम् R.v.69, ix.37; 3. dishevelled, K.S.v.47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लाख्
श्लाख् <i>vt. 1P (pres. श्लाखति)</i> To pervade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लाघ्
श्लाघ् <i>vt. or vi. 1Ā (pres. श्लाघते)</i> 1. To praise, to commend, to eulogize; 2. to flatter, to coax, (with a dat., e.g. कृष्णाय श्लाघते); 3. to be proud of, to boast of, (with an inst.), यथैव श्लाघते गंगा पादेन परमेष्ठिनः K.S.vi.70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लाघन|श्लाघनं
श्लाघन <i>n.</i> 1. Praising; 2. flattering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लाघा
श्लाघा <i>f.</i> 1. Praise, commendation, eulogium; 2. service; 3. wish, desire; 4. self praise, boast, त्यागे श्लाघाविपर्ययः R.i.22, या श्लाघा पांडुपुत्राणां सैवास्माकं भविष्यति Ve.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लाघित
श्लाघित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Praised, commended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लाघिता
श्लाघित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Praised, commended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लाघ्य|श्लाघ्यः
श्लाघ्य <i>a. (f. घ्या)</i> Venerable, respectable, praiseworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लाघ्या
श्लाघ्य <i>a. (f. घ्या)</i> Venerable, respectable, praiseworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिकु|श्लिकुः
श्लिकु <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A libertine, a debauchee; 2. a slave, a dependant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिकु|श्लिकुः
श्लिकु <i>(II) n.</i> Astronomy or astrology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिक्यु|श्लिक्युः
श्लिक्यु <i>m.</i> 1. A servant; 2. a libertine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिष्
श्लिष् <i>(I) vt. 1P (pres. श्लेषति)</i> To burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिष्
श्लिष् <i>(II) vt. 4P (pp. श्लिष्ट; pres. श्लिष्यति)</i> 1. To embrace, श्लिष्यति कामपि चुंबति कामपि कामपि रमयति रामाम् Git.G.i.; 2. to adhere, to cling to; 3. to unite, to join.With आ-, to embrace.With उप-, to embrace.With वि-, to burst, शरबंधा विशिश्लिषुः Bt.xiv.67; 2. to be separated, Megh.i.7.With सम्-, to adhere to, to cling to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिष्
श्लिष् <i>(III) vt. 10U (pres. श्लेषयति-ते)</i> To connect, to unite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=734-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिषा
श्लिषा <i>f.</i> 1. Clinging; 2. an embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिष्ट|श्लिष्टः
श्लिष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Adhered to, clung to; 2. leaning on; 3. embraced; 4. susceptible of a double interpretation (in rhetoric).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिष्टा
श्लिष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Adhered to, clung to; 2. leaning on; 3. embraced; 4. susceptible of a double interpretation (in rhetoric).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लिष्टि|श्लिष्टिः
श्लिष्टि <i>f.</i> 1. Adherence; 2. embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लीपद|श्लीपदं
श्लीपद <i>n.</i> Elephantiasis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लीपदप्रभव|श्लीपदप्रभवः
श्लीपद-प्रभव <i>m.</i> the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लील|श्लीलः
श्लील <i>a. (f. ला)</i> The same as श्रील q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लीला
श्लील <i>a. (f. ला)</i> The same as श्रील q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लेष|श्लेषः
श्लेष <i>m.</i> 1. Clinging to, adhering to; 2. union, junction, contact; 3. society, association; 4. an embrace; 5. word or sentence capable of bearing two or more interpretations (considered as a figure of speech in rhetoric), प्रत्यक्षरश्लेषमयप्रबंधविन्यासवैदग्ध्यनिधिर्निबंधम् Vas.D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

