श्लेष्मक|श्लेष्मकः
श्लेष्मक <i>m.</i> Phlegm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

