श्लेष्मण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> Phlegmatic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्लेष्मन्
श्लेष्मन् <i>m.</i> The phlegmatic humour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

