श्लेष्मन्-घ्ना, -घ्नी <i>f.</i> Arabian Jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

