श्वल्क्
श्वल्क् <i>vt. 10U (pres. श्वल्कयति-ते)</i> To tell, to narrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=735-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

