षट्का
षट्क <i>(I) a. (f. ट्का)</i> Six-fold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

