षंड|षण्ड|षंडः|षण्डः
षंड <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A bull; 2. a eunuch; (various classes of them are enumerated in medical and other works).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षंड|षण्ड|षंडः|षण्डः
षंड <i>(II) m.n.</i> A multitude, a group, a heap, a flock, a quantity. (Cf. खंड), राघवशरप्रहारजर्जरितजीर्णतालतरुषंडस्य (v.l. for खंडस्य) Kad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षंडक|षण्डक|षंडकः|षण्डकः
