षंडाली|षण्डाली
षंडाली <i>f.</i> 1. A wanton woman; 2. a pool, a pond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षंढ|षण्ढ|षंढः|षण्ढः
