षष्
षष् <i>num. (used in the pl.)</i> Six, M.i.17, 61, viii.403.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षडंश|षडंशः
षडंश <i>n.</i> 1. six parts of the body collectively; (they are- जंघे बाहू शिरो मध्यं षडंगमिदमुच्यते); 2. the six works auxiliary to the Veda; (they are- शिक्षा कल्पो व्याकरणं निरुक्तं छंदसां चितिः । ज्योतिषामयनं चैव); 3. six things obtained from a cow; (they are- गोमूत्रं गोमयं क्षीरं सर्पिर्दीर्घि च रोचना । षडंगमेतन् मांगल्यं पठितं सर्वदा गवाम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

