षण्मुख|षण्मुखः
षडानन <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kārtikeya, षडाननापीतपयोधरासु नेता चमूनामिव कृत्तिकासु R.xiv.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

