षट्कर्ण <i>(I) a.</i> heard by six ears, i.e. by three persons, e.g. षट्कर्णो भिद्यते मंत्रः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

