षट्चक्र|षट्चक्रं
षट्चक्र <i>n.</i> the six mystical circles of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्चत्वारिंशत्
षट्चत्वारिंशत् <i>f.</i> forty-six.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्चरण|षट्चरणः
षट्चरण <i>m.</i> 1. a bee; 2. a locust; 3. a louse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षड्ज|षड्जः
षड्ज <i>m.</i> the first of the seven primary notes in music; [it is thus derived- नासां कठमुरस्तालु जिह्वादंताश्च संस्पृशन् । षड्भ्यः संजायते यस्मात् तस्मात् षड्ज इति स्मृतः] षड्जसंवादिनीः केका द्विधा भिन्नाः शिखंडिभिः R.i.39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्त्रिंश
षट्त्रिंश <i>a.</i> the thirty-sixth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्त्रिंशत्
षट्त्रिंशत् <i>f.</i> thirty-six.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षड्दर्शन|षड्दर्शनः
षड्दर्शन <i>n.</i> the six systems of philosophy taken together; (they are- न्याय, वैशेषिक, सांख्य, योग, मीमांसा and वेदांत).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षड्दुर्ग|षड्दुर्गं
षड्दुर्ग <i>n.</i> six kinds of forts taken together; [the six kinds are- (1) धन्वदुर्ग, (2) महीदुर्ग, (3) गिरिदुर्ग, (4) मनुष्यदुर्ग, (5) मृद्दुर्ग and (6) वनदुर्ग].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षड्धा
षड्धा <i>ind.</i> in six ways. (Cf. षोढा.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षण्णवति
षण्णवति <i>f.</i> ninety-six.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्पंचाशत्|षट्पञ्चाशत्
षट्पंचाशत् <i>f.</i> fifty-six.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्पद|षट्पदः
षट्पद <i>m.</i> 1. a bee, न हि प्रफुल्लं सहकारमेत्य वृक्षांतरं कांक्षति षट्पदाली R.vi.69, vii.27, K.S.v.9; 2. a louse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

