षट्पदी
षट्पदी <i>f.</i> 1. a louse; 2. a female bee; 3. a stanza consisting of six lines.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=737-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्प्रज्ञ|षट्प्रज्ञः
