षोढा
षोढा <i>ind.</i> In six ways.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=738-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोढामुख|षोढामुखः
षोढा-मुख <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kārtikeya, द्रोढा जनोर्जनितषोढामुखः समिति वोढा स हाटकगिरेः Asv.7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=738-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठिव्
ष्ठिव् <i>vt. or vi. 1P, 4P (pp. ष्ठ्युत; pres. ष्ठीवति, ष्ठीव्यति)</i> 1. To spit, to eject saliva from the mouth; 2. to sputter, Bt.xii.18.With नि-, 1. to eject, to emit, Bt.xvii.10, xviii.14, R.ii.75, Sak.iv.; 2. to spit, to eject saliva from the mouth, M.v.145.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=738-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठीवन|ष्ठीवनं
ष्ठीवन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of spitting; 2. spittle, saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=738-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठेवन|ष्ठेवनं
ष्ठीवन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of spitting; 2. spittle, saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=738-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठ्यूत
ष्ठ्यूत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Spit, ejected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=738-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठ्यूता
ष्ठ्यूत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Spit, ejected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=738-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्वक्क्
ष्वक्क् <i>vt. 1Ā (pres. ष्वक्कते)</i> to go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्वष्क्
ष्वष्क् <i>vt. 1Ā (pres. ष्वष्कते)</i> to go, to move.Note. Many roots, which begin with a स् followed by a dental or a vowel except ऋ or ॠ, are given in the Dhātupāṭha as commencing with ष्. These will be found under स.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स|सं|सः
स <i>(I) ind.</i> A prefix to nouns substituted for सह or सम्, सम or सदृश and समान or एक, to form compound adjectives and adverbs yielding the senses of- (1) with (सह), तस्मै सभ्याः सभार्याय R.i.55; (2) like, similar (सदृश), e.g. सधर्म ‘having similar duties’; (3) same, identical, (समान or एक), eg. सोदर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स|सं|सः
स <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A snake; 2. air; 3. a bird; 4. an abbreviated term for the musical note shadja; 5. an epithet of Śiva; 6. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संय|संयः
संय <i>m.</i> A skeleton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्|संयन्त्
संयत् <i>m.f.</i> War, battle, fight, संयति लब्धकीर्तयः Kir.i.19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयद्वर|संयद्वरः
संयत्-वर <i>m.</i> a king, prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

