संयता
संयत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Held together; 2. fettered; 3. bound together, (pp. of यम् with सम् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतांजलि|संयताञ्जलि
