संयतवाच्
संयत-वाच् <i>a.</i> silent, taciturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्त
