संयत्ता
संयत्त <i>a. (f. त्ता)</i> Prepared, ready, being on guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयम|संयमः
