संयमन|संयमनं|संयमनः
संयमन <i>(I) m.</i> 1. One who restrains, a ruler; 2. Yama, the god of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमन|संयमनं|संयमनः
संयमन <i>(II) n.</i> 1. The act of restraining or checking; 2. confinement; 3. a cluster or square of four horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=739-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

