संश्रय|संश्रयः
संश्रय <i>m.</i> 1. Refuge, dwelling place, येन श्रियः संश्रयदोषरूढं स्वभावलोलेत्ययशः प्रमृष्टम् R.vi.41; 2. asylum, protection, patronage, (न क्षुद्रोऽपि) संश्रयाम प्राप्ते मित्रे भवति विमुखः Megh.i.17; 3. seeking alliance, leaguing together for mutual protection, (one of the six Guṇas in politics; See M.viii.160); (at the end of a compound, the word is used in the sense of- ‘pertaining to, relating to, having reference to,’ मनोरथोऽस्याः शशिमौलिसंश्रयः K.S.v.60, एकार्थसंश्रयमुभयोः प्रयोगं पश्यामः Mal.i.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

