संसक्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Tying, fastening, junction; 2. proximity; 3. intimacy, close acquaintance; 4. addiction, devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसद्
संसद् <i>f.</i> 1. An assembly, e.g. छात्रसंसदि लब्धकीर्तिः; 2. a court of justice, M.viii.52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसरण|संसरणं
संसरण <i>n.</i> 1. Going, proceeding, revolution; 2. the world, mundane existence, worldly life, संसरणतापित्तमूर्तेः Bh.V.iv.6; 3. the unresisted march of troops; 4. the commencement of battle; 5. a high-way; 6. a resting place for passengers near the gates of a city; 7. birth, production.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्ग|संसर्गः
संसर्ग <i>m.</i> 1. Mixture, union, contact, connection, association, society, न मूर्खजनसंसर्ग (v.l. for संपर्कः) सुरेंद्रभुवनेष्वपि Bhartr.ii.14; 2. sexual intercourse, copulation, M.vi.72; 3. familiarity, acquaintance; 4. equal extent, coexistence (in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्गाभाव|संसर्गाभावः
संसर्ग-अभाव <i>m.</i> relative nonexistence, said to be of three kinds viz., prior, incidental, and final (in Nyāya phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्गदोष|संसर्गदोषः
संसर्ग-दोष <i>m.</i> the fault or evil consequences arising from the society of bad people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्जन|संसर्जनं|संसर्ज्जन
संसर्जन <i>n.</i> 1. Abandoning, leaving; 2. voiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्प|संसर्पः
संसर्प <i>m.</i> 1. Creeping along, any gentle motion; 2. the intercalary month occurring in a year in which there falls a kshayamāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्पण|संसर्पणं
संसर्पण <i>n.</i> 1. The act of creeping along; 2. an unexpected attack, surprise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसाद|संसादः
संसाद <i>m.</i> An assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसार|संसारः
संसार <i>m.</i> 1. Course, passage; 2. the course or circuit of mundane existence, the world, असारं संसारं परिमुषितरत्नं त्रिभुवनम् M.M.v.; 3. a succession of births or existences, e.g. संसारेषु विचित्रेशु पच्यमानाः स्वकर्मभिः or परिवर्तिनि संसारे मृतः को वा न जायते Hit.i.; 4. transmigration, meta-empsychosis; 5. worldly illusion; 6. secular life, worldly pursuit, कंसारिरपि संसारवासनाबद्धशृंखलाम् Git.G.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारगुरु|संसारगुरुः
संसार-गुरु <i>m.</i> an epithet of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारमार्ग|संसारमार्गः
संसार-मार्ग <i>m.</i> 1. mundane existence, the world; 2. the vulva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारमोक्ष|संसारमोक्षः
संसार-मोक्ष <i>m.</i> liberation or emancipation from worldly existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारिन्
संसारिन् <i>m.</i> The individual soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसिद्ध
संसिद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> One who has obtained final beatitude. See सिद्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसिद्धा
संसिद्ध <i>a. (f. द्धा)</i> One who has obtained final beatitude. See सिद्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसिद्धि|संसिद्धिः
संसिद्धि <i>f.</i> 1. Complete accomplishment, e.g. स्वनुष्ठितस्य धर्मस्य संसिद्धिर्हरितोषणम्; 2. final emancipation, कर्मणैव हि संसिद्धिमास्थिता जनकादयः Bg.iii.20; 3. natural disposition or quality; 4. a passionate or intoxicated woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसूचन|संसूचनं
संसूचन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of showing plainly or proving; 2. telling, informing; 3. hinting, insinuating; 4. reproaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृति|संसृतिः
संसृति <i>f.</i> 1. Course, current, flow; 2. transmigration, किं मां निपातयसि संसृतिगर्तमध्ये Bh.V.iv.32; 3. the course of the world, the world. See संसार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्ट|संसृष्टः
संसृष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Commingled, mixed together, united; 2. composed; 3. associated or connected together as partners; 4. involved; 5. clothed in clean garments; 6. created.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टा
संसृष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Commingled, mixed together, united; 2. composed; 3. associated or connected together as partners; 4. involved; 5. clothed in clean garments; 6. created.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टत्व|संसृष्टत्वं
संसृष्ट-त्व <i>n.</i> 1. union; 2. voluntary reunion in interest of father and son or of brothers, after partition of property (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टता
संसृष्ट-ता <i>f.</i> 1. union; 2. voluntary reunion in interest of father and son or of brothers, after partition of property (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=742-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टि|संसृष्टिः
संसृष्टि <i>f.</i> 1. Union, combination; 2. association, intercourse, co-partnership; 3. collection, assembly; 4. voluntary reunion in interest after partition (in law); 5. the aggregation of two or more independent figures of speech in one and the ksame passage (in rhetoric). (It is thus defined in the S.D.- मिथोनपेक्शयैतेषां (i.e. पूर्वोक्तशब्दार्थालंकाराणाम्) स्थितिः संसृष्टिरुच्यते x.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कर्तृ|संस्कर्त्तृ
संस्कर्तृ <i>m.</i> 1. One who initiates; 2. one who dresses (as food), संस्कर्ता चोपहर्ता च खादकश्चेति घातकाः M.v.51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कार|संस्कारः
संस्कार <i>m.</i> 1. Forming well or thoroughly; 2. refining, polishing, मणिः प्रयुक्तसम्स्कारः R.iii.18; 3. embellishment, decoration, e.g. स्वभावसुंदरं वस्तु न संस्कारमपेक्षते; 4. forming of the mind, education, संस्कारपूतेन वरं वरेण्यं सरस्वती (नुनाव) K.S.vii.90; 5. a purificatory rite, निषेकादिर्द्विजन्मना कार्यः शरीरसंस्कारः M.ii.26. (Manu enjoins twelve purificatory rites at ii.27; others enumerate sixteen); 6. a ceremony in general; 7. investiture with the sacred cord, M.iii.43; 8. the consecration of a thing; 9. obsequies; 10. preparation (as of an article of food or medicine, e.g. सूदान्संस्कारकुशलान्); 11. impression, form, mould, e.g. यन्नवे भाजने लग्नेः संस्कारो नान्यथा भवेत्; 12. the self-productive quality; (three Sanskāras are recognized in the Vaiśeṣika philosophy, viz., भावना, वेग and स्थितिस्थापकता); 13. apprehension, conception; 14. resolution, अहो स्थिरसंस्कारा व्यवहारार्थिनः Mrich.ix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कारवर्जित|संस्कारवर्ज्जितः
संस्कार-वर्जित <i>a.</i> one over whom the purificatory rites are not performed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृत|संस्कृतं|संस्कृतः
संस्कृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Carefully or accurately formed, artificially fabricated; 2. refined, trained, adorned, वाण्येका समलंकरोति पुरुषं या संस्कॄता धार्यते Bhartr.ii.19; 3. made ready, dressed, cooked; 4. consecrated, hallowed; 5. married; 6. excellent, best.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृता
संस्कृत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Carefully or accurately formed, artificially fabricated; 2. refined, trained, adorned, वाण्येका समलंकरोति पुरुषं या संस्कॄता धार्यते Bhartr.ii.19; 3. made ready, dressed, cooked; 4. consecrated, hallowed; 5. married; 6. excellent, best.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृत|संस्कृतं|संस्कृतः
संस्कृत <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A word formed accurately according to rules, a regular derivative; 2. a man of one of the three higher castes who has received all the purificatory rites; 3. a learned man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृत|संस्कृतं|संस्कृतः
संस्कृत <i>(III) n.</i> 1. The Sanskrit language; 2. offering, oblation, sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्क्रिया
संस्क्रिया <i>f.</i> 1. Any purificatory rite; 2. funeral ceremonies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तंभ|संस्तम्भ|संस्तंभः|संस्तम्भः
संस्तंभ <i>m.</i> 1. Support, prop; 2. confirming, fixing; 3. stop, stay; 4. paralysis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तर|संस्तरः
संस्तर <i>m.</i> 1. A couch, a bed, नवपल्लवसंस्तरेऽपि ते मृदु दूयेत यदंगमर्पितम् R.viii.57, K.S.iv.34; 2. sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तव|संस्तवः
संस्तव <i>m.</i> 1. Praise; 2. acquaintance, familiarity, गुणाः प्रियत्वेऽधिकृता न संस्तवः Kir.iv.25, संस्तवस्थिरं तिरोहितं प्रेम घनागमश्रियः iv.22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्ताव|संस्तावः
संस्ताव <i>m.</i> 1. Hymning chorus; 2. the place for reciting hymns at a sacrifice; 3. praise, celebration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तुत|संस्तुतः
संस्तुत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Praised, applauded; 2. agreeing together; 3. familiar, acquainted, (pp. of स्तु with सम् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तुता
संस्तुत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Praised, applauded; 2. agreeing together; 3. familiar, acquainted, (pp. of स्तु with सम् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तुति|संस्तुतिः
संस्तुति <i>f.</i> Praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्त्याय|संस्त्यायः
संस्त्याय <i>m.</i> 1. Assemblage, heap; 2. vicinity; 3. spreading, expansion, diffusion; 4. a habitation, a house, अथवा संस्त्यायमेव गच्छावः M.M.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थ|संस्थः
संस्थ <i>(I) a. (f. स्था)</i> 1. Associated, domesticated; 2. staying, abiding, lasting; 3. stationary, fixed; 4. ended, perished, dead; 5. situated, न केवलं दरीसंस्थं … … अपास्तं मे परं तमः K.S.vi.60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्था
संस्थ <i>(I) a. (f. स्था)</i> 1. Associated, domesticated; 2. staying, abiding, lasting; 3. stationary, fixed; 4. ended, perished, dead; 5. situated, न केवलं दरीसंस्थं … … अपास्तं मे परं तमः K.S.vi.60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थ|संस्थः
संस्थ <i>(II) m.</i> 1. An inhabitant; 2. a countryman; 3. a spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्था
संस्था <i>f.</i> 1. An assembly; 2. a state or condition of being, situation; 3. occupation, business, सर्वेषां तु स नामानि … पृथक् संस्थाय निर्ममे M.i.21; 4. correct conduct; 5. stop, stay; 6. a royal ordinance; 7. end; 8. loss, destruction, death; 9. universal destruction; 10. resemblance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थान|संस्थानं
संस्थान <i>n.</i> 1. A heap, a quantity; 2. the aggregation of primitive atoms; 3. configuration; 4. fabrication, construction; 5. common place of abode; 6. vicinity; 7. a place where four roads meet; 8. position (in Vedānta philosophy); 9. a mark, sign, e.g. सास्नादिसंस्थानविशेषो लिंगम्; 10. death; 11. form, figure, disguise, चारैश्चानैकसंस्थानैः प्रोत्साह्य वशमानयेत् M.ix.261.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थापन|संस्थापनं
संस्थापन <i>n.</i> 1. The act of placing together, collecting; 2. restraining; 3. establishment; 4. regulation, fixing, कुर्वीत चैषां प्रत्यक्षमर्घसंस्थापनं नृपः M.viii.422.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थापना
संस्थापना <i>f.</i> Restraining, curbing, bringing back, संस्थापना प्रियतरा विरहातुराणाम् Mrich.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थित|संस्थितः
संस्थित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Contiguous; 2. resembling; 3. settled, fixed; 4. placed in; 5. stationary; 6. completed, ended; 7. dead, (pp. of स्था with सम् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थिता
संस्थित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Contiguous; 2. resembling; 3. settled, fixed; 4. placed in; 5. stationary; 6. completed, ended; 7. dead, (pp. of स्था with सम् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=743-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थिति|संस्थितिः
संस्थिति <i>f.</i> 1. Staying together; 2. accumulation, heap; 3. contiguity; 4. abiding, abode, यथा नदीनदाः सर्वे सागरे यांति संस्थितिम् । तथैवाश्रमिणः सर्वे गृहस्थे यांति संस्थितिम् M.vi.90; 5. duration; 6. condition of life; 7. restraint; 8. death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=744-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्पर्श|संस्पर्शः
