संहति|संहतिः
संहति <i>f.</i> 1. Combination, union, संहतिः श्रेयसी पुंसाम् Hit.i.; 2. assemblage, heap, multitude, लघयता शारदंबुदसंहतिम् Kir.v.4; 3. bulk, गुरुतां नयंति हि गुणा न संहतिः Kir.xii.10; 4. compactness, inflexibility; 5. strength; 6. the body; 7. agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=744-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

