संहार|संहारः
संहार <i>m.</i> 1. Drawing together, gathering, collection (as in वेणीसंहार); 2. contraction, withdrawal, संहारविक्षेपलघुक्रियेण R.v.45, 57; 3. restraining; 4. destruction of the world; 5. a fault in pronunciation; 6. close, end, conclusion; 7. a charm or spell for restraining a magical weapon; 8. name of a hell; 9. practice, skill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=744-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहारमुद्रा
संहार-मुद्रा <i>f.</i> name of a particular posture in Tantra worship; (it is thus defined- अध्मुखे वामहस्ते ऊर्ध्वास्यं दक्षहस्तकम् । क्षिप्त्वांगुलीरंगुलीभिः संगृह्य परिवर्तयेत्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=744-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहित|संहितः
संहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Placed together, united; 2. conformable to, in accordance with; 3. equipped, provided; 4. caused by, (pp. of धा with सम् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=744-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहिता
संहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Placed together, united; 2. conformable to, in accordance with; 3. equipped, provided; 4. caused by, (pp. of धा with सम् q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=744-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहिता
संहिता <i>f.</i> 1. Conjunction, combination; 2. collection, compilation, compendium; 3. any methodical collection of texts or verses; 4. the real continuous hymnical text of the Veda as formed out of the Padas, or separate words by proper phonetic changes according to various schools; (it is thus defined- पदप्रकृतिः संहिता); 5. a compilation or compendium of laws, a code, a digest; 6. the junction or combination of letters according to euphonic rules (in grammar). (It is thus defined- वर्णानामनेकप्राणयोगः संहिता); 7. the supreme being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=744-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

