सकाम|सकामः
सकाम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Fall of love, loving; 2. lustful; 3. one who has obtained his wish, satisfied, काम इदानीं सकामो Sak.iv.(सकामम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) with pleasure; (2) contentedly; (3) assuredly; (4) indeed.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=744-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकामा
सकाम <i>a. (f. मा)</i> 1. Fall of love, loving; 2. lustful; 3. one who has obtained his wish, satisfied, काम इदानीं सकामो Sak.iv.(सकामम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) with pleasure; (2) contentedly; (3) assuredly; (4) indeed.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=744-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

