सकाश|सकाशः
सकाश <i>(I) a. (f. शा)</i> Having visibility, present, near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=745-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकाशा
सकाश <i>(I) a. (f. शा)</i> Having visibility, present, near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=745-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकाश|सकाशः
