सकुल|सकुलः
सकुल <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A kinsman; 2. a kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=745-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकुल्य|सकुल्यः
