संकीर्ण <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A man of a mixed caste; 2. a mixed mode or note (in music); 3. an elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

