संकीर्ण <i>(III) n.</i> 1. A difficulty; 2. an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्णयोनि|सङ्कीर्णयोनि
संकीर्ण-योनि <i>a.</i> of a mongrel breed (as a mule).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्तन
संकीर्तन <i>n.</i> 1. Praising, applauding; 2. singing the praise of a deity; 3. repeating the name of a deity as an act of devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्तना
संकीर्तना <i>f.</i> 1. Praising, applauding; 2. singing the praise of a deity; 3. repeating the name of a deity as an act of devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकुचित|सङ्कुचित|सङ्कुचितं
संकुचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Contracted, shrunk, wrinkled; 2. closed, unblown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकुचिता
संकुचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Contracted, shrunk, wrinkled; 2. closed, unblown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकुल|सङ्कुल|सङ्कुलं
संकुल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Crowded, thronged; 2. confused; 3. inconsistent; 4. full of, filled with, e.g. ब्रह्मर्षिशतसंकुलः कुशिकवंशः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकुला
संकुल <i>(I) a. (f. ला)</i> 1. Crowded, thronged; 2. confused; 3. inconsistent; 4. full of, filled with, e.g. ब्रह्मर्षिशतसंकुलः कुशिकवंशः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकुल|सङ्कुल|सङ्कुलं
संकुल <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A crowd, a throng, e.g. महतः पौरजनस्य संकुले; 2. a confused fight, a melee; 3. a contradictory speech, (e.g. यावज्जीवमहं मौनी ब्रह्मचारी च मे पिता । मातातु मम वंध्येव पुत्रहीनः पितामहः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेत|सङ्केत|संकेतः|सङ्केतः
संकेत <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Sign, gesture, intimation, hint; 2. agreement, convention, तत्रानंत्यात्संकेतः कर्तुं न युज्यते K.Pr.ii.; 3. engagement, appointment, assignation; 4. condition, provision; 5. a short explanatory rule (in grammar).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेत|सङ्केत|संकेतः|सङ्केतः
संकेत <i>(II) n.</i> Rendezvous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतक
संकेतक <i>m.</i> 1. Rendezvous; 2. agreement, convention; 3. appointment, assignation; 4. a lover or mistress, who meets by assignation, संकेतके चिरयति प्रवरो विनोदः Mrich.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतित|सङ्केतित
संकेतित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Fixed by convention, साक्षात्संकेतितं योऽर्थमभिधत्ते स वाचकः K.Pr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतिता
संकेतित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Fixed by convention, साक्षात्संकेतितं योऽर्थमभिधत्ते स वाचकः K.Pr.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकोच|सङ्कोच|सङ्कोचं|संकोचः|सङ्कोचः
संकोच <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Contraction, shrinking; 2. terror, fear; 3. abridgment, diminution; 4. shutting up, closing; 5. a kind of skate-fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकोच|सङ्कोच|सङ्कोचं|संकोचः|सङ्कोचः
संकोच <i>(II) n.</i> Saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रंदन|सङ्क्रन्दन|संक्रन्दन|संक्रंदनः|संक्रन्दनः|सङ्क्रन्दनः
संक्रंदन <i>m.</i> An epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रम|सङ्क्रम|संक्रमः|सङ्क्रमः
संक्रम <i>(I) m.</i> 1. Going together, concurrence; 2. transit, transition, progress; 3. the passage of a planetary body through the zodiacal signs; 4. moving, travelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रम|सङ्क्रम|संक्रमः|सङ्क्रमः
संक्रम <i>(II) m.n.</i> 1. Difficult passage or progress; 2. a bridge, a causeway, e.g. नदीमार्गेषु च तथा संक्रमानवसादयेत्; 3. a means of effecting a difficult passage or attaining an object, सोऽतिथिः स्वर्गसंक्रमः Panch.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रमण|सङ्क्रमण|संक्रमणं|सङ्क्रमणं
संक्रमण <i>n.</i> 1. Concurrence; 2. transition from one body to another; 3. the sun’s passage from one sign of the zodiac to another; 4. the first day of the summer solstice; 5. a certain class of problems (in algebra).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रांत|सङ्क्रान्त|संक्रान्त|सङ्क्रान्तः
संक्रांत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Passed through or into, entered into; 2. transferred; 3. depicted, imaged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रांता|सङ्क्रान्ता
संक्रांत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Passed through or into, entered into; 2. transferred; 3. depicted, imaged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रांति|सङ्क्रान्ति|संक्रान्ति|संक्रांतिः|संक्रान्तिः|सङ्क्रान्तिः
संक्रांति <i>f.</i> 1. Going or meeting together, union; 2. passage from one point to another; 3. the passage of the sun through the zodiacal signs; 4. transference, imparting, पयसो गंडूषसंक्रांतयः Ut.iii., विवादे दर्शयिष्यंतं क्रियासंक्रांतिमात्मनः Mal.i.; (hence) 5. the power of teaching or transference, संक्रांतिरस्य य विशेषयुक्ता Mal.i.; 6. reflection; 7. imitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्राम|सङ्क्राम|संक्रामः|सङ्क्रामः
संक्राम <i>m.</i> The same as संक्रम q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्लेद|सङ्क्लेद|संक्लेदः|सङ्क्लेदः
संक्लेद <i>m.</i> 1. Moisture, damp; 2. the rudiment of the foetus, its form in the first month after conception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षय|सङ्क्षय|संक्षयः
संक्षय <i>m.</i> 1. Complete destruction or consumption; 2. loss, ruin; 3. destruction of the world; 4. end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षिप्ति|सङ्क्षिप्ति|संक्षिप्तिः
संक्षिप्ति <i>f.</i> 1. An abridgment; 2. throwing, sending; 3. ambuscade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षेप|सङ्क्षेप|संक्षेपः
संक्षेप <i>m.</i> 1. Throwing together; 2. abridgment; 3. conciseness; 4. taking away; 5. assisting in one’s duty; 6. a brief exposition, an epitome.(संक्षेपेण and संक्षेपतस् are used as indeclinables in the sense of ‘concisely, briefly, in short.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=746-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षेपण|सङ्क्षेपण|संक्षेपणं
संक्षेपण <i>n.</i> Contraction. See संक्षेप.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षोभ|सङ्क्षोभ|संक्षोभः
संक्षोभ <i>m.</i> 1. Trembling, agitation; 2. disturbance; 3. overturning, upsetting; 4. pride, arrogance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्य|सङ्ख्य|संख्यं|सङ्ख्यं
संख्य <i>n.</i> War, battle, कथं भीष्ममहं संख्ये योत्स्यामि मधुसूदन Bg.ii.4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्या|सङ्ख्या
संख्या <i>f.</i> 1. A number in general; 2. a numeral; 3. deliberation, reflection; 4. reason, intellect, understanding (as in संख्यावत्); 5. manner; 6. enumeration, प्रत्येकनिक्षिप्तपदः सशब्दं संख्यामिवैषां भ्रमरश्चकार R.xvi.47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यातिग
संख्या-अतिग <i>a.</i> innumerable, countless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यावत्|सङ्ख्यावत्|संख्यावन्त्
संख्या-वत् <i>m.</i> a learned man, a paṇḍit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यात|सङ्ख्यात|सङ्ख्यातं
संख्यात <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Reckoned up, calculated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्याता
संख्यात <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Reckoned up, calculated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यात|सङ्ख्यात|सङ्ख्यातं
संख्यात <i>(II) n.</i> A number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्याता
संख्याता <i>f.</i> A kind of riddle or enigma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग|सङ्ग|संगः|सङ्गः
संग <i>m.</i> 1. Joining, uniting, coming together, concurrence; 2. meeting; 3. confluence of rivers; 4. touch, contact, e.g. रथ्यांबु जाह्नवीसंगात्त्रिदशैरपि वंद्यते; 5. association, company, e.g. मृगा मृगैः संगमनुव्रजन्ति; 6. worldly attachment, विनश्यति यतिः संगात् Bhartr.ii.42; 7. desire, cupidity, Bg.ii.62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगणिका|सङ्गणिका
संगणिका <i>f.</i> An incomparable discourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगत|सङ्गत|सङ्गतं
संगत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Convened, met; 2. joined, associated; 3. united in wedlock; 4. fitted together, proper, adapted; 5. in conjunction with (as planets); 6. contracted, shrunk up, (pp. of गम् with सम् q.v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगता
संगत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Convened, met; 2. joined, associated; 3. united in wedlock; 4. fitted together, proper, adapted; 5. in conjunction with (as planets); 6. contracted, shrunk up, (pp. of गम् with सम् q.v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगत|सङ्गत|सङ्गतं
संगत <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Union, meeting; 2. alliance; 3. friendship, acquaintance; 4. a consistant speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगति|सङ्गति|संगतिः|सङ्गतिः
संगति <i>f.</i> 1. Union, junction; 2. society, association, e.g. प्राज्ञेतरैः संगतिः; 3. frequenting; 4. accidental or chance meeting; 5. applicability, relation, connection; 6. questioning for further information; 7. knowldge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगम|सङ्गम|संगमः|सङ्गमः
संगम <i>m.</i> 1. Meeting, union, encounter, Megh.ii.37, 42; 2. contact, touch; 3. association, society, company, अयं स ते तिष्ठति संगमोत्सुकः Sak.iii., R.xii.66; 4. sexual intercourse, संगमाय निशि गूढचारिणं … … कामुकेति चकृषुस्तमंगनाः R.xix.33; 5. confluence, e.g. गंगासागरसंगमः; 6. fitness, adaptation; 7. planetary conjunction (in astronomy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगर|सङ्गर|सङ्गरं|संगरः|सङ्गरः
संगर <i>m.</i> 1. Agreement, promise, प्रत्यग्रहीत्संगरमग्रजन्मा R.v.26, xiii.65; 2. a bargain; 3. acceptance; 4. war, battle, e.g. संकटेषु परीक्ष्यंते प्राज्ञाः शूराश्च संगरे; 5. misfortune; 6. poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगव|सङ्गव|संगवः|सङ्गवः
संगव <i>m.</i> A name for the three muhūrtas after early dawn, (forming the second watch of the day).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगिन्|सङ्गिन्
संगिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> United with, attached, devoted, R.xix.16, Bg.iii.26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगिनी
संगिन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> United with, attached, devoted, R.xix.16, Bg.iii.26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीत|सङ्गीत|सङ्गीतं
संगीत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Sung in chorus or harmony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीता
संगीत <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> Sung in chorus or harmony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीत|सङ्गीत|सङ्गीतं
संगीत <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A song sung by many voices, chorus, e.g. जगुः सुकंठ्यो गंधर्व्यः संगीतं सहभर्तृकाः; 2. singing accompanied by music and dancing, किमन्यदस्याः परिषदः श्रुतिप्रसादनतः संगीतात् Sak.i.; 3. the art of singing accompanied by music and dancing, साहित्यसंगीतकलाविहीनः Bhartr.ii.12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीतार्थ
संगीत-अर्थ <i>m.</i> 1. the apparatus or materials for a concert, Megh.i.56; 2. the subject of a musical performance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीतशाला
