संगीतक
संगीतक <i>n.</i> 1. Concert, symphony; 2. a public entertainment consisting of songs, dancing, and music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीति|सङ्गीति|संगीतिः|सङ्गीतिः
