संगीर्ण|सङ्गीर्ण|सङ्गीर्णं
संगीर्ण <i>a. (f. र्णा)</i> Agreed, assented to, promised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीर्णा
संगीर्ण <i>a. (f. र्णा)</i> Agreed, assented to, promised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रह|सङ्ग्रह|संग्रहः|सङ्ग्रहः
संग्रह <i>m.</i> 1. Seizing, grasping; 2. reception, admission; 3. protection, राष्ट्रस्य संग्रहे नित्यं विधानमिदमाचरेत् M.vii.118; 4. propitiation, entertainment, M.iii.138; 5. conjunction, conglomeration; 6. agglomeration; 7. sum, amount, totality, करणं कर्मं कर्तेति त्रिविधः कर्मसंग्रहः Bg.xviii.18; 8. compilation; 9. epitome, summary, तत्ते पदं संग्रहेण प्रवक्ष्ये Bg.viii.11; 10. a catalogue, a list; 11. effort, exertion; 12. a store-room; 13. mention; 14. greatness, elevation; 15. velocity; 16. an epithet of Śiva; 17. accumulation, storing, hoarding up, कोशेनाश्रयणीयत्वमिति तस्यार्थसंग्रहः R.xvii.60; 18. clenching the fist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रहण|सङ्ग्रहण|संग्रहणं
संग्रहण <i>n.</i> 1. Collecting, compiling; 2. encasing, कनकभूषणसंग्रहणोचितो यदि मणिस्त्रपुणि प्राणधीयते Panch.i.; 3. sexual intercourse; 4. adultery, M.viii.72; 5. acceptance; 6. hope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=747-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रहणी|सङ्ग्रहणी
