संघट्टन <i>n.</i> 1. Rubbing together; 2. collision, close contact; 3. union; 4. the intertwining of wrestlers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघट्टना
संघट्टना <i>f.</i> 1. Rubbing together; 2. collision, close contact; 3. union; 4. the intertwining of wrestlers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

