सजुस्
सजुस् <i>(III) ind.</i> With, together with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्ज|सज्जः
सज्ज <i>a. (f. ज्जा)</i> 1. Armed; 2. fortified; 3. got ready; 4. prepared, ready to meet, e.g. तत्रापि सज्जा वयम्; 5. ornamented, dressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जा
सज्ज <i>a. (f. ज्जा)</i> 1. Armed; 2. fortified; 3. got ready; 4. prepared, ready to meet, e.g. तत्रापि सज्जा वयम्; 5. ornamented, dressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

