संचार|सञ्चार|संचारः|सञ्चारः
संचार <i>m.</i> 1. Going, motion, संचारपूतानि दिगंतराणि R.ii.15; 2. a way, a pass; 3. difficult progress; 4. difficulty, distress; 5. course; 6. contagion; 7. inciting; 8. a gem supposed to be found in the head of serpents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारक|सञ्चारक|संचारकः
संचारक <i>m.</i> A leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारिका|सञ्चारिका
संचारिका <i>f.</i> 1. A female messenger; 2. a bawd; 3. a pair; 4. smell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारिन्|सञ्चारिन्
संचारिन् <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Moving, K.S.iii.54, R.vi.67; 2. fickle, changeable; 3. difficult; 4. contagious; 5. hereditary (as a disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारिणी
संचारिन् <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Moving, K.S.iii.54, R.vi.67; 2. fickle, changeable; 3. difficult; 4. contagious; 5. hereditary (as a disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारिन्|सञ्चारिन्
संचारिन् <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Incense; 2. wind; 3. an evanescent feeling which strengthens the pervading sentiment (in rhetoric). See व्यभिचारिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचाली|सञ्चाली
संचाली <i>f.</i> The gunjā shrub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचित|सञ्चित
संचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Heaped up, accumulated; 2. reckoned up, enumerated; 3. provided with, full of; 4. impeded, obstructed; 5. dense, thick (as a wood).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचिता
संचित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Heaped up, accumulated; 2. reckoned up, enumerated; 3. provided with, full of; 4. impeded, obstructed; 5. dense, thick (as a wood).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचिति|सञ्चिति|संचितिः
संचिति <i>f.</i> A collection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्|सञ्ज्
संज् <i>vi. 1P (The initial स् of this root is changed to ष् after any preposition ending in इ or उ) (pp. सक्त; pres. सजति)</i> 1. To cling to, to adhere to, to stick, (ससंजः) तुल्यगंधिषु मत्तेभकटेषु फलरेणवः R.iv.47; 2. to fasten.With अनु-, to associate, to accompany, e.g. अनुषक्ता द्वयेनैते भावाः स्थावरजंगमाः.With अव-, 1. to adhere to, to stick, K.S.viii.23, Sis.ix.7; 2. to delegate, to assign to.With आ-, 1. to fasten, चापमासक्य कंठे K.S.ii.64; 2. to take up, to bear, भूयः स भूमेर्धुरमाससंज R.ii.47; 3. to delegate, to assign to; 4. to be attached to.With नि-, 1. to adhere to, विटपनिषक्त (v.l.) जकार्द्रवल्कलेषु (द्रुमेषु) Sak.i., K.S.iii.7; 2. to be attached to.With प्र-, 1. to cling to, to cleave to; 2. to be relevant, to be applicable.With व्यति-, to link together, व्यतिषजति पदार्थानांतरः कोऽपि हेतुः M.M.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्|सञ्ज्
संज् <i>Pass. (सज्ज्यते, सज्यते)</i> to be attached to, to cling to, to adhere to, धर्मपूते च मनसि नभसीव न जातु रज्जोऽनुषज्यते D.K. With अव-, to prepare, to be ready.With प्र-, to apply to, to hold good in the case of, to be applicable, to follow, वैषम्यनैर्घृण्ये नेश्वरस्य प्रसज्येते S.Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=748-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज|सञ्ज|संजः|सञ्जः
संज <i>m.</i> 1. An epithet of Brahman (m.); 2. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजल्प|सञ्जल्प|संजल्पः
संजल्प <i>m.</i> 1. Conversation; 2. uproar, confusion, confused talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजवन|सञ्जवन|संजवनं|सञ्जवनं
संजवन <i>n.</i> A group of four houses joined together in a quadrangle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजा
संजा <i>f.</i> A she-goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजीवन|सञ्जीवन|संजीवनं|सञ्जीवनं
संजीवन <i>n.</i> 1. Animating, bringing to life, life-restoring; 2. one of the twenty-one hells, M.iv.89; 3. a cluster of four houses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजीवनी
संजीवनी <i>f.</i> A kind of elixir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञ
संज्ञ <i>(I) a. (f. ज्ञा)</i> Knock-kneed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञा
संज्ञ <i>(I) a. (f. ज्ञा)</i> Knock-kneed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञ
संज्ञ <i>(II) n.</i> A yellow fragrant wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञा
संज्ञा <i>f.</i> 1. Consciousness, रतिखेदसमुत्पन्ना निद्रा संज्ञाविपर्ययः K.S.vi.44; (संज्ञां लभ् ‘to recover consciousness’); 2. intellect, mind; 3. sign, token, gesture, संवाहकस्यापक्रमितुं संज्ञां ददाति Mrich.ii.; 4. thought; 5. knowledge; 6. name, appellation, designation, यदच्छाशब्दवत्पुंसः संज्ञायै जन्म केवलम् Sis.ii.47; 7. any name or noun having a meaning peculiar to itself, a proper noun (in gram.); 8. name of the daughter of Viśvakarman and wife of the sun; 9. the Gāyatrī verse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञाधिकार
संज्ञा-अधिकार <i>m.</i> a heading rule which gives a peculiar name to the rules which fall under it and influences them.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञावत्
संज्ञा-वत् <i>a.</i> 1. having consciousness, become sensible, revived; 2. having a name or denomination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञाविषय
संज्ञा-विषय <i>m.</i> (having a name for subject) an epithet, an attribute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञासुत
संज्ञा-सुत <i>m.</i> an epithet of Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञापन
संज्ञा(ज्ञ)पन <i>m.</i> 1. Informing; 2. teaching; 3. killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञपन|सञ्ज्ञपन|संज्ञपनं|सञ्ज्ञपनं
