संज्ञिता
संज्ञित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Named, called, designated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञु
