सट|सटं
सट <i>n.</i> 1. An ascetic’s matted hair; 2. a mane, Sis.i.47; 3. bristles of a boar, विध्यंतमुद्धतसटाः प्रतिहंतुमीषुः R.ix.60; 4. a crest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सटा
सटा <i>f.</i> 1. An ascetic’s matted hair; 2. a mane, Sis.i.47; 3. bristles of a boar, विध्यंतमुद्धतसटाः प्रतिहंतुमीषुः R.ix.60; 4. a crest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सटांक|सटाङ्क|सटाङ्कः
सटा-अंक <i>m.</i> a lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सट्ट्
सट्ट् <i>vi. 10U (pres. सट्टयति-ते)</i> 1. To kill, to injure; 2. to be strong; 3. to give; 4. to dwell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सट्टक|सट्टकं
