सट्वा
सट्वा <i>f.</i> 1. A kind of bird; 2. a musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सठ्
