सणसूत्र|सणसूत्रं
सणसूत्र <i>n.</i> Hempen cord or thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संड|सण्ड|सण्डः
संड <i>m.</i> A eunuch. See षंड.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संडिश|सण्डिश|संडिशः|सण्डिशः
संडिश <i>m.</i> A pair of tongs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संडीन|सण्डीन|संडीनं|सण्डीनं
