सत्|सन्त्|संत्
सत् <i>(I) a. (f. ती)</i> 1. Being, existing; 2. real, essential, true; 3. good, virtuous, chaste, सतीमपि ज्ञातिकुलैकसंश्रयां जनोऽन्यथा भर्तृमतीं विशकते Sak.v.; 4. excellent, best; 5. right, proper; 6. handsome, beautiful; 7. venerable, respectable; 8. wise, learned; 9. firm, steady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सती
सत् <i>(I) a. (f. ती)</i> 1. Being, existing; 2. real, essential, true; 3. good, virtuous, chaste, सतीमपि ज्ञातिकुलैकसंश्रयां जनोऽन्यथा भर्तृमतीं विशकते Sak.v.; 4. excellent, best; 5. right, proper; 6. handsome, beautiful; 7. venerable, respectable; 8. wise, learned; 9. firm, steady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्|सन्त्|संत्
सत् <i>(II) n.</i> 1. That which really is, entity, existence, essence; 2. truth, reality; 3. that which is good, सदसद्व्यक्तिहेतवः R.i.10; 4. Brahman (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्|सन्त्|संत्
सत् <i>(III) m.</i> A good man, a virtuous man, निजहृदि विकसंतः संति संतः कियंतः Bhartr.ii.78, सतां सद्भिः संगः कथमपि हि पुण्येन भवति Ut.ii.(सत्कृ ‘to treat with respect.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदसत्|सदसन्त्
सत्-असत् <i>(I) a.</i> 1. being and not being; 2. real and unreal; 3. true and false; 4. good and bad; 5. virtuous and wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदसत्|सदसन्त्
सत्-असत् <i>(II) n. du.</i> 1. entity and non-entity; 2. good and evil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदसद्विवेक
सत्-असत्˚विवेक <i>m.</i> discrimination between truth and falsehood, good and evil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदसद्व्यक्तिहेतु
सत्-असत्˚व्यक्तिहेतु <i>m.</i> the cause of discrimination between what is good and bad, तं संतः श्रोतुमर्हंति सदसद्व्यक्तिहेतवः R.i.10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदाचार|सदाचारः
सत्-आचार <i>m.</i> 1. virtuous conduct, good manners; 2. traditionary observance, immemorial custom, M.ii.18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदुत्तर
सत्-उत्तर <i>n.</i> a proper answer, a good reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=749-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

