सत्त्रा-हन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=750-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्त्रि
सत्त्रि <i>m.</i> 1. A cloud; 2. an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=750-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्त्रिन्
