सत्त्वोद्रेक|सत्त्वोद्रेकः
सत्त्व-उद्रेक <i>m.</i> excess or predominance of the quality of goodness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=750-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

