सत्त्वसार|सत्त्वसारः
सत्त्व-सार <i>m.</i> 1. essence of strength; 2. a most powerful person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=750-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्त्वस्थ|सत्त्वस्थः
