सत्य|सत्यं|सत्यः
सत्य <i>(I) a. (f. त्या)</i> 1. True, real, महाभूतानि सत्यानि यथात्मापि तथैव हि Yaj.iii.149; 2. faithful, honest, virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्या
सत्य <i>(I) a. (f. त्या)</i> 1. True, real, महाभूतानि सत्यानि यथात्मापि तथैव हि Yaj.iii.149; 2. faithful, honest, virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्य|सत्यं|सत्यः
सत्य <i>(II) m.</i> 1. The uppermost of the seven Lokas above the earth; 2. the Aśvattha tree; 3. the deity presiding over the Nāndīmukhaśrāddha; 4. an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्य|सत्यं|सत्यः
सत्य <i>(III) n.</i> 1. Truth, मौनात्सत्यं विशिष्यते M.ii.83, सत्यं ब्रूयात् प्रियं ब्रूयात् M.iv.138; 2. an oath, promise, a solemn asseveration, सत्येन शपयेद्विप्रम् M.viii.113; 3. a demonstrated truth or dogma; 4. the first of the four Yugas of the Hindus.(सत्यम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of ‘truly, indeed, verily,’ सत्यमतीत्य हरितो हरींश्च वर्तन्ते वाजिनः Sak.i., K.S.vi.19.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

