सत्य-दर्शिन् <i>a.</i> foreseeing truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यधृति|सत्यधृतिः
सत्य-धृति <i>a.</i> strictly truthful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यपूत
सत्य-पूत <i>a.</i> purified by truth, सत्यपूतं वदेद्वाक्यम् M.vi.46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

