सत्यवतीसुत|सत्यवतीसुतः
सत्य-वती˚सुत <i>m.</i> an epithet of Vyāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यवद्य
सत्य-वद्य <i>(I) a.</i> veracious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यवद्य
सत्य-वद्य <i>(II) m.</i> truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यवाच्
सत्य-वाच्, -वचस् <i>(I) a.</i> sincere, truthful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यवचस्
सत्य-वाच्, -वचस् <i>(I) a.</i> sincere, truthful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यवचस्
सत्य-वचस् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. a saint; 2. a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यसंगर|सत्यसङ्गर|सत्यसंगरः|सत्यसङ्गरः
सत्य-संगर, -संध <i>a.</i> true to one’s word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्यसंध|सत्यसन्ध|सत्यसंधः|सत्यसन्धः
सत्य-संगर, -संध <i>a.</i> true to one’s word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=751-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्या
