सदस्य|सदस्यः
सदस्य <i>m.</i> 1. An assisting priest at a sacrifice; 2. any person present at or belonging to an assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=752-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सदा
