सभा
सभा <i>f.</i> 1. An assembly, a council, न सा सभा यत्र न संति वृद्धाः Hit.i.; 2. a much frequented place; 3. a court of justice; 4. a public audience, a levee; 5. a gambling house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=756-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभास्तार|सभास्तारः
