सभासद्
सभा-सद् <i>m.</i> 1. a member of any society or company, an assistant at an assembly or meeting; 2. an assessor, a judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=756-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभाज्
सभाज् <i>vt. 10U (pres. सभाजयति-ते)</i> 1. To serve, to worship; 2. to gratify, to congratulate, स्नेहात् सभाजयितुमेत्य दिनान्यमूनि Ut.i.; 3. to beautify; 4. to show.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=756-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

