सभ्या
सभ्य <i>(I) a. (f. भ्या)</i> 1. Relating to an assembly; 2. polite, R.i.55; 3. refined, civilized; 4. trusted, faithful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=756-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

