साध्य|साध्यः
साध्य <i>(I) a. (f. ध्या)</i> 1. To be accomplished, to be formed, साध्ये सिद्धिर्विधीयताम्; 2. practicable, feasible, attainable; 3. to be proved or demonstrated, आप्तवागनुमानाभ्यां साध्यं त्वां प्रति का कथा R.x.28; 4. to be substantiated or made good; 5. to be inferred or concluded; 6. to be subdued or mastered; 7. to be killed, to be destroyed; 8. curable (as a disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=772-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

