सालन|सालनः
सालन <i>m.</i> The resin of the sāla tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=777-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साला
साला <i>f.</i> 1. A house; 2. a rampart, a wall. Cf. शाला.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=777-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सालाकारी
