सालावृक|सालावृकः
साला-वृक <i>m.</i> 1. a dog; 2. a jackal; 3. a hyena; 4. a wolf; 5. a wolf-like or cruel man. (Cf. शालावृक.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=777-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सालार|सालारं
सालार <i>n.</i> A pin or peg projecting from a wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=777-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सालूर|सालूरः
