सावधि
सावधि <i>a.</i> 1. Having a bound or limit, limited; 2. finite, defined, circumscribed, e.g. सर्वं सावधि केवलं कुलभुवां प्रेम्णः प्रिये नावधिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=777-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

