सावन|सावनं|सावनः
सावन <i>(II) m.</i> 1. An institutor of a sacrifice; 2. the conclusion of a sacrifice or the ceremony by which it is terminated; 3. an epithet of Varuṇa; 4. a month of thirty solar days; 5. natural day from sunrise to sunset.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=777-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सावयव
