सुतंगम|सुतङ्गम|सुतंगमः
सुतंगम <i>m.</i> the father of a son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

