सुतनु|सुतनुः
सुतनु <i>(II) f.</i> A beautiful lady, सुतनु हृदयात्प्रत्यादेशव्यलीकमपैतु ते Sak.vii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतपस्
सुतपस् <i>(I) a.</i> 1. One who practises severe penance; 2. having great heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतपस्
सुतपस् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. An ascetic, a devotee, an anchorite; 2. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतपस्
सुतपस् <i>(III) n.</i> Severe penance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतराम्
