सुतीक्ष्णा
सुतीक्ष्ण <i>(I) a. (f. क्ष्णा)</i> 1. Very sharp; 2. very pungent; 3. acutely painful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

