सुदर्शनी
सुदर्शन <i>(I) a. (f. ना or नी)</i> 1. Beautiful, handsome; 2. easily seen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदर्शन|सुदर्शनं|सुदर्शनः
