सुदा
सुदा <i>a.</i> Very bountiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदामन्
सुदामन् <i>(I) a.</i> One who gives liberally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदामन्
सुदामन् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A cloud; 2. the sea; 3. name of a mountain; 4. name of Indra’s elephant; 5. name of a poor Brāhmaṇa who came to Dvārakā to ask Kṛṣṇa’s aid and was raised to wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=784-38" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदाय|सुदायः
