सुपर्ण <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A ray of the sun; 2. a class of bird-like beings of a semi-divine character; 3. an epithet of Garuḍa; 4. a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=785-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपर्णा
