सुरभि|सुरभिः
सुरभि <i>(I) a.</i> 1. Sweet-smelling, fragrant, तदाननं मृत्युरभि क्षितीश्वरः R.iii.3, Megh.i.16; 2. agreeable, charming, pleasing; 3. handsome, beautiful, तां सौरभेयीं सुरभिर्यशोभिः R.ii.3; 4. beloved, friendly; 5. celebrated, famous; 6. wise, learned; 7. good, virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=787-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभि|सुरभिः
सुरभि <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Fragrance, perfume; 2. nutmeg; 3. resin; 4. the champaka tree; 5. the śamī tree; 6. the kadamba tree; 7. a kind of fragrant grass; 8. the season of spring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=787-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभि|सुरभिः
सुरभि <i>(III) n.</i> 1. A fragrant smell, fragrance; 2. sulphur; 3. gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=787-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभि|सुरभिः
सुरभि <i>(IV) f.</i> 1. The gum of the olibanum tree; 2. the sacred basil; 3. jasmine; 4. a sort of perfume; 5. spirituous liquor; 6. the earth; 7. a cow; 8. name of the fabulous cow of plenty, आसीत्कल्पतरुच्छायामाश्रिता सुरभिः पथि R.i.75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=787-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

