सुष्ठु <i>ind.</i> 1. Well, excellently, beautifully; 2. much, very, सुष्ठु शोभसे विनयेन Ut.i.; 3. truly, e.g. अथवा सुष्ठु खल्विदमुच्यते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

