सुष्म <i>n.</i> A rope, a cord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसन्नत
सुसन्नत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Well-directed (as an arrow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसन्नता
सुसन्नत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> Well-directed (as an arrow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसह|सुसहः
सुसह <i>(I) a. (f. हा)</i> 1. Easy to be borne; 2. bearing or enduring well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसहा
सुसह <i>(I) a. (f. हा)</i> 1. Easy to be borne; 2. bearing or enduring well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसह|सुसहः
सुसह <i>(II) m.</i> An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसार|सुसारः
सुसार <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Having good essence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसारा
सुसार <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Having good essence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसार|सुसारः
सुसार <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Good essence, good substance; 2. competence; 3. the red flowering Khadira.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्थ|सुस्थः
सुस्थ <i>(I) a. (f. स्था)</i> 1. Well-situated, being in a good condition; 2. in health, healthy; 3. faring well, prosperous, well off; 4. happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्था
सुस्थ <i>(I) a. (f. स्था)</i> 1. Well-situated, being in a good condition; 2. in health, healthy; 3. faring well, prosperous, well off; 4. happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्थ|सुस्थः
सुस्थ <i>(II) n.</i> A happy condition, e.g. सुस्थे को वा न पंडितः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्थिति|सुस्थितिः
सुस्थिति <i>f.</i> 1. Good condition, well-being, welfare; 2. health, convalescence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्मिता
सुस्मिता <i>f.</i> A woman with a smiling or pleasing countenance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहित|सुहितः
सुहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Very fit or suitable; 2. salutary, beneficial; 3. very friendly, affectionate; 4. satiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहिता
सुहित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Very fit or suitable; 2. salutary, beneficial; 3. very friendly, affectionate; 4. satiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृद्
सुहृद् <i>(I) a.</i> Having a kind heart, cordial, friendly, loving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृद्
सुहृद् <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A friend, मंदायंते न खलु सुहृदामभ्युपेतार्थकृत्याः Megh.i.38; 2. an ally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृद्वाक्य
सुहृद्-वाक्य <i>n.</i> a friend’s advice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृद|सुहृदः
सुहृद <i>m.</i> A friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृदय|सुहृदयः
सुहृदय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Good-hearted, sincere; 2. intimate, dear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृदया
सुहृदय <i>a. (f. या)</i> 1. Good-hearted, sincere; 2. intimate, dear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुह्म
सुह्म <i>m. pl.</i> Name of a people, आत्मा संरक्षितः सुह्मैर्वृत्तिमाश्रित्य वैतसीम् R.iv.35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सू
सू <i>(I) vt. 2Ā, 4Ā (pp. सूत; pres. सूते, सूयते)</i> To bring forth, to produce, एकः सूते सकलमबलामंडनं कल्पवृक्षः Megh.ii.11, R.v.36.With प्र-, to bring forth, to beget, to produce, e.g. दीपो भक्ष्यते ध्वांतं कज्जलं च प्रसूयते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सू
सू <i>(II) vt. 6P (pres. सुवति)</i> 1. To excite, to incite, to impel; 2. to discharge; 3. to remit (as debt).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सू
सू <i>(I) a. (at the end of a compound)</i> Bringing forth, yielding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सू
सू <i>(II) f.</i> 1. Birth; 2. a mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक|सूकः
सूक <i>m.</i> 1. An arrow; 2. air, wind; 3. a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूकर|सूकरः
सूकर <i>m.</i> 1. A hog, a pig, घ्राणेन सूकरो हंति पक्षवातेन कुक्कुटः M.iii.241; 2. a sort of deer; 3. a potter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूकरी
सूकरी <i>f.</i> 1. A sow; 2. a sort of moss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्त|सूक्तं
सूक्त <i>(I) a. (f. क्ता)</i> Well-spoken, well-said, अथवा सूक्तमिदम् (केनापि) Ve.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ता
सूक्त <i>(I) a. (f. क्ता)</i> Well-spoken, well-said, अथवा सूक्तमिदम् (केनापि) Ve.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्त|सूक्तं
सूक्त <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A Vedic hymn, e.g. पुरुषसूक्त, पर्जन्यसूक्त; 2. a good or wise saying, नेतुं वांछति यः खलान्पथि सतां सूक्तैः सुधास्यंदिभिः Bhartr.ii.6, R.xv.97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्तवाच्
सूक्त-वाच् <i>f.</i> 1. a hymn; 2. praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ति|सूक्तिः
सूक्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Good speech, friendly speech; 2. correct exposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्म|सूक्ष्मं|सूक्ष्मः
सूक्ष्म <i>(I) a. (f. क्ष्मा)</i> 1. Subtile, minute, atomic, योऽसावतींद्रियग्राह्यः सूक्ष्मोऽव्यक्तः सनातनः M.i.7; 2. little, small, वंश्या गुणाः खल्वपि लोककांताः प्रारंभसूक्ष्माः प्रथिमानमापुः R.viii.49; 3. nice; 4. sharp, acute; 5. crafty, artful, ingenious; 6. exact, precise, accurate, correct; 7. deteriorated, declined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मा
सूक्ष्म <i>(I) a. (f. क्ष्मा)</i> 1. Subtile, minute, atomic, योऽसावतींद्रियग्राह्यः सूक्ष्मोऽव्यक्तः सनातनः M.i.7; 2. little, small, वंश्या गुणाः खल्वपि लोककांताः प्रारंभसूक्ष्माः प्रथिमानमापुः R.viii.49; 3. nice; 4. sharp, acute; 5. crafty, artful, ingenious; 6. exact, precise, accurate, correct; 7. deteriorated, declined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्म|सूक्ष्मं|सूक्ष्मः
सूक्ष्म <i>(II) m.</i> 1. An atom; 2. the ketaka plant; 3. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्म|सूक्ष्मं|सूक्ष्मः
सूक्ष्म <i>(III) n.</i> 1. The subtle all-pervading spirit, the supreme soul; 2. minuteness; 3. one of the three kinds of power attainable by an ascetic; 4. craft, ingenuity; 5. fraud, cheating; 6. fine thread; 7. name of a figure of speech thus defined- संलक्षितस्तु सूक्ष्मोऽर्थ आकारेणेंगितेन वा । कयापि सूच्यते भंग्या यत्र सूक्ष्मं तदुच्यते S.D.x.(सूक्ष्मीकृ ‘to make thin or fine.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मैला
सूक्ष्म-एला <i>f.</i> small cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मतंडुल|सूक्ष्मतण्डुल|सूक्ष्मतण्डुलः
