सूक्ष्मदर्शिता
सूक्ष्म-दर्शिता <i>f.</i> quick-sightedness, acuteness, wisdom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मदर्शिन्
सूक्ष्म-दर्शिन् <i>a.</i> 1. sharp-sighted, eagle-eyed; 2. of acute discernment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मदारु
सूक्ष्म-दारु <i>n.</i> a thin plank of wood, a board.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मदेह|सूक्ष्मदेहः
सूक्ष्म-देह <i>m.</i> the subtile body which is invested by the grosser material frame (in Vedānta phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मशरीर
सूक्ष्म-शरीर <i>n.</i> the subtile body which is invested by the grosser material frame (in Vedānta phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मपत्र|सूक्ष्मपत्रः
सूक्ष्म-पत्र <i>m.</i> 1. coriander seed; 2. a kind of wild cumin; 3. a sort of red sugarcane; 4. a sort of mustard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मपर्णी
सूक्ष्म-पर्णी <i>f.</i> a kind of basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मपिप्पली
सूक्ष्म-पिप्पली <i>f.</i> wild pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मबुद्धि|सूक्ष्मबुद्धिः
सूक्ष्म-बुद्धि <i>(I) a.</i> sharp-witted, acute, shrewd, intelligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मबुद्धि|सूक्ष्मबुद्धिः
सूक्ष्म-बुद्धि <i>(II) f.</i> sharp wit, acute intellect, mental acumen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्ममक्षिक|सूक्ष्ममक्षिकः
सूक्ष्म-मक्षिक <i>m.</i> a musquito, a gnat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्ममक्षिका
सूक्ष्म-मक्षिका <i>f.</i> a musquito, a gnat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्ममान
सूक्ष्म-मान <i>n.</i> exact measurement, precise computation, (op. to स्थूलमान ‘rough calculation’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मशर्करा
