सूक्ष्मशालि|सूक्ष्मशालिः
सूक्ष्म-शालि <i>m.</i> kind of fine rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मषट्चरण|सूक्ष्मषट्चरणः
सूक्ष्म-षट्चरण <i>m.</i> a sort of louse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=789-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूच्
सूच् <i>vt. 10U (pres. सूचयति-ते)</i> 1. To pierce; 2. to point out, to indicate, to show, to prove, to manifest, to suggest, सारंगास्ते जललवमुचः सूचयिष्यंति मार्गम् Megh.i.21; 3. to betray, to reveal, to inform against, स जातु सेव्यमानोऽपि गुप्तद्वारो न सूच्यते R.xvii.50; 4. to indicate by gesture, to gesticulate, to communicate by signs, परिक्रम्य वामाक्षिस्पंदं सूचयित्वा Ve.iii.; 5. to trace out, to ascertain.With अभि-, to indicate, to suggest, e.g. अमन्यत नलं प्राप्तं कर्मचेष्टाभिसूचितम्.With सम्-, to indicate, to foreshadow, संयोगो हि वियोगस्य संसूचयति संभवम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=790-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूच|सूचः
