सूत्तर
सूत्तर <i>a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Very superior; 2. well towards the north.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

