सूत्रात्मन्
सूत्र-आत्मन् <i>(II) m.</i> the soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्राली
सूत्र-आली <i>f.</i> a string of beads worn round the neck, a necklace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

