सूत्रकृत्
सूत्र-कार, -कृत् <i>m.</i> an author or composer of sūtras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

