सूत्र-चरण <i>n.</i> name of a class of charaṇas or Vedic schools that introduced various sūtra works.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

