सूत्रधर|सूत्रधरः
सूत्र-धर, -धार <i>m.</i> 1. a stage-manager, a principal actor who arranges the plot of a drama and takes the leading part in the prelude, अपि कुसुमपृषत्कैर्देवदेवस्य जेता जयति सुरतलीलानाटिकासूत्रधारः Vid.Bh.i.; 2. a carpenter; 3. the author of a set of aphorisms; 4. an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रधार|सूत्रधारः
