सूत्रिका
सूत्रिका <i>f.</i> A kind of dish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रिन्
सूत्रिन् <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Having threads; 2. having rules.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रिणी
सूत्रिन् <i>(I) a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Having threads; 2. having rules.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रिन्
सूत्रिन् <i>(II) m.</i> A crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रित
सूत्रित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Strung, arranged, methodized; 2. prescribed or enjoined in aphorisms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रिता
सूत्रित <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Strung, arranged, methodized; 2. prescribed or enjoined in aphorisms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूद्
सूद् <i>(I) vt. 1Ā (pres. सूदते)</i> 1. To strike, to hurt, to wound, to kill, to destroy; 2. to effuse, to pour out; 3. to deposit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूद्
सूद् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pres. सूदयति-ते)</i> 1. To incite, to urge on, to animate; 2. to strike, to wound, to kill, to massacre; 3. to cook, to dress, to season, to prepare; 4. to pour out, to effuse; 5. to assent, to agree, to promise.With अभि- or नि-, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=791-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूद|सूदः
सूद <i>m.</i> 1. Destroying, destruction, massacre; 2. pouring out, distilling; 3. a well, a spring; 4. a cook; 5. sauce, soup; 6. anything seasoned; 7. split pease; 8. mud, mire; 9. sin, fault.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदाध्यक्ष|सूदाध्यक्षः
सूद-अध्यक्ष <i>m.</i> superintendent of the kitchen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदकर्मन्
सूद-कर्मन् <i>n.</i> cookery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदशाला
सूद-शाला <i>f.</i> a kitchen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदन|सूदनं
सूदन <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Destroying, destructive, R.ix.3; 2. dear, beloved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदनी
सूदन <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Destroying, destructive, R.ix.3; 2. dear, beloved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदन|सूदनं
सूदन <i>(II) n.</i> 1. The act of destroying, destruction; 2. assenting to, promising; 3. ejecting, throwing away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सून|सूनं|सूनः
सून <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Born, produced; 2. blown, blossomed, budded; 3. empty, vacant, (probably for शून or शून्य in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूना
सून <i>(I) a. (f. ना)</i> 1. Born, produced; 2. blown, blossomed, budded; 3. empty, vacant, (probably for शून or शून्य in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सून|सूनं|सूनः
सून <i>(II) n.</i> 1. Bringing forth, parturition; 2. a bud, a blossom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनरी
सूनरी <i>f.</i> A respectable woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूना
सूना <i>(I) f.</i> 1. Shambles, a slaughter-house, भवानपि सूनापरिचर इव गृध्र आमिषलोलुपो भीरुकश्च Mal.ii.; 2. hurting, killing; 3. uvula; 4. a zone; 5. a river; 6. mumps; 7. a ray; 8. the sale of flesh; 9. a daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूना
सूना <i>(II) f. pl.</i> The five tilings in a household which are supposed to injure animal life; (they are thus enumerated- पंच सूना गृहस्थस्य चुल्ली पेषण्युपस्करः । कंडनी चोदकुंभश्च M.iii.68). See पंचमहायज्ञ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=792-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनिन्
