सृति|सृतिः
सृति <i>f.</i> 1. Gliding, M.vi.63; 2. road, path, way, नैते सृती पार्थ जानन् योगी मुह्यति कश्चन Bg.viii.27; 3. hurting, injuring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=794-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

