सेतु-भेदिन् <i>(II) m.</i> name of a tree (दंतीवृक्ष).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=795-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

