सेवि
सेवि <i>n.</i> 1. The jujube; 2. an apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=796-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवित|सेवितः
सेवित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Followed, pursued; 2. served, attended, worshipped; 3. infested or frequented by, inhabited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=796-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

