सेविन्
सेविन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Following, pursuing, serving; 2. practising, using; 3. dwelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=796-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेविनी
सेविन् <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> 1. Following, pursuing, serving; 2. practising, using; 3. dwelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=796-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेविन्
सेविन् <i>(II) m.</i> A servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=796-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेव्य|सेव्यं|सेव्यः
सेव्य <i>(I) a. (f. व्या)</i> 1. To be served or obeyed, भयं तावत्सेव्यादभिनिविशते सेवकजनम् Mud.v.; 2. to be employed; 3. to be enjoyed; 4. to be taken care of, to be guarded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=796-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेव्या
