सैंहिकेय|सैंहिकेयः
सैंहिक <i>m.</i> A metronymic of Rāhu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=796-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैकत|सैकतं|सैकतः
सैकत <i>(I) a. (f. ती)</i> 1. Sandy, gravelly, तोयस्येवाप्रतिहतरयः सैकतं सेतुमोघः Ut.iii.; 2. having sandy soil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=796-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैकती
