सैकतिक <i>(I) a. (f. की)</i> 1. Belonging or relating to a sand-bank; 2. fluctuating, living in doubt and error.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=796-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैकतिकी
