स्कंद्|स्कन्द्
स्कंद् <i>vt. or vi. 1P (pp. स्कन्न; pres. स्कंदति)</i> 1. To jump; 2. to jump upwards, to ascend; 3. to burst out; 4. to fall, to drop, Bt.xxii.11; 5. to perish, M.vii.84.With अव-, to assail, to besiege, पुरीमवस्कंद लुनीहि नंदनम् Sis.i.51.With आ-, to assail, stored, न तानगणयन् सर्वानास्कंदंश्च रिपून् द्विषः Bt.xvii.11.With परि-, to spring about, मेघनादः परिस्कंदन् परिष्कंदंतमाश्वरिम् Bt.ix.75.With प्र-, to spring forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=801-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

