स्तिम्
स्तिम् <i>vi. 4P (pres. स्तिम्यति, स्तीम्यति)</i> 1. To become wet or moist; 2. to become fixed or immovable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तीम्
स्तिम् <i>vi. 4P (pres. स्तिम्यति, स्तीम्यति)</i> 1. To become wet or moist; 2. to become fixed or immovable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तिमित|स्तिमितः
स्तिमित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Wet, moist; 2. still, motionless, steady, rigid, dull, वाचस्पतिः सन्नपि सोऽष्टमूर्तौ त्वाशास्य चिंतास्तिमितो बभूव K.S.vii.87, R.xiii.48; 3. benumbed, paralyzed; 4. tender, soft; 5. gratified, pleased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तिमिता
स्तिमित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Wet, moist; 2. still, motionless, steady, rigid, dull, वाचस्पतिः सन्नपि सोऽष्टमूर्तौ त्वाशास्य चिंतास्तिमितो बभूव K.S.vii.87, R.xiii.48; 3. benumbed, paralyzed; 4. tender, soft; 5. gratified, pleased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

