स्तिमितत्व|स्तिमितत्वं
स्तिमित-त्व <i>n.</i> steadiness, stillness, absence of motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तिमितवायु|स्तिमितवायुः
स्तिमित-वायु <i>m.</i> still air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

