स्तुंभ् <i>vt. 5P, 9P (pres. स्तुभ्नोति, स्तुभ्नाति)</i> 1. To stop; 2. to stupefy; 3. to expel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तूप्
स्तूप् <i>vt. 4P, 10U (pres. स्तूप्यति, स्तूपयति-ते)</i> 1. To heap up, to pile, to collect; 2. to erect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तूप|स्तूपः
स्तूप <i>m.</i> 1. A heap, a pile; 2. a Buddhistic construction for keeping holy relics; 3. a funeral pile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तृ
स्तृ <i>(I) vt. 5P (pres. स्तृणोति)</i> 1. To love; 2. to protect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तृ
स्तृ <i>(II) vt. 5U (pp. स्तृत; pres. स्तृनोति, स्तृणुते; pass. स्तर्यते)</i> 1. To spread, to expand, to diffuse; 2. to spread about, to scatter; 3. to spread on or over, to cover, तस्तार (महीम्) सरघाव्याप्तैः सक्षौद्रपटलैरिव R.iv.63; 4. to clothe, to cover; 5. to kill.With अव-, to cover, to fill, प्रकंपयन्गामवतस्तरे Kir.xvi.29.With आ-, 1. to spread, आस्तीर्णाजिनरत्नासु द्राक्षावलयभूमिषु R.iv.65, xiv.81; 2. to cover.With उप-, to arrange.With परि-, 1. to spread, Bt.xiv.11; 2. to arrange; 3. to cover, अथ नागयूथमलिनानि जगत्परितस्तमांसि परितस्तरिरे Sis.ix.18.With वि-, to spread.With सम्-, 1. to spread, समिद्वंतः प्रांतसंस्तीर्णदर्भाः Sak.iv.; 2. to cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तृ
स्तृ <i>Caus. (स्तारयति-ते)</i> to cover, रक्तेनाचिक्लिदङ्भूमिं सैन्यैश्चातस्तरद्धतैः Bt.xv.48.With वि-, 1. to cause to spread, अत्र पयोधरविस्तारयितृकमात्मनो यौवनमुपालभस्व Sak.i.; 2. to extend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तृ
स्तृ <i>m.</i> A star.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तृक्ष्
स्तृक्ष् <i>vt. 1P (pres. स्तृक्षति)</i> To go, to move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तृति|स्तृतिः
