स्तृह्
स्तृह् <i>vt. 6P (pres. स्तृहति, स्तॄहति)</i> To strike, to hurt, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तॄह्
स्तृह् <i>vt. 6P (pres. स्तृहति, स्तॄहति)</i> To strike, to hurt, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तॄ
स्तॄ <i>vt. 9U (pp. स्तीर्ण; pres. स्तृणाति, स्तृणीते; pass. स्तीर्यते)</i> See स्तृ (II).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तेन्
स्तेन् <i>vt. 10U (pres. स्तेनयति-ते) (rather a denominative from स्तेन)</i> To steal, M.iv.256.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तेन|स्तेनं|स्तेनः
स्तेन <i>(I) m.</i> A thief, a robber, ये स्तेनपतितक्लीबा ये च नास्तिकवृत्तयः M.iii.150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तेन|स्तेनं|स्तेनः
