स्तेननिग्रह|स्तेननिग्रहः
स्तेन-निग्रह <i>m.</i> 1. the restraining or punishment of thieves; 2. suppression of theft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तेप्
स्तेप् <i>(I) vt. 1Ā (pres. स्तेपते)</i> To ooze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तेप्
स्तेप् <i>(II) vt. 10U (pres. स्तेपयति-ते)</i> To send, to throw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=804-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तेम|स्तेमः
स्तेम <i>m.</i> Moisture, wetness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तेय|स्तेयं
स्तेय <i>n.</i> 1. Theft, robbery; 2. anything stolen or liable to be stolen; 3. any thing private.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तेयिन्
स्तेयिन् <i>m.</i> 1. A thief, a robber; 2. a goldsmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तै
