स्तैन|स्तैनं
स्तैन <i>n.</i> Theft, robbery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तैन्य|स्तैन्यं|स्तैन्यः
स्तैन्य <i>(I) n.</i> Theft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तैन्य|स्तैन्यं|स्तैन्यः
स्तैन्य <i>(II) m.</i> a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तैमित्य|स्तैमित्यं
स्तैमित्य <i>n.</i> Rigidity, immobility, numbness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोक|स्तोकः
स्तोक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Little, small, few, यद्धात्रा निजभालपट्टलिखितं स्तोकं महद्वा धनम् Bhartr.ii.49; 2. low.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोका
स्तोक <i>a. (f. का)</i> 1. Little, small, few, यद्धात्रा निजभालपट्टलिखितं स्तोकं महद्वा धनम् Bhartr.ii.49; 2. low.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोक|स्तोकः
स्तोक <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A small portion, a drop; 2. the chātaka bird.(स्तोकम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) a little, पश्योदग्रप्लुतत्वाद्वियति बहुतरं स्तोकमुर्व्यां प्रयाति Sak.i.; (2) less.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोककाय
स्तोक-काय <i>a.</i> little-bodied, small, diminutive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोकनम्र
स्तोक-नम्र <i>a.</i> a little bent down, slightly bent, श्रोणीभारादलसगमना स्तोकनम्रा स्तनाभ्याम् Megh.ii.19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोकशस्
स्तोक-शस् <i>ind.</i> sparingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोकक|स्तोककः
स्तोकक <i>m.</i> The chātaka bird, M.xii.67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोतव्य
स्तोतव्य <i>a. (f. व्या)</i> Deserving praise, laudable, to be praised, स कस्य स्तोतव्यः कतिविधगुणः कस्यविषयः Mahimastotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोतव्या
स्तोतव्य <i>a. (f. व्या)</i> Deserving praise, laudable, to be praised, स कस्य स्तोतव्यः कतिविधगुणः कस्यविषयः Mahimastotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोत्र|स्तोत्रं
स्तोत्र <i>n.</i> Praise, eulogium, hymn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोत्रिय|स्तोत्रियः
स्तोत्रिय <i>m.</i> A particular kind of verse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्तोत्रिया
