स्त्रीकार्य|स्त्रीकार्य्य
स्त्री-कार्य <i>n.</i> 1. the business of women; 2. attendance on women or women’s apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=805-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

