स्थावरजंगम|स्थावरजङ्गम
स्थावर-अस्थावर, -जंगम <i>n.</i> 1. movable and immovable property; 2. things animate and inanimate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=809-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थाविर|स्थाविरं
स्थाविर <i>(I) a. (f. रा or री)</i> Thick, firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=809-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थाविरा
स्थाविर <i>(I) a. (f. रा or री)</i> Thick, firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=809-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थाविरी
स्थाविर <i>(I) a. (f. रा or री)</i> Thick, firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=809-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थाविर|स्थाविरं
स्थाविर <i>(II) n.</i> Old age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=809-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थासक|स्थासकः
स्थासक <i>m.</i> 1. Perfuming or smearing the body with fragrant unguents; 2. a bubble of water or any fluid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=809-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थासु
स्थासु <i>n.</i> Bodily strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=809-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थास्नु|स्थास्नुः
स्थास्नु <i>a.</i> 1. Disposed to stand firm, immovable, stable; 2. durable, permanent, eternal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=809-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थित|स्थितः
स्थित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Stood, stayed, remained, stopped; 2. standing; 3. standing up, risen, स्थितः स्थितामुचलितः प्रयातां निषेदुषीमासनबंधधीरः R.ii.6; 4. being, situated, existing, living, बाह्योद्यानस्थितहरशिरश्चंद्रिकाधौतहर्म्या Megh.i.7; 5. stood still, desisted, stopped; 6. fixed, permanent, immovable, K.S.v.82; 7. determined, resolved, established, decreed, देवि एवं स्थितम् Mal.i.; 8. steady, steadfast in conduct; 9. faithful to a promise or agreement; 10. upright, virtuous; 11. agreed, engaged, contracted; 12. being close, at hand, ready, R.iii.57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थिता
स्थित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Stood, stayed, remained, stopped; 2. standing; 3. standing up, risen, स्थितः स्थितामुचलितः प्रयातां निषेदुषीमासनबंधधीरः R.ii.6; 4. being, situated, existing, living, बाह्योद्यानस्थितहरशिरश्चंद्रिकाधौतहर्म्या Megh.i.7; 5. stood still, desisted, stopped; 6. fixed, permanent, immovable, K.S.v.82; 7. determined, resolved, established, decreed, देवि एवं स्थितम् Mal.i.; 8. steady, steadfast in conduct; 9. faithful to a promise or agreement; 10. upright, virtuous; 11. agreed, engaged, contracted; 12. being close, at hand, ready, R.iii.57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थित|स्थितः
स्थित <i>(II) n.</i> A word standing by itself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थितोपस्थित
स्थित-उपस्थित <i>a.</i> (a word) with and without the particle ‘इति.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थितपाठ्य
स्थित-पाठ्य <i>n.</i> recitation in Prākṛt by a standing woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थितप्रज्ञ|स्थितप्रज्ञः
स्थित-प्रज्ञ <i>a.</i> firm in judgment or wisdom, free from fancies or hallucinations; (he is thus described- प्रजहाति यदा कामान् सर्वान् पार्थ मनोगतान् । आत्मन्येवात्मना तुष्टः स्थितप्रज्ञस्तदोच्यते Bg.ii.55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थितप्रेमन्
स्थित-प्रेमन् <i>m.</i> a firm or faithful friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थिति|स्थितिः
स्थिति <i>f.</i> 1. Standing, staying, residing, abiding; 2. stay, residence, रक्षोगृहे स्थ्तिर्मूलमग्निशुद्धौ त्वनिश्चयः Ut.i.; 3. standing still, stopping, continuance in one state, प्रस्थितायां प्रतिष्ठेथाः स्थितायां स्थितिमाचरेः R.i.89; 4. remaining stationary, stability, duration, permanence,स मानसीं मेरुसखः पितॄणां कन्यां कुलस्य स्थितये स्थितिज्ञः K.S.i.18; 5. stop, cessation, pause; 6. any situation, state, position; 7. natural state, habit, अथवा स्थितिरियं दुर्जनानाम् Hit.i.; 8. good condition, welfare; 9. station, high station, rank; 10. continuance or steadfastness in the path of duty, correctness of conduct, propriety; 11. consistency; 12. establishment of good order (in a government); 13. settled rule, decision, decree, axiom, maxim; 14. settled determination; 15. term, limit, boundary; 16. inertia, resistance to motion (in phil.); 17. one of the three states through which the system of created things has to pass, viz., that of preservation, सर्गस्थितिप्रत्यवहारहेतुः R.ii.44; 18. duration of an eclipse (in astronomy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थितिस्थापक|स्थितिस्थापकः
स्थिति-स्थापक <i>(I) a.</i> fixing in a former or original state, capable of restoring to a previous position, having elastic properties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थितिस्थापक|स्थितिस्थापकः
स्थिति-स्थापक <i>(II) m.</i> the capability of placing in or recovering a previous position or condition, elasticity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=810-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थिर|स्थिरः
