स्ना <i>vi. 2P (pp. स्नात; pres. स्नाति; desid. सिष्णासति)</i> 1. To bathe, to perform ablution; 2. to perform the ceremony of bathing when leaving the house of a spiritual preceptor.With अप-, to bathe after mourning.With नि-, to be perfect, to be skilled in, कुतापत्येस्नेहः कुटिलमयनिष्पातमनसाम् M.M.ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=811-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

