स्निग्ध|स्निग्धं|स्निग्धः
स्निग्ध <i>(I) a. (f. ग्धा)</i> 1. Oily, unctuous, greasy, त्वय्यारूढे शिखरमचलः Megh.i.18; 2. sticky, cohesive, adhesive; 3. smooth; 4. glossy, shining, resplendent, सौदामिन्या कनकनिकषस्निग्धया दर्शयोर्वीम् Megh.i.37; 5. moist, wet; 6. cooling; 7. bland, kind, amiable, प्रीतिस्निग्धैर्जनपदवधूलोचनैः पीयमानः Megh.i.16; 8. attached, loving, tender, friendly, affectionate, (generally with a loc.); 9. lovely, agreeable; 10. thick, dense, स्निग्धच्छायातरुषु वसतिं रामगिर्याश्रमेषु Megh.i.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=812-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धा
स्निग्ध <i>(I) a. (f. ग्धा)</i> 1. Oily, unctuous, greasy, त्वय्यारूढे शिखरमचलः Megh.i.18; 2. sticky, cohesive, adhesive; 3. smooth; 4. glossy, shining, resplendent, सौदामिन्या कनकनिकषस्निग्धया दर्शयोर्वीम् Megh.i.37; 5. moist, wet; 6. cooling; 7. bland, kind, amiable, प्रीतिस्निग्धैर्जनपदवधूलोचनैः पीयमानः Megh.i.16; 8. attached, loving, tender, friendly, affectionate, (generally with a loc.); 9. lovely, agreeable; 10. thick, dense, स्निग्धच्छायातरुषु वसतिं रामगिर्याश्रमेषु Megh.i.1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=812-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

