स्निह्
स्निह् <i>vi. or vt. 4P (pp. स्निग्ध; pres. स्निह्यति)</i> 1. To be adhesive or sticky; 2. to be bland; 3. to be easily attached; 4. to have affection for, to love, किं न खलु बालेऽस्मिन्नौरस इव पुत्रे स्नुह्यति मे मनः Sak.v.; 5. to be kind to, to be pleased with; (this root and all its derivatives govern the loc. of the person or thing for whom or which affection is felt).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=812-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निह्
