स्पर्ध्
स्पर्ध् <i>vi. 1Ā (pres. स्पर्धते)</i> 1. To contend with, to vie with, to emulate, to rival, to be equal with, तान्प्रति मानमुज्झत नृपाः कस्तैस्सह स्पर्धते Bhartr.ii.16; 2. to challenge, to defy, to bid defiance.With प्रति-, to bid defiance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=813-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

