स्पष्ट|स्पष्टं
स्पष्ट <i>a. (f. ष्टा)</i> 1. Evident, clearly perceived, discerned, पात्रीकृतात्मा गुरुसेवनेन स्पष्टाकृतिः पत्ररथेंद्रकेतोः R.xviii.30; 2. true, real; 3. one who sees clearly.(स्पष्टीकृ 1. to make distinct or clear; 2. to explain, to elucidate.)(स्पष्टम् is used as an indeclinable in the sense of- (1) clearly, distinctly, (2) openly, boldly.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=813-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

