स्फुर्
स्फुर् <i>vi. 6P (pres. स्फुरति)</i> 1. To tremble, to palpitate, to throb, स्फुरता वामकेनापि दाक्षिण्यमवलंब्यते M.M.i., स्फुरति च बाहुः कुतः फलमिहास्य Sak.i., K.S.iii.9; 2. to twitch, to struggle, to become agitated; 3. to start, to dart, to spring, पुस्फुरुर्वृषभाः Bt.xiv.6; 4. to spring back, to rebound; 5. to spring up, to shoot out, to break forth; 6. to start into view, to be evident or manifest, to appear clearly, to become displayed, प्रदोषे स्फुरति निरवसादां कापि राधां जगाद Git.G.xi.; 7. to flash, to scintillate, to twinkle, to gleam, to glitter, विद्युद्दामस्फुरितचकितैस्तत्र पौरांगनानाम् Megh.i.27; 8. to shine, to glitter, बर्हेणेव स्फुरितरुचिना गोपवेषस्य विष्णोः Megh.i.15; 9. to flash on the mind, to rush into the memory; 10. to go tremulously; 11. to bruise, to destroy.With अभि-, 1. to expand; 2. to become known.With प्र-, 1. tremble; 2. to expand; 3. to become known, to spread wide, e.g. संस्थितस्य गुणोत्कर्षः प्रायः प्रस्फुरति स्फुटम्.With वि-, 1. to tremble; 2. to struggle; 3. to glitter; 4. to draw, to twang (as a bow), विकृष्टविस्फारितचापमंडलः Kir.xiv.31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुर्
स्फुर् <i>Caus. (स्फारयति-ते, स्फोरयति-ते)</i> 1. to cause to vibrate; 2. to make to shine; 3. to cast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुर|स्फुरः
स्फुर <i>m.</i> 1. Trembling, throbbing; 2. swelling; 3. a shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुरण|स्फुरणं
स्फुरण <i>n.</i> 1. Trembling; 2. quivering or throbbing of parts of the body; 3. springing or breaking forth, starting into view; 4. flashing, twinkling, glittering; 5. flashing on the mind, springing on memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुरदुल्का
स्फुरदुल्का <i>f.</i> A shooting meteor, aerolite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुरित|स्फुरितं
स्फुरित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Trembling; 2. flashing; 3. swollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुरिता
स्फुरित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Trembling; 2. flashing; 3. swollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुरित|स्फुरितं
स्फुरित <i>(II) n.</i> 1. A throb, tremor; 2. emotion of the mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुर्च्छ्
स्फुर्च्छ् <i>vt. 1P (pres. स्फुर्च्छति, स्वुर्च्छति)</i> 1. To spread, to extend; 2. to forget.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वुर्च्छ्
स्फुर्च्छ् <i>vt. 1P (pres. स्फुर्च्छति, स्वुर्च्छति)</i> 1. To spread, to extend; 2. to forget.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुर्ज्
स्फुर्ज् <i>vi. 1P (pres. स्फूर्जति)</i> 1. To thunder, to make a sound like a thunderclap, to clash, to explode; 2. to flash, to burn, to glitter, स्फूर्जत्येव स एष संप्रति मम न्यक्कारभिन्नस्थितेः Mv.iii.With वि-, 1. to resound; 2. to roar (as wind); 3. to increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुल्
स्फुल् <i>vt. or vi. 6P (pres. स्फुलति)</i> 1. To tremble, to throb, to vibrate; 2. to dart forth, to appear; 3. to collect; 4. to slay, to kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=815-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुल|स्फुलं
स्फुल <i>n.</i> A tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुलन|स्फुलनं
स्फुलन <i>n.</i> Trembling, vibration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुलिंग|स्फुलिङ्ग|स्फुलिंगं|स्फुलिंगः|स्फुलिङ्गः
स्फुलिंग <i>m.n.</i> A spark of fire, स्फुलिंगावस्थया वह्निरेधापेक्ष इव स्थितः Sak.vii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुलिंगा
स्फुलिंगा <i>f.</i> A spark of fire, स्फुलिंगावस्थया वह्निरेधापेक्ष इव स्थितः Sak.vii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुर्ज|स्फुर्ज्ज
स्फुर्ज <i>m.</i> 1. The clashing sound of a thunder clap; 2. Indra’s thunderbolt; 3. sudden burst; 4. first union of lovers characterized by some joy in the beginning and fear in the end (in dramaturgy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुर्जथु|स्फुर्जथुः|स्फुर्ज्जथु
स्फुर्जथु <i>m.</i> A thunder-clap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फूर्ति|स्फूर्तिः|स्फूर्त्ति|स्फूर्त्तिः
स्फूर्ति <i>f.</i> 1. Shaking, throbbing; 2. blooming, opening; 3. poetical genius (प्रतिभा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फूर्तिमत्|स्फूर्तिमन्त्|स्फूर्त्तिमत्
स्फूर्ति-मत् <i>a.</i> 1. tremulous; 2. kind-hearted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फेयस्
स्फेयस् <i>a. (f. सी)</i> Larger, (compar. of स्फिर q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फेयसी
स्फेयस् <i>a. (f. सी)</i> Larger, (compar. of स्फिर q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फेष्ठ|स्फेष्ठः
स्फेष्ठ <i>a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> Very large, (super. of स्फिर q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फेष्ठा
स्फेष्ठ <i>a. (f. ष्ठा)</i> Very large, (super. of स्फिर q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोट|स्फोटः
स्फोट <i>m.</i> 1. Splitting open, breaking; 2. revealing, disclosure (as in नर्मस्फोट) (in the drama); 3. a swelling, boil, tumour; 4. the idea which bursts out or flashes on the mind when a sound is uttered, बुधैर्वैयाकरणैः प्रधानभूतस्फोटरूपव्यंग्यव्यंजकस्य शब्दस्य ध्वनिरिति व्यवहारः कृतः K.Pr.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोटवीजक
स्फोट-वीजक <i>m.</i> the marking-nut plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोटन|स्फोटनं|स्फोटनः
स्फोटन <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Breaking, disclosing, making clear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोटनी
स्फोटन <i>(I) a. (f. नी)</i> Breaking, disclosing, making clear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोटन|स्फोटनं|स्फोटनः
स्फोटन <i>(II) m.</i> Separated utterance of a close combination of consonants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोटन|स्फोटनं|स्फोटनः
स्फोटन <i>(III) n.</i> 1. The act of rending suddenly, splitting, cracking; 2. winnowing grain; 3. cracking the finger-joints, snapping the fingers; 4. the separation of the letters of a double consonant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोटनी
स्फोटनी <i>f.</i> A boring tool, a gimlet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोटा
स्फोटा <i>f.</i> The expanded hood of a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोटिका
स्फोटिका <i>f.</i> A kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फोरण|स्फोरणं
स्फोरण <i>n.</i> The same as स्फुरण q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फ्य|स्फ्यं
स्फ्य <i>n.</i> An implement used in sacrifices, shaped like a spit, M.v.117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फ्यवर्तनि|स्फ्यवर्तनिः|स्फ्यवर्त्तनि
स्फ्य-वर्तनि <i>m.</i> the furrow or line made by the स्फ्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्बॄ
स्बॄ <i>vt.</i> The same as स्वॄ q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्म
स्म <i>ind.</i> 1. A particle added to the present tense of verbs or to present participles, generally giving them a past signification, इति स्म पृच्छत्यनुवेलमादृतः R.iii.5; 2. a pleonastic particle, e.g. मा स्म सीमंतिनी काचिक्कनयेत्पुत्रमीदृशम्.(It is often added to the prohibitive particle मा and used with the aorist or imperfect. See under मा.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मय|स्मयः
स्मय <i>m.</i> 1. Astonishment, surprise; 2. arrogance, pride, तस्मै स्मयावेशाविवर्जिताय R.v.19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मर|स्मरः
स्मर <i>m.</i> 1. Recollection; 2. love; 3. the god of love, स्मरसि स्मर मेखलागुणैरुत गोत्रस्खलितेषु बंधनम् K.S.iv.8, स्मर एव तापहेतुर्निर्वापयिता स एव मे जातः Sak.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरांकुश|स्मराङ्कुश|स्मराङ्कुशः
स्मर-अंकुश <i>m.</i> 1. a finger-nail; 2. a lover, a lascivious person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरागार|स्मरागारं
स्मर-अगार <i>n.</i> the female organ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरकूपक|स्मरकूपकः
स्मर-कूपक <i>m.</i> the female organ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरांध|स्मरान्ध
स्मर-अंध <i>a.</i> infatuated with passion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरातुर
स्मर-आतुर, -आर्त <i>a.</i> pining with love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरार्त|स्मरार्त्त
स्मर-आतुर, -आर्त <i>a.</i> pining with love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरासव|स्मरासवः
स्मर-आसव <i>m.</i> saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरकर्मन्|स्मरकर्म्मन्
स्मर-कर्मन् <i>n.</i> any wanton act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरगुरु|स्मरगुरुः
स्मर-गुरु <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरच्छत्र|स्मरच्छत्रं
स्मर-च्छत्र <i>n.</i> the clitoris.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरदशा
स्मर-दशा <i>f.</i> state of the body produced by being in love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरध्वज|स्मरध्वजं|स्मरध्वजः
स्मर-ध्वज <i>(I) m.</i> 1. the male organ; 2. a fabulous fish; 3. name of a musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरध्वज|स्मरध्वजं|स्मरध्वजः
स्मर-ध्वज <i>(II) n.</i> the female organ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरध्वजा
स्मर-ध्वजा <i>f.</i> a bright moon-light night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरप्रिया
स्मर-प्रिया <i>f.</i> an epithet of Rati.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरभासित
स्मर-भासित <i>a.</i> inflamed by love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरमोह|स्मरमोहः
स्मर-मोह <i>m.</i> infatuation of love, passion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरलेखनी
स्मर-लेखनी <i>f.</i> the sārika bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरवल्लभ|स्मरवल्लभः
स्मर-वल्लभ <i>m.</i> an epithet of Aniruddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरवीथिका
स्मर-वीथिका <i>f.</i> a prostitute, a harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरशासन|स्मरशासनः
स्मर-शासन <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरसख|स्मरसखः
स्मर-सख <i>m.</i> the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरस्मर्य|स्मरस्मर्यः|स्मरस्मर्य्य|स्मरस्मर्य्यः
स्मर-स्मर्य <i>m.</i> a donkey, an ass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरहर|स्मरहरः
स्मर-हर <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरण|स्मरणं
स्मरण <i>n.</i> 1. Remembering, remembrance, भवत्यभ्यस्तेऽपि स्मरणमतथाभावविरसम् M.M.i.; 2. memory; 3. tradition, traditional precept, e.g. इति कात्यायनस्मरणात्; 3.; 4. name of a figure of speech in rhetoric; (it is thus defined- सदृशानुभवाद्वस्तुस्मृतिः स्मरणमुच्यते); 5. mental recitation of the name of a deity; 6. regretting; 7. remembering with regret, anxious thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरणानुग्रह|स्मरणानुग्रहः
स्मरण-अनुग्रह <i>m.</i> 1. kind remembrance; 2. the favour of remembrance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरणापत्यतर्पक|स्मरणापत्यतर्पकः
स्मरण-अपत्यतर्पक <i>m.</i> a turtle, a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरणायौगपद्य
स्मरण-अयौगपद्य <i>n.</i> the non-simultaneousness of recollections.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मरणपदवी
स्मरण-पदवी <i>f.</i> death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मार
स्मार <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Relating to love, स्मारं विहाय मदमारंभरम्यमनुवारं भज श्रुतिगिरां सारम् Asv.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मारा
स्मार <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> Relating to love, स्मारं विहाय मदमारंभरम्यमनुवारं भज श्रुतिगिरां सारम् Asv.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मार
स्मार <i>(II) n.</i> Recollection, memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मारक
स्मारक <i>a. (f. रिका)</i> Reminding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मारिका
स्मारक <i>a. (f. रिका)</i> Reminding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मारण|स्मारणं
स्मारण <i>n.</i> Calling to mind, causing to remember.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मार्त|स्मार्तः|स्मार्त्त|स्मार्त्तं|स्मार्त्तः
स्मार्त <i>(I) a. (f. र्ता)</i> 1. Memorial, relating to memory; 2. within memory; 3. recorded in a Smṛti, आचारः परमो धर्मः श्रुत्युक्तं स्मार्त एव च M.i.108; 4. following or professing the law-books.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मार्ता
स्मार्त <i>(I) a. (f. र्ता)</i> 1. Memorial, relating to memory; 2. within memory; 3. recorded in a Smṛti, आचारः परमो धर्मः श्रुत्युक्तं स्मार्त एव च M.i.108; 4. following or professing the law-books.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मार्त|स्मार्तः|स्मार्त्त|स्मार्त्तं|स्मार्त्तः
स्मार्त <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A Brāhmaṇa following the revealed law; 2. one who knows the traditional law; 3. name of a particular sect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=816-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मि
स्मि <i>vt. 1Ā (pp. स्मित; pres. स्मयते; desid. सिस्मयिषते)</i> 1. To Smile, to laugh, स्मयमानमायताक्षाः किंचिदभिव्यक्तदशनशोभि मुखम् Mal.ii.; 2. to expand, to bloom.With उद्-, to smile.With वि-, 1. to be surprised, उभयोर्न तथा लोकः प्रवीण्येन विसिष्मिये R.xv.65; 2. to admire; 3. to be proud, M.iv.236.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मि
स्मि <i>Caus. (स्मायति-ते, स्मापयते)</i> 1. to cause to laugh; 2. to laugh at, to mock, to despise; 3. to astonish; (in this sense only स्मापयते).With वि-, to cause to be surprised, विस्माययन्विस्मितमात्मवृत्तौ R.ii.33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मिट्
स्मिट् <i>vt. or vi. 10U (pres. स्मेटयति-ते)</i> 1. To slight, to despise; 2. to love; 3. to go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मित|स्मितं
स्मित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Smiled, smiling; 2. expanded, blown, blossomed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मिता
स्मित <i>(I) a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Smiled, smiling; 2. expanded, blown, blossomed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मित|स्मितं
स्मित <i>(II) n.</i> A smile, gentle laugh, e.g. स्मितं किंचिद्वक्त्रे K.S.vii.46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मितदृश्
स्मित-दृश् <i>f.</i> a handsome woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मितपूर्वम्
स्मित-पूर्वम् <i>ind.</i> smilingly, with a smile, सप्तर्षिभिस्तात् स्मितपूर्वमाह K.S.vii.47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मील्
स्मील् <i>vi. 1P (pres. स्मीलति)</i> To wink, to blink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृ
स्मृ <i>(I) vt. or vi. 5P (pres. स्मृणोति)</i> 1. To please, to gratify; 2. to protect, to defend; 3. to live.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृ
स्मृ <i>(II) vt. or vi. 1P (often Atm. in epic poetry) (pp. स्मृत; pres. स्मरति-ते; pass. स्मर्यते; desid. सुस्मूर्षते)</i> 1. To recollect, to call to mind, to bear in mind, to think upon, to be mindful of, स्मरसि सुतनि तस्मिन् पर्वते लक्ष्मणेन Ut.i.; 2. to recite mentally the name of a deity, e.g. प्रातः स्मरामि हृदि संस्फुरदात्मतत्वम्; 3. to record in a Smṛti; 4. to desire, to long for, to remember with regret, (with gen.), कच्चिद्भर्तुः स्मरसि रसिके त्वं हि तस्य प्रियेति Megh.ii.22.With अनु-, call to mind, to remember.With अप-, to forget.With वि-, to forget, अस्मिन्क्षणे विस्मृतं खलु मया Sak.i.With सम्-, to remember, M.iv.149.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृ
स्मृ <i>Caus. (स्मारयति-ते, स्मरयति-ते)</i> 1. to cause to remember, to remind, to call to mind, य एव दुस्मरः कालस्तमेव स्मारिता वयम् Ut.vi.; 2. to give information; 3. to cause to regret; 4. to cause to desire or long for; (in this sense only स्मरयति-ते).With सम्-, to remind, (पातालं) मामद्य संस्मरयतीव भुजंगलोकः Rat.i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृति|स्मृतिः
स्मृति <i>f.</i> 1. Recollection, remembrance, memory, स्मृतिमपि न ते यांति क्ष्मापा विना यदनुग्रहम् Rajat.; 2. the body of law (civil and religious) (as op. to श्रुति or revelation), M.ii.6; 3. a law-book; 4. a passage concerning law, a text of Smṛti; 4. understanding; 5. desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृत्यंतर|स्मृत्यन्तर
स्मृति-अंतर <i>n.</i> another law-book.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृत्यपेत|स्मृत्यपेतः
स्मृति-अपेत <i>a.</i> 1. forgotten; 2. inconsistent with Smṛti; 3. unjust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृत्युक्त
स्मृति-उक्त <i>a.</i> prescribed in the codes of law, canonical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिपथ|स्मृतिपथः
स्मृति-पथ, -विषय <i>m.</i> scope or object of memory; (used with गम् or नी to mean ‘to be deceased’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिविषय|स्मृतिविषयः
स्मृति-पथ, -विषय <i>m.</i> scope or object of memory; (used with गम् or नी to mean ‘to be deceased’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिप्रत्यवमर्ष
स्मृति-प्रत्यवमर्ष <i>m.</i> retentiveness of memory, accuracy of recollection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिप्रबंध|स्मृतिप्रबन्ध|स्मृतिप्रबन्धः
स्मृति-प्रबंध <i>m.</i> a legal composition or work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिभ्रंश|स्मृतिभ्रंशः
स्मृति-भ्रंश <i>m.</i> loss or failure of memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिरोध|स्मृतिरोधः
स्मृति-रोध <i>m.</i> temporary interruption of memory, loss of memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिविभ्रम|स्मृतिविभ्रमः
स्मृति-विभ्रम <i>m.</i> confusion of memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिविरोध|स्मृतिविरोधः
स्मृति-विरोध <i>m.</i> 1. opposition to law, illegality, impropriety; 2. disagreement of two or more Smṛtis, तत्र प्रथमं तावत्स्मृतिविरोधमुपन्यस्य परिहरति S.Bh.ii.1.9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिशास्त्र|स्मृतिशास्त्रं
स्मृति-शास्त्र <i>n.</i> 1. a law-book, code, digest; 2. legal science.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिशेष
स्मृति-शेष <i>a.</i> deceased, defunct (as a person).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिशैथिल्य
स्मृति-शैथिल्य <i>n.</i> failure of memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिसाध्य
स्मृति-साध्य <i>a.</i> capable of being proved by law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिसिद्ध
स्मृति-सिद्ध <i>a.</i> established by law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मृतिहेतु|स्मृतिहेतुः
स्मृति-हेतु <i>m.</i> a cause of recollection, association of ideas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मेर|स्मेरः
स्मेर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Smiling, स्मेरैः स्मरस्य सचिवैः सरसावलोकैः Bh.V.iii.2; 2. blown, blooming, opened, अधिकविकसदंतर्विस्मयस्मेरतारैः M.M.i.; 3. evident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मेरा
स्मेर <i>(I) a. (f. रा)</i> 1. Smiling, स्मेरैः स्मरस्य सचिवैः सरसावलोकैः Bh.V.iii.2; 2. blown, blooming, opened, अधिकविकसदंतर्विस्मयस्मेरतारैः M.M.i.; 3. evident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मेरविष्किर|स्मेरविष्किरः
स्मेर-विष्किर <i>m.</i> a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्यद|स्यदः
स्यद <i>m.</i> Speed, rush, motion, velocity, भर्तृकृतेनागादिस्यदेन भुवि वस्तपरिहृतेनागागि Nal.iv.6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्यंद्|स्यन्द्
स्यंद् <i>vi. 1Ā (pp. स्यन्न; pres. स्यंदते; desid. सिस्यन्त्सति-ते, सिस्यंदिषते)</i> 1. To trickle, to ooze, to drop, to flow out, व्यालुंपंति स्फुटजललवस्यंदिनश्चंद्रकांताः Megh.ii.7, Bt.xvi.7; 2. to run, to flee.With अभि-, to rain out, संततमभिष्यंदमानमेघमेदुरितनीलिमा गिरिः प्रस्रवणो नाम Ut.i.; 2. to ooze, to be melted.With नि-, to flow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्यंद|स्यन्द|स्यंदः|स्यन्दः
स्यंद <i>m.</i> 1. Trickling; 2. going, moving rapidly; 3. a car, a chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्यंदन|स्यन्दन|स्यन्दनं|स्यन्दनः
स्यंदन <i>(I) a. (f. ना or नी)</i> 1. Quick, swift, स्यंदना नो च तुरगाः सुरेर्भावा विपत्तयः Kir.xv.16; 2. flowing, going quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्यंदना
स्यंदन <i>(I) a. (f. ना or नी)</i> 1. Quick, swift, स्यंदना नो च तुरगाः सुरेर्भावा विपत्तयः Kir.xv.16; 2. flowing, going quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्यंदनी|स्यन्दनी
स्यंदन <i>(I) a. (f. ना or नी)</i> 1. Quick, swift, स्यंदना नो च तुरगाः सुरेर्भावा विपत्तयः Kir.xv.16; 2. flowing, going quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्यंदन|स्यन्दन|स्यन्दनं|स्यन्दनः
स्यंदन <i>(II) m.</i> 1. A war chariot, a chariot, a car, मुहुरनुपतति स्यम्दने दत्तदृष्टिः Sak.i.; 2. air, wind; 3. a kind of tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=817-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

