स्वल्प <i>a. (f. ल्पा; compar. स्वल्पीयस्; super. स्वल्पिष्ठ)</i> 1. Very small, little, minute, insignificant; 2. very few.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वल्पा
स्वल्प <i>a. (f. ल्पा; compar. स्वल्पीयस्; super. स्वल्पिष्ठ)</i> 1. Very small, little, minute, insignificant; 2. very few.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वल्पाहार
स्वल्प-आहार <i>a.</i> most abstemious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वल्पकंक|स्वल्पकङ्क|स्वल्पकङ्कः
