स्वल्पविषय|स्वल्पविषयः
स्वल्प-विषय <i>m.</i> 1. an insignificant object; 2. a small part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वल्पव्यय|स्वल्पव्ययः
स्वल्प-व्यय <i>m.</i> little expenditure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वल्पव्रीड
स्वल्प-व्रीड <i>a.</i> (having little shame) shameless, impudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वल्पक
स्वल्पक <i>a. (f. का)</i> Very little, very small.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वल्पका
स्वल्पक <i>a. (f. का)</i> Very little, very small.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वल्पीयस्
स्वल्पीयस् <i>a.</i> More insignificant or minute, (compar. of स्वल्प q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वल्पिष्ठ
स्वल्पिष्ठ <i>a.</i> Most insignificant or minute, (super. of स्वल्प q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वशुर|स्वशुरः
स्वशुर <i>m.</i> father-in-law. Cf. श्वशुर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वसृ
स्वसृ <i>f.</i> A sister, स्वस्रुः श्लाघ्यो भर्ता क्व खलु स ते मातुल गतः Ve.iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वसृत्
स्वसृत् <i>m.</i> Going or moving at one’s own will.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्क्
स्वस्क् <i>vt. 1Ā (pres. स्वस्कते)</i> To go, to move. Cf. ष्वस्क्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्ति
स्वस्ति <i>ind.</i> A particle (used with a dat.) meaning, ‘may it be well with you,’ ‘hail,’ ‘adieu,’ स्वस्त्यस्तु ते निर्गलितांबुगर्भम् R.v.17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्त्ययन
स्वस्ति-अयन <i>n.</i> 1. a means of attaining prosperity; 2. the averting of evil by the recitation of mantras; 3. the benediction of a Brāhmaṇa after presentation of offerings, प्रास्थानिकं स्वस्त्ययनं प्रयुज्य R.ii.70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्तिभाव|स्वस्तिभावः
स्वस्ति-भाव <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्तिमुख|स्वस्तिमुखः
स्वस्ति-मुख <i>m.</i> 1. a letter, a note; 2. a Brāhmaṇa; 3. a bard, an encomiast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्तिवाचन|स्वस्तिवाचनं
स्वस्ति-वाचन, -वाचनक, -वाचनिक <i>n.</i> 1. a religious rite preparatory to a sacrifice or any solemn observance; 2. an offering of flowers, sweetmeat &c. to anyone intended to secure good wishes and blessings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्तिवाचनक
स्वस्ति-वाचन, -वाचनक, -वाचनिक <i>n.</i> 1. a religious rite preparatory to a sacrifice or any solemn observance; 2. an offering of flowers, sweetmeat &c. to anyone intended to secure good wishes and blessings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्तिवाचनिक
स्वस्ति-वाचन, -वाचनक, -वाचनिक <i>n.</i> 1. a religious rite preparatory to a sacrifice or any solemn observance; 2. an offering of flowers, sweetmeat &c. to anyone intended to secure good wishes and blessings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्तिवाच्य
स्वस्ति-वाच्य <i>n.</i> congratulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्तिक|स्वस्तिकः
स्वस्तिक <i>(I) m.</i> 1. A kind of mystical mark on persons or things which denotes good luck; 2. a particular symbol made with ground rice and shaped like a triangle; 3. the meeting of four roads; 4. a palace of a particular shape; 5. the crossing of the arms, स्तनविनिहितहस्तस्वस्तिकाभिर्वधूभिः M.M.iv.; 6. a kind of cake; 7. a voluptuary, a libertine; 8. garlic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्तिक|स्वस्तिकः
स्वस्तिक <i>(II) m.n.</i> 1. A mansion of a particular form with a portico in front; 2. particular mode of sitting practised by Yogins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्रीय|स्वस्रीयः
स्वस्रीय <i>m.</i> A sister’s son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्रेय|स्वस्रेयः
स्वस्रीय <i>m.</i> A sister’s son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्रीया
स्वस्रीया <i>f.</i> A sister’s daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्रेयी
स्वस्रीया <i>f.</i> A sister’s daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वागत|स्वागतं
स्वागत <i>n.</i> 1. Happy arrival, स्वागतं स्वानधीकारान् प्रभावैरवलंब्य वः K.S.ii.18; 2. welcome, प्रीतः प्रितिप्रमुखवचनैः स्वागतं व्याजहार Megh.i.4. (In greeting, this word is generally used with the dat. of the person greeted, e.g. स्वागतं दैव्यै).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=822-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

