हंडा|हण्डा
हंडा <i>(I) ind.</i> A vocative particle used in addressing a female of inferior rank (in the drama).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=825-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हंडा|हण्डा
हंडा <i>(II) f.</i> A large earthen pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=825-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हंडिका|हण्डिका
हंडिका <i>f.</i> An earthen pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=825-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हंडी|हण्डी
हंडिका <i>f.</i> An earthen pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=825-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हंडे|हण्डे
हंडे <i>ind.</i> See हंडा (I).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=825-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हत|हतः
हत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Killed; 2. disappointed; 3. struck, (pp. of हन् q.v.).(It is often used at the beginning of compounds in the sense of ‘miserable,’ ‘worthless,’ e.g. ननु भो हतविधे भरतकुलविमुख Ve.iv., or कुर्यामुपेक्षां हतजीवितेऽस्मिन् R.xiv.65, where Mall. renders हत by तुच्छ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=825-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हता
हत <i>a. (f. ता)</i> 1. Killed; 2. disappointed; 3. struck, (pp. of हन् q.v.).(It is often used at the beginning of compounds in the sense of ‘miserable,’ ‘worthless,’ e.g. ननु भो हतविधे भरतकुलविमुख Ve.iv., or कुर्यामुपेक्षां हतजीवितेऽस्मिन् R.xiv.65, where Mall. renders हत by तुच्छ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=825-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हताश|हताशः
