हरिद्वार|हरिद्वारं
हरि-द्वार <i>n.</i> name of a celebrated sacred bathing-place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=827-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हरिनेत्र|हरिनेत्रं|हरिनेत्रः
