हविष्मत् <i>a.</i> possessed of oblations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=829-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्य|हव्यं
हव्य <i>(I) a. (f. व्या)</i> Fit to be offered in oblations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=829-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्या
हव्य <i>(I) a. (f. व्या)</i> Fit to be offered in oblations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=829-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्य|हव्यं
हव्य <i>(II) n.</i> 1. An oblation or offering to the gods, (op. to कव्य q.v.); 2. clarified butter; 3. an oblation in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=829-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

