हव्य-कव्य <i>n.</i> oblations to the gods and to the spirits of deceased ancestors, M.i.94, iii.97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=829-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

