हस्ताग्र
हस्त-अग्र <i>n.</i> the extremity of the hand, the fingers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=829-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

