हस्तिन्
हस्तिन् <i>(II) m.</i> An elephant, M.iv.120, iii.162; (four kinds of elephants are enumerated, viz., भद्र, मंद्र, मृग and मिश्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=830-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्त्यध्यक्ष|हस्त्यध्यक्षः
