हस्तिकक्ष्य|हस्तिकक्ष्यः
हस्तिन्-कक्ष्य <i>m.</i> 1. a lion; 2. a tiger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=830-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिकर्ण|हस्तिकर्णः
हस्तिन्-कर्ण <i>m.</i> the castor-oil plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=830-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

