हान|हानं
हान <i>n.</i> 1. The act of abandoning, हिमहानकृता न कृता क्वचन Bt.x.5; 2. prowess, valour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=831-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हानि|हानिः
हानि <i>f.</i> 1. Decrease, deficiency, प्रसादे सर्वदुःखानां हानिरस्योपजायये Bg.ii.66, Yaj.ii.207; 2. loss, damage, यद्यपि न कापि हानिः परकीयां चरति रासभे द्राक्षाम् Ud.; 3. abandonment, relinquishment, neglet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=831-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

