हार|हारं|हारः
हार <i>m.</i> 1. Abstraction, deprivation; 2. a porter; 3. a necklace, हारममलतरतारमुरसि दधतं परिलंब्य विदूरम् Git.G.xi., स्तनैः सहाराभरणैः सचंदनैः Rt.i.4, R.vi.16; 4. a necklace of pearls, K.S.v.8, R.v.52; 5. war, battle; 6. the denominator of a fraction (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=831-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

