हारिन्
हारिन् <i>a. (f. णी)</i> 1. Taking, conveying, robbing, वाजिकुंजराणां च हारिणः Yaj.ii.273; 2. obtaining, acquiring; 3. disturbing, seizing, M.xii.28; 4. delighting, pleasing, captivating, तुष्टे विष्टपहारिणीष्टदहरौ संप्राप्यते देहिना Bhartr.ii.25; 5. having a necklace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=831-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हारिणी
