हालहल|हालहलं
हाल(ला)हल <i>n.</i> 1. A sort of deadly poison produced at the churning of the ocean and quaffed by Śiva, अहमेव गुरुः सुदारुणानामिति हालाहल तात मास्म दृप्यः K.Pr.x.; 2. poison in general, Bh.V.i.95. (Also हालहाल.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=831-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हालाहल|हालाहलं|हालाहलः
हाल(ला)हल <i>n.</i> 1. A sort of deadly poison produced at the churning of the ocean and quaffed by Śiva, अहमेव गुरुः सुदारुणानामिति हालाहल तात मास्म दृप्यः K.Pr.x.; 2. poison in general, Bh.V.i.95. (Also हालहाल.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=831-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

