हेत्वाभास|हेत्वाभासः
हेतु-आभास <i>m.</i> 1. fallacious semblance of an argument, fallacy (in logic), [it is of five kinds, viz., (1) व्यभिचार, (2) विरुद्धता, (3) असिद्धि, (4) सत्प्रतिपक्षता and (5) बाध]; 2. a fallacious middle term.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=837-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

