होमीया
होमीय <i>a. (f. या)</i> Belonging to or fit for an oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=838-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होरा
होरा <i>f.</i> 1. The rising of zodiacal sign; 2. an hour; 3. a mark, a line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=838-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होलाका
होलाका <i>f.</i> 1. The spring-festival held at the approach of the vernal season, i.e. during the ten days preceding the full-moon-day of the month of Phālguna; 2. the full-moon-day in the month of Phālguna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=838-35" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होली
होली <i>f.</i> The Holikā festival.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=838-36" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौ
हौ <i>ind.</i> A vocative particle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=838-37" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौत्र|हौत्रं
हौत्र <i>n.</i> The office of a Hotṛ priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-01" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौम्य|हौम्यं
हौम्य <i>n.</i> Clarified butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-02" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्नु
ह्नु <i>vt. 2Ā (pp. ह्नुत; pres. ह्नुते)</i> 1. To take away, to abstract, to rob, यमस्याह्नोष्ट विक्रमम् Bt.xv.88; 2. to withhold, to conceal; 3. to hide from anyone, to deny before anyone, (with a dat., e.g. कृष्णाय ह्नुते ‘he hides from Kṛṣṇa’).With अप-, to conceal, to conceal from, अपह्नुवानस्य जनाय यन्निकामधीरतामस्य कृतं मनोभुवा Na.i.49.With नि-, 1. to conceal, to hide, Bt.x.36; 2. to conceal from, to hide from, to deny before anyone, (with a dat.), Bt.viii.74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-03" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्नुति|ह्नुतिः
ह्नुति <i>f.</i> 1. Concealment; 2. denial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-04" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्यस्
ह्यस् <i>ind.</i> Yesterday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्यस्तन|ह्यस्तनं
ह्यस्-तन <i>a.</i> belonging to yesterday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्यस्तनदिन
ह्यस्-तन˚दिन <i>n.</i> yesterday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्यस्त्य|ह्यस्त्यः
ह्यस्-त्य <i>a.</i> belonging to yesterday, of yesterday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्योभव
ह्योभव <i>a.</i> what happened yesterday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-05" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रद|ह्रदः
ह्रद <i>m.</i> 1. A deep lake or pool, Yaj.i.159; 2. a ray of light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रदग्रह|ह्रदग्रहः
ह्रद-ग्रह <i>m.</i> a crocodile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-06" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रदिनी
ह्रदिनी <i>f.</i> A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-07" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रद्रोग|ह्रद्रोगः
ह्रद्रोग <i>m.</i> The sign Aquarius of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-08" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्
ह्रस् <i>vt. 1P (pp. ह्रसित; pres. ह्रसति)</i> To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-09" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रसिमन्
ह्रसिमन् <i>m.</i> Smallness, sharpness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-10" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्व|ह्रस्वं|ह्रस्वः
ह्रस्व <i>(I) a. (f. स्वा; compar. ह्रसीयस्; super. ह्रसिष्ठ)</i> 1. Short, small, little; 2. dwarfish; 3. short, (op. to दीर्घ) (in prosody).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वा
ह्रस्व <i>(I) a. (f. स्वा; compar. ह्रसीयस्; super. ह्रसिष्ठ)</i> 1. Short, small, little; 2. dwarfish; 3. short, (op. to दीर्घ) (in prosody).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्व|ह्रस्वं|ह्रस्वः
ह्रस्व <i>(II) m.</i> A dwarf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वांग|ह्रस्वाङ्ग|ह्रस्वाङ्गः
ह्रस्व-अंग <i>(I) a.</i> short-bodied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वांग|ह्रस्वाङ्ग|ह्रस्वाङ्गः
ह्रस्व-अंग <i>(II) m.</i> a dwarf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वगर्भ|ह्रस्वगर्भः
ह्रस्व-गर्भ <i>m.</i> the Kuśa grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वदर्भ|ह्रस्वदर्भः
ह्रस्व-दर्भ <i>m.</i> the white Kuśa grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वबाहुक
ह्रस्व-बाहुक <i>a.</i> short-armed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वमूर्ति
ह्रस्व-मूर्ति <i>a.</i> short in stature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-11" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्राद्
ह्राद् <i>vi. 1Ā (pres. ह्रादते)</i> To sound, to roar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-12" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्राद|ह्रादः
ह्राद <i>m.</i> Noise, sound, Kir.xvi.8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-13" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रादिनी
ह्रादिनी <i>f.</i> 1. Indra’s thunderbolt; 2. a river; 3. lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-14" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रास|ह्रासः
ह्रास <i>m.</i> 1. Sound, noise; 2. decline, decrease, deterioration, Yaj.ii.249, M.i.85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-15" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रिणी
ह्रिणी <i>vi. 1Ā (pres. ह्रिणीयते)</i> To feel ashamed. Cf. हृणी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-16" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रिणीया
ह्रिणीया <i>f.</i> 1. Reproach, censure; 2. shame, bashfulness. Cf. हृणीया.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-17" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्री
ह्री <i>vi. 3P (pp. ह्रीत or ह्रीण; pres. जिह्रति)</i> 1. To blush, to be modest; 2. to be ashamed of, (with an abl. or gen.), अन्योन्यस्यापि जिह्राम्हः किं पुनः सहवासिनाम् Kir.xi.58, Bt.iii.53, R.xv.44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्री
ह्री <i>Caus. (ह्रपयति-ते)</i> to put to shame, to degrade, to disgrace, युष्मान् ह्रेपयति क्रोधाल्लोके शत्रुकुलक्षयः । न लज्जयति दाराणां सभायां केशकर्षणम् Ve.i., R.vi.49, Kir.xi.64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-18" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्री
ह्री <i>f.</i> 1. Shame, पौलस्त्यतुलितस्याद्रेरादधान इव ह्रियम् R.iv.8, K.S.iii.57; 2. modesty, bashfulness, ह्रीमूढानां भवति विफलप्रेरणा चूर्णमुष्टिः Megh.ii.5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीजित|ह्रीजितः
ह्री-जित <i>a.</i> overcome by shame or modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीमत्|ह्रीमन्त्
ह्री-मत् <i>a.</i> bashful, modest, e.g. जाड्यं ह्रीमति गण्यते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीयंत्रणा|ह्रीयन्त्रणा
ह्री-यंत्रणा <i>f.</i> the constraint of bashfulness, R.vii.23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-19" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीका
ह्रीका <i>f.</i> 1. Timidity, fear; 2. bashfulness, shyness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-20" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीकु|ह्रीकुः
ह्रीकु <i>(I) a.</i> Bashful, modest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीकु|ह्रीकुः
ह्रीकु <i>(II) m.</i> 1. Lac; 2. tin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-21" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीण|ह्रीणः
ह्रीण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Ashamed; 2. modest, bashful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीणा
ह्रीण <i>a. (f. णा)</i> 1. Ashamed; 2. modest, bashful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-22" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीवेर|ह्रीवेरं
ह्रीवेर <i>n.</i> A kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-23" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रेष्
ह्रेष् <i>vi. or vt. 1Ā (pres. ह्रेषते)</i> 1. To neigh; 2. to creep, to go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-24" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रेषा
ह्रेषा <i>f.</i> The same as हेषा q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-25" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लस्
ह्लस् <i>vi. or vt. 1P (pres. ह्लसति)</i> To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-26" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लाद्
ह्लाद् <i>vi. or vt. 1Ā (pp. ह्लुन्न or ह्लादित; pres. ह्लादते)</i> 1. To be delighted, to be glad, to rejoice; 2. to sound.With आ-, to be delighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-27" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लाद|ह्लादः
ह्लाद <i>m.</i> Pleasure, joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लादिता
ह्लादिता <i>f.</i> Pleasure, joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-28" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लादन|ह्लादनं
ह्लादन <i>n.</i> The act of rejoicing, joy, delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-29" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लादिनी
ह्लादिनी <i>f.</i> 1. Lightning; 2. Indra’s thunderbolt. (Cf. ह्रादिनी.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-30" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वल्
ह्वल् <i>vi. 1P (pres. ह्वलति; caus. ह्वलयति-ते, ह्वालयति-ते; but प्रह्वलयति)</i> 1. To go, to move; 2. to shake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-31" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वान|ह्वानं
ह्वान <i>n.</i> 1. The act of calling; 2. a cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-32" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वृ
ह्वृ <i>vt. 1P (pres. ह्वरति)</i> 1. To be crooked; 2. to be crooked in conduct, to deceive; 3. to be injured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-33" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वे
ह्वे <i>vt. or vi. 1U (pp. हूत; pres. ह्वयति-ते; pass. हूयते; caus. ह्वाययति-ते; desid. जुहूषति-ते)</i> 1. To call, तां पार्वतीत्याभिजनेन नाम्ना बंधुप्रियां बंधुजनो जुहाव K.S.i.26; 2. to call upon, to invoke; 3. to challenge; 4. to name; 5. to emulate, to vie with; 6. to ask to beg.With आ-, 1. to call, to invite, M.iii.27; 2. (Atm.) to challenge, द्यामिवाह्वयमानं तमवोचद्भूधरं कपिः Bt.viii.18.With सम्-, to call out together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=839-34" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईदृश|ईदृशः
ईदृश <i>a. (f. शी)</i> Such, of such a kind, of this aspect, endowed with such qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=120-12.1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईदृशी
ईदृश <i>a. (f. शी)</i> Such, of such a kind, of this aspect, endowed with such qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=120-12.1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्विन्
ऊर्जस्विन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=149-14.1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्विनी
ऊर्जस्विन् <i>a. (f. नी)</i> Strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=149-14.1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृश्
एतादृश् <i>a. (f. शी)</i> Such, such like, of this kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=LRV&page=153-24.1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=lrv" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृशी
